window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_FEY_EVOLUTION_MERCHANT_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2801,"title":"Chapter 2801 The Postponed Astronomical Parliament Parliamentary Meeting!","paragraphs":["2801 The Postponed Astronomical Parliament Parliamentary Meeting!","This was the first time Lin Yuan had heard Spring praise a spiritual ingredient to such a degree.","Spring’s compliment proved the value of the sacred golden wind crystals to Lin Yuan.","This was the first time Lin Yuan had heard about elements with utmost purity. However, it did not prevent him from understanding the concept.","The sacred golden wind was a higher-level wind element than regular wind elements.","Shiny gave Lin Yuan the chance to take control of wind-elemental energy of such a level.","None of Lin Yuan’s previous feys allowed him to attain elemental energy of utmost purity.","However, it was not easy for Shiny to produce the sacred golden wind crystals. Moreover, when Shiny used its divine kingdom ability, Sacred Golden Wind Nest, to produce sacred golden wind crystals from the faith power in its divine kingdom, Shiny would also be substantially affected.","Lin Yuan did not want his nurturing of other species to affect Shiny’s development potential.","Furthermore, there was no point in Lin Yuan nurturing other species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","There were simpler ways for Lin Yuan to obtain divine kingdom abilities.","Additionally, his Body of All Spirits could also take control of the bloodlines of other species. It would enable him to easily take control of other species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds if he wanted to do so.","After all, many species prioritized and revered bloodlines.","With Sacred Golden Wind, it would be better to nurture powerful wind-type lifeforms than to nurture species.","There were a considerable number of powerful wind-type feys in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, and a few members of Sky City had also contracted wind-type feys.","Now that he understood elemental energy of utmost purity, Lin Yuan intended to obtain even more types of elemental energy of utmost purity in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","For the Satan devil Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil that Lin Yuan had contracted, it needed increasingly pure elemental energy to continue increasing its power.","The elemental dolls had appeared in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, and they had perfect purities.","The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil had been developing freely in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","In truth, Lin Yuan did not know the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s current situation.","He expected that its grade and quality had improved significantly.","Lin Yuan was initially slightly unsatisfied with Shiny’s divine kingdom ability. But now that he understood its value, he had a high appraisal of its divine kingdom ability.","Aside from its divine kingdom ability, Shiny had gained two new abilities and exclusive skills.","The ability Elemental Sword Feathers allowed Shiny to change from a purely flesh lifeform into a special lifeform that could be elementalized.","When all Shiny’s feathers were elementalized, the pure wind elements in the feathers could be triggered.","Shiny could activate many elements, and they could increase Shiny’s attacking and defensive abilities.","It was difficult for Shiny to avoid being injured during combat.","Once Shiny’s feathers were damaged, the wind-elemental energy in the environment would immediately replenish Shiny’s feathers. This increased Shiny’s defensive ability.","The elementalized feathers could also be shot out like sharp swords and had extremely strong penetrating effects, potentially causing severe damage to targets.","An ability that could improve both the attacking and defensive effects was very suitable for Shiny’s comprehensive abilities.","However, Elemental Sword Feathers’ boost of Shiny was far from being able to match up to Sacred Golden Wind.","Sacred Golden Wind enabled the wind elements under Shiny’s control to change into sacred golden wind.","Sacred Golden Wind was produced from Shiny’s body and went beyond the regular wind elements in elemental states. It had damaging and immunity effects against inferior elemental states.","This kind of immunity effect was not only restricted to inferior wind-elemental energy. It also applied to other elemental energy.","Sacred Golden Wind gave Shiny new life and did not weaken the reputation of a wind-type barren beast.","Aside from these two abilities, Shiny also acquired two new exclusive skills. They were Golden Wind Enters Body and Wind Territory Release.","Both of these exclusive skills made use of Sacred Golden Wind.","Golden Wind Enters Body involved Shiny absorbing the sacred golden wind into its body and turning it into sacred entities that could control wind elements. It would be able to suppress inferior wind elements.","In the transformed state, Shiny’s characteristics and attributes would be boosted.","Wind Territory Release involved the sacred golden wind in Shiny’s body being released into the surroundings to take control of the environment that had been filled with the sacred golden wind.","In the wind territory, all feys weaker than it would be suppressed.","The suppressed targets were directly related to the speed of the sacred golden wind.","The faster the speed of the sacred golden wind, the larger the size and strength of the wind territory.","After Shiny evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, there was still a fair amount of dragon lungs and phoenix blood left. There was enough to feed Shiny for a very long time.","This was the highest level of dragon lungs and phoenix blood that Coiling Dragon’s Valley and the Dark Clouds Bird Shrine could provide.","Going forward, Lin Yuan would have to obtain Shiny’s food from the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Shiny flapped its wings and tested its elementalized feathers.","Shiny was delighted by its increase in power.","“Lin Yuan, if the sacred golden wind crystals produced by my divine kingdom ability are useful to you, I will produce as many of them as I can for you!”","Lin Yuan knew how much Shiny liked to fight. A warrior like Shiny was not suited to being a producer.","Lin Yuan said to Shiny seriously, “Golden Wings, if I need you to provide the sacred golden wind crystals, I will let you know. At any other time, you should focus on increasing your power! The divine kingdom level isn’t the end. It’s possible that as your grade increases, the sacred golden wind’s level will also break through!”","This was Lin Yuan’s encouragement for Shiny, but this was truly how he felt.","He had a special body composition, and Morbius was also a treasure trove that produced resources.","In the future, Shiny’s power would inevitably continue to grow.","Spring nodded lightly when she heard what Lin Yuan said.","If someone else had said this, Spring would think that they were spouting nonsense. However, it made much more sense for the words to have come from Lin Yuan.","The Body of All Spirits could improve even elements with utmost purity. Lin Yuan already achieved this in his previous life.","With Lin Yuan of this life also setting his sights on this target, there was no doubt that he would be able to achieve it.","Lin Yuan played with Shiny for a while before contacting Wen Yu through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","Because of him, the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting had been postponed for some time.","Now that he was done with what he needed to do, it was time to hold the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting.","Lin Yuan did feel attached to these members of the Astronomical Parliament who he and Wen Yu had saved and nurtured.","Lin Yuan had also been the one to watch over the step-by-step growth of promising members such as Yin Lin and Su Yiren.","Wen Yu had already sent out the news.","While Lin Yuan was nurturing Shiny, the members of the Astronomical Parliament all began thinking and preparing; they all had their own answers.","The meeting among the constellations began once again.","Lin Yuan sat on the throne that represented Leo for the first time in a long while.","Frankly, the Astronomical Parliament had not been properly built up in the main world.","This did not mean that the Astronomical Parliament lacked potential; rather, it would be part of Lin Yuan and Wen Yu’s strategy for the main world in the future.","There was no need for the Astronomical Parliament to continue taking in new members.","In the beginning, the Astronomical Parliament did not take in many members due to the restrictions from Wen Yu’s sacred source lifeform’s Stars.","By the time Wen Yu’s sacred source lifeform’s Stars were increased, there was no longer any point in filling the Astronomical Parliament with members from the main world.","Lin Yuan intended to continue developing the Astronomical Parliament in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","He could take in lifeforms of a few species from the Sky Beyond the Clouds who were willing to offer their lives in exchange for having their prayers granted.","The Astronomical Parliament would become the medium by which he created tools and extended his control.","The seats that represented the north-south constellation seats were filled with figures who were familiar to Lin Yuan. These people greeted Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, Liu Jie, and Yin Lin, who were seated on the thrones.","Lin Yuan replied with a smile, “Every single person here has transformed and grown in the past few years. You have all also chosen paths that suit your liking. You should be aware that I will be leaving this world for a higher level one soon and continuing my development there. Why don’t all of you take the opportunity of this gathering to have a chat about your future plans?”","While he spoke, Lin Yuan’s eyes landed on Su Yiren.","Lin Yuan and Su Yiren had exchanged very few words over the last few years. Su Yiren had been focused on rebuilding the Dark Continent and developing the Sand Island Continent; she had done a fantastic job of both. The citizens of the Sand Island Continent were all living in bliss, and their standards of living had multiplied by numerous times of the original level.","Su Yiren had spent all her energy on the governance of these two continents in the last few years.","Lin Yuan needed to know what Su Yiren’s current plans were.","In the past, Su Yiren had already expressed her opinion to Lin Yuan. However, that was a decade ago. Time had passed, and every person’s thoughts changed constantly.","Lin Yuan had asked for the opinions of the members of the Astronomical Parliament. This meant that he was very willing to respect their wishes.","At the same moment that Lin Yuan looked at Su Yiren, Su Yiren looked at Yin Lin.","Yin Lin was currently staring at Lin Yuan.","Wen Yu knew that Yin Lin had obvious feelings for Lin Yuan; aside from deep respect, she also felt romantic sentiments.","Yin Lin had never revealed how she felt to Lin Yuan. Wen Yu expected this, but it also surprised her.","After all their years apart, Yin Lin’s feelings towards Lin Yuan had intensified.","However, as one of the Azure Federation’s Azure Envoys who was also about to become a member of royalty, Yin Lin had undergone significant training. She now had the aura of a superior and was no longer as weak as she was a decade ago. Her elegance had also become sterner.","Unsurprisingly, Yin Lin was going to take over the Azure Cloud Leopard family and was shouldering heavy responsibility.","With such responsibility, she needed to make a solemn decision.","Wen Yu felt that if she were in Yin Lin’s position, she would not be able to remain this composed.","At this moment, Wen Yu sharply noticed that Yin Lin had reluctantly peeled her gaze away from Lin Yuan’s body. Eventually, her reluctance morphed into resolution.","The change in Yin Lin’s demeanor and gaze told Wen Yu what Yin Lin’s decision would be.","As one grew up and gained authority, it was inevitable that one would also lose one’s freedom.","Wen Yu was very glad that she had started out as Lin Yuan’s assistant and only ever needed to follow his decisions.","After Lin Yuan was done speaking, the first to respond was Bu Po.","Bu Po bowed deeply to Lin Yuan before saying seriously, “Leo, I know that my talent is limited. Without your help, I wouldn’t have been able to become a Class 4 Creation Master even if a decade passed. I also have Libra to thank for my being able to oversee the Spirit Mother Federation. All I want to do in my life is be by my sister’s side. Once her lifespan comes to an end, I will protect the main world and carry out your will.”","Lin Yuan was not surprised by Bu Po’s decision; he nodded at Bu Po. It would be good if Bu Po could protect the main world, but it would be fine even if he could not because Lin Yuan had already prepared the forces that would be sufficient to protect the main world.","“I hope your dreams come true. Fate willing, let us meet again in the future.”","Lin Yuan turned his gaze to the others.","“The rest of you should also tell me your decisions just like Bu Po just did.”","The moment Lin Yuan was done speaking, Bei Xu said calmly, “Leo, if it’s possible, I would like to go wherever you go.”","At this point, Bei Xu gently pursed his lips and looked over at Su Yiren, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie before saying with faint disappointment, “If you find my talent lacking, I can join Bu Po in protecting the main world.”","Bei Xu sincerely wanted to follow Lin Yuan, but he was aware that he lacked power. Presently, he was only an emperor-class expert with a Suzerain/Myth fey. Such power was insignificant in the ranks of Sky City. Almost every white-clothed follower was stronger than him.","Lin Yuan smiled brightly. After the decade that has passed, Bei Xu still stuck by his initial decision. For the past decade, Bei Xu had been focused on developing his faction rather than raising his power. In terms of developing his faction, Bei Xu was very successful.","Although Bei Xu was not as talented as Wen Yu and Su Yiren when it came to internal governance, he could still hold his own.","Once Lin Yuan accepted Bei Xu into Sky City, he would allow him to become one of the white-clothed followers led by Liu Jie.","“Bei Xu, since you’ve made your decision, come and join me! Try your best to leave the Radiance Federation as soon as possible.”","Bei Xu jumped up from his chair in excitement.","After Bei Xu, Su Yiren expressed her stance that she was willing to follow Lin Yuan. Luo Lan followed suit.","Wen Yu was taken aback by Luo Lan’s decision."]},{"number":2802,"title":"Chapter 2802 10-Winged Red Thorn and Silver Corona!","paragraphs":["2802 10-Winged Red Thorn and Silver Corona!","Wen Yu did not interact with Luo Lan much in her day-to-day life, but she had a good impression of her.","Luo Lan ruled the Iron Hammer Federation with benevolence and righteousness. The Radiance Federation had always been ruled by the same creed.","Luo Lan had singlehandedly improved the happiness of all the Iron Hammer citizens.","In the past, the Iron Hammer Federation had been covered by snow, and food had been scarce. In spite of the harsh conditions, Luo Lan had managed to breathe new life into the Iron Hammer Federation after taking over as ruler.","With Lin Yuan’s help, the Snow Celestial Mountain had transformed into a faerie.","The Iron Hammer Federation had been buckling under snow and ice because of the Snow Celestial Mountain.","Now, the Iron Hammer Federation had the best development of the three federations in the Startling Lines Continent.","Normally, a federation filled with Scholars like the Great Lush Federation should be the one that advanced the fastest.","However, Jin Qianxun had been fully focused on the harbor, causing many of the Great Lush Scholars to depart for the Divine Wood and Iron Hammer Federations.","This strongly facilitated the homogeneity of the Startling Lines Continent’s culture.","The halt in the Great Lush Federation’s development was linked to the decisions of the one in power.","However, the Divine Wood Federation’s weather conditions were even better than that of the Iron Hammer Federation before the Snow Celestial Mountain left. They were overtaken because Yi Huailong prioritized the profits of the Yi family before that of the Divine Wood Federation.","Wen Yu and Lin Yuan were aware of this. But neither of them commented about it because Yi Huailong had not made a mistake pertaining to the Divine Wood Federation’s management.","If the Startling Lines Continent’s three federations were going to be addressed, the Great Lush Federation should be first. Compared to Yi Huailong, Luo Lan stood out as a shining beacon.","Luo Lan lacked power of her own, but Lin Yuan had the ability to help her increase it. The gap in her management abilities could be compensated by an increase in power.","Yin Lin was not surprised by Luo Lan’s choice.","Although Yin Lin and Luo Lan were not as close as Su Yiren and Luo Lan were, Yin Lin also communicated in depth with Luo Lan and gave her significant help.","Luo Lan had told Yin Lin long ago that she intended to follow Lin Yuan.","Yin Lin envied Luo Lan’s carefreeness.","Luo Lan did not have any family. Without her family tying her down, she only needed to ensure that the Iron Hammer Federation was properly managed.","By representing her own family and heading to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, she would also be able to achieve better development.","Alas, Yin Lin could not do the same. She had too many responsibilities that required her to answer to her family and the Azure Federation. If she left, it would have a severe impact on her family.","The Azure Federation could no longer be considered one of the three major federations alongside the Radiance Federation and Freedom Federation.","The Azure Federation had suffered the heaviest losses during the dead spirits crisis.","As an Azure Envoy, Yin Lin had also taken on the associating duties.","Once Luo Lan was done stating her decision, Yin Lin turned to look at Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie.","“Leo, Libra, Virgo, I have decided to stay. The Azure Federation and Azure Cloud Leopard family need me.”","Wen Yu had already seen this decision coming from Yin Lin, but Liu Jie frowned when he heard what she said.","In Liu Jie’s opinion, Yin Lin had only made it this far because of Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had saved her in the same way that he had saved Liu Jie. Without Lin Yuan, the two of them would be disabled and crippled.","It was wrong for Yin Lin to make such a decision at such a time.","However, Liu Jie did not say anything because Lin Yuan had asked the Astronomical Parliament’s members to state their opinions and was not making any decisions on their behalf.","However, Lin Yuan could request them to follow him to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan looked at Yin Lin’s expression and knew she had only come to such a decision after deep and careful contemplation.","He looked at Yin Lin seriously before saying somberly, “I respect your decision.”","Bu Po had been the first to state his stance because his world revolved around his sister.","After Yin Lin expressed her stance, Wo Lun, Ta Lei, and the rest followed.","In the end, the only members of the Astronomical Parliament whom Lin Yuan would be taking to the Sky Beyond the Clouds were Bei Xu, Su Yiren, and Luo Lan.","Now that the official matter was settled, the atmosphere became lively.","Lin Yuan was about to head to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, and it was highly possible this would be their final goodbye.","Lin Yuan had made many arrangements for the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting.","Although Yin Lin, Ta Lei, Bu Po, Wo Lun, and the rest would not be following Lin Yuan to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, they had all contracted the Lifespan Mice and were worthy of being the protectors of this Class 2 world.","Lin Yuan would increase their strength so they could safeguard the main world together.","Lin Yuan was assured in their personalities and characters. Otherwise, he would not have nurtured them so seriously when he accepted them into the Astronomical Parliament.","While Lin Yuan was making the arrangements for them, his soul started to react.","Red Thorn and Silver Corona were done clearing all the dead spirit corpses in the main world.","At first, they only absorbed the death aura that Summer had funneled into the sea below the Startling Lines Continent.","But after the dead spirits crisis ended, there were many dead spirit corpses left in the main world.","The demon insects could consume and digest the dead spirit corpses. However, it would be a waste to do so because Red Thorn and Silver Corona could also do the same.","Hence, Lin Yuan had instructed Keira to commandeer the army of demon insects to move all the dead spirit corpses to the area covered by Red Thorn and Silver Corona so they could use the energy to evolve their bloodlines.","Red Thorn and Silver Corona needed blood energy to evolve.","Lin Yuan’s Body of All Spirits could not directly increase their strength.","Moreover, using inappropriate methods to forcefully evolve Red Thorn and Silver Corona would not do them any good.","Lin Yuan intended to head into the sea under the Startling Lines Continent immediately after the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting ended to check on Red Thorn and Silver Corona so he could see how these two fellows had improved.","In previous Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meetings, the members always brought Lin Yuan various information.","But now, the main world no longer had any secrets from Lin Yuan.","Hence, the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting would be coming to an end very soon.","...","After the Astronomical Parliament meeting ended, Lin Yuan gave Wen Yu and Liu Jie a heads-up before he immediately headed to the Startling Lines Continent.","Morbius was also in the Startling Lines Continent, and Lin Yuan could meet up with Morbius there.","As for the other members of the Astronomical Parliament, they all rushed to the Radiance Federation.","During the Astronomical Parliament parliamentary meeting, Peace had only said that she did not want to go to the Sky Beyond the Clouds and nothing else. This was not because she did not want to communicate with Lin Yuan but because she felt slightly guilty toward him and did not know how to face him.","However, Peace still had no idea where she had gone wrong to have gotten herself in such a state.","...","Lin Yuan communicated with Morbius through their minds.","When Morbius controlled the Pure Land of Bliss personally, it could activate a larger area than Lin Yuan could. Hence, Morbius could help Lin Yuan collect the spirit qi crystals extremely quickly.","When Morbius found out that Lin Yuan was coming, it did not wait for him in Thick Soil City but headed directly to the sea where Red Thorn and Silver Corona were located.","Ever since Morbius gained a body and could move around freely in the main world, its demeanor was extremely carefree. It really enjoyed its current condition.","Despite being the Totem God, all it had been able to do for the past few long epochs was sleep and had been unable to produce its body. This was very ironic.","However, the awakened Morbius did not regret the decision it made with its partner back then.","After the passing of numerous long epochs, Morbius had gained the companionship of another partner.","In this entire world, Lin Yuan was the only one Morbius cared about.","Red Thorn and Silver Corona had left the sea once they no longer had any more resources to absorb.","The moment they saw Morbius, they immediately gathered around it and instinctively saw Morbius as Lin Yuan’s proxy.","Morbius could not help but smile faintly at Silver Corona and Red Thorn’s actions.","Morbius entertained Silver Corona and Red Thorn but did not retract its aura.","Once Silver Corona and Red Thorn drew near to Morbius, they did not leap into its arms like they did with Lin Yuan. Rather, they instinctively halted.","Both of them had realized that this figure resembled Lin Yuan but was not truly him.","Yet, Morbius did carry a concentrated aura of Lin Yuan. Otherwise, Silver Corona and Red Thorn would have already attacked Morbius.","Morbius said coolly, “Silver Corona and Red Thorn, you have done well with your evolutions. Yuan will definitely be surprised when he arrives! He has never stopped investing in the two of you.”","Red Thorn and Silver Corona did not let down their guard because Morbius carried Lin Yuan’s aura.","Morbius was very satisfied with Silver Corona and Red Thorn’s actions.","Silver Corona and Red Thorn were now both 10-winged fairies. Red Thorn’s bloodline was slightly stronger than that of Silver Corona.","Silver Corona and Red Thorn were only able to have such sensitivity and intelligence because their bloodlines were so elite.","Lin Yuan’s other feys would not be able to tell Morbius apart from Lin Yuan this easily.","As the Totem God, Morbius had created this appearance using its totem power. Its totem power enabled it to replicate Lin Yuan’s spiritual attributes and bloodline, much less his aura.","When Lin Yuan rushed to the shallow sea, he was drawn in by Red Thorn’s aura from far off.","Red Thorn’s bloodline power suppressed that of Silver Corona, and its appearance was much more exquisite than before.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Red Thorn.","[Fey Name]: Red Thorn (Ten-Winged Fairy) (Thousand Eyes Relinquish)","[Fey Species]: Rafflesia genus/fairy species","[Fey Grade]: Suzerain (8/10)","[Fey Type]: Source/Wood","[Fey Quality]: Myth III","Abilities:","[Mouth of Relinquish]: Secretes vigorous digestive fluids with powerful corrosive properties, allowing faster absorption of energy from food. The Tongue of Relinquish inside the mouth can significantly increase digestion speed. It can also release a special corrosive fluid from the consumed flesh and blood. When the Tongues of Relinquish pierce a target, the tip of the tongue can be severed and left in the target’s body. While the target remains alive, the tip of the tongue will control the target’s spirit and soul. After the target dies, the tip of the tongue can manipulate the target to appear as though it was still alive.","[Brutal Carnivore Vine]: The vines contain digestive fluids that grow in midair, and the sharp teeth on the inner side of the vine can grind and collect flesh and blood energy.","[Eye of Relinquish]: Eyes formed using blood and flesh energy. Each eye contains a substantial amount of blood and flesh energy. When the number of Eyes of Relinquish on every Mouth of Relinquish is maintained below 60, they can only store energy. When the number of Eyes of Relinquish is above 60, those Eyes of Relinquish can be turned into an energy ray at any time.","[Sea of Flowers State Transition]: By rapidly depleting stored energy, the sea of flowers’ child ramets’ attacking power and mobility can be improved significantly. The child ramets’ weapons will also morph to increase functionality.","[Demon Spirit Curse Kill]: When any of the ortet’s ramets touch an enemy target and break through the target’s defense, the target will be cursed. Each curse carries a negative effect that stacks with every additional attack.","[Tongue Pouch Births Demons]: When a corpse is consumed, it can be stored in the tongue pouch and nurtured. If the corpse’s power is intact, it can be nurtured into a special lifeform containing a fairy bloodline. Its previous power will be retained, and its power can increase when tempered by blood energy.","[Demon Transformed Bound Fairy]: Its bloodline will be injected into the demon nurtured by Tongue Pouch Births Demons. The demon will transform into a fairy with a bloodline one level lower and be controlled by Red Thorn. The fairy will acquire the same abilities and, with sufficient vitality, can become an individual Mouth of Relinquish (The bound fairy’s bloodline and power will increase as the main body evolves. The nutrients absorbed by the bound spirit’s Mouth of Relinquish will be channeled to the main body.)","Exclusive Skill:","[Spore Growth]: Emits a vast number of spores, which can absorb energy or flesh energy supplied by Red Thorn, out of its spore cavity to rapidly grow ramets and child ramets controlled by the ortet.","[Wither Glory]: Red Thorn can rapidly absorb energy from the soil and channel it into the sea of flowers. As long as the soil has the roots of the child ramets and ramets, the withered sea of flowers will reach its prime state.","[Spores Destruction Death Order]: Each time the entity grown from a spore is on the brink of death after being attacked by the enemy, the enemy’s energy entering the spores will transform into pure death aura and death curse energy. The death aura will trigger the effects of the death curse energy, and a time can be set to decide when the accumulated death curse energy will attempt to kill the target (the target’s survival is linked to the strength of the vitality in the target’s body)."]},{"number":2803,"title":"Chapter 2803 Legend of 16 Wings!","paragraphs":["2803 Legend of 16 Wings!","Lin Yuan had always harbored high hopes for Red Thorn.","He had acquired it from the Spirit Guards using the merit accumulated by his parents in this life.","Red Thorn was not an ordinary source-type lifeform but an amalgamation of three source-type lifeforms.","Red Thorn’s bloodline level was extremely high. Otherwise, it would not have been able to evolve into a ten-winged fairy when it was Myth Breed.","It went without saying that this was also related to Lin Yuan’s nurturing of Red Thorn and all the resources he provided it.","Red Thorn’s Tongue of Relinquish was a foundational ability that Lin Yuan relied on in his earlier battles. Without the Tongue of Relinquish, Lin Yuan would not have been able to nurture so many Eternal Weapons or take control of the Abyss Great Emperor.","The Abyss Great Emperor had been the strongest weapon at Lin Yuan’s disposal for a long time.","As Red Thorn evolved from Diamond/Fantasy to Suzerain VIII/Myth III, it wasn’t just its bloodline that improved significantly. By evolving from an eight-winged fairy to a 10-winged one, its bloodline was of an extremely high level, and it also gained a very powerful ability and exclusive skill.","Red Thorn’s Suzerain ability was called Demon Transformed Bound Fairy, allowing Red Thorn to inject its bloodline into a demon produced by the Tongue of Relinquish. The demon would then transform into a fairy with a bloodline one level lower than Red Thorn’s.","Red Thorn’s bloodline was currently higher than 10 wings. The fairy bloodline nurtured through Demon Transformed Bound Fairy would be higher than eight wings.","A fairy with a bloodline higher than eight wings would be considered outstanding.","The fairy produced by injecting bloodline into the demon would not only have the same abilities as Red Thorn but could also produce a Mouth of Relinquish if there was sufficient vitality.","When the Mouth of Relinquish digested and absorbed energy, it would channel the energy back to Red Thorn to speed up its growth. This essentially solved the issue of Red Thorn’s grade being difficult to evolve.","Moreover, Red Thorn’s depleted bloodline could be recovered in the future. With Lin Yuan’s help, Red Thorn’s roots would not be affected in any way.","Red Thorn’s Myth Breed exclusive skill was called Spores Destruction Death Order.","Red Thorn produced the sea of flowers for combat, which was its weapon against enemies.","While in the midst of fighting enemies, it was inevitable that many flowers would be destroyed.","The sea of flowers was grown from the ramets of spores. When the plants grown from the spores were killed by enemies, the energy from the enemies would be changed into pure death aura and death curse energy. The death aura could trigger the effects of the death curse energy.","Death curse energy was a type of curse energy. It could decide if the target lived or died by placing curses on the target and was extremely potent. The decision depended on the strength of vitality in the target’s body.","Undeniably, death curse energy had a low probability of affecting targets with powerful vitality in their bodies.","As long as there was sufficient death curse energy, even lifeforms with powerful vitality in their bodies could be killed by the curses.","Lin Yuan highly approved of Red Thorn’s actions, but it could not be denied that it was an extravagance.","The moment Lin Yuan arrived, Morbius shifted its gaze away from Silver Corona and Red Thorn onto Lin Yuan.","Morbius’ gaze instantly softened when it landed on Lin Yuan.","Red Thorn and Silver Corona had also noticed Lin Yuan’s presence.","Both of them had been in seclusion and a state of half-slumber. Being in half-slumber, the two of them could absorb energy faster, but this also prevented them from snuggling up to Lin Yuan despite him being present in the Startling Lines Continent.","Red Thorn was just as domineering as ever, especially when it came to occupying Lin Yuan’s time and attention.","In the past, Red Thorn’s bloodline was firmly above Silver Corona’s. Hence, Silver Corona had not dared to compete with Red Thorn.","But now, they were 10-winged fairies, and the gap between their bloodlines was no longer as wide as it used to be. Hence, Silver Corona was now brave enough to compete with Red Thorn for Lin Yuan’s affection.","This greatly displeased Red Thorn.","Red Thorn watched Silver Corona perch on Lin Yuan’s shoulder and released its higher 10-winged fairy bloodline aura more than once as a warning to Silver Corona.","Silver Corona felt trepidation due to Red Thorn’s warning, but it did not leave Lin Yuan’s shoulder. With pitiful puppy-dog eyes, it looked at Lin Yuan as though silently pleading with him to stand up for it.","This further incensed Red Thorn, and it raised its small fists that looked as though they had been carved from jade and swung them around to intimidate Silver Corona.","When Lin Yuan saw this, he smiled vexedly and was about to speak when he saw Morbius shake its head. Almost immediately after, he heard Morbius’ voice through his soul. “Partner, fairies have clear ranks between each other. Fairies of different bloodline levels will be able to restrain each other. There’s no need for you to stand up for Silver Corona.","“In the future, Red Thorn’s bloodline will definitely become stronger than Silver Corona’s. If you step in for Silver Corona now, it won’t be able to handle itself once Red Thorn’s bloodline evolves.","“Red Thorn might be domineering, but it is very disciplined and reasonable. Once its bloodline evolves, it will punish Silver Corona for any disrespect. At that time, Silver Corona will no longer dare to act in such a manner.","“If you step in for Silver Corona, you’ll only give it undeserved favor. This will not only harm Red Thorn but will also ruin the order of your feys. There’s absolutely no need for such a thing.”","Lin Yuan nodded. He agreed with what Morbius said and did not say anything.","Although Silver Corona’s bloodline could not compare with Red Thorn’s, Silver Corona had a much higher grade than Red Thorn.","Silver Corona had reached Suzerain/Myth before Lin Yuan sent it below the Startling Lines Continent to absorb death aura.","Lin Yuan checked on Silver Corona.","[Fey Name]: Sea Burial Lotus Flower (Silver Corona)","[Fey Species]: Water Willow/Water Bone Lotus","[Fey Grade]: Sovereign (6/10)","[Fey Quality]: Creation VII","Abilities:","[Spotted Coral]: When trained according to the spots on the coral jade, different effects are generated.","1. Nurture Spot Style: Nurture the spots that were absorbed from the spotted coral jade in the bone lotus flowers. The bone lotus flowers will use a living being’s life and soul to nurture the spots to give them vitality. The spots with vitality can use the living being’s original strength to increase the strength and stamina of the bone lotus flowers.","2. Burial Spot Style: Place the spots in between the bone lotus flowers. The spots will eat the bone lotus flowers and become bone insects. The bone insects will retain the spot’s abilities and can deal with attacks on the bone lotus flowers according to the abilities. The external life force will be absorbed, and their souls can also be absorbed when the external life force is still weak.","[Bone Powder Mist]: The bone lotus flowers will vomit out the living being’s bones that could not be digested. The bone powder will fly up into the sky and stay in the coral spots once it reaches a set thickness of a layer.","[Blood Bone Insect Drunk]: While the bone insects are eating, they will enter a drunken state. When they’re in a drunken state, they will not feel any pain. The circulation of their root power will also slow down.","[Blooming Lotus]: The bone lotus flowers’ structure will change and split into main lotuses and branch lotuses. The branch lotuses will strengthen combat power, while the main lotuses will lose all combat power. Every time the main lotuses bloom, the spots will use the vitality they absorbed to produce a skeletal insect. The skeletal insect can consume them to repair the damage done to the body.","[Arrival of Grant of Death]: When the hermit’s dead servants cannot stand up against the enemies, they will change into the grants of death that place death penalties on the targets’ souls.","[Soul Parasite Rebirth]: The soul will be hosted in the main lotus. The main lotus will make a copy of the aura of the lifeform’s soul and vitality. When the target’s body and soul are damaged, the main lotus can be sacrificed while absorbing vitality and soul power to enable the target to be reborn. Once reborn, the target will be in a very weak state, and its soul and roots will also be diminished.","[Lotus Territory Fairy Shadow]: The fairy bloodline in its body will be used to nurture lotus fairies in the sea of bone lotus flowers. When the lotus fairies attack targets, there is a chance that the target will die instantly. The life forms killed by the lotus fairies will be turned into lotus puppets, and they will retain a portion of the targets’ abilities from when they were alive.","[Soul Receives Bone Territory]: Use the fairy bloodline to trigger its own soul. The soul will be linked to the sea of flowers and can temporarily store the sea of flowers. The larger the sea of flowers, the shorter the period it can be stored in the soul (Its soul energy can be used to replenish its soul territory. If there is insufficient soul energy to replenish or strengthen the sea of flowers, the soul will suffer irreparable damage.)","Exclusive Skill:","[Hermit’s Dead Servant]: When attacking the target, the bone lotus flower will absorb the target’s body. 1% of the target’s power will be injected into the target’s soul to cause the target to be pregnant with its dead soul. The dead soul will consume itself, and when the bone lotus flowers gain 36 hermit dead servants, every hermit dead servant will be able to create a layer of mist over the bone lotus flowers.","[Rotted Bones into Fireflies]: Both vitality and death aura will be absorbed simultaneously. The vitality will turn into fireflies that will mend the sea of bone lotus flowers. The death aura will increase the strength of every bone lotus flower. If there is a pile of rotting bones below the bone lotus flowers to supply nutrients to them, as long as the main lotus is alive, rotting lotuses will be produced from the rotting bones and energy will be saved!","[Lotus Territory Symbiosis]: All of the life forms in the territory will be classified as one entity, and their lives will be linked together. When individual targets are attacked, the lotus territory will take on some of the damage. Before the lotus territory is destroyed, the individual targets will continue to live.","[Parasite Bone Revives Life]: During combat, branch lotuses will be sacrificed to repair the sea of bone lotus flowers. Other bone lotus flowers and insect patterns can also be rejuvenated.","Lin Yuan checked and confirmed that Silver Corona had indeed reached Sovereign VI/Creation VII!","Silver Corona was much stronger than Red Thorn in terms of grade and quality. Yet, Silver Corona’s bloodline was still no match for Red Thorn’s. It was clear that Silver Corona’s bloodline had less potential. If Red Thorn attained a few more opportunities, there was a high possibility that its bloodline would evolve to 12-wings by the time it reached Silver Corona’s grade and quality.","According to Spring, the most powerful fairy in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was a 16-winged fairy. However, this legend came from ancient times. Now, it was unlikely that there were still any 16-winged fairies in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. 14-winged fairies were the peak there.","The Sky Beyond the Clouds’ faeries were managed and developed by a faction called Faerie Institution.","A few powerful factions also managed the fairies from the various universes. Ten Thousand Fairy Celestial Palace was the strongest fairy faction in the East Universe, and it had a 14-winged fairy.","Lin Yuan knew that the stronger the fairy’s bloodline, the tougher it would be to evolve. Ten Thousand Fairy Celestial Palace’s fairy only reached 14-wings when it reached Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit.","With the way that Lin Yuan was nurturing Red Thorn, if it could reach 12-wings when it was Sovereign/Creation, it was likely that its bloodline would be able to reach 14-wings when it reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","It was possible for Red Thorn to take over the fairies’ legend. Fairies decided their ranks based on bloodline. If Red Thorn’s bloodline could truly reach 16-wings, it would be able to command all the fairy factions across the four universes.","Silver Corona’s potential paled compared to Red Thorn’s, but it was not bad at all compared to other fairies. Silver Corona’s bloodline would definitely be able to reach 12-wings when it reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. If it could attain a few opportunities, it would be able to grow its seventh pair of wings to reach 14-wings when it reached Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit.","Lin Yuan only needed to focus on nurturing Silver Corona and Red Thorn.","Lin Yuan always felt that Silver Corona had a drawback: its sea of bone lotus flowers could not be grown and destroyed at will like Red Thorn’s sea of Ffowers could. Hence, relocating Silver Corona’s sea of bone lotus flowers would be very difficult once it was grown in one area. Once this sea of bone lotus flowers was abandoned, Silver Corona would have to regrow it from scratch.","But now that Silver Corona had gained its Sovereign ability, Soul Receives Bone Territory, it could use its fairy bloodline to open a soul territory and use it as a vessel for the sea of bone lotus flowers. This would allow the sea of bone lotus flowers to be moved easily and significantly reduce the inconvenience that Lin Yuan had to work around.","Although the soul territory could only temporarily contain the sea of bone lotus flowers, external soul energy could replenish the sea of bone lotus flowers. This would allow Silver Corona to be sustained endlessly."]},{"number":2804,"title":"Chapter 2804 Perfect Lotus Seat Shadow and Lotus Creations!","paragraphs":["2804 Perfect Lotus Seat Shadow and Lotus Creations!","Among Lin Yuan’s feys, Rememberling had the ability to replenish soul energy.","When Silver Corona used Soul Receives Bone Territory to contain and move the sea of bone lotus flowers, Sky Sea would take on the job of sustaining Silver Corona.","Silver Corona’s sea of flowers was so enormous that it was difficult for it to sustain it for long with its current soul strength.","This was because Lin Yuan never instructed Silver Corona to curb the growth of the sea of bone lotus flowers. In fact, he had made it so that the sea of bone lotus flowers would be able to develop with greater convenience.","He provided Silver Corona with food by essentially spoon-feeding it.","Millions of dimensional lifeforms had already been buried within Silver Corona’s sea of bone lotus flowers when it was only Platinum grade.","Luckily, Rememberling could ensure that Silver Corona could sustain the sea of bone lotus flowers. Without Rememberling, the spiritual ingredients that were chock-full of soul energy would not be able to meet Silver Corona’s needs.","Going forward, Silver Corona could nurture the sea of bone lotus flowers without holding back.","Even when it went to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it would still exist in a forbidden zone.","Aside from Soul Receives Bone Territory, Silver Corona also gained Parasite Bone Revives Life.","This new exclusive skill had a very simple description.","During combat, Silver Corona could sacrifice the branch lotuses to repair the main lotuses or replenish the insect patterns.","It did not seem very strong, but if it was paired with Lotus Territory Symbiosis, it would become completely different.","Lotus Territory Symbiosis allowed Silver Corona to become one with all the lifeforms in the lotus territory. Its life would be linked to all the lifeforms in the lotus territory so that every target would share the damage equally. As long as the main lotuses were alive, the lifeforms in the lotus territory would not die.","This meant that unless the enemy destroyed the entire lotus territory, all the lifeforms in the lotus territory would go on living.","If Parasite Bone Revives Life was used at this moment to sacrifice a large number of branch lotuses to recover the entire sea of flowers, it would instantly return to its strongest state.","There was also no need to worry about the branch lotuses being depleted because the sea of flowers would continuously consume enemy lifeforms while battling. The enemy lifeforms that were absorbed by the sea of flowers would naturally turn into new branch lotuses. The branch lotuses would grow continuously and naturally maintain the sea of flowers.","Lin Yuan was very happy with Silver Corona’s abilities.","Alas, next to Red Thorn, Silver Corona’s brilliance waned.","Morbius watched the interactions between Silver Corona and Red Thorn and sensed their affection toward Lin Yuan.","A faint smile appeared on Morbius’ face.","Truthfully, Morbius also wanted to cling to Lin Yuan. However, Morbius had a very different personality from Red Thorn and Silver Corona and would not act on its desire.","Lin Yuan played with Silver Corona and Red Thorn for a while before solemnly introducing them to Morbius.","Red Thorn and Silver Corona naturally felt positive toward Morbius because it had Lin Yuan’s aura, and it did not take long for the two of them to become comfortable with it.","However, Morbius was not very friendly toward them. All of its friendliness was saved for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan instructed Silver Corona to remain below the Startling Lines Continent for now.","Although most of the dead spirit corpses had been cleared out from the main world, there were still remnants.","Silver Corona and its sea of bone lotus flowers would be able to eliminate the remnants.","Once Lin Yuan was really about to leave the main world, he would instruct Silver Corona to use Soul Receives Bone Territory to carry and shift the sea of flowers.","Lin Yuan would then send Silver Corona and Red Thorn into the Spirit Lock spatial zone, where there was sufficient space for them to play. Both of them liked being submerged in the pure spirit qi, and the environment was also beneficial for them.","Morbius and Lin Yuan worked side by side, and Morbius placed all the spirit qi crystals it had collected into the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Even after a few days had passed, the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope was still unable to finish organizing all the spirit qi crystals.","However, Lin Yuan was not delighted with the large harvest.","He had experience using spirit qi crystals to increase his feys’ strength and knew how many spirit qi crystals were required to evolve a fey from Myth Breed to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","This amount of spirit qi crystals was far from enough.","Now, Lin Yuan normally used his body composition to help the spirit qi professionals and feys increase their strength. As for the spirit qi crystals, he stored them away as backup resources.","“Partner, among all the feys I’ve spirit locked, the one you should be paying the most attention to is the Abyss Red Lotus. It has tremendous potential to transform. We obtained a substantial amount of world roots from the invaders from the Sky Beyond the Clouds. You have already given all the world roots to the Abyss Red Lotus to absorb. Its power must have increased enormously.”","This was the first time Lin Yuan heard Morbius voluntarily bring up a fey that had spirit locked.","Lin Yuan had obtained the Abyss Red Lotus from the abyssal world.","The fire-elemental energy within the Abyss Red Lotus enabled all the lifeforms in the abyssal world to gain a fire-elemental aura.","Although the Abyss Red Lotus had an extremely high level, it was very challenging to nurture.","In order to increase its power, it needed to consume and take control of world root power before tempering the world root power.","The Abyss Red Lotus had already tempered all the Continent Vein Cores in the main world as well as the five dimensional worlds’ treasures. Yet, its power had only just reached Suzerain/Myth II.","After all the world root power that Lin Yuan had just fed the Abyss Red Lotus, its power had only reached Sovereign/Immortal.","Now that it had reached Immortal Breed, Lin Yuan could clearly sense that it was even tougher to evolve the Abyss Red Lotus than before. The amount of world root power it required had increased by an unimaginable extent.","This also proved to Lin Yuan that Creation Breed was a large milestone in the evolution journey of feys.","This was why the leaders of factions who sought help from Class 5 Creation Masters were only able to evolve their feys to pinnacle Creation Breed. Only a small number of them could enable their feys to reach Immortal Breed.","Lin Yuan summoned the Abyss Red Lotus.","Black lotus roots hung in the air like scars. It was as though the air was soil that was holding these roots firmly in place.","The lotus leaves stretched outward, and it looked as though they were covering up the sky. However, the leaves were not blue but dark red.","Two giant red lotuses that emanated a fire-elemental aura protruded into the air.","As Morbius looked at the Abyss Red Lotus, its eyes filled with nostalgia. It wondered when this lotus would be able to return to its original state.","It was also possible that with the Saint’s reincarnation, this lotus would receive a completely new destiny.","None of this was up to Morbius or this lotus—this depended on Lin Yuan’s choices.","Morbius had regained its memories from its past life and was fully aware of what this lotus was. However, Lin Yuan had no clue.","Morbius agreed with Lin Yuan’s decision not to regain the memories of his past life because this was the only way that he would be able to walk down a different path from before.","At that moment, Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Abyss Red Lotus.","[Fey Name]: Abyss Red Lotus","[Fey Species]: Abyss red lotus species/abyss red lotus genus","[Fey Grade]: Sovereign (3/10)","[Fey Type]: Fire","[Fey Quality]: Immortal IV","Abilities:","[Lotus Nirvana]: After deciding to self-destruct, all the energy in its body will gather inside the seed. When the seed sprouts to life, the bloodline will be passed on.","[Splendor of Fire]: Fill the area with fire-elemental energy. All other energies besides fire-elemental energy will be eliminated, and the ability of other lifeforms to control fire-elemental energy will be removed.","[Hellfire Lotus Imprint]: The lotus imprint will place a lock on the target and prevent it from gaining energy. Every layer of the lotus imprint added will strengthen the lock on the target’s energy and bloodline.","[Cleansing Aura Lotus Flames]: The flames will transform into a lotus coffin. Choose a space, and the flames will preserve it. Time and fixed entities will be preserved in their current condition.","[Lotus World Law]: Control the core of the world and issue orders to the lifeforms in the world. Those who are defiant will be blocked from receiving energy from that world.","[Hellfire Application]: Combine with other lifeforms and combine the energy of the world controlled by Lotus Locks the World with its own to boost itself.","[Burning Lotus Cleansing Dance]: The body will burn up into nutrients and turn into a lotus. The lotus will be in a cleansing state. Burning the main body will increase the effects of Hellfire Application and protect the worlds linked to Lotus Locks the World.","[Perfect Lotus Seat Shadow]: The lotus will turn into a lotus seat that protects the contractor’s feet. It will continuously project a lotus shadow to protect the contractor and remove all energy in the vicinity that could harm the contractor. It will also enable the contractor to gain all the world energy and world fusions it controls, and the present world’s energy’s influence on the contractor will be reduced.","Exclusive Skill:","[Red Lotus Hellfire]: A target’s karma, bloodline, and energy will be burned up. The flames will add the Hellfire Lotus Imprint on the target’s body.","[Lotus Locks the World]: When contact is made with the core of a world, the lotus roots will wrap around the world’s core. The core of the world will become an energy source for the lotus while the lotus takes over the world.","[Everything to Ashes]: Fire-elemental energy will nourish the body. All entities and energy can be burned, injecting increasingly pure fire-elemental energy into itself. The higher the level of the burned entities and energy, the greater the impact on the roots if internal energy is lacking. (If the impact on the roots is too severe, the utilization of cleansing lotus might be affected).","[Lotus Creations]: Its bloodline will be injected into mature lotuses, and the lotus roots will activate bloodline energy based on the injected bloodline. The energy in the lotuses will be sacrificed to turn the activated bloodline and its genes into a replicated lifeform.","[Sky-Repairing Lotus Roots]: When a divine kingdom constructed from faith power collapses or is damaged, its lotus roots can repair the damaged divine kingdom and recover it to its complete state.","The Abyss Red Lotus has gained a new ability and exclusive skill.","Perfect Lotus Seat Shadow was a defensive ability.","When Perfect Lotus Seat Shadow was used, the Abyss Red Lotus’ two flowers would turn into lotus seats that would be affixed to Lin Yuan’s feet. They would project lotus shadows that protect Lin Yuan and remove all energy in the surroundings that could harm him.","Poison, curses, elemental attacks, the transfer of force, faith power, death aura, and even bloodline power were all representations of energy.","Given that Perfect Lotus Seat Shadow targeted energy, it could be considered a perfect shield.","The Abyss Red Lotus could consume the roots of worlds and fuse them with itself to take control of the world.","The Abyss Red Lotus could use Perfect Lotus Seat Shadow to enable Lin Yuan to gain the effects of world energy and world fusions.","At the same time, the harmful effects of all the energy attacks from the world in which Lin Yuan was present would also be reduced.","This meant that if the Abyss Red Lotus took control of the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ world roots and if its experts used the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ elemental energy to target Lin Yuan, the attacks would be weaker than they originally were.","This ability greatly shocked Lin Yuan.","This was only the Abyss Red Lotus’ Sovereign ability. Yet, it was already able to affect world wills.","The Abyss Red Lotus had an enormous lotus root, and it was clear it contained many glowing silver lotuses within it. Its black roots also had a few white and silver-lined lotus roots growing on it. The white- and silver-lined lotus roots contrasted strongly against the black roots.","The Abyss Red Lotus had undergone such a change because of Lotus Creations and Sky-Repairing Lotus Roots.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it was not difficult to extract bloodline. Rather, it was difficult to store bloodlines.","According to Spring, there were a few legendary species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds that had gone extinct long ago.","But if the corpses of these legendary species were obtained, their bloodlines could be extracted.","At first, the experts from the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ various species liked to inject the bloodlines of ancient species with whom they shared similar bloodlines into themselves to trigger their bloodline transformations.","However, this method always came with negative effects.","A light consequence would be the degradation of their bodies. A serious consequence would be their bodies being infected by the ancient lifeforms’ bloodlines, causing them to turn into unrecognizable monsters.","There were a few experts from powerful species whose bloodlines had mutated after absorbing the bloodlines of ancient lifeforms and ended up hunting their own species. Eventually, their species were gravely injured, and some were even exterminated.","With Lotus Creations, Lin Yuan could inject the bloodlines of these ancient lifeforms into the Abyss Red Lotus’ matured lotuses. After sacrificing these lotuses, the lifeforms would once again be able to walk the earth!"]},{"number":2805,"title":"Chapter 2805 Divine Kingdom Ability that Supports Holy Spirit Realm!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2805 Divine Kingdom Ability that Supports Holy Spirit Realm!","This was an ability that could revive an extinct species of lifeforms.","It was an undeniably fearsome ability that could even alter the culture of a place like the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","With Lotus Creations, Lin Yuan could use his hard work and resources to enable the Sky Beyond the Clouds to return to the golden era of ancient times and completely overhaul the Species Rankings.","It was shocking that an exclusive skill could have such effects.","If Lin Yuan could enable the ancient lifeforms to reappear in this world, it would make it easier for Lin Yuan to obtain their bloodlines and use them to improve his body composition.","However, in terms of function, Lotus Creations could not compete with Sky-Repairing Lotus Roots.","After a fey reached the Divine Kingdom level, its divine kingdom would become its strongest combat technique as well as its energy core.","Once there was an issue with their divine kingdom, death would not be far off in this lifeform’s future.","Flesh, spirits, and souls could be healed if they were injured, but it was challenging to fix any damage to a divine kingdom. Once a divine kingdom showed signs of collapsing, the lifeform would be headed toward death’s door.","There were very few known ways to fix divine kingdoms.","Sky-Repairing Lotus Roots could do just that.","In the future, if any of the experts under Lin Yuan suffered damage to their divine kingdoms, Lin Yuan could use the Abyss Red Lotus’ lotus roots to heal them.","Lotus roots were grown by the Abyss Red Lotus and were replenishable.","Lin Yuan observed the Abyss Red Lotus while touching its roots and suddenly noticed it was very sensitive to his body composition.","Before Lin Yuan retracted his body composition’s effects, his palm naturally released the spirit qi that circulated in his body.","When the spirit qi was injected into the Abyss Red Lotus’ roots, its roots began trembling.","The Abyss Red Lotus swayed its roots gracefully. Lin Yuan looked surprised.","The Abyss Red Lotus was able to absorb spirit qi crystals and pure spirit qi on a daily basis. Hence, it should not be reacting so strongly after coming into contact with his palm.","The spirit qi that Lin Yuan released from his palm was not much purer than the spirit qi crystals in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","What if the Abyss Red Lotus was not reacting to the spirit qi but to his body composition?","With this thought, Lin Yuan tapped into the Body of All Spirits with full force, and spirit qi continuously flowed into the Abyss Red Lotus through its roots.","The Abyss Red Lotus’s roots and body twisted around in joy.","After some time using the Body of All Spirits to strengthen the Abyss Red Lotus, Lin Yuan noticed the root his hand was touching was slowly becoming lighter in color. The originally black root slowly faded to gray, then to white.","When Lin Yuan saw that the root was becoming lighter in color, his first thought was that there was something wrong with the root and was no longer as healthy as it used to be.","However, injecting spirit qi into the root should not have any impact on the Abyss Red Lotus’s wellbeing.","It did not take long for Lin Yuan to realize he was wrong.","The lighter-colored root had become thicker than the other roots.","Could it be that his body composition was aiding the Abyss Red Lotus’s transformation?","This was the only way to explain what was happening.","Lin Yuan decided to conduct more tests in the future.","If he could truly help the Abyss Red Lotus to transform its bloodline, it would be good news for them!","At first, Morbius had intended to give Lin Yuan a reminder. But when it saw that Lin Yuan had noticed how special the Abyss Red Lotus was, Morbius stayed silent.","Lin Yuan only needed to use his body composition to change the Abyss Red Lotus, and it would be able to transform into the Floating World Lotus very soon.","Once it became the Floating World Lotus, it would be uncertain if it would progress to transform into the Floating World Controlling Honorable Lotus or head down a completely new path.","To Morbius’s memory, the previous Floating World Controlling Honorable Lotus had not gained divine kingdom-related abilities and exclusive skills when it was at this stage.","...","After checking on the Abyss Red Lotus, Lin Yuan and Morbius went to the edge of the Barren Sea together.","Lin Yuan intended to spend around a year here evolving Gray and Dark Blue to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom before spending another few years evolving the human experts he had chosen.","He would take his time to evolve the other feys once he arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Once he evolved the chosen human experts to pinnacle spirit fire, the entire main world would meet his expected standards.","There was no need for Lin Yuan to spend any more time in the main world after that.","Compared to Dark Blue, Gray was more difficult to nurture.","He only needed to provide Dark Blue with top-grade strange water, water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, and spirit qi crystals to nurture it.","On the other hand, only spirit qi crystals were needed to nurture Gray. However, the plant-type feys that provided Gray with weather needed to be evolved.","Once the Deposit Vegetable Pods in the Spirit Lock spatial zone changed into human form, they became servants there who worked under the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope.","Lin Yuan had intentionally told the Deposit Vegetable Pods to nurture the weather-producing plant-type feys.","After years in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, the weather-producing plant-type feys had changed into human form earlier than the Deposit Vegetable Pods did.","After being carefully nurtured by the Deposit Vegetable Pods, the weather-producing plant-type feys had all reached Immortal Breed.","With the help of these Immortal weather-producing plant-type feys, Gray evolved its grade and quality at a decent rate.","...","Eight months later, Gray finally underwent cleansing from the world wills.","Spring stepped in as usual and helped Gray to evolve successfully.","Gray finally became a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Heavenly Family Fey.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Gray.","[Fey Name]: Sky Clouded Crane","[Fey Species]: Crane species/Red Crane species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Natural","[Fey Quality]: Elementary Divine Kingdom","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Cloudy Weather]: The body will present itself as a cloud and will be compatible with any weather. The body can absorb the weather. Once the weather is absorbed into the cloud, it will become a new ability. No new abilities will come from evolution.","[Radiance of a Clear Day]: In an area covered by clouds or after changing the weather to that of clear skies, all life forms in the area will be stamped with a clear weather imprint. Friendly life forms’ light-type abilities will generate more damage, while enemies will sustain sunstroke, burning, and other negative effects.","[Darkness of a Cloudy Day]: In an area covered by clouds or after changing the weather to that of a cloudy day, all life forms in the area will be stamped with a cloudy weather imprint. Friendly life forms’ dark-type abilities will generate more damage, while enemies will suffer confusion, fear, and other negative effects.","[Frozen Snowy Day]: In an area covered by clouds or after the weather has been changed to become snowy, all life forms will be branded with the snowy weather imprint. Friendly life forms will produce more powerful ice-type attacks, and water-type abilities can also become ice-type. Enemies will be frozen, numbed, and experience other negative effects. Fire-type effects will also become less effective.","[Roar of a Windy Day]: In an area covered by clouds or after changing the weather to windy weather, all life forms in the area will be stamped with a windy weather imprint. Friendly life forms’ wind-type abilities will generate more damage, while enemies will experience reverse currents, wind pressure, and other negative effects.","[Judgment of Thunder Weather]: An area covered by clouds or transformed into cloudy weather will be branded with a thunder weather imprint. When thunder hits friendly life forms, their ability to cause damage will increase. When thunder hits enemies, they will feel numbness and other related negative effects.","[Fusion of Rainbow Weather]: Cloudy weather will turn to rainbow weather. The rainbow weather can promote the fusion of other weather and allow them to coexist.","[Foggy Day’s Coverage]: Cloudy weather will change into foggy weather. At the same time, a cloudy weather imprint will be placed on life forms in the area. Friendly targets will effectively hide their presence in the fog, while enemies will be hit with a series of negative effects such as blindness and dizziness.","Exclusive Skill:","[Jade Contract]: Condense every type of weather absorbed into a jade. The jade will adorn the feathers. Once the weather turns into the jade decoration, the cloud will no longer carry the aura of that weather. But when the jade decoration is activated, every type of weather will turn into a jade beast.","[Body of Weather]: The body will comprehend the construction of natural phenomena it controls and produce them accordingly. These natural phenomena can be used to aid other targets, so they will receive double empowerment regardless of the weather they are experiencing.","[Abandon Weather Reincarnation]: When it is severely injured or in a near-dead state, it will immediately give up one of the weather it controls and instantly return to full health (after the ability is used, the weather can be taken control of again. However, regaining the abandoned weather will require accumulation and will not change the respective ability.","[Weather Transformation Seal]: Gather all the weather it has under its control and create a seal full of weather power. It will be used to suppress a target. Under the weather seal, friendly targets will receive comprehensive boosting from weather-related elemental power.","[Sky-Shading Weather]: Four types of weather will be combined to block any phenomenon in the sky. The sky and earth will be separated, and all long-distance detection will be blocked. While this ability is in effect, the abilities represented by the four combined weathers cannot be used.","[Cloud Cover Sky Calamity]: When world wills descend, the clouds it produces will absorb the might of the world wills and produce calamity clouds. The calamity clouds will have both attacking and defensive effects. (Its clouds’ ability to contain world wills is linked to the faith power under its control. The stronger the faith power under its control, the more capable its clouds’ ability to contain world wills.)","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[All Weather Dependency]: Its divine kingdom will be linked to the divine kingdoms of other lifeforms. The divine kingdoms will become dependent on each other. It will be able to borrow the faith power from the other divine kingdoms, and the weather phenomena under its control will also nourish the other divine kingdoms to speed up their derivations.","Lin Yuan had picked up Gray from the wild. At that time, its feathers had been a mess, and based on its color alone, it looked nothing like a celestial crane.","It could be said that Gray only managed to live because of Lin Yuan’s kindness.","But now, Gray was a Heavenly Family Fey that could control all weather phenomena.","Gray’s growth was the best repayment for Lin Yuan’s kindness.","Lin Yuan was delighted with Gray’s divine kingdom ability.","All Weather Dependency was a support-type divine kingdom ability, which was the most inferior type of divine kingdom ability.","However, All Weather Dependency was extremely useful to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom had always been different from others.","The divine kingdoms of regular lifeforms were just miniature kingdoms that contained fountains of faith. The divine kingdom would only gain value when faith power was absorbed to expand the divine kingdom.","However, Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom could derivate. There was a holy spirit in the divine kingdom that managed its development and was fully obedient to Lin Yuan.","After communicating with Spring, Lin Yuan found out that this was a trait of Holy Spirit experts. The divine kingdoms of regular Divine Kingdom experts could not derivate life.","Hence, the lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds that did not know any better would not think much of Gray’s divine kingdom ability.","However, the same could not be said if Gray’s divine kingdom ability was discovered by Holy Spirit experts.","Once Gray used All Weather Dependency to combine its divine kingdom with that of Holy Spirit experts, the weather would take form in their divine kingdoms and significantly speed up the speed of derivation.","A lifeform’s level was linked to the value that it could create.","Gray could create value for the Holy Spirit experts. This was proof of how high Gray’s level was.","Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom was currently in a stage of constant development. He intended to combine Gray’s divine kingdom with his own. This would create a win-win situation.","Ever since Truth began managing his divine kingdom, Lin Yuan had not attended to it for a long time.","Truth was akin to Lin Yuan’s representative, who worked on the divine kingdom. It would allocate the faith power in the divine kingdom according to his needs so as to develop and adjust it.","As a result, Lin Yuan had actually been investing significantly into his divine kingdom and enabling it to develop along the best route."]},{"number":2806,"title":"Chapter 2806 The Attacking Merciful Star Peony!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2806 The Attacking Merciful Star Peony!","Before Gray used All Weather Dependency to combine its divine kingdom with Lin Yuan’s, he intended to check what level his divine kingdom had reached in the long time that had passed.","Lin Yuan shifted his consciousness and entered his divine kingdom.","The moment Lin Yuan entered his divine kingdom, Truth appeared.","“Lord Ruler, welcome back. Please take a look at the present divine kingdom! The drop of holy blood you dropped into the divine kingdom has enabled life to blossom in the divine kingdom’s sea. Many of them have the potential to eventually be able to walk on land!”","Truth spoke in a very jovial tone. It seemed to think that it had made an enormous contribution.","Lin Yuan’s lips twitched.","He had dropped that drop of holy blood into the divine kingdom’s water region very long ago. At least 14 to 15 years had passed.","This was the same amount of time that Lin Yuan had been a spirit qi professional.","Despite the passing of such a long period of time, his holy blood had only just enabled the evolution of a few multicellular lifeforms. It was not yet guaranteed that these multicellular lifeforms would be able to walk on land. They only had the potential to do so.","It seemed that developing a divine kingdom took a very long time!","When Truth saw the expression on Lin Yuan’s face, it thought he was dissatisfied with the results of the divine kingdom’s development.","Truth hurriedly began to explain, “Lord Ruler, I have been developing your divine kingdom at full capacity. If you didn’t have so much faith power, I wouldn’t dare to maintain operations at its maximum limit! Your divine kingdom is developing faster than anyone else’s! The development of a divine kingdom is slow and gradual. It can’t be accomplished easily.”","Lin Yuan nodded, and he did not put Truth on the spot.","Lin Yuan trusted that Truth would not dare to lie to him.","If the development of the divine kingdom was naturally this slow, it meant that Truth had truly tried its best.","Although the divine kingdom had not changed much in all these years, Truth had grown rapidly during this time.","“Truth, if I provide the divine kingdom with some weather, will the lifeforms be able to derive quicker?”","Ever since it sensed that Lin Yuan was dissatisfied with the speed of the divine kingdom’s development, Truth had been feeling aggrieved.","Hence, Truth added a few more lines in response to Lin Yuan’s question.","“Lord Ruler, the derivation of the divine kingdom and the real world is fundamentally different. The derivation of the divine kingdom does not include external conditions. The weather you mentioned is one such external condition. Due to the lack of these external conditions, the derivation of the divine kingdom can go in any direction.","“Each time an alteration is made, the derivation of the divine kingdom will halt. If you introduce external conditions, the number of times that the divine kingdom will need to be altered will be reduced. It will also increase the speed of the divine kingdom’s development!”","Once he heard Truth say this, Lin Yuan exited his divine kingdom and instructed Gray to combine its divine kingdom with his own.","Gray was more than happy to combine its divine kingdom with Lin Yuan’s.","In terms of their emotional connection and its own improvement, there were no drawbacks for Gray to combine its divine kingdom with Lin Yuan’s.","Gray used All Weather Dependency, and it did not take long for their divine kingdoms to be combined.","Gray’s divine kingdom was subsumed into Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom and was akin to a bucket of water being poured into a small river. It was fully taken over by Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom.","Meanwhile, various weather conditions, such as clear, cloudy, snowy, windy, stormy, and foggy weather and rainbows, appeared in Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom. It could be said that it was as though all the different types of weather that could exist in the main world had been drawn into Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom.","Truth initially thought that the introduction of weather that Lin Yuan had referred to would be done using precious treasures that could influence the divine kingdom. It did not expect Lin Yuan to use such a method to enable so many different types of weather to appear.","These various types of weather could affect the lifeforms in the water that had evolved from Lin Yuan’s holy blood. It would not be long before these lifeforms were able to walk on land.","The weather phenomena had the largest impact on the land.","With cooperation from the lifeforms that could walk on land, the weather phenomena would enable vitality to surge continuously on land.","Lin Yuan was very happy with the changes in his divine kingdom.","Although the speed of derivation was rather slow, the size of the divine kingdom had grown considerably.","Lin Yuan went to the edge of the divine kingdom and looked at the mist that enveloped it.","He tried to detect what was beyond the mist and realized that the mist blocked his wills. This did not change even after he used faith power to strengthen the extension of his wills.","Lin Yuan ventured a bold guess. If every divine kingdom was enveloped in such mist, it was inevitable that his continuously expanding divine kingdom would eventually meet the divine kingdoms of other lifeforms. Once two large divine kingdoms met, there would be an explosive interaction!","There were cases in the Sky Beyond the Clouds where one divine kingdom consumed another. This would indeed enable one divine kingdom to become stronger.","Lin Yuan did not spend much time in his divine kingdom. He also did not use the faith power in his fountain of faith to make sweeping changes there.","It would be better to stock up on faith power. This would only benefit Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had already spent enough faith power building the divine kingdom’s frame.","This method of investing and building his divine kingdom did not align with the development of a divine kingdom.","Once his divine kingdom developed to a certain extent, Lin Yuan would spend more faith power to shape his divine kingdom!","Aside from All Weather Dependency, Gray had obtained two new exclusive skills. They were Sky-Shading Weather and Cloud Cover Sky Calamity.","Sky-Shading Weather suited the function that Lin Yuan had assigned to Gray.","Gray used Cloudy Weather to cover Sky Sea’s body.","On the other hand, when Gray used Sky-Shading Weather to seal off four of its weather abilities, it would be able to shade the entire sky and separate the sky from the land.","This significantly increased Gray’s ability to hide Sky Sea and also prevented experts from using long-distance detection techniques. It also improved the link between Sky Sea, Gray, and Dark Blue.","Cloud Cover Sky Calamity took Lin Yuan by even greater surprise.","Once a fey evolved from Fantasy Breed to Myth Breed, it would begin experiencing numerous types of World Cleansings.","These World Cleansings were unavoidable.","Even Divine Kingdom and Holy Spirit feys feared these cleansings.","Lin Yuan used the best methods to nurture every single one of his feys.","But despite using the best methods to nurture these feys to the Divine Kingdom level, it was difficult to escape being targeted by world wills.","This was proof of how difficult it was for lifeforms to reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","The spirit qi professionals in the main world who did not have the support of factions would not carelessly engage their feys in evolutions.","Lin Yuan was aware of this and had used these circumstances to take in numerous talented individuals into Sky City.","It was likely that this situation was even more severe in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","It was virtually impossible for small species and exiled members of species to evolve. If they forcefully underwent evolution, there was a high chance they would be repelled by the world wills.","Cloud Cover Sky Calamity would allow Gray to use the clouds it produced to absorb the might of the world wills and turn them into calamity clouds that could be used for both attack and defense.","Gray’s clouds’ ability to contain the might of world wills was related to the strength of its faith power.","The stronger the faith power that Gray controlled, the more capable its clouds would be at containing the might of world wills.","Once Gray used All-Weather Dependency to merge its divine kingdom with Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom, the faith power in Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom became Gray’s source of support. Gray could use the strength of the faith power in Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom to contain world wills.","As a result, Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter would not need to step in to fend off the world wills during the evolutions of World Emperor/Divine Kingdom feys. Gray could take on this heavy responsibility.","The cleansings from the world wills that were the bane of other experts’ existences would become Lin Yuan’s unique weapons.","Once Lin Yuan was done evolving Gray and Sky Sea, he sent them back into the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Firstly, Hu Quan needed to replant the weather-producing plant-type feys on Sky Sea’s back and build a separate garden for them.","Secondly, the newly evolved Gray and Sky Sea also needed to become accustomed to their evolved bodies in the Spirit Lock spatial zone’s environment that was highly concentrated with spirit qi.","Now that he had settled Gray and Sky Sea, Lin Yuan turned his attention to Dark Blue.","Luckily, Lin Yuan had evolved more of the water-type Elemental Shellfish when he had been nurturing them. As a result, he currently had sufficient water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls.","Otherwise, if he did not have enough of the water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls, it would be difficult for Lin Yuan to continue evolving Dark Blue.","Dark Blue’s evolution also involved its mermaid bloodline.","Lin Yuan had already fully awakened his Body of All Spirits, and his mermaid bloodline was no longer his secret weapon.","Lin Yuan used the Body of All Spirits to nourish his mermaid thearch bloodline while simultaneously injecting it into Dark Blue’s body.","It would take considerable time for Dark Blue to reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","During this time, Lin Yuan only needed to inject his mermaid thearch bloodline into Dark Blue’s body, as well as continuously supply it with water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls and spirit qi.","Lin Yuan summoned the Merciful Star Peony so he could see how it had grown.","Lin Yuan summoned the Merciful Star Peony almost daily so it could absorb power from the stars.","Although the Suzerain/Myth III Merciful Star Peony was very close to but had yet to reach Creation Breed, it could already change into human form.","The Merciful Star Peony’s long dress looked as though it had been dipped in starlight. Its human form was a textbook example of soft beauty.","However, its soft features fully brought out the Merciful Star Peony’s aura.","After being summoned by Lin Yuan, the Merciful Star Peony bowed gracefully to him before quietly standing next to him while it absorbed power from the stars. It was completely quiet, and did not utter a single word.","Lin Yuan did not say anything to the Merciful Star Peony either. This was just the Merciful Star Peony’s personality.","As a fey that he had used his spiritual energy to contract, Lin Yuan was fully aware of how the Merciful Star Peony felt about him.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Merciful Star Peony.","[Fey Name]: Merciful Star Peony","[Fey Species]: Buttercup species/peony species","[Fey Grade]: Suzerain (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood/Light","[Fey Quality]: Myth III","Abilities:","[Activate Light]: In a place filled with starlight, it will be guided by the stars and unaffected by blinding effects. In a place with absolute darkness, the surroundings can still be clearly seen.","[Casted Item Starlight]: When stars appear, the starlight can temper the body to improve its quality.","[Tempering Essence Starlight]: In a place with starlight, it will absorb energy from the starlight to temper spiritual energy and increase the strength of spiritual energy.","[Condensing Spirit Starlight]: In a place with starlight and when its soul is injured, the starlight will nourish its soul and heal it quickly.","[Starlight Robes]: The starlight will be directed to a target’s body and transform into a robe. While the target is draped in the robe, they will be immune to poison and curses, and the harm suffered from poison and curses will be reduced.","[Star-Storing Flower Jade]: Once the flower petals have absorbed sufficient starlight, they will become jade-textured and break away from the flower. The jade-textured flower petals can be stored for a long time and will speed up the rate at which starlight tempers the body.","[Star River Guide]: In any environment, it can link its thoughts and the star river to confirm its location. It will also experience blessing effects to raise luck and turn adversity into fortune.","Exclusive Skill:","[Constellation Imprint]: Attempt to communicate with the stars. If communication is successful, a star imprint will appear on the body. The star imprint can help the body take on all curse effects. When the star imprint is triggered, the energy within it will flow into the body and raise the body’s quality within a short period.","[Star Contraction]: It will become deeply bound to a star and be able to use the star’s energy to raise its defensive capabilities. The degree to which the defensive capabilities will be raised depends on the strength of the star and the bond with the star.","[Merciful Stars]: For stars containing too much energy, it will become a negative burden. The hardship of stars will be comprehended, and the energy within the stars will be extracted. The energy from the stars will be used to strengthen the body composition of a target. (If the target is forcefully strengthened and is unable to handle the power from the stars, the strengthening will be halted. It will need to take on the additional power from the stars as well as the consequences.)","When Lin Yuan previously checked on the Merciful Star Peony’s data, it had only been Silver grade.","After more than ten years of absorbing starlight to improve itself, the Merciful Star Peony had grown at a rather rapid rate.","The Moon Empress had given the Merciful Star Peony to Lin Yuan to contract because it did not need him to provide it with a Willpower Rune and could automatically comprehend a Willpower Rune from the environment.","Although the Merciful Star Peony had not been able to comprehend a Willpower Rune for a long time, it had finally succeeded and done its best!","It was normal to be unable to comprehend a Willpower Rune even after a decade had passed."]},{"number":2807,"title":"Chapter 2807 Mermaid Crown!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2807 Mermaid Crown!","In the wild, it was rare for even the most talented feys to comprehend a Willpower Rune within a decade. It was more common for them to take centuries to comprehend a Willpower Rune.","The Mother of Bloodbath and Endless Summer had taken centuries after evolving to Diamond X/Legend before they comprehended Willpower Runes.","Lin Yuan was rather amazed.","He had contracted a fair number of feys. If he did not intentionally check their attributes, it would be very difficult for him to keep track of their growth.","Lin Yuan was overjoyed with the Merciful Star Peony’s growth.","He had contracted it because of its ability, Casted Item Starlight, and exclusive skill, Constellation Imprint.","Constellation Imprint would enable the strengthening of the body within a short time, while Casted Item Starlight used the power of stars to temper the body and, accordingly, improve the physique.","Lin Yuan did not feel the effects of Casted Item Starlight in his day-to-day life, but it did significantly improve his physique.","The Merciful Star Peony’s Silver ability, Tempering Essence Starlight, and Gold ability, Condensing Spirit Starlight, had similar functions to Casted Item Starlight. However, one targeted the increase in spiritual energy and increased the strength of spiritual energy, while the other healed injuries to the soul.","These three abilities individually targeted the body, spirit, and soul.","Although Lin Yuan was now a pinnacle spirit fire expert, these abilities were still useful to him.","The Platinum ability, Starlight Robes, was a defense-type one. It used a piece of clothing made from starlight to help the target fend off the effects of poison and curses.","Starlight Robes could be used on multiple targets and could be deemed as serving a group function.","This ability was outstanding, but Lin Yuan had many abilities that defended against curses.","Only abilities with special functions could truly be of help to Lin Yuan.","However, just because the ability Starlight Robes was not of much help to Lin Yuan did not mean that the Merciful Star Peony was not excellent.","Star-Storing Flower Jade was just like Constellation Imprint in that it was based on Casted Item Starlight.","After the Merciful Star Peony’s flower petals absorbed sufficient starlight, they would become jade-textured. The energy in the jade-textured flower petals would be able to speed up the starlight’s tempering of Lin Yuan’s body.","The biggest function that the Merciful Star Peony served for Lin Yuan was improving his physique.","Hence, all the abilities the Merciful Star Peony gained that were related to this function were precious and effective.","The Suzerain ability, Star River Guide, allowed Lin Yuan to communicate with the stars and confirm his location.","This ability could see through deception and tricks at crucial moments.","Apart from using the star river to confirm his location, he could also obtain blessings from the star river and improve his fortune.","The concept of fortune was broad and abstract. It was difficult to quantify.","However, no one would stop seeking fortune. To everyone, the more fortune, the better.","The Merciful Star Peony could bring fortune to Lin Yuan. This was enough for Lin Yuan to keep it by his side.","Aside from new abilities, the Merciful Star Peony had also gained new exclusive skills.","Star Contraction allowed the Merciful Star Peony to become bound to a star and use the energy in the star to raise its defensive level.","This significantly increased the Merciful Star Peony’s ability to protect itself.","When it faced enemies, it could use the power of the star to defend against damage.","The energy from the star that the Merciful Star Peony could utilize depended on the strength of the star and the depth of its bond with the star.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there would be many powerful stars.","In order to increase the Merciful Star Peony’s upper limit, Lin Yuan could pick the most powerful star and enable it to bond to the Merciful Star Peony.","Among all of the Merciful Star Peony’s abilities and exclusive skills, Lin Yuan found Merciful Stars the most interesting.","As a transmigrator, Lin Yuan understood the significance of stars.","However, the sun, moon, and stars of this world were different from the ones that Lin Yuan had learned about in his previous life. These celestial bodies did not revolve around tangible worlds but manifestations of world wills and energy.","Spring had told Lin Yuan this.","If Spring had not casually mentioned this during one of their conversations, Lin Yuan would not have begun pondering over this.","The different stars were the different representations of world wills that had split off.","If the sun and moon in the fey world were real, the fey world should be a celestial body as well.","Then, the Moon Empress would be unable to use Forage Moon to consume the main world and dimensional worlds’ moons.","The stars formed from the world wills would accumulate energy continuously.","When the energy in the stars reached a limit, they would break, and the world wills that comprised the stars would be absorbed by other stars.","Through Merciful Stars, the Merciful Star Peony would take mercy on and experience the hardship of a star and extract the energy within. It would then use the energy to strengthen the body of other targets.","The amount of energy that could be accumulated in a star was enormous. There was a high possibility that such an immense amount of energy would cause the lifeform that was being strengthened to collapse.","Luckily, there was a safety net during the strengthening.","Once the target that was being strengthened could not handle the power of the stars, the strengthening would halt immediately. The additional energy would enter Lin Yuan’s body, and he would have to carry the burden.","Lin Yuan’s current body was not strong enough to carry too much star power.","But once his body was continuously tempered by starlight, it would eventually be able to handle the star power.","At that time, Lin Yuan could instruct the Merciful Star Peony to use Merciful Stars to strengthen all the members of the Astronomical Parliament.","Lin Yuan was unsure how powerful the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ stars were.","If Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter could handle the power, Lin Yuan could strengthen the four of them. This would essentially be strengthening his strongest forces.","As the Merciful Star Peony absorbed the power of the stars, it formed an exceptionally beautiful streak of light above the sea.","Lin Yuan was not in a rush to increase the Merciful Star Peony’s power.","The Merciful Star Peony would be able to come into contact with even more star power in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, and it would be able to increase its power much faster than when it was in the main world.","In the day, Lin Yuan allowed the Merciful Star Peony to move around freely. At night, the Merciful Star Peony stayed by Lin Yuan’s side and absorbed the power of stars.","When the power of stars tempered his body, Lin Yuan experienced extreme pain.","However, he was already accustomed to the pain.","Hard work paid off for those who put in the work.","...","Dark Blue finally received the attacks of the world wills and began evolving toward World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","Normally, Lin Yuan would send Spring to help with such situations and help the evolving fey to fend off the attacks from the world wills.","But this time, Lin Yuan stopped Spring.","Instead, he instructed Gray to use Cloud Cover Sky Calamity to absorb the world wills that were targeting Dark Blue.","Gray’s ability to absorb the world wills was linked to the faith power it controlled.","Gray had used All Weather Dependency to fuse with Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom. Hence, it easily used its clouds to absorb the world wills attacking Dark Blue.","A black ball of calamity cloud was formed.","Gray never excelled at combat. But now that it could control such calamity clouds, it had leaped to the front ranks of Lin Yuan’s feys.","After Gray produced the calamity cloud, Dark Blue successfully reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Dark Blue.","[Fey Name]: Moving Source Water (Mermaid Emperor Throne)","[Fey Species]: Source genus/Sacred Source Species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Water","[Fey Quality]: Elementary Divine Kingdom","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Flowing]: The water will rush rapidly, and the energy from the water can allow it to flow in any location.","[Halted Flow]: Separating from the main body and turning all the water-elemental energy in the body into raging energy that shoots towards the target.","[Faith Water]: Change faith power into a warm stream of water that can nurture other lifeforms using faith power. Faith Water can increase the rate at which faith power heals and replenishes the lifeform and slow down the faith power in larger bodies. Faith Water can also be used to draw back faith power that was given out, along with any additional faith power gained by the target.","[Faith Application]: The owner can be combined with the Moving Source Water and use all the power in the Moving Source Water. The owner can also inject faith power into the Moving Source Water to increase the strength of the Moving Source Water’s abilities.","[Faith Gift or Robbery]: Dark Blue can inject the faith power in its body into targets that can possess faith power to bolster them. It can also steal the right to control faith power from the bodies of targets with weaker faith power.","[Water Vein Block]: Use its bloodline energy to trigger its water-elemental energy that is not in its vicinity. The water-elemental energy will take on the water characteristics under its control and gather them closely together to form a block.","[Faith Shackle]: Link its bloodline power to a target with a similar bloodline. The target’s bloodline will be sealed away. If together, they have greater bloodline power than that of the target, the target will lose the ability to accept and manipulate the faith power in its body.","[Faith Charging Tide]: Its own faith power will form tidal water and attack specific targets. The faith power in its body will be sacrificed, and the tidal water will take away the same amount of faith power from the target as the amount that had been sacrificed. Half of that faith power will be returned to its own body.","[Quiet Faith Weak Water]: The faith power and bloodline power in its body will be combined to form a special water source. When this water source is injected into a target’s fountain of faith, it will slow down the speed at which faith power circulates, thereby quieting down the water in the fountain of faith.","[Faith Refinement]: It will organize patches of faith power before purifying the faith power to enable it to directly absorb from other targets.","Exclusive Skill:","[Power Water Soul]: Choose a power and condense it into the soul of the Moving Source Water. Any power can be chosen, but the choice cannot be undone. The power will affect the Moving Source Water’s future abilities and exclusive skills. When the Moving Source Water receives a certain level of feedback from the power, the Moving Source Water can comprehend any Willpower Rune according to the water-elemental characteristics in its body.","[Undepleted Clean Water]: The water-elemental energy it controls will have an extremely strong resistance to other elements and will not be depleted. In a contaminated environment or when facing an ability with contamination effects, it can ensure the purity of the water-elemental energy under its control.","[Disorientation Water Territory]: Its water-elemental energy and bloodline power will fill up an environment and enable the water-elemental energy in the environment to have the ability to block auras and energy fluctuations, thereby disorienting enemy targets in the area.","[All Water Surging Tides]: The water-elemental energy in its body will be compared to the water-elemental energy in the surrounding environment. If the purity of its water-elemental energy is higher than that of the environment, it can extract the water-elemental energy of the environment to heal its wounds and replenish its depleted energy.","[Charging Flow Body]: The flow of water in its body will flow rapidly forever and will not be affected by the locking effects of other entities. The energy in the body will not stop because of special abilities. Rather, the speed of faith power collection will be increased.","[Mermaid Crown]: When its bloodline is the best among the mermaid species, it will be able to tap into the faith power of inferior mermaids without receiving their respect. When it receives faith power from the surrounding mermaids, the faith power in its body will be improved.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Ocean Abundance]: The water-elemental energy in its body will turn into a territory of water and will be able to speed up the rate of evolution of water-type lifeforms. The water-type lifeforms’ ability to produce resources will also be significantly improved. The lifeforms in the sea will also be able to gain more faith power.","Lin Yuan saw that the Moving Source Water and Mermaid Disorientation had changed into Moving Source Water and Mermaid Emperor Throne respectively.","This change came about from the transformation of Dark Blue’s mermaid bloodline.","Dark Blue’s mermaid bloodline had reached emperor-class but was still a far way off from pinnacle emperor-class.","However, the bloodline of the 12 streams of water surrounding it had all reached pinnacle king-class.","Relative to Dark Blue’s level, its bloodline was rather weak.","However, this happened because Lin Yuan had not spent much time using the Body of All Spirits to evolve Dark Blue’s bloodline.","Additionally, Lin Yuan did not want to affect the mermaid bloodline in his body.","Otherwise, the bloodline of Dark Blue’s main body would have already reached the thearch level!","Lin Yuan could continue to evolve Dark Blue’s bloodline.","Lin Yuan looked through Dark Blue’s new abilities, exclusive skills, and divine kingdom ability in detail.","Dark Blue’s Ocean Abundance was a rare territory-type divine kingdom ability.","Although Ocean Abundance was unrelated to the control of faith power, it was a treasure trove that could significantly increase the production of resources."]},{"number":2808,"title":"Chapter 2808 Time to Set Off!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2808 Time to Set Off!","In the main world, there were many more sea clans than terrestrial lifeforms.","Without Lin Yuan, the main world’s federations and feys would be no match for the sea clans, even if they worked together.","The Vast Sea Labyrinth was the strongest sea faction but had always kept a low profile and stayed out of the main world’s affairs. They only stepped forward to save the sea clans when the dead spirits crisis broke out.","Now, Lin Yuan was preparing to head to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan would not use Dark Blue’s divine kingdom ability to nurture the sea clans.","There were many lifeforms in the water territories of the Sky Beyond the Clouds. The water species made up more than half of the ranks on the top 100 of the Species Ranking.","Lin Yuan would be able to garner greater benefits if he used Ocean Abundance to nurture a species that could produce special resources.","The Spirit Lock spatial zone was continuously expanding, and Lin Yuan decided to set aside a space to turn into a sea where Dark Blue could live.","Lin Yuan would nurture more aquatic lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","The Elemental Shellfish that produced elemental pearls were also considered production-type aquatic lifeforms. These Elemental Shellfish could be boosted by Ocean Abundance.","Rather than increasing the rate at which the water-type lifeforms produced resources, Lin Yuan was more interested in Ocean Abundance’s ability to speed up the evolution of water-type lifeforms, as well as their provision of faith power.","Aside from Ocean Abundance, Dark Blue had also gained three new abilities: Quiet Faith Weak Water, Faith Charging Tide, and Faith Refinement.","Ever since Dark Blue reached Silver grade, all of its abilities were related to faith power.","Faith Charging Tide used faith power to attack enemies while reducing the other party’s faith power.","Faith power would turn into charging tides that washed over the target. When Dark Blue sacrificed its own faith power, the same amount of faith power would be stripped from the target.","This depreciation did not come with any losses, but Dark Blue would be able to receive half of the faith power that had been depleted. This would allow Dark Blue to restrict enemies whose faith power was much more powerful than its own!","Any ability that allowed a weaker entity to defeat a stronger entity was an amazing one.","Compared to Faith Charging Tide, Quiet Faith Weak Water did not have any strong combat effects. However, it was a terrifying restricting ability.","Quiet Faith Weak Water was something that Dark Blue produced using its own faith power, bloodline, and the 12 different attributes. It did not target the lifeform’s body, spirit, or soul but the fountain of faith in the divine kingdom.","Once the weak water that Dark Blue produced entered the target’s fountain of faith, the water flow would slow down and eventually become still.","Once the water in the fountain of faith became still, the divine kingdom would not be able to operate and would be rendered ineffective.","However, it would not be easy to enable the Quiet Faith Weak Water to enter the enemy’s divine kingdom. The target needed to be restrained and would need to open its divine kingdom to absorb the Quiet Faith Weak Water.","Hence, Quiet Faith Weak Water was more so targeted at enemy captives. It was a functional-type ability that could prevent the enemy captives from inappropriately using their abilities.","When Lin Yuan went to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, he would inevitably need to conquer the powerful species.","If the white-clothed followers carried the Quiet Faith Weak Water around with them, it would save them a lot of trouble while they were carrying out guard duties.","Compared to Faith Charging Tide and Quiet Faith Weak Water, Faith Refinement did not have any combat functions and was a pure support-type ability.","Faith power could be extracted from targets using special methods. However, the extracted faith power usually contained substantial impurities.","Dark Blue’s Faith Refinement could be used to refine the impure faith power and enable it to be absorbed by other targets. Hence, in the future, Lin Yuan could use the impure fragments of faith power that he obtained from other lifeforms. Once the faith power had been purified, it could be used to evolve other lifeforms who needed faith power to strengthen themselves.","Dark Blue’s abilities were all related to faith power. However, its two exclusive skills were unrelated to faith power.","Charging Flow Body allowed the water in Dark Blue’s body to continue flowing rapidly. The rapidly flowing body would not restrain Dark Blue in any way. The circulation of energy in its body would not be affected either.","For a lifeform, these effects were very powerful. It was a controlling-type exclusive skill that would not restrict itself in any way but would essentially cripple other lifeforms.","Moreover, Charging Glow Body could speed up Dark Blue’s collection of faith power. This would allow Dark Blue to gather faith power even faster than before.","Mermaid Crown was strongly linked to Dark Blue’s mermaid bloodline, enabling it to control the mermaid species.","Even if the mermaids did not respect Dark Blue and its bloodline, Dark Blue could still extract and manipulate the faith power in the bodies of mermaids with inferior bloodlines.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there was no guarantee that a mermaid with a strong bloodline would be able to gain authority immediately among new mermaid species.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, mermaids clustered together in different clans. A mermaid clan had inferior mermaids at the bottom and mermaid emperors and mermaid thearchs at the top. They were all linked by their bloodlines.","Unless a mermaid’s bloodline was at a much higher level than that of another mermaid, they would end up spurned.","Mermaid Crown would allow Dark Blue to ignore the rejection from the other mermaids it wanted to control.","After Dark Blue took control of these mermaids’ faith power, it would not have to worry about these mermaids being disobedient and acting out.","Lin Yuan would not express excessive pity toward mermaids just because he had the mermaid thearch bloodline.","Ever since Lin Yuan activated his Body of All Spirits, he could control the bloodlines of all species in the world. If he was especially merciful toward them, there would be no need for him to head to the Sky Beyond the Clouds to contest for supremacy!","Aside from enabling Dark Blue to take control of the faith power of mermaids with inferior bloodlines, Mermaid Crown also allowed Dark Blue’s faith power to improve when the mermaids in the vicinity gained faith power.","Lin Yuan learned from his communication with Dark Blue that Mermaid Crown could cover an area the same size as that of Ocean Abundance.","It seemed that aside from using Ocean Abundance to nurture aquatic lifeforms that could produce resources, Lin Yuan also needed to nurture promising mermaids to speed up the improvement of Dark Blue’s divine kingdom!","Lin Yuan had learned from Fan Lou and Kong Huan that most of the mermaids from the East Universe had relocated to the North Universe.","The Bloodians in the East Universe had targeted the mermaids and continuously invaded their living spaces. It was said that this was because a bigshot of the Bloodians desired the mermaid bloodline.","The East Universe was enormous. When Lin Yuan first arrived, he would have to begin by developing quietly. He could not begin searching for the mermaids immediately.","This led Lin Yuan to think of the mermaids in the main world.","The mermaids came to the main world through a dimensional rift and found the main world’s environment to be suitable. They thus began proliferating their presence in the main world.","Mermaids were affiliated with water. As a result, more water-type lifeforms felt a certain level of affection for mermaids. Even the violent sea beasts would never lay a hand on the mermaids and attempt to eat them unless they were starving.","Now, the mermaids were done taking over the main world’s seas. This had brought peace to the seas. The mermaids would even help the human trading boats they encountered to clear their paths.","However, this was just the present.","As time continued passing in the main world, the mermaids would eventually supersede the Vast Sea Labyrinth as the rulers of the seas.","Mermaids had beautiful appearances, but they were not kind. They were highly intelligent creatures and were just as ambitious as humans. If not reined in, they would definitely attack the main world.","There were signs of the mermaids doing so in the water world.","As a species that prioritized bloodline, the mermaids would be unwilling to share the sea with other species as long as they had sufficient power to keep them out.","There were very few sea beasts in the water world’s territory occupied by the mermaids.","A few inferior mermaids would even leave the mermaids’ territory to hunt sea beasts and cruelly attack them for sport.","Lin Yuan had already noticed these issues some time ago.","He felt he could use this opportunity to raise the mermaids in the Spirit Lock spatial zone before taking proper control of them.","Dark Blue already had a higher mermaid emperor bloodline and was capable of ruling the mermaids.","Under Lin Yuan’s orders, the emperor-class mermaids, Dazzling Silver, Light Green Umber, Dark Blue, and Red Beauty, listened to Dark Blue’s orders and assisted it dutifully.","It would not be long before Dark Blue’s bloodline evolved to mermaid thearch.","...","After evolving Dark Blue, Lin Yuan stretched.","He did not intend to evolve any more feys in the main world.","In the three years that had passed, Lin Yuan’s appearance had not changed much. However, his charisma was outstanding! He radiated the aura of an elite.","In the past three years, Lin Yuan had completed the final safeguards for the main world and had increased the power of all the people he needed to do so. Even if he left the main world with his team now, the main world would be able to continue functioning stably for at least the next 1,000 years.","As for how the main world would continue developing after 1,000 years, that would be up to the main world’s fate!","Lin Yuan would continue to protect the main world in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and would not allow it to be invaded or disturbed.","...","In the past 10 years, Chu Ci had also grown up into a lady. After being nurtured by Lin Yuan, she had reached the Divine Kingdom level sooner than him.","Chu Ci had been reliable since young. As she followed Lin Yuan around, she slowly came to understand that the meaning of power was protection.","In Chu Ci’s journey of growth, she also came to have someone in her life whom she wholeheartedly wanted to protect. This person was Lin Yuan.","In the past, Chu Ci lacked power and was unable to protect Lin Yuan.","But now, she had considerable power and would continue to increase it.","Besides staying by Lin Yuan’s side, Chu Ci frequently went to see Cold Moon to receive her teachings.","Cold Moon’s teachings no longer only involved those of increasing her power. Instead, Cold Moon focused more on teaching Chu Ci to nurture her capabilities.","Cold Moon also taught Chu Ci management skills and was considered Liu Jie’s peer. In terms of military campaigns, she was no match for Liu Jie. But when it came to negotiation, she was stronger than him.","For the past three years, Lin Yuan had sent Chu Ci to liaise with the mermaids. The mermaids were now all living in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Luckily, the Spirit Lock spatial zone was sufficiently large, and the mermaids were a relatively small species. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would have no way of containing all of them!","In the last three years that Lin Yuan spent evolving the main world, Hu Quan had also worked hard on building the base on Sky Sea’s back to the best of his abilities.","...","Lin Yuan sought out Wen Yu.","Wen Yu had slowed down her pace of life in the past few years. Since she already intended to leave the main world to head to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there was no need for Wen Yu to continue managing the main world.","Once she left, someone would have to take over her job.","In the past three years, aside from paying attention to Sky City and managing its internal affairs, Wen Yu had returned to her role as a Weaver and helped Lin Yuan to make many new sets of clothes.","Now that she had changed from a busy lifestyle to a rather mundane one, Wen Yu’s mindset had improved significantly.","When Wen Yu spotted Lin Yuan, she set down the scissors she was holding and smiled in greeting.","Wen Yu’s long hair reached her waist, and her lips curled gently. “Young Master, I am almost done making this new set of clothes. I don’t make many half-armors, so I spent a lot of time picking the inner lining.”","Lin Yuan smiled. “Wen Yu, in the past three years, your mindset has improved the most out of you, me, and Big Brother Liu. However, it won’t be long before you lose all your free time.”","Wen Yu’s eyes flashed. “Young Master, all the people who will be heading with you to the Sky Beyond the Clouds have received Thoughts Letter Papers. I will send out the message now!”","Lin Yuan grinned.","Regardless of what he said, Wen Yu was always able to understand his meaning immediately.","“Wen Yu, inform the others, but I will let Master know personally.”","Wen Yu nodded seriously.","In truth, Wen Yu had not been very happy when the Moon Empress joined Sky City.","This was not because Wen Yu disrespected the Moon Empress.","It was actually the opposite. As a previous moon attendant in the Radiant Moon Palace, Wen Yu had always seen the Moon Empress as her idol. It was also the Moon Empress who had given her the chance to change her destiny.","Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Wen Yu had established Sky City.","Wen Yu was very afraid that after the Moon Empress joined Sky City, Lin Yuan would no longer be Sky City’s true leader.","However, it was proven that she had overthought.","After the Moon Empress joined Sky City, she followed Lin Yuan quietly and acted as Sky City’s support.","With her joining Sky City, the faction’s management simplified significantly.","Both in the past and now, the Moon Empress quietly sheltered Lin Yuan and helped him to lay down a steady path.","Hence, Wen Yu understood the respect that Lin Yuan felt for the Moon Empress."]},{"number":2809,"title":"Chapter 2809 Night Leaning Moon has Yet to Come!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2809 Night Leaning Moon has Yet to Come!","“Young Master, I will go and let the rest know now! Where should I tell them to gather? Should we meet in Thick Soil City in the Startling Lines Continent or the Radiance Federation’s Royal Capital?”","Every person in the main world had their own ties. Lin Yuan would give them the time to say their goodbyes.","The World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Sky Sea was not suited to appear in front of the main world’s lifeforms.","After some pondering, Lin Yuan decided that neither the Royal Capital nor Thick Soil City was the best choice. He eventually decided to set the location as Epoch God Palace.","After all, the path to the Sky Beyond the Clouds started in Epoch God Palace.","Lin Yuan told Wen Yu the geographic coordinates of Epoch God Palace so she could make the arrangements.","There were no longer any dangers in the main world.","Sky City’s members would be able to handle any issues even if the journey was long.","Now, all of Sky City’s white-clothed followers had reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. They were slightly stronger than Lin Yuan, the City Lord of Sky City.","Wen Yu had never been to Epoch God Palace and did not know what location Lin Yuan had decided on. But he had to have his reasons for setting that location.","The moment Wen Yu used the Thoughts Letter Paper to send out the message, all of its recipients’ expressions turned stern.","All of them knew they would eventually be leaving the main world for the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Now that the day had come, they felt excitement and reluctance. All of these emotions eventually morphed into determination.","Sky City’s white-clothed followers were now the strongest group in the entire main world.","But a few decades ago, every single white-clothed follower had been the plainest among the main world’s residents. None of them had been able to contract a decent fey in their youth. They had also been unable to comprehend Willpower Runes regardless of how hard they worked because they lacked the Creation Master resources to strengthen themselves.","As adventurers, it was tough for them to join a faction and earn resources to increase their strength. It was a kind of hardship that could not be perceived or understood by anyone else.","The turning point only came once they met Lin Yuan and joined Sky City. Their positions transformed, and their characters changed as well.","Now, their incredible power has brought them great benefits and convenience. The white-clothed followers were thankful for the help they had received from Sky City.","After making their arrangements, the white-clothed followers resolutely headed toward the coordinates that Wen Yu had sent.","Su Yiren, Luo Lan, and the rest also contacted Wen Yu immediately after receiving the message to tell her they needed a few days to tie up loose ends.","However, the two of them continued serving as the compasses. They needed to leave a set of instructions before they could lay down their worries and leave.","But now, the two of them had thought things through clearly. Remaining in the main world would curb their development.","Rather than remaining in the main world, their dream was to head to a wider world and work alongside Lin Yuan in growing his faction.","Previously, Lin Yuan had selflessly helped them while they were trying to revive the Dark Continent and take back and develop the Iron Hammer Federation. Without his help, neither of them would have been capable of accomplishing these feats.","Once they went to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it would be time for them to help him!","Luo Lan and Su Yiren would be working hard together for the same cause.","...","When Wen Yu used the Thoughts Letter Paper to send out the message, Lin Yuan used the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Space Tunnel to travel to the Radiant Moon Palace’s inner palace.","Even after all the years that had passed, Lin Yuan was still the only one aside from Cold Moon, Mystic Moon, and the four tea attendants who could enter and leave the Radiant Moon Palace’s inner palace freely.","The Moon Empress’ focus was no longer on increasing her power. She was the Radiance Federation’s top expert. Despite possessing talent that far exceeded that of others, the Moon Empress’ journey had not been an easy one, and she had brushed against death countless times.","However, Lin Yuan’s abilities made all her hard work seem insignificant.","In terms of their level of power, Sky City’s white-clothed followers were all just as powerful as the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress felt that her effort was better spent supporting Lin Yuan than increasing her power. After all, Lin Yuan could just use the method he used previously to increase her power.","The Moon Empress was not an old-fashioned and conservative person. She understood what she needed to do to express her value to the greatest extent. Hence, unlike Chef Supreme and the Bamboo Monarch, she was not in a dilemma over the purpose of increasing her power.","When the Moon Empress saw Lin Yuan, she set down the documents in her hand and told him with a smile, “Little Yuan, your subordinate Bai Qinghuan is a rare, talented strategist! With the world’s current prosperity, her military talent and bloodthirst are too strong and not positive traits. But in a place like the Sky Beyond the Clouds, these are necessary qualities! She is worth using but needs to be restrained!”","The Moon Empress’ tone was serious when she said that.","Lin Yuan also agreed with her assessment.","The Moon Empress had to have carefully examined Bai Qinghuan before making such an assessment.","Lin Yuan had not relied heavily on Bai Qinghuan in the past ten years.","Bai Qinghuan had remained in the Radiance Federation ever since she had been instructed to work alongside Hollow Earth in taking down the dimensional wall.","This had caused Bai Qinghuan to be terrified, and she would frequently pray for the chance to speak to Lin Yuan. However, she had never been granted the opportunity.","For the past few years, Lin Yuan had been busy nurturing feys and the main world’s experts to increase the main world’s overall strength. He had not had any time to meet with Bai Qinghuan.","Moreover, he felt that rather than seeing Bai Qinghuan, it would be better to give her the chance to settle down and stabilize her mindset.","Ten years had passed, and the Moon Empress had given Bai Qinghuan such an assessment. This meant that Bai Qinghuan had indeed grown and improved significantly these past few years.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Lin Yuan would pair her up with Keira so they could commandeer the demon insects in the conquest across the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","This was akin to throwing a stone to ask for directions. Through the demon insects, Lin Yuan would be able to begin his development rapidly.","“Master, Bai Qinghuan’s character has improved significantly in the past few years. She could not be relied on in the past!”","At that point, Lin Yuan said solemnly, “Master, it’s time to set off. We will leave the Radiance Federation together five days later. You should also say your goodbyes to your old cohorts!”","The Moon Empress had more ties in the Radiance Federation than Lin Yuan did. There was no question she was reluctant to leave them behind.","However, she eventually chose to leave with him. Before she left, she needed to make her rounds to say her goodbyes.","Lin Yuan would also have to do the difficult job of saying goodbye to his companions and loved ones over the next few days.","Lin Yuan had already done this with Gao Feng, Xia Qing, and the rest.","Before he left, Lin Yuan would take Chu Ci to see Uncle Li and Auntie Zhang.","The Moon Empress smiled and adjusted Lin Yuan’s collar.","Truthfully, she had already said her goodbyes.","With the Moon Empress’s position, these people had come to see her instead.","However, there was one person who had yet to come to see her. This was the Chief Guard of the Spirit Guards, Night Leaning Moon.","The main world’s seas were calm, and the Radiance Federation was peaceful and prosperous.","The Spirit Guards had finished their expansion six years ago.","Although there were still things that Night Leaning Moon needed to do as the Chief Guard, she was not overly busy.","The reason Night Leaning Moon had not come to see the Moon Empress was that she did not want to say goodbye to her.","Lin Yuan had already decided that they were setting off.","Since Night Leaning Moon had yet to come to see her, she would go and see Night Leaning Moon instead!","The Moon Empress knew why Night Leaning Moon had chosen to stay behind in the main world. It was because she knew that she supported Night Leaning Moon’s decision. The Radiance Federation truly needed Night Leaning Moon badly as well.","Everything had to come to an end eventually, and everyone had to eventually say their goodbyes to one another. Separation was something that every person needed to face.","“Little Yuan, stay for lunch. I will need to leave in the afternoon and will meet with you at the Return from Faraway Mansion five days later. Since we’re leaving, the Space Tunnel you created in the Radiant Moon Palace’s inner palace can be removed. If you leave the Space Tunnel here, it will prevent the Ethereal Jellyfish from creating new tunnels!”","The Moon Empress was the one who had prepared the Ethereal Jellyfish for Lin Yuan, and she was well aware of its circumstances. The Ethereal Jellyfish needed to be the one to remove the Space Tunnel.","Lin Yuan had not nurtured the Ethereal Jellyfish in the past ten years. Ever since the Ethereal Jellyfish comprehended the Willpower Rune, it had remained in the Spirit Lock spatial zone to absorb pure spirit qi. It had successfully reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom two years ago.","When Lin Yuan summoned the Ethereal Jellyfish, he checked on it using True Data.","Lin Yuan had not looked at the Ethereal Jellyfish’s data since its last evolution.","[Fey Name]: Ethereal Jellyfish","[Fey Species]: Ulmaridae/Floating Jellyfish","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (3/10)","[Fey Type]: Spatial","[Fey Quality]: Elementary Divine Kingdom","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Tentacle Node]: By breaking its tentacles, the broken tentacles are treated as a spatial node.","[Node Teleportation]: By sensing a spatial node, it transports targets toward a certain spatial node.","[Node Activation]: The spatial teleportation marked by the Tentacle Node will be activated, and the target of the activated node will be teleported to other Tentacle Nodes or toward itself. Tentacle Node will be invalidated after the teleportation.","[Dissociate Catch]: When the Ethereal Jellyfish is traveling through various dimensions, it can catch some of the spatial energy in different dimensions and condense them into spatial crystals.","[Main Tentacle]: A main tentacle will grow from the Ethereal Jellyfish’s body. When a large amount of spatial energy is supplied to the main tentacle, it falls off. The fallen main tentacle can create a Space Tunnel anywhere that connects to the Ethereal Jellyfish’s location.","[Spatial Shift]: The energy in a specified area can be rounded up. When the Ethereal Jellyfish lights up and goes to another dimension, the energy from the specified area can be brought to the other dimension.","[Space Collapse]: A space will be selected, and its own spatial energy will be injected into this space. This will cause the space to collapse, and whatever is within it will be released.","[Space Stasis]: A space will be selected, and its own spatial energy will be used to fortify the space. This will prevent the space from crumbling or being targeted by special spatial abilities.","[Abyss Fishing]: Its own energy will be drained, and its tentacles will be placed within an abyss to fish for entities that have been released into the abyss or lifeforms that exist within the abyss. (The lifeforms being fished need to be weaker than itself.)","[Overload Transformation]: The bottom of every main tentacle will split off into an imitation that is linked to the main tentacle. The imitation will be able to help it store a large amount of spatial energy. At key moments, the spatial energy can be used to make up for its lack of spatial energy.","Exclusive Skills:","[Space Tunnel]: Break off a large number of tentacles or fuse the tentacles with spatial spiritual materials in the space to form special long-distance space passageways. When there are three long-distance space passageways, one of them has to be removed before a new one can be set up.","[Tentacle Sacrifice Antenna Formation]: Form an antenna formation from all the tentacle nodes. When the tentacle nodes are sacrificed, the energy can be used as a guide to the antenna formation. Once the guide has been accepted, the spatial energy will freeze the surrounding space, and one will cross through space to return to the antenna formation.","[Tentacle Strengthening]: All of its tentacles will be strengthened while they are growing. The amount of energy in the tentacles will be increased and can be used frequently. The effects of sacrificing the tentacles will also be amplified.","[Abyss Shining]: A temporary location will be marked. All of the energy in its body will be drained to hide the marked location in the abyss. It will only reappear some time later.","[Abyss Beast Transformation]: The rare Abyssal Beast bloodline in its body will be triggered to turn its body into an Abyssal Beast. After the transformation, its abilities will also change and become more inclined toward attack, defense, and control, which are more related to combat. Its combat and survival capabilities will be significantly raised.","[Abyssal Beast Domination]: The tentacles will be combined with the energy in the Abyssal Beast bloodline. The tentacles will be able to control the might of the Abyssal Beast bloodline and turn it into its servant. (It will only be able to control Abyssal Beasts weaker than itself.)","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Path Duplication]: When spatial teleportation tunnels or spatial teleportation gates are encountered, faith power can be used to dissect the path and make a copy of them. Its spatial energy can be used to reopen the teleportation paths.","While Lin Yuan was checking on the Ethereal Jellyfish’s data, the Moon Empress was also examining the Ethereal Jellyfish. Her expression was one of growing amazement."]},{"number":2810,"title":"Chapter 2810 Your Name!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2810 Your Name!","The Ethereal Jellyfish was a spatial source-type lifeform that the Moon Empress had found for Lin Yuan.","The Moon Empress’ ability to comprehend Willpower Runes was very strong, but it was still not easy.","Yet, Lin Yuan had managed to nurture this spatial source-type fey to such a degree.","It was difficult for the Moon Empress not to be amazed by Lin Yuan’s ability to nurture feys.","Lin Yuan looked at the abilities, exclusive skills, and divine kingdom ability that the Ethereal Jellyfish had gained and thought, When I realized that the Ethereal Jellyfish reacts to the Abyssal Beast bloodline, I gave it the extracted bloodline to absorb. Now, the Ethereal Jellyfish has gained abilities related to the Abyssal Beasts.","This significantly increased the Ethereal Jellyfish’s ability to acclimate to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Taking Space Collapse and Space Stasis as examples, one drained its energy to pierce a selected space and release the entities within, while the other used the energy to fortify the selected space to prevent it from crumbling or being targeted by others. These two abilities were useful in daily life and battle.","However, compared to a special functional-type ability like Abyss Fishing, the value of these two abilities was almost void!","Abyss Fishing allowed the Ethereal Jellyfish to drain all of the energy in its body to place its tentacles in an abyss before using the tentacles to fish for entities that had either been released into the abyss or that existed there. Lifeforms weaker than the Ethereal Jellyfish could also be picked out.","Anything that could avoid being destroyed by the abyss and could continue drifting there was not simple and extremely valuable.","Most of the lifeforms that could be found in the abyss were Abyssal Beasts. If the Abyssal Beast caught by the Ethereal Jellyfish was too strong, the Ethereal Jellyfish would suffer a backlash. But unless the Abyssal Beast, which was weaker than the Ethereal Jellyfish, had potential, it would not have much use.","The Ethereal Jellyfish also had to undertake risks when it used Abyss Fishing. Unless the Ethereal Jellyfish could increase its power and reach Pinnacle Divine Kingdom level, at the very least, Lin Yuan would not instruct it to use Abyss Fishing.","Abyss Fishing seemed similar to Dissociate Catch. However, Dissociate Catch targeted dimensional energy in a space, while Abyss Fishing targeted that which did not belong to this world.","The World Emperor ability Overload Transformation fundamentally raised the Ethereal Jellyfish’s potential and value.","The Ethereal Jellyfish’s main tentacles would produce an imitation that could store a large amount of energy. This meant that the Ethereal Jellyfish would be able to gain a large vessel in which to store a large volume of energy.","This store of energy would allow the Ethereal Jellyfish to release the spatial energy explosively at crucial moments. This could get Lin Yuan out of sticky situations.","In the past, the Ethereal Jellyfish did not have endurance-type abilities. But with its endurance-type ability, ιt would be able to stay in the battle for longer ανδ become more effective at shortening travel time.","Among the newly gained abilities, Abyss Fishing was the only one related to the Abyssal Beast bloodline.","However, Abyss Shining and Abyssal Beast Transformation were linked to the Ethereal Jellyfish’s Abyssal Beast bloodline.","Abyss Shining was a characteristic exclusive skill that most Abyssal Beasts had.","An enormous space would be pulled into the abyss when there was a large-scale invasion of Abyssal Beasts in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. They would then eliminate the lifeforms that had entered the abyss.","The large factions from all four universes would send experts to exterminate the Abyssal Beasts because they feared that the Abyssal Beasts would gather together to set off a disaster.","Abyssal Beast Transformation was an exclusive skill that enabled an Abyssal Beast to attack the main world. It was an exclusive skill that essentially sealed off a space. As a result, the entities in the space could not be removed temporarily. It increased the occupancy time of the entities.","When the Ethereal Jellyfish tapped into its new bloodline, it would be able to transform into an Abyssal Beast. Its abilities would then change into attack-, defense-, and control-type ones that increased its combat capabilities.","This exclusive skill was very similar to Chimey’s transformation abilities.","However, Lin Yuan was not satisfied with Abyssal Beast Transformation because the Ethereal Jellyfish did not serve any combat functions.","Tentacle Sacrifice Antenna Formation allowed the Ethereal Jellyfish to become an important fey that coordinated with Sky Sea.","The Ethereal Jellyfish needed to be protected. How could it ever be in danger?","Meanwhile, Abyssal Beast Domination allowed the Ethereal Jellyfish to combine its tentacles with the energy in the new bloodline to control Abyssal Beasts and turn them into its servants.","The Abyssal Beasts were extremely difficult to control and tame, but they had a myriad of abilities and stood out from the crowd.","The strong factions in the four universes frequently went on expeditions to exterminate Abyssal Beasts, but they also spent resources to round up and take control of groups of them.","If the Abyssal Beasts under Faerie Institution’s control went on a rampage, it would cause a Class A disaster.","A faction like Faerie Institution insisted on taking control of Abyssal Beasts despite knowing that they were dangerous. This was enough to prove their value.","The Ethereal Jellyfish would combine its tentacles with the new bloodline and inject it into the Abyssal Beast to take control of it.","The Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles would strategically move around in the Abyssal Beast’s body. Hence, it could only take control of Abyssal Beasts with a weaker bloodline than its own.","While the Ethereal Jellyfish was evolving, the Abyssal Beast it obtained externally defined its bloodline and was difficult to evolve.","Without Lin Yuan’s Body of All Spirits that could evolve the purity of the bloodline in the Ethereal Jellyfish’s body, Abyssal Beast Domination would be a useless exclusive skill!","No spirit qi professional wanted their fey to obtain a powerful ability that did not serve any practical function.","However, Lin Yuan felt that the three exclusive skills related to the Abyssal Beast bloodline could not be compared to Tentacle Strengthening.","Almost all of the Ethereal Jellyfish’s abilities came from its tentacles and antennae. When its tentacles and antennae were strengthened, all of its abilities would be enhanced.","Once the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles and antennae were strengthened and the energy within was improved, not only would its teleportation abilities and distance be enhanced, but the depletion of the teleportation process would also be reduced. This would enable a tentacle to be used multiple times.","While Lin Yuan was looking through the Ethereal Jellyfish’s data, the Moon Empress sighed softly. “Little Yuan, the Ethereal Jellyfish’s divine kingdom ability isn’t bad. However, it will put you at risk.”","Lin Yuan smiled. “Master, you know how I am. I won’t put myself in danger unless absolutely necessary! But if I attain a useful ability, we will have more options when facing problems!","“If the Ethereal Jellyfish’s divine kingdom ability is used to recreate a path, there will be a large number of benefits to grab hold of. There might even be the uncovering of secrets that no one else knows about!","When the Moon Empress first found out about the Sky Beyond the Clouds and learned that Lin Yuan intended to venture into that world, she thought that he had picked an arduous path.","However, it was proven that she had underestimated him.","Lin Yuan had begun accumulating energy in the main world. He had also used the experts under him to stop the invaders from plundering the main world.","The Moon Empress learned a lot about the Sky Beyond the Clouds from Lin Yuan. She knew full well why those experts had come to the main world.","If Lin Yuan had not had the ability to slaughter them, the main world would either have been destroyed by the invaders or have lost the majority of its resources.","The Radiance Federation was currently the heart of the main world and would definitely be the invaders’ main target.","The main world did not have a clear idea of the strength of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter. After all, she had yet to watch them in action.","But if they had the ability to take down the invaders swiftly and without making any waves, it was proof they would also be considered exceptional even in the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","The Moon Empress did not nag at Lin Yuan to tell him to be careful.","Lin Yuan was the City Lord of Sky City and had the ultimate decision-making authority. With his current power and abilities, he was able to make the right decisions.","The Moon Empress was not an old-fashioned teacher who thought she would always have to be the one teaching her disciple.","When the Moon Empress was teaching Lin Yuan, her experience and knowledge had been above his. But now, she admitted that he was more capable and stronger than her!","...","In the afternoon, the Moon Empress personally cooked lunch.","After lunch, the Moon Empress left for the Midnight Palace.","In the Radiance Federation’s Royal Capital, the Midnight Palace was just as famous as the Radiant Moon Palace.","The Radiant Moon Palace housed the Moon Empress, one of the Radiance Federation’s three strongest Creation Masters, while the Midnight Palace housed the Chief Guard of the Spirit Guards. Both were members of the Radiance Federation’s royalty.","The Midnight Palace sat in the north of the city and was surrounded by an enormous garden filled with statues. Despite being part of the city, the garden afforded the Midnight Palace a solemn tranquility.","The Guard Ye Banquet was held in the Midnight Palace.","Normally, it was Night Leaning Moon who went to the Radiant Moon Palace to see the Moon Empress.","This was the first time that the Moon Empress visited the Midnight Palace since the Guard Ye Banquet had ended.","The Moon Empress did not ride the Freezing Moon Pagoda Carriage, which was iconic of her status. Instead, she made her way to the hidden entrance of the Midnight Palace’s garden like a regular traveler.","The entrance to the Midnight Palace’s garden was guarded.","The moment the two guards spotted the Moon Empress, they instantly recognized her and bowed hurriedly.","The businesslike woman dressed in half armor hastily said, “Moon Empress, I will go and send word to the Chief Guard this instant!”","This woman had already guessed that the Moon Empress had not informed Night Leaning Moon of her visit. If she had done so, given their relationship, Night Leaning Moon would have come to the entrance to receive the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress waved her hand. “The two of you can continue guarding this place. There’s no need to send word on my behalf. I’ll just go in to see Leaning Moon!”","Once the Moon Empress was done speaking, she morphed into a ray of moonlight and streaked through the garden before stopping at the Midnight Palace.","In the Midnight Palace’s study...","A woman with black hair that fell to her hips and wearing a veil over her face was currently staring unsmilingly at the book in her hands. Her mind was someplace far away.","Night Leaning Moon was born with a silver spoon in her mouth. She was a direct descendant of her family, and they had placed high hopes in her. Her childhood and younger days were similar to that of Long Tao of Coiling Dragon’s Valley.","In her younger days, Night Leaning Moon had also been arrogant and ignorant.","However, everything changed when ‘she’ appeared.","The Moon Empress did not have the support of a family and only ever relied on herself.","At first, Night Leaning Moon had not thought much of the Moon Empress.","In the first two years since becoming classmates, the Moon Empress had not stood out. There had been absolutely nothing special about her.","In the final evaluation of their third year, the Moon Empress had leaped ahead of all the rest and became first place in their class. One of those she had surpassed was Ji Changdeng, who had always butted heads with Night Leaning Moon.","It was only then that Night Leaning Moon began paying attention to this tall and cold yet delicate girl.","Night Leaning Moon’s eyes had never left the Moon Empress since.","From then on, they began walking their paths side by side, deepening their bond.","Night Leaning Moon had experienced heartfelt separation twice in her life thus far.","The first time was when she learned that the Moon Empress had suffered hidden injuries and only had five years left in her lifespan. The second was when she learned that the Moon Empress intended to leave for the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Both times, Night Leaning Moon had felt a sense of helplessness.","There was nothing that terrified Night Leaning Moon more than separation. However, she had no choice but to face the music.","Previously, the separation had been filled with grief and ardent hatred for the Freedom Federation.","But this one only had unadulterated reluctance.","The Moon Empress leaving for the Sky Beyond the Clouds was not as bad as her lifespan coming to an end.","But it was likely they would never be able to meet again.","The decades that they had spent together were clearly etched in Night Leaning Moon’s mind and began playing through scene by scene.","Slowly, Night Leaning Moon’s gaze cleared, and she sighed woefully.","“Xiyue. Oh, Xiyue. With this goodbye, our twin souls will be pulled apart. Do you still remember my original name?”","Night Leaning Moon’s sigh was soft and gentle. The last thing she expected was a response.","At that moment, a cold voice echoed from the door of the study. “Of course, I still remember your name!”"]},{"number":2811,"title":"Chapter 2811 I’m Leaving the Radiant Moon Palace to You!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2811 I’m Leaving the Radiant Moon Palace to You!","Night Leaning Moon’s head snapped up.","Night Leaning Moon was not surprised that the Moon Empress had come to see her.","She had to say goodbye to Night Leaning Moon before she left.","Night Leaning Moon did not have the courage to go and see the Moon Empress herself.","Now that she was here, it meant that her departure was imminent.","Night Leaning Moon could not stop the tears from welling up in her eyes.","Just as Night Leaning Moon was about to rise to open the door for the Moon Empress, she saw the latter push the door open and step in.","It had been fine when they were not in each other’s presence. But now that they were face to face, the emotions bottled up, and Night Leaning Moon lost her iron grip on her composure.","“Ye Lin. That’s your original name. But I prefer your current name to your old one. The name I gave you. Leaning Moon, we spent our youths together and dedicated our lives to protecting the Radiance Federation once we became experts.","“We have always shared the same goals. But now, our goals have diverged, and we’ve made our own choices. Even if we’re apart, we’ll continue excelling in our chosen fields. You have formed a contract with the Lifespan Mouse and gained an endless lifespan! It’s not impossible we’ll be able to meet again in the future!”","The Moon Empress knew that Night Leaning Moon was not the type to beat around the bush. She had her own dreams and opinions. Otherwise, she would definitely have chosen to go with the Moon Empress to the Sky Beyond the Clouds when she invited her!","Night Leaning Moon’s emotions had erupted because she could not bear for the Moon Empress to leave.","The Moon Empress felt the same!","The Moon Empress had an icy personality, which was undoubtedly related to her childhood.","Night Leaning Moon was the direct descendant of an elite family, while the Moon Empress was an orphan who did not even know who her parents were. Had that mysterious beggar not taken her in, she would never have been able to step foot on the path to becoming a Creation Master, much less contract her feys.","The Moon Empress had locked up her heart long ago. She had seen too much of the ugly side of the world. As a result, she no longer craved warmth and sincerity.","Before the mysterious beggar took her in, she had once scrounged for food scraps in garbage bins to keep her skinny body alive.","At that time, the Radiance Federation had not been as prosperous or abundant as it was now.","This was why the Moon Empress had been able to connect with Lin Yuan when she took him in as her disciple. Only those who had experienced such a life could understand how tough it was.","With such a mindset, the Moon Empress preferred to keep to herself. She had been a far cry from the person she was now, resolute in her dream of giving her everything for the sake of the Radiance Federation.","Without Night Leaning Moon, the Moon Empress would never have accepted the feelings of her companions.","When she saw Night Leaning Moon’s expression, in a rare occurrence, the Moon Empress revealed her true emotions.","She stepped forward and hugged Night Leaning Moon before saying softly into her ear, “Leaning Moon, since you aren’t intending to go to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, you can stay in the main world and help with its evolution!","“These are the resources I’m leaving for you to use. It should be able to last you almost 1,000 years! Since you’ve decided to stay in the main world, you can become the main world’s protector! You can protect the main world from any anomalies that take place. I don’t trust anyone else but you!”","The Moon Empress actually hoped that Night Leaning Moon would go with her to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","But when Night Leaning Moon turned her down, the Moon Empress was reluctant but also relieved.","Lin Yuan had made a lot of preparations to keep the main world safe.","The Moon Empress had not had the chance to get to know the people Lin Yuan relied on.","But she knew that regardless of what happened, Night Leaning Moon would never endanger the main world and the Radiance Federation.","This was not just trust between friends. It could be said that the Moon Empress and Night Leaning Moon were soulmates! It was a bond that went beyond that of friendship and romance. Only those who possessed such a bond could understand it.","Night Leaning Moon forcefully scrunched her nose twice before saying with a smile, “Xiyue, with me around, there’s nothing that you need to worry about!","“Little Yuan allowed me to contract the Lifespan Mouse and enabled me to gain an endless lifespan. Once the main world evolves, I might have the chance to head to the Sky Beyond the Clouds! We will be reunited then!”","Night Leaning Moon’s lips trembled while she said that. She still could not bear for the Moon Empress to leave. But she knew that this separation was unavoidable. If that were the case, it would be better for her to send the Moon Empress off with a smile.","“Xiyue, the date for the departure to the Sky Beyond the Clouds must have been decided on. When are you leaving? I’ll send you off personally.”","The Moon Empress looked at Night Leaning Moon calmly and paused for a moment before saying softly, “I will leave the Radiance Federation with Little Yuan five days later. Why don’t I stay here in the Midnight Palace for the next few days?","“Given the circumstances, it’s the best time to drink the Moon Night Wine you buried in the Endless Pond. Let’s drink and make merry! Now that I’m thinking about it, we haven’t had a proper talk since becoming members of royalty!”","At that point, Night Leaning Moon could no longer hold back, and tears began flowing down her cheeks. The image of the Moon Empress became blurry.","Since the Moon Empress was going to spend her last five days before leaving in the Midnight Palace, it meant that Night Leaning Moon was the person the Moon Empress cared the most about. This alone was enough!","“Xiyue, I’ve been burying the Moon Night Wine for you. I bury 30 bottles every year. The snow from the plum blossoms falls onto the Endless Pond every winter. I will go and fetch the oldest bottle now for us to drink.","“Why don’t you take the remaining Moon Night Wine with you so you can have a glass every time you think of me? Without you here, I wouldn’t be in the mood to drink our namesake wine.”","The Moon Empress chuckled softly. “If you bury 30 new bottles annually, there must only be more than 1,000 bottles. If I have a glass every time I think of you, I’ll finish all of the Moon Night Wine in no time!","“Once I’m gone, no one will be living in the Radiant Moon Palace. Why don’t I leave it to you? The Radiant Moon Palace is much more beautiful than your Midnight Palace!”","Night Leaning Moon gently wiped the snot from her nose and pushed down all of her feelings of bitter sadness and reluctance. She adjusted the veil across her face and said with a smile, “Xiyue, even if you didn’t leave the Radiant Moon Palace to me, I would take it for myself after you left. I won’t allow the place in the main world with the most traces of you to be handed over to anyone else!”","Night Leaning Moon retrieved the Night Moon Wine before placing it in front of the Moon Empress.","...","On the third night, Night Leaning Moon downed a full cup of the Moon Night Wine before saying, “Xiyue, Ji Changdeng’s feelings for you are real. Have you gone to see him now that you’re leaving?”","The Moon Empress shook her head. “There’s no need for me to see Ji Changdeng! It’ll be better for him this way.”","The Moon Empress knew how Ji Changdeng felt about her. He had confessed his feelings to her more than once. Each time, she would firmly turn him down so he would not have any misunderstandings about how she felt.","Ji Changdeng had been persistent in the past few years.","If the Moon Empress went to see him now, she would be giving him empty hope.","In the main world, there was no one aside from Night Leaning Moon, whom the Moon Empress felt reluctant to leave behind.","The person who she cared about the most was Lin Yuan, and he would be going with her to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","...","During the time that the Moon Empress was in the Midnight Palace, Lin Yuan brought Chu Ci to Kitchen Fragrance Palace.","Chu Ci did not have many memories of their parents but had many fond memories of Uncle Li and Auntie Zhang. She did not see them as her parents but as seniors who were very important to her.","In the past few years, Chu Ci had visited Kitchen Fragrance Palace to meet Uncle Li and Auntie Zhang more times than Lin Yuan had.","“Big Brother, when we get to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, will we be unable to see Uncle Li and Auntie Zhang ever again?”","Lin Yuan raised his hand and touched Chu Ci’s head, pressing down the stray hairs on the top of her head as he said seriously,","“I can’t say that we won’t be able to meet ever again, but we won’t be able to see them anytime soon. Uncle Li and Auntie Zhang made their choice. We need to respect them! They have both contracted the Lifespan Mice. If we ever get the chance to return to the main world, we will be able to see them again!”","It took a very long time for a newly promoted Class 2 world to be promoted to Class 3.","Objectively, Lin Yuan did not want the main world to be promoted to Class 3 because of him. Once it did, it would no longer be under any safeguards.","Class 3 worlds often clashed against each other.","A Class 3 world that was held up by a powerful force was completely different from one that had developed and built up its strength slowly!","Currently, it was difficult for the main world to compete with other Class 3 worlds.","Unless the main world was promoted to Class 3, Uncle Li, Auntie Zhang, and the rest would never be able to depart from the main world to enter the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","According to Winter, it was not easy to visit a Class 2 world.","Firstly, a strong enough mountable Abyssal Beast was needed. The experts also needed to be strong enough to withstand the world wills of the Class 2 world. The trip to the Class 2 world would only be successful once these two requirements were met.","Moreover, it was difficult to escape the detection of the major factions in the East Universe when one rode an Abyssal Beast to a Class 2 world.","The main world currently had a spotlight on it in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","For the sake of its safety, the main world could not continue to receive so much attention from the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ factions.","Unless it was absolutely necessary, Lin Yuan would not return even if he did gain an Abyssal Beast that could travel between the main world and Sky Beyond the Clouds.","...","Lin Yuan was not dropping in unexpectedly. He had given advance notice before coming. It was a sign of respect to greet elders before visiting them.","Uncle Li knew that Lin Yuan was bringing Chu Ci to bid farewell and had prepared a table full of dishes.","Li Changlin had always been open-minded and did not get hung up over goodbyes.","When Lin Yuan went to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, he would have access to a larger platform and receive even more extensive development. As such, there was not only no reason for him to be sad, but he should be congratulating Lin Yuan instead.","Chef Supreme was devastated that his youngest disciple was also going to leave with Lin Yuan. That old fogey sure was resistant to change!","His wife was just like her father. Not only was she reluctant to see Zong Ze leave, but she also could bear for Chu Ci and Lin Yuan to go.","When he left Kitchen Fragrance Palace with his wife, Chef Supreme had yet to take in Zong Ze as a disciple. His wife only began seeing Zong Ze as her junior brother when they returned to Kitchen Fragrance Palace.","In truth, his wife had a much deeper link to Lin Yuan and Chu Ci.","Chef Supreme made a personal appearance to greet Lin Yuan.","Although Chef Supreme felt reluctant to see Zong Ze leave with Lin Yuan, he knew that the Sky Beyond the Clouds would be better for Zong Ze’s development.","The Moon Empress would accompany Lin Yuan and would be able to help look after Zong Ze.","Chef Supreme left soon after welcoming Lin Yuan. He left the space to his daughter and first disciple.","Zong Ze also wanted to stay behind, but Chef Supreme dragged him away.","He had high hopes for Zong Ze and saw him as his grandson.","Chef Supreme would be giving Zong Ze his final teachings and lectures in the next few days. Once Zong Ze went to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Chef Supreme would not be able to reach him to teach him anything.","...","When Lin Yuan saw the usually bold and brash lady staring at him and Chu Ci with tears in her eyes, he hurriedly placed a golden-red pork rib onto her plate.","“Auntie Zhang, I remember that this dish is a favorite of yours and Uncle Li.”","Zhang Yingying rolled her eyes before placing two pieces of red-braised meat on Lin Yuan’s plate and scooping out a bowl of fish head soup for Chu Ci.","“Little Yuan, you still remember what I like to eat. Once you leave, you won’t be able to eat Uncle Li’s cooking anymore! You and Little Ci have to eat more this time. Uncle Li and I will be there to send you off. I can’t stop you and Little Ci from leaving, but you can’t stop us from sending you off either!”","Lin Yuan mixed red braised meat around with the rice in his bowl. There was no better fragrance than that of red braised meat mixed with rice.","Lin Yuan truly enjoyed his time with Zhang Yingying and Li Changlin.","In spite of Chu Ci’s young age, she could also understand the significance of separation. She also did her best to savor her final moments with Zhang Yingying and Li Changlin.","After the meal, Lin Yuan and Chu Ci chatted with Zhang Yingying and Li Changlin deep into the night before returning to the Return from Faraway Mansion.","Lin Yuan needed to use the next few days to confirm the exact number of people that would head to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","As the leader of Sky City, Lin Yuan would communicate with every white-clothed follower using the Thoughts Letter Paper so he could ask if they needed any help.","Some of the white-clothed followers had family in the main world.","Lin Yuan had given them these five days so they could make their arrangements for their family."]},{"number":2812,"title":"Chapter 2812 The Mother of Bloodbath Returns!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2812 The Mother of Bloodbath Returns!","Duan He was one of the first white-clothed followers to join Lin Yuan.","On the other hand, Zhou Luo had fought side by side with Lin Yuan and Liu Jie in the evolving Class 3 water world dimensional rift. The three of them had braved death together. Hence, Lin Yuan trusted Zhou Luo implicitly.","Duan He and Zhou Luo worked under Sky City and eventually became friends. It was not an exaggeration to say that they were sworn friends.","Zhou Luo did not have any family and had been staying with Duan He.","Duan He had always been family-oriented. He never forgot to bid farewell to his family before going on any missions.","But this time, the farewell would be forever.","When Duan He went to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, he would no longer be able to see his family.","Duan He was full of woe, but his family had no clue.","After Duan He left the Duan residence, Zhou Luo told him, “Old Duan, can you really bear to do this? I think that, regardless of anything else, you should tell your family the truth instead of lying about going out on a mission! Who knows when we’ll return from this journey?”","Duan He took a deep breath before responding candidly. “I am reluctant to do this, but who can bear such a goodbye? All I know is one thing. The Duan family’s current position and development are solely due to the Young Master. Because of his power, I have reached the Divine Kingdom level, a level I never imagined attaining.","“Normally, we should be using the resources we earn to increase our strength. But in actuality, all the resources we use to increase our strength come from the Young Master. All the resources I earned went to elevating the Duan family.","“At present, there are six thearch-class Duan experts. Two of them have reached Immortal. The Duan family is now one of the strongest factions in Soaring Dragon City. Rather than saying that it’s a result of my effort, it’s more accurate to say that all credit goes to the Young Master’s generosity. As such, I have to embark on this new journey with the Young Master.","“My reluctance is irrelevant. Once I’m gone, there will be others to tell them the truth. I just don’t want to say goodbye face-to-face.”","Zhou Luo nodded. It was just as Duan He said.","If any white-clothed follower had a family, they would have bright futures ahead of them.","It was true that all of this came from Lin Yuan.","It was likely that the other white-clothed followers felt the same way.","If Duan He had not joined Sky City, he would never have been able to enable the Duan family to develop to such an extent.","But, as opposed to Duan He, Zhou Luo liked his current situation.","He was alone and did not have many ties. All he needed to do was remain loyal to Sky City. He was the definition of being light-footed because he did not have love weighing him down.","The day before they were due to set off, a crown-wearing spider that resembled a red gem discreetly crawled into Lin Yuan’s hair.","Although Blood Love had already reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, Lin Yuan could still sense her presence.","Blood Love had eventually come to him.","At first, Blood Love had intended to go with Lin Yuan to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","At that time, Blood Love had it all planned out. Her parents, Blood New Moon and Jade Sundial, would accompany her to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","However, reality did not play out as so.","Blood New Moon and Jade Sundial had no intention of going to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Instead, they would stay back in the main world.","All of the ties the two of them had were in the main world. Moreover, as leaders of the Heavenly Family Cottage, the two of them had their own responsibilities.","Blood Love had always craved for a family.","Lin Yuan had realized this soon after he became acquainted with Blood Love.","Hence, Lin Yuan had sent Blood Love to the Heavenly Family Cottage to live for a period so she could think things through carefully and seriously. Would she really go with Lin Yuan to the Sky Beyond the Clouds or stay in the main world to become one of the Heavenly Family Cottage’s leaders and enjoy the experience of being part of a family?","Now, Blood Love that was hidden in his hair had just shown Lin Yuan the decision she had made.","Lin Yuan’s lips curled into a smile as he said, “My Path Protector, you will be in charge of my safety once we get to the Sky Beyond the Clouds!”","When Blood Love heard that, she realized that Lin Yuan had seen through her attempt at being stealthy.","She changed into human form and appeared next to Lin Yuan.","“Lin Yuan, don’t think I’m not aware that there are many people in your camp who are stronger than me. How could it ever be my job to protect you? I decided to go with you to the Sky Beyond the Clouds because I’m worried that leaving me behind will make you too sad.”","Blood Love poured out a cup of water for herself, her gaze never leaving Lin Yuan.","Blood Love was usually a pillar of ice and never smiled at anyone. She only offered Endless Summer the occasional warm gestures.","But after spending the past few years basked in the love of her family, Blood Love’s personality had changed drastically. All members of the Heavenly Family Cottage loved her. Hence, it was inevitable that Blood Love would become rather arrogant.","This was one of the times when Blood Love was acting arrogantly.","Blood Love had not said everything that she was thinking.","Truthfully, rather than being afraid that Lin Yuan would be sad and missing her, Blood Love was more afraid of being without Lin Yuan.","Time had cemented Blood Love’s awareness of her feelings toward Lin Yuan.","There was no greater bliss than being together with one’s companion and supporting each other through the ages.","“There are a few spiritual ingredients that came from sacred source lifeforms in this spatial equipment. It is larger than regular Diamond fey storage boxes. It has all sorts of treats to ensure that you’ll be kept satisfied in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“I heard from Spring that the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ species place a high priority on food so the standard of food there is rather high. You might become interested in the delicacies of some species!”","Blood Love gleefully received the bracelet-shaped Diamond fey storage box.","From this, she could see how much Lin Yuan cared for her.","He had made ample preparations despite being uncertain if she would also head to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Without waiting any longer, the gourmet and glutton Blood Love took a look at what food was in the spatial equipment.","At that point, Lin Yuan said, “I have already spoken to Endless Summer. If you chose to go with me to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Endless Summer would come with me. But if you decided not to go, Endless Summer would stay in the main world. Since you’ve decided to come with me, I will notify Endless Summer.”","Blood Love was once again touched by Lin Yuan.","Her parents might not be aware of her relationship with Endless Summer, but Lin Yuan was definitely aware. Lin Yuan knew just how important Endless Summer was to Blood Love.","Endless Summer had been her steadfast companion over the years. They had survived the cruelty of the forest and worked together to increase their strength.","This was a relationship that could not easily be described with words.","The two of them had saved each other countless times.","Endless Summer had great talent for internal governance. Listen would praise her when they managed the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce together.","Subsequently, Endless Summer and Wen Yu managed the private faction territories on Star Web together. When Wen Yu became busy, Endless Summer had also been able to pick up the slack and hold down the fort on her own.","Lin Yuan had always needed such internal governance talents, but it was not easy to nurture such individuals.","In spite of all the years that had passed, there was still no one who could replace Endless Summer.","She had heard that Endless Summer had also reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom and gained an impressive divine kingdom ability.","Yet, Lin Yuan would have been willing to leave Endless Summer by Blood Love’s side because he knew of their relationship.","Lin Yuan had increased Blood Love’s power all the way to pinnacle spirit fire.","When Blood Love reached pinnacle spirit fire, her bloodline showed signs of evolving. Hence, it would be best to wait for her bloodline to stabilize before continuing to increase her power.","Lin Yuan had given Blood Love numerous resources and sent Summer to watch over Blood Love. Hence, he still did not know about the divine kingdom ability she had gained.","Blood Love believed that her divine kingdom ability would be of considerable help to Lin Yuan.","Blood Love said with a straight face, “Lin Yuan, I’ll go and see Sister Summer myself! I know that your eyes are magical and can see through a lifeform’s abilities and exclusive skills. Can you see my divine kingdom ability?”","Lin Yuan smiled. He had not expected Blood Love to test him!","It was child’s play for him to check Blood Love’s divine kingdom ability.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Blood Love.","[Fey Name]: Mother of Bloodbath","[Fey Species]: Tarantulas/jade-spider-species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (2/10)","[Fey Type]: Natural (Light)/Blood","[Fey Quality]: Elementary Divine Kingdom","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Execution Sting]: Blood and light energy will be injected into the target through the eight sharp chelicerae to control their blood while simultaneously purifying them.","[Eyes of Senluo]: The spider eyes look directly at the core of the blood inside the target and anticipate the target’s next movements based on the blood flow. At the same time, the spider eyes can look through the target to a certain extent.","[Funeral of Light]: After killing a target with a strong enough soul, the target’s soul can be momentarily controlled by light energy. Once the light dries up with soul energy, the target can become a temporarily controllable zombie.","[Spider Form Attachment]: Condense its own blood energy into a blood core that can overload attacks from the outside world. When the spider core is shattered, the light energy within can restrain a target.","[Blood Control]: Call down belts of sunlight from the sun to restrain and attack targets while activating the blood energy in the target’s body. The flow of fresh blood in the target’s body can be momentarily controlled.","[Hug of Dawn’s Light]: Take in energy from the sun and swallow it to temporarily increase its power. The light energy can also be used to slowly heal injuries.","[Sun Light Drapery]: Activate the stored energy in the body during combat. A jade sundial with the carving of a sun on it will appear behind the Mother of Bloodbath. Every time the energy in its body is used, half of the energy will be taken from the sun. The jade sundial will defend against damage caused by the outside world.","[Hanging Sun Net]: With the sun at the center, its energy will be used up to activate the sun’s energy. The energy from both entities will form a net. The target trapped in the sun net will be restrained temporarily before being released to the surface of the sun.","[Foundry Day Falling Attack]: Use the energy in its body to communicate with celestial bodies and obtain their support. When the energy supplied by the celestial bodies is activated, the target can be attacked from a long distance away. The attacked target will be cleansed and free of impurities.","[Beautiful Day Condensed Essence]:","Exclusive Skills:","[Desire Spider Form]: Increase its affinity for light energy so that the body will not reject excessive light energy but will transform it into hair that can store the light energy. After the devoured light energy tempers inside the body, light energy can be absorbed directly into the body.","[Concealed Spider Shadow]: Stop the flow of its own blood energy, conceal its aura, and transform it into the form of ‘nothing’. It can then use the sun as its eyes to survey the surrounding environment.","[External Blood Bone]: The chelicerae will be fused into other young feys’ bodies so they can become its blood bones. The strength of the external blood bone cannot be higher than the strength of the target being pierced. The dark-type curses or negative soul-type effects of the target can be purified.","[Rich Light Trial]: When causing damage to a target, the target will also be injected with light elements that will have a deadly purging effect.","[Sundial Sage]: Its bloodline will be used to change other spider-species lifeforms. All spider-species fey, aside from dark-type ones, will be protected by the sun. When these spider-species feys provide it with faith power, its bloodline power will be extraordinarily boosted.","[Application Support]: It will be applied to other lifeforms, and its energy will support the target’s attacks and defenses. Its support will not affect the application abilities of other lifeforms. After the application, the target will gain its bloodline and will be boosted by celestial bodies.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Day Forging Furnace]: The spiritual ingredients will be absorbed into its body, and the energy from the celestial bodies will temper the spiritual ingredients. The spiritual ingredients will be transformed into precious instruments through the most appropriate techniques. When flesh lifeforms are being tempered, the lifeform’s physique will improve rapidly as long as it is able to handle the energy from the furnace."]},{"number":2813,"title":"Chapter 2813 Conflict in the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2813 Conflict in the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce!","Realization spread across Lin Yuan’s face.","She would only ask him such a question after obtaining a powerful divine kingdom ability.","It was proven that Blood Love’s divine kingdom ability was indeed powerful. It was irreplaceable in Lin Yuan’s team.","Day Forging Furnace allowed Blood Love to use the energy from celestial bodies to temper spiritual ingredients and turn them into the most suitable precious instruments.","There was an immense amount of energy in celestial bodies that could create precious instruments quickly.","By using the most suitable methods to temper spiritual ingredients, their effectiveness could be magnified to the greatest extent.","When Lin Yuan tempered precious instruments in the past, he had to seek the help of the few and far between Class 5 Creation Masters as well as Begin Lady.","It took a very long time for Begin Lady to use her body to temper precious instruments.","Begin Lady had spent the past ten years creating precious instruments but had yet to supply one to every white-clothed follower.","With Blood Love’s divine kingdom ability, it would be much easier for Lin Yuan to obtain precious instruments in the future.","When Begin Lady used her body to temper precious instruments, her bloodline evolution would be affected.","But when Blood Love used her divine kingdom ability to tap into the energy within celestial bodies and temper precious instruments, she would not be affected in any way. The relationship between Blood Love and celestial bodies would also be deepened.","After all, Day Forging Furnace could not only temper inanimate items like spiritual ingredients but living entities as well.","As long as the entities being tempered could handle the energy in the furnace, Day Forging Furnace would also rapidly strengthen the bodies made of flesh.","This energy did not clash with the Merciful Star Peony’s tempering effects that made use of moonlight.","Although the two abilities were similar, without the Merciful Star Peony to temper his body, Lin Yuan’s body might be unable to handle being tempered by the energy in celestial bodies.","The Merciful Star Peony’s tempering improved the fundamentals of Lin Yuan’s body.","When Blood Love used her divine kingdom ability to temper Lin Yuan’s body, his body composition could improve rapidly.","Day Forging Furnace could not only improve his body fundamentally but also help others to strengthen their bodies using the energy from within the celestial bodies.","This would also give Sky City’s other key members the chance to improve their bodies through Day Forging Furnace.","Foundry Day Falling Attack allowed Blood Love to use the energy in her body to communicate with celestial bodies and gain their support.","In other environments, she would naturally form links to the celestial bodies there and use them to strengthen herself.","Foundry Day Falling Attack would allow the celestial bodies to inject their energy into her body to enable her to attack targets across a far distance.","This long-distance combat technique allowed Blood Love to hunt and kill without revealing her face.","Since Blood Love was using the energy within celestial bodies, she would be able to roll grades to fight.","Beautiful Day Condensed Essence allowed Blood Love to use her bloodline to temporarily fuse with celestial bodies and utilize the energy in them to boost herself. It would thus be provided with a sea of energy.","This was a pure support-type ability.","The energy in celestial bodies was gargantuan. When the energy was injected into a target, there was a high chance that the target would not be able to handle it.","Luckily, Beautiful Day Condensed Essence would help to deflect this and prevent the target from suffering too much damage from the energy in the celestial bodies.","Lin Yuan had many functional-type feys.","Once Blood Love boosted them, they would be able to excel with flying colors.","Compared to these abilities, Blood Love’s two new exclusive skills were undoubtedly stronger.","Sundial Sage allowed Blood Love to use her bloodline to change other spider-species lifeforms. This would enable all spider-species lifeforms apart from dark-type ones to receive the protection of celestial bodies.","These lifeforms would provide Blood Love with faith.","When Blood Love received the faith from the spider-species lifeforms, her faith power would be significantly boosted.","This boosting would allow Blood Love to elevate her divine kingdom even faster.","For any lifeform, any ability or exclusive skill that could quickly raise their divine kingdom was extremely precious.","The other exclusive skill, Application Support, was rather similar to Beautiful Day Condensed Essence.","Yet, while one harnessed the energy emanating from celestial bodies to target, the other utilized her own spiritual form to enhance the combat and defensive capabilities of other lifeforms, channeling her energy to the target without affecting other lifeforms.","If Blood Love used Application Support on Lin Yuan, he could still merge with Dark Blue and the Abyss Red Lotus. This was enough to show Application Support’s might.","As Blood Love grew stronger, Application Support’s boosting effects would also be raised.","Additionally, once Application Support was used on a target, the target would also receive the same bloodline and be boosted by celestial bodies.","Lin Yuan was well aware of the effects of being boosted by celestial bodies.","When Blood Love was applied to a target, she would only be able to boost the target to a small extent compared to the boost from a celestial body.","Lin Yuan raised his hand and gave Blood Love a thumbs-up before saying with a smile, “Blood Love, you will probably be making many precious instruments, strengthening my body, and boosting me in the future! I also want to know what it feels like to receive your bloodline and experience being adored by celestial bodies!”","Lin Yuan’s words caused surprise to bloom on Blood Love’s face.","Blood Love knew that Lin Yuan could see a fey’s exclusive skills and abilities. However, she did not know whether he could also see the new abilities she gained after her evolution!","She was stronger than Lin Yuan. He was currently a pinnacle spirit-fire expert, while she had already reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","Blood Love raised an eyebrow before saying with a smile, “There’s nothing difficult about allowing you to experience my bloodline.”","Blood Love used Application Support on Lin Yuan.","Blood Love’s body turned into a golden-red ray of light and enveloped Lin Yuan. His body was thus draped in a golden-red glow. Then, a radiant sun appeared above Lin Yuan’s head.","Lin Yuan could sense that the power in his body had amplified in an instant.","As for the increase in his defensive abilities, Lin Yuan could not immediately be sure of the effects.","At first, Lin Yuan had to tilt his head to look at the sun hanging above him. Now, he could feel himself being cared for by the sun.","Warmth slowly spilled over him and provided his body with power.","Lin Yuan could sense that if he just tried to call out to the sun, ribbons of energy would immediately descend from the sun.","This feeling made Lin Yuan feel safe and secure.","At that moment, Lin Yuan was standing in the shoes of a Heavenly Family Fey to comprehend the world.","It was a mystical feeling that could even be called addicting.","Once Lin Yuan was done sensing all this, he said, “Blood Love, since you say that you want to see Endless Summer, go now! Endless Summer is also waiting for you to make your decision!”","Blood Love did not delay and immediately left for the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","...","The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce was managing and allocating all the resources in the world, and Listen badly needed his partner, Endless Summer.","After being nurtured all these years, Qin Yu’s capabilities were just as strong as Endless Summer’s. However, Listen still felt more comfortable with Endless Summer.","Qin Yu was ambitious, but this did not mean that he was disloyal.","In a complex environment like Sky City, having ambition was a virtue.","However, Listen did not like to work with ambitious people. Firstly, it was challenging to make friends with them. Secondly, Qin Yu’s growth also put pressure on Listen.","Upon arriving at the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce, Blood Love saw Listen, Endless Summer, and Qin Yu in the midst of a discussion for a new batch of resources.","Lin Yuan would provide the main world with one final batch of resources before he left.","Listen, Endless Summer, and Qin Yu’s opinions were split on how to allocate this batch of resources.","Listen felt that the Radiance Federation and Startling Lines Continent were Lin Yuan’s base camps, so most of the resources should go to them. As for the other continents, they were all functioning steadily and could receive token amounts of resources.","Endless Summer felt that the amount of resources that the Radiance Federation and Startling Lines Continent could absorb had reached their limit. If they received more resources, the factions would only store them away instead of utilizing them immediately. Hence, it would be better to give these resources to the other continents to raise the happiness level and power of the main world as a whole.","After all, now that Lin Yuan was about to leave the main world, there was no need for the spotlight to shine too brightly on the Radiance Federation and Startling Lines Continent.","Qin Yu felt that since this was the final batch of resources, the best course of action would be to distribute it evenly so that every corner of the main world could receive a fair amount of Lin Yuan’s grace.","When Lin Yuan provided this batch of resources, he only said he would be giving it to the main world. He had not specified that it had to go to the Radiance Federation and Startling Lines Continent.","If Lin Yuan only wanted to provide resources to the Radiance Federation and Startling Lines Continent, he could have made this clear.","When Listen, Endless Summer, and Qin Yu walked in and saw Blood Love, Endless Summer waved to Blood Love with a smile.","Since Blood Love was there, it meant she had decided to accompany Lin Yuan. This meant that Endless Summer would be set off for the Sky Beyond the Clouds soon as well.","Unlike Blood Love, Endless Summer did not have parents or a new family in the Heavenly Family Cottage in the main world. The only ties Endless Summer had in the main world were with Blood Love and Lin Yuan, who had saved her.","From a personal standpoint, it would be better for Endless Summer’s development if she went to the Sky Beyond the Clouds with Lin Yuan. Hence, Endless Summer had hoped that Blood Love would choose to follow Lin Yuan.","Listen and Qin Yu walked forward quickly to bow to Blood Love.","In Sky City, Blood Love’s status was that of the City Lord’s Path Protector.","In terms of rank, Blood Love was only below the Moon Empress. She could be considered Lin Yuan’s senior.","Regardless of how strong Blood Love was, members of Sky City like Listen and Qin Yu were very respectful toward her.","In such matters, Blood Love would not make a decision on Listen, Qin Yu, and Endless Summer’s behalf.","Firstly, this was not her job. She was not as capable as Listen, Qin Yu, and Endless Summer when it came to allocating resources.","Secondly, making a decision on their behalf was also disrespectful to the three of them.","Blood Love said, “My arrival has disturbed your work. If you can’t reach a decision, why don’t you ask Lin Yuan about it? He is currently at the Return from Faraway Mansion, speaking to the white-clothed followers through the Thoughts Letter Paper. If you send your questions over, he will reply immediately.”","Blood Love shot a look at Endless Summer, and the latter followed her into the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","Blood Love had spoken straightforwardly.","It was true that the best way to address a split in their opinions would be to ask Lin Yuan for his opinion.","Although Listen was the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s President, the three of them were joint supervisors. The two of them could not take Listen’s opinion at face value.","This was also how Listen felt.","Hence, Listen described and wrote down the three trains of thought on a Thoughts Letter Paper.","Lin Yuan replied to Listen’s message very quickly.","[Lin Yuan]: This batch of resources is meant for all the federations in the main world. I have already prepared the resources meant for the Radiance Federation and Startling Lines Continent. You can distribute the resources to all of the main world’s federations as you see fit. Make sure that the weak federations won’t end up crumbling because of a lack of resources.","Lin Yuan had always been a selfish person and ensured that he provided resources to the Radiance Federation and Startling Lines Continent before giving out any additional resources he had.","These other resources were meant for the weaker federations.","Lin Yuan did not want the weaker federations to fall immediately after he left the main world.","If that happened, the work he had put into saving them would become meaningless.","When Listen and Qin Yu saw Lin Yuan’s messages, they realized that Endless Summer’s opinion was the most aligned with Lin Yuan’s thoughts.","In the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s guestroom...","Endless Summer hugged Blood Love. “Sister Blood, have you decided to stay with the Young Master from now on? This is great!”","Endless Summer’s joy was not a pretense.","After spending time by Lin Yuan’s side and increasing its power, Endless Summer became addicted to the feeling of being by Lin Yuan’s side.","Endless Summer would never have been able to reach this level if she had been left to her own devices in the wild.","Blood Love reached out its arms and held Endless Summer. “Sister Summer, let’s continue working hard together in the Sky Beyond the Clouds! When we first arrive at the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there won’t be resource allocation tasks like the ones here. How do you plan on developing yourself there?”"]},{"number":2814,"title":"Chapter 2814 Embroidered Flower Form Hearts!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2814 Embroidered Flower Form Hearts!","Endless Summer knew that Blood Love was asking these questions because she was concerned about her future.","First, he would have to find a suitable place to set up camp before slowly expanding his establishment. This was the most stable and reliable course of action.","This principle also applied despite the large establishment atop Sky Sea’s back.","While Lin Yuan was developing his territory, he could use the demon insects as his eyes to investigate the surroundings and make contact with the other factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Hence, there would be no resource allocation tasks for Endless Summer to attend to in the beginning.","After a moment of silence, Endless Summer said, “Qin Yu is much more suited to internal management than I am. He and Wen Yu also have good chemistry. It’s likely that once we get to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Qin Yu will become Wen Yu’s assistant and handle the tasks assigned to him by Wen Yu. He could also be taken in by Liu Jie and be assigned to manage the white-clothed followers.","“I work well with Listen. Although we occasionally diverge in opinion, we are usually on the same page. There won’t be any resource allocation tasks in the beginning, but as the development progresses, we will need to set up channels through which to trade resources.","“I work well with Listen. Although we occasionally diverge in opinion, we are usually on the same page. There won’t be any resource allocation tasks in the beginning, but as the development progresses, we will need to set up channels through which to trade resources.","“I will still have to work with Listen in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. You know that I’ve never liked fighting and killing. Moreover, both my exclusive skills and divine kingdom ability are functional-type. I’ll go with you to see Lin Yuan later so I can give him something. I also want to ask him for some resources.”","Blood Love nodded.","Endless Summer had everything planned out. She knew what she needed and what she needed to do.","Endless Summer had always been more mature than Blood Love and looked after her like an older sister would.","Since Endless Summer had a clear plan for herself, there was nothing more for Blood Love to say.","Frankly, Blood Love would prefer Endless Summer to work with Wen Yu on internal governance rather than handle resource allocation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. The members of Sky City who stood out and became pivotal cogs in the system were those who were involved in internal governance.","Endless Summer smiled and picked up Blood Love’s hand. “Sister Blood, rather than you being concerned for me, I care more about whether you’ve faced your true self.","“Being a good match for each other doesn’t really matter in relationships. All that matters is that both parties are attracted to each other. If the two sides feel the same way about each other, they will naturally stick.”","If Blood Love heard this from Endless Summer in the past, she would become filled with melancholy. But now, she felt exceptionally calm.","“Sister Summer, you didn’t become acquainted with Lin Yuan much later than I did. You watched him on his journey, too. Do you think he has ever thought about starting a relationship? His life is much too fulfilling. Aside from his ever-growing responsibilities and goals, he has never paid serious attention to anything. How could I allow myself to become stuck? Regardless of anything, I am his Path Protector and eternal companion. That’s enough!”","Endless Summer sighed softly. She knew that Blood Love had to have thought things through deeply and carefully before making such a decision.","It was true that when it came to someone as spectacular as Lin Yuan, becoming his companion was the most sustainable relationship.","Wen Yu was one of them. However, she did a better job of hiding her feelings. Wen Yu might have also made the same decision.","“Sister Blood, let me go and notify Listen and Qin Yu before I leave with you. I am sure they have asked Lin Yuan for his opinion.”","Endless Summer was very certain of the decision that Lin Yuan would make.","Although Listen had joined Lin Yuan earlier, he spent the majority of his time managing the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce and rarely spent time with Lin Yuan. Hence, he did not have as good of an understanding of Lin Yuan.","If Lin Yuan had wanted to save this batch of resources for the Radiance Federation, he would have given it directly to the Moon Empress or one of the members of royalty so the Radiance Federation could distribute it internally.","Listen knew that Lin Yuan loved the Radiance Federation. Still, he did not know Lin Yuan had set his goals beyond becoming a member of the Radiance Hundred Sequence or Radiance Envoy long ago.","Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have distributed resources to the entire main world instead of saving all of them for the Radiance Federation and focused on solely building up the Radiance Federation!","Lin Yuan would definitely tell Listen to divide the resources among all of the federations in the main world and to take special care of the federations that struggled to fend for themselves.","However, he would also instruct Listen not to do things too obviously.","The quantity of resources was not the issue. The concern was with the equitable distribution of those resources. This issue did not only apply to the human world. It applied to the fey world as well.","It was inevitable for federations that obtained more of Lin Yuan’s resources to become the target of resentment from other federations.","Given Lin Yuan’s intelligence and strategic mind, there was no way he would not have thought of all this.","When Endless Summer heard Lin Yuan’s answer and confirmed that he had given the response she had expected, she did not say anything to Listen. All she did was smile at him.","This was not the first time that this had happened.","Each time there was a split in their opinions, she was the one who accurately guessed Lin Yuan’s thoughts.","Each time, Listen’s attitude toward her would change slightly.","This time, Listen began to ponder and consider whether her stance was the right one. He was unlike Qin Yu, who stubbornly stuck by his stance.","This was what was known as adaptation.","“Listen and Qin Yu, it won’t be long before we have to depart. The two of you should make the arrangements quickly. I need to go and see Lin Yuan about some matters. If you can’t handle the workload, I can leave Sister Blood here to help you.”","Endless Summer spoke honestly and had no intention of elevating her position.","In the past, there had been a long period of time when Endless Summer was Sky City’s strongest expert.","Endless Summer had saved Listen’s life once in the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s President’s Office.","She had also saved Lin Yuan more than once.","Hence, many members of Sky City were extremely respectful toward Endless Summer despite being stronger than her.","Back at the Return from Faraway Mansion...","When Lin Yuan saw Endless Summer and Blood Love walk in while holding hands, he said with a smile, “Liu Jie has gone to fetch ingredients. Wen Yu will be back soon as well. We haven’t had a proper gathering in a very long time. Endless Summer, you have worked hard working with Listen all this time!”","Endless Summer hurriedly waved her hand. “Lin Yuan, please don’t say that! It makes it sound as though I’m not a member of Sky City!”","Endless Summer gazed at this young man who had saved her life and changed her fate. He had now grown into a fully-fledged man.","If she had not been aware of Blood Love’s feelings toward Lin Yuan from the beginning, she might have also developed special feelings toward him.","Endless Summer did not wait for Lin Yuan to respond. Rather, she took out a pink and purple embroidered flower ball that looked as though it was made of jade and held it out to Lin Yuan.","“Lin Yuan, this is a product of my divine kingdom. Do you think it’ll be useful to you? There is a fragmented tree core in the flower ball. The tree core has the same effects on plant-type feys as the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire because it contains energy from the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire!”","Lin Yuan received the embroidered flower ball and used True Data to check on Endless Summer.","[Fey Name]: Endless Mystical Dream Summer","[Fey Species]: Bunched-flower species/hydrangea species","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (4/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood/Mind","[Fey Quality]: Elementary Divine Kingdom","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Abilities:","[Shooting Spears of Summer]: The flower vines will become shafts, while the flowers will become blades. The spears will be able to pierce armor and targets.","[Flower Sleet]: Every flower petal can cause damage to targets. The petals can also absorb blood to replenish energy.","[Three Thousand Shooting Spears]: Three thousand spears will shoot out immediately. When one spear makes contact with a target, the other spears will gather at that spot as well.","[Midsummer Cage]: A cage will be created using flowers and vines. Inside the cage will exist a world of its own that Endless Summer can control.","[Mind Halt]: Influence a target’s mind and cause the target to become instantly confused, preventing the target’s mind and soul from working together.","[Flower Tree Execution]: The roots will grow and form a chain around a target. When the roots pierce a target’s body, they will continue to grow and drain the target’s energy. The drained energy will be stored as fruits.","[Willow Flower Sky Cover]: Release all the energy and vitality inside the body and allow it to grow freely. Willow flowers will grow all over the area. The more flowers that grow, the stronger one will be. The willow flowers can also drain energy from targets.","[Blooming Summer Link]: Its blooming summer energy will nourish the targets in contact with its flower petals. All flora and fauna lifeforms will begin germinating, and their injuries will be naturally healed. Boosting and healing the flora and fauna will also increase its own energy and recovery.","[Magical Dream Finger]: The energy in the blooming flora and fauna will be transformed into mind energy and gathered in its finger to supply it to targets. The mind energy’s attack on the target will put the target’s mind and soul in a dream state. The target can only be awakened through a special method.","[Dream-Stealing Forced Change]: It will enter the mind of the affected target, read the target’s past to forcefully change the target’s circumstances, and alter the target’s present. After changing the target’s circumstances, it will experience backlash once the target leaves the dream state.","Exclusive Skills:","[Flourishing Flowers]: As powers increase, the number of flowers will also multiply. The flowers can also cause more damage.","[Thousand Openings of the Mind]: The heart will open a thousand times and increase control over spiritual power.","[End of Summer]: Change its body into summer and concentrate all the power of summer into one point before finally releasing the attack.","[Lifeform Shrivel]: The flower vines can absorb energy from other lifeforms. When the absorbed energy reaches its limit, it will present itself as a vest that can defend against attacks.","[Tree Core Cycle]: Its body will take in as many tree cores as possible, forming a cycle in its body. The cycle of tree cores will provide it with an enormous amount of energy and increase the speed of its energy recovery.","[Thriving Summer Territory]: Regardless of the environment, its own energy will be used to trigger and bring forth a thriving summer. Its surroundings will form a thriving summer territory where it will be protected. All targets in the territory will be nourished and boosted by the thriving summer.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Embroidered Flowers Form Hearts]: Its body will take root in the divine kingdom. Faith power will be used to trigger the main body and cause flowers to bloom on the main body. The faith power will combine with the flowers to form flower jades that contain tree cores. The tree cores are able to revive plant-type lifeforms. The revived plant-type lifeforms will go on to provide it with energy and faith power.","Based on Endless Summer’s data, Lin Yuan now knew the effects of this jade-like embroidered flower ball.","Lin Yuan learned from the description of the divine kingdom ability that the tree core could indeed be used in place of the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire.","The Lifeform Sacrificial Fire was a treasure that had a place on the ranking of precious treasures. It came from the Twin Red Pagoda.","The Twin Red Pagoda was a plant that was desired but almost impossible to attain. Even if it was attained, it required a large amount of resources to be nurtured.","If Lin Yuan did not have Morbius and the Spirit Lock spatial zone could dissect energy ores to produce exceptionally pure spirit qi for the Twin Red Pagoda to absorb, there was no way it could have produced the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire within a century.","Back then, the Twin Red Pagoda that had been shackled in the dimensional rift had only managed to produce a spark after a few thousand years passed.","Lin Yuan said solemnly, “Endless Summer, the tree core in the flower jade you produce using your divine kingdom ability can save any plant-type lifeform. It is extremely precious. You will have to use your faith power to produce them often in the future.","“However, once the tree cores you produce have saved plant-type lifeforms, the plant-type lifeforms will also be able to compensate you and help you obtain faith power. This is also a way for you to quickly increase your power. You can pick a few promising plant-type feys at the Sky Beyond the Clouds and begin working on them.”"]},{"number":2815,"title":"Chapter 2815 Riding the Wind and Setting Off!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2815 Riding the Wind and Setting Off!","Lin Yuan was delighted. Endless Summer’s abilities and exclusive skills were undoubtedly a pleasant surprise for him.","Endless Summer’s divine kingdom ability allowed him never to worry about the plant-type lifeforms he nurtured dying unexpectedly while he was caring for them.","Many plant-type lifeforms were extremely fragile.","Despite Lin Yuan’s possession of pure spirit qi, it was still not easy for him to cultivate some plant-type feys.","Endless Summer looked thrilled.","She knew that her divine kingdom ability could not only save plant-type lifeforms but would also benefit herself.","If Lin Yuan found a few remarkable plant-type lifeforms and she used Embroidered Flower Form Hearts to form links with them, not only would her body benefit, but she would also gain an endless stream of faith power as they evolved toward World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","Endless Summer was very enthusiastic about increasing her power. She hoped to increase it as quickly as possible. This would make it easier for her to protect herself and the people she wanted to protect.","Additionally, the competitive atmosphere around Lin Yuan was far too intense. The stronger she became, the better chance she had of competing against the rest.","Every individual had selfish desires, and Endless Summer was no exception.","“Lin Yuan, if that’s the case, I will do my best to use Embroidered Flower Form Hearts to produce as many tree cores as possible.”","Lin Yuan smiled and nodded at Endless Summer before handing her a batch of resources. This batch consisted not only of spirit qi crystals but also of the pupae of the Wood-Building Winged Sandflies.","The Wood-Building Winged Sandflies’ pupae contained wood-elemental energy and were suitable for Endless Summer to absorb.","Lin Yuan had obtained the Wood-Building Winged Sandflies from the Moon Empress and had been carefully nurturing them. He rarely used their pupae.","Now, there was a mulberry orchard in the Spirit Lock spatial zone where millions of Wood-Building Winged Sandflies lived.","Two Deposit Vegetable Pods in human form looked after them, and they would periodically hand Lin Yuan a large batch of them.","Because of this, Lin Yuan no longer lacked pure sources of the four basic types of elemental energy: wind, water, earth, and fire.","When Endless Summer was Sky City’s strongest expert, her abilities and exclusive skills had been skewed toward attack, and she possessed exceptional combat abilities. But as she continued to evolve, her abilities and exclusive skills began moving toward support.","Blooming Summer Link allowed Endless Summer to enable targets that were in contact with her petals to be nourished by the thriving summer energy.","The plants that were nourished by the thriving summer energy would enter the germination stage.","The germination stage was the most active phase of a plant-type lifeform’s growth. During this phase, it could recover from injuries very quickly and regrow damaged body parts.","This ability would not only allow her to support the plant-type lifeforms on their side during combat but could also be used to cultivate plant-type lifeforms on a daily basis, thereby increasing their production volume.","The most basic example would be Endless Summer using Blooming Summer Link to link up with the weather-producing plant-type feys on Sky Sea’s back. This would enable the weather-producing plant-type feys to substantially increase their production of weather phenomena.","Magical Dream Finger was an extremely effective controlling-type ability.","In an instant, all the plant-type energy in the thriving summer would be transformed into mind energy that attacked the target’s mind.","If there was a large number of plant-type lifeforms around Endless Summer, the mind attack would be powerful, and there was a high probability the target’s soul and mind would be put in a dream state.","While their soul and mind were in the dream state, their body would be at the mercy of being butchered.","Once their body was destroyed, their mind and soul would lose their anchor and naturally disintegrate.","It was very difficult to awaken a mind and soul in a dream state. There were only a few divine kingdom abilities that could be used to awaken the mind and soul.","Magical Dream Finger alone would only be seen as a controlling-type ability. But when it was paired with Dream-Stealing Forced Change, it became a controlling-type prerequisite ability.","She would then be able to investigate the target and learn about the target’s life. When used on an enemy captive, they would be able to learn all about the enemy’s circumstances.","Moreover, Dream-Stealing Forced Change could also be used to tamper with the target’s dreams to alter their experiences. This would affect the target’s reality.","However, doing this would cause Endless Summer to suffer backlash when she returned to reality.","This backlash could cost Endless Summer her life. Hence, unless it was absolutely necessary, Lin Yuan would only ask Endless Summer to investigate the target but not alter the target’s dream state.","Lin Yuan would not recklessly ask his subordinates to undertake dangerous tasks.","Aside from these abilities, Endless Summer had also gained two new exclusive skills: Tree Core Cycle and Thriving Summer Territory.","Endless Summer’s original tree core had been destroyed, and the Lifeform Sacrificial Fire had taken its place. She had also absorbed the Sky-Covering Weeping Willow’s tree core. As such, Endless Summer had become a plant-type lifeform that possessed multiple tree cores.","Tree cores were the plant-type lifeforms’ energy cores.","By possessing two tree cores, Endless Summer was akin to a human who possessed two hearts. It was an occurrence that seemed to only appear in fairy tales.","But with Tree Core Cycle, Endless Summer’s body could contain multiple tree cores. The tree cores would form a perfect cycle in her body. The more tree cores she possessed, the more energy Endless Summer’s body would receive. These tree cores would speed up the rate at which Endless Summer recovered energy in her body.","Lin Yuan thought, It looks like I’ll need to find more tree cores for Endless Summer in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Then, I’ll use my resources to help her absorb more tree cores. This will further expand Thriving Summer Territory.","Thriving Summer Territory allowed Endless Summer to use her energy to bring forth a thriving summer regardless of the environment she was in. This would turn her surroundings into a safe haven.","Within her safe haven, the effects of Blooming Summer Link on the plant-type lifeforms would become even stronger. All the plant-type lifeforms, with the inclusion of Endless Summer, would be nourished and boosted by the thriving summer environment in the safe haven.","If Endless Summer only had two tree cores, the boosting effects of the exclusive skill would be rather ordinary.","Lin Yuan’s current perspective and experience were terrifying. He had nurtured far too many excellent feys, and regular exclusive skills could not catch his eye.","But if Endless Summer absorbed more tree cores and used the energy in them to activate Thriving Summer Territory, the effects would be unimaginable.","Lin Yuan looked at his companion who had developed perfectly and was promptly filled with a profound sense of pride.","He had a part to play in the growth of all his companions. It was a special and amazing feeling!","...","Once Liu Jie returned, he earnestly prepared a table full of dishes.","Blood Love and Endless Summer had large appetites. Since they were going to eat, they had to eat their fill.","When night came, Lin Yuan did not go to sleep. Rather, he stood on the balcony and looked out at the Return from Faraway Mansion at night.","In the past ten years, he had traveled to almost every corner of the main world.","But now that he was truly about to leave, Lin Yuan felt rather reluctant.","Lin Yuan let out a sigh and summoned Genius and Chimey.","Just like him, these two fellows were unrecognizable from their original selves.","If someone claimed that Lin Yuan, once labeled a useless cripple, Chimey, a Sound Bird unable to sing, and Genius, a Hundred Questions Beast with matted fur, could reach this level of growth, not even Chu Ci, his closest relative, would have believed it.","As Chimey and Genius’ strength grew, their intelligence also came to surpass that of regular humans.","Both of them knew that Lin Yuan was feeling sentimental.","They leaped up onto Lin Yuan’s shoulders and silently accompanied him. They also looked in the same direction he was looking, out at the window toward the Submerged Flood Dragon Lake in the distance.","Neither Genius nor Chimey felt a sense of belonging to the Radiance Federation or the main world.","To the two of them, any place with Lin Yuan was their home.","This was because they had not felt a shred of warmth before their paths crossed with Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan finally looked away and began stroking Genius and Chimey.","At that moment, Genius spoke. “Yuan, I know what you’re thinking. Going to the Sky Beyond the Clouds is the best choice. You are being held back in this world. It won’t benefit you to be restricted by this world’s world wills. You will only be able to better protect the main world once you leave for the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“Fan Lou is able to help hide the aura of the main world’s World Emperor/Divine Kingdom experts because he has the protection and support of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. If the day comes that they stop shielding him and he loses his position as a Boundary Patrol Envoy, the main world will once again be exposed to the experts from the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“The Sky Beyond the Clouds isn’t a peaceful place. Regardless of how careful Fan Lou tries to be, accidents could take place at any time.”","As Lin Yuan listened to Genius’ analysis, he knew that Genius was trying to comfort him.","Genius was always warm-hearted like that. Rather than saying that Genius was lucky to have met him, it was more accurate to say that he was lucky that he had been able to save Genius.","Chimey was not skilled at comforting others, but while Genius was comforting Lin Yuan, Chimey began singing a soft tune.","Any sound produced by Chimey was inexplicably pleasant.","Lin Yuan relished the time with Genius and Chimey.","Lin Yuan did not feel nervous or perplexed in the slightest about going to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Rather, it filled him with burning enthusiasm.","He was done putting his crew together.","Once he arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds, he would have to strengthen himself while making a name for himself among all the species who lived there.","The moonlight at 3:00 a.m. shone brilliantly.","It was currently the height of summer. In another hour, the first rays of sunlight would begin spreading across the sky, putting an end to the brooding and reflective night.","Lin Yuan went to the patch of grass that sat next to the main manor.","It was there that Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Wen Yu sat cross-legged all that time ago and decided to set up Sky City together.","Lin Yuan bumped into Wen Yu on the first floor of the manor.","When Wen Yu saw Lin Yuan, her gaze softened to tenderness. “Young Master, you can’t sleep either? I was about to go out to sit on the grass.”","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow. “That’s exactly what I was going to do!”","As the two of them walked out of the main mansion, they saw Liu Jie lying on the grass with his legs crossed. He was staring up at the moonlight-illuminated clouds floating across the night sky.","Liu Jie rose when he heard the footsteps behind him.","After seeing they belonged to Lin Yuan and Wen Yu, he let out two peals of laughter.","“I didn’t think that the two of you would be getting any sleep tonight. You would definitely come to sit here through the night!”","Liu Jie stood up before sitting back down cross-legged.","This sight caused Lin Yuan and Wen Yu to feel sentimental.","Back then, the three of them had also sat together in cross-legged positions. They were akin to newly born calves who had just begun learning about the world and were filled with hope.","With their solid foundations, none of them had been afraid. This applied even when they established Sky City and had to take on the top faction Connected Beast Park.","Now, as they were gathered there again, they had reached the peak of the main world’s pyramid and had grown beyond the Radiance Federation.","The trio had weathered all storms together, and their relationship had only become stronger and purer.","Lin Yuan was not the only one who grew consistently. The same also went for Liu Jie and Wen Yu.","The three of them chatted until noon. The sun shone down on them and slowly melted away their shadows.","Neither Endless Summer nor Blood Love disturbed Wen Yu, Lin Yuan, and Liu Jie.","Blood Love had witnessed the development of their relationship as well as their growth.","The three of them only began rising up after meeting the Moon Empress.","...","Before Lin Yuan left the Radiant Moon Palace’s inner palace, he could sense that the Moon Empress had been troubled by something.","The Moon Empress also had people in the main world whom she could not bear to leave behind.","But now, he could sense that she was relaxed. This meant she had tied up all her loose ends in the main world, including making the necessary goodbyes!","Lin Yuan raised his hand and summoned the Kill Food Sky Butterfly, which had recently reached Immortal Breed. He said with a smile, “Master, you’re here. It’s time for us to set off!”","Ever since Lin Yuan evolved Blackie to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, he had not ridden the Kill Food Sky Butterfly.","He had chosen the Kill Food Sky Butterfly today because they had to wait for the white-clothed followers and because he wanted to take one last look at the main world.","At that moment, an elderly voice echoed from the entrance of the Return from Faraway Mansion. “I didn’t believe Leaning Moon when she said you wanted to leave quietly. No one is stopping you from leaving. Aren’t you at least going to give us the opportunity to see you off?”","Lin Yuan looked up and saw that the elderly man who had spoken was seated in a wheelchair.","Xia Qing pursed her lips and suppressed her emotions as she continued pushing the wheelchair.","Every person behind this elderly man was a very familiar face to Lin Yuan."]},{"number":2816,"title":"Chapter 2816 Changes to the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2816 Changes to the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team!","Chef Supreme crossed his arms in front of him and looked at Lin Yuan with a tangle of emotions in his gaze.","Chef Supreme never denied Lin Yuan’s abilities and talent.","This outstanding individual was about to leave their world and begin venturing into a wider world.","His youngest disciple, Zong Ze, whom he viewed as his grandson, would also be leaving with Lin Yuan.","Because of Li Changlin, Chef Supreme had learned about Lin Yuan’s existence sooner than the Moon Empress had.","Chef Supreme saw Lin Yuan as a junior.","However, as Lin Yuan grew, even Chef Supreme, who held the highest position in the Radiance Federation, came to be filled with respect for Lin Yuan.","Standing next to Chef Supreme was the Bamboo Monarch, who was holding Wang Fuxiang’s hand.","The Bamboo Monarch and Wang Fuxiang’s love finally bloomed because of the flower pollen that Lin Yuan had given the Bamboo Monarch. The Moon Empress might have delivered the flower pollen to him, but it had come from Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was essentially the Bamboo Monarch’s savior. Without Lin Yuan, the Bamboo Monarch would have already been killed by the curse.","The Bamboo Monarch was grateful to Lin Yuan for saving his life. However, Wang Fuxiang’s gratitude exceeded the Bamboo Monarch’s. After all, Lin Yuan had helped the pure-hearted Wang Fuxiang safeguard her love.","Cicada Song, Iron Prison, Ji Changdeng, and the other members of royalty were standing in an orderly manner.","At first, Night Leaning Moon had told the Moon Empress she would not send her off. But now that all the others were there, Night Leaning Moon could not hold back.","Night Leaning Moon could not bear to see the Moon Empress leave, but the same went for Liu Jie.","Night Leaning Moon had an insipid personality. Once she let someone into her heart, they would remain there forever.","Night Leaning Moon would miss Liu Jie but would not worry about him. Being by Lin Yuan’s side, he would be able to develop much better than if he stayed with her.","Night Leaning Moon could clearly sense that Liu Jie had grown in the past few years. She had taught him everything that she could, while Cold Moon had also imparted significant teachings to him.","Now that Liu Jie was stronger than Night Leaning Moon, she felt a great sense of accomplishment as a Master.","Night Leaning Moon had no idea the Moon Empress had already felt this sense of accomplishment long ago, and that her feelings had been much stronger.","Ji Changdeng had his two disciples, An He and Liu Yifan, next to him. Ji Changdeng’s gaze fell on the Moon Empress, and he let out a sigh full of romantic adoration.","However, Ji Changdeng could not tear his eyes away from the Moon Empress.","An He and Lin Yuan were friends, and close ones at that.","Lin Yuan had told An He about his intention to head to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, but the latter had chosen to remain in the main world.","An He had made the same decision as Gao Feng and Xia Qing, but their reasons were vastly different.","Xia Qing wanted to carry on her parents and grandfather’s legacy and become the Radiance Federation’s protector. It was a noble undertaking. She had been working hard toward this goal for many years.","Gao Feng had found the love of his life and wanted to sheathe his sword and settle down with his family. The Gao family needed him, a disciple of a member of royalty, to lead them toward glory.","As for An He... It was due to pure laziness.","The conflict between the Radiance and Freedom Federations’ younger generation had awakened An He’s fighting spirit. But now that the conflict was over, his fighting spirit had also been fully quenched.","This frustrated Lin Yuan, but he still respected An He’s decision. Frankly, An He’s Senior Brother badly wanted to go to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Alas, there were no deep ties between Lin Yuan and Liu Yifan. Hence, he could not make such a request.","In truth, Liu Yifan longed to head to a wider world to develop himself.","Every Radiance Envoy had the heart of an expert.","This send-off had been initiated by Xia Qing. She felt that if Lin Yuan, the hero of the main world, was going to leave, he had to be sent off in style.","Otherwise, people like Tian Ningning, who had only had shallow ties to Lin Yuan, would not be present.","After a moment of stupefaction, Lin Yuan hurriedly smiled and waved.","He was taken aback to see so many people here to send him off. It filled his heart with warmth. He was sure he would never forget this scene.","“What are you saying? It’s just that this departure is rushed, and I don’t want to waste your time!”","The Moon Empress’ lips curled gently, and she quipped, “This is just how Little Yuan is. He knows that all of you are busy and doesn’t want to disturb you.”","Chef Supreme chuckled. “Moon Empress, Little Yuan is afraid of disturbing us, but are you? You are going to a wider world to grow and develop, not to endure suffering. As much as we’ll miss you, we’re more than happy for you! We hope that your journeys of development will go well!”","Chef Supreme took out a spatial instrument, approached Lin Yuan, and placed it in his hands.","“This is filled with excellent ingredients from our world. When you get to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, you will probably come to miss these ingredients. This should be enough to last you for a long time!”","Once Chef Supreme handed over his gift, the Bamboo Monarch and the rest also held out their goodbye gifts.","All of them had grown using the resources that Lin Yuan had supplied.","The presents they had prepared for Lin Yuan were not that of seniors to their juniors. Rather, it was a genuine gesture of their feelings toward him.","This send-off did not take long. The Kill Food Sky Butterfly proceeded to carry the people leaving this world away from the Radiance Federation.","The teary-eyed Li Changlin and Zhang Yingying wanted to chase after the Kill Food Sky Butterfly, but Chef Supreme stopped them.","“Changlin, regardless of distance, separation is inevitable. You know this. Rather than going as far as you can to send them off, why not stop here? Can’t you see that Little Yuan and Chu Ci can’t bear to leave you behind either?”","Lin Yuan was filled with bitterness. However, Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter were delighted to be heading to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","They felt that Lin Yuan had dallied in the main world for too long. If he had spent his time in the Sky Beyond the Clouds instead, he would have been able to gain more rewards!","...","While the Kill Food Sky Butterfly flapped its wings, the Snow-Covered Foxes in the North Universe were experiencing problems. This was due to a female fox.","This female fox had a captivating appearance and had even been a member of the Honor Absent Parliament when she lived in the East Universe.","However, this was not enough to cause waves among the Snow-Covered Foxes, a species ranked in the top ten of the Species Ranking.","The issue stemmed from two of the Snow-Covered Fox leaders inexplicably fighting over this Alluring Fox. The fighting led the Alluring Fox to declare she would pick the victor.","There was no question that this matter was bizarre.","The Snow-Covered Foxes’ dependent species were all aware of the leaders’ authority. They never cared about whether the dependent species lived or died!","There were many dependent species who became curious about this female fox. It was said she was the leader of a fox species.","The intelligent dependent species all began racking their brains to come up with a way to form a bond with this species.","If this female fox married one of the Snow-Covered Fox leaders, her species would receive that leader’s protection and gain incomparable power within the Snow-Covered Foxes.","While the dependent species were all envious of Kong Huan’s luck, she had yet to come back to her senses after escaping death!","It was true that the two Snow-Covered Fox leaders were fighting because of her. However, it was not due to their love for her.","She was nothing more than a cover. The real reason was that the two of them had been nursing a grudge against each other for a long time.","However, the Snow-Covered Fox elites were forbidden from fighting with each other as it diminished the species’ overall strength. Hence, every fight needed to be disguised under a seemingly legitimate reason.","Only a faction that had witnessed the true power of the top ten ranks of the Species Ranking could properly perceive such a powerful species.","Kong Huan’s Alluring Soul bloodline could seduce a Snow-Covered Fox envoy, but it was a far cry from being able to seduce one of the Snow-Covered Fox leaders.","Perhaps only the pinnacle Alluring Soul bloodline or the level above it could earn the affection of such a top expert.","This event struck true terror into Kong Huan.","The Alluring Foxes had almost been eliminated.","During crucial times, Kong Huan frequently thought about injecting energy into the jade. However, she held herself back each time.","Firstly, Winter had given her the jade so she could send reports and relay information.","Although he had said she could also inject energy into the jade when she was in trouble, Kong Huan did not believe that Winter could take on the entire Snow-Covered Fox species.","Moreover, if she asked Lin Yuan for support without achieving any accomplishments, he would definitely question her abilities.","In this world, it was unlikely there was anyone else who could help her to evolve her Alluring Fox bloodline.","Moreover, Lin Yuan possessed an Alluring Fox bloodline that was stronger than her own.","Thus, Kong Huan could not help but feel extremely reliant on Lin Yuan.","She had caught the eyes of the leaders because of her bloodline’s ability to captivate foxes.","She was nothing more than a toy.","Toys did not deserve to have any pride.","However, she had managed to endure this event.","She had no idea how genuine the feelings of this leader who fought for her were. However, at the very least, he was willing to invest effort into her.","This meant that the Alluring Foxes would not be in danger for now. This was enough.","If Lin Yuan did not contact her even after a few years had passed, Kong Huan would inject energy into that jade to contact him.","Lin Yuan had told her to gain a stable position in the North Universe, and she had achieved this. She had earned the favor of one of the Snow-Covered Fox leaders and managed to become the most outstanding figure among the dependent species.","This outstanding result was sufficient for her to report to Lin Yuan.","The past few years had been extremely difficult for Kong Huan. Nothing had gone well since arriving in the North Universe.","...","Meanwhile, Fan Lou had received significant resources and spent the past few years basking in happiness.","Although he still did not have much of a presence among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, he was able to address the leader of the Light Wind Wolves as ‘Brother’!","This was not because the Light Wind Wolf leader held Fan Lou in high regard.","In actuality, none of the Light Wind Wolves acknowledged his bloodline.","Fan Lou had a lowly and impure bloodline. He only managed to gain a hint of the Light Wind Wolf bloodline from consuming a fruit that contained the bloodline. His bloodline only improved after consuming a drop of the Chaos Wind Demon and Light Wind Wolves’ essence blood. It was only with this that his bloodline was finally elevated to a passable level.","Aside from Fan Lou’s bloodline, the Light Wind Wolves also looked down on him because of his character.","Ever since Feng Qing began keeping Fan Lou by his side as his assistant, Fan Lou had become extremely full of himself.","There were times when he arrived at the Light Wind Wolves’ meetings later than the Elders. This was disrespect of the highest form.","It would be fine if Fan Lou had a pure Light Wind Wolf bloodline. The crux was that Fan Lou’s bloodline was impure and had inserted himself into the family.","However, no one dared to reproach Fan Lou openly on account of his relationship with Feng Qing. To top it off, Fan Lou often brazenly brought up his relationship with Feng Qing. Hence, the others had no choice but to extend courtesies toward him. It was as though someone had poured out a bucket of swill on the door of their house, yet they had no choice but to praise him.","It was true that Fan Lou’s hubris had ballooned, but he knew how to keep it in check.","Fan Lou knew what needed to be done and ensured to do everything he could to earn Feng Qing’s favor.","Fan Lou, who had suppressed the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, had become Feng Qing’s most trusted aide.","Feng Xuan had butted heads with Fan Lou in the past, and Feng Qing had punished them.","Ever since then, Feng Xuan had no choice but to be courteous toward Fan Lou.","Fan Lou did his best to curry favor with Feng Qing but did not see him as his true master. The only master he acknowledged was Lin Yuan.","Fan Lou had personally experienced the power of Lin Yuan’s subordinates and knew how much they respected him.","The experts under Lin Yuan were all far stronger than Feng Qing!","On the one hand, Fan Lou curried favor with Feng Qing because it was part of the task that Lin Yuan had given him. It helped to make sure that he could hold onto his position as the captain of a Boundary Patrol Team.","On the other hand, Fan Lou wanted to use Feng Qing to raise his standard of living. One needed to take responsibility for creating the kind of blissful life one wanted.","Fan Lou paid close attention to the happenings in the Class 2 world where Lin Yuan lived.","Fan Lou found out that every once in a while, a fey from Lin Yuan’s world would reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","Evolving a fey in a Class 2 world where World Emperor/Divine Kingdom feys should not exist in the first place demanded unimaginable resources. Fan Lou refrained from making any estimates regarding the quantity.","Fan Lou looked forward to being contacted by Lin Yuan and receiving a new task.","While Fan Lou was imagining a better life for himself, he saw his communication crystal light up. The message was coming from a member of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team.","“Captain, Honor Absent Palace has sent people to investigate the Boundary Patrol Teams. They have arrived at the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team’s headquarters!","“Didn’t you say that you were busy today? Xi Fan is already leading the people from Honor Absent Palace in proceeding with the investigation. I’m sending a message to you to check if you’re able to return before Honor Absent Palace’s people leave!","“I heard that many captains of Boundary Patrol Teams have bought meals for these people from Honor Absent Palace. All of them have impressive backgrounds, but I haven’t been able to find out much about them.”"]},{"number":2817,"title":"Chapter 2817 Teleportation to the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2817 Teleportation to the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","The member of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team who had sent the message to Fan Lou to inform him about the situation was one of his close subordinates. He was trustworthy.","Fan Lou had invested resources in this member and supported him because he wanted to have a better grasp of the happenings in the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team.","This subordinate did not let him down and immediately informed him of a situation he had just caught wind of.","Beads of cold sweat began dripping down Fan Lou’s back, and he stared blankly for five seconds before asking loudly, “What? Xi Fan is leading the people from Honor Absent Palace in proceeding with the investigation? Why didn’t he inform me of something as serious as this?”","This member of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team could tell that Fan Lou was shocked and afraid.","Fan Lou held great authority in the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team, especially now that he had Feng Qing’s favor.","Given that he had the favor of one of the members of the Honor Absent Parliament and was also serving as that member of parliament’s assistant, it meant that Fan Lou’s future was limitless!","Xi Fan was one of Fan Lou’s close subordinates. Otherwise, he would not have been able to become the Vice Captain of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team.","Xi Fan believed that as Feng Qing continued to favor Fan Lou, he would eventually tire of being the captain of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team.","Xi Fan was determined to take Fan Lou’s place. Hence, he was over-eager to prove himself whenever the opportunity arose.","Xi Fan never anticipated that his actions would displease Fan Lou.","Normally, the captain of a Boundary Patrol Team did not leave his post.","He had represented Fan Lou without causing the supervisors from Honor Absent Palace to become suspicious. Rather than being angry at him, Fan Lou should be praising him for his work!","Fan Lou groaned to himself.","He should not have accepted Feng Qing’s invitation to participate in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ meeting today. He also should not have helped Feng Qing to pass on a message after the meeting ended.","If another lifeform in the Class 2 world evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom while Xi Fan was leading the supervisors from Honor Absent Palace, he would have bungled the job that Lin Yuan had given him!","If that happened, he could not hope to continue living.","With this thought, Fan Lou felt he needed to use the jade crystal to contact Winter. He would ask Winter to inform Lin Yuan to hold back on evolving lifeforms.","But it did not take long for Fan Lou to change his mind.","Xi Fan had already begun leading the supervisors around. It was too late for him to send a report. It would be pointless to do so now.","Acting in hindsight would never please one’s superiors.","If he contacted Lin Yuan and nothing happened during the investigation, it would lead Lin Yuan to think he was incompetent.","After all, with Fan Lou’s authority, he would not be able to put a stop to this investigation even if he returned to the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team now.","...","Once Fan Lou was back at the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team’s headquarters, he rushed in to see Xi Fan speaking to a man and a woman. He was bent down on one knee and was in a servile position.","The man and woman did not have austere expressions on their faces.","Fan Lou let out an internal sigh of relief.","The supervisors conducting the surprise investigation of the Boundary Patrol Teams would not be staying with the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team for long. It was likely they were only still there because they were waiting for him, the captain, to return before giving him the gift.","After thinking for a moment, Fan Lou smiled and approached them.","“I’m so sorry. I was helping Lord Feng Qing with some matters and was delayed. I’m sure the two of you have finished with your investigation. Nothing out of the ordinary has happened with the universe territories under the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team’s control. If something had happened, I would have learned my lesson from last time and informed Lord Feng Qing immediately so he could send a report to Honor Absent Palace!”","Fan Lou spoke courteously, and no one could fault his demeanor.","However, he mentioned Feng Qing, a member of the Honor Absent Parliament, multiple times so he could subversively leverage Feng Qing’s status to elevate himself.","The two supervisors came across this situation often.","Half of the Boundary Patrol Team captains had networks and links. It was a cushy job!","It was because of this that people often tried to claim more profits through underhanded means.","The male supervisor coughed. “It’s true that nothing unusual was found during the investigation. However, the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team had a major issue in the past. Whether there are truly issues is still yet to be decided.","“We are currently discussing whether there is a need to investigate the territory where the issue took place. Captain Fan, now that you’re back, why don’t you come with us?”","Fan Lou relaxed when he heard that.","These were nothing more than cursory statements.","The two supervisors were carrying heavy responsibilities. If issues were found in the areas they investigated, they would not be able to shirk any of the repercussions.","Their words were only meant to give him a warning. If he did not give them benefits, they would make life difficult for him!","Fan Lou hurriedly took out the items he had prepared.","“Of course, taking you there is no issue. But the two of you must be tired from checking on the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team! I will send someone to prepare a meal. Please take a Layered-Cloud Purple Reishi each as my greeting gift to the two of you!”","The male and female supervisors’ eyes lit up when they saw what Fan Lou had taken out.","The Layered-Cloud Purple Reishi grew on mountain peaks. Once it matured, it would gather clouds and mist around it, making it extremely hard to find. The Light Wind Wolves had an easier time attaining the Layered-Cloud Purple Reishi because of their bloodline skills. Hence, the two supervisors were unsurprised that Fan Lou possessed the Layered-Cloud Purple Reishi.","However, they had not expected him to be willing to give away something so precious.","It seemed that the rumors about Fan Lou receiving heavy rewards from Feng Qing were true!","The female supervisor received the Layered-Cloud Purple Reishi from Fan Lou before saying, “We won’t be having the meal. We still need to check on the other Boundary Patrol Teams. Captain Fan, fate willing, we will be able to meet again! I hope that the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team will not have any issues during the next check!”","The two supervisors from Honor Absent Palace left.","Fan Lou pursed his lips.","It was unlikely that the two of them would be back to check on them!","Honor Absent Palace would never allow the same group of supervisors to check on the same Boundary Patrol Team repeatedly. They were concerned that the team and supervisors would begin colluding.","Moreover, it was unlikely there would be another check for a long time after this one!","The member of the Boundary Patrol Team who had reported the matter to Fan Lou sensed that something was off about Fan Lou.","He did not dare to draw close to Fan Lou and kept his distance.","Xi Fan did not know that Fan Lou had been enraged by his behavior. He even believed that he had helped Fan Lou and was anxious to receive rewards for his contribution!","“Captain, you weren’t around when the supervisors arrived. I started leading them in the investigation first because I didn’t want them to wait. Didn’t you spend a lot of resources on that territory? I made sure to bring the supervisors there so that they’d be able to sense how serious we are. The two supervisors gave very high ratings.”","Xi Fan was adept at saying pretty words and made a habit of flattering Fan Lou as well. Otherwise, Fan Lou would not have begun viewing him as a close subordinate and given him so much authority.","At first, Fan Lou had been livid.","However, unless something happened, Fan Lou had been planning to let Xi Fan go.","He had not expected Xi Fan to take the two supervisors to the area he had sternly ordered to be sealed off!","Xi Fan’s actions were the equivalent of putting Fan Lou’s life on the line!","Fan Lou’s eyes brimmed with a cold and killing intent, and he gently patted Xi Fan’s shoulder twice.","“Xi Fan, we have worked together for so long. You have worked hard all these years as my second-in-command. In a few days, the Light Wind Wolves need a few helpers for an operation. If you’re able to do things as well as you did this time, I can recommend you to Lord Feng Qing. That’ll give you the chance to be like me!”","Xi Fan was overjoyed. He had not noticed the cold glint in Fan Lou’s eyes at all.","Fan Lou had decided that Xi Fan would die during that operation. Then, he would promote another Vice Captain who would report everything to him and listen to him obediently.","Fan Lou had promoted Xi Fan in the past out of convenience. But this time, it would be for his peace of mind.","...","Lin Yuan had no idea that this hiccup had taken place.","Lin Yuan had not helped another fey to evolve ever since Dark Blue reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. He also had not caused any other commotion for some time.","Once Lin Yuan left, it was unlikely that another lifeform would be able to evolve on its own.","The world wills would suppress the evolution of the native feys.","It was only when a Class 2 world evolved to Class 3 and the world wills transformed that the barrier to evolving to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom would be lowered.","...","The journey took a few days. The Immortal Kill Food Sky Butterfly finally arrived at Epoch God Palace.","The Moon Empress immediately spotted the towering Four Seasons Mountain.","After staring serenely at the Four Seasons Mountain for a moment, the Moon Empress said calmly, “Little Yuan, I remember you telling me about faeries. They are lifeforms that have evolved from natural formations such as mountains and rivers. This mountain should have the potential to evolve, right?”","The Moon Empress had seen Begin Lady and Celestial Sight and was very curious about faeries.","Lin Yuan smiled and nodded. “Master, this mountain is called the Four Seasons Mountain. If it’s able to evolve into a faerie, it will be of a much higher level than Begin Lady and Celestial Sight!","“However, we won’t be able to help it to evolve before we leave for the Sky Beyond the Clouds. We will need an immense amount of energy to teleport to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. This immense amount of energy will be supplied by the Four Seasons Mountain!”","The Moon Empress nodded. It seemed that Lin Yuan had already made all the arrangements.","Blood Love frowned slightly.","Lifeforms always had to undertake suffering and risk to evolve. It went without saying that the journey would be even more difficult for natural formations.","“Lin Yuan, will the Four Seasons Mountain be affected if we use its energy for the teleportation? Didn’t you say that the Abyssal Beasts are also able to travel from the main world to the Sky Beyond the Clouds?”","When Lin Yuan heard that, he immediately understood what Blood Love was thinking.","It was true that Abyssal Beasts were also able to travel between the main world and Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan could also use the Ethereal Jellyfish’s exclusive skill to catch and take control of young Abyssal Beasts.","However, using Abyssal Beasts for travel required a location to be set. They would not be able to reach the Sky Beyond the Clouds if they traveled blindly.","Before Lin Yuan spoke, Spring said with utmost seriousness, “You don’t have to worry about this. The teleportation will indeed use up the Four Seasons Mountain’s energy but won’t harm its roots. The energy it depleted can be replenished in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“The Four Seasons Mountain’s four seasons power is full of potential. It was unable to receive any fate-changing opportunities because it was born in this world. The Four Seasons Mountain is blessed to have met you, Young Master!”","Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter also started addressing Lin Yuan as ‘Young Master’ when they were in the presence of others. Unless it was absolutely necessary, they did not want to reveal Lin Yuan’s identity as the Saint to others.","Blood Love smiled when she heard what Summer said.","She was used to deciding things through violence and was no saint. Her mindset only started to change after she became a Heavenly Family Fey.","Blood Love had indeed learned a lot during its time in the Heavenly Family Cottage. One of such was empathy for all lifeforms.","The Moon Empress was very satisfied with the change in Blood Love’s attitude.","Blood Love had been too bloodthirsty in the past. It did not benefit Lin Yuan to have such a character by his side.","Winter said softly, “Young Master, are you going to head to the Sky Beyond the Clouds now or wait for a few days? I am done charging the Space Tunnel, and it can be used for teleportation at any time. I have counted all your white-clothed followers. Everyone is present.”","Lin Yuan had stayed in Epoch God Palace for a very long time. He had already obtained all the resources he needed, so there was no longer any need for him to continue remaining in Epoch God Palace.","“Winter, go and make the preparations. Since it will be teleportation, we’ll be able to reach the Sky Beyond the Clouds very soon. Let’s not dawdle in Epoch God Palace!","“Remember not to harm the Four Seasons Mountain’s roots during the teleportation. If you can’t guarantee this, I have spirit qi crystals that will be able to help.”","By now, the Four Seasons Mountain already had intelligence and was able to sense its surroundings.","When the Four Seasons Mountain heard what Lin Yuan said, it swayed its body in response to Lin Yuan.","Wildflowers bloomed at the foot of the mountain, and the plants on the side of the mountain were in full bloom. Further up the mountain was enveloped in the throws of autumn, and red leaves danced in the air. The peak of the mountain was covered with white snow.","In an instant, the Four Seasons Mountain seemed to come alive."]},{"number":2818,"title":"Chapter 2818 Combat Sequence and Reserve Sequence!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2818 Combat Sequence and Reserve Sequence!","This sudden change caused the aura of the four seasons to begin circulating.","The mountain, thousands of meters tall, began undergoing astonishing changes that stunned all those who were watching.","While watching the Four Seasons Mountain, Blood Love and the others all hoped that it would not change much.","This especially applied to Begin Lady and Celestial Sight.","Lower-level faeries naturally looked up to and respected higher-level faeries.","The first time that Celestial Sight laid eyes on Begin Lady, such emotions were naturally invoked within him because Begin Lady was an intermediate faerie.","This was why faeries that did not have any links to each other were able to assimilate and get along well with the other faeries after the establishment of the Faerie Institution.","Based on its roots, Four Seasons Mountain would definitely be a higher faerie once it transformed.","Only the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope in the Spirit Lock spatial zone was aware that Lin Yuan was in possession of such a large amount of spirit qi crystals.","Due to Morbius’ evolution, the Spirit Lock spatial zone had continuously expanded.","Lin Yuan had asked Hu Quan to set aside the space meant for the Pure Land of Bliss and its extensions. This included the spirit pool, which was the second core of the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The Wind Speed Rapid Antelope could control wind elements to organize the sea of spirit qi crystals. It did not need the help of anyone else.","Although Hu Quan and the other Spirit Craftsmen were secluding themselves from the real world, and Begin Lady and Celestial Sight spent most of their time in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, secrets that needed to be kept hidden should stay that way.","Hence, Begin Lady and Celestial Sight felt that the spirit qi crystals were extremely precious.","Begin Lady and Celestial Sight were also touched that Lin Yuan was willing to use spirit qi crystals to prevent the Four Seasons Mountain’s roots from becoming injured. It led them to think back to all that Lin Yuan had done for them.","As opposed to regular feys, Celestial Sight and Begin Lady were more willing to head to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Celestial Sight and Begin Lady had sensed the restraints from the world wills long ago. These restraints made it very difficult for them to continue increasing their strength.","Given the circumstances, they felt that going to the Sky Beyond the Clouds would be the best choice.","...","When Winter received Lin Yuan’s instruction, he hurriedly said, “Young Master, just give me four hours to prepare. I have gathered all your white-clothed followers. I’ll call them over now!”","Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter all had high aptitudes for butlering or stewardship.","However, Spring was the weakest of the four and could only manage a few of Lin Yuan’s personal matters.","Summer and Autumn did not have a strong talent for managing the lifestyle of factions. Meanwhile, Winter had the strongest talent for internal governance.","In numerous tasks that Winter had been involved in, Lin Yuan could tell how thoughtful and detail-oriented he was.","It did not take long for the white-clothed followers to appear in front of Lin Yuan.","There were now a total of 500 white-clothed followers.","After several rounds of selection over the years, many white-clothed followers had been eliminated.","The eliminated white-clothed followers were still members of Sky City, but they were no longer part of Sky City’s combat sequence. Rather, they were relegated to Sky City’s reserve sequence.","The members of the reserve sequence would be assigned to numerous roles in Sky City. They would fill gaps wherever they appeared.","Members of Sky City’s combat sequence and reserve sequence received different treatments.","Although the quota of white-clothed followers remained the same at 500 so that there would be 50 teams of 10, the members were evaluated every three years.","Those who were eliminated would be replaced by members of the reserve sequence.","This structure was very similar to the Radiance Hundred Sequence selection. It was meant to spur positive competition within Sky City and prevent the combat sequence of the white-clothed followers from becoming complacent.","This system had been designed by Liu Jie, the manager of the white-clothed followers.","When Liu Jie designed this system, his main consideration had not been the complacency of the white-clothed followers’ combat sequence.","Sky City was in a constant state of rapid development, and every person did their best to increase their power and prove their worth.","In such an environment, complacency would lead to elimination.","Liu Jie’s main consideration for designing this system was the convenience of switching out the members of the 50 teams.","Every person had different temperaments. Hence, some people got along better, while others would come to dislike each other. Despite the other party not having done anything, they could not help but feel an increasing loathing for them.","This was a common occurrence among the Radiance Federation’s large guild clubs.","Liu Jie had been part of guild clubs in the past, and this was the reason that eventually caused him to withdraw from them.","By giving the members of the 50 teams the opportunity to change their members every three years, the white-clothed followers would form stronger bonds with each other.","Lin Yuan and Wen Yu approved of Liu Jie’s design.","In the past, Liu Jie was brave and had some strategic intelligence, but most of his strategy revolved around the design of insect army battles.","Now, most of his focus was on managing factions. This allowed Lin Yuan and Liu Jie to see his talent in managing factions.","The 500 combat sequence white-clothed followers stood in an orderly formation and looked at Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Wen Yu with bright eyes.","1,500 reserve sequence members stood behind the combat sequence, their fighting spirits just as high. They were all determined to take the place of the combat sequence members three years later.","Aside from Lin Yuan, Wen Yu, Liu Jie, Listen, Duan He, Zhou Luo, and the other members of management, there were 2,000 regular members of Sky City.","It was impossible for Lin Yuan to have increased the strength of every member in the past ten years or so.","There were two captains of every white-clothed follower team. Lin Yuan had evolved the captains’ feys to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. The captains themselves also possessed Divine Kingdom power.","Lin Yuan had evolved the remainder of the white-clothed followers to the spirit fire level. He could continue to slowly evolve them once they arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","The reserve sequence was going to be assigned to various positions. Hence, they did not have a manager.","The members of the reserve sequence had only just reached the birth horoscope level. However, this was sufficiently powerful for the main world.","The white-clothed followers did not have a clear understanding of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan had also not shared information about it. This was because Lin Yuan had never personally been there. Fan Lou and Kong Huan’s knowledge of the Sky Beyond the Clouds was limited.","Moreover, Lin Yuan knew that as the white-clothed followers continued to increase their power and reached the peak of the main world, it was inevitable for them to become arrogant.","Hence, he needed to wait until they had been knocked down a peg by the Sky Beyond the Clouds in order to realize just how dangerous it was and how lacking their strength was.","Lin Yuan cleared his throat and said loudly, “Later, all the members of Sky City will head to the Sky Beyond the Clouds and begin the conquest there. I believe that everyone has been looking forward to this day!","“In the past, someone asked me where Sky City’s headquarters are and whether it is Thick Soil City. I want to let everyone know that Sky City’s headquarters is not in Thick Soil City but here!”","Lin Yuan raised his hand and pointed to the sky.","Everyone looked up, only to see the thick clouds floating across the sky.","The clouds were clustered together like cotton balls.","If those who paid attention to meteorological processes saw such clouds, they would think that rain was about to fall.","The white-clothed followers all looked up at the sky. For a moment, they did not understand what Lin Yuan meant.","However, Liu Jie, Wen Yu, and the rest knew that Lin Yuan was referring to Sky Sea.","Hu Quan had not shown his face ever since Lin Yuan had taken him away.","It was likely that Hu Quan was done building Sky City atop Sky Sea.","Now that Lin Yuan was about to head to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it seemed that he was going to inform his faction of Sky Sea’s existence!","After looking up, the Moon Empress frowned for a few seconds while scanning the sky.","She had noticed that something was off about the sky.","The Moon Empress had returned the moon to the main world through Forage Moon. She had also left a part of her roots on the moon.","Her roots would take control of the energy in the moon and prevent the moon’s energy from causing future disasters in the main world, such as tsunamis and the like.","The Moon Empress noticed that the moonlight was not piercing through the clouds directly above Lin Yuan.","This meant there was definitely something strange about those clouds!","If Lin Yuan had not specified the position, the Moon Empress would not have picked up on anything.","While everyone was looking at the clouds, the plume of clouds suddenly dissipated, and a giant figure appeared in the sky.","It was the figure of an enormous whale that was difficult to describe.","The enormous whale slowly moved its wings and was carrying a majestic city on its back.","The city was shrouded in various weather phenomena.","There was a rainbow across the center of the city, enhancing the city’s beauty.","Even Wen Yu and Liu Jie could not stop their jaws from dropping. They had not expected Lin Yuan to evolve Sky Sea to such a degree!","Given Wen Yu and Liu Jie’s reactions, the reactions of the white-clothed followers who were seeing Sky Sea for the first time did not have to be described.","The city atop Sky Sea was full of Hu Quan’s architectural style. Anyone who was acquainted with Hu Quan could recognize this with a single glance.","Lin Yuan had already used the Ethereal Jellyfish’s exclusive skill to set up teleportation nodes on Sky Sea’s back.","When everyone looked away from Sky Sea’s back, Lin Yuan said, “Each of you has the tentacle node that I previously distributed. Later, you can use the tentacle node to directly transport yourself to the city in the sky. The city being carried by Sky Sea is Sky City’s headquarters!”","Once Lin Yuan was done speaking, the dissipated clouds gathered together again, hiding Sky Sea’s figure.","From this, the white-clothed followers knew the clouds hiding Sky Sea’s body were also summoned by one of the feys under Lin Yuan’s control.","In the time that the Moon Empress spent by Lin Yuan’s side, she had also changed her mindset as an expert.","She still had the heart of an expert now, but she also understood just how much room for growth there was when one looked beyond the main world!","The journey of an expert was endless. This delighted someone like her, who had an endless lifespan. This was because she could use her long lifespan to slowly and continuously break through and reach new heights.","The Moon Empress did not understand the circumstances in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. She also did not know how abundant the resource availability in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was.","However, something like the Lifespan Mouse was also considered a treasure of the highest level there!","Even the most powerful lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds would eventually reach the end of their lifespans.","...","It was likely that the only one in the group who did not want to go to the Sky Beyond the Clouds was Keira.","When Lin Yuan and Keira first made their deal, he had agreed to allow Keira to remain in the Spirit Lock spatial zone while they were in the main world. But once they got to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Keira would have to lead the demon insects in scouting and clearing the surrounding environment. She would no longer be able to remain in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","It was said that it was easy to transition from frugality to extravagance but not vice versa.","Keira was extremely disappointed.","However, she knew that Lin Yuan had only allowed her to remain in the Spirit Lock spatial zone to compensate her for her contribution during the dead spirits crisis.","In the past ten-odd years, she had produced almost ten fetuses that could produce hundreds of demon insects with Class 1 Genetic Locks.","This was sufficient to enable Sky City to develop independently in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Her nest took up a very large space in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and got in the way of Hu Quan’s constructions.","In spite of Keira’s disappointment, she had no lack of fighting spirit.","Keira was ambitious in accomplishing achievements and racking up success.","As long as she could achieve results that benefited Lin Yuan in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it was likely that he would give her numerous spirit qi crystals that would aid her development.","Lin Yuan did not care about what Keira thought.","If Lin Yuan had not been so busy in the past few years, he would already have ordered Keira to decrease the size of her nest.","As the number of fetuses increased, Keira built more and more irregular structures in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Hu Quan would complain about this to Lin Yuan each time he saw him.","...","Once Lin Yuan was done speaking, Wen Yu and Liu Jie, who were Sky City’s deputies, spoke.","When Liu Jie and Wen Yu were done giving their speeches, Lin Yuan looked at the Moon Empress.","The Moon Empress knew that Lin Yuan wanted her to say a few words. But after pondering for a moment, she shook her head at Lin Yuan.","She, Cold Moon, and Mystic Moon were supporters who stood behind Lin Yuan, Liu Jie, and Wen Yu. They were there to watch them grow.","The Moon Empress felt that this was the best decision.","If the Moon Empress wanted to obtain special treatment and authority in Sky City, she would have already used her title as the CIty Lord’s Master to issue orders.","...","Hu Quan led Lin Yuan in admiring all of the interior designs and decorations of Sky City. He had spared no expense in the construction of Sky City.","With the guarantee that no functions were omitted, the entire Sky City had been constructed as a work of art.","All of the walls of Sky City’s interior had been carved with the hollowed low relief technique. Phoebe zhennan boards that were almost 20 centimeters thick were embedded into the walls and carved using the hollowed low relief technique. As a result, the carvings all seemed to be animated and full of life."]},{"number":2819,"title":"Chapter 2819 Spirit Contractor!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2819 Spirit Contractor!","Due to Sky Sea’s Lashing Spirit Tail Wings, it could naturally gather spirit qi around itself. This allowed the carvings made from jade-textured wood to be nourished by spirit qi and shine with a soft amber glow. Anyone covered by the amber would be put in a state of utmost comfort and relaxation.","Everyone looked around their surroundings.","It turned out that this was Sky City’s headquarters! This was going to be their home from now on!","Wen Yu, who managed Sky City, quickly returned to her senses. After spending such a long time by Lin Yuan’s side, her shock tolerance had risen significantly from its original level.","When she first joined Lin Yuan, she was shocked numerous times daily. But now, she had been with Lin Yuan for almost 20 years. If she was still not used to it by now, it would mean that there was something wrong with her abilities.","Wen Yu assigned Sky City’s 500 combat sequence and 1,500 reserve sequence white-clothed followers to their individual rooms.","At first, Hu Quan was troubled after learning of the number of people who would be staying in Sky City. He was perplexed over how to best construct the 2,000 rooms in a way that would not be cramped.","At that time, Hu Quan had yet to see Sky Sea’s true self. Although he knew of Sky Sea’s existence, he thought of it as nothing more than a larger Island Whale. But once he saw Sky Sea’s true self, Hu Quan knew that his worries had been for naught.","The over 2,000 members of Sky City could live comfortably on Sky Sea’s back. There was more than enough space on Sky Sea’s spacious back to make each room 200 square meters large. Later, Sky Sea evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, and the size of its back increased again.","Hu Quan decided to turn the Sky City he had constructed previously into the main palace that was open to the public. He then constructed two other smaller palaces behind the main palace. They were the Follower City and Reserve City.","The Follower City would only house the combat sequence white-clothed followers and came with completed self-care and nutrition facilities. There were also many areas for battling and sparring. The Follower City was looked after by 500 Deposit Vegetable Pods in human form. They served as personal butlers to the white-clothed followers.","The Follower City and Reserve City were of a similar size. The Reserve City housed the 1,500 reserve sequence members. They did not have any Deposit Vegetable Pods to serve them. However, they had all the same facilities.","The difference between the Follower City and Reserve City was enough to ignite the fighting spirit of the combat sequence and reserve sequence members. The combat sequence white-clothed followers would try hard to preserve their position, while the reserve sequence members tried their best to improve their standing.","The Spirit Craftsmen under Hu Quan had carved many jade-textured wooden materials over the years. Hu Quan had placed these jade-textured wood carvings in the Follower City and Reserve City’s storage rooms.","Wen Yu took out these ornaments that were extremely valuable in the main world and placed them in the rooms of the combat sequence and reserve sequence white-clothed followers. Wen Yu had an extremely strong execution ability and settled everything quickly.","The rooms belonging to Lin Yuan and the other main members of Sky City were all in the four tall towers that rose above the main structure.","From the outside, these four towers looked white. The interior could not be seen at all. But from the inside, it seemed transparent. From within the four towers, the expansive sky and stars could be seen with utmost clarity. Frankly, most of the main members of Sky City spent the majority of their time in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The Spirit Lock spatial zone continuously grew larger, and Lin Yuan could keep it perfectly hidden. By living in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, they could be ensconced in pure spirit qi. The key members of Sky City could thereby increase their power.","However, it went without saying that once one reached the Divine Kingdom level, one needed faith power as well as pure spirit qi to increase their strength. Faith power was what enabled divine kingdoms to evolve.","Once they got to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Lin Yuan would have to find ways to collect faith power. When it came to collecting faith power, even Lin Yuan had to be envious of Keira.","The demon insects that Keira produced were able to supply faith to Keira, regardless of their class of Genetic Lock. This made it easy for Keira to evolve her divine kingdom rapidly. The evolution of Keira’s divine kingdom was related to the size of its demon insect army.","Hence, Keira’s mind was full of ideas for expanding her insect army. In the main world, Keira’s ideas were curbed by Lin Yuan. However, Lin Yuan intended to allow Keira to go wild once they arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan could not help but gaze out into the distance. The two of them were rulers of federations and had to overcome significant emotional turmoil before deciding to leave with Lin Yuan.","For the past tens of years, they had invested all their efforts into governing the Iron Hammer Federation and the Darkness and Sand Island Continents. It was only to be expected that they were reluctant.","However, it went without saying that aside from reluctance, the feelings of hope for a brighter future were stronger. The two of them intended to have a good talk with Lin Yuan in the Sky Beyond the Clouds to see how they could be of help!","Su Yiren and Lin Yuan went to the Sky Beyond the Clouds for the sake of their development and did not want to be relegated to the sidelines. Rather, Bei Xu felt extremely relaxed.","Bei Xu never formed many ties. Ever since he was saved by Lin Yuan, the latter became his guiding light.","Bei Xu’s greatest hope was to be able to remain by Lin Yuan’s side, and he had accomplished this.","Bei Xu had a strong urge to grow stronger but was not as lost as Liu Jie had been in the past. He very happy with his step-by-step improvement.","...","Lin Yuan sipped on the Three Treasures Tea that Wen Yu had brewed and waited for Winter to contact him. Spring, Summer, and Autumn stood next to him. The three of them knew that Lin Yuan would only be able to truly spread his wings once he left the Class 2 world for the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","A thought struck Lin Yuan, and he called Blood Love over. He told Blood Love to tell Spring, Summer, and Autumn about her divine kingdom ability. Next, Lin Yuan summoned the Merciful Star Peony.","Spring, Summer, and Autumn immediately understood Lin Yuan’s intention. He wanted to use Blood Love and the Merciful Star Peony to temper their bodies.","Tempering their bodies was the best way to refine their bodies. Regular tempering techniques did not have much effect on them. However, this method of using the energy of celestial bodies to temper their bodies was extremely effective.","Lin Yuan always thought about the rest of them when he obtained resources.","Spring, Summer, and Autumn could not help but think back to how they were cultivated by that noble figure many epochs ago.","Autumn was the first to speak. “Young Master, this method of tempering is useful for all of us. While you’re using the Merciful Star Peony’s star power to temper us, we can use our bodies to adjust our tolerances and feed back a tolerable amount of star power to you. This way, you’ll be able to temper your body without worrying that the star power will damage your body!”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up.","That was great! He could now temper his body sooner than before!","While Lin Yuan was interacting with Spring, Summer, and Autumn, Blood Love and the Merciful Star Peony obediently sat on chairs next to Lin Yuan.","The two of them knew how strong Spring, Summer, and Autumn were. With their powers, Blood Love and Merciful Star Peony were extremely respectful to them despite also being Lin Yuan’s subordinates.","...","It did not take long for Lin Yuan to receive a message from Winter.","The tunnel’s setup was done and could be used for teleportation at any moment.","Due to the protection from the Four Seasons Mountain, teleportation over such a distance would not cause any discomfort.","However, they could not be certain of where they would end up after the teleportation.","Lin Yuan immediately sent out the order for Winter to begin the teleportation.","Prior to the teleportation, Lin Yuan summoned Gray and Dark Blue back to the Spirit Lock spatial zone. This would reduce some of the energy depletion required for the teleportation.","Soon, Lin Yuan sensed an energy enveloping Sky Sea.","He felt Sky Sea shake a few times.","It did not take long before Lin Yuan felt the concentration of spirit qi on Sky Sea’s back increase substantially. The glow of the fully jade-textured wooden materials also intensified.","Lin Yuan knew that he was headed to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Sky Sea’s Lashing Spirit Tail Wings automatically gathered all the spirit qi in the environment.","With the increase of spirit qi in the environment, the concentration of spirit qi on Sky Sea’s back naturally rose as well.","Spring released her own aura before saying softly, “Young Master, the area we’ve been transported to is very quiet. It’s not within the territory of any species. However, there are some random fish. Should I go and ask them about the area or remove them?”","When Lin Yuan heard this, he knew that the random fish that Spring spoke of had discovered Sky Sea.","If Lin Yuan wanted to hide Sky Sea’s tracks, he would have to seal their lips. Otherwise, it was inevitable for information to leak, regardless of how closed-off the environment was.","However, they had only just arrived, and Lin Yuan felt that scouting out the area would be a better option than unleashing a massacre.","“Spring, bring them over here. I’ll ask them about the situation myself. We can learn about the area from them, and it’ll make it easier for me to decide where to move Sky Sea that will best suit our development!”","Spring bowed to Lin Yuan before her figure disappeared.","Soon, she brought three back with her as she reappeared in front of Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan sensed the three figures and noticed that none of them had reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. The strongest of them had only just reached Eternal.","Based on Fan Lou and Kong Huan’s introduction of the universes in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Eternal lifeforms were seen as outstanding in Class 1 and 2 worlds but were considered mediocre in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","At that moment, the three figures were staring at Lin Yuan timidly.","Although the three of them were not considered strong, they could tell who called the shots.","Spring had not employed any overly threatening methods, yet she had managed to scare the three of them. They now knew that this group of people could easily put an end to their lives.","The three of them had never seen such interior design before. It was far too opulent!","Lin Yuan gently knocked the table twice, and his pleasant voice rang out in the three figures’ ears, “It looks like the three of you have been living here all this time. You must have an understanding of the environment here. I would like you to tell me all about this place.”","The three of them looked startled when they heard what Lin Yuan said. It was clear that they did not understand what he had said.","Lin Yuan attempted to speak to them in the language of the Alluring Foxes but received the same reaction.","Lin Yuan had learned the East Universe’s lingua franca from Kong Huan and Fan Lou.","Fan Lou did not carry the legacy of any species.","Kong Huan was an Alluring Fox, and Lin Yuan had taken the opportunity to learn the Alluring Fox’s language.","However, neither of the two languages worked on the three of them.","Given that the three of them did not even know the East Universe’s lingua franca, it meant that this was an extremely remote place.","Lin Yuan summoned Genius.","The three figures watched as Lin Yuan waved his hand, and a cat with 12 tails materialized in his arms. They could not help but gasp simultaneously and begin mumbling something under their breath.","Lin Yuan shot a look at Spring to signal her to suppress them.","Next, Lin Yuan nodded at Genius.","Genius used Connected Tails to link Lin Yuan and the three figures.","Lin Yuan was currently a pinnacle spirit fire expert and was only a step away from reaching the Divine Kingdom level. He was sufficiently powerful to suppress these three native lifeforms from the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Hence, Lin Yuan could use Connected Tails to take in all of the knowledge and life experience of these three figures.","It did not take long for realization to spread across Lin Yuan’s face.","The three of them used to live in a village. The village’s head would go out to search for homeless lifeforms to take them in and protect them.","However, they needed to worship a stone statue to live in the village. If they failed to provide faith power to the stone statue for more than ten years, they would be chased out of the village.","The three of them had been simultaneously expelled from the village. They then escaped to this place and have been settled here for the past ten years.","The three of them knew very little about this place.","Despite being uninhabited, the three of them did not have any trouble filling their bellies.","From the perspective of those who laid about and did nothing, the three of them led cushy lives.","It seemed that he would have to approach the head of that village in order to glean any information about this place!","Given that they needed to supply faith to that stone statue, it meant that the village head was likely under the thumb of a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom expert.","Lin Yuan had heard from Kong Huan that many species created storage stones to accumulate faith power. An expert only needed to place their soul imprint on the storage stone to mark the storage stone with their spiritual attribute. They would then be able to extract the faith power in the storage stones to strengthen themselves.","The three of them knew very little, but they did enable Lin Yuan to understand some of the common knowledge and norms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Lin Yuan could now disguise himself and pass for a native of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Among the common knowledge that he learned, Lin Yuan was most interested in the concept of spirit contractors."]},{"number":2820,"title":"Chapter 2820 Scheme Behind the Faith!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2820 Scheme Behind the Faith!","The three of them had deemed him a spirit contractor after watching him summon Genius.","Fear, admiration, and respect surfaced in their gazes when they mentioned spirit contractors.","This enabled Lin Yuan to understand the significance of the term.","From the three individuals’ knowledge, Lin Yuan learned that spirit contractors were individuals who could use spiritual energy, soul energy, or bloodline power to take control of other lifeforms.","This concept of spirit contractors caused Lin Yuan to press his lips together.","If that was what spirit contractors were, didn’t that mean all the spirit qi professionals in the main world could be considered spirit contractors?","Why were spirit contractors so rare in the Sky Beyond the Clouds?","Lin Yuan looked at Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter, who were next to him, before instructing Genius to use Connected Tails on the four of them so he could share the memories he had obtained from the trio.","When Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter learned of their concept of spirit contractors, they did not disagree with the concept.","Spring was the first to speak. “Young Master, the understanding of concepts is related to an entity’s level and circumstances. The three of them are at a very low level. Hence, it is almost impossible for them to come into contact with spirit contractors.","“However, there are a fair number of spirit contractors in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. A few species are born with the ability to use their bloodlines to take control of other lifeforms. There are many experts whose spiritual energy and souls mutate during the process of increasing their strength. They thus gain the ability to form contracts with other lifeforms using their spiritual energy and souls.","“Faith power can also be used to control other lifeforms. However, using faith power to control other lifeforms cannot be considered a form of spirit contraction.”","Lin Yuan nodded when he heard what Spring said. He agreed with Spring.","It was true that these three were weak. With such inferior power, they knew barely anything about this wide world.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan was now extremely interested in spirit contractors.","Autumn rarely had the opportunity to demonstrate his value to Lin Yuan.","Since Lin Yuan did not know about spirit contractors, he could help fill in the gaps!","“Young Master, among the two captives that you later took in, the Alluring Fox is considered a spirit contractor! However, in a place like the Sky Beyond the Clouds, everyone would rather invest resources in themselves as opposed to targets they had spiritually contracted.","“Spirit contraction only works on recently born or weak lifeforms. Hence, it is usually only members of large factions who spiritually contract lifeforms. That Alluring Fox has only spiritually contracted newborns that were born with innate power or potential.”","After Autumn’s explanation, Lin Yuan now had an accurate understanding of spirit contractors.","In the main world, humans had relatively weak bodies, and it was necessary for them to use feys for combat.","However, the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ experts naturally possessed outstanding combat abilities. Despite being spirit contractors, there was no need for them to contract other lifeforms to help them in battle. Thus, the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ spirit contractors no longer relied on spiritually contracting other lifeforms.","If this was truly the case in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, any member of Sky City would be seen as the disciple of a major faction!","There were no native humans in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","But this did not matter because the various species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds usually preferred to take human form. This was something that Lin Yuan already knew.","Lin Yuan did not want to waste too much time here.","In truth, Lin Yuan could have sent out Keira and used her and her army of insects to scout out the surroundings. It would not take long for Lin Yuan to gain a perfect understanding of the circumstances of this environment and draw up a precise map.","However, Lin Yuan did not do this.","He knew that once he sent out Keira, the demon insects would sweep through the environment and leave devastation in their wake. That was just the kind of species they were—they lived and evolved by consuming.","Connected Tails allowed Lin Yuan to access the three individuals’ memories and knowledge. It also allowed him to use the language they understood to communicate with them.","“I want to know the location of the village from which you escaped. I need you to lead the way.”","From their memories, Lin Yuan had a general idea of the village’s location. He asked them this question because he wanted to give them a chance.","If the three of them seized this chance, Lin Yuan would take them in.","Lin Yuan would undoubtedly need help if he wanted to begin developing in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","If the three of them lied to him, he would not hesitate to send these three native lifeforms to the netherworld.","Based on their experiences, the three of them could not be considered good people in the traditional sense. Rather, they were lifeforms that abided by the law of the jungle.","When they came across weaker lifeforms, they would turn into sharks that had caught a whiff of blood. They would never give up until they had their target in their jaws! They had caught and killed countless weaker lifeforms.","When they heard what Lin Yuan said, they did not immediately tell Lin Yuan all that they knew. Rather, they followed their nature and began negotiating.","“Lord, the village where we used to live is far from here. If we take you there, will you give us any benefits? You are a spirit contractor master who has spiritually contracted beautiful lifeforms. It shouldn’t be difficult for you to give us a little something!”","The man with rough skin, who had just spoken, began chuckling. The rows of yellow teeth he revealed led Wen Yu, who was sitting next to Lin Yuan, to frown.","Blood Love glared coldly at the rough-skinned man. It was the gaze of someone looking at something that was about to die.","Lin Yuan looked away from the three of them and waved at Autumn.","Autumn immediately led the three of them away.","Autumn knew that Lin Yuan was saying that he no longer wanted to see them. The three of them would no longer have anything to do with Lin Yuan. Hence, Autumn could decide what to do with them.","Autumn detested those who did not understand their circumstances.","Through Connected Tails, Autumn had accessed their memories and had a general idea of the village’s location. They would need to release their spiritual aura to search for the village’s exact location.","This meant that the three of them would also need to expend some effort to locate the village.","They were unable to pinpoint the village’s location accurately, yet they responded as though they had all the answers and even asked Lin Yuan for benefits. Their behavior was unforgivable!","The three of them were clearly incapable of saving themselves. Yet, they were still attempting to negotiate.","Their greed tainted Lord Saint’s sacred years.","Since that was the case, there was no need for them to continue living.","Autumn used his power to imprison the three of them.","With Autumn’s power, they did not even have the opportunity to admit their mistake. All they could do was stare at him pleadingly.","However, Autumn did not feel a shred of mercy.","A young girl they had caught had also looked at them with the same pleading eyes. But they had not given her the chance to continue living.","Once Autumn was done dealing with them, he immediately returned to Lin Yuan’s side.","Autumn did not report what he had done to Lin Yuan, as he felt that there was no need to do so.","The three of them had already wasted so much of Lin Yuan’s time. If they continued to take up Lin Yuan’s time after death, it would only amplify their crime!","Autumn knew of Lin Yuan’s goal. He began releasing his spiritual aura in the direction he had gleaned from their memories and started the search on Lin Yuan’s behalf.","Lin Yuan released Dark Blue and Gray from the Spirit Lock spatial zone so the two of them could hide Sky Sea’s movements.","Dark Blue, Gray, and Sky Sea’s partnership could be described as sheer perfection.","Frankly, it was not necessary for Lin Yuan to find a safe place to develop.","Sky Sea was Sky City’s core and could be located anywhere.","Lin Yuan wanted to establish a territory because the many feys that were part of Sky City and the Divine Kingdom white-clothed followers needed to obtain faith power. The best way was to establish a territory and obtain protection for lifeforms, thereby attaining faith power from these lifeforms. Hence, it became necessary for Lin Yuan to establish a territory.","Next to Lin Yuan, Summer said seriously, “Young Master, once you begin traveling to the village and learn of its exact location, I don’t think you should build your territory near that area. You should find an area of fertile land with an abundance of resources. The barrenness of this place exceeds my previous expectations.”","Lin Yuan nodded.","Summer’s words were very reasonable to him.","With Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter’s strength, Lin Yuan would be able to take any fertile land for himself. However, it was not easy to come across a piece of fertile land.","Once Winter settled the Four Seasons Mountain and helped it replenish its energy, he said seriously, “Young Master, don’t forget that you still have Fan Lou as a chess piece in the East Universe!","“You are now in the East Universe and can use him to accomplish many tasks. You’ll be able to find fertile land by asking Fan Lou about it. Once you find the village’s exact location, tell Fan Lou to come to us.","“It requires too much energy to use the jade I gave Fan Lou. You can give him a Thoughts Letter Paper. That way, you’ll be able to find out information from him!”","When Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter first joined Lin Yuan, they dared not make any suggestions to him for fear that doing so would displease him.","Lin Yuan had put a lot of effort into changing their mindsets to the current point where they saw themselves as his aides.","Rather than serving him, Lin Yuan preferred them to make up for his gaps like seniors would. This would help him to improve continuously and prevent his growth from becoming stunted. It also prevented his ego from being inflated by the constant adulation.","Lin Yuan had not forgotten about Fan Lou. Now that he had arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it was indeed time to contact him.","There was no need for Lin Yuan to be overly careful while he was developing in the East Universe. He would not go after those who did not cross him. But once someone bared their fangs at him, he would make sure to put an end to them!","If any faction laid a hand on Lin Yuan, he would be able to gain notoriety quickly by eliminating them. This would surely send shockwaves through the other factions.","The group already had a general location. As Spring continued to search the surroundings, she soon discovered the village.","The village was very small. It could be considered the smallest inhabited locale in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Yet, there were hundreds of millions of lifeforms living within it.","The population of lifeforms living in the Sky Beyond the Clouds could not be conceptualized by Lin Yuan, who came from the main world.","Presently, every single lifeform in the village was lined up in an orderly formation as they worshipped the sculpture in the middle of the open-air courtyard.","A gray-haired elderly man covered in liver spots was leaning on a wooden cane and standing next to the sculpture. He surveyed all the worshippers to ensure that they were injecting a sufficient quantity of faith power into the sculpture.","The lifeforms that did not supply sufficient faith power to the sculpture would be picked out and told to stand off to the side. They would receive special punishment from the elderly man later.","Each punishment would be followed by a significant shrinking of the group.","Hence, all the lifeforms in the village were motivated to do their best to supply faith to the sculpture. This was so they could earn the elderly man’s protection.","The village was surrounded by danger, and ferocious beasts frequently emerged. The elderly man had already protected the village more than once.","The sculpture was of a lifeform hidden under wings. The lifeform probably had a humanoid form, but the wings prevented discernment of a precise answer.","In order to supply faith to a lifeform whose appearance they could not even see, they needed to use their imagination to persuade themselves to have faith in this lifeform.","Summer studied the situation in the village before sharing her findings with Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was rendered speechless with shock when he heard that.","It turned out that faith was collected in this manner in the Sky Beyond the Clouds! How was this any different from rearing milk cows and draining them daily?","Just like spirit qi, faith power could also be categorized into different levels. This was the lowest-level method of collecting faith power.","It was unlikely that anyone would be willing to absorb faith power that was filled with so many impurities. Such faith power came with so much negative energy that it could even damage a divine kingdom.","Lin Yuan told them of his thoughts.","When Winter heard that, he began to explain, “Young Master, faith power isn’t just used to increase one’s power here. It also serves as currency. Experts who are able to use such methods to gather faith power will use such low-quality faith power as currency or give it out as rewards to their subordinates.”","Spring was silent for a moment before she said, “Based on what we learned from the three native lifeforms, this village has been here for at least a few thousand years. These lifeforms are slaves. Faith power that is forced out isn’t genuine.","“Young Master, if you want to collect faith power, you can consider saving the lifeforms in this village. Rescuing others is the best way to obtain faith power. It’s commonly employed in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.”","Lin Yuan felt that Spring’s suggestion was feasible.","Then, A wild idea appeared in his head.","Could it be that all incidents of being rescued in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were linked to such a scheme?"]},{"number":2821,"title":"Chapter 2821 Lin Yuan Makes a Move!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2821 Lin Yuan Makes a Move!","Faith was a one-sided action.","The faith that came from being saved would involve the individual being saved having to endure suffering.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, even the most inferior individual could implicate an enormous entity as long as it involved faith.","The elderly man who was overseeing the ritual in the village had to have the support of a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom expert.","Hence, the act of saving another came at a large cost. It was not something that anyone would dare to do flippantly.","Rather than saving indiscriminately, it might be easier to perform the rescue of a self-manufactured crisis. This would essentially negate the costs.","In all the schemes meant to obtain faith power, the weak would have to endure increasing suffering. There was no question about this.","Having just arrived, Lin Yuan needed information to begin rolling out his operations. Hence, he needed to make a move on this elderly man.","He could easily save hundreds of millions of the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ regular lifeforms.","Lin Yuan was willing to do so.","Firstly, once he saved them, they would be able to provide him with an endless stream of faith power. Secondly, it also related to his innate personality and character.","Summer relayed what she had sensed to Lin Yuan.","From what Summer found, Lin Yuan learned that the elderly man had only just reached the spirit fire level, putting him on the same level as Lin Yuan.","However, Lin Yuan was pinnacle spirit fire and could easily overpower the elderly man.","Lin Yuan raised his hand, and the amber-button-shaped Source Sand landed by his feet.","Source Sand had reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom long ago. However, Lin Yuan had yet to find special metal spiritual ingredients it could absorb through Metal Consume Manifestation.","Lin Yuan checked on the Source Sand.","[Fey Name]: Source Sand (Amber Button)","[Fey Species]: Elemental/Sand","[Fey Grade]: World Emperor (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Earth","[Fey Quality]: Elementary Divine Kingdom","[Divine Kingdom Grade]: Miniature","Exclusive Skills:","[Sand Control]: Increase the contractor’s control toward the Source Sand and also reduce the spiritual power consumption when controlling the Source Sand.","[Metal Consume Manifestation]: Consume a type of metal into the Source Sand and allow the Source Sand to possess characteristics of the metal that was consumed. At the same time, the Source Sand can rapidly condense the metal within the gravel, forming a specified form (Ferromanganese/Chain Blade) (Day and Night Spirit Silver/Feathers) (Red Lotus Soft Gold/Trigone Strands).","[Gravel Spirit Acceptance]: The Source Sand can consume a type of fey or dimensional lifeform. The consumption will be determined by the lifeform’s energy and genetic model complexity.","[Overlord Sand Control]: A special type of sand will be produced. It will be the command center of the sea of sand and be able to exert strong control over the sea of sand. The special sand can control a type of metal. Once the metal has been absorbed, the entire sea of sand will be boosted by that specific metal.","[Sand Protection]: Use the metal attributes under its control to fortify the grains of sand. The grains of sand will form tight shields that will protect targets. The protection of targets can be strengthened, and the energy in the grains of sand will reflect the damage suffered by the target.","[Reverse Sand]: The sea of sand will form a reverse whirlpool. The dead or injured target in the sea of sand that pass through the whirlpool will revert the target to the condition it was in before it engaged in combat.","[Sea of Sand Tempering]: The lifeform’s body will be placed within the sea of sand. The sea of sand will dissect the target’s body before gathering and refining the energy. The refined energy can then be used.","Divine Kingdom Abilities:","[Sea of Sand Forbidden Fruit]: Its sand bloodline will be transformed into forbidden fruit in the sea of sand. When fed to earth-type lifeforms, they will be changed into sand-type and be under the Source Sand’s control.","The Source Sand had always consumed various earth-type spiritual ingredients and heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls. Currently, it consumed hundreds of earth-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls daily.","It was unlikely there was any other elemental fey in the world that could obtain the same volume of resources.","The Source Sand was an extremely special elemental-type fey. It did not come with abilities like other elemental-type lifeforms did.","In order to form a contract with it, two Willpower Runes had been needed.","However, compared to elemental-type lifeforms that came with abilities, the Source Sand’s exclusive skills were much more versatile.","In the process of its evolution to World Emperor, the Source Sand had gained three new exclusive skills and a divine kingdom ability.","Sand Protection was the Source Sand’s new elemental ability.","Being at the Divine Kingdom level, the Source Sand could absorb metal-type spiritual ingredients of extremely high levels and in enormous quantities.","Lin Yuan had not picked metal-type spiritual ingredients from the main world for the Source Sand to absorb because it was very tedious to swap out the metal-type spiritual ingredients that were absorbed through Metal Consume Manifestation. It would be better to wait until they arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds before picking the high-grade spiritual ingredients from there.","Once the Source Sand absorbed a large amount of high-grade metal-type spiritual ingredients, the metal attributes under the Source Sand’s control would be unimaginably powerful.","When the metal attributes were activated to protect targets, the protection could extend to damage caused by rolled-grade attacks.","The Source Sand’s defensive abilities were already excellent when it was protecting others.","But when the Source Sand used Sand Protection to protect Lin Yuan, the defensive abilities could even be strengthened and enhanced. It would even be able to reflect the damage inflicted on the target. Those who attacked Lin Yuan would be killed without Lin Yuan having to use his attacks.","Compared to Sand Protection, Sea of Sand Tempering had a stronger focus on function.","Reverse Sand was a timed ability. Targets in the sea of sand that died or were injured would be reverted to the same state they were in before combat.","Once the Source Sand used it and there was sufficient aid prepared for the battle, it could eliminate all casualties.","For example, the lifeforms formed through Metal Consume Manifestation that were killed could be swallowed by the sea of sand and enter the whirlpool before being reverted to their complete states. They would then be able to continue battling.","Compared to Reverse Sand, the effects of Sea of Sand Tempering were not bad at all.","Sea of Sand Tempering gave Lin Yuan an extremely good method of dealing with corpses.","The Source Sand would dissect the energy of the corpses.","The energy in corpses was related to the type of energy controlled by the corpse. It could be elemental energy, spirit qi, or death aura.","Lin Yuan had no lack of such energy.","However, World Emperor/Divine Kingdom lifeforms that were dissected and refined would produce a large amount of faith power.","Once the faith power was refined, the Source Sand could either absorb the faith power itself or give it to Lin Yuan to use.","This would be unrelated to the Source Sand’s divine kingdom ability. Sea of Sand Forbidden Fruit transformed earth-type lifeforms into sand-type lifeforms, which would still supply faith power to the Source Sand.","Sea of Sand Forbidden Fruit was considered a production-type divine kingdom ability, the most valuable type. However, its actual value was not extremely high.","In Lin Yuan’s arsenal, this divine kingdom ability was only considered mid-range. He felt that it was less valuable than Sea of Sand Tempering.","Lin Yuan knew that he had this impression because his standards were rising.","After being summoned by Lin Yuan, the Source Sand did not immediately sink underground and begin creating sand like it usually did.","The Source Sand currently had the intelligence of an adult and could communicate on a normal level.","However, the Source Sand did not like to speak much and was rather closed off. Despite having the appearance of a fresh and beautiful girl, it had the personality of a dignified and haughty gentleman.","Since Lin Yuan had not given the Source Sand any new metal-type spiritual ingredients to absorb, his wings were still made of the Day and Night Spirit Silver.","Lin Yuan injected energy into his wings, and they immediately turned pure white. The influence from the spirit qi caused the wings to glow.","Lin Yuan rose into the sky and began flying toward the statue.","Lin Yuan was wearing a moon-white robe. He resembled a godly being when paired with the 12 flapping wings on his back.","Lin Yuan did not retract his aura. Hence, all the villagers and the elderly man on the ground noticed his presence.","A panicked expression appeared on the elderly man’s face when he saw Lin Yuan.","He had been in this village for a long time and oversaw everything within it. However, he was not as uncultured as the rest of the villagers.","Every once in a while, the elderly man would offer some of the faith power stored within the sculpture to that Lord.","That Lord’s aura caused the elderly man’s knees to buckle. However, this young man with six pairs of white wings did not give the elderly man that same feeling. This meant that this young man was much weaker than that Lord. Nonetheless, the elderly man knew that he was still no match for this young man.","After a momentary shock, the elderly man calmed down.","With his position, the elderly man could not appear weak in front of the lifeforms from which he was harvesting faith. Once he came off as weak, his image of being infallible would crumble, and the amount of faith they supplied to the sculpture would undoubtedly fall.","Recently, the Lord had been displeased with the amount of faith power he had been receiving. He had reproached the elderly man for offering a decreasing amount of faith power.","If the elderly man continued to supply such a low amount of faith power, he was at high risk of being swapped out.","The elderly man enjoyed the power he wielded in the village. Thus, he would raise the quantity of faith power even if it meant utilizing radical methods. After all, the Lord had never been bothered by the purity of the faith power.","Hence, despite knowing that Lin Yuan was stronger than him, the elderly man still rose to the sky and walked toward Lin Yuan before saying sternly, “I do not know where you come from, but this village is under the protection of the Quiet Rain Evil Crows.","“The Quiet Rain Evil Crows have more than one Divine Kingdom member! You better think your actions through before enacting them!”","The elderly man spoke sternly to preserve his pride. However, he was only brave enough to threaten Lin Yuan but would not actually employ force to chase Lin Yuan away.","The elderly man’s source of support was the lifeform represented on the sculpture.","If Lin Yuan tried to kill him, the sculpture would be triggered instantly, and Lin Yuan would find himself face to face with the Quiet Rain Evil Crows’ Divine Kingdom experts.","In a small village like this, there was nothing that could catch the eye of this 12-winged expert. There were plenty of villages like this in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow when he heard this.","He was unbothered by the elderly man’s threat.","He had many Divine Kingdom lifeforms under him as well as four individuals who were above the Divine Kingdom level. The Quiet Rain Evil Crows were considered a small species.","Lin Yuan checked on the living conditions of the lifeforms living in the village.","After an extended period of servitude without proper nourishment, the lifeforms’ eyes were cloudy, and their skin yellow.","Lin Yuan had not expected food to also be a scarce resource that needed to be fought for in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","But after thinking about it, Lin Yuan understood why this was.","As Lin Yuan’s power grew, his ingestion of energy also increased. Hence, the quality of his food also improved.","The low-level resources in the Sky Beyond the Clouds could fill one’s stomach but could not provide the energy one needed.","Lin Yuan felt that the three escapees had had a better quality of life than these villagers.","Lin Yuan laughed coldly. “The Quiet Rain Evil Crows instructed you to absorb faith power using the sculpture made of storage stone. That is despicable behavior. The Quiet Rain Evil Crow experts have yet to show up, but your actions of forcing these living lifeforms to give their faith to a sculpture are incorrigible!”","Once Lin Yuan was done speaking, he waved his hand, and the Perfect Touch Wisteria appeared in front of him.","Three vines trapped the elderly man in midair.","Green Vine was the first of Lin Yuan’s feys to reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. Restraining a spirit fire lifeform was like taking candy from a baby.","When Lin Yuan summoned the lifeform that was even more powerful than himself with a wave of his hand, the elderly man realized that Lin Yuan was far from weak.","The elderly man had come across spirit contractors in the past. There was a spirit contractor among the Quiet Rain Evil Crows.","However, this was the first time the elderly man was seeing a spirit contractor who could contract a lifeform that was stronger than he was!","The aura of this girl who could control vines was similar to that of the Quiet Rain Evil Crow with whom he was in contact.","It was no wonder that his intimidation attempt had been ineffective. It turned out that this young man could not care less about the Quiet Rain Evil Crows!","The lifeforms who had been waiting to continue supplying their faith to the sculpture looked excited when they saw all that had just unfolded.","However, the older lifeforms in the village had terrified expressions.","They had experienced similar scenarios in the past.","It was likely that ownership of the village would be changing hands today!","Still, having a different owner was not always a good thing!"]},{"number":2822,"title":"Chapter 2822 North of the Lonely River!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2822 North of the Lonely River!","Each time the village leader changed, the village would have to change its faith.","In a village of this size and level, no bigshot would truly be willing to guide and enact change in the village. They would be more likely to do what was happening now, which was to send their subordinates to forcefully collect faith.","The older individuals had heard that a village like this, comprising hundreds of millions of lifeforms, was traded around like objects.","If a lifeform wanted to supply faith power to a sculpture, it would need to continuously lie to itself to change its mindset and self-hypnotize. Otherwise, the faith power would never be generated!","How could anyone naturally have faith in a sculpture?","The elderly man had never given any explanation of the lifeform that the sculpture represented. All he did was address this sculpture using various terms for gods and celestial beings.","They could only hope that once there was a change in the village’s ownership, their lives would become less agonizing. It was torturous to have their food so strictly restricted!","The villagers who did not provide sufficient faith would have to suffer violent punishment from the elderly man, while those who were able to provide sufficient faith would have their supply of food cut down. Only the villagers who were able to provide more faith power than was expected of them would not have their supply of food reduced and receive meager rewards.","This elderly man was currently a beginner spirit fire expert and was much weaker than Lin Yuan.","However, he was slightly stronger than Genius.","If Lin Yuan instructed Genius to use Connected Tails on the elderly man and the elderly man put up resistance, Genius would be harmed.","Lin Yuan would never want to see Genius harmed!","Lin Yuan lifted his hand, and the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom released a large amount of spores. The spores entered the elderly man’s body, and Lin Yuan shot a look at Green Vine.","Green Vine’s vines formed a treehouse in the sky, where Lin Yuan interrogated the elderly man.","First, he wanted to know the exact coordinates of his place. Next, he also wanted to learn about the Quiet Rain Evil Crows. This would allow him to make preparations in advance if they possessed a certain level of power.","The elderly man had begun a new round of offerings today. He had instructed the villagers to begin worshiping the stone statue.","The elderly man had not been collecting faith power for long, but the faith power in the storage stones had been less than expected.","The World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Quiet Rain Evil Crow would be able to sense this and eventually come to investigate the situation.","Lin Yuan did not need to act personally to obtain information from this elderly man.","Lin Yuan released the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom in human form, and it demonstrated professional interrogation techniques.","The elderly man spilled all the information that he possessed.","They were currently located in an area known as North of the Lonely River.","This was the most remote region of the East Universe. However, this did not mean that this area was barren. It was actually the opposite, as North of the Lonely River was filled with resources.","No faction had crossed the Lonely River and broken ground on North of the Lonely River because there were many powerful aquatic species residing in the Lonely River.","These aquatic species not only occupied the waters of the Lonely River but the air above it as well.","They only respected a faction like Honor Absent Palace, who were the rulers of the East Universe.","A few of the experts from the species living in the Lonely River were also members of the Honor Absent Parliament.","Honor Absent Palace had thought of venturing into North of the Lonely River, but it would require them to cross the Lonely River.","The species living in the Lonely River might not obstruct the people from Honor Absent Palace, but they would definitely charge a high fee for each crossing of the Lonely River.","In the end, the costs exceeded the potential benefits. Hence, Honor Absent Palace lost interest in developing North of the Lonely River.","Since no one had begun harvesting the resources from North of the Lonely River, the area was extremely impoverished.","The elderly man had accidentally ended up joining the Quiet Rain Evil Crows a few thousand years ago. He was not a true member and did not have a good grasp of the Quiet Rain Evil Crows’ circumstances.","All he knew was that the two Quiet Rain Evil Crows he usually interacted with had reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. It was a level that he could only dream of reaching.","Once Lin Yuan gleaned the information he wanted, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom looked at him. It was clear that it wanted to know what Lin Yuan wanted to do with this elderly man.","The Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom had been molded by Lin Yuan. He could not say that it was kind, but it had an objectively decent character.","At that moment, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom was filled with killing intent toward the elderly man. He had misused his power for profit and committed too many wicked acts.","Lin Yuan sighed and nodded at the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom.","It was true that the elderly man deserved to die. However, killing the elderly man would not be able to save all the lifeforms that had died at his hand over the years. The number of lifeforms that had been killed for failing to provide sufficient faith power was greater than the current population of the village!","Once it received Lin Yuan’s signal, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom used Thought-Separating Flames to burn the elderly man to ashes.","Lin Yuan left the treehouse that Green Vine created out of its vines.","The lifeforms in the village dared not move about carelessly and remained timidly rooted to the spot.","Lin Yuan was aware of how the elderly man maintained order in the village and knew that the villagers were all starving and undernourished.","Lin Yuan summoned five of the Deposit Vegetable Pods in human form. They then began distributing the Soldier Ration Radish’s leaves and vines.","The Soldier Ration Radish was a lifeform that Chef Supreme had accidentally cultivated. When lifeforms from the main world consumed them, a small quantity would be enough to fill their stomachs.","The same went for the lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","When Lin Yuan summoned Green Vine, the villagers realized that he was a spirit contractor.","Normally, spirit contractors did not contract many entities, as it required resources to nurture each contracted entity. If they contracted too many, they would be overstrained.","The villagers also saw the five Deposit Vegetable Pods Lin Yuan summoned as entities he had contracted.","The Deposit Vegetable Pods continued to distribute the Soldier Ration Radishes and urged the villagers to consume as much as they wanted.","The Deposit Vegetable Pods had only just been summoned by Lin Yuan and could not speak in the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ language. However, they could use signing and gesturing to convey their meaning.","The villagers had never eaten anything like the Soldier Ration Radish. But they were so hungry that it was difficult for them to stay on guard. Under the stress of starvation, the villagers who had been failing to supply sufficient faith power to the sculpture stuffed the Soldier Ration Radish’s leaves into their mouths.","With the first chew of the Soldier Ration Radish, the villagers felt vitality flowing through their bodies. It did not take long for them to feel full.","This feeling of fullness took the villagers by astonishment. This was an extremely precious feeling to them. They had almost forgotten the last time they felt this way.","The villagers who had consumed and were experiencing the benefits of the Soldier Ration Radish looked up at the 12-winged Lin Yuan. They instinctively felt reliant on him.","In a place like the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the weak lifeforms lived arduous lives akin to that of insects.","But weak lifeforms also had a way of pursuing survival. This was done by seeking the protection of stronger experts. The villagers now saw Lin Yuan as a source of protection.","The instant these villagers placed their hope in Lin Yuan, he could distinctly sense that many weak dots of light had appeared in his fountain of faith. These dots of light represented the lifeforms that were present.","It was just as Summer had said. Saving them was the best way of obtaining faith power!","However, generating the glowing dots of faith power was vastly different from receiving a constant stream of faith power.","In order to receive a constant stream of faith power from these targets, he would have to maintain the protection he offered them.","But it would take a large amount of resources to deepen their faith in him and raise their happiness levels.","This was why so many experts in the Sky Beyond the Clouds chose not to protect the weaker lifeforms and enable them to become a stable supply of high-quality faith power despite being clearly capable of doing so.","Lin Yuan had been thinking about one thing ever since he heard all about North of the Lonely River from the elderly man. He contemplated whether this was the place to develop his faction.","Once he developed his faction to a certain extent, he would then be able to cross the Lonely River and extend his enterprise to other areas.","Lin Yuan was never the type to be reckless. He intended to wait for Fan Lou to arrive so he could ask him about the allocation of resources in North of the Lonely River. It would be best if he could obtain the resource allocation plan for North of the Lonely River.","It would not be too late for Lin Yuan to make his decision after he gained an understanding of the resource allocation there!","Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter had been watching over Lin Yuan from the shadows.","The four of them were not surprised when they saw Lin Yuan put a clean end to the elderly man’s life.","Lin Yuan was in a constant state of rapid growth. The four of them had been with Lin Yuan all these years, and at each milestone, they could not help but be amazed at his growth.","Once the starving villagers had their fill of the Soldier Ration Radish, those who had been able to supply above-average quantities of faith power to the sculpture and had not had their food allowance reduced got their first taste of the Soldier Ration Radish.","No one was exempt from group mentality, especially when benefits were involved.","Once Lin Yuan saw that almost all the villagers had consumed the Soldier Ration Radish, he said in a low voice, “Rather than supplying your faith to a sculpture from an unknown source, why don’t you decide for yourselves who you give your faith to?","“The entire village has been consuming the sour fruits growing outside the village as well as wild beasts that you catch with traps. The number of beasts you’ll be able to catch varies day by day. It’s impossible that all of you will get to eat meat every day.","“However, the sour fruits grow in large quantities. I will send people to harvest the sour fruits later. The sour fruits will make up most of your daily diet, while the beast meat will be distributed fairly. If any of you has a larger appetite and needs more to feel full, you can submit a request for the Soldier Ration Radishes!”","Lin Yuan was not using the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ lingua franca.","Since the three escapees had not been able to understand this language, it was unlikely that these villagers would be different.","The best way to become closer to these villagers would be to use the language they were familiar with.","Lin Yuan was not making empty promises when he told the villagers to decide for themselves to whom they gave their faith.","Lin Yuan did not dictate that they offer their faith to him.","Sky City had many main members. Regardless of whom the villagers offered their faith to, they would be able to strengthen Sky City’s overall power.","In the main world, Sky City only followed the most excellent path of development.","Given the current circumstances, they would have to gather lifeforms in large quantities to develop Sky City in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. They would simultaneously protect these lifeforms while receiving faith power from them.","Thus, Sky City needed to build a massive faction that was akin to a kingdom in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. In this kingdom, Sky City’s main members would be able to steadily increase their strength.","It went without saying that this was just an idea Lin Yuan had. He would have to have a discussion with the Moon Empress, Liu Jie, Wen Yu, and the rest before he decided whether he would put this idea into action.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan had been rulers of federations in the main world. They would be of great help to Lin Yuan when it came to managing an enormous kingdom!","Lin Yuan’s words caused disbelief to spread across the villagers’ faces.","But it did not take long before the villagers started to whoop loudly with joy.","Lin Yuan could sense that the glowing dots of faith in the fountain of faith were now much brighter.","Winter moved over to Lin Yuan’s side and said, “Young Master, I have contacted Fan Lou and informed him of our location. He said that he will find the opportunity to slip away from his current master and meet up with you!”","Winter had expressed his displeasure toward Fan Lou.","In Winter’s eyes, Fan Lou was no different from an ant. Yet, someone like him dared to make Lin wait. This was over the line!","However, Lin Yuan did not find anything wrong with this.","After meeting with Lin Yuan, Fan Lou would have to go back to his master. It was crucial for him to maintain a positive relationship with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf, a member of the Honor Absent Parliament, to fulfill the tasks assigned by Lin Yuan. Additionally, he had to leverage his position as the captain of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team to safeguard the main world.","“Winter, we’re not in a rush. We can wait here for Fan Lou. There should be many other similar villagers around the area. Go and send word to Wen Yu, Liu Jie, Su Yiren, Luo Lan, and the rest. They have reached the Divine Kingdom level, and it’s unlikely that anything in this area will be able to pose a threat to them. Tell them to lead a team of white-clothed followers each to save the villagers and collect as much faith as possible.”","Winter bowed to Lin Yuan before relaying Lin Yuan’s message.","Winter knew that Lin Yuan wanted to give the people around him the opportunity to collect faith power.","If Lin Yuan was greedier, he could collect all the faith power for himself and increase his own power first."]},{"number":2823,"title":"Chapter 2823 The Bloodians’ Plan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2823 The Bloodians’ Plan!","After spending considerable time by Lin Yuan’s side, Winter knew that Lin Yuan was not a greedy person.","As the leader of a faction, Lin Yuan would prioritize his own power. However, unlike other faction leaders, Lin Yuan would also consider other members apart from prioritizing his own power.","It was a blessing to be under such a ruler as one would not have to worry about being tripped by obstacles. There would also be plenty of opportunities available!","Every person under Lin Yuan, including Wen Yu and Liu Jie, was only able to accomplish their current achievements because they had been nurtured by Lin Yuan. Without his nurturing, they would never have been able to leave the main world to come to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Once they received Lin Yuan’s instruction, Wen Yu, Liu Jie, Su Yiren, Luo Lan, Bei Xu, Listen, Qin Yu, and the rest of Sky City’s members who had reached the Divine Kingdom level all led teams and headed out.","This was a precious chance for all of them.","They all knew the importance of faith power in increasing their strength. Faith power was a requirement for their strength enhancement.","On the one hand, all of them cherished this opportunity from Lin Yuan. On the other hand, this was an event that would require them to compete among themselves.","They needed to enable a lifeform to generate faith before finding a way to sustain the supply of faith power.","Hence, every member of Sky City picked their team of white-clothed followers and started to do their best in this task.","Lin Yuan liked to facilitate such positive competition within Sky City because it would spur their fighting spirits.","All of them were of similar ages and held high positions in Sky City.","They needed to develop together to raise the overall power of Sky City’s main members.","Lin Yuan did not only advocate for combat power. The members’ mindsets and thought processes were equally important.","Sky City’s main members, picked by Lin Yuan, were all extremely intelligent.","...","While Liu Jie, Wen Yu, and the rest were out carrying out their task, Fan Lou, enjoying the benefits of his position among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, had a stunned expression on his face.","Fan Lou had been waiting for Lin Yuan to summon him, but he was also afraid of being summoned by Lin Yuan. His fear was that being summoned by Lin Yuan would lead to unbearable changes that harmed his future development.","If Lin Yuan told him to leave the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and Feng Qing, he would be in no position to say no.","Fan Lou was very happy with his current life. With his position, he had people pandering to him wherever he went.","All of them were trying to benefit from his power and influence. However, only those who had truly experienced the benefits of being bootlicked would understand the feeling.","Nonetheless, Fan Lou adored this feeling!","If Fan Lou could decide for himself, he would prefer to break free from Lin Yuan and continue enjoying such a life by Feng Qing’s side!","But despite thinking this way, Fan Lou knew it was impossible.","He was only able to receive recognition from Feng Qing because of Lin Yuan. If Lin Yuan had not made those arrangements and enabled him to receive the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ protection, he would have been killed by Feng Qing long ago!","Feng Qing was very nice to those who were close to him, but he was obsessive and paranoid.","Fan Lou knew how arrogant Feng Qing was.","Kong Huan’s arrogance emerged through her control over her subordinates. However, most of Feng Qing’s arrogance came from his own obsessive confidence.","It would be understandable if Feng Qing’s obsessive arrogance came from his own outstanding power. But in actuality, it came from the Bloodians’ support of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","The Bloodians had their motives for supporting the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Over the years, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had also supplied a fair share of resources to the Bloodians.","In exchange, the Bloodians supported the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves when it came to key matters.","Given that Feng Qing’s overwhelming confidence came from having the protection of a stronger species rather than his power, Fan Lou felt that Feng Qing’s confidence was a mirage.","It was because Feng Qing was not a traditional expert that he needed to be affirmed.","This made it easier for Fan Lou to curry favor with and become more valuable to Feng Qing.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves next to Fan Lou noticed that he was acting strangely.","Luckily, the meeting was over, and Fan Lou came up with an excuse before leaving the meeting room.","He went to an empty space and took out the round white jade.","North of the Lonely River was extremely far from Fan Lou’s current location.","It was not impossible for him to travel there, but he would have to come up with a legitimate reason to do so.","Feng Xuan already resented him for stealing Feng Qing’s favor, so Fan Lou did not want to give him any reason to trip him up.","Luckily, Lin Yuan needed him to keep his position as the captain of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team. He could use this excuse to ask Lin Yuan to give him some time.","Fan Lou was not trying to negotiate with Lin Yuan but doing his best to fulfill Lin Yuan’s task.","Fan Lou was very smart and knew that Lin Yuan cared more about his position as the captain of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team than keeping him by Feng Qing’s side.","He needed to protect the base! As long as he could protect Lin Yuan’s base, the latter would not toss him aside.","Feng Qing thought back to how Feng Qing had just mentioned wanting to trade with the Dark Pufferfish for a potion that could deter the mermaids.","Once the Dark Pufferfish contaminated a body of water with their venom, the mermaids would no longer be able to use their bloodlines to control that body of water.","The Bloodians did not want their movements to be tracked by the mermaids. Hence, they asked the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves to help them with this. There was no question that the Bloodians wanted to accomplish this matter successfully.","However, none of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were willing to make such a long-distance trip. In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, going on a long-distance trip put one at risk of being targeted or falling into danger.","Moreover, the Dark Pufferfish were very overbearing. They would have to spend some resources to trade with them.","At first, Fan Lou had also been unwilling to participate in this matter. He had a cushy life. Only those with something wrong with their brains would decide to leave such a life for a desolate place like the Lonely River. If he was away from Feng Qing for too long, it would also give Feng Xuan the chance to take his space!","But now, Fan Lou felt he could agree to this matter that no one else wanted to touch. He could use the excuse of wanting to share the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ burden.","Lin Yuan had ordered him to head to the Lonely River. This was something he absolutely needed to do.","It would be better if he could also use this method to improve Feng Qing’s impression of him!","He would not only help Feng Qing but the Bloodians as well. This would not only elevate his position in Feng Qing’s eyes but would also give him the opportunity to receive rewards from the Bloodians!","Most importantly, Fan Lou wanted to obtain the leadership position of the team that would be heading to the Lonely River.","Once he obtained the leadership position, it would be easy for him to meet up with Lin Yuan!","If Feng Qing arranged for a Chaos Wind Demon Wolf to lead the trip, he would have to interact with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf if he wanted to step away from the team.","If his request to leave was rejected, he would have wasted Lin Yuan’s time!","After making his decision, Fan Lou quickly made his way to Feng Qing’s bedchamber.","Given Fan Lou’s position, he did not need to send word in advance to enter Feng Qing’s bedchamber.","Not even Feng Xuan had been afforded such generosity at the height of his favor as Feng Qing’s aide.","When Fan Lou entered Feng Qing’s bedchamber, he saw Feng Qing conversing with Feng Xuan with a grave expression on his face.","Fan Lou heard Feng Qing and Feng Xuan speaking about the matter of helping the Bloodians to head to the Lonely River to trade with the Dark Pufferfish.","Normally, Feng Qing had a lighthearted expression and a small smile on his lips. He only frowned when he was being rebuked or if someone turned him down.","It seemed that Feng Qing wanted Feng Xuan to head to the Lonely River, but the latter was unwilling to do so!","Fan Lou could understand where Feng Xuan was coming from.","Feng Xuan had a decent background and was considered a direct Chaos Wind Demon Wolf descendant. After catching Feng Qing’s eye, his position among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves skyrocketed.","Although he did not receive as much favor from Feng Qing as before, his life was still comfortable.","As an outsider, Fan Lou could not be considered Feng Xuan’s equal.","Fan Lou thought, This is my chance. If I agree to this operation, it will come off as my helping Feng Qing out of a sticky situation.","Currently, Feng Qing needed someone he trusted to take on this matter.","Fan Lou could tell that Feng Qing trusted him. When Feng Qing saw Fan Lou walking in, he waved at him to gesture at him to come nearer. Feng Qing saw Fan Lou as someone who could bring him luck. Hence, he did not want to let Fan Lou leave his side.","Alas, the only other person he could trust and who was competent enough to accomplish this matter was Fan Lou.","Feng Qing believed that Fan Lou was also unwilling to take on this task. There were no upsides to this task, only risks.","Fan Lou had done a good job of being his assistant and managed everything well.","Feng Qing felt affection for Fan Lou.","However, to Feng Qing, bloodline was more important than feelings.","If Feng Xuan was unwilling and he forced Feng Xuan to go, it would stir up debate within the species.","Feng Qing did not want his reputation among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves to be affected.","Before Feng Qing could speak, Fan Lou beat him to the punch and said, “Lord Feng Qing, based on what you just said, you haven’t decided on who to send on the Lonely River matter. If you don’t mind, I am willing to make the trip for you! I will definitely do a good job for your sake!”","Fan Lou spoke gallantly, and passion shone in his eyes. He looked fully as though he genuinely wanted to alleviate Feng Qing’s troubles.","With this juxtaposition, Feng Qing felt disappointed in Feng Xuan.","Feng Qing was happy that Fan Lou wanted to share his burdens.","Unless it was absolutely necessary, Feng Qing would keep Fan Lou with him.","However, Feng Qing had no choice but to think about the Bloodians. They had given this task to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves some time ago. If they did not send someone soon, the Bloodians would definitely become displeased.","“Fan Lou, since you’ve taken the initiative, you can go on this trip! Don’t worry. I will definitely send sufficient support to ensure your safety.","“I will also assign a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Abyssal Beast for you to use for transportation. This will allow you to return as soon as possible! If you have any other requests, just let me know!”","Fan Lou was delighted.","Now that he had helped Feng Qing with a pressing issue, he had met his goal and would immediately receive benefits from Feng Qing.","Fan Lou did not have any resource needs. Even if he did, he would not tell Feng Qing about them, as it would cause him to come across as manipulative and scheming after those resources.","Feng Qing came across as magnanimous but was actually extremely selfish.","Lin Yuan wanted to see Fan Lou to learn more about North of the Lonely River. He would have to provide as many details as possible.","With this thought, Fan Lou said, “Lord Feng Qing, I am more than happy to work for you. How could I ever have other requests? However, I am unfamiliar with the Lonely River. Do you happen to have a map of the north area? I would like to search the north area for resources for you once I’m done trading with the Dark Pufferfish!”","Feng Xuan’s eyes had been flaring with rage ever since Fan Lou entered. But he had failed to catch an error in Fan Lou’s words. Fan Lou’s actions were also impeccable.","However, Feng Xuan did not understand why Fan Lou would put his life in danger for this task. Was he really not after any benefits from Feng Qing?","If Fan Lou made a request at this moment, Feng Qing would definitely agree.","Feng Xuan believed that if he were in Fan Lou’s shoes, he would definitely seize the opportunity to obtain more benefits for himself.","Fan Lou asked for the map and said that he wanted to gather more resources from North of the Lonely River for Feng Qing. This was essentially increasing his own workload.","Could it be that Fan Lou truly admired Feng Qing and had become loyal to him?","If that were the case, there would be no need for Feng Xuan to continue competing with Fan Lou in the future.","Feng Xuan did not want to put himself second when he worked for Feng Qing. Rather than waiting for Feng Qing to hand resources to him, it would be better for him to work hard and earn his own resources.","Feng Xuan felt defeated.","Feng Qing patted Fan Lou’s shoulder forcefully. “I don’t have a map of the Lonely River’s surroundings, but I can ask for one from the Bloodians.","“Make sure to stay safe during this operation. Don’t think too much about the resources. All you need to do is trade with the Dark Pufferfish for the venom that the Bloodians need.","“Once you’re back, I’ll personally inject the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf essence blood into your body so that your bloodline will be able to evolve to that of a Chaos Wind Demon Wolf!”"]},{"number":2824,"title":"Chapter 2824 Meeting with Fan Lou!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2824 Meeting with Fan Lou!","If Fan Lou had obtained this promise from Feng Qing before joining Lin Yuan, he would have definitely been thrilled.","In the past, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf bloodline was the strongest that Fan Lou had ever come into contact with. However, now that he had witnessed the resources and power that Lin Yuan possessed, Fan Lou no longer held the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf bloodline in such high regard.","Despite the thoughts running through Fan Lou’s mind, he still vocalized his gratitude. “Lord Feng Qing, thank you for rewarding me by enabling my ordinary bloodline to evolve. Does this mean that once you inject the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf bloodline into my body, I will henceforth be considered a Chaos Wind Demon Wolf?”","Fan Lou knew when to be humble and when to pander to Feng Qing.","Feng Qing cared a lot about his own bloodline.","If he rejected the bloodline Feng Qing was offering as a reward, it would be seen as him looking down on the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, immediately causing Feng Qing to fly into a rage.","He needed to show his excitement and use his flattery skills to make Feng Qing happier.","Feng Qing had promised that despite the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves not having a map of the area near the Lonely River, he would ask for one from the Bloodians.","The Bloodians were a powerful faction that had set their sights on the Lonely River in the past, so they definitely had a map!","Fan Lou would be able to prove his worth to Lin Yuan better with that map.","Fan Lou was certain of his goal for his operation. All he needed to do was obtain the venom from the Dark Pufferfish.","The Dark Pufferfish were the ruling species of the Lonely River. They did not even have to be courteous to the Bloodians.","It went without saying they did not have to give someone as trivial as him the time of day.","However, Fan Lou was not concerned that he would not be able to accomplish the task.","All he needed to do was tell Lin Yuan what he needed, and Lin Yuan would definitely help him to resolve the issue!","Feng Qing was very happy with Fan Lou’s response.","When he was in need of someone, Fan Lou stepped up. There was no better subordinate than this!","Moreover, Fan Lou also had exceptional abilities and always did his best in the tasks he was given.","“The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ warriors will be working with the Bloodians in a joint operation soon. But for your sake, I will assign the Forbidden Wolf Team, who are currently training outside, to protect you.","“I will also give you authority among the Light Wind Wolves. You can pick the Light Wind Wolf experts you want to go with you.”","Fan Lou and Feng Xuan looked shocked when they heard what Feng Qing said.","Fan Lou never expected Feng Qing to assign the Forbidden Wolf Team to him!","There were a total of 16 members in the Forbidden Wolf Team. It was said that every one of them had World Emperor/Divine Kingdom power and had the authentic Chaos Wind Demon Wolf bloodline. All of them had also received a portion of the Moon-Worshiping Wolf legacy.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had departed from the Moon-Worshiping Wolves and did not possess much of their legacy.","Only the true core members could receive the legacy!","If everything went well with this operation, it seemed that Feng Qing would truly promote and support him!","Once his shock passed, Feng Xuan looked deeply into Fan Lou’s eyes.","Could it be that this piece of trash was going to enter the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ inner circle?","Normally, only the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves with the authentic bloodline could be part of the inner circle.","However, it was not impossible for Fan Lou to become part of the inner circle if he had Feng Qing’s support.","With this thought, Feng Xuan suddenly felt that he had been too reckless trying to compete with Fan Lou all this time.","Feng Qing’s mood improved tremendously, but he did not keep Fan Lou back for long.","Before Fan Lou left, Feng Qing gave him numerous resources and a piece of fertile land that he could manage as he saw fit.","Fan Lou had received many benefits, but Feng Xuan had not received anything.","Fan Lou sensed that Feng Xuan had something on his mind, and based on Feng Xuan’s personality, he anticipated another argument. However, Fan Lou was not in the mood for it at all.","The risks he would have to undertake on this trip to the Lonely River would not be removed just by having the Forbidden Wolf Team and the Light Wind Wolf experts by his side.","The star pirates that traversed the four universes all possessed fearsome strength. Even a large species like the Bloodians would have to send out their strongest experts to avoid casualties.","Fan Lou used to work under Kong Huan.","The Alluring Foxes used to be much more formidable. They had deteriorated so severely because they had encountered a notorious stat pirate group while traveling in the outskirts. This encounter had cost them six Divine Kingdom experts.","If the Alluring Foxes had not suffered such a blow, the Honor Absent Parliament member’s role would not have gone to Kong Huan.","Given that he could not even guarantee his own survival, Fan Lou did not want to squabble with a petty character like Feng Xuan.","He had Lin Yuan’s support. As long as he did a good job on the tasks Lin Yuan gave him, his future development would be limitless!","Just as Fan Lou was about to visit the Light Wind Wolves to recruit their World Emperor/Divine Kingdom experts to accompany him on the journey to the Lonely River, Feng Xuan blocked his way.","Feng Xuan said seriously, “Fan Lou, I would like to congratulate you in advance on joining the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and becoming a pure-blooded Chaos Wind Demon Wolf. If Lord Feng Qing is willing to help you, your bloodline will definitely be able to evolve successfully!”","Fan Lou raised an eyebrow but did not respond. He looked at Feng Xuan in this manner to signal to him to continue speaking.","Fan Lou already knew that Feng Xuan had said this because he knew that he was about to become Feng Qing’s true right-hand man and wanted to ameliorate their relationship. Hence, he was using this opportunity to mend the bridge between them and flatter him.","Fan Lou had also done similar actions in the past.","When one lacked power and a solid foundation, one did not have the luxury of acting recklessly. Every step one took had to be calculated.","Ever since Fan Lou joined Lin Yuan, he stopped seeing Feng Xuan as his enemy—he did not think Feng Xuan deserved to be his rival.","Fan Lou never intentionally made things difficult for Feng Xuan.","Rather than relying on Feng Qing’s rewards and trying to knock down a direct Chaos Wind Demon Wolf descendant, it would be better for him to use his chance to improve his relationship with Feng Qing.","However, he would not be the one to extend the olive branch. It had to be initiated by Feng Xuan because Fan Lou needed to maintain the upper hand over him in the future.","When Feng Xuan saw that Fan Lou had not reciprocated his gesture, he felt slighted.","Luckily, Fan Lou’s expression was not one of scorn.","Feng Xuan gnashed his teeth and continued. “Fan Lou, we used to be rivals. Now, you have emerged victorious over me. I won’t be competing with you in the future. I think that we have developed an understanding after working together for so long.","“Let’s stop being rivals. We are more suited to collaborating as allies! I will still be staying by Lord Feng Qing’s side. Our collaboration will also be beneficial to you.”","Feng Xuan thought that Fan Lou would put him on the spot once he was done speaking.","Contrary to his expectations, Fan Lou reached out his hand. “In the beginning, you were the one who recommended me and gave me the chance to join Lord Feng Qing. I will never forget that!","“Rather than saying that we’ll be collaborating, let’s become friends instead. If this matter goes well, I will also become a Chaos Wind Demon Wolf. If it doesn’t go well, I won’t be able to continue serving Lord Feng Qing. You will have to serve him in my place!","“I have other matters to attend to, so I can’t stay here any longer to chat. I will ask you out for a drink once I’m back from the Lonely River!”","Fan Lou’s words caused Feng Xuan’s expression to falter.","Once Fan Lou was out of Feng Xuan’s line of vision, all the sincerity vanished from Fan Lou’s eyes.","Fan Lou did not know if Feng Xuan was familiar with Feng Qing’s habits. He knew that Feng Qing had a habit of monitoring his subordinates’ every move.","Normally, Fan Lou would not be able to sense Feng Qing watching him. But the jade that Winter had given him had the ability to detect it.","Based on the jade’s reaction, Feng Qing was currently listening in on their exchange. Hence, he did not mind using this opportunity to properly show off in front of Feng Qing.","...","When Fan Lou arrived at the Light Wind Wolves’ headquarters, it was like he had returned home.","He then picked the four World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Light Wind Wolves.","All he needed to do was wait for the Forbidden Wolf Team to arrive and for Feng Qing to pass him the map of the area surrounding the Lonely River.","Fan Lou would soon be ready to set off.","...","Lin Yuan was currently in a remote area known as the Lonely River.","Sky City’s main members had already saved almost 240 villages.","Liu Jie was the fastest among them. He used the army of insects to surround each village before saving the villagers. This method caused the proportion of faith power he received to be very small.","However, Liu Jie was very stable and calm. After all, every lifeform in the village would have to give up their faith. Even if they did not give it to him, it made no difference, even if they gave it to other members of Sky City.","Wen Yu was the slowest among them, but the proportion of faith power she received was the largest. It was even larger than the proportion that Lin Yuan received!","As such, Lin Yuan discovered a new talent that Wen Yu had.","The villagers from the various villages could not gather together quickly. Otherwise, chaos would ensue!","Once Lin Yuan confirmed the location of this area, it would make it easier for him to gather the villagers in the area.","At that point, he could send people to govern the villages!","Lin Yuan looked at Su Yiren’s report before telling her with a smile, “Yiren, you don’t have to be humble when it comes to governing federations. You have always done better than Wen Yu in this regard.","“You and Luo Lan also have a perfect partnership when it comes to managing federations. That is an advantage that the two of you have. I believe that you will continue to shine and grow this advantage!","“You don’t have to worry about what Wen Yu thinks. She’s not the intolerable type. It’s actually the opposite because she’s the one who suggested that you come up with this report.","“If you need any resources, just let me know! I will tell Wen Yu and Listen to deliver the resources to you immediately so they will be of use and take effect as soon as possible.”","From what Lin Yuan said, Su Yiren could sense the admiration, trust, and acknowledgment that he felt toward her.","Apart from her happiness, Su Yiren also felt the heavy weight of pressure.","The Sky Beyond the Clouds was a new environment that Su Yiren was unfamiliar with.","Sky City’s exploration of the Sky Beyond the Clouds had only just begun.","Su Yiren was worried she would make a mistake that would harm Lin Yuan’s future endeavors.","But since Lin Yuan had given her this task, she would do her best to accomplish this task.","In spite of her humility, Su Yiren knew how capable she was when it came to management.","Su Yiren was not the type to fear a challenge. The more challenging the task, the more motivated she would be to accomplish it.","Luo Lan had been longing to prove herself.","When she heard the important task that Lin Yuan had just given the two of them, Su Yiren could only imagine how happy Luo Lan would be.","Normally, she could tell Listen about any resources she needed, and he would tell Wen Yu about it so she could make a decision. Once Wen Yu gave her approval, Listen would dispense the resources immediately.","For a faction, this was an extremely quick process of obtaining resources.","Now, Lin Yuan told her to let him know if she needed any resources. This was proof of how important the task was to him.","Although Lin Yuan had said that, Su Yiren would not bother him over such a trivial matter.","Listen and Wen Yu got along swimmingly with Su Yiren and Luo Lan. She trusted that they would not shortchange her when it came to resources.","Still, if such problems truly arose, she could just tell Lin Yuan about it.","“Young Master, since you’ve assigned this task to Luo Lan and me, we will definitely do our best to manage the many villages to the best of our abilities!","“At first, managing these villages will require numerous resources to set up the base. I will ask Listen directly for the resources! If we encounter issues that we can’t come to an agreement on, I will have to bother you for an intervention!”","Su Yiren really liked interacting with Lin Yuan.","After all the time she had spent by Lin Yuan’s side, Su Yiren knew he was the busiest member of Sky City.","Wen Yu only called the shots when it came to small matters. She always sought Lin Yuan’s opinion about serious matters.","Lin Yuan also ensured that he had a handle on all of Sky City’s affairs, big or small. Even if a member of the reserve sequence met with an injustice, he would ask about it and handle the issue.","Lin Yuan’s power was not the only reason he was able to gain the respect of all of Sky City’s members. It was also because of his character and approach to handling matters.","As Su Yiren left Lin Yuan’s room and before he had the chance to relax, Winter walked in.","When no one else was around, Winter still preferred to address Lin Yuan as ‘Lord Saint’.","“Lord Saint, Fan Lou is already on his way to the Lonely River. He is on a mission for the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and will only be able to meet with you in two days!”"]},{"number":2825,"title":"Chapter 2825 The Dark Pufferfish’s Instigation!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2825 The Dark Pufferfish’s Instigation!","Winter’s expression was extremely sour during the entire conversation.","Fan Lou had already kept Lin Yuan waiting for so long, but now he wanted Lin Yuan to wait even longer.","This was despite him having already arrived at the Lonely River.","Winter did not care about Fan Lou’s task from the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. He was displeased solely because of his respect for Lin Yuan.","But with Winter’s strategic intelligence, he understood Fan Lou’s value.","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow and exclaimed, “Fan Lou sure is smart!”","Apart from resolving the issue he had and telling him which parts of the Lonely River were abundant with resources, Fan Lou also intended to obtain benefits for him.","It was clear that it would not be easy to accomplish this task and would require Fan Lou to put significant thought into it.","Since Lin Yuan could help Fan Lou with this, he was willing to do so. He would also be able to gain an understanding of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ movements by learning about their needs.","“Winter, Fan Lou should have mentioned what his task is, right?”","Winter had not intended to bring up the task. It was true that Fan Lou had mentioned the matter in his report. However, Winter did not feel telling Lin Yuan about the task was necessary.","But now that Lin Yuan had asked about it, Winter answered honestly, “Lord Saint, Fan Lou has come to this place as a representative of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves because of the Bloodians. He needs to trade for poison from a species called the Dark Pufferfish.","“The Dark Pufferfish’s unique poison is able to contaminate a body of water and affect the aquatic lifeforms’ control over water-elemental energy. Based on what I learned from Fan Lou, the Bloodians intend to use the poison to make a move on the mermaids!”","Lin Yuan’s eyes narrowed.","When he obtained the New Thearch’s Scale’s legacy in the water world, he also glimpsed the clash between the Bloodians and mermaids. It had been full of bloodshed. Such a conflict would only end once one side had been fully eliminated.","If the Dark Pufferfish’s poison was able to contaminate water and the Bloodians used it to target the mermaids, the latter were in deep trouble!","When Lin Yuan found out about this, he did not feel any compassion or intend to help the mermaids.","Lin Yuan currently had many bloodlines in his body, and the mermaid bloodline was only one of them.","If he really made a comparison, his Bloodian bloodline was just as strong as his mermaid bloodline, as he had recently been focusing on nurturing the Bloodians’ bloodline.","Dark Blue needed to take control of many mermaids to increase its power.","Lin Yuan needed to find a highly populated place with mermaids and take control of that place.","This was Lin Yuan’s first time there, and it was difficult for him to search for the mermaids.","However, the Bloodians would be able to help him with the search.","Based on the tone Winter used when he mentioned the Dark Pufferfish, they were either a species that only emerged in the recent epoch or had an insignificant presence at the time that Winter left the Sky Beyond the Clouds, so he did not know anything about them.","Fan Lou had not hidden anything from Lin Yuan and reported everything about his mission. He had made contact with the Dark Pufferfish before giving his report to Winter.","The Dark Pufferfish were exceptionally arrogant and did not think much of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, even though they had a member of the Honor Absent Parliament among them.","It was only after Fan Lou mentioned the Bloodians that the Dark Pufferfish did away with their arrogance and began communicating with him.","The Dark Pufferfish knew that the Bloodians wanted their poison.","The Bloodians had given Fan Lou the resources meant for the trade. Normally, all Fan Lou needed to do was hand over these resources.","Fan Lou had not expected the Dark Pufferfish to raise the price abruptly and to an astronomical extent.","The resources the Bloodians had provided were utterly insufficient to purchase the volume of poison they wanted. Even if Fan Lou gave all of the resources to the Dark Pufferfish, he would only be able to obtain 1/3 of the volume of poison the Bloodians had in mind.","He was there on behalf of the Bloodians, only to encounter such an issue.","The Bloodians would definitely be enraged if he returned with only 1/3 of the expected volume.","The Bloodians’ rage would be mostly directed at the Dark Pufferfish, but he would also receive some of the blowback.","The Dark Pufferfish were far too arrogant. Even if he tried to negotiate, it was unlikely they would be willing to make the trade based on the original price.","Once this matter was settled, Fan Lou’s future would be blindingly bright. But if he bungled the matter, he would not be able to survive the Bloodians’ rage. How could a puny character like him handle their wrath?","Given that Fan Lou could not handle the situation on his own, he had no choice but to turn to Lin Yuan for help.","Every member of the Forbidden Wolf Team was one of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ main members.","Due to Feng Qing’s high regard for Fan Lou, the members of the Forbidden Wolf Team were very courteous toward Fan Lou. None of them wanted to offend someone like Fan Lou, who had so much of Feng Qing’s favor.","Had Fan Lou not been as important to Feng Qing as he was, he would not have sent them to accompany him on this mission!","...","The Forbidden Wolf Team’s captain, Feng Nuo, said, “Fan Lou, even if this deal falls through, it won’t be your fault. The entire Forbidden Wolf Team will vouch for you, so you don’t have to be too worried!","“The Dark Pufferfish’s request is ridiculous. It’s not difficult for them to produce the poison. I’m sure that the Bloodians won’t be able to forgive them for their crazy demand.”","Fan Lou looked at Feng Nuo with a troubled gaze.","In the past, Fan Lou only regarded Feng Nuo as a rather stiff individual with an inflexible way of thinking and doing things.","But after hearing that, he now saw Feng Nuo as naive.","The Dark Pufferfish had the audacity to state such a price because they were not bothered by the Bloodians.","The Lonely River’s water was very turbid, and it was difficult for spirit-related means to penetrate the surface of the water.","The Dark Pufferfish could move around freely in the Lonely River and did not have to fear the Bloodians.","Fan Lou did not know if the Bloodians would be able to forgive the Dark Pufferfish, but they would definitely not forgive him for messing up this operation.","So what if the Forbidden Wolf Team could vouch for him? They would also have to suffer blame and punishment!","Fan Lou saw Feng Nuo as naive but did not express this thought.","Fan Lou hated fools like this. However, he believed it was necessary to lay out the truth of the matter to Feng Nuo due to the current circumstances. This would motivate Feng Nuo to cooperate with him.","Fan Lou spent close to two hours explaining the situation to Feng Nuo.","At first, Feng Nuo appeared apathetic. But the longer that Fan Lou spoke, the deeper Feng Nuo’s brow furrowed.","Now, he finally understood the current situation.","Feng Nuo had relied on his power to become the Forbidden Wolf Team’s captain. He was lacking when it came to analytical thinking.","“Fan Lou, what should we do if things are truly as you say? We’re in a bad state whether we make the trade or not. Are we just going to continue wasting time here interacting with the Dark Pufferfish?”","Fan Lou could not help but roll his eyes upon hearing that. Would he still be there doing nothing if he knew what to do?","“Lord Feng Qing gave me a map of the area around the Lonely River. I’m going to share it with you. We will work separately for the next few days and search for a few spots where resources can be harvested.","“North of the Lonely River will be our base point. This will allow us to check if the locations on the map are accurate as well as accumulate resources. We can bring the resources back for Lord Feng Qing or use them in the trade with the Dark Pufferfish!”","Fan Lou was panicking internally.","If this were the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ internal matter, the worst punishment he would receive for messing it up would be a few reproachful words from Feng Qing. But it would not affect his position.","This matter concerned the Bloodians. If they wanted to come after him, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves would not be able to protect him!","Hence, when Fan Lou laid out a plan of action, Feng Nuo was extremely willing to cooperate.","Now, Feng Nuo already saw Fan Lou as his hope for survival.","Fan Lou would have to shoulder the bulk of the responsibility if something went wrong with this operation.","Feng Nuo was willing to lead the Forbidden Wolf Team in cooperating with Fan Lou’s plan.","“Okay. You can tell me which areas you want the Forbidden Wolf Team to search. Since you’re the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team’s captain, searching for resources must be your forte. You should keep the Light Wind Wolves with you to ensure your safety!”","...","Now that Fan Lou had Feng Nuo in the palm of his hand, the Dark Pufferfish experts were passably courteous to him during his next meeting with them.","However, they refused to budge on their demands.","The Dark Pufferfish had already confirmed that the Bloodians required their poison’s support to move on the mermaids.","The mermaids and Bloodians were old enemies. Although the Bloodians had emerged victorious in past conflicts, they had not escaped unscathed either. Each clash with the mermaids would end with the Bloodians losing many members.","It was very easy for them to produce their poison, and it was not overly precious to them.","However, it was extremely useful to the Bloodians and would reduce their casualties in their clashes with the mermaids.","The Dark Pufferfish dared to demand such an astronomical asking price because they were well aware of this.","“So what if we already agreed on a price with the Bloodians? This trade is happening because the Bloodians asked for it. If you’re unwilling to trade, I will leave now and won’t be meeting with you again!”","Fan Lou looked at this elderly Dark Pufferfish who was putting on airs. In spite of his boiling rage and frustration, there was nothing he could do.","“Why don’t we do this? Give us some time to think it over, and I’ll give you a response later. You have already witnessed the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ attitude toward the Dark Pufferfish. The elders specially prepared these gifts with the hopes of establishing friendly relations with the Dark Pufferfish.”","Fan Lou spoke sincerely, but this could not be further from how he truly felt.","The two sides had already reached such a state over this trade. What friendly relations could there be to speak of?","Fan Lou did not mean what he said, and the elderly Dark Pufferfish did not believe him either.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ territory was very far from the Lonely River. It was impossible for both sides to maintain contact after this matter.","The Dark Pufferfish ruled over the Lonely River as they pleased and would never need to ask anything of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","These greeting gifts were only meant to smoothen the process of the trade.","But rather than gunning for the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ resources, it would be better for the Dark Pufferfish to aim for the other resources that the Bloodians possessed.","Nonetheless, it went without saying that the Dark Pufferfish would not turn away the gifts that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were offering of their own accord.","“Of course, you can have time to think it over. Come and see me whenever you’re done thinking. However, the Dark Pufferfish also have our limits. If you drag this on for too long, we will just reject your request to trade! At that time, we will only continue communications with a Bloodian!”","Fan Lou gnashed his teeth as he watched the elderly Dark Pufferfish leave.","Even if Fan Lou was extremely good-natured, he would not be able to stop himself from forcefully slamming his fist down on a nearby table.","Regardless of how Fan Lou examined the issue, he could not come up with a solution.","Any changes would only be made possible after he met with Lin Yuan.","Fan Lou intended to complain about these troubles to Lin Yuan immediately upon meeting him. He would ask Lin Yuan to help him to solve this problem.","With how important the Class 2 world was to Lin Yuan, Fan Lou believed that he would help him.","In Fan Lou’s mind, Lin Yuan possessed plenty of resources, and losing this amount was trivial to him.","One had to know that the Lonely River both protected and restricted the Dark Pufferfish.","The concentration of spirit qi in the Lonely River was low while the river’s earth-elemental energy and water-elemental energy were also filled with impurities.","If the Dark Pufferfish wanted to escape this environment’s effects, they would have to temper their bodies using pure spirit qi, earth-elemental energy, and water-elemental energy.","What the Dark Pufferfish needed Lin Yuan had given to Fan Lou and Kong Huan as rewards in spades of hundreds and thousands.","Fan Lou possessed resources that could satisfy the Dark Pufferfish. But he did not want to use them.","Once he used these resources, the Forbidden Wolf Team would definitely find out about it. Fan Lou would not be able to come up with an acceptable excuse if they reported the matter to Feng Qing.","Furthermore, Fan Lou wanted to use these resources for himself to increase his power. Once he gave them away, he was unsure when he could obtain more from Lin Yuan.","...","The next day, Fan Lou shared the map with the Forbidden Wolf Team and the Light Wind Wolves who had come with him.","Fan Lou assigned areas to the Forbidden Wolf Team before doing the same to the Light Wind Wolves. He did not keep the Light Wind Wolves by his side.","Since Fan Lou was going to see Lin Yuan, he would have to be on his own."]},{"number":2826,"title":"Chapter 2826 Secret Uncovered!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2826 Secret Uncovered!","In truth, Fan Lou could have kept the Light Wind Wolves with him.","If he brought these Light Wind Wolves, who were stronger than him, to meet Lin Yuan, he would kill them. Then, Fan Lou would act surprised, and no one would see through him.","He was completely out of his comfort zone in the Lonely River and was incapable of laying a hand on the Light Wind Wolves, who were stronger than him.","However, logic convinced Fan Lou not to do this because he was afraid it would anger Lin Yuan. If his actions angered Lin Yuan, everything would be for naught!","The Dark Pufferfish wanted to obtain more benefits from Fan Lou. Hence, they would give him sufficient time to ruminate and ensure that his group was safe while they were in the Lonely River.","The Dark Pufferfish knew that Fan Lou and his group had docked on land and were exploring the barren area known as North of the Lonely River.","The Dark Pufferfish did not try to stop them.","Firstly, the Dark Pufferfish could not leave water for long periods as it would affect their power.","Additionally, the resources in North of the Lonely River were far and few. There were only a few resources to be found in the Bone-Corroding Valley of the western region.","The King Blood Jackals ruled over the Bone-Corroding Valley. Their bloodline had the ability of retrospective tracing and had been fearsome since ancient times.","There were very few King Blood Jackals, but all of them were obsessed with wealth and would never allow anyone to touch the sea of resources they controlled!","Hence, there were almost no resources in North of the Lonely River that were worth harvesting.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolf group was definitely unaware of this. Otherwise, they would not have docked and begun searching the area.","Although resources were scarce in North of the Lonely River, there were a fair number of species. The species controlled numerous villages and collected extremely inferior faith power.","The Dark Pufferfish felt that these terrestrial species would never be able to prosper. The map that Fan Lou had was one that Feng Qing had asked from the Bloodians. Hence, he was aware of the King Blood Jackals’ existence.","During his meeting with Lin Yuan, Fan Lou also intended to use the map as evidence of his accomplishments!","The Bloodians were an elite species and had an extremely high quality of life.","They were also very skilled at attacking and combat. Hence, they paid close attention to the details of their maps.","However, this map drawn up by the Bloodians stopped at the Bone-Corroding Valley, which was under the King Blood Jackals’ control. This meant that the Bloodians had failed to break into the King Blood Jackals’ territory and continue exploring the area beyond.","Jackal species had similar bloodlines to wolf species.","The King Blood Jackals’ bloodline was much nobler than that of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves came from the Moon-Worshiping Wolves, but their bloodline had mutated. The mutation was like a shackle that limited them and prevented them from ever being able to reach the same level as the Moon-Worshiping Wolves.","Once the King Blood Jackals’ bloodline reached a certain level, they would be able to transform into the Emperor Blood Jackals.","If the King Blood Jackals did not have such a small population, located in such a remote area, and were so uninterested in conflict, they would definitely have made it onto the Species Ranking!","Before Feng Qing injected the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf bloodline into Fan Lou, his bloodline was extremely inferior. He could swap out his bloodline for a higher level one, but attaining the King Blood Jackal bloodline was an impossibility!","If he obtained the King Blood Jackal bloodline, he would not be able to answer to Feng Qing when he returned.","If he did not have the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf bloodline, he would not be considered a Chaos Wind Demon Wolf.","Regardless of how much Feng Qing trusted him, he would never rely on him again.","Nonetheless, everything would be determined by Lin Yuan’s plans for him. Everything about him was contingent on the decisions that Lin Yuan made.","As a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom expert, Fan Lou could travel extremely quickly when he used his full effort.","Fan Lou followed the guide and arrived at a valley just outside of a village.","A curious expression appeared on Fan Lou’s face.","This was the location he and Lin Yuan had agreed on. The jade in his hand had also led him here.","Was a bigshot like Lin Yuan truly living in that nearby village? It did not suit his identity at all.","At that moment, Fan Lou sensed an energy fluctuation from the sky.","The energy fluctuation had been intentionally released by Winter.","There was no need for Winter to hide and be sneaky when he was dealing with someone as weak as Fan Lou.","After releasing his aura and getting Fan Lou to notice him, he would begin guiding Fan Lou as per Lin Yuan’s instructions.","The moment that Fan Lou saw Winter, he could not stop terror from surfacing on his face.","However, the terrified expression soon changed to one of suspicion and respect.","Fan Lou would never be able to forget how Winter had stopped Kong Huan’s massacre atop the Abyssal Beast’s back by just lifting his hand.","Technically, Winter was his savior. Otherwise, he would have been killed by Kong Huan that day.","However, Fan Lou could not bring himself to feel thankful to Winter.","Fan Lou had not expected Winter to appear in the sky. He could not see anything in the sky that Winter could land on.","Apart from his fear, Fan Lou was extremely respectful toward Winter because he was an expert by Lin Yuan’s side.","“Lord Winter, I’m glad to see you again!”","At the end of the day, visitors needed to be treated with respect. Winter’s serene eyes swept over Fan Lou before he raised his hand and pointed at Fan Lou.","Fan Lou was completely incapable of resisting as Winter picked his body up from the ground, and the two began soaring through the air together.","From the moment that Fan Lou touched the clouds, he sensed that something was different about these clouds.","It did not take long for a majestic scene to appear before Fan Lou’s eyes.","Fan Lou felt himself being enveloped by spirit qi that was even purer than what was in the external space.","As the captain of a Boundary Patrol Team under Honor Absent Palace, Fan Lou’s bloodline did not particularly stand out.","However, he did have a wealth of experience and insight.","Nonetheless, he had never seen such a paradise before!","He had visited Honor Absent Palace’s main palace before. It was spectacular. That was undeniable.","However, the decoration in Honor Absent Palace had been far from the level of exquisite opulence atop this giant whale.","Fan Lou had made guesses about Lin Yuan’s background many times. But the more he learned about Lin Yuan, the more Fan Lou realized that his understanding was lacking.","Fan Lou racked his brain but still failed to hypothesize where Lin Yuan came from.","Winter walked over to Lin Yuan and stood next to him.","Lin Yuan sensed Fan Lou’s state before saying with a smile, “Many years have passed since we parted. You look like you’re in a good state and haven’t suffered in the past few years.”","Lin Yuan raised his hand and pointed at a nearby chair. “Sit. The tea is still steaming, so have it while it’s hot.”","Fan Lou could tell that Lin Yuan was treating him graciously, but he was also aware of his identity. He was a servant whose soul was in Lin Yuan’s control. Under no circumstances could he sit in front of Lin Yuan as though they were equals!","Even an expert like Winter was standing behind Lin Yuan!","Fan Lou would never dare to compare himself with Winter, nor would he dare to put on airs when Winter was present.","“Master, I’m okay with talking while standing! Thanks to the arrangements you made for me, I am now the most favored individual in Feng Qing, a member of the Honor Absent Parliament’s circle! This time, I specially asked him to ask the Bloodians for a map of the area around the Lonely River!”","Fan Lou took out the map and held it out before bowing as a means of offering it up to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow and narrowed his eyes as he stared at Fan Lou.","He received the map and saw that there were locations that were clearly marked out.","It could be said that with this map, Lin Yuan’s reason for asking Fan Lou to come had been fulfilled.","Knowing that Fan Lou could think this far and make requests to Feng Qing for his sake improved Lin Yuan’s impression of him.","“This map is proof of your intentions. I will send people to verify the contents of this map.”","While Lin Yuan spoke, he took out a brocade sack and tossed it at Fan Lou. It contained exactly 100 spirit qi crystals.","These spirit qi crystals filled with pure spirit qi were exactly the rare resource that Fan Lou needed to increase his power.","With a raise of his hand, Lin Yuan summoned Genius.","Lin Yuan had never summoned a fey in front of Fan Lou until now. Hence, Fan Lou had been unaware that Lin Yuan was a spirit contractor.","Yet, Fan Lou was not surprised to learn that Lin Yuan was a spirit contractor. He was curious to know the reason for Lin Yuan summoning his fey.","Lin Yuan did not want Fan Lou to report every single detail he had access to.","Firstly, Lin Yuan did not know what had happened to Fan Lou or how his experiences had played out.","Secondly, asking him questions would waste a lot of Lin Yuan’s time. It would be far easier to use Genius’ Connected Tails to understand his experiences.","“Genius will be using an ability on you. Do not use your spiritual energy or soul energy to put up a block.”","Fan Lou nodded with half-understanding.","The moment Genius used Connected Tails to link up with Fan Lou, the latter immediately understood the ability that Lin Yuan had mentioned.","All the hair on Fan Lou’s body stood up. He had never expected such a thing to happen!","Fan Lou had not done anything wrong. He had done his best to assist Lin Yuan in safeguarding the secret that was the Class 2 world.","However, because there were times he needed to carry out tasks for Feng Qing as his subordinate, he could not pay constant attention to the Class 2 world.","This sudden evaluation had been Fan Lou’s nightmare. Regardless of how perfect of a job he had done, it was still a nightmare that had tormented him for a very long time. He was terrified of Lin Yuan finding out about this!","Given the circumstances, it seemed that Lin Yuan already knew!","When all the hair on Fan Lou’s body stood up, Winter’s eyes landed on him.","Lin Yuan’s expression changed multiple times as well. He thought, It’s a good thing I didn’t help more experts or feys to evolve before I left the main world. Otherwise, this sudden inspection would definitely have resulted in the main world catching the attention of the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ experts.","This discovery shocked and angered Lin Yuan.","But from Fan Lou’s memory, Lin Yuan knew that Fan Lou had indeed done his best to carry out the task he had been given. There was no way that Fan Lou could have predicted this unexpected situation, so there was no need to blame him for it.","Now that Lin Yuan was in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, he could use his power to protect the main world.","When Genius severed the connection of Connected Tails, Fan Lou fell to his knees and began begging Lin Yuan for mercy.","Lin Yuan looked down at Fan Lou, who had terror written all over his face and tears streaming down his face. He knew that Fan Lou truly felt guilty and was not putting on a pretense of begging for his life.","Lin Yuan was not angry that Fan Lou had failed to be present during the sudden inspection. Another reason for Fan Lou remaining by Feng Qing’s side was so he could secure his position as the captain of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team. Without Feng Qing supporting Fan Lou, Fan Lou would not be able to hold on to his position.","Lin Yuan was angry that Fan Lou had not notified him immediately when the matter happened.","If Fan Lou had notified Winter immediately through the jade crystal, he could have learned of the situation in advance.","Although Lin Yuan did not blame Fan Lou, necessary punishment needed to be doled out.","When Fan Lou noticed that Lin Yuan had not responded to his pleas, he became even more alarmed.","Just as Fan Lou was about to climb toward Lin Yuan’s leg and continue begging fervently, he heard Lin Yuan say, “Do you know where you went wrong?”","Lin Yuan did not give Fan Lou the chance to reply before he continued. “You erred by failing to notify me immediately! You have to remember that I can find out anything about your experiences at any time.","“I won’t forget your contributions and will give you a bright future. I hope that going forward, you will get rid of any unsavory thoughts. Otherwise, I will not hesitate to swap you out! There are many people in the Sky Beyond the Clouds who can take your place!”","Fan Lou froze when he heard that.","Lin Yuan’s tone was strict, but Fan Lou could tell that Lin Yuan had forgiven him.","Fan Lou hurriedly said, “Master, don’t worry. From now on, I will report every matter to you, big or small!”","Lin Yuan took another two sips of the tea that had yet to go cold before saying softly, “Stand up to speak. Hold onto this paper. Once you leave, you can experiment with communicating with me through this piece of paper.","“If you are able to communicate with me through this paper, you won’t need to use Winter’s jade crystal anymore. You can keep the jade crystal and use it when you’re in danger.”","Lin Yuan was giving Fan Lou a Thoughts Letter Paper.","In the main world, the Thoughts Letter Paper was the best tool used among Lin Yuan’s subordinates.","It would be just as useful in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","However, Lin Yuan was unsure of the scope that the Thoughts Letter Paper could cover.","The Sky Beyond the Clouds was much larger than the main world.","Although the Elemental Paper had reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, Lin Yuan was unsure if he would be able to communicate with Fan Lou while he was here in North of the Lonely River.","Lin Yuan intended to use Fan Lou to test the Thoughts Letter Paper. If he could communicate with Fan Lou through the Thoughts Letter Paper, it could become a key tool!","Fan Lou did not think much when he received the paper from Lin Yuan.","There were many treasures for transmission. Fan Lou would not be at all surprised if Lin Yuan could produce any of such treasures.","Fan Lou cared most about the part where Lin Yuan said that the jade crystal would be able to protect him!"]},{"number":2827,"title":"Chapter 2827 Sky City’s Lonely River!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2827 Sky City’s Lonely River!","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, even a big shot like Feng Qing trod on thin ice in everything that they did.","Feng Qing would never communicate as freely with the Bloodians as he did with the Alluring Foxes.","Since even someone of Feng Qing’s status acted that way, it went without saying that the same went for someone like Fan Lou.","Fan Lou was the most afraid of death.","Since the jade crystal could protect Fan Lou, he could not help but feel a sense of security.","From what Lin Yuan said, Fan Lou also noticed the fundamental difference between Lin Yuan and the other superiors he had served in the past. The other superiors would never care if a small fry like him lived or died.","“Master, don’t worry. I will definitely do a good job in this matter!”","Fan Lou paused before continuing. “This time, Feng Qing sent me on a mission. It’s because of this opportunity that I managed to find the reason to bring the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves with me to the Lonely River. But with my current capabilities, I don’t think I can accomplish this mission!”","Remaining in Feng Qing’s good books and receiving his praise was also a very important part of him helping Lin Yuan.","Now that Fan Lou was encountering an issue he could not solve, he decided to turn directly to Lin Yuan for help.","Not only was Lin Yuan not turned off by Fan Lou’s request for help, but he also admired Fan Lou’s choice.","When Lin Yuan decided to nurture Fan Lou, he only viewed Fan Lou as a set of eyes he could use. He had not been banking on using Fan Lou’s capabilities to solve his issues.","If Fan Lou came to him for help when he encountered issues, it would prevent Fan Lou from affecting the operation with his hesitation.","“It goes without saying that I’ll help if you are encountering issues. But before that, I need to know what the Bloodians need from the Lonely River.”","Despite having the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Abyssal Beast, it still took Fan Lou close to a month to arrive at the Lonely River.","This deal had to be extremely important to the Bloodians for Feng Qing to send Fan Lou on such a long-haul journey.","Fan Lou had wanted to tell Lin Yuan about this but eventually decided against it because he was afraid that Lin Yuan would be uninterested.","But now that Lin Yuan seemed interested in this matter, Fan Lou began giving a detailed report.","“Master, you are well aware of the Bloodians’ situation. They consume the blood of other lifeforms and are constantly hunting other species.","“The Bloodians are the mermaids’ sworn enemies and want to attack the other mermaid tribes in the East Universe. They will be sending many of their best and brightest warriors. However, the mermaids are very strong, and every clash with them results in the Bloodians suffering heavy casualties.","“The Bloodians’ elite doesn’t want the species to suffer such giant losses. In recent years, the Bloodians’ birth rate has been falling. If they lose too many of their pure-blooded members, their population will be affected. Hence, the Bloodians decided to gear up before beginning the attack.","“The poison secreted by the Dark Pufferfish that live in the Lonely River will contaminate water. The poison will not only lower the mermaids’ ability to control water but also harm the mermaids’ bodies and reduce their defenses. This will make it easier for the Bloodians to pass through their bodies and use their blood enchantments to control the blood in the mermaids’ bodies. They will then rip apart the mermaids’ scales that seem soft but are actually very tough.”","Fan Lou added, “If the Bloodians successfully trade with the Dark Pufferfish and obtain a large amount of their poison, the attack on the mermaids will definitely cause a commotion in the East Universe.","“The mermaids have ties to many other sea species. But the Bloodians also have many allies. This war will involve many of the species in the East Universe and could cause some species to be permanently erased from the Species Ranking. A few species that have never appeared on the Species Ranking will thus be able to make an appearance on the Species Ranking!”","Lin Yuan ignored Fan Lou’s lamentation.","The mermaids had always been part of the top 100 of the Species Ranking.","It was only to be expected that a savage war between two species would involve other species.","Ever since he awakened his Body of All Spirits, Lin Yuan’s feelings toward the mermaids had changed.","With numerous bloodlines coexisting in his body, Lin Yuan was no longer affected by bloodlines and would not show favor toward any particular species.","Morbius had told Lin Yuan with the utmost seriousness that the Body of All Spirits was not infallible. Its weakness was that once a certain bloodline energy in the body exceeded that of other bloodlines, the bloodline energy would affect the possessor’s emotions.","In the past, Lin Yuan only had the mermaid bloodline. Hence, he inevitably showed favor to the mermaids.","But now, Lin Yuan would no longer be misguided by his bloodlines as he had been continuously strengthening them.","Even if the Bloodians obtained the Dark Pufferfish’s poison, declaring war on the mermaids was an enormous issue and would not be initiated recklessly. Some time for preparation would be needed.","Lin Yuan felt that he stood to benefit from the Bloodians’ attack on the mermaids.","“Fan Lou, once you return, try your best to become involved in the Bloodians’ vendetta against the mermaids. Do you know how strong the Dark Pufferfish are?”","Lin Yuan would help Fan Lou to complete his trade with the Dark Pufferfish. However, there were many ways to accomplish the trade, and he did not necessarily have to use above-board methods to meet the Dark Pufferfish’s request.","For the Dark Pufferfish to have the audacity to make such demands of the Bloodians, it meant they were substantially powerful in their own regard!","However, based on what Fan Lou said, Lin Yuan knew that he had the wrong idea.","When Fan Lou mentioned the Dark Pufferfish, scorn and disdain were written all over his face.","“Master, the strongest Dark Pufferfish isn’t even as strong as Kong Huan. They are able to dominate the Lonely River because of the poison in their bodies.","“Additionally, the original species that dominated the Lonely River all left after the Dark Pufferfish contaminated the water. They all moved to areas outside of the Lonely River and continued their development there. Most of the species that remain in the Lonely River aren’t able to relocate.","“The Dark Pufferfish are acting so unreasonably toward the Bloodians and are trying to take advantage of them through this trade because the Bloodians can’t consume poisonous species. This means they can’t eat the Dark Pufferfish.","“Even if the Bloodians are being taken advantage of, they won’t come to the Lonely River personally because they don’t stand to benefit. This is the upper hand that the Dark Pufferfish hold!”","Lin Yuan did not reply to Fan Lou immediately. Instead, he spread out the map that Fan Lou had given him.","After examining it for a moment, Lin Yuan was certain that there were sufficient resources North of the Lonely River.","He told Fan Lou with a smile, “Leave soon. If you’re gone for too long, people will become suspicious. Go and tell the Dark Pufferfish that the Bloodians will send a bigshot to facilitate the trade. Ask them to have as many members present at the trade as possible!”","Fan Lou was stunned when he heard what Lin Yuan said. He could guess what Lin Yuan was trying to do.","Lin Yuan had to find out from Fan Lou about the trade between the Bloodians and the Dark Pufferfish. He was definitely unrelated to the Bloodians.","The Bloodians were not going to send someone here. Lin Yuan said this because he wanted to deceive the Dark Pufferfish.","If Fan Lou deceived the Dark Pufferfish on his own, he would be unsuccessful.","Fan Lou wondered, Can it be that he plans on attacking the Dark Pufferfish!?","When this thought appeared, Fan Lou did not feel any worry or fear. Rather, he felt confident.","Subordinates liked it when the superiors they served put on strong fronts. When they put on strong fronts, their subordinates would feel a sense of pride and security.","This was exactly how Fan Lou felt.","“Master, I will go back and do as you say. If a bigshot from the Bloodians arrives, the Dark Pufferfish will definitely take the matter seriously. I will say that the Bloodians want to trade for a very large volume of poison. This will definitely cause the Dark Pufferfish to ask the Bloodians for even more resources. There is no limit to the Dark Pufferfish’s greed.”","Fan Lou was able to assimilate perfectly into the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. He would definitely be able to pull the wool over the Dark Pufferfish’s eyes as well.","Moreover, given the circumstances, there was no reason for the Dark Pufferfish to doubt what Fan Lou said. In the eyes of the Dark Pufferfish, Fan Lou was nothing more than a distant relative of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, who were being supported by the Bloodians.","How could the servant of a servant have the courage to lie to a superior?","...","Once Fan Lou left, Winter said seriously, “Lord Saint, if you intend to make a move on the Dark Pufferfish, what do you think about sending Autumn and me to take control of the species in the Lonely River?","“That way, the entire Lonely River will become our eyes. We can then set up camp in the Lonely River and develop rapidly outwards from north of the Lonely River.","“I took a look at the map. The King Blood Jackals mentioned on the map have extremely high evolution potential. If you take control of the King Blood Jackals, it will be worth investing a large amount of resources into them!","“The King Blood Jackals are very intelligent. They might be obsessed with riches, but they will do well at management tasks. If you send them to work under Su Yiren and Luo Lan, the two of them will have an easier time.","“Once you have many villages under your control, they will be grouped into tribes and subsequently kingdoms. At that point, it won’t be as easy to govern that establishment as it is to govern the human federations in the Class 2 world you came from!","“The people under you all have their own talents and deserve to obtain faith power. In such a situation, the faith will become disorganized if you don’t have sufficient manpower to sort out the disputes.”","Lin Yuan nodded seriously. He strongly agreed with what Winter said.","The Sky Beyond the Clouds was not the same as the main world. It was not a fair comparison at all.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan needed to slowly become accustomed to the style of governance in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. They needed to go through the process of learning and improving.","“Start with the Dark Pufferfish. Once we have control over the Dark Pufferfish, it will make it easier for us to conquer the entire Lonely River and extend our control over the other species in the Lonely River.","“If we go in and make a huge ruckus, the news will spread, and many factions will begin paying attention to the Lonely River.","“Almost all the fertile territories marked out on the map are under the control of the King Blood Jackals. I am going to make the King Blood Jackals’ territory my main area of development.”","The meeting with Fan Lou had allowed Lin Yuan to gain an understanding of the circumstances. He now had a clear direction for his future development. All he needed to do now was follow it.","...","When Fan Lou returned, the Forbidden Wolf Team and Light Wind Wolves had yet to arrive.","Fan Lou knew that it was impossible for the Forbidden Wolf Team or Light Wind Wolves to turn up anything in their search.","North of the Lonely River was desolate and impoverished. The Forbidden Wolf Team and Light Wind Wolves also did not have the courage to provoke the King Blood Jackals.","Moreover, they were on a mission and could not venture that far in their search.","Fan Lou did not have to wait for long before the two groups returned.","Fan Lou put on an act of asking about their results.","With the Forbidden Wolf Team around, the Light Wind Wolves did not have any authority to speak.","Feng Nuo started to complain, “Just how isolated and poor is the Lonely River? Not only does it not have any high-quality resources, but there aren’t even any decent spiritual resources to be found. After searching for such a long time, we didn’t manage to find anything.","“However, we did stumble upon a few villages. The villages seem to be in good condition. If we were able to stay here longer, we could collect some faith from the villages.”","Fan Lou did not respond to Feng Nuo’s complaints.","Normally, the villages scattered around such regions were extremely chaotic.","Since Feng Nuo said that the villages were in good shape, it meant that Lin Yuan had to be involved.","He was about to lie to the Dark Pufferfish that a bigshot from the Bloodians was about to arrive. He could not allow the Forbidden Wolf Team or Light Wind Wolves to find out about this. Otherwise, he would not be able to explain himself to Feng Qing when he returned.","The Forbidden Wolf Team would definitely report the situation to Feng Qing.","Fan Lou’s brain was running at high speed as he tried to come up with a way to accomplish this task.","While he was thinking, he heard Feng Nuo say miserably, “Fan Lou, you might not have the pure Chaos Wind Demon Wolf bloodline, but you have Lord Feng Qing’s favor and can be considered one of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","“This task isn’t an easy one. Me and the Forbidden Wolf Team are only in charge of ensuring your safety. If this matter isn’t successful, we will all be blamed and punished. You need to think about the current privilege that you have! Regardless of what happens, you need to make sure to satisfy Lord Feng Qing.”","Feng Nuo spoke with a heavy tone that carried a hint of a warning.","Fan Lou knew that Feng Nuo was trying to enforce a sense of pressure on him.","Feng Nuo had to be extremely low-spirited now as he begrudged his bad luck of having to be involved in such a troublesome mission.","Fan Lou could use this chance to carry out his plan!"]},{"number":2828,"title":"Chapter 2828 Genius Finally Breaks Through!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2828 Genius Finally Breaks Through!","“Senior Feng Nuo, thank you for your reminder! I am well aware of the importance of this operation. I will try my best to complete the trade with the Dark Pufferfish! However, you know that the Dark Pufferfish’s demands are unreasonable. I will need some time to think about completing this trade successfully.","Fan Lou knew that Feng Nuo was worried about the consequences he would face if the plan failed. Additionally, he wanted to clarify their responsibilities, hoping that Fan Lou would shoulder all of the liabilities.","If Fan Lou had not had Lin Yuan’s support and had made it this far on his own, he would definitely have been unwilling to take on any responsibility.","Feng Nuo and the rest were indeed there to protect him. But at the same time, they were also responsible for assisting him in completing the trade.","But now, the trade with the Dark Pufferfish was no longer an issue for Fan Lou. Hence, Fan Lou did not mind putting on an act for Feng Nuo and the Light Wind Wolves.","Feng Nuo and the Light Wind Wolves did not protest when Fan Lou voluntarily took on full responsibility.","Feng Nuo and the rest had also been present in the previous meetings with the Dark Pufferfish.","The Dark Pufferfish’s attitude was one of complete unresponsiveness. Regardless of how capable Fan Lou was or how silver his tongue was, he would never persuade them.","The Dark Pufferfish were only after practical resources. These were resources that Fan Lou could not supply!","...","On the first day, Fan Lou acted extremely anxious and restless in front of the Forbidden Wolf Team.","Fan Lou’s fidgety demeanor gave the Forbidden Wolf Team a headache, thinking of him as spineless while also pitying him. He should have thought his capabilities through. How could he have attempted to involve himself in such a mission?","A trivial character who used to follow Kong Huan was now following Feng Qing and had fortuitously managed to earn Feng Qing’s favor.","But his time in the sun had not lasted long before he came up against such a situation. What a poor fellow!","Fan Lou did not know what the Forbidden Wolf Team and Light Wind Wolves were thinking of him. But even if he did know, he would not care in the slightest.","...","On the second day, Fan Lou met with the Dark Pufferfish expert with whom he had previously interacted.","Previously, this Dark Pufferfish went to the Abyssal Beast where Fan Lou and the rest were residing.","This time, Fan Lou leaped into the Lonely River and entered the Dark Pufferfish’s territory.","The Dark Pufferfish expert did not at all care about Fan Lou’s gesture of coming to see him. He had already predicted that Fan Lou would soon be coming to meet him for a discussion in the hopes of convincing them to lower their demands.","The Dark Pufferfish would not budge on the amount of resources they had requested. In fact, they might even ask for more!","Rather, the Dark Pufferfish wanted to make things as difficult for Fan Lou as possible to attract the Bloodians there so they could discuss the trade directly with them.","However, this Dark Pufferfish expert had not expected a Bloodian to be arriving so soon!","When Fan Lou said that the Bloodian bigshot would arrive in two days to talk about the trade with the Dark Pufferfish, this expert was taken aback.","The Bloodians had always been arrogant. Since when did they start being so proactive?","The Dark Pufferfish had made such unreasonable demands because they knew how badly the Bloodians needed their poison. But this did not mean that the Dark Pufferfish dared to act in an overbearing manner toward the Bloodians.","This Dark Pufferfish expert said seriously, “I will inform the other members of my species immediately. When the time comes, we will send people to receive that honored guest.”","At this point, the expert looked directly into Fan Lou’s eyes and punctuated each word as he said, “Telling my species about this matter means that it is of utmost importance. If a Bloodian doesn’t arrive in two days, you will have to answer for the consequences! Lying to the Dark Pufferfish will only lead to death!”","Fan Lou was not at all terrified when he heard the threat.","The Dark Pufferfish would soon be under Lord Lin Yuan’s control.","In the future, they would be Lin Yuan’s servants just like he was or be exterminated.","As high and mighty as they were now, they would soon be just as pathetic.","The Dark Pufferfish were only capable in the Lonely River. But once they were conquered, it was unlikely that Lin Yuan would have any use for them.","“Of course. I wouldn’t come up with such lies unless I had real information! If I did that, the Dark Pufferfish wouldn’t be the only ones coming after me. The Bloodians and all the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves would never let me off, either. Don’t you know that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves are under the Bloodians?","“However, the person the Bloodians are sending is no ordinary character. I hope that all the members of the Dark Pufferfish will be present.”","Fan Lou’s words caused the expert’s expression to change. Before he could speak, Fan Lou continued. “Those words aren’t coming from me, but the Bloodians. You can decide for yourselves if you want to cooperate. I only hope that you won’t be lacking in courtesy if a high-ranking Bloodian appears!”","Once Fan Lou was done speaking, he excused himself and returned to the Abyssal Beast’s back.","Fan Lou knew that he would definitely be unable to force all the Dark Pufferfish to appear. He could only coax them to appear by using his words.","The words he used had been enough. If he said any more, the Dark Pufferfish would become suspicious!","Now that Fan Lou had accomplished this matter, he immediately sent a message to Lin Yuan through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","...","When Lin Yuan received Fan Lou’s message, he thought, It looks like I’ll have to act like a high-ranking Bloodian in two days!","For the past two days, Lin Yuan had been with Genius.","From the moment Genius arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it had been preparing for its evolution.","If Genius wanted to evolve and was capable of doing so, it went without saying that Lin Yuan would give it the greatest support.","“Yuan, you don’t have to worry about me! I have already saved up enough tails and can use them to escape if I’m in any danger! You don’t have to worry that I will suffer backlash from the world wills!”","Spring, who had been with Lin Yuan all this time, said seriously, “Lord Saint, if your fey encounters any problems during the evolution, I will step in to solve the issue. Not even world wills will be able to harm your feys!”","Lin Yuan relaxed when he heard what Genius and Spring said.","Among all of his feys, Lin Yuan had the deepest relationship with Genius and Chimey. After all, they had been with him for the longest time and were the two rays of light that shone even during his darkest times.","Lin Yuan could not imagine how he would have been able to endure all those tough times if they had not been there for him!","Lin Yuan reached out and stroked Genius’ small head. He looked at Genius’ billowing tails and could not help but give it a final piece of advice.","“Genius, your situation is special. Please don’t force yourself and end up injuring yourself!”","Among all of Lin Yuan’s feys, Genius and Chimey had the lowest levels.","It was not because Lin Yuan did not want to provide them with the resources to evolve. In fact, he wanted to wait until they arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds before increasing their strength because he wanted to give them even more chances.","Chimey needed to form links with the energy in celestial bodies to evolve. She would then produce a sun that was suitable for this world.","On the other hand, Genius needed to communicate with world wills and connect with them.","In order for Chimey to evolve, it needed to wait for Lin Yuan to arrive at the Sky Beyond the Clouds, where he could obtain flames that were of an even higher level than top-grade strange flames.","In the meantime, Genius could go first.","Genius nudged Lin Yuan’s hand with its face before turning its amazonite-colored eyes toward the sky. Its long tails turned into ribbons of light that seemed to fuse with the surroundings. A mystical ripple of energy rose from Genius’ body.","It did not take long for the world wills to begin rapidly gathering above Genius’ head.","However, these world wills were different from the ones that gathered when the feys evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. The previous world wills had an air of judgment, but these ones were communicating with Genius.","But regardless, Genius would have to endure the Trial of World Creation to evolve from Suzerain X/Myth III to Creation Breed!","In truth, Creation Breed was a level that was considered mediocre in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. It was not anything to be impressed by.","Genius’ evolution went much smoother than Lin Yuan had imagined. It had not been as tumultuous as the previous ones. Genius also did not need to use Tail Trigger to sacrifice its additional tails.","As such, Genius naturally managed to evolve while communicating with the world wills.","Spring did not allow the Trial of World Creation to hit Genius. She raised her hand and helped Genius overcome the Trial of World Creation.","After the Trial of World Creation descended, the Creation World Ley Lines that descended were the same as the ones in the main world. Hence, the strength of the Creation World Ley Lines was the same.","Genius’ appearance had not changed significantly. However, the feeling that it gave Lin Yuan was much more lively than before!","Its tails were much more slender and billowy than before.","Once the number of tails reached 12, it no longer increased despite the rise in its life rank.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Genius.","[Fey Name]: Highest Access Fate-Knowing Beast","[Fey Species]: Fantasy-cat-genus/fantasy-cat-species","[Fey Grade]: Suzerain (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Spiritual/Soul","[Fey Quality]: Creation I","Abilities:","[Memory Deduction]: When recalling something, it will be able to remember every minuscule detail. From this, it will be able to organize the information and infer the truth.","[Crowded Cat]: If it can control cat-species feys and convince the cats to crowd around it, it will be able to become affiliated with all of the cat-species feys’ elements and bodies. Every time the cat-species feys crowd around, it will be weak for some time.","[Spiritual Energy Expansion]: Transfer the spiritual energy into an emergency bank for the contractor. Even though the contractor cannot willfully use Spiritual Energy Expansion to increase his own store of spiritual energy, he can use it to defend himself against spiritual energy damage.","[Master of Cats]: As the new leader of cat-species feys, it can use spiritual energy to form contracts with other cat-species feys, control their lives, and share in their spiritual power.","[Soul Permutation]: Use and change different spiritual energies into soul power.","[Tail Trigger]: When using soul power, a tail can be sacrificed to increase the soul power. The spiritual energy inside the body can also be condensed to produce replacement tails to be used when there are no longer any tails left and Tail Trigger cannot be used.","[True Knowledge Analysis]: Use spiritual energy to envelop an entity, and the composition of the entity will be analyzed. Entities that have been combined will be analyzed separately. After the analysis, there will be a confirmation from the heavenly will to ascertain accuracy.","Exclusive Skills:","[Tool Transformation]: Capable of transforming into a tool for the contractor to use.","[Tail of Fate]:","1. Connected Tails: According to the number of tails, lives can be connected. The connected lives can share thinking and intention.","2. Highest Access Tail: Combine all the tails into one. If it craves for knowledge enough, it can sacrifice its spiritual energy to communicate with the heavens and request an answer.","[Sky Fate Attachment]: The affiliation with heavenly will be deepened, and the fate of the heavenly will will be attached to it to elevate its chances of success when concocting spirit fluids or when performing other actions.","[Linked Fate Protection]: Link the fate of the cat-species lifeforms under its control with fortune. A network will be formed that will protect all the cat-species lifeforms. When the cat-species lifeforms under its protection evolve, its spiritual energy will increase, and its store of spiritual energy will increase as well.","Genius had only just reached Creation Breed. It would be some time before it evolved from Suzerain to Sovereign.","Lin Yuan felt that Genius’ Creation Breed exclusive skill could stand toe-to-toe with the divine kingdom abilities of World Emperor/Divine Kingdom feys.","Lin Yuan’s evaluation of Linked Fate Protection was not at all exaggerated. It was an extremely well-rounded ability!"]},{"number":2829,"title":"Chapter 2829 Lin Yuan Becomes a Bloodian","paragraphs":["Chapter 2829 Lin Yuan Becomes a Bloodian","When Genius used Linked Fate Protection, it could link its own fate and the fate of the cat-species lifeforms controlled by Master of Cats with fortune.","Even the lifeform with the best fortune would only have slightly more luck than other lifeforms.","Lin Yuan’s Death Demon Concubine Beast had the ability to gather fortune. He could use Merciful Soul to sense the fortunes of other lifeforms.","This was proven during the sensing.","As Genius continued to evolve, the number of cat-species feys it could control using Master of Cats also increased.","After linking the fates and fortunes of so many cat-species lifeforms, it would form a network that protected Genius and all the cat-species lifeforms.","It was very difficult to use regular methods to break through such protection over fates and fortunes.","Moreover, under the protection of such a network of fate and fortune, the cat lifeforms’ conditions would be improved!","The cat-species lifeforms would even condense their fate into spiritual energy and channel it back into Genius as a means of increasing its store of spiritual energy","Spiritual energy was the base of all of Genius’ abilities.","When Genius’ store of spiritual energy increased, Memory Deduction, Spiritual Energy Expansion, Soul Permutation, and True Knowledge Analysis would all improve. Tail of Fate would also become stronger!","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with Genius’ evolution.","Newly evolved, Genius meowed and leaped into Lin Yuan’s arms.","Genius snuggled up to Lin Yuan for a moment before turning its blue eyes to him and saying in a child-like voice, “Yuan, now that my grade and quality have increased, I can also strengthen the entire army of Hundred Questions Beasts and all the cat-species feys!","“In your words, I might need to go into seclusion for some time. After this evolution, the army of Hundred Questions Beasts will be able to enormously increase their production and quality of resources!”","Lin Yuan reached out and massaged Genius’ small head. Without them noticing, Genius’ establishment had grown larger and larger!","It no longer clung to him like it used to when it was young. Rather, it did its best to produce resources and increase its power.","It went without saying that everything that Genius did was for Lin Yuan’s sake.","Lin Yuan had watched all of Genius’ changes. As a result of these changes and continuous growth, it was now able to stand on its own two feet!","Lin Yuan felt both glad and troubled by Genius’ changes.","“Go, Genius. If you have any needs, let me know immediately! Remember not to be too rushed or forceful while you’re nurturing the army of Hundred Questions Beasts and cats. Give them some space to grow on their own!”","“Yuan, speaking of needs, there is something I need! All the knowledge I had in the past was related to the main world. This knowledge isn’t enough to help me make accurate judgments in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. I need a large system from which I can absorb knowledge about the Sky Beyond the Clouds and perfect my knowledge bank of its structure!”","In truth, even without Genius saying this, Lin Yuan knew this from the moment he arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan, an ordinary individual, owed his success in passing the Creation Master tests and attaining the status of a Class 2 Creation Master to Genius, ultimately capturing the attention of the Moon Empress!","When he first arrived at the marsh world and began exploring it, it was also through Genius that he gained an understanding of the marsh world’s situation.","It went without saying that Lin Yuan would use Genius’ ability to take control of the knowledge in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Once Genius gained the knowledge, it would be equivalent to all of Sky City’s members gaining the knowledge.","“Genius, once I take control of the Lonely River, I will bring you all the documents and literature available here so you can use Connected Tails to acquire the memories of all the experts. The same will go for the species in the barren land!”","The King Blood Jackals should have gathered a fair amount of documents and literature.","Many of the species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were highly intelligent, and they always kept records.","Nonetheless, the most comprehensive set of historical records would undoubtedly come from Honor Absent Palace.","Going forward, Lin Yuan would try to find a way to obtain a systematic collection of knowledge from Honor Absent Palace.","After he returned Genius to the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan received a message from the Moon Empress.","Culture was important in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. It was possible that mechanical civilizations had lived there tens of epochs ago. But now, any trace of such a civilization had long vanished.","The Sky Beyond the Clouds did not have anything that resembled a phone.","Items that could be used for communication were not common in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. They were only attainable by lifeforms that had reached a certain level.","In terms of the means of information transfer, the Sky Beyond the Clouds was rather behind the times.","However, the lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds all had different abilities, exclusive skills, and divine kingdom abilities. This was what made this world defined by martial force exceptionally beautiful.","The lifeforms that had transmission abilities were all recruited by various factions and enjoyed decent lives. However, information that was transmitted by lifeforms or feys that were used as tools did not have the same level of secrecy and information security that the Elemental Paper had.","[Moon Empress]: Little Yuan, there are now over 500 villages under Sky City’s control. The total population is close to 200,000,000. These people are all in similar states to the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribes. However, the Iron Hammer Federation’s tribes were all worshiping the Snow Celestial Mountain. But that’s not the case for these tribes. Their faith is very messy.","[Moon Empress]: I think that we should try to find a way to channel all the villagers’ faith towards a common target rather than trying to manage them systematically. I have thought it through, and I still think that it isn’t a good idea to gather the villagers together and direct their faith toward different targets!","[Moon Empress]: I’m not saying that it’s impossible, but it would require too high of a cost and manpower. Sky City doesn’t have so many people to spare!","It was said that older people had more experience and capabilities. The Moon Empress had taken over the Radiance Federation right before the dead spirits crisis broke out. She had managed to keep the Radiance Federation running in perfect order even during the most perilous times.","After the dead spirits crisis ended, the Moon Empress, who started from running the Radiance Federation, began managing and saving the entire main world.","The Moon Empress’ abilities were not something that Su Yiren and Wen Yu could replicate or compete with.","The Moon Empress rarely approached him about issues with development. Once she did, it meant that she had noticed issues with the present strategies.","Lin Yuan carefully ruminated over the Moon Empress’ words. It did not take him long to realize the problem with his plan.","Faith was a very personal matter and was highly exclusive.","The Moon Empress had used the Iron Hammer Federation as an example and mentioned that its tribes had dedicated their faith to the Snow Celestial Mountain’s magical spirit. Their shared faith prevented them from fighting each other to the death even when resources were lacking.","If there had been two or three targets for faith in the Iron Hammer Federation, the federation would have devolved into chaos long ago.","The population of these hundreds of villages could not be compared to the population of the Iron Hammer Federation! It was only the equivalent of the population of a few Platinum tribes.","However, Sky City had too many members who had the abilities and the right to obtain faith power.","If faith power was disorganized, it would not lead to issues immediately but was a ticking bomb.","[Lin Yuan]: Master, it’s true that I didn’t think things through properly. Since that’s the case, what do you think about me gathering the tribes together before dividing them up again? Each tribe will then be ruled by one of Sky City’s main members. Then, the entire tribe will dedicate their faith power to Sky City’s representative members.","Lin Yuan had come up with a similar idea in the past, but he had been unwilling to send out all of Sky City’s main members. He preferred to keep them close to Sky City.","But now, it seemed he needed to dispatch everyone!","It was not to be said that there were no upsides to sending out all of Sky City’s main members. Doing so would train their capabilities.","After all, with the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles, the main members could all return to Sky City’s headquarters with ease.","When the Moon Empress saw Lin Yuan’s reply, she knew that he had taken her advice and understood her deeper meaning.","[Moon Empress]: Little Yuan, we have only just arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds and are still in the exploratory phase. We don’t have to be afraid of making mistakes early on. We can just fix them later! Since you’ve made your decision, why don’t you tell Little Yu and Little Jie to collect more villages since they don’t have much to do? Otherwise, there won’t be enough people in each tribe.","Lin Yuan was very glad that the Moon Empress had been willing to come with him to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. With her there, he did not have to worry about anything he did!","After Lin Yuan sent out this order, he called for Su Yiren and Luo Lan and explained the situation to them.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan both expressed their agreement after Lin Yuan explained the new arrangement to them. This arrangement would make it much easier for them to carry out their management roles in the future!","...","While Lin Yuan was planning out Sky City’s affairs, the Dark Pufferfish were holding a meeting in response to Fan Lou’s news.","A bigshot from the Bloodians was about to visit the Dark Pufferfish. This was highly important to them.","Moreover, it was highly likely that that Bloodian was no ordinary member but a high-ranked one!","A visit from a high-ranked Bloodian meant that this trade was extremely important to the Bloodians.","The Dark Pufferfish were not afraid of the Bloodians.","So what if a high-ranked Bloodian arrived? Would they dare to attack all the Dark Pufferfish in the Lonely River?","If they did, the Bloodians would fail to obtain the Dark Pufferfish’s poison. After all, their poison could only be secreted by living Dark Pufferfish.","The Bloodians always placed their pride above everything.","Since they had sent the Dark Pufferfish an advance notice of a visit, the Dark Pufferfish could extend the necessary courtesies to them. They would all be present to greet the visiting Bloodian.","Naturally, they jumped into action as they waited for Lin Yuan’s visit.","...","At the agreed-upon time, Lin Yuan used the Body of All Spirits to combine the Bloodian bloodline with his own.","Almost instantly, Lin Yuan’s eyes and hair turned bloody red.","Among the Bloodians, red hair and red eyes were revered. Only members with extremely high-level bloodlines possessed such hair and eye color.","A high-ranking Bloodian had to be a higher Divine Kingdom expert at the very least.","With Lin Yuan’s current aura, he was slightly lacking to pass for a high-ranking Bloodian. But he could pass for an elite Bloodian!","Lin Yuan did not know about the lie that Fan Lou had told the Dark Pufferfish, but there was no need for him to know.","When Lin Yuan appeared and confirmed that all the Dark Pufferfish had gathered, Autumn and Winter would immediately step in to take control of all the Dark Pufferfish. At that point, he could do whatever he wanted with them!","After taking control of them and gaining an understanding of the Lonely River’s circumstances, Lin Yuan could swiftly take control of the entire Lonely River.","Although Lin Yuan had time and Sky City was in no rush to develop, developing Sky City rapidly upon their arrival would undoubtedly boost the members’ morale.","While Lin Yuan headed to the Lonely River, Spring and Summer made their way to the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","Spring and Summer would first take control of the King Blood Jackals.","Once Lin Yuan had full control of the Lonely River, he could move Sky Sea into the King Blood Jackals’ territory!","Lin Yuan quickly brought Autumn and Winter with him to the location where they agreed to meet Fan Lou.","...","Fan Lou was the only one waiting for Lin Yuan.","The Forbidden Wolf Team and Light Wind Wolves were still completely unaware and feeling stressed as they thought about how Fan Lou could possibly complete the trade.","When Fan Lou saw Lin Yuan looking like a genuine Bloodian, he was astonished.","With the posture of a servant, Fan Lou led Lin Yuan to the Dark Pufferfish’s palace where he would meet with their experts.","The Lonely River’s water was turbid, and there was a large amount of mud and plants in the water.","The Dark Pufferfish’s palace was rooted in the mud and appeared rather bare.","However, based on the decoration, Lin Yuan knew that the Dark Pufferfish had invested a lot of effort into building this palace.","The pearls of the large clams hidden among the rocks at the bottom of the river and colorful stones were used to decorate this palace.","At the door of the palace stood two lavishly dressed humanoid lifeforms.","Lin Yuan frowned slightly when he saw them."]},{"number":2830,"title":"Chapter 2830 I’m Sure You Understand Words!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2830 I’m Sure You Understand Words!","This strapping young man with red hair and eyes had a dignified air about him. Indeed, he possessed the traits of an authentic Bloodian.","However, bloodline level was one matter, while power was another.","Based on the aura of this young man, it was clear that he was unrelated to a high-ranked Bloodian. Did that illegitimate wolf give them false news?","That illegitimate wolf would never be brave enough to do so.","If the information was false, it had to be the work of the Bloodians.","This matter was extremely important to the Dark Pufferfish.","It was understandable for all the Dark Pufferfish to gather to receive a high-ranked Bloodian. But there was no need to do so for a young, pure-blooded Bloodian. This was an insult to the Dark Pufferfish.","If the Dark Pufferfish let this matter go and the Bloodians spread the news, the Dark Pufferfish would become the laughingstock of the entire East Universe!","A Dark Pufferfish Elder took two steps forward and asked Lin Yuan with annoyance, “Are you the guest the Bloodians sent to visit the Lonely River? Didn’t the Bloodians tell their subordinate to inform us that a high-ranking Bloodian would be coming?”","Lin Yuan could hear the displeasure in his voice. But amidst the displeasure, there was also a hint of biding his time.","Lin Yuan did not immediately respond to the Dark Pufferfish Elder’s question. Instead, he asked loudly, “Since we’ve already sent word, that must mean all the Dark Pufferfish have gathered, right?”","The Dark Pufferfish Elder expected this young Bloodian to provide him with an explanation after being told off. He had not anticipated this young Bloodian to respond with a question of his own.","Was it possible that this was just an advance guard sent by the Bloodians and that the high-ranking Bloodian was arriving later?","If that was not the case, the Dark Pufferfish Elder could not understand how this young Bloodian could summon up such audacity!","The Dark Pufferfish always put up a strong front and were not easy to get along with.","The Dark Pufferfish Elder frowned and said, “That’s right. All the Dark Pufferfish have gathered! If a high-ranking Bloodian isn’t coming and you’ve lied to us, we will keep you here! The Dark Pufferfish aren’t—”","Lin Yuan did not allow this Dark Pufferfish Elder to finish his sentence before waving his hands.","Autumn and Winter’s auras burst out, forming a cage around the Dark Pufferfish’s palace. They also enveloped a 1,500-meter radius around the palace.","Autumn and Winter had locked the auras of all the lifeforms in this water territory. However, the lifeforms were completely unaware of this.","This was unlike the Dark Pufferfish in the palace, who felt as though they had sunk into mud. Despite being in the water, they found breathing incredibly difficult.","The Dark Pufferfish Elder looked at Winter and Autumn with astonishment. Could it be that these two experts were Bloodians?","If the Bloodians had such power, why didn’t they send such experts to the Dark Pufferfish’s territory and force them to agree to their requests? Alternatively, they could just conquer the peace-loving mermaids without trading for the Dark Pufferfish’s poison.","The Bloodians believed that power came before everything.","Regardless of how elite this young Bloodian’s bloodline was, he could not use his bloodline alone to take control of such experts!","While the Dark Pufferfish Elder was shocked by Lin Yuan’s status, he watched as this red-haired and red-eyed young man began to transform. He turned into a spirited young man with black hair and eyes!","This young man had a natural serenity about him. But in the eyes of the Dark Pufferfish Elder, Lin Yuan was like a demon who controlled the lives of all the Dark Pufferfish!","Lin Yuan walked past the Dark Pufferfish Elder and the other experts standing by the entrance of the palace.","He walked deeper into the palace and sat on the dark green throne at the back of the hall.","Autumn and Winter stood by his sides, and Autumn said softly, “Young Master, this old Dark Pufferfish isn’t lying. All the Dark Pufferfish have truly gathered. There are no Dark Pufferfish in a 1,500-meter radius.”","Lin Yuan nodded before giving them instructions, “Autumn and Winter, gather all the managers in the hall. The regular members can arrange themselves in an orderly fashion outside the hall. The Dark Pufferfish better be obedient. Otherwise, no Dark Pufferfish will ever be seen in the Lonely River in the future! There will be no need for the Dark Pufferfish to exist!”","Lin Yuan’s voice was extremely loud.","Autumn and Winter were not the only ones who heard this. All the Dark Pufferfish could hear what he said as well.","Lin Yuan first wanted to inform the Dark Pufferfish of their predicament so they would not make any impulsive or erroneous choices.","Autumn and Winter released their auras, and the Dark Pufferfish were no longer immobilized.","Autumn and Winter used their souls to relay Lin Yuan’s instructions to all the Dark Pufferfish. They instructed them to line up in orderly formations in the next ten minutes, per Lin Yuan’s instruction.","Many Dark Pufferfish chose to flee after being released by Autumn and Winter.","Soon, they found themselves squeezed by a powerful force before they were crushed in the water. Their blood stained the water around the palace.","A powerful Dark Pufferfish’s flesh was extremely nutritious for aquatic lifeforms. But due to Autumn and Winter’s auras, no aquatic lifeform dared to swim into the palace’s vicinity!","The Dark Pufferfish, who had immediately fled after being released, were extremely rebellious and would be the most difficult to keep on a leash.","By eliminating them, the Dark Pufferfish would be shocked into being obedient. With so many Dark Pufferfish killed to set an example, even the most disobedient manager eventually walked into the hall while the regular members lined up outside the hall.","This matter caused every Dark Pufferfish to become disconcerted. They did not know what was in store for their future.","Lin Yuan sensed the Dark Pufferfish’s bloodline. He believed that there was no need to use the Body of All Spirits to take control of this bloodline. There was nothing exceptional about it.","Their poison was the best part of their bloodline.","However, Lin Yuan did not intend to use his body to produce poison.","“Young Master, there are no powerful species in the entire Lonely River. That’s why the Dark Pufferfish are able to rule over the Lonely River! If there are any lifeforms more powerful than World Emperor/Divine Kingdom or have even reached the Holy Spirit realm, the Dark Pufferfish’s poison would not have been able to affect the lifeforms in the Lonely River.","“The strongest lifeforms in the Lonely River have reached the Higher Divine Kingdom level. Rather than wasting time, why don’t we take control of these lifeforms? With Autumn here to protect you, you will be safe!”","Winter always thought for Lin Yuan’s sake and put his needs first.","If Autumn was not enough to protect Lin Yuan, Winter would never have made such a suggestion!","Autumn smiled when he heard what Winter said.","If Winter went to take control of the other species in the Lonely River, he could stay there to protect Lin Yuan on his own!","He did not have many opportunities to protect Lin Yuan on his own.","Autumn really wanted to prove himself to Lin Yuan. Otherwise, he would become the least important of Lin Yuan’s four followers!","Lin Yuan nodded at Winter.","It would indeed save Lin Yuan a lot of time if Winter went to take control of the other aquatic lifeforms in the Lonely River. Moreover, with Winter’s abilities, nothing would go wrong with him handling this matter!","“Go ahead, Winter. You don’t have to think about anything else while you’re taking control of the other species in the Lonely River who can stand toe-to-toe with the Dark Pufferfish. Then, bring those species here.”","While replying to Winter, Lin Yuan was thinking of a way to take control of the Dark Pufferfish.","It would be troublesome for Lin Yuan to use the fountain of faith in the divine kingdom to take control of the Dark Pufferfish’s faith. But if he used other methods, he would not be able to guarantee their loyalty.","Autumn could guess what Lin Yuan was thinking and hurriedly said, “Young Master, it is easy for you to take control of all the Dark Pufferfish. There is a special lifeform in the Sky Beyond the Clouds known as the Faith Tree. The Dark Pufferfish have a habit of taking control of other aquatic species. They definitely have a sprout of the Faith Tree.","“All you need to do is form a contract with a Faith Tree and have the Dark Pufferfish form contracts with the Faith Tree’s fruits! The Faith Tree’s fruits will form a link between the source of these Dark Pufferfish’s faith power.","“If any Dark Pufferfish has traitorous thoughts, the Faith Tree’s fruit they have a contract with will rot. The decay will contaminate the source of faith power. The more species you control using the Faith Tree, the more faith power you will be able to collect. A few superior members of factions gain most of their faith power from the species they control using Faith Trees.”","Autumn’s words gave Lin Yuan a sudden sense of enlightenment. He felt as though doors had been opened.","It turned out that there were such benefits to taking control of species!","However, it was not easy to use a Faith Tree to take control of a species. It required the support of enormous power!","An immense pressure needed to weigh down on the entire species so that none of the members dared to have any thoughts of disobedience.","Otherwise, even if a Faith Tree was used to take control of the species, the Faith Tree’s fruits would go rotten extremely quickly.","Lin Yuan swept his gaze across all the Dark Pufferfish, and not a single one of them dared to meet his eyes.","Fan Lou had been standing behind Lin Yuan and was the epitome of obedience.","At that moment, his excitement was causing goosebumps to rise all over his body.","Fan Lou had followed numerous experts in his time. But he had never felt as exhilarated as this!","The haughty Dark Pufferfish were now reduced to sniveling weaklings. They were no longer as high and mighty as they used to be.","Fan Lou believed that if he went over now to slap every single Dark Pufferfish, they would not utter even a single word.","But Fan Lou did not do this. It went without saying that doing so would displease Lin Yuan.","Fan Lou wanted to continue remaining by Lin Yuan’s side and reaping the associated benefits!","“The Dark Pufferfish should have a Faith Tree, right? Which one of you is the leader? Bring the Faith Tree to me!”","Lin Yuan’s words did not cause anyone to stand up immediately. He said coldly, “The Dark Pufferfish are the ruling species in the Lonely River. Is your leader a coward? I don’t like tedium and will only say things once. If no one stands up, I don’t mind picking one of you to become the Dark Pufferfish’s leader.”","Lin Yuan used his hand to gently knock on the throne’s armrest, mimicking thudding noises that sounded like a countdown to death.","A frail and elderly Dark Pufferfish walked out from the crowd and clasped his hands together in front of Lin Yuan.","“Lord, my name is Ink Thorn. I am the leader of the Dark Pufferfish. Greetings, Lord. I wish you well!”","Ink Thorn had no choice but to reveal himself.","Ink Thorn did not doubt Lin Yuan’s words at all. He indeed had such abilities.","It was obvious that this young man did not intend to annihilate the Dark Pufferfish. Otherwise, he would not have asked them to give him the Faith Tree or used so much effort to gather them.","If he wanted to eliminate the Dark Pufferfish, he could have sent the two experts behind him to do so. If this young man picked a random Dark Pufferfish to become the new leader, he would be turned into a joke as the original leader!","He would also never be able to regain his status in the future while the Dark Pufferfish were under Lin Yuan’s control.","Now that it was a fact that the Dark Pufferfish were under Lin Yuan’s control, Ink Thorn needed to protect his authority.","The Dark Pufferfish were indeed nurturing their own Faith Tree sprout, and they wanted to dominate the Lonely River.","However, as the leader, Ink Thorn found it difficult to hand over the Faith Tree sprout to Lin Yuan.","When Autumn saw that Ink Thorn only greeted Lin Yuan without showing any signs of following his orders, he scoffed.","14:08","An aura enveloped Ink Thorn and broke through the defenses he was so proud of.","A mouthful of fresh blood spewed out from Ink Thorn’s mouth.","“As the leader of the Dark Pufferfish, I’m sure you understand words!”"]},{"number":2831,"title":"Chapter 2831 Four Overlords of Lonely River!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2831 Four Overlords of Lonely River!","“Are all the Dark Pufferfish disobedient, or does this only apply to your leader?”","Given the current situation, Ink Thorn dared not go against Lin Yuan’s instructions.","Ink Thorn was strongly inclined to rebel.","If Winter were in Lin Yuan’s place, he would not have given Ink Thorn any chances and would have killed him immediately.","However, doing so would only cause the problem of inciting infighting among the Dark Pufferfish as the main members fought over becoming the new leader.","Even if Lin Yuan forcefully suppressed the main members and assigned a new leader, it would be difficult for this new leader to assume control and maintain order right off the bat.","Lin Yuan frowned at Ink Thorn and paused mid-knocking on the throne’s armrest. The continuous thudding stopped.","Ink Thorn froze and dragged his body, severely injured by Autumn’s aura, over to Lin Yuan before bowing. He said, “Lord, it is the Dark Pufferfish’s honor to be taken in by you. I will go and fetch the Faith Tree’s sprout for you now. The sprout will definitely be able to grow strong as long as it can absorb a large amount of pure spirit qi. In the entire Lonely River, only the sprout nurtured by the Dark Pufferfish is capable of reaching such a level!”","The wise are those who understand their circumstances.","Ink Thorn understood his circumstances and made the best judgment based on them.","However, Ink Thorn did not know if this young man was put off by his previous actions and would order his subordinate to kill him because of it.","If there was any hope of leading the Dark Pufferfish in resistance against this enemy, Ink Thorn would not hesitate to do so for the sake of the Dark Pufferfish’s pride and future development. After all, the Dark Pufferfish are currently a free species.","Once Lin Yuan took control of the Faith Tree, the future generations of Dark Pufferfish would only be able to serve and wait upon Lin Yuan and his descendants!","The Faith Tree could be inherited through bloodline. A direct descendant’s bloodline could inherit the Faith Tree. It was not a case of servants being released once the Faith Tree’s current master died!","In order to express his respect, Ink Thorn slammed his head heavily onto the ground in a kowtow.","The Dark Pufferfish’s authoritative might dissipated with every slam and eventually vanished.","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow.","Since Ink Thorn was now obedient, there was no need to cause a large fuss.","Lin Yuan did not want to waste too much time there.","Soon, Winter would lead the other species in the Lonely River there.","The Faith Tree was enough for him to take control of the Dark Pufferfish.","Once Lin Yuan took control of the powerful species in the Lonely River, he would allow them to compete and share power.","Martial force was not sufficient for him to subdue all the species in the Lonely River. He needed to extend kindness as well as discipline.","Once he controlled the species using his power, he would use his means to win their hearts, thereby gaining a large supply of faith from these lifeforms. That was Lin Yuan’s main goal!","Ink Thorn carried a light blue jade pot and slowly walked over.","There was a light gold tree sprout growing in the jade pot. It was almost two meters tall. The tree sprout’s leaves were heart-shaped and did not have any patterns on them. They glowed with a faint light.","Autumn had already explained to Lin Yuan how he could take control of the Faith Tree sprout.","The Faith Trees’ roots needed to be planted in the fountain of faith to take control of the sprout. The faith power in the fountain of faith would then seep into the sprout.","This process took up a large amount of faith power. But once the faith power in the fountain of faith fully entered the Faith Tree, it would be ready to help its contractor take control of other species.","If the amount of faith power in the fountain of faith was low, it would immediately be drained dry by the sprout.","Only the experts of a few species were unable to contract Faith Tree sprouts but did so by force. As a result, their divine kingdoms were damaged.","Based on his level of power, Ink Thorn was unable to form a contract with the Faith Tree.","Lin Yuan was weaker than Ink Thorn. But due to the special characteristics of his divine kingdom, he had more than enough faith power in his divine kingdom to contract three to five Faith Tree sprouts.","Ink Thorn placed the Faith Tree sprout by Lin Yuan’s feet before taking a few steps back.","Ink Thorn thought that Autumn would be the one forming a contract with the Faith Tree. He never expected Lin Yuan to be the one to plant the sprout in his divine kingdom.","Astonishment appeared on Ink Thorn’s face.","A damaged divine kingdom couldn’t be healed. Was this young man not afraid of hurting his divine kingdom?","Even if this young man was not afraid of damaging his divine kingdom, the experts by his side should be warning him.","Ink Thorn was afraid that Lin Yuan would become angry once his divine kingdom was damaged and that the rage would be turned onto him. That would spell doom for him!","Time ticked by, and what Ink Thorn was worried about did not happen.","Suddenly, the fluctuations of faith power begin radiating from Lin Yuan.","A golden tree that is tens of meters tall appeared in front of Lin Yuan. Every single one of these golden tree’s golden leaves shines with orange-gold light. The orange-gold light pierced through the heart-shaped leaves like flying birds.","It was clear that Lin Yuan had used the faith power in his divine kingdom to form a contract with the Faith Tree.","Moreover, he had fully matured the Faith Tree and cultivated it until it thrived fully.","While Ink Thorn and the other Dark Pufferfish were shocked, Lin Yuan’s heart ached. The Faith Tree sprout had absorbed far more faith power than he had expected.","Luckily, Lin Yuan had accumulated sufficient faith power. Otherwise, the amount of faith power that the Faith Tree sprout drained might have affected the divine kingdom’s subsequent derivation. It might have caused the derivation to slow down!","“Okay. You will now inject faith into the Faith Tree and link it with your divine kingdoms! I always treat the people under me very well. When you work for me in the future, you will be able to receive generous rewards if you do well!”","Lin Yuan took out a Diamond fey storage box and placed it in Autumn’s hands.","Next, he told the Dark Pufferfish, “Once all of you link your divine kingdoms to the Faith Tree and it produces fruits, you will be able to obtain a spirit qi crystal each from Autumn. The spirit qi crystal contains pure spirit qi and can strengthen your bloodlines.”","The Dark Pufferfish looked shocked once again.","Spirit qi had to be of a certain purity for it to be used to strengthen bloodlines.","Lin Yuan used martial force to take control of the Dark Pufferfish. There was no need for a superior to lie to a subordinate.","However, it was difficult to imagine one providing such a large amount of pure spirit qi.","Every lifeform that lived in the Sky Beyond the Clouds knew how precious pure spirit qi was.","Instead of keeping it for himself, Lin Yuan was giving away the spirit qi as a reward. This meant that he had no lack of pure spirit that could strengthen bloodlines.","Ink Thorn could not begin to dream of the faction that Lin Yuan came from.","It might not be bad for the Dark Pufferfish to become the servants of such a powerful faction!","Ink Thorn was the first to step forward to inject faith power into Lin Yuan’s Faith Tree. Once the Faith Tree was familiar with his faith, it formed a link with his divine kingdom.","The moment Ink Thorn sensed that his divine kingdom was linked with the Faith Tree, a golden fruit the size of a thumb grew beneath a heart-shaped leaf.","By providing the Faith Tree with his faith power, he was also aiding its growth. Because of his faith, the Faith Tree grew many new leaves.","Ink Thorn had initially prepared this Faith Tree for himself. But now, it was being used to take control of him instead.","Before Ink Thorn could rue his predicament, he received a spirit qi crystal from Autumn.","Ink Thorn carefully crushed the spirit qi crystal, and spirit qi beyond Ink Thorn’s imagination entered his body, nourishing him.","His bloodline began circulating under the nourishment of the pure spirit qi.","This comfort caused Ink Thorn to let out a soft sigh.","The way that Ink Thorn looked at Lin Yuan changed.","The spirit qi that Lin Yuan gave to the Dark Pufferfish could do more than just trigger bloodlines. The spirit qi was sufficient to activate his genetic model.","Ink Thorn had never had the right to come into contact with such resources.","By now, this black-haired and black-eyed young man no longer had the aura of a Bloodian.","Ink Thorn could not be certain of Lin Yuan’s identity. But at this moment, Lin Yuan seemed far superior to a high-ranking Bloodian!","With the Bloodians’ foundation, even if they could produce such pure spirit qi, they would not be able to produce much of it, much less give it to every Dark Pufferfish!","The logic behind Lin Yuan’s actions was simple. He wanted to offer a mix of positive and negative consequences.","However, the positive consequence that Lin Yuan offered was better than anything that the Dark Pufferfish had ever experienced.","Lin Yuan had not expected this.","Currently, Lin Yuan did not have a complete understanding of the degree of poverty in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. But it would not take long before he came to understand this.","This was because once Lin Yuan had control over all the species in the Lonely River, he would pick 100 lifeforms with whom Genius could connect using Connected Tails. This would allow Lin Yuan to gain a complete understanding of the circumstances of the Lonely River and, by extension, the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan was fully focused on growing the Faith Tree.","There were now thousands of glittering golden fruits growing on the Faith Tree. At first, the Faith Tree had only been a few tens of meters tall. But now, it was more than 500 meters tall.","Luckily, the Dark Pufferfish’s palace was sufficiently grand. Otherwise, the Faith Tree would have broken through the roof.","The Dark Pufferfish managers all received spirit qi crystals.","Soon, the regular Dark Pufferfish began dedicating their faith to the Faith Tree.","The spirit qi crystals were a reward for the Dark Pufferfish managers. The regular Dark Pufferfish received water-type heavenly-maiden-grade elemental pearls as a reward.","Even if the quality of the rewards fell, the regular Dark Pufferfish would still be more than satisfied.","It was not long before news came from Winter.","Winter had taken control of the Hidden Fog Turtles, Mantis Stone Crabs, and Shadow-Hunting Stingrays.","These four species were known as the Four Species Overlords of Lonely River. They were the strongest species in the Lonely River.","Fan Lou had already introduced them to Lin Yuan.","Winter needed time to bring these three species to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan used this opportunity to summon Genius and used Genius to investigate the Dark Pufferfish’s memories so it could vividly describe the past few thousand years of events that had taken place in the Lonely River.","The Lonely River was an unimpressive place compared to the rest of the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Nonetheless, its development had been an exciting one.","Lin Yuan watched the rise and death of hundreds of species.","In spite of the thousands of species that had gone extinct in the Lonely River in the past few thousand years, there were always new species entering the Lonely River and joining the fray.","The Dark Pufferfish, Hidden Fog Turtles, Shadow-Hunting Stingrays, and Mantis Stone Crabs could dominate the Lonely River because they each had their own competencies.","The Dark Pufferfish could contaminate water with the poison in their bodies. Once one was afflicted with the Dark Pufferfish’s poison, one would lose the ability to control water elements.","The Hidden Fog Turtles mainly controlled the upper section of the Lonely River and produced a large amount of fog on the river’s surface.","When flying feys crossed the Lonely River, the Hidden Fog Turtles would shoot out jets of water to attack them.","The Hidden Fog Turtles were not strong at doing combat in water. They were one of the Four Species Overlords of Lonely River because they had extremely strong defensive abilities. Not even the Mantis Stone Crabs’ giant pincers could break past the Hidden Fog Turtles’ defenses!","The Mantis Stone Crabs used their bodies in battle. While they were attacking, they utilized both thunder elements and fire elements. When coupled with their extremely strong defensive abilities, they were able to stand above the Dark Pufferfish, Hidden Fog Turtles, and Shadow-Hunting Stingrays. The other three species’ members could not compete with the Mantis Stone Crabs’ members.","The Shadow-Hunting Stingrays were the most mysterious of the Four Species Overlords of Lonely River. All of them were like assassins in the Lonely River.","Their concealment and hunting abilities were unmatched in the Lonely River. None of the species in the Lonely River wanted to make an enemy out of the Shadow-Hunting Stingrays.","When the Shadow-Hunting Stingrays robbed them of their resources, they usually chose to accept the short-term loss and would not begrudge the Shadow-Hunting Stingrays over it.","If the Shadow-Hunting Stingrays did not lack ambition and had a small number of members who were not united, they would likely have already conquered the Lonely River.","The Dark Pufferfish’s unreasonable demands of the Bloodians were related to the Shadow-Hunting Stingrays to a certain extent.","The Dark Pufferfish had lost too much in their fights with the Shadow-Hunting Stingrays and were in urgent need of a large amount of resources to bolster their store of resources."]},{"number":2832,"title":"Chapter 2832 Master of the Lonely River!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2832 Master of the Lonely River!","It was precisely because of this that the Dark Pufferfish attempted to corner the Bloodians and acquire a significant amount of resources from them.","However, it was also easy to take control of the Shadow-Hunting Stingrays, who were akin to water assassins.","Winter was much more decisive than Autumn when it came to execution.","Winter had already eliminated the disobedient members of the three species.","If he brought the disobedient members to Lin Yuan, it would be an insult to Lin Yuan, and it was unlikely that the rebellious members could be straightened out using martial force.","Lin Yuan would not be focusing on the Lonely River.","Winter did not want the three species he took in to cause problems in the future and lead Lin Yuan to think that he was incompetent.","Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter were all Lin Yuan’s followers and had spent many epochs together. Before they found him, they had been each other’s closest companions. But after finding him, their relationship changed from that of companions to rivals who competed for Lin Yuan’s favor.","Winter did not want Lin Yuan to stop relying on him!","The Dark Pufferfish’s leader, Ink Thorn, Mantis Stone Crab’s leader, Mantis Age, Hidden Fog Turtle leader, Booming Fog, and Shadow-Hunting Stingray’s leader, Hunting Tracks, were old friends.","The four species had sparred and collaborated countless times during their time living in the Lonely River. They had schemed against each other in the past.","This especially applied to Mantis Age and Booming Fog. In a few tens of thousands of years, the two sides became bitter enemies.","The Hidden Fog Turtle, Mantis Stone Crab, and Shadow-Hunting Stingray’s leaders were all in shock and disbelief. They remained frozen with astonishment up to the point that Winter brought them to Lin Yuan.","But in spite of their shock, the three of them were well aware that this black-haired and black-eyed young man was not someone they could fight back against. The species members who had tried to rebel had all paid horrible prices!","This price could not be afforded by Mantis Age, Booming Fog, and Hunting Tracks.","If many of their members died, their combat power would fall by at least 1/5. This would undoubtedly affect their future development.","In the face of such an overwhelmingly powerful faction, the three of them did not mind allowing this faction to take control of their species.","Many of the species on the East Universe’s Species Ranking were supported by factions.","However, the three of them were still unsure of the kind of person that Lin Yuan was.","But regardless of Lin Yuan’s character and whether he was going to treat the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords as toys, they would definitely be leading their members in dedicating their faith to his Faith Tree.","Clearly, Ink Thorn had led the Dark Pufferfish to become loyal to this young man.","The three of them turned their gazes to Ink Thorn to try and discern something from his expression.","This black-haired and black-eyed young man had two experts under him with immeasurable power. With such power, they need not come up with any ways to scheme and take down the Dark Pufferfish!","Hence, it was likely that the Dark Pufferfish fell under this young man’s control one by one.","Having lost his freedom, Ink Thorn should be downcast.","However, Mantis Age and the rest could not see any solemness on Ink Thorn’s face. Rather, he looked shocked and even happy.","This emotion should not be present on his face now!","At that moment, the three of them heard Lin Yuan say, “Ink Thorn, you should be familiar with the three of them. Explain to them clearly what I just told you!”","Ink Thorn was surprised to hear Lin Yuan’s instruction.","Ink Thorn felt as though he had gotten close to Lin Yuan, and the latter was now relying on him. This was an amazing feeling!","Ink Thorn hoped to become Lin Yuan’s point of contact in the Lonely River.","However, he knew that Lin Yuan wanted power in the Lonely River to be shared equally and would not give him such an opportunity.","There were many times when being prepared was not enough to receive opportunities.","He and the rest were insignificant in the eyes of this young man. It was unlikely they would even have the opportunity to interact with Lin Yuan’s two servants.","Ink Thorn had guessed Lin Yuan’s thoughts exactly.","Lin Yuan used martial force to compel the four major species in the Lonely River to become loyal to him. He did not believe that the four species who had been forced to give up their faith to him would be willing to work wholeheartedly for his sake.","In the entire Sky City, Bei Xu needed the most training. He lacked an avenue from which he could receive training.","The Lonely River would be the best place for Bei Xu to train!","With the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords under his control, there was nothing that could pose a danger to Bei Xu in the Lonely River.","By having Bei Xu manage the Lonely River, it would be able to develop rapidly.","Otherwise, as time went on and Bei Xu lagged further and further behind the other members of Sky City, he would sink deeper into self-doubt!","Lin Yuan could already clearly sense that the pressure was causing Bei Xu to lose his usual talkative liveliness.","While Bei Xu was managing the Lonely River, Lin Yuan would send Endless Summer to support Bei Xu for some time.","Endless Summer had come to Lin Yuan and told him that she wanted to work with Listen on resource allocation-related tasks in the future.","Lin Yuan agreed with Endless Summer’s future plan for Listen. That was where her talents lay.","However, they had only just arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds and decided on a territory. They had yet to build channels for trade. Listen and Endless Summer did not currently have anything to do.","But neither Endless Summer nor Listen could sit still and be idle.","After helping Lin Yuan to take over the King Blood Jackals’ territory, Listen would manage the resources in the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","Endless Summer could also help Lin Yuan to organize the resources in the Lonely River while she was supporting Bei Xu. She would then be able to distribute the Lonely River’s resources.","From then on, the Lonely River would become the moat of Sky City’s territory.","Ink Thorn told Mantis Age, Hunting Tracks, and Booming Fog about Lin Yuan’s requests and rewards.","Once the three of them heard these, they felt exactly the same way that Ink Thorn did. They were floored.","The three of them had not expected Lin Yuan to give such an abundance of resources as rewards to the species he had only recently taken control of.","It was clear that their existence did not matter much to Lin Yuan. Yet, he was willing to give them such impressive resources. This just meant that Lin Yuan possessed a quantity of resources beyond their imaginations!","Their species would only be able to walk toward brighter futures by following such a person.","...","By the time Lin Yuan left the Lonely River, his Faith Tree was already 3,000 meters tall. He could sense that it was currently supplying him with an endless stream of faith. Although it was not a large quantity, it was sufficiently pure.","The Faith Tree was able to increase the purity of faith power. But it was this reason that made it come across as useless.","How could lifeforms that obtained the Faith Tree be as capable as Lin Yuan when it came to taking control of other lifeforms?","The Lonely River had a new ruler now.","The Four Species Overlords would continue to compete among themselves, but they now had a common master.","It could be said that the Lonely River had fully entered a new era.","When Fan Lou followed Lin Yuan around, he had almost no chance to speak. However, as an observer, Fan Lou had a clearer understanding of Lin Yuan’s process of taking over the Lonely River.","The Dark Pufferfish were not the only ones under Lin Yuan’s control. The other three overlord species, just as powerful as the Dark Pufferfish, had also become Lin Yuan’s servants!","This revelation gave Fan Lou a completely new understanding of Lin Yuan’s power.","Lin Yuan had not employed any schemes to take control of the three species.","Winter had just made a suggestion that Lin Yuan happened to find feasible. Soon after, the three species were all subdued.","His mission was successfully accomplished. All this was done almost unknowingly.","The Forbidden Wolf Team and Light Wind Wolves on the Abyssal Beast’s back were completely unaware of this.","Later, all he needed to do was work with the Dark Pufferfish and put on a show in front of Feng Nuo.","Even if Lin Yuan did not issue orders to the Dark Pufferfish, they would undoubtedly be willing to cooperate with him because he had come with Lin Yuan.","Fan Luo had been standing by Lin Yuan’s side all this time. It was clear that he was much closer to Lin Yuan than they were!","Lin Yuan stood on the shore of the Lonely River, a river of emotions washing over him.","Luckily, he was the reincarnation of the Saint and had Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter following him. Otherwise, after defeating Tower Canon and somehow escaping Crimson’s assassination attempt, he would be severely injured and might not have time to recover before facing an invasion from the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","By that time, Lin Yuan had already possessed World Emperor/Divine Kingdom power.","With his few World Emperor/Divine Kingdom feys, even if he had managed to defeat Fan Lou, he would never have managed to emerge victorious over an expert of Kong Huan’s level.","At that point, he would not have been the one taking control of Kong Huan but would have instead ended up in the palm of her hand!","Lin Yuan felt it was unlikely that Kong Huan would have killed him. Rather, she would have taken him to the Sky Beyond the Clouds and kept him as a pet.","Hence, fate was a marvelous thing.","But even if Kong Huan had captured him, Lin Yuan would never reveal his secrets. He would bide his time and grow before attempting to fight back against Kong Huan.","However, he would not be able to protect himself in such a situation, much less safeguard the world.","Lin Yuan found it difficult to imagine what would become of the main world then.","Kong Huan was docile and humble in front of Lin Yuan because he possessed the pinnacle Alluring Soul bloodline and had control over her divine kingdom.","In truth, Kong Huan was extremely selfish and violent.","Almost none of her subordinates could vouch for her with words of positivity.","If Lin Yuan had not coincidentally taken control of Fan Lou, the latter would also have been killed by Kong Huan.","In this colossal world, fate was sewn into every passing second and minute.","Lin Yuan really liked this feeling of living on the edge of the knife.","“Fan Lou, go back. When you’re trading for the poison with the Dark Pufferfish, you can take another 500,000 Honor Absent dollars from them. Tell Ink Thorn that I’m the one telling him to pay you. He won’t hold back.”","Honor Absent dollars were the currency used in the East Universe. It was produced and distributed by Honor Absent Palace.","However, given that various resources had undeterminable values, resources were usually used for bartering. Alternatively, spirit qi or faith power of a certain power were used. After all, one spiritual ingredient held different values for different species.","Nonetheless, Honor Absent dollars could indeed be used for purchasing goods. They could be used to buy various rare resources directly from Honor Absent Palace!","Lin Yuan had given Fan Lou sufficient rewards.","As the captain of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team, Fan Lou was normally paid less than 700,000 Honor Absent dollars a year. One reward from Lin Yuan was already worth six months of his annual compensation.","The key point was that Fan Lou had not even done that much. All that he had done for Lin Yuan had also been for his benefit.","Fan Lou seriously knelt in front of Lin Yuan with his hands clasped together into fists as he said, “Lord, thank you for your generous reward! I will do my best to carry out all the tasks you give me! Do you have any other instructions for me?”","Lin Yuan said seriously, “Next, I need you to pay attention to the Bloodians’ movements. Observe how they plan on attacking the mermaids, then report what you find to me. It’ll be best if you use the paper I gave you. But if you can’t, you can continue communicating with me through that jade crystal. Remember that the Bloodians’ activities are very important to me.”","Lin Yuan was not paying attention to the conflict between the Bloodians and mermaids because he pitied the mermaids. He was concerned that the Bloodians’ declaration of war would cause the mermaids to vanish from the East Universe. If that happened, he would not be able to use the mermaids to nurture Dark Blue and increase its power.","Lin Yuan needed to think for the sake of his feys!","Additionally, Lin Yuan sensed the benefits of the Bloodian bloodline.","Apart from using spirit qi, the best method was to absorb the high-grade bloodlines of the same species.","Lin Yuan needed to make contact with the Bloodians.","While he did this, he would continuously obtain the high-grade Bloodian bloodlines to strengthen his own bloodline and combat power of his body.","Fan Lou felt immense pressure on his shoulders when he heard Lin Yuan’s instructions.","He was favored by Feng Qing and did not have any links to the Bloodians. The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves stood between him and the Bloodians.","There were many species, like the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, who were working with the Bloodians. The latter were only considered upper-middle of the group.","It was impossible for him to go over the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ heads to communicate with the Bloodians.","Even if he became ten times more outstanding than he was now, he would never catch the eye of the Bloodians.","Feng Qing would never have agreed if he had encouraged him to approach the Bloodians for more information. Instead, Feng Qing would become repulsed by him and think that he had ulterior motives!","He was completely reliant on Feng Qing in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","But since Lin Yuan had spoken, he could not say that he could not achieve it!","While Fan Lou was struggling, Lin Yuan added, “I understand your concerns. Since this is something I’m assigning to you, I won’t make it too difficult for you. The Dark Pufferfish will take the initiative to create an opportunity for you to make contact with the Bloodians!”"]},{"number":2833,"title":"Chapter 2833 Frigid’s Opportunity!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2833 Frigid’s Opportunity!","Lin Yuan was aware of Fan Lou’s capabilities.","Lin Yuan used Fan Lou because he wanted Fan Lou to work for him. As long as Fan Lou worked for him, Lin Yuan would give him benefits and would not make his life unnecessarily difficult.","Even if Fan Lou made a mistake, he could just eliminate him.","Fan Lou’s worries were unnecessary.","If Lin Yuan wanted Fan Lou to complete a task, he would do his best to pave the way for him.","The Dark Pufferfish would not trade their poison to the Bloodians in a one-time deal. When Fan Lou returned, there would be two Dark Pufferfish going with him.","These two Dark Pufferfish experts would interact with the Bloodians and name Fan Lou as the liaison to the Dark Pufferfish.","This way, Fan Lou would be able to successfully become acquainted with the Bloodians and would also become more important to Feng Qing.","Based on Fan Lou’s memories, Lin Yuan understood that Feng Qing was very pragmatic and believed in luck. Feng Qing felt that his luck had taken a turn for the better ever since Fan Lou appeared and that it was Fan Lou who had brought him significant benefits. It was for all these reasons that he heavily favored Fan Lou.","This time, Fan Lou had not only done a good job with Feng Qing’s task but had also brought him significant benefits.","The Dark Pufferfish were even stronger than the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Feng Qing would be delighted to be approached by a strong species. His position among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves would be elevated as a result.","Just like how Kong Huan had to contend with rivals among the Alluring Foxes, Feng Qing also had rivals among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Feng Qing’s rivals were not weak, and his position had been shaken in an incident a few years ago.","Fan Lou was unaware of all of this, but it did not prevent him from realizing, based on Lin Yuan’s words, the benefits that he would be receiving. Fan Lou could not contain his joy.","Before this operation, Fan Lou only thought about completing Lin Yuan’s task and preserving his own life. He never expected Lin Yuan to give him such a major opportunity.","Lin Yuan gave Fan Lou 500,000 Honor Absent dollars and numerous spirit qi crystals. These resources caused Fan Lou to be overcome with elation.","But Fan Lou was actually after the elevation of his status. Once his status was raised, he would be able to enjoy the comforts of the upper class.","In the past, Fan Lou could only wield his power and indulge in luxury among the Light Wind Wolves. He needed to walk on eggshells when it came to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","After this operation, he would not even have to continue keeping his guard up among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves!","Moreover, once he caught the Bloodians’ attention, he would be able to slowly wean himself off his reliance on Feng Qing.","Suddenly, a thought appeared in Fan Lou’s head.","As long as he did his best under Lin Yuan, he might be able to turn the tables on Feng Qing and become someone whom Feng Qing needed to rely on!","Unlike other superiors he had served in the past, Lin Yuan did not wait for Fan Lou to express his unending gratitude.","All Lin Yuan did was calmly turn his gaze to Fan Lou.","“I like people who know their place. All you need to do is work hard at the tasks you’re given.”","Lin Yuan did not give Fan Lou many instructions or words of encouragement. Fan Lou made sure to take his words to heart.","Lin Yuan then used Node Transportation to return to Sky Sea’s back.","Spring and Summer had sent messages. They informed him that the King Blood Jackals were much stronger than expected but were not a big issue for the two of them. They were easily able to take control of the King Blood Jackals.","The King Blood Jackals’ current queen was close to reaching Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit.","With experts of such power present in the remote area North of the Lonely River, it was no wonder that the King Blood Jackals were able to occupy such a large proportion of the resources and deter other species from the area. It was impossible to achieve this without ferocious power!","But taking control of them was one matter as the King Blood Jackals had violent tempers, and it was very difficult to tame them through regular means.","The King Blood Jackal Queen had not stopped resisting violently.","Spring and Summer did not do anything else. Rather, they waited for Lin Yuan to arrive so he could decide what to do.","In regular fights among species, the most time and effort-saving method was to kill the stubborn King Blood Jackal Queen.","But now, Lin Yuan urgently needed help.","Once the King Blood Jackal Queen gave up her loyalty, he would essentially gain a competent general.","The King Blood Jackals were not considered one of the ruling species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and had been under the control of another powerful species in the past.","In order to gain the loyalty of the King Blood Jackal Queen, benefits apart from martial force and intimidation were necessary!","The King Blood Jackal bloodline could strengthen explosive abilities and was of an acceptable standard for Lin Yuan to absorb through the Body of All Spirits.","...","As Summer looked at the golden-haired female warrior who was continuing to thrash and wail despite being chained up, she shook her head in frustration.","This blonde sure was stubborn!","But a personality as stubborn as this would become exceptionally loyal once she was tamed.","For an expert like the King Blood Jackal Queen, who had her own unique bloodline, the most attractive bait was the prospect of strengthening her bloodline.","The King Blood Jackal Queen’s bloodline had reached the peak of its current level. Hence, Lin Yuan would easily be able to trigger a bloodline transformation in her.","The King Blood Jackal Queen’s bloodline was akin to a bottle that was fully filled.","When Lin Yuan used the Body of All Spirits to evolve the King Blood Jackal Queen’s bloodline, he would essentially be pouring more water into the bottle. The bottle would eventually crack under the pressure from the water.","This was the strength of the Body of All Spirits!","...","Once Lin Yuan received the messages from Spring and Summer, he decided to ride Sky Sea to the sky above the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","For a species like the King Blood Jackals that Lin Yuan intended to take control of, he did not mind them finding out about Sky Sea’s existence. This was because he would eventually have stronger control over them than he did the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords!","Sky Sea moved extremely quickly, and the villages under Wen Yu, Liu Jie, and the rest would never be able to keep up. Moreover, it would not be suitable to relocate the villages in such a large-scale migration.","Once Lin Yuan had fully cleared out the King Blood Jackals’ territory, he would arrange for the villages to be relocated to areas with an abundance of resources.","The lifeforms in the villages would be given citizenship and take up residence in the territories. They could use their labor and contributions to trade for resources and improve their quality of life. From then on, they would not need to wait to be fed.","This would not only give them pride but also set the goal of improving their standard of living!","Lin Yuan told the Moon Empress of this situation, and she could not help but express her amazement.","Lin Yuan’s development in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was progressing extremely differently from her expectations.","After arriving in a higher-level world, Lin Yuan did not struggle to survive. Rather, he immediately began thriving.","She could no longer help him in terms of martial force. Rather, she now needed him to protect her.","But when it came to managing territories, she was still able to be of help to her disciple!","Besides the Moon Empress, Lin Yuan also told Wen Yu, Liu Jie, Su Yiren, and the other main members of Sky City about the situation.","Lin Yuan did not need to invest too much effort into managing his territories.","Truthfully, in the faction known as Sky City, Lin Yuan never saw himself as a trailblazer but as a producer. He would only be able to increase his own value by producing as many resources as possible!","This was an ability that no other member of Sky City could replicate and was the foundation of Sky City itself.","Otherwise, even if Sky City had its current lineup, it would not have sufficient resources. Even the most talented and resourceful people were unable to accomplish anything without the necessary materials. Sky City would never have been able to develop to its current extent!","The King Blood Jackals had to have many feys or special resources that could be nurtured in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Almost all of the resources in the Spirit Lock spatial zone came from the main world. They would need to be overhauled and upgraded now that they were in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","In truth, Lin Yuan had been bothered by something before coming to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. He was worried about whether he would be able to continue obtaining spirit qi crystals by helping feys evolve like he did in the past. This was why Lin Yuan had been doing his best to gather and stock up on as many spirit qi crystals as he could back in the main world.","But once Lin Yuan arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds and witnessed the small villages, he knew that he had been overly concerned!","It was far easier to obtain spirit qi crystals in the Sky Beyond the Clouds than in the main world. While collecting the spirit qi crystals, Lin Yuan could even help the lifeforms who had reached the necessary grade to overcome their World Cleansings as a form of rewarding them.","Over the past few days, numerous lifeforms in the villages evolved.","The Sky Beyond the Clouds’ world wills were much stronger than those of the main world. Hence, it was also two to three times more challenging to evolve lifeforms here than in the main world.","However, the lifeforms did not differ greatly in power.","It was because it was two to three times more difficult that many lifeforms lost their lives in the process. The lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds who did not have anyone to support them did not dare to carelessly attempt evolutions.","It was the greatest gift to any faction if one could help them successfully complete their evolutions.","...","Lin Yuan had obtained a few types of special strange water from the Dark Pufferfish. The strange water was much stronger than the special-grade strange water found in the Class 5 water world dimensional rifts of the main world.","Lin Yuan had learned from Hunting Tracks that such strange water was produced in large quantities in the Lonely River.","Each time the strange water appeared, brawls would take place in the Lonely River.","Strange water was often produced in the large rivers and lakes in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan only needed to put his mind to it, and he would be able to obtain an endless stream of strange water.","Dark Blue was not the only one who needed the strange water. It would also have wondrous effects on Frigid.","Frigid needed to absorb a large amount of attributes from strange water to evolve.","Sky Sea would take some time before arriving at the King Blood Jackals’ territory. Lin Yuan could use this opportunity to use the strange water to nurture Frigid.","Lin Yuan had not paid attention to Frigid in a very long time.","But even if top-grade strange water could not significantly evolve Frigid, Lin Yuan had not stopped supplying resources to it.","Frigid was currently Sovereign/Creation. If not for his fear of cutting off Frigid’s evolution potential, Lin Yuan could have already evolved Frigid to Immortal Breed when he was in the main world.","Lin Yuan lifted his hand and summoned Frigid.","Frigid had a calm personality and did not like to interact with others. This was a trait it shared with its contractor, Lin Yuan.","A group of strange fish accompanied Frigid. They were covered with a thick layer of bone-like scales. The reflection off of the bones filled the space with coldness. These fish were Frigid’s Poisonous Magic, and they were called the Cold Season Poisonous Fishes.","This was one of Frigid’s combat techniques.","Compared to Barren beasts and demons, the sea demons’ abilities mostly involved boosting precious instruments.","With Frigid’s current power, it could easily boost a 10 Stars precious instrument past 12 Stars to reach a new level!","The Sky Beyond the Clouds’ ingredients and materials were far better than what Lin Yuan had access to in the main world. Hence, Lin Yuan would definitely be forging new precious instruments.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on Frigid and the Cold Season Poisonous Fishes.","[Fey Name]: Purple Frigid Sea Demon Emperor","[Fey Species]: Sea demon emperor species/sea demon species","[Fey Grade]: Sovereign (5/10)","[Fey Type]: Water","[Fey Quality]: Creation Breed","Life Water:","[Purple Frigid Heavy Water (Jellyfish)]: When it absorbs water, the water sprite will start to grow until it reaches its limit. At its limit, every drop of water in the water sprite will be as heavy as 1,000 gold pieces and flow out in all directions. Once it comes into contact with a friendly target, the frigidity in the water will gather on the surface of the target and increase its defense. When it comes into contact with an enemy target, the frigidity and curse will cause the part of the target that it comes into contact with to freeze and be injured. The curse in the frozen target can explode and attack the target’s soul, causing it to become frozen forever. It will then become a Cold Frost Soul that has the ability to boost soul power. (It is in the midst of evolving into the independent sea. Once the evolution is successful, the water sprite and independent sea can swap between each other.)","Life Poisonous Magic:","[Cold Season Poisonous Fish (School of Fish)]: The school of fish will place a curse on a lifeform in the area. Every subsequent year that the lifeform stays alive, a cold curse will accumulate in it. Every layer of the cold curse will slow down the circulation of its blood, spiritual power, spiritual energy, and soul power. After it uses its tail to pierce the cursed target, the accumulated curse in the target’s body will explode. This will not only harm the target but also allow the Cold Season Poisonous Fish to absorb the cold season power that accumulates alongside each additional layer of the cold curse. (Every additional Cold Season Poisonous Fish that appears will increase the amount of cold season absorbed by 20%) Once there is a sufficient amount of the cold season power, the sea demon’s bloodline power can be used to substantially boost a precious instrument.","After checking on them, Lin Yuan said, “Frigid, you have always wanted to evolve into the independent sea. You never wanted to remain as a water lifeform. Your chance is here!”"]},{"number":2834,"title":"Chapter 2834 The Attacking Alluring Foxes!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2834 The Attacking Alluring Foxes!","Frigid was rather obstinate. Lin Yuan knew that he had affected it mentally by limiting its evolution all this time. As a result, Frigid felt that it was not important to him.","“In the past, I didn’t allow you to evolve because the level of strange water I had access to was too low. But now that we’re in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, its natural environment produces extremely high-quality strange water.","“If you evolve now, the independent sea you transform into will be able to absorb even more attributes. Dark Blue is grown up now. Once you transform into the independent sea, you will be able to work with Dark Blue and help each other.”","As obstinate as Frigid was, it knew that Lin Yuan was doing this in its best interests.","Frigid was not the type to be ungratefully ignorant!","Frigid had always been on good terms with Dark Blue. In the beginning, Lin Yuan kept both of them in the same body of water.","The mermaid bloodline was attractive to the sea demon bloodline. Hence, Frigid felt naturally close to Dark Blue.","Now, there were many mermaids living in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, and Frigid was very happy living there.","Once it was able to transform into the independent sea, the mermaids would be able to live in its body!","But as of now, Lin Yuan was still in no rush to evolve Frigid into the independent sea. He would continue to allow Frigid to absorb even more water-elemental attributes.","It went without saying that there was a limit to the number of attributes it could control.","It was only when it could no longer absorb any more water-elemental attributes into its body and doing so would harm its body that Frigid would be ready to transform into the independent sea!","Lin Yuan gave the strange water that contained special attributes to Frigid so it could absorb them.","Rather than evolving Frigid, Lin Yuan was more interested in evolving the Cold Season Poisonous Fishes.","The Cold Season Poisonous Fishes had yet to show signs of further evolution ever since they evolved into a school of fish.","As Frigid’s Poisonous Magic, the Cold Season Poisonous Fishes were linked to the strength of Frigid’s bloodline. Once its bloodline evolved, the Cold Season Poisonous Fishes would definitely evolve further!","As fast as Sky Sea was, North of the Lonely River was so large that they were still some distance away from the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","Lin Yuan felt that he needed to nurture some feys that could travel rapidly to cross this barren land. It would be best if these feys could ferry a large number of people.","Otherwise, it would take an extremely long time to relocate all the villages!","However, Lin Yuan still had no idea where to find such feys.","Lin Yuan needed to speed up his exploration of the Sky Beyond the Clouds to discover new feys.","Fan Lou had already met with Ink Thorn as Lin Yuan’s representative.","At Fan Lou’s level, he did not have the right to meet with Ink Thorn, the Dark Pufferfish’s leader.","Yet, Ink Thorn was treating Fan Lou like he was a valued guest.","Once again, Fan Lou felt the benefits of being by Lin Yuan’s side.","When had he ever been as distinguished as this?","“Lord Ink Thorn, Lord Lin Yuan has asked you to provide me with 500,000 Honor Absent dollars. You are to go with me to speak to the Bloodians so that the Bloodians will begin paying attention to me and taking me seriously. I’m sure that, with your partnership with the Bloodians, this won’t be difficult to achieve.”","Ink Thorn deserved to be addressed in such a way by Fan Lou. Even if the Dark Pufferfish were already under Lin Yuan’s control, the power they wielded was undeniable.","But for Fan Lou to address him as ‘Lord’, followed by Lin Yuan in the same manner, Ink Thorn could not accept being addressed in such a way!","He was terrified that news of his inappropriate behavior would reach Lin Yuan and displease him. Even if Lin Yuan could act as though he did not care about this, his two servants would not be able to let it slide!","From Ink Thorn’s interactions with Lin Yuan, he could tell how protective his two servants were of his reputation and authority.","Ink Thorn knew that Fan Lou said this because he was trying to take the initiative and handle matters.","It was indeed necessary for Ink Thorn to try and get on the good side of Fan Lou, Lin Yuan’s aide. However, he could not bear to address Fan Lou as ‘Lord’.","“If this is Lord Lin Yuan’s request, 500,000 Honor Absent dollars won’t be a problem. It is fate that has brought us together. I am very willing to offer 200,000 Honor Absent dollars as a token of our budding friendship!”","Ink Thorn was not concerned about Fan Lou lying to him. If Lin Yuan had any other instructions in the future, he would deliver them to him directly.","Lin Yuan had given him, Mantis Age, Hunting Tracks, and the rest of the paper that they could use for communication. This made it extremely easy for them to communicate with each other.","Even if Lin Yuan did not issue orders to him directly, Ink Thorn could ask Lin Yuan about this interaction with Fan Lou. The more they communicated, the better their relationship would become!","It was clear that Fan Lou, who was trying to put on airs and keep him in check, was nothing more than a petty, trivial figure.","Fan Lou’s behavior told Ink Thorn everything about the kind of person he was.","With such a person, money was enough for them to establish a relationship.","Ink Thorn did not hope that Fan Lou would speak favorably of him to Lin Yuan. It would be enough as long as he did not try to harm the Dark Pufferfish!","If Fan Lou wanted to maintain a stable relationship with the Bloodians, he would also need to rely on the Dark Pufferfish.","Fan Lou had no thoughts of obtaining extra resources from Ink Thorn. Still, he could not be happier if Ink Thorn was willing to voluntarily provide him with more resources.","“Your Excellency, I can tell that you are easy to get along with. I hope that we will have a happy partnership going forward! I will be sure to tell Lord Lin Yuan about the Dark Pufferfish’s contributions. Later, please send a Dark Pufferfish expert to put on a show with me in front of the Forbidden Wolf Team.”","But the moment that Fan Lou mentioned the Forbidden Wolf Team, a flash of disdain caused Ink Thorn to frown.","Ink Thorn was unaware of Fan Lou’s situation and saw him as another member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Compared to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, Fan Lou’s Chaos Wind Demon Wolf bloodline was relatively faint. It was an enormous blessing for someone like him to be employed by his species.","But not only was Fan Lou not looking out for his species, but he was taking such an attitude toward them.","This caused Ink Thorn to feel sickened by Fan Lou.","Someone like Fan Lou would not only bring any benefits to his species but could even lead them to their doom. If ever the opportunity arose, he would not hesitate to toss aside the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and use them as his springboard.","Ink Thorn forcefully concealed his revulsion of Fan Lou.","Ink Thorn could tell that Fan Lou was a sensitive person. If he displayed his aversion, Fan Lou would definitely pick up on it.","If that happened, his previous gestures of building an amicable relationship with him would be for naught!","“That goes without saying. I will tell the member who received you to maintain contact with you. The two of you can discuss the details of what you’re going to do.”","Ink Thorn put all thoughts of strengthening his relationship with Fan Lou out of his mind and left the Dark Pufferfish’s palace.","He was going to accept Hunting Tracks’ invitation to a joint discussion on the management and organization of the entire Lonely River.","If Lin Yuan had not taken control of the Lonely River and the Four Species Overlords, he, Hunting Tracks, Mantis Age, and the rest would never gather together like this to work for a common cause.","Fan Lou did not know that his actions had already greatly put off Ink Thorn.","Frankly, even if Fan Lou knew, he would not care.","He and Ink Thorn belonged to different worlds, and Ink Thorn would never be able to understand him!","If Ink Thorn had started out in life in the same lowly position he did, with a bloodline that was virtually worthless, Ink Thorn would never be able to attain his current status.","Suddenly, Kong Huan came to Fan Lou’s mind.","Fan Lou and Kong Huan could be considered old friends.","When he had been her subordinate, he would spend every day in fear and walking on eggshells.","Both he and Kong Huan had joined Lin Yuan at the same time. But now, he was the one meeting with Lin Yuan in the East Universe.","Meanwhile, Kong Huan had gone to the North Universe. How was she doing now? It was unlikely that she was having an easier time than he was.","Even with Fan Lou’s limited experience and knowledge, he could guess that a powerful species like the Snow-Covered Foxes would never act too kindly toward a new dependent species.","Even if the Alluring Fox bloodline was extremely attractive to fox-species lifeforms, there were other powerful fox species in the East Universe.","The Evil Flaming Tail Foxes did not flourish in the East Universe the same way that the Snow-Covered Foxes did, but they had made it onto the top 100 of the East Universe’s Species Ranking numerous times in the past.","The Evil Flaming Tail Foxes had interacted with the Alluring Foxes in the past and had been extremely friendly to them but had not offered them any benefits.","If the Evil Flaming Tail Foxes had protected the Alluring Foxes, Feng Qing would never have dared to cause trouble for the Alluring Foxes.","Fan Lou did not know how much stronger Kong Huan’s ability to mesmerize fox-species lifeforms became after her bloodline evolved.","...","Kong Huan had encountered significant hurdles since relocating the Alluring Foxes to the North Universe.","But ever since she gained the protection of one of the Snow-Covered Fox leaders, she gained a platform of development.","Kong Huan knew that by coming to the North Universe, the Alluring Foxes had lost all of their roots in the East Universe. Roots were the most important part of any development.","Apart from laying down their roots, she also needed to build a good relationship with the Snow-Covered Foxes’ other dependent species.","The Snow-Covered Foxes were adept at management, and almost every member had extremely strong business capabilities. Moreover, the Snow-Covered Foxes’ bloodline characteristics stood out from that of other fox species.","As the Alluring Foxes continued expanding their business subsidiaries, Kong Huan remained prudent throughout the developments. She gave more than half of the profits to the leader whose protection she was under.","Normally, according to the rules for dependent species, Kong Huan only needed to give up 20% to 30% of her profits. But she had exceeded that quota because she wanted to improve the leader’s impression of her.","It was not at all easy to curry favor with a Snow-Covered Fox leader.","Moreover, Kong Huan did not dare to give the resources that Lin Yuan had given her to the other Alluring Foxes. She was afraid that the news might leak. Hence, she did not give them to the Snow-Covered Fox leader either!","This was because she could not explain how she came into possession of resources of such a level.","Kong Huan used her own means to gain the favor of a Snow-Covered Fox leader, and he assigned a large territory to the Alluring Foxes where they would be able to develop freely.","This was a giant honor and reward to the Alluring Foxes.","More importantly, this reward was proof to the other dependent species that the Alluring Foxes were important to this Snow-Covered Fox leader. Regardless of how displeased the other dependent species were with the Alluring Foxes, they would never dare to touch them.","The leaders of many dependent species tried the same method that Kong Huan used but failed to achieve the same level of success.","While interacting with the Snow-Covered Fox leader, Kong Huan learned how to leverage her Alluring Bone bloodline appropriately to please the leader.","Kong Huan was doing a good job of leading the Alluring Foxes, but she still yearned for Lin Yuan to get in contact with her. Even a few morsels of information about him would be fine as well.","When she found out that Lin Yuan possessed the Alluring Soul bloodline, she began seeing him as her spiritual leader!","There was no question that relying on this Snow-Covered Fox leader was not a sustainable way of improving the Alluring Foxes’ development.","Unless she evolved her bloodline again, she would be nothing more than a toy to this leader.","This Snow-Covered Fox leader had a fair number of female fox-species lifeforms by his side. At best, she was a new and shiny toy who did not have anything that allowed her to stand out.","Lin Yuan was the only one who would be able to help the Alluring Foxes to transform.","Regardless, until Lin Yuan got in contact with her, she would continue leading the Alluring Foxes in developing stably!","The Snow-Covered Foxes had too many species, and their internal strife was brutal. They also continued to recruit other fox species from the other universes.","Every once in a while, a dependent species would be destroyed. They either offended the leader whose protection they were under, were punished by other leaders, or fell to the internal competition among the dependent species.","Kong Huan felt rather melancholy.","If she had known that joining the Snow-Covered Foxes would eventually lead to such an outcome, would she have made the same choice?","In spite of her lamentation, Kong Huan did not feel any pity. Rather, she would join in the sabotage of the weaker fox species because this was the only way she could increase the supply of resources that the Alluring Foxes needed for survival.","...","Ink Thorn carefully instructed the Dark Pufferfish who would be putting on the act with Fan Lou. He emphasized doing his best to work with Fan Lou so as not to give Fan Lou anything that he could complain to Lin Yuan about.","Although the Dark Pufferfish, Mantis Stone Crabs, Shadow-Hunting Stingrays, and Hidden Fog Turtles would no longer cause large commotions in the Lonely River, their rivalry was more intense than ever.","All of them had the Thoughts Letter Paper, meaning they all had the chance to interact with Lin Yuan.","On the surface, everything appeared calm. But beneath the surface, they were trying to undermine each other.","The current situation of the Four Species Overlords sharing equal power would not persist forever. Eventually, one species would receive a reward from Lin Yuan and gain the opportunity to lead the pack."]},{"number":2835,"title":"Chapter 2835 Chance to Evolve to Major Satan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2835 Chance to Evolve to Major Satan!","In Lin Yuan’s eyes, the Sky Beyond the Clouds was far more expansive than the main world.","Sky Sea, Gray, and Dark Blue all adored this carefreeness.","Sky City had not been developing slowly at all. While carrying out their tasks, Sky City’s main members never stopped learning more about the Sky Beyond the Clouds and increasing the rate at which Sky City assimilated into it.","While nurturing Frigid, Lin Yuan thought of the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil, who had been remaining with Begin Lady in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Ever since Lin Yuan contracted the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil, it evolved quickly from a higher devil to Satan and gained fearsome abilities.","The greatest value of the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil was that Lin Yuan could still fuse with it even after triggering another bloodline in his body.","When he fused with Dark Blue in the past, the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil would be applied to him, and this substantially raised his combat abilities.","In the past decade, Lin Yuan had not stopped supplying the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil with resources.","As Morbius continued to evolve, the Element Well’s production capabilities rose as well.","Lin Yuan gave the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil permission to use as much of the Element Well’s water as it wanted to produce elements.","Lin Yuan summoned the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil.","The long black horns on the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s head folded into a tall crown. The crown was as black as ink and had an air of evil, mystery, and danger.","But perched on the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s head, the crown came off as majestic and dignified.","The black mountain goat skulls in the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s crimson red eyes spun slowly.","Long black hair draped over its beautiful robes. Every inch of its beautiful robes had multicolored flowers embroidered on it. The robes stretched out in a five square meter radius around the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil.","It was holding a staff the same color as its crown, and above it were petals of flowers formed from pure elemental energy.","The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s devil tattoos moved from its face to the back of its ear, then to its neck as they made their way to its collarbone.","The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s tail, proof of its being a Satan, was hidden under its robes.","The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil was much more beautiful than Lin Yuan had remembered. It was truly a Satan-species/beautiful-evil-god-species!","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil.","[Fey Species]: Satan-species/beautiful-evil-god-species","[Fey Type]: Natural","[Fey Quality]: Immortal IV","Satanic Abilities:","[Calamity Judgment]: According to the elemental energy that the target wields, a Calamity Flower will bloom on the target. Every time the target uses elemental energy, the Calamity Flower will absorb the elemental energy and store it. When the Calamity Flower is exploded, the target will suffer a backlash from the stored elemental energy.","[Calamity Flower Toying With Life]: The Calamity Flower will fall from the Flower Basket of Calamity and become hidden. When a lifeform of the same type as the Calamity Flower comes into contact with the Calamity Flower, it will be compared with the purity of the elemental energy within the Calamity Flower. If it is purer than the elemental energy in the Calamity Flower, the Calamity Flower will give the target a boost. If the elemental energy is less pure than the elemental energy within the Calamity Flower, the Calamity Flower will rob the target of its elemental energy and use an ‘about to die’ effect on the target. Before the ‘about to die’ effect ends and the target is not reimbursed with elemental energy, the target will die. If the elemental energy is of the same purity as the elemental energy in the Calamity Flower, it can decide whether to boost the target or steal its elemental energy and place the ‘about to die’ effect on it.","[Misfortune for All]: All the creatures in the area will form a net of karma linked by misfortune. Two types of calamities will be compared, and the weaker one will automatically sacrifice half of its calamity to the stronger party before entering a temporary state of feebleness.","[Calamity Territory Flower Puppet]: When faced with lifeforms that also have the devil bloodline, it can suppress its target according to its bloodline and rob the usage of the satanic abilities of inferior devils. After the inferior devil is killed, the inferior lifeform will become a flower puppet in the sea of flowers. The flower puppet and sea of flowers will inherit the satanic abilities of the dead devil and a portion of the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s own abilities. When faced with lifeforms that do not have the devil bloodline, the calamity territory can be opened. When the target enters the calamity territory, three Calamity Flowers will automatically bloom on the target. When the calamity territory is opened, the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil will not be able to move, and the toil of using other satanic abilities will be magnified.","Lin Yuan saw that the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil had evolved to Sovereign V/Immortal IV.","However, the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s satanic abilities were only related to its bloodline. It would only be able to gain more satanic abilities by transforming into a Major Satan and evolving its bloodline.","Although its satanic abilities had not increased from the evolution of its grade and quality, the current strength of the abilities could not be compared to what they previously were!","Lin Yuan had estimated that the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil would only be able to evolve to Major Satan once its Calamity Flowers increased from 11 to 12.","This was impossible to achieve in the main world.","The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil needed to absorb different types of elemental energy to produce more Calamity Flowers.","Having found 11 types of elemental energy in the main world, he had reached the limit. There was no way for the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil to continue evolving its bloodline in the main world.","The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s bloodline would only be able to transform again in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","After remaining quiet for more than ten years, the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s personality had changed drastically. It stood quietly by Lin Yuan’s side, and there was wronged sadness on its innocent face.","Of all the feys he had contracted, Lin Yuan had shown the least concern for the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil.","At first, the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil only wanted resources from Lin Yuan.","But once it realized that it was completely bound to him, it began hoping it could receive Lin Yuan’s affection like his other feys did.","Lin Yuan sensed the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s sadness, and he now knew how it felt about him.","Lin Yuan had shown the least concern for the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil because he saw it as extremely selfish and calculative. He assumed that it felt no genuine emotion.","However, Lin Yuan forgot that devils only targeted their schemes toward lifeforms of the same level.","When a lifeform’s level was higher than that of the devil, the devil would realize that its schemes would not bring it any benefits. At that point, the devil would begin investing in genuine emotions.","“Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil, you were unable to evolve your bloodline in the main world. Now that you’re in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, your bloodline will be able to continue evolving. If I encounter special elements or lifeforms that can produce special elements, I will bring them to you!","“I summoned you because I want to tell you to try your best to suppress your grade. Try not to evolve to Eternal Breed! There will definitely be higher-level bloodlines above Major Satan. If you evolve to Eternal at the same time that you evolve to Major Satan, you will have the chance to evolve past Major Satan when you reach World Emperor/Divine Kingdom and gain your own divine kingdom!”","Lin Yuan’s advice caused surprised happiness to spread across the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s face. It saw this as Lin Yuan showing concern for it.","Lin Yuan had promised that he would help it to evolve.","Major Satan seemed like an unattainable level to the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil. If not for Lin Yuan, a higher devil would probably be the highest level it would ever attain.","Due to its resource needs, no one had wanted to contract it. The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil was well aware of that.","Now, not only did it have the opportunity to evolve to Major Satan, but it might also be able to evolve past Major Satan.","The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil was far more interested in evolving its bloodline than evolving its grade.","Lin Yuan had heard from Spring that devils existed in the Sky Beyond the Clouds as well.","However, they were less united than the other species. The devils were on guard against each other, and every one of them lived for themselves.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, even lifeforms with the strongest bloodline potential would find it difficult to make a name for themselves on their own.","Hence, devils were not well-respected by the species of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","However, the devils served as aides in some species.","With the devils’ innate capabilities, it was difficult for them to gain the chance to increase their strength to great heights.","The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil was a highly intelligent lifeform, and Lin Yuan intended to keep it in Sky City. It might have talent in internal governance.","Lin Yuan had not given the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil many opportunities and did not know what talents it had.","But he knew that devils were skilled at misleading and leading others astray.","The Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s existence would be of great help to Lin Yuan in his endeavor to collect faith in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","...","After flying for a few days, Sky Sea finally arrived at the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","If Spring and Summer had not already taken control of the King Blood Jackals, the latter would definitely have violently attacked Lin Yuan for arriving at their territory.","Just passing over the territory of a species could be seen as an act of provocation.","Sky Sea remained in the sky above the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","At that moment, not even a peep could be heard in their territory.","Even before Sky Sea arrived, Spring and Summer were already prepared to welcome Lin Yuan.","Spring went over to Lin Yuan and said softly, “Lord Saint, Summer and I have taken full control of the King Blood Jackals. However, the queen is obstinate and refuses to surrender. Are you willing to educate her?”","Spring and Summer were perceptive and had a good grasp of the situation.","If Lin Yuan did not show an interest in the King Blood Jackal Queen, Spring and Summer would try to take control of her again. If that still did not work, they would hesitate to kill her.","The King Blood Jackals had other members who were deserving and had the ability to become queens. A new queen could be assigned to lead them!","Even after giving such a report to Lin Yuan, Spring and Summer wanted to give the King Blood Jackal Queen another opportunity because she had outstanding potential.","Once they lost her, there was no telling when they would be able to find another talent worth nurturing!","“Let’s go. Take me to see just how strong-headed the King Blood Jackal Queen is!”","Lin Yuan was very interested in someone so highly recommended by Spring and Summer.","However, this would all depend on how cooperative the King Blood Jackal Queen was.","If she was extremely uncooperative, Lin Yuan would not waste too much time and effort on her, much less mourn her loss.","Lin Yuan would not mind even if he lost all the King Blood Jackals.","There were many powerful species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. With Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter’s strength, Lin Yuan could easily take in the species they apprehended.","Even after being a superior for so long, Lin Yuan’s character had yet to change. However, his mindset and approach to matters had changed.","It might seem as though Sky City’s development was going swimmingly, but this was no child’s play. It was a ruthless battle for dominance!","If he continued maintaining a heart of gold while leading Sky City in its development in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Lin Yuan would be doing a disservice to all of Sky City’s members! Lin Yuan was such an irresponsible person!","The King Blood Jackals had been living in this barren land for an extremely long time, and their palace was very grand.","Based on the decorations in the palace, Lin Yuan could tell that the King Blood Jackals were partial to the color gold.","The entire palace was built with pure gold, stone, and metals.","In this territory, Lin Yuan could see many servants who were not King Blood Jackals sustaining the upkeep of the territory. They were all outstanding members of the King Blood Jackals’ dependent species and were extremely intelligent.","If they were slightly dumber or lacked perception, they would already have been eliminated!","Spring and Summer had imprisoned all the King Blood Jackals in the palace.","The servants knew that the territory had just undergone a drastic change and that these people who had just entered the territory were the new owners.","When the servants saw Lin Yuan, they hurriedly lowered their heads and knelt on the ground.","Their actions told Lin Yuan that the King Blood Jackals highly valued status. Those of different stations were subjected to different treatments and wielded different levels of power in the territory.","The King Blood Jackal Queen stood right on the top of the pyramid.","After becoming accustomed to her lofty heights, her haughtiness needed to be utterly shattered in order for her to surrender willingly. That was the only way to subdue the proud queen.","Being one step away from reaching Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit in this desolate land did indeed give her cause to be as proud as she was.","After entering the palace, Lin Yuan came upon the dashing King Blood Jackals dressed in gold armor. They were all lined up in neat rows."]},{"number":2836,"title":"Chapter 2836 The King Blood Jackals’ Two Royals!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2836 The King Blood Jackals’ Two Royals!","Most of the King Blood Jackals were male, but all the female members had higher statuses than the male members. This was evident based on the sequence of the formations.","There were only two male King Blood Jackal captains, making up less than 1/3 of the total number.","The King Blood Jackals were a matriarchy, so this situation was unsurprising.","The two male King Blood Jackals had to be excellent for them to be selected over female King Blood Jackals.","When the King Blood Jackals spotted Spring and Summer, their bodies trembled in obvious fear. Spring and Summer must have done something to strike such terror into them.","The King Blood Jackals were not as strong-headed as their queen.","From the way that the King Blood Jackals were standing there, it meant that they had already been tamed.","When Summer saw that the King Blood Jackals did not move or respond to Lin Yuan’s arrival, she scoffed.","“Only a few hours have passed since you were last taught a lesson. Have you forgotten what I told you? I have already eliminated the disobedient King Blood Jackals. You only deserve to stand here because you were obedient. How dare you not greet the Lord?”","Kneeling was also the highest form of respect in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Normally, in a species, only superiors with the best bloodlines received such greetings from their subordinates.","The rules and significance surrounding kneeling were much stricter and more solemn than they were in the main world.","When the King Blood Jackals heard what Summer said, they hurriedly bowed in greeting. This was the clearest way of demonstrating their subservience.","The stubborn King Blood Jackals had already been killed, and their bloodlines extracted, essentially draining the final value of their existence.","The King Blood Jackals who survived all had their heads bowed. They definitely did not want to meet the same end.","Even their queen, the pillar of the King Blood Jackals, had been subdued by the enemy and was completely unable to fight back. The other King Blood Jackals, who were weaker than her, knew that any resistance was futile.","If the enemy wanted to stomp out the King Blood Jackals, most of them would fight back.","But as things stood, the enemy did not have such an intention. Rather, they wanted to turn the King Blood Jackals into servants, just like the King Blood Jackals had done with other species.","The King Blood Jackals did not treat their servants extremely well but still enabled them to develop and grow. They also gave their servants benefits to keep their loyal service.","When Lin Yuan saw the King Blood Jackals kneeling in front of him, he thought, Any task I give to Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter is always done to perfection.","“The King Blood Jackals will become Sky City’s dependent species from today onward. Every King Blood Jackal will become a manager in Sky City’s territory and will be in charge of the operations and development in the territory.”","Immediately upon arrival, this superior started assigning the King Blood Jackals to become managers. He was placing a lot of value and trust in them!","This was the first time that the King Blood Jackals were hearing of the faction known as Sky City.","There was no way that Sky City was a native faction of North of the Lonely River.","One of the female King Blood Jackals asked, “Lord, where is Sky City’s territory? Tell us the location of the territory so we can allocate tasks and do our best to accomplish this mission you’ve given us!”","Lin Yuan looked seriously into the eyes of the King Blood Jackal, who had spoken. Given that she dared to speak to him directly, that King Blood Jackal had to have a brazen personality. This made her suitable to be a leader.","It also meant that she held a high position among the King Blood Jackals. Otherwise, regardless of how brazen she was, she would never dare to be the first King Blood Jackal to speak in such circumstances.","The King Blood Jackals prioritized bloodlines just as highly as the Bloodians and mermaids did.","Lin Yuan did not falter at all when he was posed this question.","“Currently, Sky City is planning on developing in North of the Lonely River. The entire North of the Lonely River is part of Sky City’s territory. You will be in charge of the area where you are currently located. Subsequently, your responsibilities will expand outward from this area. You are familiar with this area that you have been occupying all this time. You should be able to do a good job of managing it for me!","“You will continue to manage the servant species that are already under your control. If your queen chooses to submit to me, I will continue allowing her to rule over the King Blood Jackals. If your queen chooses to be stupidly stubborn, I will select a male and female King Blood Jackal to receive the queen’s bloodline. They will then jointly rule over the King Blood Jackals.”","A new King Blood Jackal ruler was only chosen once the previous ruler passed.","The King Blood Jackal Queen was in the prime of her life.","Under the King Blood Jackals’ rule, none of the other King Blood Jackals had the opportunity to lead the species.","Lin Yuan’s words were somewhat of a promise to the King Blood Jackals.","If Lin Yuan killed the King Blood Jackal Queen outright, he would definitely displease the other King Blood Jackals.","But if, after he killed the queen, he extracted her bloodline and gave it out as a reward, the King Blood Jackals would feel as though they had hope of becoming one of the new rulers of the species. As a result, they would definitely do their best to manage the area to prove their capabilities to Lin Yuan!","Picking a male and female King Blood Jackal as joint rulers meant that Lin Yuan wanted them to keep each other in check.","When Lin Yuan nurtured the two King Blood Jackals, he would definitely try to encourage the two to compete and balance each other.","While investigating the King Blood Jackals’ territory, Spring and Summer discovered that there were just as many male King Blood Jackals as females. However, the males had all been sent out to guard the territory.","The male King Blood Jackals were loyal to the queen and would serve her unquestioningly. Even if she asked them to sacrifice themselves, they would do so.","However, the male King Blood Jackals would not offer such unconditional loyalty to a fellow male.","In the past, there were instances of rebellions led by male King Blood Jackals. They were a result of the males receiving unfair treatment in the species.","If the King Blood Jackal Queen had not used force to quell the uprisings, the King Blood Jackals might have already split into multiple species, just as what had happened to the Moon-Worshiping Wolves.","By selecting a male King Blood Jackal as one of the rulers, Lin Yuan would remove the hostility and resentment brewing among the male King Blood Jackals. This would help in establishing and maintaining peace among the species.","The King Blood Jackals were his tools.","Lin Yuan was interested in the King Blood Jackals’ power and management talent.","He did not want his tools to turn against him and cause chaos in the territory.","Lin Yuan’s words caused a stir among the King Blood Jackals.","The eyes of the female King Blood Jackals standing at the front of the rows glinted.","However, the most excited ones were the two male King Blood Jackals.","Now that this new ruler was there, such an opportunity had arisen!","For the male King Blood Jackals, this opportunity was beyond their wildest dreams.","When they heard the voices of the King Blood Jackals growing stronger, the managing King Blood Jackals at the front immediately quelled the noise.","Lin Yuan nodded in satisfaction. Speaking to intelligent people always saved time and effort.","It was clear that the King Blood Jackals understood his meaning.","Based on the actions of the managing King Blood Jackals, it was possible that the managers standing at the front were not as loyal to their queen as they seemed.","As Lin Yuan walked into the main hall, the King Blood Jackals remained kneeling. They would stay in this state until there was a conclusion regarding the queen.","Regardless of whether their queen surrendered, the King Blood Jackals would be ushering in a new era.","Spring and Summer had only told Lin Yuan about the King Blood Jackals. They had not provided him with any strategic suggestions.","Lin Yuan used this method to take full control of the King Blood Jackals.","Even if he eliminated the King Blood Jackal Queen, it would not affect his control over them.","As he walked deeper into the hall, Lin Yuan saw a golden-haired figure in a crumpled and shrunken heap on the ground. Her hands and legs were chained to the throne.","This figure, who should be seated on the throne, was now chained to it.","Nonetheless, the prisoner tried to keep her back as straight as possible, and her aura remained sharp and cutting.","The moment Lin Yuan walked through the door, her red-golden eyes snapped at him.","Lin Yuan was witnessing the demeanor of a pinnacle Divine Kingdom expert who was the ruler of a powerful species.","Lin Yuan was extremely impressed by the King Blood Jackal Queen.","He smiled and said, “You don’t know me, but I’m sure you know why I’m here. I’m not here to encourage you to welcome death. I’m here to allow you to make your own decision.”","Lin Yuan told the queen everything he had just told the other King Blood Jackals.","The King Blood Jackal Queen’s eyes flashed.","The gears in her head had to be turning rapidly.","When Lin Yuan interacted with the female King Blood Jackal elites, he could tell that all of them were ambitious. The queen had to be aware of this as well.","Given that the queen gave such enormous authority to the female King Blood Jackals, it meant that she wanted to cultivate their ambitiousness.","Ambition was the best driving force!","The King Blood Jackal Queen had her power and was not afraid of the female King Blood Jackals’ ambition weakening her position.","But now, the King Blood Jackal Queen had no choice but to grapple with the female King Blood Jackals and the ambition she had cultivated.","Lin Yuan’s words immediately hit the King Blood Jackal Queen’s pain point. She had no choice but to approach him cordially.","“What are your intentions for the King Blood Jackals?”","Lin Yuan smiled. He did not respond to her but asked instead, “What is the King Blood Jackals’ intention for keeping so many dependent species in this desolate area? We have forcefully taken control of the King Blood Jackals.","“I want you to understand that this isn’t because we have a vendetta against you. Rather, we want to use pure power to maintain absolute control over the King Blood Jackals! So, you don’t have the right to negotiate terms with me!","“But if you become my subordinate, you can obtain some benefits for yourself. The benefits will involve evolving your bloodline and helping you become a Holy Spirit expert.”","The first portion of Lin Yuan’s words continuously stoked the flames of the King Blood Jackal Queen’s rage.","But the latter part of what he said caused shock and interest to appear on her face.","At the same time, she began to think carefully about Lin Yuan’s suggestion of becoming his subordinate.","If she chose not to submit, there was no question that he would kill her and give her bloodline as a reward to the other King Blood Jackals.","Although doing so would cause her to lose her pride as an expert and she would no longer be able to uphold the promise she made to her seniors of safeguarding the King Blood Jackals, she would be able to evolve her bloodline and grade.","If she could evolve her bloodline and reach the Holy Spirit level, she would truly be able to leave her mark on the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","Even if the King Blood Jackals became servants, they would still be able to make great strides in the Species Ranking and obtain a decent ranking with a ruler of her power.","The King Blood Jackals could act as they pleased in North of the Lonely River, but this was not because the resources here met their needs. Rather, once they left this barren land and began exploring other areas, the King Blood Jackals might end up in great danger.","The King Blood Jackal Queen dared not take such a risk before she reached the Holy Spirit level.","If they followed this young man, the King Blood Jackals would definitely be able to leave North of the Lonely River!","If this young man could give her such an opportunity, it would be her blessing to give her loyalty to him."]},{"number":2837,"title":"Chapter 2837 Crimson Heaven Godly Falcons!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2837 Crimson Heaven Godly Falcons!","The King Blood Jackal Queen finally bent her back and stared unblinkingly at Lin Yuan as she asked seriously, “Lord, my name is Kani. I am willing to trust the promise you’ve just given me. From now on, I will listen to your orders!”","If Lin Yuan promised to evolve her bloodline and advance her to the Holy Spirit level, there was no way that Kani could ignore such benefits.","Even if she managed to resist the temptation, she could not escape Lin Yuan’s grasp.","Just like he said, his arrival was her final ultimatum. He was not there to negotiate with her.","In order to encourage the King Blood Jackals to compete with each other and work together for the sake of developing the species, Kani had cultivated their ambitious natures.","The close aides under her were likely hoping that she would put up a fight so they could obtain rewards from Lin Yuan.","When they heard Kani’s choice, Spring and Summer looked at her approvingly.","When one lived in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and had to lead a species, being aware of one’s circumstances was more important than possessing power.","In the future, Kani would definitely be relieved and glad for the choice she had made.","Lin Yuan raised his hand and released his divine kingdom’s aura.","He looked at Kani and said, “Link your fountain of faith to my divine kingdom! The King Blood Jackals will remain under your control, and your authority won’t be affected by my presence. You might even have the chance to take control of and rule over more species in the future.”","Since Kani had chosen to become loyal to Lin Yuan, she did not feel any hesitation to merge her fountain of faith with his divine kingdom and allowed him to take full control of her.","However, the moment that she sensed Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom’s aura, Kani’s body froze.","Just like Kong Huan, Kani sensed Truth’s aura in Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom.","She now began viewing him as a Holy Spirit expert.","Kani was unaware of Spring and Summer’s exact level of power, but they were definitely beyond the Divine Kingdom level as well. Otherwise, there was no way that they would be able to use force to take control of the King Blood Jackals immediately and shackle her to her own throne without giving her any opportunity to fight back.","Lin Yuan’s power delighted Kani.","Rather than being controlled by a weak Holy Spirit expert, Kani preferred to be controlled by a strong Holy Spirit expert.","Lifeforms who abided by the law of the jungle usually admired the strong.","Lin Yuan had only used the Faith Tree to take control of Ink Thorn, Mantis Age, and the rest. But he used his divine kingdom to take control of Kani. Clearly, he had different attitudes toward different subordinates.","Lin Yuan would supply resources to the Dark Pufferfish, Shadow-Hunting Stingrays, and the rest but would not give them the opportunity to expand and develop beyond the Lonely River.","Spring and Summer saw Kani’s shocked expression and felt she was making too big of a fuss.","In the coming days, she would be shocked almost daily as she remained by Lin Yuan’s side.","At that moment, Lin Yuan walked over to Kani and helped her to remove her cuffs before grabbing her wrists.","The King Blood Jackals were liberal, and Kani had hundreds of male partners.","Kani preferred rough and manly males.","Using the Body of All Spirits to evolve bloodlines took a large toll on Lin Yuan.","For now, apart from participating in strategizing, Lin Yuan was unable to do anything else.","Two months later, once the Bloodians obtained the Dark Pufferfish’s poison, the operation would begin. At that point, Lin Yuan would have to focus on the Bloodians’ operation and would not have extra energy that he could use to nurture Kani.","Once Kani heard what Lin Yuan said, she felt waves of shock and delight wash over her repeatedly.","She never expected an opportunity to come her way so soon.","However, she could not help but be worried about this opportunity she was given.","When Kani evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, she had been grievously injured by the cleansing from the world wills and had almost lost her life.","It was only after she recovered and her power broke through that the other King Blood Jackals were able to evolve under safer circumstances.","When she evolved to Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit, it would be much more dangerous than when she evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. One misstep and the World Cleansing would reduce her to ashes.","Kani could not help but feel anxious about that.","She could not pass on such an opportunity, but taking it would put her at enormous risk.","Spring and Summer could tell that Kani was worried but decided not to assuage her concerns. Rather, they waited for her to express her worries to Lin Yuan so he could dispel them. This would inadvertently cause Kani to feel reliant on Lin Yuan.","Otherwise, given Kani’s way of doing things, she would not consult Lin Yuan often in the future while she was leading the King Blood Jackals in managing his territory.","As the one who made the decisions and managed Sky City, Lin Yuan needed managers who were insightful and could think critically. However, these managers also needed to run all key decisions past Lin Yuan. If the managers were given too much leeway, it would not be beneficial for the organization of Sky City’s growing establishment.","After hesitating for a moment, Kani told Lin Yuan about her concerns.","“Master, thank you for giving me this opportunity! But before evolving, I need to make sufficient preparations. When I evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, I was almost killed by the world wills. I need to accumulate more power just in case!”","Lin Yuan looked at Spring and Summer. When they nodded, he told Kani, “Since I’m going to help you to evolve, I will definitely consider the safety aspect of the process. Spring and Summer will both be able to protect you, so you don’t have to worry. I don’t think anyone knows this place better than you do.","“Why don’t you tell me about this area so I can gain a clear understanding of the circumstances? I am very curious to find out why the King Blood Jackals never expanded your territory. There is a fair amount of resources in the east!”","Lin Yuan could only think of one possibility for this, which was that there was a species just as strong as the King Blood Jackals in the mountain in the east. This was the only explanation for such an occurrence.","Lin Yuan’s words dissolved all of Kani’s concerns. Since her safety was ensured, Kani was more than willing to increase her power as soon as possible.","In response to Lin Yuan’s question, Kani said seriously, “Master, the mountain is called the White Falcon Mountain. The name comes from the Spinning Wings White Falcons, a dependent species of the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","“The Crimson Heaven Falcons are the true rulers of the Lonely River. If not for their dislike of the weather here and the preference to live in lush forests and towering mountains, we would never dare to occupy this area!”","At that point, an awkward expression appeared on Kani’s face. However, she could not hide anything from Lin Yuan. She knew that if Lin Yuan found out that she was hiding anything from him or lying to him, he would not only stop using her but would also punish her.","Lin Yuan had given her such an opportunity so soon after taking her in. She knew that this opportunity meant that he valued her. By hook or by crook, she was not going to let this chance slip by.","When Lin Yuan did not say anything after her explanation, Kani added, “The Spinning Wings White Falcons had a Holy Spirit expert 600 years ago. However, he still hasn’t been able to break through to Domain Mountain class.","“The Crimson Heaven Falcons must be much more powerful than the Spinning Wings White Falcons in order to make them their dependent species. All I know about the Crimson Heaven Falcons are rumors, so I can’t guarantee the accuracy. But there seems to be a lot of stock in one of the rumors.","“The Crimson Heaven Falcons have the power to make it to the top few ranks of the Species Ranking. Although there aren’t many members, they still have the power to conquer many species.","“The reason they decided not to enter the Species Ranking is that they’ve been holding out for an opportunity and can’t compete with all the species! Since the Crimson Heaven Falcons haven’t left North of the Lonely River, it must mean that that opportunity has yet to arrive!”","Lin Yuan’s eyes flashed. He never expected Kani to be unaware of even such details about the Crimson Heaven Falcons."]},{"number":2838,"title":"Chapter 2838 The Demon Insects Restarted!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2838 The Demon Insects Restarted!","But this also proved just how powerful the Crimson Heaven Falcons were!","Even the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ dependent species, the Spinning Wings White Falcons, were stronger than the King Blood Jackals.","Hence, it was unlikely that the Crimson Heaven Falcons would take notice of the King Blood Jackals.","Normally, a powerful species liked to protect lifeforms with the same type of bloodline they had. The King Blood Jackals did not qualify.","Spring said from the side, “Young Master, should we make contact with the Crimson Heaven Falcons? If you think we should, I can immediately get in touch with the Crimson Heaven Falcons!","“Alternatively, I can go ahead and take control of them directly. If the Crimson Heaven Falcons are truly staying here because they are holding out for an opportunity, this opportunity must be extremely important to them!","“This opportunity might be useful for us. The Crimson Heaven Falcons should be the descendants of a branch bloodline of an ancient bloodline. I never heard of the Crimson Heaven Falcons in the past.”","Spring and Summer were not at all concerned about the Crimson Heaven Falcons, who supported the Spinning Wings White Falcons. They were merely Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit. Such power was merely tier one in the East Universe.","Spring and Summer felt that they were undeserving of being taken seriously.","Spring had only made an example suggestion to Lin Yuan. However, her suggestion frightened Kani.","Kani thought that once she mentioned the Spinning Wings White Falcons and the Crimson Heaven Falcons who supported them, Lin Yuan would definitely take them seriously. Yet, Spring and Summer could not be less bothered by them.","It would be understandable if they had such an attitude towards the Spinning Wings White Falcons. After all, they only gained their first Holy Spirit Realm expert a few centuries ago. It was highly likely that the expert had not reached Domain Mountain.","However, it was arrogant to act that way toward the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons were very domineering. This could be seen from the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","She did not have the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ power.","Spring and Summer only learned about the Crimson Heaven Falcons from her. Even she was unaware of their power, much less Spring and Summer!","Was Spring not concerned that she would end up tripping and falling while trying to make contact with the Crimson Heaven Falcons?","The Crimson Heaven Falcons were very domineering. This could be seen from the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Kani did not know if she should give Lin Yuan a reminder.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons’ bloodline did not have as long of a legacy as the King Blood Jackals, but almost two epochs had passed since they reached their prime. They could be considered an established species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Was it certain that the Crimson Heaven Falcons were the descendants of the branch bloodline of an ancient bloodline just because Spring had never heard of them?","Kani found Spring rather arrogant but did not dare to upset her.","Firstly, it was clear that Spring and Lin Yuan were much closer than she and Lin Yuan. Moreover, Lin Yuan did not react after hearing what Spring said, meaning that he agreed with what she said.","Spring did not know what Kani was thinking, but if she did, she would not mind demonstrating her power to Kani. Spring did not want to be looked down on by an inferior lifeform, especially an inferior lifeform who would be following Lin Yuan in the future.","Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter were all dedicating their faith and loyalty to Lin Yuan. However, they felt uncontrollably superior to other lifeforms.","Wen Yu, Liu Jie, and the Moon Empress, who were more sensitive than others, realized this early on in their interactions with the four of them.","Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter’s attitudes only started changing slowly once they understood how Lin Yuan thought of them.","“Spring, the King Blood Jackals still have a pile of tasks to attend to. You can go and make contact with the Crimson Heaven Falcons after the villages have settled into the area around the King Blood Jackals’ territory and Sky City’s kingdom and supply of faith are built up! It will be difficult for us to manage all of them if we take on such an enormous operation at once.”","Lin Yuan had already decided that he would focus on developing the King Blood Jackals’ territory for now. On the way there, Sky Sea had passed many villages. Every weak species controlled a few villages. Lin Yuan intended to take control of all of these villages.","As for the weak species, the King Blood Jackals could take those with potential as servants. Those without potential would be given a stable environment where they could continue developing!","Once the trade chain was built, these species would be able to participate in trade with Listen. With the network of trade, all the species connected to it would be able to lead better lives. With a successful trade chain, it would also be easier for Sky City to gather resources.","In order to achieve this, Lin Yuan would need at least ten years.","Hence, Lin Yuan was not in a rush to begin working on too many activities.","While Sky City was developing stably in North of the Lonely River, Lin Yuan would explore the East Universe’s main area. Lin Yuan wanted to see how long it would take for information to travel out from North of the Lonely River.","When Kani saw the wild and bold manner in which Lin Yuan and his group acted, she never expected him to be so careful when it came to developing his commercial business. This was good news to her.","“Master, I will invite all the King Blood Jackals to a meeting later. Do you have any suggestions in terms of management? If you do, I will definitely act as per your instructions!”","Spring and Summer were very satisfied with Kani’s actions.","Lin Yuan had given her all the authority with regard to managing the King Blood Jackals, but they were still serving Sky City. Otherwise, there was no need for Lin Yuan to invest so much resources into nurturing the King Blood Jackals.","Lin Yuan was silent for a moment before saying to Kani, “In the future, you might be spending more time traveling with me than staying with the King Blood Jackals. So I hope that you will be able to nurture a few trustworthy managers who will truly be able to manage the King Blood Jackals as opposed to tools who will only listen to orders but are unable to make any decisions of their own!","“You will only be able to grow stronger if you stick by my side. Once you evolve to Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit, you will be the King Blood Jackals’ ruler forever!”","Kani never expected Lin Yuan to be willing to keep her by his side and take her out with him to train. This was an extremely rare opportunity for her!","If she was frequently by Lin Yuan’s side, she would become his close aide. With Lin Yuan’s generosity, there were many benefits to being his close aide.","Now that Kani had dedicated her loyalty to Lin Yuan, she would work hard for his sake. With her fountain of faith under his divine kingdom’s control, it was impossible for her to break free from him. However, this did not mean that she should stop trying to gain as many benefits as she could from him.","The part of becoming loyal to Lin Yuan that Kani looked forward to the most was not increasing her own power but the bright future that was in store for the King Blood Jackals once her power was increased.","After thinking for a moment, Kani said, “Master, I think your suggestion of having two rulers is a good one. I will select two outstanding King Blood Jackals and nurture them. They will take over the yoke of authority and oversee the King Blood Jackals.","“I will also assign four guards to each of these two King Blood Jackals. The eight King Blood Jackals will all be male. This will elevate the status of the male King Blood Jackals. Master, what do you think of my suggestion?”","When Lin Yuan made the suggestion of the two rulers to Kani, he had intended to pick a male and a female.","But now, she was going to pick two female rulers. This could be seen as trying to skew Lin Yuan’s plans.","However, Kani had insisted on this because she was the ruler of a matriarchy and looked down on the male King Blood Jackals. She did not want them to have the authority to rule over the King Blood Jackals. Allowing them to be the two female King Blood Jackal rulers’ guards was the biggest compromise she was willing to make!","She was worried that Lin Yuan would reject her suggestion. Hence, she even changed her original plan of having four male and four female guards to eight male guards.","Lin Yuan could see through Kani’s intentions. After pondering over it, he agreed to her plan.","A species that had been developing for all this time had to have its own unspoken norms and customs.","Lin Yuan did not want to change these norms and customs unnecessarily, especially if it was something that Kani was strongly opposed to.","By having eight King Blood Jackals guarding the two new rulers, the male King Blood Jackals’ status among the King Blood Jackals would already be elevated.","“Kani, you can call the shots on this matter. But I don’t want there to be any more rebellions from the male King Blood Jackals while they are under your charge!","“The King Blood Jackals will be responsible for the operations in the territory, and someone will get in contact with you. All the King Blood Jackals are outside the hall. Go and see them! Don’t allow anyone else to enter the inner palace before I leave.”","Kani performed a servant’s most respectful act towards Lin Yuan before leaving to reorganize the King Blood Jackals. She would smooth out all the kinks that could possibly destabilize the King Blood Jackals.","There was one thing that Kani did not tell Lin Yuan and would not be telling him, which was that she was the one who instigated the male King Blood Jackals’ rebellion.","Ripples like that were like waves that rolled across her peaceful life. They allowed her to nurture the best King Blood Jackals and remove those she did not like.","However, this ripple caused all of Kani’s playfulness to vanish because she realized that in the face of real problems, the ambition of the King Blood Jackals she had cultivated would end up seriously affecting her life!","Kani did not know what Lin Yuan saw in her that made him willing to nurture her. If he did not see something in her but was interested in other King Blood Jackals instead, the other King Blood Jackals would not try to plead for mercy for her. Rather, they would gleefully push her towards her doom!","After Kani left, she intentionally stationed two trusted aides by the palace’s entrance to prevent anyone from disturbing Lin Yuan. Kani did not want to think of herself as incompetent and unable to settle even something like this.","Once Kani left, Lin Yuan released Keira.","Keira was completely different from what she used to be.","Previously, she protected her one and only batch of insect eggs and held back in everything she did. As badly as she wanted to get on Lin Yuan’s good side, she never dared to use up the entire batch.","But now, she had hatched all of her insect eggs, accumulated 30 more batches, and had specially evolved many demon insects. These demon insects all had extremely strong functional abilities.","Keira felt that she could not compete with the demon insect queens in the West Universe now, but once she unleashed her accumulated power, she would rapidly be able to reach their level! Keira had been pleading with Lin Yuan and hoping that he would set her free to develop herself.","The demon insects’ development did not just depend on spirit qi. They also needed to absorb various lifeforms and their genes. They would then use the genes to produce more types of lifeforms.","After being released by Lin Yuan, Keira once again began pleading with him.","She was delighted that this time, he did not turn her down. Instead, he gave her a real opportunity.","“Keira, I have been restraining you because the time wasn’t right. But the time is right now. The demon insects shouldn’t exist for destruction. I told you this long ago. The demon insects also made a huge contribution to defending the main world during the dead spirits crisis. You also helped to rebuild the main world afterward.","“This version of the demon insects is the one that will be helpful to Sky City. As a ruler and leader, you must agree with what I’m saying. If the demon insects can only develop themselves through destruction, you will be nothing but tools forever.”","Keira was stunned when she heard what Lin Yuan said. But she soon nodded.","This was not the first time that he was telling her this.","At first, she did not agree with what he said. Rapid destruction and plundering were the demon insects’ way of life. If they did not do that, their development would be significantly hindered. In an unfamiliar environment, this did not benefit the demon insects.","But Keira slowly came to understand that the demon insects were dependent on Lin Yuan. They would never be able to obtain the same resources he provided them on their own.","Hence, the demon insects needed to cooperate with Lin Yuan’s plan.","This was the reason for them being by Lin Yuan’s side.","Reality proved that Lin Yuan had enabled the demon insects to develop faster than Keira had anticipated.","As such, Keira was very willing to work with Lin Yuan.","“Master, if you have any requests, just let me know. You don’t have to worry about the tasks you leave in my hand. I will carry them out carefully and properly!”"]},{"number":2839,"title":"Chapter 2839 Crimson Heaven Godly Falcons!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2839 Crimson Heaven Godly Falcons!","The King Blood Jackal Queen finally bent her back and stared unblinkingly at Lin Yuan as she asked seriously, “Lord, my name is Kani. I am willing to trust the promise you’ve just given me. From now on, I will listen to your orders!”","Kani was strong-headed, but she was also smart. She knew when she had to be flexible and admit defeat.","If Lin Yuan promised to evolve her bloodline and advance her to the Holy Spirit level, there was no way that Kani could ignore such benefits.","Even if she managed to resist the temptation, she could not escape Lin Yuan’s grasp.","Just like he said, his arrival was her final ultimatum. He was not there to negotiate with her.","In order to encourage the King Blood Jackals to compete with each other and work together for the sake of developing the species, Kani had cultivated their ambitious natures.","The close aides under her were likely hoping that she would put up a fight so they could obtain rewards from Lin Yuan.","When they heard Kani’s choice, Spring and Summer looked at her approvingly.","When one lived in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and had to lead a species, being aware of one’s circumstances was more important than possessing power.","In the future, Kani would definitely be relieved and glad for the choice she had made.","Lin Yuan raised his hand and released his divine kingdom’s aura.","He looked at Kani and said, “Link your fountain of faith to my divine kingdom! The King Blood Jackals will remain under your control, and your authority won’t be affected by my presence. You might even have the chance to take control of and rule over more species in the future.”","Since Kani had chosen to become loyal to Lin Yuan, she did not feel any hesitation to merge her fountain of faith with his divine kingdom and allowed him to take full control of her.","However, the moment that she sensed Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom’s aura, Kani’s body froze.","Just like Kong Huan, Kani sensed Truth’s aura in Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom.","She now began viewing him as a Holy Spirit expert.","Kani was unaware of Spring and Summer’s exact level of power, but they were definitely beyond the Divine Kingdom level as well. Otherwise, there was no way that they would be able to use force to take control of the King Blood Jackals immediately and shackle her to her own throne without giving her any opportunity to fight back.","Lin Yuan’s power delighted Kani.","Rather than being controlled by a weak Holy Spirit expert, Kani preferred to be controlled by a strong Holy Spirit expert.","Lifeforms who abided by the law of the jungle usually admired the strong.","Lin Yuan had only used the Faith Tree to take control of Ink Thorn, Mantis Age, and the rest. But he used his divine kingdom to take control of Kani. Clearly, he had different attitudes toward different subordinates.","Lin Yuan had taken control of the Four Species Overlords because he wanted to use them to take control of the Lonely River.","Lin Yuan would supply resources to the Dark Pufferfish, Shadow-Hunting Stingrays, and the rest but would not give them the opportunity to expand and develop beyond the Lonely River.","However, there was a high chance that he would keep Kani by his side.","Spring and Summer saw Kani’s shocked expression and felt she was making too big of a fuss.","In the coming days, she would be shocked almost daily as she remained by Lin Yuan’s side.","At that moment, Lin Yuan walked over to Kani and helped her to remove her cuffs before grabbing her wrists.","The King Blood Jackals were liberal, and Kani had hundreds of male partners.","Kani preferred rough and manly males.","Using the Body of All Spirits to evolve bloodlines took a large toll on Lin Yuan.","For now, apart from participating in strategizing, Lin Yuan was unable to do anything else.","Two months later, once the Bloodians obtained the Dark Pufferfish’s poison, the operation would begin. At that point, Lin Yuan would have to focus on the Bloodians’ operation and would not have extra energy that he could use to nurture Kani.","Once Kani heard what Lin Yuan said, she felt waves of shock and delight wash over her repeatedly.","She never expected an opportunity to come her way so soon.","However, she could not help but be worried about this opportunity she was given.","When Kani evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, she had been grievously injured by the cleansing from the world wills and had almost lost her life.","It was only after she recovered and her power broke through that the other King Blood Jackals were able to evolve under safer circumstances.","When she evolved to Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit, it would be much more dangerous than when she evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. One misstep and the World Cleansing would reduce her to ashes.","Kani could not help but feel anxious about that.","She could not pass on such an opportunity, but taking it would put her at enormous risk.","Spring and Summer could tell that Kani was worried but decided not to assuage her concerns. Rather, they waited for her to express her worries to Lin Yuan so he could dispel them. This would inadvertently cause Kani to feel reliant on Lin Yuan.","Otherwise, given Kani’s way of doing things, she would not consult Lin Yuan often in the future while she was leading the King Blood Jackals in managing his territory.","As the one who made the decisions and managed Sky City, Lin Yuan needed managers who were insightful and could think critically. However, these managers also needed to run all key decisions past Lin Yuan. If the managers were given too much leeway, it would not be beneficial for the organization of Sky City’s growing establishment.","After hesitating for a moment, Kani told Lin Yuan about her concerns.","“Master, thank you for giving me this opportunity! But before evolving, I need to make sufficient preparations. When I evolved to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, I was almost killed by the world wills. I need to accumulate more power just in case!”","Lin Yuan looked at Spring and Summer. When they nodded, he told Kani, “Since I’m going to help you to evolve, I will definitely consider the safety aspect of the process. Spring and Summer will both be able to protect you, so you don’t have to worry. I don’t think anyone knows this place better than you do.","“Why don’t you tell me about this area so I can gain a clear understanding of the circumstances? I am very curious to find out why the King Blood Jackals never expanded your territory. There is a fair amount of resources in the east!”","Before coming to see Kani, Lin Yuan had looked through a map of the King Blood Jackals’ territory. This discovery had piqued his curiosity. It did not fit with the King Blood Jackals’ style to know about the presence of resources but not expand their territory to harvest them.","Lin Yuan could only think of one possibility for this, which was that there was a species just as strong as the King Blood Jackals in the mountain in the east. This was the only explanation for such an occurrence.","Lin Yuan’s words dissolved all of Kani’s concerns. Since her safety was ensured, Kani was more than willing to increase her power as soon as possible.","In response to Lin Yuan’s question, Kani said seriously, “Master, the mountain is called the White Falcon Mountain. The name comes from the Spinning Wings White Falcons, a dependent species of the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","“The Crimson Heaven Falcons are the true rulers of the Lonely River. If not for their dislike of the weather here and the preference to live in lush forests and towering mountains, we would never dare to occupy this area!”","At that point, an awkward expression appeared on Kani’s face. However, she could not hide anything from Lin Yuan. She knew that if Lin Yuan found out that she was hiding anything from him or lying to him, he would not only stop using her but would also punish her.","Lin Yuan had given her such an opportunity so soon after taking her in. She knew that this opportunity meant that he valued her. By hook or by crook, she was not going to let this chance slip by.","When Lin Yuan did not say anything after her explanation, Kani added, “The Spinning Wings White Falcons had a Holy Spirit expert 600 years ago. However, he still hasn’t been able to break through to Domain Mountain class.","“The Crimson Heaven Falcons must be much more powerful than the Spinning Wings White Falcons in order to make them their dependent species. All I know about the Crimson Heaven Falcons are rumors, so I can’t guarantee the accuracy. But there seems to be a lot of stock in one of the rumors.","“The Crimson Heaven Falcons have the power to make it to the top few ranks of the Species Ranking. Although there aren’t many members, they still have the power to conquer many species.","“The reason they decided not to enter the Species Ranking is that they’ve been holding out for an opportunity and can’t compete with all the species! Since the Crimson Heaven Falcons haven’t left North of the Lonely River, it must mean that that opportunity has yet to arrive!”","Lin Yuan’s eyes flashed. He never expected Kani to be unaware of even such details about the Crimson Heaven Falcons."]},{"number":2840,"title":"Chapter 2840 The Demon Insects Restarted!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2840 The Demon Insects Restarted!","But this also proved just how powerful the Crimson Heaven Falcons were!","Even the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ dependent species, the Spinning Wings White Falcons, were stronger than the King Blood Jackals.","Hence, it was unlikely that the Crimson Heaven Falcons would take notice of the King Blood Jackals.","Normally, a powerful species liked to protect lifeforms with the same type of bloodline they had. The King Blood Jackals did not qualify.","Spring said from the side, “Young Master, should we make contact with the Crimson Heaven Falcons? If you think we should, I can immediately get in touch with the Crimson Heaven Falcons!","“Alternatively, I can go ahead and take control of them directly. If the Crimson Heaven Falcons are truly staying here because they are holding out for an opportunity, this opportunity must be extremely important to them!","“This opportunity might be useful for us. The Crimson Heaven Falcons should be the descendants of a branch bloodline of an ancient bloodline. I never heard of the Crimson Heaven Falcons in the past.”","Spring and Summer were not at all concerned about the Crimson Heaven Falcons, who supported the Spinning Wings White Falcons. They were merely Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit. Such power was merely tier one in the East Universe.","Spring and Summer felt that they were undeserving of being taken seriously.","Spring had only made an example suggestion to Lin Yuan. However, her suggestion frightened Kani.","Kani thought that once she mentioned the Spinning Wings White Falcons and the Crimson Heaven Falcons who supported them, Lin Yuan would definitely take them seriously. Yet, Spring and Summer could not be less bothered by them.","It would be understandable if they had such an attitude towards the Spinning Wings White Falcons. After all, they only gained their first Holy Spirit Realm expert a few centuries ago. It was highly likely that the expert had not reached Domain Mountain.","However, it was arrogant to act that way toward the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons were very domineering. This could be seen from the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","She did not have the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ power.","Spring and Summer only learned about the Crimson Heaven Falcons from her. Even she was unaware of their power, much less Spring and Summer!","Was Spring not concerned that she would end up tripping and falling while trying to make contact with the Crimson Heaven Falcons?","The Crimson Heaven Falcons were very domineering. This could be seen from the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Kani did not know if she should give Lin Yuan a reminder.","The Crimson Heaven Falcons’ bloodline did not have as long of a legacy as the King Blood Jackals, but almost two epochs had passed since they reached their prime. They could be considered an established species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Was it certain that the Crimson Heaven Falcons were the descendants of the branch bloodline of an ancient bloodline just because Spring had never heard of them?","Kani found Spring rather arrogant but did not dare to upset her.","Firstly, it was clear that Spring and Lin Yuan were much closer than she and Lin Yuan. Moreover, Lin Yuan did not react after hearing what Spring said, meaning that he agreed with what she said.","Spring did not know what Kani was thinking, but if she did, she would not mind demonstrating her power to Kani. Spring did not want to be looked down on by an inferior lifeform, especially an inferior lifeform who would be following Lin Yuan in the future.","Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter were all dedicating their faith and loyalty to Lin Yuan. However, they felt uncontrollably superior to other lifeforms.","Wen Yu, Liu Jie, and the Moon Empress, who were more sensitive than others, realized this early on in their interactions with the four of them.","Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter’s attitudes only started changing slowly once they understood how Lin Yuan thought of them.","“Spring, the King Blood Jackals still have a pile of tasks to attend to. You can go and make contact with the Crimson Heaven Falcons after the villages have settled into the area around the King Blood Jackals’ territory and Sky City’s kingdom and supply of faith are built up! It will be difficult for us to manage all of them if we take on such an enormous operation at once.”","Lin Yuan had already decided that he would focus on developing the King Blood Jackals’ territory for now. On the way there, Sky Sea had passed many villages. Every weak species controlled a few villages. Lin Yuan intended to take control of all of these villages.","As for the weak species, the King Blood Jackals could take those with potential as servants. Those without potential would be given a stable environment where they could continue developing!","Once the trade chain was built, these species would be able to participate in trade with Listen. With the network of trade, all the species connected to it would be able to lead better lives. With a successful trade chain, it would also be easier for Sky City to gather resources.","In order to achieve this, Lin Yuan would need at least ten years.","Hence, Lin Yuan was not in a rush to begin working on too many activities.","While Sky City was developing stably in North of the Lonely River, Lin Yuan would explore the East Universe’s main area. Lin Yuan wanted to see how long it would take for information to travel out from North of the Lonely River.","When Kani saw the wild and bold manner in which Lin Yuan and his group acted, she never expected him to be so careful when it came to developing his commercial business. This was good news to her.","“Master, I will invite all the King Blood Jackals to a meeting later. Do you have any suggestions in terms of management? If you do, I will definitely act as per your instructions!”","Spring and Summer were very satisfied with Kani’s actions.","Lin Yuan had given her all the authority with regard to managing the King Blood Jackals, but they were still serving Sky City. Otherwise, there was no need for Lin Yuan to invest so much resources into nurturing the King Blood Jackals.","Lin Yuan was silent for a moment before saying to Kani, “In the future, you might be spending more time traveling with me than staying with the King Blood Jackals. So I hope that you will be able to nurture a few trustworthy managers who will truly be able to manage the King Blood Jackals as opposed to tools who will only listen to orders but are unable to make any decisions of their own!","“You will only be able to grow stronger if you stick by my side. Once you evolve to Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit, you will be the King Blood Jackals’ ruler forever!”","Kani never expected Lin Yuan to be willing to keep her by his side and take her out with him to train. This was an extremely rare opportunity for her!","If she was frequently by Lin Yuan’s side, she would become his close aide. With Lin Yuan’s generosity, there were many benefits to being his close aide.","Now that Kani had dedicated her loyalty to Lin Yuan, she would work hard for his sake. With her fountain of faith under his divine kingdom’s control, it was impossible for her to break free from him. However, this did not mean that she should stop trying to gain as many benefits as she could from him.","The part of becoming loyal to Lin Yuan that Kani looked forward to the most was not increasing her own power but the bright future that was in store for the King Blood Jackals once her power was increased.","After thinking for a moment, Kani said, “Master, I think your suggestion of having two rulers is a good one. I will select two outstanding King Blood Jackals and nurture them. They will take over the yoke of authority and oversee the King Blood Jackals.","“I will also assign four guards to each of these two King Blood Jackals. The eight King Blood Jackals will all be male. This will elevate the status of the male King Blood Jackals. Master, what do you think of my suggestion?”","When Lin Yuan made the suggestion of the two rulers to Kani, he had intended to pick a male and a female.","But now, she was going to pick two female rulers. This could be seen as trying to skew Lin Yuan’s plans.","However, Kani had insisted on this because she was the ruler of a matriarchy and looked down on the male King Blood Jackals. She did not want them to have the authority to rule over the King Blood Jackals. Allowing them to be the two female King Blood Jackal rulers’ guards was the biggest compromise she was willing to make!","She was worried that Lin Yuan would reject her suggestion. Hence, she even changed her original plan of having four male and four female guards to eight male guards.","Lin Yuan could see through Kani’s intentions. After pondering over it, he agreed to her plan.","A species that had been developing for all this time had to have its own unspoken norms and customs.","Lin Yuan did not want to change these norms and customs unnecessarily, especially if it was something that Kani was strongly opposed to.","By having eight King Blood Jackals guarding the two new rulers, the male King Blood Jackals’ status among the King Blood Jackals would already be elevated.","“Kani, you can call the shots on this matter. But I don’t want there to be any more rebellions from the male King Blood Jackals while they are under your charge!","“The King Blood Jackals will be responsible for the operations in the territory, and someone will get in contact with you. All the King Blood Jackals are outside the hall. Go and see them! Don’t allow anyone else to enter the inner palace before I leave.”","Kani performed a servant’s most respectful act towards Lin Yuan before leaving to reorganize the King Blood Jackals. She would smooth out all the kinks that could possibly destabilize the King Blood Jackals.","There was one thing that Kani did not tell Lin Yuan and would not be telling him, which was that she was the one who instigated the male King Blood Jackals’ rebellion.","Ripples like that were like waves that rolled across her peaceful life. They allowed her to nurture the best King Blood Jackals and remove those she did not like.","However, this ripple caused all of Kani’s playfulness to vanish because she realized that in the face of real problems, the ambition of the King Blood Jackals she had cultivated would end up seriously affecting her life!","Kani did not know what Lin Yuan saw in her that made him willing to nurture her. If he did not see something in her but was interested in other King Blood Jackals instead, the other King Blood Jackals would not try to plead for mercy for her. Rather, they would gleefully push her towards her doom!","After Kani left, she intentionally stationed two trusted aides by the palace’s entrance to prevent anyone from disturbing Lin Yuan. Kani did not want to think of herself as incompetent and unable to settle even something like this.","Once Kani left, Lin Yuan released Keira.","Keira was completely different from what she used to be.","Previously, she protected her one and only batch of insect eggs and held back in everything she did. As badly as she wanted to get on Lin Yuan’s good side, she never dared to use up the entire batch.","But now, she had hatched all of her insect eggs, accumulated 30 more batches, and had specially evolved many demon insects. These demon insects all had extremely strong functional abilities.","Keira felt that she could not compete with the demon insect queens in the West Universe now, but once she unleashed her accumulated power, she would rapidly be able to reach their level! Keira had been pleading with Lin Yuan and hoping that he would set her free to develop herself.","The demon insects’ development did not just depend on spirit qi. They also needed to absorb various lifeforms and their genes. They would then use the genes to produce more types of lifeforms.","After being released by Lin Yuan, Keira once again began pleading with him.","She was delighted that this time, he did not turn her down. Instead, he gave her a real opportunity.","“Keira, I have been restraining you because the time wasn’t right. But the time is right now. The demon insects shouldn’t exist for destruction. I told you this long ago. The demon insects also made a huge contribution to defending the main world during the dead spirits crisis. You also helped to rebuild the main world afterward.","“This version of the demon insects is the one that will be helpful to Sky City. As a ruler and leader, you must agree with what I’m saying. If the demon insects can only develop themselves through destruction, you will be nothing but tools forever.”","Keira was stunned when she heard what Lin Yuan said. But she soon nodded.","This was not the first time that he was telling her this.","At first, she did not agree with what he said. Rapid destruction and plundering were the demon insects’ way of life. If they did not do that, their development would be significantly hindered. In an unfamiliar environment, this did not benefit the demon insects.","But Keira slowly came to understand that the demon insects were dependent on Lin Yuan. They would never be able to obtain the same resources he provided them on their own.","Hence, the demon insects needed to cooperate with Lin Yuan’s plan.","This was the reason for them being by Lin Yuan’s side.","Reality proved that Lin Yuan had enabled the demon insects to develop faster than Keira had anticipated.","As such, Keira was very willing to work with Lin Yuan.","“Master, if you have any requests, just let me know. You don’t have to worry about the tasks you leave in my hand. I will carry them out carefully and properly!”"]},{"number":2841,"title":"Chapter 2841 All the Members in Attendance!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2841 All the Members in Attendance!","Regardless of how much wealth Ta Lei amassed in Thick Soil City, he would never have a better quality of life than the lifeforms who went to the Sky Beyond the Clouds and continuously evolved their life rank.","Before coming to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, no one had a frame of reference for what they could encounter there. Not even Lin Yuan knew what the Sky Beyond the Clouds would be like.","But ever since arriving at the Sky Beyond the Clouds and being exposed to this wide world filled with such exquisite spirit qi, Bai Qinghuan felt as though she were given a new lease on life!","Bai Qinghuan did not envy the strong. Rather, now that she was in this wider world, she wanted to use her own capabilities to change this world. She believed that Lin Yuan would be willing to give her the opportunity to do so.","Su Yiren, Luo Lan, Wen Yu, and Liu Jie shared the same ambitions as Bai Qinghuan.","Lin Yuan looked at Sky City’s main members, whose eyes were blazing with ambition, and said with a smile, “We haven’t had a proper meeting in a long time. We have gained our footing in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and need to begin our development! During this meeting, you will be given individual responsibilities, and we can discuss how you’ll carry out these responsibilities.”","While Lin Yuan was giving out his orders, he emanated the aura of a superior.","Lin Yuan never intended to discuss the responsibilities of Sky City’s members with them. Rather, he would make the decisions on his own.","Firstly, as Sky City’s leader, Lin Yuan was aware of each of their abilities and knew which direction would be best for them.","For some of them, like Su Yiren and Luo Lan, Lin Yuan had already communicated his plans to them.","But there were a few members whose roles had yet to be set. Lin Yuan was going to use this meeting to confirm their roles.","Wen Yu spoke first. “Young Master, you should be the one to decide all our directions and responsibilities. In the past, you gave us space to make our own decisions. But if you have any requests, just let us know, and all of us will do our best to fulfill them!”","Wen Yu’s words immediately garnered a response from the group.","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “Wen Yu, you will continue to serve as my assistant and help with Sky City’s overall tasks.","“If anyone encounters any issues in the future, continue to inform Wen Yu of them. Wen Yu will collate the information before giving me a report on them. I will be leaving Sky City soon and might not be returning for some time. During that time, all of you will be working under Wen Yu’s management.”","Lin Yuan’s words demonstrated Wen Yu’s importance, and once again, the group was reminded of her status in Sky City.","Recently, all of Sky City’s main members had obtained substantial power and authority. All of them competed fairly for faith power, and it was easy for them to forget the authority that Wen Yu held in Sky City. This would not benefit Wen Yu when she began managing Sky City in Lin Yuan’s stead.","Hence, Lin Yuan needed to say these things before he left.","All of their expressions froze momentarily before they began looking at Wen Yu differently.","Now that Wen Yu’s role had been declared, Lin Yuan hurriedly went on to address the plan for Liu Jie.","“Liu Jie, you will continue to manage the white-clothed followers and oversee all of the reserve and combat sequence members. Duan He and Zhou Luo will be your assistants and help you manage the white-clothed followers.","“Big Brother Liu, I suggest that you spend more time increasing your power. You are no longer restricted by the limited number of Firefly Demon Fetuses and will be able to turn all the carcinoma feys into fairies in a short time before beginning to nurture these fairies.","“I will give you all the resources you’ll need before I leave. As the leader of the white-clothed followers, increasing your power is a priority for you!”","Lin Yuan’s affection for Liu Jie shone through in his words, and his arrangement for Liu Jie cemented the latter’s position in Sky City.","Liu Jie had an unshakable hold on the third-place position in Sky City, and he had status equal to Wen Yu. The two of them and Lin Yuan made up the triangular pinnacle of Sky City’s pyramid.","Listen, Bei Xu, Su Yiren, Luo Lan, and the rest were all well aware of Liu Jie’s position.","Liu Jie had always presented himself as Lin Yuan’s retainer, but it was easy for others to underestimate him because he never undertook any of Sky City’s management tasks.","Liu Jie had spent some time learning from Bai Qinghuan, and the latter had looked down on him. She never expressed this view, but this was how she saw him. To her, he was all bravery but no strategic mind.","This did not refer to Liu Jie’s combat strategies. As the Heart of Insect Swarm that was acknowledged by the entire Radiance Hundred Sequence, Liu Jie’s combat strategies were not lacking, and he could command the army of insects to perfection.","The strategy that Bai Qinghuan was referring to was the management of Sky City’s internal affairs.","Lin Yuan assigned Liu Jie to manage the white-clothed followers and Duan He and Zhou Luo to assist him.","This made Liu Jie’s job extremely simple.","Zhou Luo and Duan He had joined Lin Yuan earlier than Bai Qinghuan did, and they were both very respectful toward Liu Jie. They would never cause any issues while they were assisting him.","Bai Qinghuan hoped that Lin Yuan would allow her to participate in large-scale battles in the future.","Large-scale battles would definitely require the support of Liu Jie, who led the white-clothed followers. Thus, Bai Qinghuan intended to find the opportunity to improve her relationship with Liu Jie properly.","None of Sky City’s members lacked resources, but they would not think of themselves as having too many resources, either.","Lin Yuan had asked Liu Jie to turn all of the insect-species carcinoma feys into fairies. Before leaving for the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Liu Jie had searched the entire main world for insect-species carcinoma feys, and he had brought almost all of them to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Liu Jie possessed more than 1,000 insect-species carcinoma feys and had nurtured all of them into fairies.","With the exclusion of Lin Yuan, Liu Jie was now the strongest member of Sky City and required an unimaginable amount of resources.","This knowledge affected Liu Jie as well.","He never expected Lin Yuan to use such a luxurious method to increase his power.","Liu Jie knew that Lin Yuan had to have thought the matter through carefully and deeply before making such an arrangement.","With a serious expression, Liu Jie said, “Young Master, I will nurture every fairy and will not let down the trust you have in me!”","Duan He and Zhou Luo were very anxious about their circumstances.","Both of them felt that they only managed to become Sky City’s main members because they became acquainted with Lin Yuan the earliest.","Zhou Luo was the first white-clothed follower Lin Yuan recruited, while Duan He was Sky City’s emperor-class expert. But now, that advantage had been nullified.","Now that Lin Yuan had given the two of them roles similar to what they had held in the past, Zhou Luo and Duan He relaxed fully.","Next, Lin Yuan moved on to Luo Lan and Su Yiren.","Su Yiren’s abilities were stronger than Luo Lan’s. Hence, Su Yiren took the lead when it came to governing the kingdom, while Luo Lan assisted her.","All of Sky City’s main members expected this, and Luo Lan agreed as well.","Even now, there were many things that Luo Lan could learn from Su Yiren.","Luo Lan had been growing rapidly, and Su Yiren had been teaching and guiding her because of the friendship they shared. The two of them were like teacher and student but were also sisters.","After settling Luo Lan and Su Yiren, Lin Yuan moved on to Listen and Endless Summer.","Lin Yuan mulled for a moment before he looked at Qin Yu and asked, “Qin Yu, I am now going to give you a choice. Are you going to manage the Lonely River as a means of training yourself like Bei Xu is going to do or will you join Listen and Endless Summer in building the trading network?","“The trading network is linked to Sky City’s assimilation into the Sky Beyond the Clouds. It will enable Sky City to have a stable source of the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ native resources. I will be giving a lot of support to the building of the trading network.”","Qin Yu used to work with Listen and Endless Summer. The three of them always butted heads over planning decisions.","Most of the time, they would end up following Listen’s decision. Occasionally, they could go with Endless Summer’s decision. Qin Yu did not feel like he was making much of a contribution, and he did not like that feeling.","Hence, despite Lin Yuan emphasizing the importance of the trading network and committing to investing numerous resources in this endeavor, Qin Yu did not intend to continue working with Listen and Endless Summer.","Firstly, it was difficult for him to stand out when he worked with them. Secondly, he shared Bei Xu’s preference for managing factions.","Previously, Qin Yu had only spent a short time learning from Jin Qianxun. Nonetheless, he had managed to organize Thick Soil City well, and there had been many things that Ta Lei needed to rely on Qin Yu for.","However, ever since managing Thick Soil City, Qin Yu had never had the chance to manage another faction or area.","Now that Lin Yuan was giving him the chance to choose, Qin Yu preferred to fight for his passions.","Qin Yu said firmly, “Young Master, just like Bei Xu, I would like to share your burdens. My talent for trading is mediocre, and I caused a lot of issues for Big Brother Listen and Big Sister Summer. I have always felt bad for that.”","Listen and Endless Summer had been working with Qin Yu for more than ten years and knew what troubled him.","It was true that he had made errors regarding planning for resource allocation, but his talent was not as lacking as he made it out to seem.","The talent to manage factions could also be translated to the allocation of resources.","Qin Yu might not have done as good of a job as Bei Xu, but he was not bad either!","The two of them wished Qin Yu a future that he would be satisfied with!","During this meeting, Lin Yuan would decide the development direction for all of Sky City’s key members, and this would essentially be permanent.","Lin Yuan approved of Qin Yu’s bravery in fighting for his future. “Okay. Since you’re interested in and have the determination to manage factions, you will assist Su Yiren and Luo Lan until a suitable territory for you to manage emerges!”","Qin Yu’s eyes filled with gratitude when he heard what Lin Yuan said.","By sending him to work with Su Yiren and Luo Lan, it was clear that Lin Yuan wanted him to work with them.","When it came to management, Qin Yu had only ever learned such skills from Jin Qianxun, who was very conservative and did not show any burning passion or determination for anything. All the skills that Qin Yu had learned were superficial.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan were more capable than Jin Qianxun when it came to this area.","If he were able to learn from them, he would definitely be able to improve his ability to manage factions in the future.","Qin Yu was on relatively good terms with both of them, and they were not considered rivals. He believed that they would be willing to teach him.","As Lin Yuan’s Path Protector, Blood Love would remain by Lin Yuan’s side in his future training and journeys. There was no need for him to make any arrangements for her.","Zong Ze and Gu Lang were part of Sky City now, but he had yet to assign them tasks that were related to Sky City. Instead, he had told them to spend time learning and gaining an understanding of Sky City.","After spending such a long time learning, both of them had to have come up with their own thoughts and opinions.","“Zong Ze and Gu Lang, which direction do the two of you want to take? Will you join the building of the trading network or work with Qin Yu in managing the faction?”","Gu Lang always had a clear plan for his life. He had been prepared from the moment he decided to follow Lin Yuan to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“City Lord, I hope to work with Listen and Endless Summer in establishing the trading network! That is where my skills lie. As a newcomer, I will take on a learner’s mindset when working with Listen and Endless Summer.”","Gu Lang’s tone was very humble, but he was not trying to come across in such a way. This was just his plan.","He needed to understand Listen and Endless Summer’s styles and rhythms before he could coordinate with them. The three of them would become a tight-knit and well-oiled team.","After hearing that Qin Yu experienced numerous issues working with Listen and Endless Summer, Gu Lang would try his best to avoid encountering such problems.","Gu Lang always admired Listen.","When Gu Lang first became acquainted with Lin Yuan, Listen had only been the manager of a small chamber of commerce.","Lin Yuan never stopped providing Listen with opportunities that would enable any chamber of commerce to rise in prominence.","After the dead spirits crisis ended, Listen used his abilities to form a trading network with all the main world’s federations. Even the Bamboo Monarch could not help but sing praises of Listen.","Gu Lang was very willing to work with such an outstanding figure because this was the only way he would be able to continuously improve.","Given Gu Lang’s understanding of Zong Ze, the latter would be uninterested in managing factions and building a trading network.","Even without his curse, Zong Ze was a fighter through and through."]},{"number":2842,"title":"Chapter 2842 Hu Quan’s Ambitions!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2842 Hu Quan’s Ambitions!","Zong Ze would not invest effort in roles he was uninterested in. Hence, he would definitely ask Lin Yuan for roles related to combat and fighting. This was exactly what happened.","Zong Ze told Lin Yuan straightforwardly, “City Lord, do you have any sectors related to combat that will allow me to train? I have always been skilled at combat. When I opened a chamber of commerce with Gu Lang, he handled most of the management responsibilities. I wasn’t any help at all! If I have to manage something or work with someone in such a role, I will become useless and have nothing to do!”","Zong Ze was very aware of his abilities and was unwilling to do anything he did not want to do. He detested being an inconvenience to others. Otherwise, he could have insisted on being assigned the same role as Gu Lang and sat back while Gu Lang did all the work. After all, given his relationship with Gu Lang, the latter would never resent him for acting this way.","Lin Yuan had thought about Zong Ze’s situation and had come up with an arrangement for him. Even if Zong Ze had not brought this up, Lin Yuan would not have sent Zong Ze to do something he was not skilled at doing.","Truthfully, aside from combat, Zong Ze was also skilled at the organization that came after a battle. Lin Yuan had discovered this while developing in the abyssal world alongside Zong Ze.","Before leaving the main world, Chef Supreme had intentionally visited Lin Yuan and told him all about Zong Ze.","Chef Supreme had watched Zong Ze grow up, and they became especially close after Li Changlin refused to receive Chef Supreme’s teachings. Moreover, Chef Supreme’s second disciple, Xia Chen, was fully focused on running the Kitchen Fragrance Palace. Hence, Chef Supreme had lavished all his love and affection on Zong Ze.","Chef Supreme had also told Lin Yuan about Zong Ze’s battle organization and planning talents.","Chef Supreme knew that Zong Ze did not like to brag about himself. If Lin Yuan was unobservant, Chef Supreme was certain that Zong Ze’s talents would go unnoticed for a long time. Telling Lin Yuan about all this was the final thing he could do for Zong Ze as his master.","Lin Yuan had begun making preparations for Zong Ze long ago.","“Zong Ze, I previously asked you to communicate with the demon insects. You must be very aware of the demon insects’ circumstances. I will be asking Keira and the demon insects to help with the migration of the villagers.","“Why don’t you stay with her and help with this task? Once the migration of the villages is completed, Keira will send the demon insects all over the territory to collect and take control of the other species. I’m sure you’re interested in this job as well!”","Zong Ze’s eyes lit up. He was not very interested in helping Keira with the migration of the villages, but he was far more interested in going with the demon insects to take over other species!","This direction perfectly aligned with Zong Ze’s adventurous spirit.","Zong Ze was not the only one whose eyes lit up when he heard Lin Yuan’s arrangements. Bai Qinghuan’s eyes lit up as well.","Bai Qinghuan was also interested in such a direction, but Lin Yuan had yet to assign a role to her. This caused her to feel rather disappointed.","Previously, she was the one who had made an error. Bai Qinghuan did not know if Lin Yuan was still angry with her.","Just like Zong Ze, Bai Qinghuan was also very willing to fight for her own opportunities. She mustered her courage and said, “City Lord, I would also like to go with Keira. With my talents, I will definitely be able to help her!","“Keira isn’t human, and the way she comprehends things differs from humans in certain ways. With me around, I will be able to prevent her from making the wrong choices! Please give me this opportunity. I won’t make the same mistake again.”","While Bai Qinghuan was begging Lin Yuan, she essentially put on a presentation, clearly describing her skills. She also expressed that she had learned from her previous actions, showing Lin Yuan that she had grown.","Bai Qinghuan was very enthusiastic. Her ability to deliver such a speech indicates not only her loyalty but also her sincere desire to contribute to the development of Sky City. This commitment goes beyond personal growth, highlighting her dedication to the city’s progress.","Given that she had learned from her mistake, Lin Yuan was willing to give her a chance.","Unlike Return to Ruins, Keira was unaware of Lin Yuan’s attitude toward Bai Qinghuan and would not leverage this to bully her. Keira was also able to communicate with Lin Yuan anytime she wanted and only listened to Lin Yuan’s orders.","Without direct orders from Lin Yuan, not even Liu Jie, Wen Yu, or the Moon Empress could get Keira to do anything!","Wen Yu and Liu Jie needed to contact Lin Yuan each time they needed help from the demon insects.","If Bai Qinghuan had not learned from her mistake and continued doing whatever she wanted, Keira would give Bai Qinghuan a rude wake-up call.","Bai Qinghuan’s abilities were still formidable. Once she arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds, her abilities elevated significantly from the level they were at in the main world.","But none of these were the reasons Lin Yuan was giving her another chance.","If Bai Qinghuan didn’t grasp the lesson from her previous experience, Lin Yuan would kick her out of Sky City’s group of main members and relegate her to the ranks of the white-clothed followers’ reserve sequence.","“Okay. Since you’ve admitted and reflected on your previous mistake, you can work with Keira and Zong Ze in the future!”","Now, among all of Sky City’s main members, Hu Quan was the only one who did not have a plan laid out for him.","Hu Quan had been working doggedly by Lin Yuan’s side for the past few years. He and his disciples had worked tirelessly to build Sky City and infrastructure in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. Even a regular person who had contracted the Vitality Sloth would not work themselves to such a degree.","First, Lin Yuan acknowledged Hu Quan’s contributions to Sky City before asking him, “Hu Quan, you are still Sky City’s head designer and are in charge of construction. What plans do you have for your future development?”","Lin Yuan was showing Hu Quan the greatest respect by asking him such a question at this meeting.","Hu Quan hurriedly stood up before bowing to Lin Yuan. “City Lord, please don’t say that! For years, you provided me with precious resources that I have never even seen before in my life and enabled my Spirit Craftsman class to rise continuously. This is enough for you to recruit all the Spirit Craftsmen in the world!","“You also allowed me to contract the Lifespan Mouse and obtain an endless lifespan. Now, I don’t have to worry about falling sick and old and eventually dying. I am able to endlessly challenge my Spirit Craftsman class. You have given me the life I always wanted! So please don’t be so polite or courteous to me!”","Hu Quan also wanted to say that Lin Yuan’s ideas were the spark for many of his inspirations. But after thinking about it, Hu Quan decided not to say that.","If he said that, the other members of Sky City would think that he was trying to flatter Lin Yuan.","After all, Lin Yuan was not a Spirit Craftsman.","However, to Hu Quan, this was the truth!","Now that Hu Quan had said all that he wanted to say, he began describing his plan for the future.","As a workaholic, Hu Quan had carefully analyzed his future direction from the moment he arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds. He knew that his decisions affected not only himself but also the disciples who followed him and devoted themselves to him over the years.","He now possessed all the Spirit Craftsman techniques in the main world. He had surpassed all other Spirit Craftsmen in the main world.","Nonetheless, Hu Quan felt that this was not enough if he wanted to remain by Lin Yuan’s side.","There were many beautiful structures in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Take the King Blood Jackals’ castle as an example. It had a rough beauty and looked as though it had not been carved or sculpted with care. But on the inside, one would immediately realize that this castle was filled with details.","Hu Quan honestly laid out his requests.","“City Lord, if it’s possible, I hope that you can assign a few experts to me who will accompany me to train. We will learn about the techniques of building the various species’ structures and buildings!","“I will do my best to pick and incorporate the best aspects while filtering out the useless ones. If you happen across any native Spirit Craftsmen in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, please bring them here so I can spar and learn from them!”","Lin Yuan smiled when he heard what Hu Quan said.","Hu Quan’s plan was exceptionally clear, and Lin Yuan did not need to worry about him.","It would be easy for him to assign a few experts to Hu Quan to accompany him in his travels! As for whether Lin Yuan would be able to find native Spirit Craftsmen from the Sky Beyond the Clouds with whom Hu Quan would be able to interact, he would try his best, as Hu Quan had specially mentioned it.","“Uncle Hu, the Spirit Craftsmen under you might not have reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom like you have, but all of them are indisputable birth horoscope experts. The increase in their spiritual power will allow them to contract more feys.”","Hu Quan hurriedly said, “City Lord, that is exactly what I have in mind. So far, we have only contracted native feys from the main world. Even if we pick up some of the architectural techniques from the Sky Beyond the Clouds, we won’t be able to execute them without the proper feys. If we can form contracts with feys from the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the Spirit Craftsmen will definitely be able to renovate Sky City into a better version in the future!”","Lin Yuan said seriously, “Uncle Hu, I will look carefully for such feys while I am on my journeys. However, the most important part will be waiting for you to deepen your understanding of the Sky Beyond the Clouds so you can choose the feys yourself.”","Once Lin Yuan and Hu Quan were done speaking, the meeting of Sky City’s main members officially came to an end.","Technically, Sky City had another main member—Chu Ci.","It was Chu Ci’s own decision not to participate in this meeting.","After speaking with Su Yiren, Luo Lan, and the rest, Chu Ci realized just how lacking her abilities were. She had only managed to reach the same level as the rest of them because Lin Yuan had nurtured her. But when it came to intelligence and strategizing, she was a far cry from the rest!","This was related to her talent as well as the education she had received.","In their youth, Chu Ci and Lin Yuan faced the challenge of survival. Chu Ci had dedicated herself to her school lessons, driven by a dual purpose: to bring happiness to Lin Yuan through her academic success and to secure scholarships that could alleviate Lin Yuan’s financial struggles.","Chu Ci had held onto that mindset for 16 years.","But in the first 16 years of Luo Lan, Su Yiren, Gu Lang, and the rest’s lives, they had received only the best education. They had been taught not just the knowledge that regular spirit qi professionals needed to know but also knowledge pertaining to management and business.","This gave them an enormous advantage that Chu Ci did not have. In the past 20-odd years, Chu Ci had concentrated on improving her combat skills and battle strategies. If she had to fight Zong Ze or Gu Lang, she would stand a good chance of winning.","But in terms of managing trade and governance abilities, she could not hold a candle to Zong Ze, Gu Lang, Su Yiren, and Luo Lan!","Chu Ci intended to spend some time learning these skills from Cold Moon and Mystic Moon.","If she took on tasks on Sky City’s behalf without gaining any skills, she would make blunders or embarrass Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was surprised by Chu Ci’s attitude.","He felt that Chu Ci was always anxious to prove herself. Yet, when the opportunity arose, she lacked confidence and decided to work on her failings instead.","In the future, she would be able to gain a fresh perspective on management and participate in meetings with Sky City’s other main members.","When the meeting ended, Lin Yuan returned to his room on Sky Sea’s back and began nurturing the King Blood Jackal bloodline he had absorbed into his body! New ????? ?hapters are published on N(o)v?l(?)ire.n?t","While he evolved the bloodline, he attempted to merge it with his body.","In an instant, his eyes turned golden-red, and a ravaging bloodlust erupted from his body.","Lin Yuan’s facial features started changing, and his muscles expanded.","When Blood Love, who was in Lin Yuan’s hair, saw what was happening to him, her heart began pounding like a drum.","At that moment, he could not be more attractive to her.","This erupting wildness was on a completely different level from the oppressed male King Blood Jackals.","Kani’s aura was similar to Lin Yuan’s current one.","However, from the moment Blood Love became acquainted with Kani, the latter was a prisoner.","Kani was fully under Spring and Summer’s thumb. She did not have the formidability of the queen of the King Blood Jackals at all.","Lin Yuan did not notice the change in his appearance.","His golden hair fell past his ears and tickled his ears.","The King Blood Jackal bloodline caused Lin Yuan’s hair to become much stronger than before.","Lin Yuan now felt that his body was full of explosive energy and sensed that he was now even able to control metals."]},{"number":2843,"title":"Chapter 2843 Advancement of the King Blood!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2843 Advancement of the King Blood!","Every time Lin Yuan acquired a different bloodline, he felt that he had improved to a different extent.","This made him understand how powerful his Body of All Spirits was.","As Lin Yuan absorbed more and more bloodlines through the Body of All Spirits, he was able to apply the best method to deal with any circumstances.","As time passed day by day, Blood Love could feel that Lin Yuan’s aura was becoming unusually cheerful.","Lin Yuan was expending a large amount of resources to nurture the King Blood Jackal bloodline in his body.","His peak King Blood Jackal bloodline was gradually improving.","Lin Yuan’s aura underwent a sudden and dramatic transformation as his golden hair extended to his back.","His golden hair stood on end, emanating a much stronger aura.","A dark gold hue manifested in Lin Yuan’s reddish-gold eyes, intensifying his cold-blooded appearance.","This aura frightened Blood Love.","However, Blood Love quickly came back to her senses and exclaimed, “Lin Yuan, did you upgrade the King Blood Jackal bloodline to the Emperor Blood grade? I feel that the pressure of your bloodline is at least ten times stronger than before.”","Lin Yuan smiled and nodded.","The King Blood Jackal bloodline in his body could be said to be the highest level of bloodline stored in the Body of All Spirits.","Compared to the mermaid emperor bloodline, the Alluring Fox bloodline was of a higher level.","However, the bloodline that he had spent more than 20 days carefully strengthening was soon going to be provided to the King Blood Jackal Queen, Kani.","If he provided Kani with the emperor bloodline he had nurtured, it would become the seed for the advancement of Kani’s bloodline.","It would induce Kani’s bloodline grade to transform from King Blood to Emperor Blood grade.","When that time came, there would be a Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit expert under Lin Yuan’s command.","After Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter, Sky City finally had a person who could take charge!","This made Lin Yuan’s investment meaningful.","If the emperor bloodline was provided to Kani and she still did not manage to advance, there would really be no need for Lin Yuan to waste his resources.","During the process of nurturing the King Blood Jackal bloodline, Lin Yuan had been learning about Sky City’s recent development through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","After Lin Yuan sent out Keira, the mobilization speed of the insect swarm was extremely fast.","In less than half a day, Keira had created teams that could support the village’s migration with the Class 2 Genetic Lock demon insects as the core according to Lin Yuan’s request.","Then, these teams would be put into use.","A Class 2 Genetic Lock demon insect possessed an extremely high IQ. However, regardless of how high its IQ was, a Class 2 Genetic Lock demon insect could not handle everything alone.","Owing to Lin Yuan’s request to Keira, each team was equipped with three to five Class 3 Genetic Lock demon insects.","As a result, the Genetic Lock demon insects did not cause any trouble during the past 20 days.","Zong Ze and Bai Qinghuan had already arrived beside Keira.","The two of them had already known that the swarm led by Keira was extremely powerful.","They had helped humans resist the nest of dead spirits in the main world and had never been at a disadvantage in the battle against the tide of dead spirits.","Zong Ze and Bai Qinghuan had overestimated the demon insects. However, when they actually came into contact with them, they realized that the demon and alien insects were completely different.","The power of the demon insects was not something alien insects could compare to.","The demon insects were no less intelligent than humans. In fact, in some large-scale operations, the demon insects knew how to listen to orders better than humans.","Zong Ze and Bai Qinghuan did not focus on the demon insects’ management.","The demon insects were fully managed by Keira, their queen.","If Zong Ze and Bai Qinghuan focused on managing the demon insects, it would be equivalent to threatening Keira’s status. This would fundamentally break off the cooperation between the three. The source of this content ?s Nov?l??re.?et","Zong Ze knew his strengths very well.","Zong Ze asked Keira for ten demon insect squads and instructed them to clean the original infrastructure of those villages. He then gathered all the useful resources and got the demon insects to erase all traces of life in these villages.","This was to prevent any faction from crossing the Lonely River one day and discovering the situation in North of the Lonely River.","This kingdom, with the King Blood Jackals’ territory as its core, had just been established.","Bai Qinghuan didn’t give Keira any opinions during the demon insect squad’s village migration process.","Bai Qinghuan’s mind was on the demon insects spreading in the wilderness of North of the Lonely River and controlling the battles of the other species.","Only when that time came would she be able to display her intelligence.","Bai Qinghuan was extremely happy that Lin Yuan had arranged for Zong Ze to work with her.","More than ten years ago, Bai Qinghuan had been at the lowest point of her life.","Back then, Bai Qinghuan had been taught a lesson by Return to Ruins. She had almost thought that Lin Yuan was prepared to abandon her and not put her in an important position.","At that time, Bai Qinghuan met Zong Ze by chance.","Zong Ze had heard about Bai Qinghuan’s strong strategic sense, prompting him to seek a conversation with her. Following a deep discussion, he extended an invitation for her to join him at the intersection of the main world and the dimensional rift, where they trained together for nearly two years.","Subsequently, Bai Qinghuan found herself admiring Zong Ze.","For individuals dedicated to pursuing their values, love wasn’t deemed a mandatory life choice.","Thus, Bai Qinghuan concealed her admiration, recognizing the similarity between herself and Zong Ze—they both fervently pursued their values.","Now, with the opportunity to collaborate, she anticipated more frequent interactions with Zong Ze than in the past.","Even if she didn’t have a future with Zong Ze, she could still derive a lot of pleasure from their interactions.","...","Listen was already familiar with planning trade routes.","In the beginning, Listen had been managing the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce in the Radiance Federation, and the chamber’s route had been confirmed long ago.","The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s original accumulation process mainly relied on cooperation with Hu Quan’s Heavenly Craft Pavilion.","Listen displayed his talent in managing the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce.","It was on his way to the Startling Lines Continent that Listen first set out to build a trade route.","At first, the trade route was limited to the Divine Wood Federation, but Lin Yuan gradually gave Listen a wider platform.","The Startling Lines Continent’s three federations were all under Lin Yuan’s control. Listen had completely connected the three federations’ trade lines and revived the Startling Lines Continent’s economy, making it rich.","Taking advantage of the dead spirits crisis, Listen also helped the Radiance Federation perfect the trade chain.","The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce had set up three-figure branches in every big city.","There were thousands of branches in the Radiance Federation so that the more remote prefectures and counties in the various large cities would not have to worry about obtaining resources.","This allowed outstanding spirit qi professionals to appear in the remote prefectures and counties in the Radiance Federation.","With the Radiance Federation as the core, Listen structured the entire world’s trade system and received the Moon Empress’s great recognition.","Listen’s ability allowed him to sort out the trade chains within the King Blood Jackals in just 20 days.","The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce was reopened in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Listen had asked Lin Yuan about the chamber of commerce’s name.","The Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce was Listen’s obsession, but he was afraid that Lin Yuan would have a problem with this name now.","Lin Yuan did not change the name of the chamber of commerce. First of all, the name was of no great matter.","No matter how far this chamber of commerce developed in the future, it would be managed by Sky City.","Secondly, Lin Yuan found the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce’s name very intimate.","Listen could be considered a veteran figure in Sky City.","Apart from Liu Jie and Wen Yu, Listen had been by Lin Yuan’s side the longest.","Lin Yuan would give Listen absolute freedom over such a small matter.","Endless Summer and Gu Lang did not participate in the construction of the chamber of commerce’s trade chain. The two of them began to travel around the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","They wanted to see if there were any resources worth developing and nurturing.","Listen was not in a hurry to take out the many resources brought by the main world. They would be stored in the intermediate spatial equipment without any losses. Even if these resources were sold, they could only be exchanged for resources that could be collected in the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","Listen suddenly had an idea. If he really wanted to open the trade chain, he could not only trade with the species in the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","Allowing these communities to interact with resources was no different from opening a grocery store in an intermediate district.","What Listen needed was the trade of supplies in the King Blood Jackals’ territory with external supplies. Then, they would earn a lot of profits from the trade with external supplies.","Listen wanted to cooperate with Bei Xu after Lin Yuan expressed that he wanted to trade the supplies produced by the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River in the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","Lin Yuan agreed with Listen’s idea.","However, the most important thing now was to build the trade chain in the territory.","Lin Yuan told Listen to wait until the trade chain in the King Blood Jackals’ territory was completed and circulated smoothly. He would get Bei Xu to bring Listen and the leaders of the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords together to discuss trade matters.","Listen was pleasantly surprised when he received Lin Yuan’s reply. He was a very ambitious person, especially since he had already successfully experienced the feeling of strategizing. Now that he was in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Lin Yuan was still willing to give himself space to showcase his ambitions!","...","The Moon Empress and Wen Yu were in charge of Sky City’s situation.","This meant that Lin Yuan only needed to make decisions for many things.","Wen Yu had always been self-aware of her abilities. Back at the main world, she had been mainly responsible for helping Lin Yuan gather information.","Sky City’s other members did not send messages to Lin Yuan much, so Wen Yu could handle it by herself.","But now, everything was in a state of waiting in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","There was too much news rushing to him every day.","If not for the Moon Empress’ help, Wen Yu would not have been able to handle it.","Wen Yu was extremely grateful to the Moon Empress and became even more respectful toward her. After all, she had learned a lot from the Moon Empress.","During her time with the Moon Empress, Wen Yu was able to notice her improvement every day.","...","Lin Yuan returned to the King Blood Jackals’ palace.","Kani was standing in front of Lin Yuan with an expectant and nervous expression.","According to the previous agreement, Lin Yuan was there to help her improve her bloodline. This was the closest she had ever been to the Emperor Blood grade.","Kani hoped to seize this opportunity no matter what!","Lin Yuan sensed Kani’s nervousness and spoke very seriously. “Whether you can improve this time is indeed very important, but it doesn’t mean that you won’t have another chance to improve after you can’t improve this time.","“All you have to do is grab as much as you can.","“Haven’t you always been looking forward to the Emperor Blood grade? I’ll give you the emperor bloodline now!”","Lin Yuan activated his Body of All Spirits and released the emperor bloodline that he had nurtured.","Feeling the bloodline pressure, Kani subconsciously knelt on the ground with admiration in her eyes.","Upon seeing Kani’s expression, Lin Yuan knew that it was because of the bloodline worship.","This King Blood Jackal bloodline worship was not inferior to the mermaid bloodline worship!","It might even be stronger. Otherwise, there was no need for Kani, the King Blood Jackal Queen, to immediately lower herself after sensing the emperor bloodline.","The moment Kani recovered from the bloodline worship, she could not hide her astonishment.","Kani had never expected that Lin Yuan would extract a portion of her bloodline and transform it in just 20 days!","How shocking was that!?","Kani had indeed heard from Lin Yuan that he wanted to nurture the bloodline she provided. However, she had never thought that Lin Yuan could raise her bloodline to this level.","If she injected fresh emperor bloodline into her body, with the strength of her current bloodline, her bloodline transformation could be said to be a sure bet.","Moreover, this emperor bloodline was nurtured with her own bloodline. Implanting it into her body would not cause much rejection and pose a threat to her safety.","“Master, thank you for nurturing me. When my bloodline advances, I will definitely do my best to repay Master’s kindness!”","Lin Yuan waved his hand. “As long as you work hard for me in the future, your current advancement is only the beginning. You’ll have more opportunities in the future!”","Lin Yuan could not help but think of White Speak as he looked at Kani.","White Speak had always been working for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan originally wanted to bring White Speak to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, but White Speak wanted to stay in the main world.","Previously, when Lin Yuan asked his subordinates for their opinions, White Speak had hesitantly explained his decision to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan had not forced White Speak to stay in the main world.","Just like the Samsara Realm Dictators in the dimensional worlds, Lin Yuan did not take any of them with him.","It wasn’t that Lin Yuan didn’t want to take them away, but these Samsara Realm Dictators all belonged to the power of the main world.","Taking them away would greatly affect the main world’s strength.","Even if there would be a conflict between humans and dimensional lifeforms in the main world sooner or later, Lin Yuan still hoped to use these Samsara Realm Dictators under his control to exchange for tens of thousands of years of peace between humans and dimensional lifeforms.","Although Lin Yuan had not left the main world for long, he was already starting to miss his hometown!"]},{"number":2844,"title":"Chapter 2844 Divine Kingdom Ability: Jackal-Devouring Purgatory!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2844 Divine Kingdom Ability: Jackal-Devouring Purgatory!","It was only the Radiance Federation’s experts, dimensional worlds’ Dictators, the Heavenly Family Cottage, the Vast Sea Labyrinth, and other top factions that were aware of what Lin Yuan had done for the main world.","However, these people did not know everything.","This included White Speak and Eternal Source, who had been Lin Yuan’s subordinates for a long time.","White Speak wanted to stay in the main world.","Eternal Source wanted to follow Lin Yuan to the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan had taken away the mermaids, leaving only the sea beasts and sea clans in the water world.","However, many lifeforms in the marsh world had adapted very well to life in the sea.","The marsh world itself was an environment where the ratio of water to swamp was five times that of land.","In the marsh world, the water was divided into shallow and deep pools. The shallow pools could reach a depth between 50 and 300 meters. Meanwhile, the deep pools were like a bottomless abyss, tens of thousands of meters deep.","The salt in the sea was nothing to swamp lifeforms.","The Marsh Crocodiles had lived in the sea for a period of time, and they had begun to treat the salt in the sea as their source of energy.","Among the marsh Dictators, Eternal Source was the strongest.","If Lin Yuan had not left Eternal Source in the main world, he would not have been at ease.","Once the lifeforms in the marsh world were unable to be in harmony with the sea clans, there would be a conflict. Even if both sides suppressed the dispute in the beginning, there would inevitably be problems in the long run.","If the problem surfaced under long-term suppression, it would likely trigger a war between the sea clans and the dimensional lifeforms of the marsh world.","By that time, the entire main world would be involved.","Lin Yuan hoped that Kani would be by his side in the future and would be able to replace White Speak and Eternal Source perfectly.","“Kani, continue sensing the Emperor Blood’s aura first. When your body has adapted to the aura and is no longer easily influenced by it, proceed to absorb the emperor bloodline into your body.","“By that time, I’ll use a large amount of pure spirit qi to help you break through.","“You don’t have to concern yourself with resources or resisting the world wills. Your sole focus should be on fusing the bloodline.”","Kani felt an indescribable warmth in her heart when she heard Lin Yuan’s words.","Kani was not born as the queen of the King Blood Jackals. Instead, she was just like most female King Blood Jackals. She had to take one step at a time and experience countless changes and opportunities, narrowly escaping death to reach her current position.","The King Blood Jackals had abnormally cold-blooded tendencies.","Female King Blood Jackals would be directly dealt with by the queen if they overstepped their boundaries.","Their bloodlines would be given as a reward to the other King Blood Jackals who performed relatively well.","Living in such an environment, the King Blood Jackals naturally hoped that someone from their species would offend the queen. That way, an opportunity would arise for them to enhance their bloodlines.","Kani had only ever received warmth from her mother when she was still a young jackal.","However, Lin Yuan attended to her more attentively than her mother had in the past. He only needed her to put her whole focus on enhancing her bloodline.","Kani found this to be the most gentle form of protection.","Previously, Kani had only felt submissive toward Lin Yuan, but she now felt a deeper dependence on him.","Kani suddenly realized that she had a target she could rely on in the future!","Kani calmed down, quietly felt the aura, and discovered that the emperor bloodline, which should have been extremely violent, emitted a refreshing and gentle smell instead.","The smell was very similar to the aura that Lin Yuan exuded.","This was probably because the emperor bloodline was brewing in Lin Yuan’s body and was tainted by his aura!","Lin Yuan absorbed the King Blood Jackal bloodline that she had given him and transformed it into Emperor Blood grade in just 20 days.","Kani had no idea what method Lin Yuan had used.","However, Kani was certain that Lin Yuan’s bloodline was much more advanced than hers!","If not for the fact that the upper bloodline nurtured the lower bloodline, it would be impossible for the lower bloodline to undergo a rapid transformation.","Kani had always been proud of her bloodline, but the current situation forced her to accept the fact that her bloodline was inferior to Lin Yuan.","It took Kani nearly half a day to reach a point where she was minimally affected by the emperor bloodline’s aura.","Kani tried to absorb the emperor bloodline into her body. The moment it entered her body, Kani felt like she was in a huge furnace.","She could feel her skin and flesh melting under the intense heat of the furnace.","Kani guarded her mind and circulated the peak King Blood Jackal bloodline in her body to contain and absorb the emperor bloodline.","The bloodline came from the same source, so the absorption speed was not slow.","However, absorbing the emperor bloodline required Kani to expend a large amount of energy.","Based on the current energy consumption, the energy in her body might be exhausted in less than ten minutes. Once the energy was exhausted, the emperor bloodline that had yet to be absorbed would wreak havoc in her body. Her body would be riddled with gaping wounds in an extremely short period.","At that moment, Kani saw Lin Yuan bring out a few wooden boxes made of completely jade-textured wood.","Fully jade-textured wood in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was considered a luxury commodity.","In a pure spirit qi environment, wood attaining a fully jade-like texture would absorb spirit qi.","Absorbing it meant that it would cause the loss of spirit qi.","Those factions with pure spirit qi would not be willing to spend it on nurturing completely jade-textured wood.","When Lin Yuan opened the wooden box, Kani was completely stunned by the scene before her.","These wooden boxes were densely packed with spirit qi crystals. There were probably more than 10,000 spirit qi crystals in each wooden box.","Lin Yuan took out these spirit qi crystals in front of him. Clearly, these spirit qi crystals were used to replenish his energy.","The King Blood Jackals had been running this place for nearly two eras. It was impossible for Kani to get the King Blood Jackals to take out so many resources.","Moreover, if a species wanted to become stronger, hoarding resources was counterproductive. These resources could be immediately converted into strength. The earlier they were utilized, the stronger the species would be.","This way, the species could snowball and increase the speed at which they collected resources.","The resources of the King Blood Jackals had basically been used up by Kani.","In fact, when Kani’s bloodline was stuck at the peak King Blood Jackal bloodline, she had also tried to make a breakthrough in her bloodline.","Every attempt would consume a portion of the King Blood Jackals’ foundation.","Kani had almost exhausted said foundation. Otherwise, when Lin Yuan helped her bloodline break through, Kani would have prepared more resources to express the importance she placed on improving her strength and bloodline!","Lin Yuan didn’t hesitate to use the Source Sand to crush the spirit qi crystals one after another.","The speed at which the spirit qi crystals shattered was comparable to the speed at which Kani absorbed the spirit qi.","Lin Yuan placed his palm on Kani’s back, and pure spirit qi continuously poured into her body to help her transform her bloodline.","Lin Yuan knew very well that helping Kani advance to Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit Realm was not a small project. It would take a long time.","Fortunately, Lin Yuan could divert his attention to deal with Sky City’s matters while helping Kani advance.","Actually, when Lin Yuan first saw Kani, he had already used Morbius’ True Data to investigate her.","The King Blood Jackal bloodline was abnormally violent. Almost all of Kani’s abilities and exclusive skills were geared toward enhancing her offensive abilities.","Kani could also use her bloodline to control metals to nurture exclusive weapons compatible with her combat style.","This weapon was different from the weapon transformed by a lifeform’s Body Weaponization in the main world.","Weapons nurtured by Kani’s bloodline could be mass-produced.","Kani herself was an abnormally powerful armory!","Among all her skills and exclusive skills, Kani’s most eye-catching feature was her divine kingdom ability, Jackal-Devouring Purgatory.","Once Kani’s domain-type divine kingdom ability was activated, the lifeforms in the domain would be bitten and devoured by the shadow of a wild jackal comparable to Kani’s own strength.","This biting and devouring would not end until Kani took the initiative to stop using her divine kingdom ability. ???? ????s? ???????s ?? ?ovel??re.?et","Moreover, these bites and devouring would not only affect the body but also the mind and soul.","Among all the divine kingdom abilities that Lin Yuan had seen, this one was the most offensive!","None of the divine kingdom abilities of the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River could compare to Kani’s divine kingdom ability.","This was also the reason why Lin Yuan was willing to nurture Kani despite spending so much effort and resources.","...","While Lin Yuan was nurturing Kani, Fan Lou had returned to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ palace to report to Feng Qing.","Fan Lou was still as respectful to Feng Qing as usual.","However, Fan Lou’s eyes were filled with deep disdain for Feng Qing.","After witnessing Lin Yuan’s strength, Feng Qing was no longer worshipped by Fan Lou.","As someone close to Lin Yuan, Fan Lou perceived that his status was higher than Feng Qing’s.","Despite having such thoughts, Fan Lou did not let Feng Qing notice anything amiss.","Feng Qing personally welcomed Fan Lou and greeted him in front of his other subordinates. He was very happy that Fan Lou could return safely.","After Fan Lou’s departure, Feng Xuan had returned to Feng Qing’s side as his assistant. However, Feng Qing felt that Feng Xuan could not compare to Fan Lou in any way.","Feng Qing didn’t even ask about the details of Fan Lou’s trip and helped the latter improve his bloodline.","Fan Lou accepted the upgrade of his bloodline with a clear conscience. He knew very well that he would completely become a core member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves in the future.","Not only that, but he would only establish contact with the Bloodians after the Dark Pufferfish emissary negotiated with them.","By that time, his status would become much higher than it was now!","Fan Lou first reported the situation to Feng Qing.","If it were in the past, Fan Lou would definitely praise the captain of the Forbidden Wolf Team, Feng Nuo.","However, Fan Lou did not do so this time because he no longer regarded a figure like Feng Nuo with any significance.","Before heading to the Lonely River, Fan Lou had still paid attention to Feng Xuan.","However, if Feng Xuan were to look for Fan Lou to discuss collaboration now, he would not give him any attention.","Feng Xuan could no longer threaten him in any way.","Feng Qing took the Dark Pufferfish’s venom from Fan Lou. Although there wasn’t much of it, it was enough for him to report to the Bloodians.","Feng Qing didn’t want the Bloodians to start a war with the mermaids from the bottom of his heart. Once the Bloodians started a war with the mermaids, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves would most likely be forced to participate.","If it were for the benefit of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, it would be fine if they suffered losses. However, the war between the Bloodians and the mermaids had nothing to do with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves no matter what benefits the Bloodians obtained.","“Lord Feng Qing, I spent a great deal of effort finding some Lonely River specialties for you.”","With that, Fan Lou handed Feng Qing the resources he had prepared in advance.","These resources were not much, but they were enough to stir Feng Qing’s heart.","Fan Lou had always known his limits.","After Fan Lou became Lin Yuan’s subordinate, they no longer lacked resources. Still, Fan Lou would not prepare too many resources for Feng Qing because of this mission.","In the beginning, Feng Qing was undoubtedly happier to receive a large number of resources than now. However, Feng Qing would inevitably have to contemplate it subsequently.","If he established connections with the Bloodians in the future, he would still have to rely on Feng Qing.","This was because Lin Yuan thought highly of him. The most important reason was that he had to take care of the Class 2 world.","Feng Qing took the resources that Fan Lou had given him.","The Lonely River was a remote place. The resources were definitely not as much as the area where the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were located.","These resources were nothing to him. The only highlight was the strong exotic charm.","However, these resources were not a small sum for Fan Lou.","The resources that Fan Lou had obtained could be put into his own pocket.","People were really afraid of comparison. In comparison, Fan Lou was much better than Feng Xuan!","“Fan Lou, you did very well this time. If you have anything you want, just tell me. Your contribution to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves is substantial. There’s no need to withhold your requests!”","Fan Lou looked at the expression on Feng Qing’s face and knew that Feng Qing was indeed extremely happy because of his actions. Yet, what Feng Qing said now was only casual and was not to be taken seriously at all!","If he really dared to demand an exorbitant price because of his contribution this time, even if Feng Qing might not immediately sever ties with him, he would definitely have a bad impression of him in the future.","If Fan Lou really wanted resources, he could ask Lin Yuan for them.","Lin Yuan was many times more generous than Feng Qing.","Moreover, everything that Lin Yuan gave him was beneficial to him.","No matter how much Feng Qing valued him, it was impossible for him to provide him with such pure spirit qi.","Fan Lou was prepared to take this opportunity to borrow Feng Qing’s power to control the entire Sixth Boundary Patrol Team completely. After that, even if the supervisors of Honor Absent Palace carried out a surprise inspection, they could let him know in advance.","As a member of the Honor Absent Palace Parliament, Feng Qing could do this if he was willing to put in some effort.","“Lord Feng Qing, I do have a request. I’ve been a Boundary Patrol Envoy of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team for more than 600 years. I have a deep attachment to my role as a Boundary Patrol Envoy.","“I hope you can help me enhance my authority over the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team. Let’s minimize the interference of the Spacetime Supervisory Council in the management of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team.”"]},{"number":2845,"title":"Chapter 2845 The Holy Spirit Divine Kingdom Ability!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2845 The Holy Spirit Divine Kingdom Ability!","Feng Qing didn’t want Fan Lou to ask for too much.","Fan Lou had indeed made great contributions to himself and the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. However, taking the initiative to claim credit meant that Fan Lou prioritized his own interests highly. This would imply that Fan Lou had a hidden motive for helping him.","If that was the case, no matter how much Feng Qing liked Fan Lou, he would not be able to put Fan Lou in an important position.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, there was no lack of people who would risk their safety to fight for their future.","If Fan Lou had been such a person from the start, Feng Qing would have rewarded him handsomely.","However, Fan Lou’s performance had always been different.","After hearing Fan Lou’s request, Feng Qing was relieved as it was extremely normal in his opinion.","It was true that Fan Lou was the Boundary Patrol Envoy of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team.","However, Fan Lou only had the authority to command the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team. In fact, the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team still had to be supervised by the Spacetime Supervisory Council.","The Spacetime Supervisory Council had the right to deploy the members of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team freely.","This would undoubtedly diminish Fan Lou’s authority.","To ensure that a Boundary Patrol Team would not become the Boundary Patrol Envoy’s private property, the Spacetime Supervisory Council would often let the members of the Boundary Patrol Team move around.","In a few decades, the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team would probably be under Fan Lou’s control.","Feng Qing was very willing to fulfill Fan Lou’s wish. After all, his request did not require much effort on Feng Qing’s part.","As a member of the Honor Absent Parliament, Feng Qing had a lot of authority in front of the Spacetime Supervisory Council. He only needed to extend a greeting.","If Fan Lou’s ambition was placed on the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team, then everything Fan Lou did for him was sincere.","Feng Qing was extremely satisfied to have such an assistant by his side. “I’ll personally go and inform the Spacetime Supervisory Council. From now on, you can manage and develop the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team at will. There’s no need to worry that the Spacetime Supervisory Council will send people to investigate the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team.","“Participate in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ meeting more during this period. When you gain a firm foothold among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, I can bring you to meet a few bigshots in the Spacetime Supervisory Council after the next Honor Absent Parliament meeting.”","Previously, Feng Qing hated his subordinates using him as a springboard, but now, he was even willing to take the initiative to give Fan Lou a chance.","Feng Xuan had never experienced such treatment before!","If it were in the past, Fan Lou would definitely be extremely grateful to Feng Qing, but now, he no longer cared about Feng Qing.","Nonetheless, Fan Lou was very willing to befriend the bigshots of the Spacetime Supervisory Council. It would be easier for him to help Lin Yuan take care of that Class 2 world if he had a good relationship with such influential figures.","Fan Lou was well aware of Feng Qing’s great reputation. Even if Feng Qing seriously introduced him to those bigshots, those people would not pay much attention to him. After all, he was, at most, one of Feng Qing’s subordinates.","There were less than two months left until the next meeting. In these two months, through the maneuvers of the Dark Pufferfish, he would establish connections with the Bloodians.","At that time, even without Feng Qing’s introduction, the directors of the Spacetime Supervisory Council should be interested in getting to know him.","Feng Qing didn’t say much to Fan Lou. Instead, he took the Dark Pufferfish venom that Fan Lou had given him to the Bloodians.","Fan Lou returned to the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team and began to reorganize it.","He then found an excuse to kick out all the disobedient people. Naturally, he would not give these team members a chance to develop in other Boundary Patrol Teams. Instead, he would assign them one last mission.","In the mission, these expelled members would all end up dead.","These members were all well aware of how mystical the Class 2 world was.","While these members were part of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team, he could exert control over them. However, if they really went to the other Boundary Patrol Teams, it was inevitable that they would divulge information.","If he attracted the interest of those with ulterior motives again, he would not be able to report to Lin Yuan.","Fan Lou was ruthless enough. It was precisely because of his ruthlessness that he could survive until now with such a lowly background.","...","With Lin Yuan’s help, Kani successfully reached the Holy Spirit level.","Kani’s breakthrough caused a huge commotion. The natural disaster triggered by the world wills really frightened Kani.","If Kani were to endure such a World Cleansing, she would not be able to pass it successfully.","Yet, the two experts beside Lin Yuan supported the sky with one hand and set up a barrier to protect themselves. No matter how the world wills attacked like a tsunami Lin Yuan, the barrier was still intact.","The two experts under Lin Yuan were not affected at all. It was as if they were doing something very ordinary.","This made Kani reevaluate Spring and Summer’s strength.","Spring and Summer’s strength completely exceeded Kani’s expectations. At that moment, Kani seemed to suddenly comprehend why they looked down on the Spinning Wings White Falcons, and even the Crimson Heaven Falcons behind them!","Kani refrained from delving too deeply into her thoughts during the evolving process, for fear that her distraction would affect her evolution.","If Lin Yuan did not provide her with sufficient resources, she would not be able to evolve even if she tried her best. Still, it was not to the extent that she would let him down.","Now that Lin Yuan had provided her with sufficient resources and ensured her protection, how would she have the face to follow Lin Yuan in the future if she failed to evolve successfully due to her own shortcomings?","During the evolution process, Kani returned to her original form.","In her true form, Kani was a three-meter-long, slender but powerful jackal.","Its fur was dark red with mottled golden spots.","The spots on the back of the spine were dark gold, and the further forward the spots were, the lighter the color.","Its sharp fangs were exposed, emitting an intensely bloodthirsty and violent aura that permeated the barrier constructed by Spring and Summer.","Kani’s body hadn’t changed much since her bloodline reached Emperor Blood grade.","In terms of changes, the biggest change was probably Kani’s fur. It turned from dark red to a light golden color with a red glow, and her dark golden spots turned black.","From the outside, Kani was no longer as fierce as before. Instead, she had become more restrained.","Not only did her ferocious appearance become restrained, but her aura also became much more subdued.","Even with Kani’s controlled breathing, Lin Yuan could hardly sense her presence, even when she was in front of him.","When Spring saw the puzzled expression on Lin Yuan’s face, she spoke softly. “Young Master, Kani’s situation should be related to her newly obtained divine kingdom ability after advancing to the Holy Spirit level.”","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to assess Kani’s condition.","Lin Yuan discovered that Kani had a new divine kingdom ability apart from the Jackal-Devouring Purgatory.","The divine kingdom ability was called Nightmare Hunting Shadow.","[Nightmare Hunting Shadow]: Converts one’s killing aura into attack power to enhance one’s subsequent attacks. One’s breath control and attack power are developed in equal measure. After killing the target, one can temporarily enhance a portion of the target’s attack power on one’s body. The enhanced attack power will continuously decrease with time (At the same time, one can enhance multiple units that are killed by oneself. The number of units is related to the killing itself and is not limited by one’s strength).","Lin Yuan was surprised when he saw Kani’s newly comprehended divine kingdom ability.","It could be said that Nightmare Hunting Shadow had completely changed Kani’s position in battle.","Previously, Kani was a warrior with a strong presence, but now she had become an assassin with almost no presence.","Kani was more suitable to be Lin Yuan’s follower than before.","Sky City once had a core member, which was the Invisible Demon, Shadow.","Lin Yuan had raised Shadow’s strength to the World Emperor grade, which was the strongest form of combat power in the main world.","Firstly, Lin Yuan needed a powerful demon to suppress Caroline and Carlos.","Caroline and Carlos had been affected by the Abyss Red Lotus, so their strength had increased extremely quickly.","When Lin Yuan left the main world, Caroline and Carlos had already surpassed Eternal Source.","Secondly, Shadow was the only Sky City member that Lin Yuan had left in the main world. If anything happened in the main world, Shadow would use the soul jade left behind by Winter to contact him.","Even if Lin Yuan could not help the main world, he should be aware of the situation.","After obtaining her new divine kingdom ability, Kani’s aura concealment ability was much stronger than Shadow’s.","Apart from the aura concealment ability, the strongest point of Nightmare Hunting Shadow was the increase in attack power for Kani.","Kani’s aura was abnormally fierce. This aura turned into attack power and augmented Kani’s body, allowing her to still have the ability to fight above her level even though she had stepped into the Holy Spirit level.","Kani connected with Jackal-Devouring Purgatory through Night Killing Shadow Hunt and harvested the lives of other lifeforms.","The attacks of the other lifeforms would continuously accumulate on Kani, rendering her stronger the more she fought.","Lin Yuan heaved a sigh of relief when Kani successfully stepped into the Holy Spirit level.","Kani’s divine kingdom must have undergone earth-shattering changes.","Since Lin Yuan controlled Kani’s fountain of faith, she had given him a large amount of faith power when she became a Holy Spirit expert.","The faith power nourished Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom and accelerated its evolution.","Lin Yuan could use the fountain of faith to extract the faith power from Kani’s divine kingdom, but he did not do so.","It wasn’t easy for Lin Yuan to help Kani evolve, so he wouldn’t cut off her potential.","What left Lin Yuan feeling a little regretful was that neither of Kani’s divine kingdoms had the ability to accumulate faith power.","This led Lin Yuan to understand that Kani would not be able to evolve for a long time after reaching Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit.","Next, he would guide Kani’s evolution from the World Emperor grade to the Domain Mountain-class. All that was required was for Kani to consistently absorb spirit qi for accumulation.","Lin Yuan communicated with Kani and learned that she would be able to complete her transformation in about three months.","Lin Yuan did not plan to wait for more than three months in North of the Lonely River.","Furthermore, compared to letting Kani absorb the spirit qi crystals while simultaneously injecting spirit qi into her body through his Body of All Spirits, it was better to just let Kani absorb the spirit qi crystals.","Morbius had been helping Lin Yuan plan in the King Blood Jackals’ territory during this period to help the lifeforms in the faith countries evolve.","This place served the same purpose as the places around Thick Soil City in the Startling Lines Continent.","It allowed Lin Yuan to harvest numerous spirit qi crystals.","There was no need for him to be afraid of using up all the spirit qi crystals. Lin Yuan could continuously use spirit qi crystals to accumulate resources for himself.","He looked at Kani and said, “Kani, collect these unused spirit qi crystals. In the future, use them to increase your power. If these spirit qi crystals are used up, you only need to ask from me. I’ll provide you with more!”","“I’ll give you ten days to make arrangements for the King Blood Jackals’ territory. After ten days, we’ll head east along the Lonely River!”","Kani, who had just evolved, piously knelt in front of Lin Yuan and fervently expressed her irrepressible admiration and gratitude.","Kani inherently possessed a nature that admired strength. After being the queen of a species for so long, Kani’s nature was concealed. Now that she had met Lin Yuan, Kani’s nature was completely aroused.","Moreover, not only was Lin Yuan powerful, but he also had unimaginable resources.","If Kani had such a huge amount of pure spirit qi, she would occasionally command it to refine her bloodline.","However, Lin Yuan had used such resources to help her increase her strength. It could be said that Lin Yuan did not care about this pure spirit qi at all. Following Lin Yuan was truly a blessing.","The King Blood Jackals would have a huge rise in their status in the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds due to the increase in their strength.","Kani suddenly thought of something and told Lin Yuan, “Master, I just stepped into the Holy Spirit level and triggered the world wills. This will definitely be noticed by the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","“Previously, there wasn’t a Holy Spirit existence among the King Blood Jackals. Therefore, the Spinning Wings White Falcons did not regard us seriously.","“From now on, the Spinning Wings White Falcons will have to interact with my King Blood Jackals.”","Lin Yuan understood what Kani meant. She was afraid that no one would take care of the territory after she left with him.","Lin Yuan commanded Spring and Winter to go along with him on his trip this time. Summer and Autumn were left in the territory.","As a martial force, he had to help solve a series of problems that could only be solved with martial strength.","If the Spinning Wings White Falcons dared to instigate trouble, Summer and Autumn would naturally handle the situation.","“Kani, you just have to do your own thing. I have my arrangements for safety. Even if the experts of the Crimson Heaven Falcons come looking for us, there won’t be any hidden dangers.","“You must have met Autumn and Winter during this period. Their strength is not inferior to Spring and Summer!”"]},{"number":2846,"title":"Chapter 2846 Thunder-Descending Shadow (Leopard Form)","paragraphs":["Chapter 2846 Thunder-Descending Shadow (Leopard Form)","“Although I’ve taken you away from the King Blood Jackals, there will be people guarding the safety of the entire territory.”","Kani was shocked when she heard Lin Yuan’s words. Only at that moment did Kani comprehend the formidable strength of Lin Yuan’s other two subordinates!","For a moment, Kani did not know which species Lin Yuan was from.","Even the East Universe’s bigshots from Honor Absent Palace were not comparable to Lin Yuan. He not only had several subordinates who were at least at the Holy Spirit level but also had an abundance of high-end resources.","Since Lin Yuan had already made arrangements, Kani only needed to make some internal arrangements for the King Blood Jackals. Then, she could proceed to absorb these spirit qi crystals.","Lin Yuan had been busy for more than half a month. Just as Lin Yuan was about to take a good rest, Wen Yu sent him a message through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","[Wen Yu]: Young Master, Listen, Endless Summer, and Gu Lang have been patrolling the King Blood Jackals’ territory and discovered a massive thunder zone on the outskirts of the western territory. It was formed by rare thunderstorms persisting for a long time.","[Wen Yu]: The King Blood Jackals mentioned that previously, there were no lifeforms in this thunder zone, but now, some rare thunder elemental-type lifeforms have emerged.","[Wen Yu]: Behind this area is a canyon that connects to another territory controlled by the King Blood Jackals.","[Wen Yu]: We need to clear this area. Listen, and the others wanted me to inquire if there’s any value in nurturing these thunder elemental-type lifeforms.","Elemental-type lifeforms had always been rare. If not for these rare entities, Wen Yu would not have needed to ask Lin Yuan.","When Lin Yuan saw Wen Yu’s message, his initial thoughts were not about these thunder elemental-type lifeforms but rather the thunder zone that was born from the rare thunderstorms.","Gray excelled at absorbing all kinds of weather phenomena.","Thunderstorm weather was relatively rare in nature.","Unless Gray actively sought it out, it would be very difficult for it to absorb such weather from the environment.","Since this area was going to be cleared, Lin Yuan felt that he might as well bring Gray over to let Gray absorb the thunderstorm and strengthen its ability related to thunderstorms.","Lin Yuan prepared to bring Gray along on this trip to assess whether there was a need to cultivate these thunder elemental-type lifeforms.","In the King Blood Jackals’ territory, Sky Sea revealing its presence wasn’t a problem even without Gray covering it.","Doing this enabled the lifeforms in the territory to witness Sky City on Sky Sea’s back and sense its majesty. At the same time, their sense of awe could also facilitate the creation of faith power.","...","Lin Yuan brought Gray to Wen Yu’s designated location, and Sky Sea finally revealed its true form.","The entire castle of the King Blood Jackals was covered by Sky Sea’s massive body.","Apart from the King Blood Jackals, the World Emperor/Higher Divine Kingdom experts had long since discovered Sky Sea’s existence.","Under the integration of Gray, Dark Blue, and Sky Sea, ordinary Divine Kingdom experts would not be able to see Sky Sea’s outline through the clouds.","...","Keira led the demon insects for the villages’ migration, and the first batch had already arrived at the King Blood Jackals’ territory. They began to establish roots at the designated locations.","Along the way, Bai Qinghuan gave a speech in various villages to inform them of the importance of this migration.","After this relocation, each village would not need to relocate again, and they would be protected by a large faction. There wouldn’t be any concerns about hidden dangers.","During the migration, at least half of the demon insects that paved the way would be left in the villages to guard them in the future.","Some of these villages had previously been ruled by various species that exploited them, forcing the villages to offer their faith. They had previously been promised numerous incentives, and at this point, they had become immune to such promises.","The reason they believed Bai Qinghuan’s words was that Lin Yuan had asked Keira to distribute the Soldier Ration Radish during the migration. Even in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the Soldier Ration Radish was still the best substitute for food.","It had been a long time since the lifeforms in the villages had experienced the feeling of being full. Since they could consistently experience the satisfaction of a full stomach in the future, the villagers were willing to work hard to offer their faith.","In the process of managing the villages, the lifeforms in these villages had undergone extensive training. Those who were disobedient and unwilling to contribute faith power had long been driven out of the village or killed.","Lin Yuan not only ensured that these villages could have enough to eat but also allowed them to build infrastructure in a location and lived in it.","In the hearts of the village members, Lin Yuan, the City Lord of Sky City, was like a savior.","There were also specialized individuals providing medical treatment for the lifeforms in those villages who were afflicted by serious illnesses.","Previously, the lifeforms in the villages were all under control, and they were obligated to reproduce mechanically to ensure that there were enough descendants to contribute faith power.","Now that the problem of food and shelter had been resolved, the lifeforms in the villages could undergo natural reproduction. The happiness in the villages was no longer limited to individuals but permeated throughout the villages.","Lin Yuan did not provide any help to the lifeforms in the villages when it came to building their infrastructure. Instead, he let them collect the materials themselves.","Even though there was a huge difference in the style of the houses in each village, Lin Yuan knew very well that the houses built by these lifeforms could give them a sense of belonging.","Lin Yuan brought a total of 2,000 Land Imps from the main world.","Lin Yuan created a paradise for these Land Imps at the side of the underground palace that he had just set up, which was an area in the sea of bone lotus flowers.","Land Imps reproduced very rapidly. Basically, a Land Imp couple could give birth to a small population of over 100 offspring in 10 years.","When the number of these Land Imps reached a certain scale, the houses built by the lifeforms in the villages would age with use.","By that time, Lin Yuan would be able to build standard infrastructure for each village by distributing benefits because, 10 years later, the lifeforms’ sense of belonging in the villages would have nothing to do with those houses.","...","Soon, Lin Yuan brought Gray to the thunder zone.","Gray looked at the dense thunderclouds in the sky, and its excitement caused the thunderclouds around Lin Yuan to tremble.","“Gray, feel free to absorb these thunderstorms. These thunderclouds often gather here, either due to the presence of secret treasures here that can cause thunderclouds to form or because of the terrain of this area. Either way, it will provide you with a continuous source of thunderstorms for you to absorb,” Lin Yuan said with a smile.","Gu Lang and Endless Summer had already gone to other areas. Listen was waiting at the outskirts of the thunder zone with a team of more than 3,000 demon insects.","He was holding a few purple crystals, which were releasing electric arcs from time to time.","Upon seeing Lin Yuan, Listen waved at him and quickly walked up to him. Meanwhile, the demon insects all prostrated themselves on the ground. This was the highest etiquette of the demon insects, and only Keira and Lin Yuan could be on the receiving end of it.","While Lin Yuan and Listen were talking, Gray used its cloud form to envelop the thunderclouds and quickly absorbed the thunder, causing thunderclouds to stop sending down thunderstorms.","Listen greeted Lin Yuan before handing the purple crystals to him. “Young Master, these thunder crystals are the core of the thunder lifeforms that inhabit this thunder zone. It’s obvious that these thunder lifeforms have only appeared recently. The strongest thunder lifeforms I’ve seen are only comparable to a Gold fey.","“However, after my experiments and observations, I only need to provide some spirit qi to these thunder lifeforms, and they will immediately become stronger!","“Young Master, with just one spirit qi crystal you gave me, I elevated the strength of a thunder elemental-type lifeform, comparable to a Gold fey, to the level akin to a Diamond fey! In other words, nurturing these thunder elemental-type lifeforms only requires a very small amount of resources!”","Lin Yuan nodded.","Compared to before, Listen was more meticulous in his work, to the point that Lin Yuan did not even need to capture an elemental-type thunder lifeform that had hatched in the thunder zone for investigation. This allowed Lin Yuan to understand the advantages of these elemental-type lifeforms.","Listen was not a Creation Master and did not have abilities like True Data. Therefore, Listen’s understanding of this thunder elemental-type lifeform was too superficial.","Lin Yuan only needed to find a thunder elemental-type lifeform and use Morbius’ True Data to investigate it to find out about its specific abilities and strengths.","At that moment, Listen added, “Young Master, these thunder elemental-type lifeforms are not without flaws. Their intelligence is extremely low, and they are too violent. Once they are controlled, they will instinctively struggle. Ultimately, this will lead to energy depletion, leaving only their elemental core behind.”","Lin Yuan had heard the Moon Empress mention it before.","Most of the elemental-type lifeforms were related to the inherent characteristics of the elements themselves. It was not difficult to understand why thunder elemental-type lifeforms had such violent traits. However, under normal circumstances, their traits could be restrained as their intelligence increased.","Lin Yuan raised his hand and summoned the Perfect Touch Wisteria.","“Green Vine, help me catch a few thunder elemental-type lifeforms in this thunder zone. If you discover a few different forms of existence, remember to help me bring them over.”","Green Vine entered the thunder zone in a flash.","Green Vine was a little unhappy that Lin Yuan had kept it in the Spirit Lock spatial zone. It was much livelier than Sky Sea and Gray.","However, Green Vine knew very well that Lin Yuan wanted it to stay in the Spirit Lock spatial zone to absorb spirit qi crystals.","Green Vine used its vines to absorb those precious high-grade spiritual ingredients. Ever since it could replace the spiritual ingredients that had fused with the vines, Lin Yuan had helped it equip all eight vines.","It wasn’t easy for Lin Yuan to let it out, so Green Vine naturally had to complete the mission that Lin Yuan had given it.","The thunder zone was not large, and Green Vine gave it a thorough search. Yet, it only brought out one thunder lifeform that looked like a leopard.","Lin Yuan silently thought that there seemed to be only one type of thunder lifeform in this thunder zone.","While Green Vine entered the thunder zone to capture the thunder lifeform, Lin Yuan was communicating with Listen.","As soon as Listen mentioned the leopard-like thunder lifeform, Lin Yuan could sense that this beautiful thunder lifeform was only Gold grade.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to investigate this leopard-like thunder lifeform.","[Fey Name]: Thunder-Descending Shadow (Leopard Form)","[Fey Species]: Elemental-species/elemental-genus","[Fey Grade]: Gold (6/10)","[Fey Type]: Thunder","[Fey Quality]: Epic","Abilities:","[Thunder Light]: Activates the thunder energy in one’s body, transforming oneself into a glowing object that connects to the clouds in the sky and emits the same amount of light along with the clouds.","[Thunder Roar]: Rapidly rotates and rubs the thunder energy within oneself, producing a violent roar to stimulate the eardrums. In the presence of condensing clouds, the clouds will also emit a roar of an equivalent degree.","[Thunder Transformation]: Allows one’s body to absorb the aura of other lifeforms in the environment, enabling it to simulate the appearance of other lifeforms.","[Thunder Appearance]: Fills the surroundings with thunder energy. Wherever the thunder energy goes, it has a concealment effect. When the thunder energy touches the target, it can detect the target’s location before the thunder energy dissipates.","Exclusive Skill:","[Thunder Marking]: Creates a mark on the target using thunder energy. Subsequently, one’s damage-type abilities will not affect the target with the mark.","Lin Yuan learned the specific name of this thunder elemental-type lifeform. It was called the Thunder-Descending Shadow, and the reason for its appearance was Thunder Transformation.","The thunder zone was filled with violent thunder energy, making it difficult for flesh lifeforms to survive.","Moreover, all the Thunder-Descending Shadows in the entire thunder zone area existed in the form of leopards. This indicated that there was something in the thunder zone that provided this leopard-type aura.","Lin Yuan estimated that this thing most likely existed below the thunder zone. It might even be related to the existence of the thunder zone.","However, considering the Thunder-Descending Shadow’s abilities and exclusive skills, Lin Yuan felt that it needed to be nurtured in large quantities to deploy it in multiple villages.","For example, Thunder Light was like an enhanced version of a flare.","Not only could the Thunder-Descending Shadow raise itself into the sky as a glowing object, but it could also attract clouds and make them emit light like him.","Once the Thunder-Descending Shadow used Thunder Light in the village, it would be enough to draw the Protector’s attention to the village and resolve the problems in the village.","If Thunder Light could be used to communicate with the outside world, then Thunder Roar was akin to sounding an air defense siren to alert the lifeforms in the village."]},{"number":2847,"title":"Chapter 2847 Thunder Flame Suspension!","paragraphs":["2847 Thunder Flame Suspension!","Even with experts like Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter presiding over the faith country, there were still numerous demon insects guarding it.","When they encountered these problems, having an ability like Thunder Roar to remind the members of every village helped maximize the safety of these villagers in dealing with emergencies and reduce Lin Yuan’s losses.","Lin Yuan’s goal in establishing the faith country was to collect faith.","Therefore, every lifeform in the villages that could provide faith power was an extremely precious treasure.","Just based on Thunder Light and Thunder Roar alone, the Thunder-Descending Shadow was indeed worth cultivating.","Its Gold ability, Thunder Appearance, allowed the Thunder-Descending Shadow to break through concealment.","When imbuing the target with the thunder energy, the thunder energy would burst into dazzling thunder light and directly mark the target’s location. Unless the target spent a lot of effort to eliminate this thunder energy, they would not be able to escape the detection of the thunder.","It did not take much energy for the Thunder-Descending Shadow to use Thunder Appearance. Without using other abilities, simply using Thunder Appearance could maintain the constant level of energy in its body.","Under such circumstances, the Thunder-Descending Shadow could serve as the supervisor in the village. If someone in the village did something bad that could jeopardize the safety of the others in the village, the Thunder-Descending Shadow could investigate first and then directly mark the lifeforms involved and have the demon insects handle the situation upon their arrival.","The Thunder-Descending Shadow’s Thunder Appearance could ensure the highest level of discipline in the village under flexible use. It would prevent the bullies hiding in the village from bullying the weak lifeforms in the village.","This could increase the happiness of the villagers and stabilize the output of faith power.","Previously, during the investigation of these villages, Lin Yuan had discovered many instances of bullying and had been pondering how to stop these situations. Now, Lin Yuan finally found a way to completely resolve it.","The Thunder-Descending Shadow’s Thunder Transformation not only confirmed for Lin Yuan that there were powerful thunder-type leopard-species lifeform’s corpse underground, but it also had a very strong effect.","If the Thunder-Descending Shadow were to be deployed into multiple villages, existing in its leopard form might not be suitable.","When the faith country was established, every village would have a temple. Statues of Sky City’s core members would be placed in the temple.","As the supervisor of the village, the best place for the Thunder-Descending Shadow to go was to stay in the temple to let the lifeforms in the village be aware of the authority of the temple.","Lin Yuan believed that the most suitable form for the Thunder-Descending Shadow should be the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil, which wore a priest’s robe and looked extremely holy but was a scheming devil in reality.","Later, Lin Yuan only needed to let the Thunder-Descending Shadow follow the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil for a while, absorbing its aura and transforming it into a simple Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil.","That way, all the Thunder-Descending Shadows in the temple could exist in a specific standard form.","Even if Lin Yuan wanted to integrate the villages, it would not affect the beliefs of these villages.","When the Thunder-Descending Shadow’s grade continued to increase, it would obtain a powerful offensive ability, and Thunder Marking would finally be useful by that time!","Not only did Lin Yuan have to nurture these Thunder-Descending Shadows in large quantities, but he also had to increase their strength.","Listen had just mentioned that it was abnormally easy for a Thunder-Descending Shadow to increase its grade.","One spirit qi crystal was enough to evolve the Thunder-Descending Shadow from Gold to Diamond grade. It had the ability to synthesize thunder energy by itself through pure spirit qi.","Lin Yuan only needed to spend a small amount of spirit qi crystals to enhance the Thunder-Descending Shadow’s strength to a very high level.","As a transmigrator, Lin Yuan had grown up listening to all kinds of myth stories.","Ever since Lin Yuan understood the significance of faith power in improving his strength, his actions were geared toward creating a Myth system. To put it bluntly, the core members of Sky City, including the white-clothed followers and even the reserve members of Sky City, were all members of this Myth system.","As the Sacrifice in charge of supervising and delivering divine punishment in the temple, the Thunder-Descending Shadow definitely had to be extremely powerful.","Green Vine observed the Thunder-Descending Shadow in leopard form and said seriously, “Yuan, when I entered the thunder zone just now, I realized that the power of thunder surging in the thunderclouds is nothing. The thunder energy is mainly seeping out of the ground. There must be treasures underground. Do you think we should dig out the treasure?!”","Lin Yuan knew what Green Vine was thinking. It probably wanted to use the vines to absorb the thunder-type treasure underground.","This leopard’s corpse that had thunder attributes was linked with the creation of the Thunder-Descending Shadow. Lin Yuan would definitely not use the leopard’s corpse as a consumable.","However, Lin Yuan found it difficult to excavate the corpse. He was afraid that digging the corpse out of the ground would deplete the thunder energy there, making it very likely that there would not be enough thunder energy to produce the Thunder-Descending Shadow for a long time.","Lin Yuan turned to ask, “Listen, did this thunder zone seriously affect the establishment of the trade chain?”","Listen nodded seriously. “Young Master, the mountain valley behind this thunder zone is connected to another territory of the King Blood Jackals. Their territory is in the shape of a narrow gourd, with a vast area behind the territory. Furthermore, it contains a lot of resources.","“It’s not practical to use avian-type feys for all trades in the future. If not for that, Endless Summer and Gu Lang would not have come to this thunder zone to investigate!”","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment before giving orders to Green Vine and the thousands of demon insects around him, “Go and carefully dig out the leopard’s corpse in the subterranean area. Remember, don’t let this corpse suffer any damage!","“Also, gather all the Thunder-Descending Shadows in this thunder zone and report to me after counting them. These Thunder-Descending Shadows are very useful to me. Even if these Thunder-Descending Shadows resist violently, don’t hurt them!”","Lin Yuan had never been a hesitant person. Building the trade chain in the territory was the most important thing now.","After moving the leopard’s corpse away, thunder energy would keep seeping out of it. Sooner or later, another thunder zone would be created.","It was really unreasonable to throw such an important resource there. Instead of having to arrange for numerous people to guard this place, it was better to move the leopard’s corpse onto Sky Sea’s back.","He would let Sky Sea’s flesh fuse with the leopard’s corpse and nourish it. Otherwise, the energy in the leopard’s corpse would be exhausted sooner or later.","Once the thunder zone was formed, there would be many thunderclouds in the sky. Gray’s cloud form could perfectly cover the thunderclouds, preventing them from exposing Sky Sea’s whereabouts.","Furthermore, this thunder zone was not small, and there were already many Thunder-Descending Shadows inside.","These Thunder-Descending Shadows should be enough for the faith country that was about to be built.","Lin Yuan had always been willing to invest resources in Green Vine, and Green Vine was very understanding.","Back in the main world, Lin Yuan had given his most precious resources to it.","Green Vine would properly supervise these demon insects to complete the mission that Lin Yuan had assigned.","Lin Yuan took out a few spirit qi crystals and began to nurture the Thunder-Descending Shadow in leopard form.","The Thunder-Descending Shadow had already begun to go berserk, and the energy in its body was surging violently.","If this situation continued, it wouldn’t take long for the Thunder-Descending Shadow to be left with only the elemental core.","Lin Yuan raised his hand and summoned Begin Lady, who had been staying in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Faeries had an appeasing effect on all elemental lifeforms. The existence of a faerie represented the protection of nature.","Begin Lady enveloped the Thunder-Descending Shadow with her aura, and soon, it quieted down. It moved closer to the Begin Lady and greedily absorbed her aura.","Lin Yuan was well aware that once the Begin Lady left the Thunder-Descending Shadow, it would quickly return to its berserk state.","However, when he evolved the Thunder-Descending Shadow to Fantasy Breed, its intelligence would be completely awakened. Then, it would no longer be controlled by the elemental skills in its body!","Begin Lady was clearly very interested in the Thunder-","Descending Shadow. She examined it and said, “Lin Yuan, elemental-type lifeforms like the Thunder-Descending Shadow only need to absorb a large amount of energy from their birthplace to make it easy for them to comprehend a Willpower Rune and undergo a transformation.","“Celestial Sight and I aren’t lightning-type faeries, but we can still support these Thunder-Descending Shadows with our own auras.”","Lin Yuan was delighted. If that was the case, he might as well evolve all the Thunder-Descending Shadows to Diamond X/","Fantasy V.","When they reached this level, their intelligence would be no different from a seven or eight-year-old child.","Begin Lady and Celestial Sight could help these Thunder-","Descending Shadows comprehend Willpower Runes and help them transform Willpower Runes into Law Runes.","When the strength of the Thunder-Descending Shadow increased to Suzerain/Myth III, it could transform into a human form, making it more convenient for them to mimic the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil.","Lin Yuan came to the Thunder-Descending Shadow and crushed the spirit qi crystals in his hand. As expected, its strength increased rapidly, just as Listen had said.","After the Thunder-Descending Shadow’s evolution, it did not change at all, but the thunder energy inside was much more violent than before.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to investigate the Diamond/","Legend Thunder-Descending Shadow.","[Fey Name]: Thunder-Descending Shadow (Leopard Form)","[Fey Species]: Elemental-species/elemental-genus","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (7/10)","[Fey Type]: Thunder","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Thunder Light]: Activates the thunder energy in one’s body, transforming oneself into a glowing object that connects to the clouds in the sky and emits the same amount of light along with the clouds.","[Thunder Roar]: Rapidly rotates and rubs the thunder energy within oneself, producing a violent roar to stimulate the eardrums. In the presence of condensing clouds, the clouds will also emit a roar of an equivalent degree.","[Thunder Transformation]: Allows one’s body to absorb the aura of other lifeforms in the environment, enabling it to simulate the appearance of other lifeforms.","[Thunder Appearance]: Fills the surroundings with thunder energy. Wherever the thunder energy goes, it has a concealment effect. When the thunder energy touches the target, it can detect the target’s location before the thunder energy dissipates.","[Thunder Flame Suspension]: The suspended thunder ball pulls the target and attaches the target to the thunder ball. The thunder energy inside the thunder ball, friction at high speeds, activates the fire elements to burn the target attached to the thunder ball. After burning the target’s body to ashes, the spirit and soul will be imprisoned in the thunder ball.","[Annihilation Thundercloud]: Summons thunderclouds to cover an area. The thunder that descends from the thunderclouds will cause damage to lifeforms. Initially, it will paralyze the target, and attacking the paralyzed target will double the effectiveness of the attacks.","Exclusive Skill:","[Thunder Marking]: Creates a mark on the target using thunder energy. Afterward, one’s damage-type abilities will not affect the target with the mark.","When Lin Yuan finished using spirit qi crystals to nurture the Thunder-Descending Shadow, the first batch of Thunder-","Descending Shadows captured from the thunder zone had already been brought out by the demon insects.","Lin Yuan realized that most of these Thunder-Descending Shadows were Bronze grade. Only a few of them were at the Silver grade, and even fewer were at the Gold grade. However, their abilities were surprisingly identical.","Lin Yuan did not appear surprised because he had already received an explanation about this situation from Listen. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have considered nurturing the Thunder-Descending Shadows solely based on their abilities.","Lin Yuan chose a Thunder-Descending Shadow and used the spirit qi crystals to increase its strength. He realized that these Thunder-Descending Shadows even possessed the same Platinum and Diamond abilities!","Their Platinum ability, Thunder Flame Suspension, was not very offensive, and its usage was not simple or direct at all. It could be described as fanciful. However, this ability was very suitable for Lin Yuan’s intended role for Thunder-Descending Shadow.","As a Sacrifice guarding the temple, the Thunder-Descending Shadow needed some fancy and ritualistic methods. However, Thunder Flame Suspension was not only flashy and ritualistic but also spiritual and soulful. Furthermore, it even carried a strong sense of mystery!","Using Thunder Flame Suspension as a method to punish the depraved lifeforms in the village would definitely serve as an effective warning."]},{"number":2848,"title":"Chapter 2848 Star Map Shackle","paragraphs":["2848 Star Map Shackle","The spirit and soul imprisoned in the ball of thunder, displayed on the altar in front of the temple, would not only protect the village but also serve as a warning to the villages.","While Lin Yuan was nurturing the Thunder-Descending Shadow, Green Vine dug out the corpse from below the thunder zone.","The corpse below the thunder zone was completely different from what Lin Yuan had imagined.","He had been picturing an enormous creature that was thousands of meters long. Yet, it turned out to be less than even a meter long. It was evident that this was a leopard cub.","Lin Yuan would never have expected this thunder zone to be created by the corpse of a leopard cub. He had been expecting to see a powerful thunder-type leopard-species lifeform who had died here some time in the past few centuries.","This corpse was showing clear signs of beginning to skeletonize.","For an unknown reason, cracks had appeared on the bones, and the partially crystallized interior was revealed. This was what had created the thunder zone.","This leopard that lived many epochs ago definitely came from a powerful species!","It would be easy for Lin Yuan to use the Abyss Red Lotus’ ability to reproduce this lifeform.","The idea bloomed in his head.","[Lotus Creations]: Its bloodline will be injected into mature lotuses, and the lotus roots will activate bloodline energy based on the injected bloodline. The energy in the lotuses will be sacrificed to turn the activated bloodline and its genes into a replicated lifeform.","The significance of Lotus Creations was that it could produce reproductions of powerful species that had lived many epochs ago.","Lin Yuan intended to ask Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter to take a look at this leopard and if they knew what it was.","Using True Data, Lin Yuan had already discovered that this corpse came from a lifeform called the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard. However, he did not understand the situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and did not know what its significance was.","The Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard’s corpse could create the thunder zone and hatch the Thunder-Descending Shadows. All Lin Yuan needed to do was extract some of the marrow from within the crystal and would be able to use the Abyss Red Lotus’s young lotuses to create the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard.","Green Vine led the demon insects back to Lin Yuan’s side and told him seriously, “Yuan, there are 19,677 Thunder-Descending Shadows. None of them were harmed or lost when they were captured, and I have brought all of them to you.”","Lin Yuan nodded. He was satisfied with the number of Thunder-Descending Shadows in the thunder zone. 19,677 of them were sufficient to meet his initial needs.","19,677 Thunder-Descending Shadows could control 19,677 villages in his faith country.","The large villages with a population of more than 10,000,000 would not be combined. However, the villages with populations in the millions would be combined. Every village in the faith country would have a population of more than 10,000,000.","He only needed spirit qi crystals to nurture the Thunder-Descending Shadows.","Lin Yuan gave numerous spirit qi crystals to Begin Lady and Celestial Sight so they could nurture and manage all of the Thunder-Descending Shadows.","Lin Yuan did not want to waste time nurturing the Thunder-Descending Shadows. It would take at least a few months to nurture more than 19,000 of them.","Fan Lou had sent a message to Lin Yuan through the Thoughts Letter Paper, but Lin Yuan had not received it.","The Thoughts Letter Paper’s efficacy in the Sky Beyond the Clouds had already been tried and tested.","However, the message had not been delivered because Wen Yu’s Elemental Paper’s level was too low. If its grade could be evolved, the message would be transmitted successfully!","Communication and transmission were of the utmost importance to a faction.","However, once Wen Yu’s power reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, it was no longer easy for Lin Yuan to increase her power quickly. After all, faith power needed to be accumulated slowly.","Nonetheless, this did not really affect Lin Yuan because Fan Lou could get in contact with him through the soul contact if he really had something he needed to report.","Once Lin Yuan moved nearer to the main area of the East Universe and was closer in distance to Fan Lou, they would be able to resume communication through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","It was likely that the Dark Pufferfish envoy had begun making their way to meet with the Bloodians.","...","Lin Yuan brought the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard’s skeletonized bones to Sky Sea’s back and called in Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter so he could ask them the questions he had.","The four of them reacted as per Lin Yuan’s expectations. They were aware of the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard’s existence and knew a lot about the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopards.","“Lord Saint, I can’t believe the corpse of a lifeform as powerful as the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard was found in a place as barren as North of the Lonely River!","“As far as I know, by the time we rose in power, the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopards had retreated after being embroiled in internal conflict. Their biggest challenge was reproduction and continuing their legacy.","“Once internal conflict emerges, it becomes even more difficult for a species to produce offspring. It’s almost inevitable that they will start heading toward their doom. This Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard cub’s bloodline is rather pure. But based on the degree of skeletonization of the corpse, it has been dead for at least seven or eight epochs!”","From the extreme shock on Spring’s face, it was clear that she was flabbergasted at the fact that Lin Yuan had stumbled on the corpse of a Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard. This corpse of an ancient lifeform was an extremely precious treasure.","Spring was aware of the Abyss Red Lotus’s abilities. It could enable the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard to reappear in this world.","The Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard could create unimaginable value for Lin Yuan!","Lin Yuan had a certain level of understanding of the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopards now.","But his biggest concern was whether he would be able to create the thunder zone and Thunder-Descending Shadows by extracting marrow from the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard’s corpse.","If he could not be certain that he would be able to create the Thunder-Descending Shadows, Lin Yuan would prefer to use the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard to create the thunder zone. Once the number of Thunder-Descending Shadows met his needs, he would then extract marrow from the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard to enable it to reappear in this world!","Lin Yuan asked the question that he most wanted an answer to. Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter were the only ones who could answer this sort of question.","Spring began explaining to Lin Yuan seriously, “Young Master, this Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard might just be a cub, but it still possesses an enormous amount of thunder energy. If you want to create a thunder zone, you can break and expose its crystallized bones! Since the bones have been crystallized, they will be able to regain energy once they are nourished by spirit qi. Young Master, you can extract the energy at that point!”","Lin Yuan relaxed when he heard this.","If he could replenish the energy in the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard’s crystallized bones by using spirit qi crystals, he could let go of all restraints and utilize the bones as he pleased!","He could even take out a portion of the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard’s bones and give them to Green Vine to absorb. This would enable Green Vine to increase its power.","When necessary, Green Vine could even use its exclusive skill to summon the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard.","“Spring, why don’t you help me crush the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard’s bones? Then, extract some of the crystallized bones.”","Upon receiving Lin Yuan’s instructions, Spring immediately sprang to work and shattered the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard’s bones.","When a large portion of the crystallized bones were exposed, they began to shine with a brilliant bluish-purple light.","Spring extracted the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard’s spine and told Lin Yuan seriously, “Young Master, if you are going to re-awaken the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard, my suggestion is that you use the marrow from the spine as it has the highest concentration of energy and will allow you to re-","awaken the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard in the shortest span of time.","“Alternatively, you can use your Body of All Spirits to absorb the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard’s bloodline. Its bloodline is highly worth nurturing!”","When Lin Yuan found out that using the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard’s crystallized bones would not prevent him from using it to create the thunder zone, a similar idea had formed in his head.","Summer brought the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard’s corpse to the location on Sky Sea’s back that Lin Yuan had specified.","Sky Sea’s flesh swallowed the Raging Thunder Heavenly Leopard as though it was mud. This simultaneously nourished the corpse while releasing the energy within it.","At this rate, the thunder zone would be produced in less than two weeks.","...","Lin Yuan had initially intended to take Spring and Summer with him when he left the King Blood Jackals’ territory and headed to the East Universe’s central area. But an unexpected occurrence forced him to halt his plans.","This unexpected occurrence was that the Suzerain X/Myth III Merciful Star Peony was finally showing signs of a breakthrough after more than a month of absorbing energy from the stars. Not only was its grade about to evolve but its bloodline was also poised to transform.","It went without saying that Lin Yuan would step in to help the Merciful Star Peony and prevent it from being tripped up at any point of the evolution process.","With a raise of his hand, Lin Yuan summoned the Merciful Star Peony.","The Merciful Star Peony shone with a faint silver glow.","Now that it was about to evolve, the Merciful Star Peony chose not to undergo the process in its human form. Rather, it would undergo the transformation in its original form.","The Merciful Star Peony had already reminded Lin Yuan that it needed to be supplied with pure spirit qi.","Lin Yuan stood off to the side and instructed Source Sand to crush the spirit qi crystals and replenish spirit qi for the Merciful Star Peony. He also placed his hand on the Merciful Star Peony’s leaf and injected a large amount of spirit qi into its body.","At this moment, the Sky Beyond the Clouds was filled with stars and an air of lonely vastness.","Lin Yuan raised his head to look at the sky. He could clearly sense that the energy from the celestial bodies in the sky was much stronger than what he experienced in the main world.","The Merciful Star Peony flexed its petals and made contact with the constellations. The energy from the constellations sunk into the Merciful Star Peony.","In less than two hours, Lin Yuan noticed that the Merciful Star Peony’s petals had grown at least three times larger.","The singular flower lit up with mottled starlight, and it looked as though maps of stars had been drawn on the petals.","The Merciful Star Peony’s aura had changed completely.","Spring quickly and deftly fought off the World Cleansing, and the Creation World Ley Line landed on the Merciful Star Peony.","Lin Yuan knew that the Merciful Star Peony had transformed into a Suzerain/Creation fey!","Since the Merciful Star Peony had only just evolved, it needed some time before it could transition from Suzerain X to Sovereign.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Merciful Star Peony.","[Fey Name]: Star Vastness Peony","[Fey Species]: Buttercup species/peony species","[Fey Grade]: Suzerain (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood/Light","[Fey Quality]: Creation I","Abilities:","[Activate Light]: In a place filled with starlight, it will be guided by the stars and be unaffected by blinding effects. In a place with absolute darkness, the surroundings can still be clearly seen.","[Casted Item Starlight]: When stars appear, the starlight can temper the body to improve the body’s quality.","[Tempering Essence Starlight]: In a place with starlight, it will absorb energy from the starlight to temper spiritual energy and increase the strength of the spiritual energy.","[Condensing Spirit Starlight]: In a place with starlight and when its soul is injured, the starlight will nourish its soul and heal it quickly.","[Starlight Robes]: The starlight will be directed to a target’s body and transform into a robe. While the target is draped in the robe, they will be immune to poison and curses, and the harm suffered from poison and curses will be reduced.","[Star-Storing Flower Jade]: Once the flower petals have absorbed sufficient starlight, they will become jade-textured and break away from the flower. The jade-textured flower petals can be stored for a long time and will speed up the rate at which starlight tempers the body.","[Star River Guide]: In any environment, it can link its thoughts and the star river to confirm its location. It will also experience blessing effects to raise its luck and turn adversity into fortune.","Exclusive Skill:","[Constellation Imprint]: Attempt to communicate with the stars. If the communication is successful, a star imprint will appear on the body. The star imprint can help the body take on all curse effects. When the star imprint is triggered, the energy within it will flow into the body and raise the body’s quality within a short period.","[Star Contraction]: It will become deeply bound to a star and be able to use the star’s energy to raise its defensive capabilities. The degree to which the defensive capabilities will be raised depends on the strength of the star and the bond with the star.","[Merciful Stars]: For stars, containing too much energy will become a negative burden. The hardship of stars will be comprehended, and the energy within the stars will be extracted. The energy from the stars will be used to strengthen the body composition of a target. (If the target is forcefully strengthened and is unable to handle the power from the stars, the strengthening will be halted. They will need to take on the additional power from the stars as well as the consequences.)","[Star Map Shackle]: It will use the energy of the celestial bodies it is linked to draw a star map that will be applied to a target’s body. Regardless of whether it is day or night, the shackle of the star map will prevent the target from strengthening its body and energy. The energy it absorbs will only strengthen the shackle. At night, the effects of the shackle will be amplified."]},{"number":2849,"title":"Chapter 2849 Lin Yuan Embarks!","paragraphs":["2849 Lin Yuan Embarks!","Lin Yuan’s eyebrow twitched uncontrollably when he saw that.","Previously, the Star Vastness Peony’s abilities all revolved around Lin Yuan picking a target and tempering that target’s body.","Now that the Star Vastness Peony had reached Creation Breed, it had opened a new path for itself.","From now on, it could not only temper the targets Lin Yuan selected but could also use the energy from within celestial bodies to shackle targets, thereby taking control of them.","Once the target was shackled by the energy of the celestial bodies, it would no longer be able to increase its power or replenish its diminished energy. If it absorbed external energy in an attempt to strengthen itself, the energy would not benefit it in any way. Rather, it would only strengthen the shackle. Each night, when the stars were shining brightly, the effects of the shackle would be amplified.","Once Star Vastness Peony used Star Map Shackle on a target, the target would remain under its control for a long time.","In the future, it was possible that Lin Yuan would encounter a species he wanted to interact with but who were extremely hostile to him. At that point, he could use Star Map Shackle on one of the young main members of the species.","It was possible to tamper with Star Map Shackle, but it was like a tattoo that would be applied to the target. If it was damaged, there was a high likelihood that the target’s safety would also be compromised.","Lin Yuan continued using his Body of All Spirits to inject energy into the Star Vastness Peony even after it evolved.","It did not take long for the Star Vastness Peony to evolve from Suzerain to Sovereign.","Once again, Lin Yuan took a look at the Star Vastness Peony’s data.","He saw that its Sovereign ability was called Star River Protection.","[Star River Protection]: The celestial bodies it is linked to will be activated. Their energy will be released and start to flow like a river, providing protection from any elemental attacks that involve energy.","For a Sovereign ability, Star River Protection had a relatively simple description. However, its effects were fearsome.","Regular abilities only defended against physical and elemental attacks. However, Star River Protection could defend against any type of energy.","There were very few abilities that could defend against faith power.","Now that it had successfully evolved, the Star Vastness Peony transformed into human form and happily bowed to Lin Yuan.","Its clear eyes were full of gratitude toward Lin Yuan. It knew that it would never have been able to improve its power or grade so quickly without Lin Yuan. All of this came from Lin Yuan, and the Star Vastness Peony wanted to do something for him in return!","“Yuan, I already used Star-Storing Flower Jade to produce more than 10 of the jade-textured flower petals. You can use them when using Casted Item Starlight and Tempering Essence Starlight to temper your body and spiritual energy.”","Lin Yuan understood the gesture that the Star Vastness Peony was trying to make and said with a smile, “Star Vastness Peony, you will need to absorb starlight for a long time before you’re able to evolve your grade and quality again.","“I never asked you to use Merciful Stars to help Spring, Summer, Autumn, Winter, and I improve our physiques because your grade was rather low. Hence, using an exclusive skill like Merciful Stars could have negatively affected you. But now that you’ve reached Sovereign, you can withstand the effects of Merciful Stars!”","The Star Vastness Peony was greatly looking forward to using Merciful Stars to help Lin Yuan, Spring, Summer, Autumn, Winter, and the rest.","Using Merciful Stars benefited the Star Vastness Peony significantly as well.","“Yuan, let me make some preparations. From tomorrow, I will be able to use Merciful Stars to temper a target every week. However, I will need to get a sense of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter’s bodies first to ensure that nothing will go wrong.”","The Star Vastness Peony did not say this because it did not trust Lin Yuan’s judgment but because it was fully aware of the effects of its ability. It needed to be responsible to Lin Yuan.","...","Lin Yuan stretched and slept restfully in his room.","Each time Lin Yuan helped one of his feys to increase their powers, he would not be able to rest for some time. Although his soul was strong enough that he did not need to sleep as much or use sleep to replenish his spirit and soul, sleeping was still a blissful act for him.","When Lin Yuan woke up, he made some preparations before taking Spring and Winter with him as he left the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","Lin Yuan was embarking with a goal. He wanted to test the transmission limits of the Thoughts Letter Paper. He would be able to test this by continuously moving east.","While he crossed the Lonely River, Lin Yuan paid a visit to Bei Xu.","Bei Xu had grown substantially in the more than ten years that had passed. He was doing an excellent job of managing the Lonely River by himself.","At first, Endless Summer had accompanied him and given him a lot of advice that broadened his horizons. However, he was the only one who was truly in charge of the Lonely River, and it had not been long before Endless Summer was called away by Listen.","As Bei Xu walked next to Lin Yuan and saw Lin Yuan’s approving expression, he felt a sense of accomplishment. With Lin Yuan’s acknowledgment, it meant that all his hard work was justified!","“Young Master, based on my investigations, there aren’t many resources being produced in the Lonely River. So, I don’t intend to focus on harvesting resources. I am going to make use of the Lonely River’s geographical advantage and change it in the same way you did when you built the harbor in the Startling Lines Continent. This way, I’ll also be able to help if the King Blood Jackals’ territory has any resource needs or needs to trade for resources.","“Listen came to the Lonely River a while ago and gave me some guidance. He suggested that I turn the Lonely River into a trading hub that connects the King Blood Jackals’ territory with the outside world.”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “That’s a good idea. The Lonely River will become an important junction for the exchange of resources between North of the Lonely River and the outside world.”","Lin Yuan had taken control of the King Blood Jackals’ territory, but this was not where his focus was.","He would eventually have to make contact with the Spinning Wings White Falcons and the Crimson Heaven Falcons who supported them. It would only be after that that he would have the entire North of the Lonely River in his possession.","At that point, the entire North of the Lonely River would become part of his supply of faith!","This was the only way that all the faith power needs of Sky City’s main members, as well as Lin Yuan himself, would be met.","Listen was skilled at communication, and Lin Yuan did not mind Listen giving Bei Xu advice.","By giving him advice, Bei Xu now owed Listen a favor.","In Sky City, even Wen Yu and Liu Jie had owed Listen favors in the past.","Bei Xu not only took in Listen’s advice but had many ideas of his own as well.","Lin Yuan no longer had to worry.","He gave Bei Xu a reminder, “Bei Xu, there isn’t a rush to change the Lonely River, but it is still extremely important. It will be best if you get the Four Species Overlords involved! They need to feel like they are participating for them to be willing to help you manage the Lonely River in the future. If you need manpower or resources, just let Wen Yu know.”","The resources that were currently present in the Lonely River were far from enough to support the changes that needed to be made.","The Lonely River’s environment had many advantages. The water was sufficiently deep, and Island Whales could swim in it freely.","Whale species were full of development potential. Lin Yuan would continue to nurture the Island Whales in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and do his best to enable them to become a powerful species!","The Island Whales would be able to live happily and comfortably in the Lonely River.","The spirit qi and water-elemental energy in the Lonely River were much purer than that of the main world.","Additionally, Lin Yuan was going to inject more resources into the Island Whales.","He had already given these resources to Wen Yu, and she would move the Island Whales into the Lonely River once most of the Lonely River’s changes had been implemented.","Before introducing the Island Whales, it was necessary to ensure that none of the lifeforms in the Lonely River would cause any harm to the Island Whales.","Aside from nurturing the Star Vastness Peony, Lin Yuan had also made many decisions of late.","He really liked the feeling of having a group of highly capable companions and running a faction with them.","When he first started developing Sky City, he had to do everything on his own, and it had taken up all of his time. As a result, he had had very little time left over to nurture his feys.","In truth, Lin Yuan’s Spirit Lock spatial zone housed a lifeform that was considered extremely precious in the Sky Beyond the Clouds—the Sky-Plundering Beast.","Lin Yuan had already nurtured the Sky-Plundering Beast. Just like Genius when it was young, the Sky-Plundering Beast clung to Lin Yuan every chance it had.","The Sky-Plundering Beast’s value lay in its blood, which could block world wills and allow feys that were evolving to fend off the effects of World Cleansing.","Lin Yuan could not bear to draw blood from the Sky-Plundering Beast periodically. Hence, he kept it like a pet.","He could sense that after being nurtured by his Body of All Spirits all this time, the Sky-Plundering Beast’s bloodline was showing signs of evolving.","Bei Xu carefully noted down everything that Lin Yuan had said. He truly saw the development of the Lonely River as his career, which he needed to dedicate his life to.","At first, Bei Xu did not understand Ta Lei’s perspective. He did not understand why Ta Lei had chosen to remain in the main world to look after Thick Soil City.","But slowly, he found himself able to stand in Ta Lei’s shoes.","When one lacked capabilities and needed to work alongside geniuses, Bei Xu knew that his power would not stand out. Hence, if he wanted to remain by Lin Yuan’s side, he needed to properly develop his governance talents!","The Lonely River was very important to Lin Yuan, meaning that everything Bei Xu did now was very important to Lin Yuan as well.","...","When the leaders of the Four Species Overlords learned of Lin Yuan’s arrival, all of them clamored to meet with him.","Normally, Lin Yuan would have turned them down. But he did not do so this time.","Lin Yuan brought Bei Xu with him when he met with the four leaders. He acted very familiar and affectionately toward Bei Xu. This was vastly different from his attitude toward Fan Lou.","Additionally, he emphasized to the four leaders that they needed to do their best to work with Bei Xu and meet his requests. Once they upset Bei Xu, they would be swapped out and replaced.","At first, Ink Thorn, Mantis Age, and the rest had not thought much of Bei Xu. They saw him as nothing more than an inconsequential child.","All of them cooperated with Bei Xu and made things easier for Bei Xu when issues emerged, but these were all superficial gestures.","Everything was going smoothly for Bei Xu now because he had yet to affect the Four Species Overlords’ benefits. Once their benefits were threatened, Bei Xu would find himself facing a lot of opposition!","However, it was inevitable that he would eventually have to affect the Four Species Overlords’ benefits to change the Lonely River and set up the flow of trade.","But from now on, the Four Species Overlords leaders would no longer take the same attitude they previously had toward Bei Xu.","They had witnessed Lin Yuan’s methods, and all of them had their number of members reduced by at least 1/5. The members who had been eliminated were those who had been unwilling to submit to Lin Yuan.","If any of them angered Lin Yuan, they would be eliminated as well!","Before he left, Lin Yuan patted Bei Xu’s shoulder. “Bei Xu, remember not to force yourself regardless of what happens. If you are in any danger, don’t hesitate to use the tentacle to transport yourself to Sky City’s main city.”","...","Lin Yuan only remained in the Lonely River for a night before he continued traveling east with Spring and Winter.","During his journey, Lin Yuan saw that the further east he traveled, the more opulent his environment. But in terms of a store of resources, the resources in North of the Lonely River were not considered sparse. Rather, most of the resources had been consolidated and were controlled by the powerful species.","Slowly, Lin Yuan sensed that the parameters of his communication through the Thoughts Letter Paper were changing, and transmission was abruptly dampened. This meant that the Thoughts Letter Paper could no longer be used as an acceptable tool for communication. Hence, this had to be the limit of its range of use.","Based on the map that Fan Lou had given him, he had not traveled far.","Thus, Lin Yuan now knew that the Thoughts Letter Paper could only be used as a tool for communication between North of the Lonely River and Sky City’s members.","He would not be able to achieve long-distance communication anytime soon.","In order to prevent himself from becoming uncontactable to the Moon Empress, Wen Yu, and the rest, Lin Yuan used the Thoughts Letter Paper to explain the situation to them.","While Lin Yuan was storing the Thoughts Letter Paper, he heard a blood-curdling shriek.","Based on the energy fluctuations, the fight that was taking place up ahead involved World Emperor/Divine Kingdom experts.","This piqued Lin Yuan’s interest.","Black wings appeared behind his back, and he flew toward the fight.","Spring and Winter looked at each other before following closely behind Lin Yuan.","They had seen such blood fights many times in the past.","Countless lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds lost their lives due to various reasons. The two of them had not realized that Lin Yuan was so interested in watching such spectacles."]},{"number":2850,"title":"Chapter 2850 Thorny Scale Tooth Mouse!","paragraphs":["2850 Thorny Scale Tooth Mouse!","The battles between the various species were always to the death.","During these vicious fights, the weaker members of the small species who were unable to fight would also be eliminated. This reduced the species’ drain on resources.","This might come across as merciless, but it was the basic way of life for the smaller species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Only the powerful species listed in the Species Ranking had the resources needed to care for the weaker members of their kind, who were unable to engage in combat due to their limited lifespan.","In the human world, families looked out for each other and were united, unlike feys, who were always fighting with each other. This was why humans had sufficient resources to positively advance their environment and living conditions.","However, this culture did not exist in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan was interested in this fight, partially because he was curious and partially because he wanted to collect faith power.","Faith power was not a good that could be bought and sold.","Once a lifeform gave their faith to Lin Yuan, they would supply faith power to him continuously as long as their faith did not waver. They could even become stronger sources of faith power if their faith in him grew.","Lin Yuan saw bodies littered on the ground even before he arrived at where the main battle was taking place.","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the bodies and saw that they were mostly the corpses of Rough Scale Tooth Mice. A few of them were of the Thorny Scale Tooth Mice.","Lin Yuan found this curious because it was obvious that the Thorny Scale and Rough Scale Tooth Mice belonged to the same type of lifeform. The Thorny Scale Tooth Mouse was the evolved form of the Rough Scale Tooth Mouse, and the two were not in competition with each other. Both the Rough Scale Tooth and Rough Scale Tooth Mice’s heads had been pierced by a long spike. They had been killed in an extremely clean manner.","The Thorny Scale Tooth Mice were all Suzerain/Myth, while the Rough Scale Tooth Mouse were only Platinum/Diamond. Such power was inconsequential in a place like the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","If the two species were truly warring, they would not have allowed so many weak lifeforms to be sacrificed as it did not benefit the development of their species!","At that moment, Kani, who had been in the Spirit Lock spatial zone all this time attempting to reach Domain Mountain class, sent a message to Lin Yuan.","She could sense that she was going to break through in the next few days.","At that point, she no longer needed to absorb pure spirit qi. All she needed to do was wait for her grade to evolve on its own.","Before Kani began leading the King Blood Jackals in North of the Lonely River, the previous queen had led the King Blood Jackals in their conquests.","The previous queen had died in a battle for a piece of fertile territory. If that had not happened, Kani would have had to work and endure for much longer before she became queen of the King Blood Jackals.","Yet, the piece of fertile land that had been important to the previous queen was nothing more than a poor and dilapidated land in Lin Yuan’s eyes.","Lin Yuan smiled when he found out that Kani was about to reach Domain Mountain class. It meant that all his hard work had not gone to waste.","Immediately after being summoned, Kani saw the corpses of the Thorny Scale and Rough Scale Tooth Mice on the ground, and her expression turned stern.","“Master, I can’t believe there’s a rodent infestation here! This is clearly the edge of the rodent infestation. Given the strength of these rodents, it must be a pinnacle Class 2 or even Class 3 rodent infestation!","“All the species in a 30,000-kilometer radius will be affected by the rodent infestation. The powerful species will be able to flee, but the weaker species will be sacrificed and end up bitten to death by these bastardly rodents.","“Master, I suggest that you take a detour. The further ahead you travel, the more of these rodents you’ll encounter. Once you get to the main area, the rodents will be climbing all over each other, forming walls of rodents that are thousands of meters tall.”","Lin Yuan had felt that these mice species were weak. Yet, Kani immediately declared this to be a disaster.","Kani had addressed the mice as bastardly, meaning that she or even all the species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds had a deep hatred for the Thorny Scale and Rough Scale Tooth Mice.","Mice could also cause disasters in the main world, but they only affected regular people. The true calamities that could affect an entire species were those caused by carcinoma feys.","But based on Kani’s description, the rodent infestation of the Thorny Scale and Rough Scale Tooth Mice was even more destructive than calamities caused by carcinoma feys!","The Thorny Scale and Rough Scale Tooth Mice were only around the size of a palm. They never grew longer than a human forearm.","It was difficult to imagine how many mice were required to form walls that were thousands of meters tall. It was likely that the mice at the bottom would either be crushed to death or suffocated.","When Kani saw that Lin Yuan had not reacted to what she said, she hurriedly tried to urge him again, “Master, these bastardly mice might not seem strong, but as they continue to consume flesh, minerals, and everything else in their path that contains energy, their power will grow.","“Their power grows much faster than that of regular lifeforms. They won’t attack their own but will devour their dead kin. When they consume their own kind, they will reproduce even quicker.","“The mice have emperors and empresses. They aren’t responsible for reproduction—their only job is to command. The female mice can produce offspring rapidly.","“Some of these bastardly mice appeared in our territory in the past, and it was only after thousands of years of hard battle that we managed to exterminate all of them. These mice are the bane of all species.","“Aside from emperors and empresses, there are also kings. The regular mice aren’t very intelligent, but once they become kings, they will become intelligent enough to lead other mice into hiding.","“It took the King Blood Jackals so long to eliminate the mice because they can hide hundreds of meters underground. They will only return to the surface once their numbers have grown again. This makes it extremely difficult to defend against them.”","When Lin Yuan heard that, he could not help but think of the demon insects.","Based on Kani’s description, he believed that these bastardly mice, as Kani called them, were even more capable of reproduction than the demon insects were.","However, these mice could not compete with the demon insects’ intelligence. Even demon insects with Class 2 genetic locks were much smarter than regular lifeforms, much less demon insects with Class 1 Genetic Locks.","This was likely why the demon insects were accepted by most species, but the mice were shunned!","That said, the mice’s appearance solved an issue that had been plaguing Lin Yuan for a long time.","Because of the existence of dimensional rifts in the main world, Silver Corona and Red Thorn could evolve their grades and qualities by consuming the waves of dimensional lifeforms that emerged from the dimensional rifts. But due to the lack of dimensional rifts in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Lin Yuan had lost his means of evolving Red Thorn and Silver Corona. After all, he could not instruct them to hunt the other species.","But now, the appearance of these mice solved this problem that Lin Yuan had been facing.","Silver Corona was currently in Sky City’s territory and was unable to seize this meal opportunity. As such, Red Thorn was the only one who was available to enjoy this meal!","Lin Yuan raised his hand, and Red Thorn appeared in front of him.","After going so long without food, Red Thorn was understandably irritated.","It had never been deprived of food from the moment Lin Yuan began nurturing it.","But in spite of its annoyance, it still clung tightly to Lin Yuan.","After being summoned, Red Thorn immediately took a seat on his shoulder. A red thread extended from Red Thorn’s green vine-like hair and wrapped around Lin Yuan’s wrist. This was just like how Lin Yuan used to tie butterfly knots on Red Thorn’s vines.","Lin Yuan raised his hand before pinching Red Thorn’s cheeks and saying with a smile, “Red Thorn, you won’t have to go hungry again. Now you can consume as much of these dead mice on the ground as you want. The further we travel, the more corpses there will be. You’ll be able to have a fine meal! This rodent infestation might enable you to evolve!”","Red Thorn was currently Suzerain VIII/Myth III. Of all of Lin Yuan’s feys, Red Thorn was the most difficult one to evolve. This was not because of Red Thorn’s lacking talent but because it needed far too much energy to evolve.","Red Thorn’s bloodline had already evolved to ten wings and had created a new record for the fairies in the main world.","Red Thorn’s bloodline was also considered extraordinary in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. This was clear from Kani’s expression!","Kani was obviously shocked when she saw the five pairs of wings flapping on Red Thorn’s back.","Kani’s eyes were not fooling him. Kani was indeed astonished by Red Thorn having such a bloodline despite being only Suzerain/Myth.","However, Kani was even more floored by Lin Yuan.","She knew that Lin Yuan was a spirit contractor. With the resources in his possession, it was expected that he had contracted and was nurturing numerous lifeforms.","However, it was shocking that he had managed to evolve a Myth Breed fairy to ten wings!","If Lin Yuan was willing to invest in one fey to such a degree, it had to mean that his other feys received the same level of treatment.","Fairies had established a faction called Fairy Palace in the previous epoch. They had a presence in all four universes.","From the moment that Fairy Palace was established in the East Universe, they remained in the top 30 of the Species Ranking. In recent years, they had even climbed up to the top ten. This was evidence of how fearsome Fairy Palace was!","Fairy Palace’s interior structure was very complex, but authority was determined based on the strength of bloodline.","Fairies prioritized their bloodline’s legacy, and they were always willing to invest resources into nurturing their young.","The young members nurtured by Fairy Palace were also able to reach ten wings when they were only at Myth Breed. However, this only happened when Fairy Palace used the best resources and did their best to manifest such an outcome.","The fairy sitting on Lin Yuan’s shoulder had a bloodline that matched that of the most outstanding young fairies.","However, she had no idea of the power that Lin Yuan’s ten- winged fairy possessed.","Red Thorn was never picky when it came to food. It used to consume the corpses of various dimensional lifeforms. Most of them had already decayed horribly by the time Red Thorn got to them. Red Thorn would then use the poison in the decaying dimensional lifeform corpses to speed up its digestion and absorption of them.","The Thorny Scale and Rough Scale Tooth Mice were considered weak in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, but they were the best source of food for the Suzerain/Myth Red Thorn.","Red Thorn did not move while sitting on Lin Yuan’s shoulder. All it did was raise its slender hand, and spores immediately materialized before spreading and charging forward.","The spores landed on the Thorny Scale and Rough Scale Tooth Mice’s bodies and anchored themselves before growing into thick black vines. The vines did not consume the mice they were attached to but instead consumed the mice that did not have vines growing out of them.","The mouth on the tips of the vines could gnaw and tear away the mice’s hard skin, devouring the mice like a grinder.","Soon, the brutal vine ramets on the ground started growing as well, and the special spore cavities began ferociously spewing spores into the air. It did not take long for a sea of flowers to grow and stretch out as far as the eye could see.","Every inch covered by the sea of flowers had been cleared by the Thorny Scale and Rough Scale Tooth Mice corpses.","The vines’ roots were deep in the ground, and Kani could sense that the vines were able to serve as tools for detection. They could accurately locate the mice underground before capturing them and dragging them to the surface to be consumed.","The expansive sea of flowers was both fierce and bizarre. The black thicket of vines also had gill-shaped flowers growing on them.","The gill-shaped flowers swayed in the wind, and an engorged ball of flesh grew at the center of the clusters. The ball of flesh released a howl that resembled that of a furnace and was like a newly grown sprout that had yet to grow into its final form.","Suddenly, Kani was struck by a thought. Was it possible for Lin Yuan’s ten-winged fairy to eradicate the calamity caused by these bastardly mice?"]},{"number":2851,"title":"Chapter 2851 Creation Breed Red Thorn!","paragraphs":["2851 Creation Breed Red Thorn!","Kani hurriedly shook her head.","Lin Yuan did not know what Kani was thinking. If he did, he would have laughed to himself.","It was true that Red Thorn was a ten-winged Suzerain/Myth fairy and.","However, its abilities were very special. Hence, any mice weaker than Red Thorn would be promptly devoured by the sea of flowers. There was also a high possibility that the mice that were stronger than Red Thorn would be killed by the attacks from the sea of flowers.","If Lin Yuan was willing to waste a long time here and Red Thorn continued extending its sea of flowers toward the rodent infestation, it might end up consuming all the mice! The sea of flowers that Red Thorn controlled was truly terrifying when it spread out and was operating at top capacity.","However, Lin Yuan did not intend to waste too much time there. He only wanted to capture a few mice so he could cultivate them.","Once the female mice were allowed to reproduce endlessly, it would take hundreds of years for Lin Yuan to put a stop to this pinnacle Class 2 rodent infestation.","Lin Yuan did not have so much time to waste.","If the rodent infestation grew stronger or reached the territory of powerful species, the powerful species would send experts to deal with the rodent infestation. If none of the species stepped in, Honor Absent Palace would have to act.","Lin Yuan needed to use this opportunity to increase Red Thorn’s power. It would evolve from Suzerain VIII/Myth III to Sovereign/Creation while simultaneously rescuing the species that were being invaded by the mice.","In the main world, Lin Yuan felt compelled to save the world because he saw it as his home.","But this was Lin Yuan’s first time in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, so he did not feel much attachment to it. If he felt compelled to save every place, he would not be able to lead a faction.","Spring and Winter shared a look. They were worried that Lin Yuan would ask them to handle the Class 2 rodent infestation.","It would not be difficult for them to put a pid on the pinnacle Class 2 rodent infestation. All it required was some effort.","However, Spring and Winter believed that doing so would lead to repercussions and karma.","In actuality, a disaster like a rodent infestation was considered natural in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. The rodent infestation would eliminate the weaker species while allowing many resources to be returned to the environment.","Each time a disaster broke out, there would be changes and new growth in that location. Many strong species used opportunities like this to rise up and begin thriving.","At Spring and Winter’s level, almost every expert believed in the seemingly baseless karma. Even the most powerful lifeform would suffer after creating too much negative karma.","Red Thorn had not had such a large meal in a long time.","The mice’s fur and bones were exceptionally tough because their diet mainly consisted of minerals.","The further they traveled, the more mice they encountered. Slowly, Red Thorn was unable to match its consumption rate to the increasing quantity of mice.","The energy in the Eyes of Relinquish entered the sea of flowers, and the sea of flowers began expanding at many times its original rate.","The sea of flowers spread rapidly, and the brutal vine ramets took care of the swarms of mice.","The sea of flowers was even able to digest the wall of mice that was tens of meters tall rapidly.","Red Thorn’s Spore Growth rapidly unleashed its effects.","Each time the brutal vine ramet consumed a mouse, the special spore cavities would spray even more spores to increase Red Thorn’s control over the battle.","Red Thorn quickly absorbed the sea of vitality and sighed. “Yuan, this is the best meal I’ve ever had! These mice are filled with energy. They are much better than the dimensional lifeforms that come from dimensional rifts!”","Lin Yuan smiled vexedly. It was true that even the dimensional lifeforms of Class 5 dimensional rifts were limited in power.","Once Red Thorn’s power reached a certain level, the weaker dimensional lifeforms’ bodies no longer contained sufficient energy to meet Red Thorn’s needs.","Later, Red Thorn consumed numerous dead dimensional lifeforms. The combined power of the deceased dimensional lifeforms was even less than that of the dimensional lifeforms that came from Class 5 dimensional rifts. They could not compare to the Suzerain mice at all.","It did not take long for Red Thorn to evolve from Suzerain VIII to Suzerain IX.","“Red Thorn, you will always be able to eat food of this level from now on. While you’re eating and digesting, you don’t have to gobble them up and increase the burden on the Mouths of Relinquish.”","When Red Thorn heard what Lin Yuan said, it flew up from his shoulder and gently pressed its lips to his face.","“Yuan, if that’s the case, using Tongue Pouch Births Demons to turn corpses into fairies will progress much faster than before! I also no longer have to be worried about the fairies affecting the speed of my evolution! Why don’t I use the brutal vine ramets to pick some of the better mice and raise them in the sea of flowers? We can then nurture these mice!”","Red Thorn’s ideas matched Lin Yuan’s own.","“Okay, Red Thorn. You can select the mice! Remember not to keep too many of them. Around 30,000 will be sufficient!”","Kani did not know what to say as she watched the interactions between Lin Yuan and Red Thorn.","Before Lin Yuan summoned Red Thorn, Kani would have protested if Lin Yuan wanted to bring the Rough Scale and Rough Scale Tooth Mice to North of the Lonely River. She did not want there to be another outbreak of a rodent infestation in North of the Lonely River.","But now, the calamity-causing mice were nothing more than energy-supplying food to Red Thorn.","She never expected the mice to one day end up in such a predicament!","“Yuan, don’t worry. I will try my best to find more mice kings while I’m selecting the mice. I can use my abilities to turn the mice kings into fairies before turning them into eight-winged fairies. The mice kings will be able to help me manage the swarms of mice! The mice will become a buffet that I can dig into whenever I want!”","Lin Yuan did not have any objections to what Red Thorn said.","When Red Thorn used Tongue Pouch Births Demons and Demon Transformed Bound Fairy to turn lifeforms or corpses into fairies, it required many resources. This would definitely affect Red Thorn’s development, and if it were serious, it would even slow down Red Thorn’s rate of evolution.","Normally, opportunities like this would be left to powerful lifeforms and corpses. This was the only way that Red Thorn’s investment would be worth it.","Nonetheless, keeping the mice within Red Thorn and Silver Corona’s seas of flowers would not guarantee that the mice would never escape. Once they escaped and spread, Lin Yuan would need to invest effort into stamping out the rodent infestations.","There were many villages in the faith country. One rodent infestation that got out of hand would definitely affect many key areas of the faith country and cause the supply of faith from the faith country to decrease drastically.","If Red Thorn used Tongue Pouch Births Demons and Demon Transformed Bound Fairy to nurture eight-winged fairies, they would be able to manage the mice tide effectively and prevent it from spreading to other areas.","Lin Yuan headed east continuously, and Red Thorn’s sea of flowers followed him.","As for the mice that Red Thorn could not consume, it drained their energy, and they wilted immediately. Red Thorn had used all of its energy on hunting and consuming the mice.","Suddenly, Lin Yuan sensed a special energy flowing from Red Thorn. He knew that it was about to evolve.","Spring and Winter would naturally protect Red Thorn, and there was no need for Red Thorn to worry that it would be endangered by the World Cleansing. All it needed to do was continue hunting the mice!","After its evolution, Red Thorn’s bloodline also became more concentrated.","However, it was still far from becoming a 12-winged fairy!","Lin Yuan used True Data to check on the Creation Breed Red Thorn.","[Fey Name]: Red Thorn (Ten-Winged Fairy) (Thousand Eyes Relinquish)","[Fey Species]: Rafflesia genus/fairy species","[Fey Grade]: Suzerain (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Source/Wood","[Fey Quality]: Creation I","Abilities:","[Mouth of Relinquish]: Secretes vigorous digestive fluids with powerful corrosive properties, allowing faster absorption of energy in the food. The Tongue of Relinquish inside the mouth is able to increase digestion speed by several times. It can also secrete a special corrosive fluid from the flesh and blood that it consumes. When the Tongues of Relinquish pierce a target, the tip of the tongue can be cut off and left in the target’s body. While the target remains alive, the tip of the tongue will control the target’s spirit and soul. After the target dies, the tip of the tongue can control and manipulate the target to make it appear as though it is still alive.","[Brutal Carnivore Vine]: The vines contain digestive fluids that grow in midair, and the sharp teeth on the inner side of the vine can grind off and collect flesh and blood energy.","[Eye of Relinquish]: Eyes formed by using blood and flesh energy. Each eye contains a huge amount of blood and flesh energy. When the number of Eyes of Relinquish on every Mouth of Relinquish is maintained below 60, they are merely able to store energy. When the number of Eyes of Relinquish is above 60, those Eyes of Relinquish that are above 60 can be turned into an energy ray at any time.","[Sea of Flowers State Transition]: By quickly using up the stored-up energy, the sea of flowers’ child ramets’ attacking power and mobility can be improved by several times. The child ramets’ weapons will also morph in a way that increases their functionality.","[Demon Spirit Curse Kill]: Whenever any of the ortet’s ramets touches an enemy target and breaks through a target’s defense, the target will be cursed. Every curse carries a negative effect that will be stacked with every additional attack.","[Tongue Pouch Births Demons]: When a corpse is being consumed, it can be stored in the tongue pouch and nurtured. If the corpse’s power is intact, it can be nurtured into a special lifeform that contains a fairy bloodline. Its previous power will be retained, and its power can also be increased when tempered by blood energy.","[Demon Transformed Bound Fairy]: Its bloodline will be injected into the demon nurtured by Tongue Pouch Births Demons. The demon will transform into a fairy with a bloodline that is one level lower and is controlled by Red Thorn. The fairy will take on the same abilities and, with sufficient vitality, can become an individual Mouth of Relinquish (The bound fairy’s bloodline and power will be increased as the main body evolves. The nutrients absorbed by the bound spirit’s Mouth of Relinquish will be channeled to the main body.)","Exclusive Skill:","[Spore Growth]: Spits a huge amount of spores, which can absorb the energy or flesh energy supplied by Red Thorn, out of its spore cavity to quickly grow ramets and child ramets that are controlled by the ortet.","[Wither Glory]: Red Thorn can rapidly absorb the energy from the soil and pour the energy into the sea of flowers. As long as the soil has the roots of the child ramets and ramets, the withered sea of flowers would reach its prime state.","[Spores Destruction Death Order]: Each time the entity grown from a spore is on the brink of death after being attacked by the enemy, the enemy’s energy that enters the spores will turn into pure death aura and death curse energy. The death aura will trigger the effects of the death curse energy, and a time can be set to decide when the accumulated death curse energy will attempt to kill the target (the target’s survival is linked to the strength of the vitality in the target’s body).","[Spore Division]: Each time spores are produced, the spores will absorb energy from the surroundings and divide. The division will not affect the spores’ differentiation potential.","Red Thorn asked Lin Yuan questions during its evolution. Each time it evolved, it would ask Lin Yuan about the direction of its evolution!","Lin Yuan thought carefully before instructing Red Thorn to continue evolving its proliferation ability.","Red Thorn’s Creation Breed exclusive skill was related to its proliferation ability.","Spore Division seemed simple, but it actually increased Red Thorn’s overall power by several times. Red Thorn’s sea of flowers could now grow twice as fast!","The evolved Red Thorn immediately used its new exclusive skill.","After the sea of flowers consumed the wall of mice that was 200 to 300 meters tall, it suppressed the mice and occupied the mice’s living space."]},{"number":2852,"title":"Chapter 2852 Treasure City!","paragraphs":["2852 Treasure City!","Red Thorn consumed the mice according to Lin Yuan’s instructions. It protected the species that were struggling stubbornly but failing to escape from the swarm. It did not kill the members of these species.","Red Thorn carefully selected the mice, choosing only those with fatter and chubbier bodies.","Suddenly, Red Thorn frowned. “Yuan, when I attacked these mice previously, they did not resist and silently endured the assault. But now, they are starting to fight back and are attacking my sea of flowers.","“I have already caught four to five mouse kings. From what I’ve learned about the mouse kings, they are incapable of harnessing and commanding such a large wave. Each mouse king’s ability to transmit information is very limited.","“I suspect that the mouse emperor and empress aren’t far from the sea of flowers. If we can catch them and nurture them into fairies, they will definitely be more useful than if we just turn them into potions!”","Red Thorn’s understanding of the mice came from its interaction with the rodents. Red Thorn did not see the rodent infestation as serious—it viewed the mice as food.","Kani hurriedly said, “Master, the mouse emperor and empress are spatial-type and can teleport within the swarm of mice. They can teleport instantly. Moreover, they are always surrounded by guards who are even stronger than mouse kings.","“Unless the entire wave is stamped out, the emperor and empress will never show up. We are now in the vicinity of the 19 islands that are under Honor Absent Palace’s control. This is the Cleansing Station Island’s edge. The rodent calamity must have reached here a few days ago. It’s likely that the officer in charge of Cleansing Station Island has received the news and will soon send people to handle the rodent infestation.","“Honor Absent Palace is the ruling faction in the East Universe, and there are many highly skilled experts under them. If we encounter these people, trouble will surely follow!","“Every year, Honor Absent Palace invests a large sum into deterring rodent infestations. The investments reach all 19 islands, but there continue to be rodent infestations in all 19 islands. The officer in charge of Cleansing Station Island probably doesn’t want to take responsibility for the losses. So each time a special or powerful expert appears at the same time as a rodent infestation, they will use these factions and experts as scapegoats.”","Kani had been leading the King Blood Jackals in developing in North of the Lonely River. Although the area where she was developing was part of Honor Absent Palace’s jurisdiction, they had yet to assign a staff member to manage North of the Lonely River.","North of the Lonely River was also not part of any of the 19 islands.","Kani hated having to interact with the officials from Honor Absent Palace because it always brought trouble.","Kani knew that Lin Yuan was traveling incognito this time. Otherwise, he would have more than just three followers accompanying him.","This was why Kani made such a suggestion to Lin Yuan.","When she joined Lin Yuan, she noticed that he was not a native of the East Universe. It seemed as though he had only just arrived at the East Universe. Otherwise, there was no need for him to develop in a place as remote as the Lonely River.","If Lin Yuan had any intentions toward the East Universe, he would become Honor Absent Palace’s biggest enemy!","Those figures had established Honor Absent Palace to provide better lives to the lifeforms living in the East Universe. Honor Absent Palace existed to protect the entire East Universe.","However, from the current circumstances, Honor Absent Palace was enjoying the authority of lording over the entire East Universe but was not properly protecting them. Only the powerful species who were part of the Species Ranking had their voices heard by Honor Absent Palace. The less powerful species would recommend one of their stronger members to join Honor Absent Palace as a member of parliament.","If Kani eventually led her species out of North of the Lonely River and began developing within Honor Absent Palace’s 19 islands, it was likely she would eventually join Honor Absent Palace as a parliament member to fight for the rights of her species.","Lin Yuan did not want to create too much commotion on this journey because his plans for this trip included not just participating in the Bloodians’ plan. He would also move a batch of mermaids into the Spirit Lock spatial zone where Dark Blue was living so they could supply faith power to Dark Blue.","If he caused too much of a stir, he would definitely catch the attention of factions, and this would lead to unwanted and unnecessary issues.","“Red Thorn, go ahead and pick the mice. Once you’re done, we’re leaving. You have to point the species you’ve saved in the right direction so they know how to hide from the rodent infestation after we’re gone.”","Red Thorn did not insist on capturing the mouse emperor and empress. It would never do something that caused issues for Lin Yuan. This was just a suggestion that Red Thorn had. If its suggestion was unfeasible, it would never insist on it.","Red Thorn’s bloodline had always been stronger than that of Silver Corona, but the latter’s grade was higher. Now that it had evolved to Creation Breed, the gap between itself and Silver Corona had shrunk.","“Yuan, wait another half a day for me. I am about to be able to evolve my grade. Let’s leave after that!”","Lin Yuan was willing to allow Red Thorn to evolve its grade there. It so happened that once it evolved, Red Thorn would gain a new ability. Lin Yuan hoped that Red Thorn’s new ability would be related to controlling fairies.","The Cleansing Station Island was enormous, and the first thing the manager would have to do after learning about the rodent infestation was to conduct an investigation. He would only send people to address the rodent infestation after gaining a comprehensive understanding of the situation. He could not send people immediately after the rodent infestation began.","If he made a decision before properly understanding the situation, he might be able to put out the urgent fires but would be criticized for being reckless.","The officials managing the 19 islands were under the supervision of Honor Absent Palace. Being criticized in such a manner would surely affect them in the future.","Hence, these officials were always very cautious before they made their decisions.","There was no way that the people from the Cleansing Station Island would be arriving there anytime soon.","Red Thorn had sufficient time to evolve, and it took three days to reach Sovereign.","The new ability it gained was called Fairy Bloodline Blessing.","[Fairy Bloodline Boost]: Each time it takes control of a fairy with a similar bloodline, its overall power will increase by 3% to 5%.","It would be difficult for Red Thorn to use Tongue Pouch Births Demons and Demon Transformed Bound Fairy to produce a fairy with the same bloodline as its own. This not only required many resources and energy but also time.","However, while Red Thorn was developing, the number of fairies it nurtured would only increase. It would definitely have many fairies by its side in the future.","This meant that Fairy Bloodline Boost would be able to increase its power significantly!","After Red Thorn evolved its grade, it stopped using the sea of flowers to attack the mice.","Instead, it extracted the energy it had injected into the sea of flowers and absorbed it back into its body.","Red Thorn had already opened a path using the sea of flowers that the species it had rescued could pass through.","At Red Thorn’s current grade, it was unable to utilize faith power. However, its act of saving the species would definitely leave a deep impression on the species’ members. There was a high chance that, unbeknownst to Red Thorn, the saved parties had already dedicated their faith power to the sea of flowers.","They had suffered a huge loss at the hands of the rodent infestation, but Red Thorn had led them to a safe location far from the calamity, where they could reside in peace once again.","There was no way that Honor Absent Palace would offer any compensation to the species that were affected by such a crisis. Hence, it was almost impossible that any of these species would cross paths with people from Honor Absent Palace.","There were plenty of powerful and strange lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. The sea of flowers would inevitably leave behind signs of having grown here. These signs could not be removed. It was likely that rumors surrounding Red Thorn would be passed around this area for a long time to come!","...","Lin Yuan continued heading east. The map that Fan Lou had given him was very useful.","After traveling east for another few days, he would be able to reach the largest trading city in the Cleansing Station Island, Treasure City.","Treasure City relied on trade, and there were hundreds of chambers of commerce in the city. Each of them was helmed by a species.","The goods being sold in Treasure City’s markets were not extremely precious. The truly precious resources were traded privately or at gated auctions held by the upper echelon.","Lin Yuan was a newcomer, and he had not come to Treasure City to trade for precious resources.","This trip to Treasure City did allow him to broaden his horizons and increase his understanding of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan had heard from Fan Lou that many chambers of commerce would compile and sell books. The books contained information on resources that could be harvested in the wild, as well as the chambers of commerce’s descriptions of various resources.","However, the books’ descriptions of the effects of spiritual ingredients were not comprehensive. Many chambers of commerce mistook the effects of the resources they had harvested and sold them as other kinds of goods. As a result, there were often disputes between the chambers of commerce.","Due to the overwhelming number of resources in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, the sellers could not ascertain the effects of every kind of resource. Hence, the trades were simple, and many who traded in Treasure City received benefits. There were some who even managed to trade for miracle goods.","As a result, Treasure City, which was an amalgamation of chambers of commerce, only grew increasingly larger.","Kani had not been to such a bustling area in such a long time. She did not care for places like Treasure City. She believed that the most precious resources in this world were pure spirit qi and faith power. There was no way that such resources were available for sale in Treasure City!","Kani assumed that, being a young lifeform, Lin Yuan had come to Treasure City to immerse himself in the excitement but would soon leave in disappointment.","Despite not having reached Treasure City yet, Lin Yuan had already encountered thousands of merchant groups.","The merchant groups were either traveling out of Treasure City or were carrying resources towards Treasure City.","Lin Yuan felt as though he had returned to the main world. This was the same sight that could be seen in the Radiance Federation’s cities.","Lin Yuan thought, A trading city like Treasure City must have many rules. I don’t know any of Treasure City’s rules, so I need to find myself a reliable guide.","At that moment, Lin Yuan saw two merchant groups in the middle of a brawl. They were both rushing toward Treasure City. The brawl was not only one of words, as martial force had been unsheathed as well.","At first, it looked as though the two merchant groups were equally matched. However, two elderly men walked out from the carriage of one of the merchant groups, and the scales of the fight began to tip.","“Huang Zhen, we run into the Bloodwood Lion Bees everywhere and have always given way. What more do you want? We are no longer in possession of that mineral vein. You know which faction is harvesting it now.","“Do you want us to take on that faction with you because you lack the capabilities to do it on your own? We have already admitted that we aren’t as strong as the Bloodwood Lion Bees and have provided you with many resources. How dare you continue to strike so treacherously against us?”","This voice sounded like bloody shrieks and roars. The tone was one of pure rage.","Lin Yuan gleaned useful information from this voice.","The first piece of information was that stronger species could take resources from weaker ones. Honor Absent Palace could not interfere with this.","The second piece of information was that if misunderstandings took place between weak and strong factions, the weaker faction could supply resources to the stronger one as a means of mediation.","However, the Bloodwood Lion Bees refused to leave this species, who had fought with them over a mineral vein alone, even after receiving benefits.","This weaker faction might be in a sticky spot.","Should he rescue the merchant group of this species and escort them into Treasure City, teeming with various chambers of commerce, the species would view him as their savior and implore him for protection.","When that happened, this species would definitely be willing to act as his guide if he wanted to browse Treasure City and shop for resources!"]},{"number":2853,"title":"Chapter 2853 I’ve Already Given You A Chance!","paragraphs":["2853 I’ve Already Given You A Chance!","Despite having made a decision, Lin Yuan did not immediately take action. Instead, he chose to wait for the conflict between the two merchant groups to escalate.","Coincidentally, Lin Yuan also wanted to see the overall strength of the merchant groups in Treasure City.","A cold laugh followed the shout.","“You, Purple Feather Rain Pigeons, have long been on the blacklist of our Bloodwood Lion Bees.","“It was true that we discovered that mineral vein together, but the strength of our Bloodwood Lion Bees far exceeds that of your Purple Feather Rain Pigeons. This Water Flame Crystal Vein should belong to us.","“If you hadn’t insisted on fighting for it, which led to the news being leaked, how could this mineral vein have been occupied by the Sword Feather Vultures?","“If we can acquire this Water Flame Crystal Vein, we will obtain great benefits. We’ve already promised your Purple Feather Rain Pigeons that we can give you 10% of the profits from the mineral vein as repayment. You only need to allocate 30% of your manpower to develop the mineral vein.","“It’s you that don’t know what’s good for you. You can’t blame others!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the shrill voice from before sounded again. “Huang Zhen! Is it just you who is shameless to such an extreme, or are all the Bloodwood Lion Bees like you?","“This Water Flame Crystal Vein is very well-hidden. We discovered the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons through the power of our bloodline! It’s clearly you who want to snatch the resources of our Purple Feather Rain Pigeons! You can’t deny it!","“You’re unbelievable! Not only did you only give us 10% of the profits, but you also demand that we give you 30% of our manpower. Do you want us to labor for you? Don’t even dream about it!","“You want to oppress and exploit Purple Feather Rain Pigeons. Why can’t we counterattack? If you are capable, why don’t you compete with the Sword Feather Vultures for the vein’s ownership?","“You must have suffered considerable losses when you attacked our five merchant groups previously and didn’t gain much, right?! Now that you’ve chosen to attack me, I’ll show you how powerful I am!”","Unbridled laughter echoed.","“Yu Run, aren’t your words an attempt to boost the prestige of your Purple Feather Rain Pigeons?","“Do you know why our Bloodwood Lion Bees have always occupied the resources in your hands during our cooperation? That’s because ever since the leader of the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons passed away, the younger generation has become too weak.","“You’re just taking advantage of the situation! We merely didn’t attack you before we discovered the Water Flame Crystal Vein because of our past friendship!","“However, since you dare to spout such arrogant words, I’d like to see how your merchant groups, which aren’t even protected by a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom expert, can make our Bloodwood Bees pay the price!","“Kill!”","The battle started following the shout!","Lin Yuan appeared with Spring, Winter, and Kani in front of the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons and Bloodwood Lion Bees’ merchant groups. Afterward, he didn’t say much and merely exchanged a glance with Kani.","Huang Zhen, who was leading the Bloodwood Lion Bees, was already bloodthirsty, as annihilating the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons and returning to the chamber of commerce would earn him many rewards.","The Bloodwood Lion Bees nursed a longstanding grudge against their adversaries. Those who held grievances with them either lacked the ability to prevail in a confrontation or had previously become targets of the Bloodwood Lion Bees.","Consumed by bloodlust, Huang Zhen showed no courtesy to the four people who had suddenly appeared in front of him.","“If you have any questions, step aside and ask the others. Can’t you see that we’re in the middle of resolving grudges here?","“If you don’t get lost now, don’t blame me for attacking you, too!”","Kani was well aware that Lin Yuan wanted to protect the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ merchant groups.","In order to protect them, they had to attack the Bloodwood Lion Bees’ merchant groups.","Attacking aside, Kani did not think that the leader of the Bloodwood Lion Bees’ merchant groups had the authority to speak to her and Lin Yuan in such a manner.","At present, Kani was concealing his aura and refrained from releasing it.","As a Holy Spirit existence, her aura alone could crush all the members of the Bloodwood Lion Bees’ merchant groups.","Kani’s eyes were filled with killing intent, yet she refrained from launching a direct attack. Instead, she turned to look at Lin Yuan and asked for his opinion. If Lin Yuan nodded, Kani would immediately kill him.","Lin Yuan did not immediately give Kani instructions because he was waiting for the leader of the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons to speak.","The elegant middle-aged man, covered in bloodstains, seemed to clutch at a straw when facing Lin Yuan and the others.","Even though the conflict between the two sides was evident from their aura, the group of people in front of him was still willing to get involved. This indicated they were definitely stronger than the Bloodwood Lion Bees’ merchant groups.","Huang Zhen was irritable and easily angered. He had already offended the four people in front of him. In terms of martial force, Yu Run’s merchant groups were no match for Huang Zhen’s merchant groups.","Yu Run would not hesitate to lead his men to kill the merchant groups Huang Zhen led. However, if he could rope in this group of four people, perhaps he and his merchant groups would have a chance of survival!","Thinking of this, Yu Run hurriedly said, “We can be your guides. When I lead the merchant groups back to the chamber of commerce in Treasure City, I can bring you around.","“The Treasure Convention, held once every 100 years in Treasure City, is scheduled to take place in six days. Factions from all over the Cleansing Station Island have already gathered in Treasure City more than a month ago. I’ve had experiences as a guide before. I’ll definitely have no problem bringing you around.","“If you want to participate in the Treasure Convention, you need to fight for a spot in advance. I can personally arrange four spots for the four of you.”","Yu Run treated Lin Yuan and the others as allies and as a last resort. He told them almost everything he knew.","Lin Yuan was very pleased with Yu Run’s attitude. His commitment was exactly what Lin Yuan needed.","Lin Yuan’s visit to Treasure City was spontaneous, and he did not expect to stumble upon the Trading Convention, which only happens once every 100 years.","Lin Yuan’s main goal for this trip was to obtain resources and revamp Sky City’s resources. Under such circumstances, there was no reason for Lin Yuan not to participate in the Treasure Convention!","Just as Huang Zhen finished speaking, he heard a clear and pleasant voice.","“Whether or not they can bring us into Treasure City is not up to you to decide. I’ve already given you a chance. Since you insist on attacking me, don’t blame me for being impolite.","“Kani, do it!”","Just as Lin Yuan finished speaking, Kani’s figure shot out like an arrow.","Screams sounded one after another.","When Kani stood in front of Lin Yuan again, only the heavily injured Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ merchant groups were left.","The merchant groups of the Bloodwood Lion Bees, who had acted abnormally arrogantly just moments ago, vanished on the spot. The only proof of their existence was the broken armor on the ground.","Kani was elegantly wiping the corner of her bleeding mouth.","As the King Blood Jackal Queen, Kani was a pure carnivorous creature. She had always enjoyed eating the flesh of large lifeforms such as deer, horses, and oxen. Now that she was eating insects, she couldn’t really muster up much interest.","However, the way she attacked stunned the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons and Lin Yuan. It was Lin Yuan’s first time commanding Kani to attack, and he did not expect her to be so brutal.","If Lin Yuan’s subordinates had done this in the main world, he would have definitely restrained them. However, upon arriving there, Lin Yuan understood the law of survival in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Hence, there was really no need for Lin Yuan to manage and restrict them.","Kani’s style of handling situations was more suited for survival in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Lin Yuan had just witnessed how cruel the environment in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was.","Just because the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons were not as strong as the Bloodwood Lion Bees, the latter suppressed and bullied them.","If Lin Yuan had not chosen the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons as his guide in Treasure City, they would most likely have been exterminated by the Bloodwood Lion Bees!","In the beginning, Lin Yuan did not harbor any killing intent toward the Bloodwood Lion Bees’ merchant groups. On the contrary, it was Huang Zhen who had wanted to attack Lin Yuan’s group.","Those who live by the sword, die by the sword.","After eliminating the merchant groups, Lin Yuan had no intention of engaging further with the Bloodwood Lion Bees. However, if they dared to attack him in the future, Lin Yuan would not hold back!","Lin Yuan’s adaptability was extremely strong, and he had already become accustomed to the way of interaction between the various species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","After a long while, Yu Run recovered from his shock.","The strength that Kani had displayed just now completely exceeded Yu Run’s understanding. For a moment, Yu Run could not grasp the level of strength Kani possessed to unleash such force, causing Huang Zhen to be unable to react in time!","Not only could this group of people protect him, but they could also protect the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons against the Bloodwood Lion Bees.","Every species wanted to develop in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, and it was difficult to define them as good or bad.","Upon discovering that the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons could not retain control of the Water Flame Crystal Vein and were dissatisfied with the way resources were allocated by the Bloodwood Lion Bees, Yu Run opted to share this information with the Sword Feather Vultures.","If they could not obtain it, the Bloodwood Lion Bees could forget about obtaining it!","If he took the initiative to reveal the information, he might be able to obtain a favor from the Sword Feather Vultures.","Nevertheless, the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons had made a mistake. Upon learning the news, they invaded the Water Flame Crystal Vein.","Not only did they not return the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ favor, but they also do not have any intention of protecting them from the Bloodwood Lion Bees.","If the Sword Feather Vultures had such intentions, the Bloodwood Lion Bees would not have dared to target the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons.","Without knowing if Lin Yuan’s group was stronger than Huang Zhen’s merchant groups, Yu Run made a choice. It was a last resort to protect himself.","Yu Run’s strategy displayed indifference to the well-being of Lin Yuan and his companions, as he was fully aware that once he committed, the resulting anger would be directed at the group before him.","Lin Yuan acknowledged this dynamic as well. He and the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons had essentially exploited each other.","Despite this, Lin Yuan held a considerable advantage over the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons, giving him greater authority to voice opinions and make decisions within this mutually advantageous arrangement.","“Lords, our merchant groups need a short rest before we can go on our way. I wonder if you can give us half a day to rest? Otherwise, at least half of our merchant groups’ members will die on the way! We’re still about a day away from Treasure City.”","Spring and Winter frowned when they heard Yu Run’s words. If the two of them were alone outside, they could completely afford to be addressed as Lords by Yu Run.","However, as Lin Yuan’s servants, the way he addressed them as Lords implied that they were on equal footing with Lin Yuan. Spring and Winter did not dare to overstep their boundaries.","Winter was the first to speak. “You only need to refer to our Young Master as Lord. The three of us are all servants. We don’t dare to be on equal footing with Young Master! Don’t address us wrongly next time!”","Based on Kani’s understanding of Lin Yuan, he was not someone who would care about such a situation. Lin Yuan had always been very easy-going with his subordinates.","Spring and Winter were so powerful that they were more akin to Lin Yuan’s protectors by his side.","Lin Yuan did not seem to have the ability to restrict Spring and Winter. However, they held Lin Yuan’s status in such high regard that they did not dare to be addressed on equal footing with him.","From the looks of it, Spring and Winter had completely submitted to Lin Yuan like devout believers.","Kani’s status was inferior to Spring and Winter, but she did not notice any issue with the way she was addressed. This made Kani feel a little panicked as she secretly thought that she had been negligent.","Yu Run quickly corrected himself and told Lin Yuan, “I’m sorry, Lord. Can you give me a chance to rest?”"]},{"number":2854,"title":"Chapter 2854 Target: Treasure Convention!","paragraphs":["2854 Target: Treasure Convention!","Yu Run wished to rely on Lin Yuan and his group, but his wish was one-sided. Yu Run wasn’t certain whether Lin Yuan’s group would protect the Purple Feather Rains Pigeons.","Yu Run did not expect Lin Yuan to help them for no reason. Lin Yuan provided them with help for two reasons. Firstly, it was because of his commitment to Lin Yuan and his willingness to be Lin Yuan’s guide in Treasure City. For this, he even secured four spots for the Treasure Convention without hesitation.","Secondly, it was because the Bloodwood Lion Bees had acted rudely towards Lin Yuan. Otherwise, in Yu Run’s opinion, Lin Yuan had no reason to kill the Bloodwood Lion Bees’ merchant groups.","In Yu Run’s mind, the best way to resolve the grievances between them and Bloodwood Lion Bees was to use Lin Yuan and the others as shields, causing a conflict to arise between the Bloodwood Lion Bees and Lin Yuan.","It would be best if Lin Yuan’s group was provoked and decided to fight to the death with the Bloodwood Lion Bees. This could resolve the predicament faced by the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons once and for all.","Of course, this was only Yu Run’s thoughts.","After bringing Lin Yuan and the others back, Yu Run would inform the leader of his thoughts and let the leader decide, as Yu Run was only the person in charge of the merchant groups and did not have much decision-making power.","This time, they were targeted by the Bloodwood Lion Bees’ merchant groups and suffered heavy losses. Yu Run knew very well that he would most likely be punished upon his return.","Rest and recuperation were extremely crucial in reducing the losses of the merchant groups. Healing ability was an extremely rare ability. In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, most species did not possess them. The Purple Feather Rain Pigeons, in particular, did not possess any healing abilities.","If such a species wanted to acquire healing abilities, they would need to have a spirit contractor among them. The spirit contractor would form contracts with lifeforms proficient in healing. This was the most effective way to resolve the lack of healing abilities.","Of course, there was another way. Powerful species like the Bloodians would rear some species that were known for their healing abilities, providing them with resources and shelter. In return, these species were expected to serve the Bloodians wholeheartedly. This would result in a mutually beneficial situation for both sides involved.","Coincidentally, there were spirit contractors in the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ merchant groups. However, it was extremely difficult to heal so many injured people with just one healing entity. This was the reason Yu Run had requested half a day of rest from Lin Yuan.","In fact, Yu Run was also afraid that Lin Yuan would lose patience. After all, in Yu Run’s heart, Lin Yuan was the savior of the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons.","Lin Yuan shook his head. It was impossible to wait here for half a day. He could not afford to waste that much time. However, Lin Yuan would not let the injured Purple Feather Rain Pigeons just die here.","“I don’t have half a day to spare for you. However, I can help you recuperate from your injuries!”","As he spoke, Lin Yuan raised his hand and summoned the Jasmine Lily. Green light emitted from Jasmine Lily’s body and fell upon the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons. The gentle healing energy instantly enveloped them.","Following that, the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ merchant groups, who were on the brink of death, subconsciously perked up. Their vitality was greatly replenished, enabling them to get up and move freely in just a minute or two.","Among the entire merchant groups, only Yu Run, a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom expert, was uninjured.","Without exception, Jasmine Lily treated all the lifeforms whose strength was not at the World Emperor/ Divine Kingdom. This did not pose a problem for Jasmine Lily at all.","Many of the merchant groups’ members present had not only lost their vitality but also had impaired limbs as a result of the enemy’s rapid attacks.","When the stingers on the tail of the Bloodwood Lion Bees pierced a target’s body, they would not release bee poison. However, they could maximize the blood-type energy in the target’s body, causing it to explode.","In the main world, there was hardly any means to repair the impaired limbs, and the same applied in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Even if there were spiritual ingredients that could repair impaired limbs, they were extremely expensive, and ordinary factions did not have the qualifications to acquire them.","The non-combat members of the various merchant groups in Treasure City were basically all experts with crippled limbs who could not fight. Such a scenario was already common in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","However, these Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ experts with crippled limbs miraculously recovered under Lin Yuan’s treatment to the point that they did not look like they had suffered from any injuries before.","Yu Run was surprised yet delighted to witness that Lin Yuan possessed such an ability. He was happy that so many Purple Feather Rain Pigeons had recovered. This was an extremely good thing for the species.","If this young man before him could heal these Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ experts with impaired limbs, would the other experts with impaired limbs also have a chance of recovery?!","The reason Yu Run had such thoughts was largely related to Lin Yuan’s nonchalant use of this ability to heal them. Lin Yuan did not appear to value the ability very much.","If the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons faithfully served the young man in front of them and then asked for his help, he would certainly offer his help, right?","Originally, Yu Run had intended to use Lin Yuan’s group’s strength to resolve their problems. However, Yu Run did not dare to have such thoughts anymore.","This young man was a spirit contractor and had contracted such a powerful healing fey. His status must be very noble!","If Lin Yuan sensed that the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons had taken advantage of him, they would be doomed.","Yu Run did not plan to bring up his previous suggestion to the leader. Instead, he intended to propose that they befriend and faithfully serve Lin Yuan and his group. He hoped to use this opportunity to gain Lin Yuan’s favor.","If the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons could maintain a good relationship with such an existence, it would be an opportunity that could change the fate of their species.","Otherwise, even if the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons survived the current crisis, they would inevitably encounter trouble similar to the Bloodwood Lion Bees in the future. If another calamity befell them, he might not be able to encounter such a savior again.","Yu Run quickly led the members of the merchant groups to express their gratitude to Lin Yuan. “Lord, we are deeply grateful for your help with our Purple Feather Rain Pigeons. We have no way to repay your kindness.","“Lord, we will arrange everything for you in Treasure City. We will definitely let you feel the sincerity of our species!”","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with Yu Run’s performance, as it showed that he was a sensible person. At the very least, Yu Run understood the purpose of his actions, and that would save Lin Yuan a lot of trouble in the future.","“I heard that almost every merchant group in the chambers of commerce in Treasure City has its own books. You should be able to help me get these books, right? I’m very interested in the experiences of various merchant groups.”","Yu Run was quite surprised.","From Yu Run’s point of view, he could not understand the value of the books that Lin Yuan had taken a fancy to. However, if Lin Yuan was interested in these books, Yu Run would not need to spend much effort to help him obtain them.","All the chambers of commerce sold these books. Some even offered services such as purchasing books and applying for book membership cards to increase book sales.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, those experiences were basically worthless, and it was not an exaggeration to say they had no value at all. This was because the merchant groups of the various chambers of commerce were out training all the time. During the process of going out to obtain resources, their knowledge was constantly accumulating.","Yu Run was puzzled as to why Lin Yuan wanted these books. In order to increase book sales, some chambers of commerce had even exaggerated their content.","Could it be that Lin Yuan was just there to watch the show? If he bought every book for 10 Honor Absent dollars just to watch the show, it would indeed be a little expensive.","Since Lin Yuan had spoken up, even if Yu Run did not fully understand it, he would not ask further.","“Lord, there are currently more than 46,000 chambers of commerce stationed in Treasure City. More than 40,000 of them have relevant books. If you’re interested in all of them, I can guarantee that these books will be ready for you in three days. It’s just that these books are very expensive. They all cost more than 450,000 Honor Absent dollars.”","Yu Run felt that it was necessary to inform Lin Yuan about the price in advance. He did not have the authority and ability to take on these expenses for Lin Yuan. Although the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons could fork out more than 400,000 Honor Absent dollars, it was unlikely for the leader to approve of investing these resources in Lin Yuan.","At the same time, Yu Run really could not afford to fork out his own money. Furthermore, these resources were meant for the species’ benefit, and Yu Run wouldn’t sacrifice his personal interests to benefit the entire species’. Most importantly, his fellow members would not appreciate his actions.","Before Lin Yuan left the King Blood Jackals’ territory, he took 5,000,000 Honor Absent dollars with him.","The King Blood Jackals operated and developed in North of the Lonely River. When they exchanged resources internally, they basically did not choose to use Honor Absent dollars.","Most of the 5,000,000 Honor Absent dollars were the resources obtained by the King Blood Jackals after killing the adventurers from other species.","Apart from taking 5,000,000 Honor Absent dollars from the King Blood Jackals, Lin Yuan also took 2,000,000 Honor Absent dollars from the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River.","7,000,000 Honor Absent dollars was a huge sum, but if Lin Yuan wanted to use these Honor Absent dollars to obtain resources in Treasure City and made a big purchase at the Treasure Convention, it would definitely not be enough.","Lin Yuan took out a spirit qi crystal and handed it to Yu Run. “How many Honor Absent dollars can this crystal containing spirit qi be exchanged for in Treasure City?”","Yu Run didn’t know why Lin Yuan was asking him this question, but he had a feeling that Lin Yuan was testing him.","Yu Run carefully sensed the spirit qi in the spirit qi crystals and said seriously, “Lord, with the concentration and purity of the spirit qi in your crystal, one crystal can be exchanged for at least 800,000 Honor Absent dollars.","“If someone urgently needs it, it’s not impossible to sell it for 1,300,000 Honor Absent dollars! However, it’s too wasteful to exchange resources of this level for Honor Absent dollars.","“Spirit qi resources with such purity can be directly converted into chips at the Treasure Convention to snatch and auction those rare and precious resources.","“The purchasing power and priority of the chips at the Treasure Gathering are higher than that of the Honor Absent dollars. However, the evaluation of the chips at every Treasure Convention varies significantly. Regardless, such pure spirit qi can definitely meet the standards required for chips!”","Lin Yuan had originally wanted to exchange some spirit qi crystals for Honor Absent dollars. However, upon hearing Yu Run’s words, he immediately changed his mind.","Since spirit qi crystals could be exchanged for bargaining chips, Lin Yuan intended to purchase numerous resources at the Treasure Convention. In that case, it might be worth using the spirit qi crystals to acquire chips for a sweeping spree at the Treasure Convention. Even if the Treasure Convention could not satisfy Lin Yuan’s needs, it would still provide him with a satisfactory harvest!","As for resources, Lin Yuan had a lot of them to exchange for Honor Absent dollars, as the King Blood Jackals’ territories were quite rich in resources.","Lin Yuan did not take the spirit qi crystals from Yu Run. Instead, he said directly, “In that case, I’ll reward you with these spirit qi crystals! Use three days to help me prepare the books from the chambers of commerce and store them all in this spatial equipment. During the next three days of helping us, prepare resources. I don’t wish to have any delay in exploring Treasure City.”","Yu Run hurriedly promised, “I definitely can’t purchase books from over 40,000 chambers of commerce alone. I’ll inform our leader about this and have him arrange for someone to do it.","“When we reach Treasure City, I can bring you around Treasure City at any time. I wonder if you have any accommodation needs? If you haven’t decided yet, you might consider staying in our Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ chamber of commerce. We will do our best to serve you, Lord! Moreover, we have a large stockpile of resources available for you to choose from!”","Lin Yuan smiled at Yu Run. “The Treasure Convention is about to begin. The major factions have gathered in Treasure City. I want to know which powerful factions are involved and where they are staying.”","Yu Run knew that Lin Yuan was not planning to rest in the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ chamber of commerce.","If Lin Yuan had such plans, he would not have asked that question.","Yu Run wished for Lin Yuan to stay with their merchant groups. Apart from being able to get closer to Lin Yuan’s group, he was also considering that if the Bloodwood Lion Bees’ experts came looking for trouble, Lin Yuan would be able to take better care of them in the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ chamber of commerce.","After all, it was Lin Yuan’s subordinates who had killed the Bloodwood Lion Bees. Hence, the enmity between Lin Yuan and the Bloodwood Lion Bees had already been formed. This was a fact that could not be denied.","It seemed that the passive approach of relying on Lin Yuan’s group to deal with the Bloodwood Lion Bees was no longer feasible."]},{"number":2855,"title":"Chapter 2855 Fortune Treasure Palace’s Special Honor Guest!","paragraphs":["2855 Fortune Treasure Palace’s Special Honor Guest!","If Yu Run wanted to solve the problem, he could only persuade their leader to take the initiative to seek protection from Lin Yuan. However, did the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons really have a bargaining chip that could sway Lin Yuan?","Thinking of this, Yu Run felt a heavy weight in his heart.","When that time arrived, he would leave these matters to the leader to consider. For now, he only needed to put his focus on entertaining Lin Yuan and his companions.","“Lord, to be honest, those powerful factions will choose to stay in Fortune Treasure Palace when they enter Treasure City. Fortune Treasure Palace is the largest private faction in Treasure City. It’s mainly responsible for receiving guests from all over the island.","“However, if you want to stay in Fortune Treasure Palace, the requirements are a little harsh. You need to purchase at least three items from Fortune Treasure Palace’s exhibition hall.","“Fortune Treasure Palace doesn’t accept Honor Absent dollars and demands that only items of a level sufficient to exchange for chips can be used for transactions.","“The items sold in Fortune Treasure Palace are top-notch, but the price tags are quite exorbitant, with at least a 20% markup. Therefore, if you want to stay in Fortune Treasure Palace, you have to pay a huge price.","“If not for the purpose of flaunting their status, I doubt that those factions would be willing to let Fortune Treasure Palace earn these resources.”","Fortune Treasure Palace had the capability to accommodate powerful factions that came to Treasure City and make them willing to purchase exorbitant items from them. Lin Yuan inwardly acknowledged that Fortune Treasure Palace must have a powerful background and backing from powerful species or factions.","Fortune Treasure Palace’s reception of various factions and their willingness to purchase exorbitant items indicated that they must provide extremely high-quality services.","If Lin Yuan wanted some ordinary resources, the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons could provide him with help. Nevertheless, if Lin Yuan wanted rare resources, it would be too difficult for the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons as the latter did not possess such ability.","Lin Yuan believed that staying in Fortune Treasure Palace was a good thing. He could take this opportunity to cooperate with some factions that were residing there.","Fortune Treasure Palace had amassed so many powerful species, forming a large-scale fame and fortune fair. The factions must more or less have the purpose of socializing in mind.","“In that case, bring us to the Fortune Treasure Palace! When you return to report, I will book a room for you in Fortune Treasure Palace so it will be easier for us to communicate later.”","Lin Yuan raised his brows and looked into the distance, signaling Yu Run to lead the merchant groups forward.","Yu Run led the way while digesting Lin Yuan’s words.","Lin Yuan was fully aware of how much it cost to book a room in Fortune Treasure Palace, yet he would book a room just for the sake of convenience in communication.","It was worth noting that booking a room in Fortune Treasure Palace cost resources that could easily be exchanged for chips. The Purple Feather Rain Pigeons would struggle to acquire such high-level resources, yet Lin Yuan didn’t appear to care about them at all. How audacious!","Neither Yu Run nor the leader of the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons had experienced this kind of treatment before.","There were more than 46,000 chambers of commerce in Treasure City, but less than 200 of them had the capability to stay in Fortune Treasure Palace!","Rather than saying that those 200 chambers of commerce could not afford to purchase the items displayed in Fortune Treasure Palace, it was more accurate to say that apart from those 200 chambers of commerce, the rest were unwilling to invest resources at such a high level.","...","The closer they got to Treasure City, the more merchant groups Lin Yuan saw. He could tell how prosperous Treasure City was just by looking at those merchant groups.","Lin Yuan communicated with Yu Run quite a bit along the way. He learned that there were more than 7 trillion people in Treasure City, and this was the number of officially certified members.","None of Lin Yuan’s group had Treasure City’s identity certification.","Upon entering Treasure City, Yu Run instructed his fellow members, who had completely recovered, “Transport the goods to the chamber of commerce first. Inform the leader that I will meet him in two hours.”","Yu Run didn’t elaborate much, but he trusted that these people would definitely brief the leader on the situation. When he returned, he wouldn’t need to waste any more time and could dive straight into important discussions with the leader.","After making the arrangements, Yu Run sought Lin Yuan’s approval.","Lin Yuan simply nodded indifferently, not putting the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons in his eyes at all. Regardless of their intentions, it was not worth Lin Yuan’s effort to worry about them at all.","What Lin Yuan needed the most now was for the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons to help him collect the books sold in the chamber of commerce within three days. Lin Yuan would pass these 40,000 books to Genius for digestion, absorption, and organization of their contents.","Afterward, he would have Connected Tails transmit the organized knowledge to him, allowing Lin Yuan’s understanding of spiritual ingredients and various species to surpass the average level in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Then, he wouldn’t have to worry about encountering situations that he didn’t understand like he did now.","Flying was allowed in Treasure City as long as the flying height did not exceed the height of the City Lord Manor. Otherwise, it would result in interception by city guards and be perceived as a provocation to the authority of Treasure City.","In order to return as soon as possible to report the situation to the leader, Yu Run specially brought a fey carriage. The fey carriage was driven by three bat-shaped lifeforms with their spirit fire alight.","Lin Yuan silently thought that while the Sky Beyond the Clouds didn’t pursue any technological developments, to a certain extent, it had maximized their lifeforms’ potential to their peak.","Lin Yuan used Morbius’ True Data to investigate these bat lifeforms. They were called Gigantic Swift Bats, and all their abilities and exclusive skills were basically designed to enhance speed, making the most of what they had.","Judging from Yu Run’s pained expression, Lin Yuan was certain that the fey carriages used by these bats were extremely expensive!","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, every fey that displayed unique characteristics could obtain a high-quality survival opportunity.","“The items sold in Fortune Treasure Palace are fixed and non-","negotiable. In this case, do you still require my presence?”","Kani furrowed her brow and exclaimed, “Before Master permits you to leave, you just have to follow obediently! Why are you spouting so much nonsense!? If you’re in such a hurry to meet your leader, you can have him meet you here instead!”","Kani realized that Yu Run had expressed his intention to return to the chamber of commerce more than once. Even if Lin Yuan did not mind, Spring and Winter were probably already dissatisfied with Yu Run.","Kani believed that she hadn’t been very helpful to Lin Yuan while being by his side. Therefore, she felt compelled to perform well in front of him.","Yu Run instinctively recoiled at Kani’s words. Just as he was about to offer an explanation, Kani continued. “Master still intends to book a room for you in Fortune Treasure Palace. If you don’t accompany him, how will you know where your room is? Don’t tell me you’re going to ask Master later?”","Yu Run also realized that he had indeed spoken too much. Just because Lin Yuan had not displayed any aggressive behavior, Yu Run had subtly neglected the fact that Lin Yuan was more capable of determining the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ life and death than the Bloodwood Lion Bees. After realizing that, Yu Run began to serve Lin Yuan more seriously.","Along the way, Yu Run sensed that Lin Yuan was very interested in Treasure City. It seemed that he had never been there before. Yu Run took the opportunity to tell Lin Yuan about the situation in Treasure City.","Spring and Winter glanced at Kani again and found her much more agreeable. Lin Yuan possessed an easy-going personality, and many times, his subordinates had to help him address this dynamic with the external world.","...","The Gigantic Swift Bats were indeed worthy of their exorbitant prices. In less than an hour, they arrived at the entrance of Fortune Treasure Palace and were stopped by the guards.","In Fortune Treasure Palace, there were fey carriages that specialized in receiving guests. The speed of these fey carriages exceeded those of the fey carriages driven by the Gigantic Swift Bats.","Fortune Treasure Palace occupied a vast area of land. All the buildings within Fortune Treasure Palace were remarkably dreamy, with every single independent building serving as accommodations for those large factions.","Lin Yuan intended to bring Hu Quan around the Sky Beyond the Clouds in the future. He should be able to obtain a lot of inspiration from these fantastical buildings.","Fortune Treasure Palace’s guards were exceptionally thorough in their treatment of guests. Two guards walked forward, and one of them welcomed Lin Yuan and his companions.","The other guard asked in a clear and pleasant voice, “Would you like me to lead the way to the lounge area or the exhibition hall?","Under normal circumstances, guests visiting Fortune Treasure Palace were directly escorted to the exhibition hall. To qualify for Fortune Treasure Palace’s services, they must purchase at least three items from the exhibition hall.","However, Fortune Treasure Palace did not do so. Considering that the guests had traveled a long way, they were allowed to rest first.","Most guests would head to the lounge area first to enjoy the Fortune Treasure Palace’s services. All services and meals in the lounge area were free, but only if they proceeded to the exhibition hall later to complete the transaction. Otherwise, they would have to pay for the expenses in the lounge area.","It was worth noting that the expenses in the lounge area were astonishing. Previously, many factions had enjoyed their services in advance but failed to complete three transactions successfully in the exhibition hall, resulting in significant consequences.","Lin Yuan was not tired at all. There was no need for him to rest.","Lin Yuan said directly, “Please take us straight to the exhibition hall. I intend to purchase a total of six items and reserve two rooms.”","The two attendants smiled when they heard that. It was because the attendants in Fortune Treasure Palace earned commissions from the guests.","The Fortune Treasure Palace’s rooms were not cheap. There were very few wealthy guests like Lin Yuan who could afford to reserve two rooms at once. Hence, the two attendants served Lin Yuan and his companions with even more enthusiasm.","“Esteemed guests, if you’re interested in reserving two rooms, you can secure the available rooms ahead of time. Would you be interested in doing so? This way, you can ensure that the room of your choice won’t be taken by someone else.”","Lin Yuan turned and told Kani, “Go ahead and pick two adjacent rooms. I’ll be done choosing the items soon.","Lin Yuan looked up and told the attendant, “I’ve heard that the items in the exhibition hall need to be exchanged with chip-","level resources at the Treasure Convention. I wonder how many chips can be exchanged for this crystal.”","Another attendant had already brought Kani to select rooms.","When the other two attendants saw Lin Yuan take out the spirit qi crystal, they knew he had the means to book two rooms. The spirit qi content in that spirit qi crystal was extremely large and abnormally pure. Just a single crystal filled with spirit qi could be traded for resources in the exhibition hall.","“Hello, esteemed guest. I cannot confirm the number of chips this crystal of yours can be exchanged for at the Treasure Convention as the ratio of chips has yet to be confirmed. However, it should be able to exchange for more than 1,500 chips here! The specific amount will be decided by the manager in the exhibition hall.”","In less than five minutes, the Fortune Treasure Palace’s special fey carriage brought Lin Yuan to the main hall. The entire Fortune Treasure Palace was filled with items for sale.","The attendant brought Lin Yuan and his companions to the entrance of the exhibition hall, and a new attendant received Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan observed through Morbius and realized that these attendants were not from the same species. This meant that Fortune Treasure Palace was not like those chambers of commerce, which were made up of a single species.","The female attendant smiled and told Lin Yuan and his companions, “Hello, esteemed guests. I believe the attendant who received you just now has briefed you on the transaction rules. I wonder if you are regulars of our Fortune Treasure Palace, with chips already stored here, or would you like me to assist you in exchanging chips?”","Lin Yuan did not immediately respond. Instead, he asked, “I’ve heard that as a special honor guest, one can live here for free and only needs to pay a 3% markup price to find items through Fortune Treasure Palace. If that’s true, I would like to know how I can become a special honor guest of Fortune Treasure Palace.”","Lin Yuan had heard the attendant mention special honor guests and was very interested in becoming one.","Becoming a special honor guest was equivalent to obtaining the Fortune Treasure Palace’s resources. Lin Yuan needed this channel.","If not for the female attendant exchanging glances with the male attendant and confirming that Lin Yuan had resources that could be exchanged for chips, she might have wondered if the youthful lifeform in front of her was crazy.","How could it be so easy to become a special honor guest of Fortune Treasure Palace?"]},{"number":2856,"title":"Chapter 2856 Probing Into the Crimson Heaven Falcons!","paragraphs":["2856 Probing Into the Crimson Heaven Falcons!","There were three ways to become a special honor guest of Fortune Treasure Palace. The first method was to verify one’s Holy Spirit level. Fortune Treasure Palace was very willing to establish connections with Holy Spirit experts.","Fortune Treasure Palace itself used resources to worship Holy Spirit experts. The latter did not need to do anything for Fortune Treasure Palace when they received the offerings.","However, when Fortune Treasure Palace needed help or had a mission, they would take out additional resources to hire these Holy Spirit experts, who would have no way of rejecting Fortune Treasure Palace’s request.","Of course, those Holy Spirit experts could also choose to decline the Fortune Treasure Palace’s offerings. As long as they proved their strength, they could obtain the special honor guest card of Fortune Treasure Palace.","The second method to become a special honor guest was to purchase items costing more than 30,000,000 chips, thereby gaining access to Fortune Treasure Palace’s services for resource acquisition.","Being able to spend 30,000,000 chips in Fortune Treasure Palace was sufficient proof of the special honor guest’s wealth.","It’s worth noting that, according to the attendant, Lin Yuan’s spirit qi crystal could only be exchanged for a few thousand chips.","The third method involved making a huge contribution to Fortune Treasure Palace. Those who obtained the special honor guest title through that method were usually internal members of Fortune Treasure Palace. External members had no chance at all, even if they made contributions.","Although the female attendant harbored doubts about Lin Yuan’s ability to become a special honor guest despite possessing resources like spirit qi crystals, she still explained the process to Lin Yuan very seriously in accordance with the principle of service.","Lin Yuan raised his eyebrows. It turned out that it was so easy to become a special honor guest!","Although Lin Yuan’s resources could be easily obtained through the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he did not want to waste the available resources.","30,000,000 chips were equivalent to nearly 20,000 spirit qi crystals. According to Fortune Treasure Palace’s pricing rules, Lin Yuan would have to spend nearly 4,000 spirit qi crystals to become a special honor guest of Fortune Treasure Palace.","“If I become a special honor guest and stay in Fortune Treasure Palace, I don’t have to buy items here anymore, right?”","The female attendant looked surprised. Why did that young man before her make it sound like he was really going to become a special honor guest?","“That’s right. If you become a special honor guest of our Fortune Treasure Palace, not only do you not need to purchase three items here, but all the items sold within Fortune Treasure Palace will also be available to you at the new VIP prices.”","Winter understood what Lin Yuan meant and asked the attendant, “Do you use the leaves of the Holy Presence Bodhi to verify if one possesses Holy Spirit strength?”","Upon hearing that, the female attendant’s expression immediately became serious. Could there be a Holy Spirit expert among that group?! Without one, it would be meaningless to inquire about the method to verify the Holy Spirit level.","“I wonder if any of you are interested in becoming special honor guests? Currently, we no longer use the leaves of the Holy Presence Bodhi to verify the Holy Spirit level, as using them may reveal the appearance of the holy spirit, which is deemed disrespectful to Holy Spirit experts.","“Our Fortune Treasure Palace extends full sincerity to every Holy Spirit expert, so we now use the seed of the Holy Presence Bodhi for testing instead. This ensures that not only will the appearance of the holy spirit remain undisclosed, but also the divine kingdom abilities won’t be detected by the outside world.”","Winter asked Lin Yuan softly, “Young Master, do you need me to obtain a special honor guest card for you?”","Lin Yuan nodded at Winter.","The female attendant hurriedly said, “If you want to verify your strength and obtain a special honor guest card, I’ll call the person in charge of our Fortune Treasure Palace over now. Please follow me to the VIP room on the second floor for a moment. All kinds of dishes have been prepared in the VIP room. You can try whatever you want!”","This was the first time this female attendant had received a lifeform who had reached the Holy Spirit level. She was exceptionally excited. Today’s encounter would undoubtedly become a memorable conversation topic in her future career.","“Alright. Remember to get your person in charge here as soon as possible. After I become the special honor guest, it’s very likely that I’ll make a huge deal with Fortune Treasure Palace.”","Upon hearing that, the female attendant walked faster. She brought Lin Yuan and his companions to the VIP room and immediately went to look for the person in charge.","When Lin Yuan’s group reached the second floor, the other people in the exhibition hall subconsciously looked at them. These people were fully aware that those who had the capability to step onto the second floor were all extraordinary figures and are worth establishing connections with.","Lin Yuan sat in the VIP room and sipped on the rose-red juice in his cup. The fruit juice was very thick, sweet, and sour, with a rich fragrance, unlike any other fruit juice that Lin Yuan had ever drunk before. Not only was it delicious, but it also seemed to contain abundant energy and had a certain refreshing effect that helped the drinker focus.","The dishes served were also abnormally unique. Some of the spiritual ingredients used had already reached the World Emperor grade. Judging from the dishes, it was evident how much Fortune Treasure Palace valued potential special honor guests.","Spring had used her aura to create a barrier that enveloped Lin Yuan, preventing outsiders from detecting his aura.","Spring said softly, “This Fortune Treasure Palace has some traces of the Divine Lifeform Pavilion. I wonder whether it has obtained the Divine Lifeform Pavilion’s inheritance or it imitating its business model.","“If the Divine Lifeform Pavilion hadn’t offended the dominant factions of the two universes at the same time and secretly attacked the faeries many times and angered the six faerie kings of Faerie Institution, it wouldn’t have been reduced to ashes at its peak.”","Lin Yuan revealed an interested expression. This was the first time he had heard of the Divine Lifeform Pavilion’s legend.","Seeing that Lin Yuan was interested, Spring continued. “The Divine Lifeform Pavilion operated similarly to Fortune Treasure Palace. They used resources to rope in a large number of experts, which is a much more convenient and economical method than nurturing them.","“However, when encountering a calamity that can shake the foundation of the Divine Lifeform Pavilion, these experts lack loyalty and may easily betray the pavilion. If those experts who were roped in by Divine Lifeform Pavilion back then were willing to protect it, then it wouldn’t have been left without any foundation.”","Winter pondered for a moment before saying, “I have a suspicion that, even without the Divine Lifeform Pavilion’s inheritance, the Fortune Treasure Palace harbors ambitions.","“The Holy Presence Bodhi’s seeds can only germinate upon sensing the aura of the holy spirit. Instead of viewing Fortune Treasure Palace’s choice to use the seeds over leaves as solely for the sake of the special honor guests, it’s more accurate to say that they aim to cultivate the Holy Presence Bodhi!","“The Holy Presence Bodhi is one of the few treasures that can strengthen the holy spirit in the divine kingdom. Fortune Treasure Palace invests most of its resources in cultivating its own members. If I’m not wrong, Fortune Treasure Palace will surely love to trade the high-end resources in Young Master’s hands!”","...","While Lin Yuan and his companions were waiting in the VIP room, the King Blood Jackals’ territories were in turmoil.","Before the Thoughts Letter Paper reached its maximum distance limit, Lin Yuan had had a conversation with Liu Jie, Wen Yu, the Moon Empress, Listen, and the other core members of Sky City.","For the first time in its history, Sky City was without Lin Yuan’s control. Wen Yu and Liu Jie had always relied on Lin Yuan to make decisions and were not accustomed to his absence.","Regardless of how strong Autumn and Summer were, it was inevitable that there would be stronger lifeforms above them in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. They were afraid that Lin Yuan would encounter trouble that was difficult to resolve. After all, Liu Jie and Wen Yu had never truly understood Autumn and Summer’s strength.","When the Moon Empress realized that Liu Jie and Wen Yu had been consistently relying on Lin Yuan as their backbone and that their effectiveness had diminished in his absence, the Moon Empress stepped up and began to manage Sky City on Lin Yuan’s behalf.","The Moon Empress had previously said that she would help Lin Yuan guard Sky City, so she would definitely not let anything happen to it.","One village after another had already migrated to the vicinity of the King Blood Jackals’ territory. What the Moon Empress needed to do next was to build the embryonic form of the faith country according to Lin Yuan’s wishes.","This was a huge project, but it was hardly a problem for the Moon Empress. However, the current problem did not stem from within the territory of the King Blood Jackals.","The Spinning Wings White Falcons had sent a team of envoys to King Blood Jackals’ territory.","All along, the King Blood Jackals and the Spinning Wings White Falcons had been living in harmony. The reason for such a situation was most likely that the Spinning Wings White Falcons knew that Kani had reached the Holy Spirit level.","Since Kani had already departed with Lin Yuan, there was no chance for the Spinning Wings White Falcon envoys to encounter her. Without encountering Kani, their objective would not be fulfilled, and they wouldn’t be able to report back.","The attitude of the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ envoys seemed gentle, but they were abnormally domineering. This was because the Spinning Wings White Falcons had always been stronger than the King Blood Jackals as they had already had a Holy Spirit expert since seven years ago.","However, after the First Elder of the Spinning Wings White Falcons stepped into the Holy Spirit level, he had never been able to break through from World Emperor to the Domain Mountain.","The Holy Spirit level and Domain Mountain class were two different hurdles for a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom expert. The former was more related to faith power, while the latter was more related to bloodline.","In the eyes of the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ envoys, even if the King Blood Jackal Queen was fortunate enough to break through to the Holy Spirit level, it was impossible for her to reach Domain Mountain class. There were no resources for Kani’s bloodline to evolve in this wasteland.","Secondly, the Spinning Wings White Falcons had the Crimson Heaven Falcons backing them, while the King Blood Jackals had no one to rely on.","The Spinning Wings White Falcons showed disdain for the King Blood Jackals.","In the early years, the Spinning Wings White Falcons had the idea of competing with the King Blood Jackals for this wasteland. However, the Crimson Heaven Falcon envoys overruled them.","This time, the Spinning Wings White Falcons sent envoys to the King Blood Jackals because the Crimson Heaven Falcon envoys had the intention of roping in the King Blood Jackals.","A species without a Holy Spirit expert and a species with a Holy Spirit expert had completely different values and significance.","In the past, the King Blood Jackals were merely neighbors to the Spinning Wings White Falcons, who had taken a portion of the resources yet did not pose any significant threat. However, they had now threatened the interests of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, making them feel a sense of danger.","The Spinning Wings White Falcon envoys not only intended to convey the intentions of the Crimson Heaven Falcon envoys to rope in the King Blood Jackals but also had the idea of probing the true intentions of the King Blood Jackals.","In the end, when they arrived at the King Blood Jackals’ territory, only two female King Blood Jackals were sent to entertain them.","It was rumored that the King Blood Jackal Queen had been in seclusion all this time. However, she had already reached the Holy Spirit level, so what was the reason for her seclusion? Could it be that she was planning to evolve to Domain Mountain in one go?","The Spinning Wings White Falcon envoys felt that they were being treated coldly and kept putting pressure on the two female King Blood Jackals who received them.","The two female King Blood Jackals contacted Wen Yu more than once to report the situation.","The envoys led a team of more than 1,000 people. When they arrived at the King Blood Jackals’ territory, they began to investigate the situation.","The two female King Blood Jackals couldn’t stop them. However, they knew that everything in the territory was constantly changing.","If the envoys were to wantonly investigate the situation in the territory, many aspects of the territory would fall under the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ control.","If Lin Yuan had been around, Wen Yu would have only needed to report the information to him and let him make the decision. However, now that Lin Yuan had left, there was no way to communicate with him.","This situation was reported to the Moon Empress. She had always been an extremely decisive person and never beat around the bush.","The Spinning Wings White Falcon envoys, unable to meet Kani, had already expressed their intentions to the two female King Blood Jackals who received them.","The Moon Empress knew very well that the one who was truly interested in the King Blood Jackals was not the Spinning Wings White Falcons but rather the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","The Moon Empress decided to ask Summer and Autumn solemnly, “If there’s no choice and conflicts arise with the Crimson Heaven Falcons in the future, can the two of you ensure the safety of our territory?”","Autumn had always been impulsive but refrained from hastily answering the Moon Empress’ question. The Moon Empress was Lin Yuan’s Master, and he respected her profoundly.","In Autumn’s heart, the Moon Empress held an extremely important position and was second only to Lin Yuan in the entire Sky City.","“Moon Empress, I have never investigated the situation of the Crimson Heaven Falcons. Please give me two days to look into it! After I investigate the situation with the Crimson Heaven Falcons, I will immediately give you a response!”"]},{"number":2857,"title":"Chapter 2857 The Fortune Treasure Palace’s Benefits!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2857 The Fortune Treasure Palace’s Benefits!","The Moon Empress was filled with an adventurous spirit. Otherwise, she wouldn’t have directly attempted to activate her birth horoscope with her limited lifespan. However, while the Moon Empress may have taken too many risks in improving her strength, she had always been cautious in managing a faction.","For example, when the Moon Empress was in charge of the Radiance Federation and the entire main world, she had basically considered all potential unforeseen events and positioned them accordingly.","Now that Lin Yuan was not around, the Moon Empress was much more serious about helping Lin Yuan organize and manage Sky City.","The Moon Empress was fully aware that Summer and Autumn were extremely powerful, but she did not like to take overly risky actions before she had a clear grasp of the situation.","Autumn’s words made the Moon Empress feel relieved.","The Moon Empress did not necessarily need Autumn to be stronger than the Crimson Heaven Falcons. There were plans in place if Autumn happened to be stronger, and countermeasures if he turned out to be weaker.","Certainly, it would be better if Autumn were stronger than the Crimson Heaven Falcons. This would save the Moon Empress a lot of trouble and prevent any losses to Lin Yuan’s territory.","Before Autumn returned from investigating the situation with the Crimson Heaven Falcons, the Moon Empress would withhold any response to the Spinning Wings White Falcon envoys waiting in the territory. She would let the two female King Blood Jackals, whom Kani had placed in an important position, continue entertaining them.","The Spinning Wings White Falcons did not know that the King Blood Jackals were already under Sky City’s control. With Kani and the entire King Blood Jackals under Lin Yuan’s control, no one would leak the news to the Crimson Heaven Falcon envoys.","The Crimson Heaven Falcon envoys’ core request was to see Kani. However, Kani had departed alongside Lin Yuan, so the Spinning Wings White Falcon envoys would definitely not be able to encounter them. Eventually, it was just a matter of time before the envoys resorted to threatening.","By that time, if they did not receive a favorable response from her, the envoys would probably immediately report the situation after returning. If this information reached the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ ears, they would take charge of the situation as the Spinning Wings White Falcons only played a tool-like support role.","If the Moon Empress’s stance remained firm, the Crimson Heaven Falcons would most likely dispatch experts to intimidate them. The Moon Empress’ goal was not to prevent conflict from occurring but to prolong it as much as possible. Ideally, she hoped that conflict wouldn’t erupt until Lin Yuan returned. However, if it erupted, then she would just have to deal with it actively.","The Moon Empress had only been in the Sky Beyond the Clouds for a short period, yet she had thoroughly understood the situation and temperament of the native lifeforms. Conquests and massacres were common occurrences there, and to win in conquests, being powerful was important.","The Moon Empress felt an inexplicable pressure that had been lingering in her heart for a long time. She knew very well where the pressure was coming from.","Her sense of pressure stemmed from her weakness and inability to resolve anything in the Sky Beyond the Clouds with her strength. Despite this internal pressure, the Moon Empress remained a pragmatic individual.","Since she could not solve the problem with her strength, she began to work hard on her management and Creation Master abilities.","The Moon Empress had once again experienced a breakthrough in her Creation Master class. However, she did not tell anyone about it. First of all, there was no one to share this information with, as everyone was her junior. Additionally, the Moon Empress was aware that her Creation Master abilities held little significance in Sky City.","Perhaps it was the Moon Empress’ misconception, but she felt as if she had suddenly been enlightened after arriving at the Sky Beyond the Clouds. On the path of evolving as a Creation Master, she seemed to have lost the threshold.","The Moon Empress looked at the silent night in front of her and could feel faith power constantly gathering in her body. This faith power came from the faith country that Lin Yuan had advocated for. Now, the core members of Sky City, including some white-clothed followers, would be able to receive nourishment from the faith country.","Initially, even the Moon Empress could not understand why Lin Yuan had insisted on building a faith country. Now, everyone in Sky City understood Lin Yuan’s intentions and the importance of the faith country.","The faith country built in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was the cornerstone of the faith power needed for all members of Sky City to evolve to the next grade. Therefore, no matter what kind of enemy they faced, the faith country could not suffer any losses.","After careful consideration, the Moon Empress held the first meeting with Sky City’s core members after Lin Yuan left. During the meeting, the Moon Empress did not withhold information about the Spinning Wings White Falcons and the Crimson Heaven Falcons targeting the King Blood Jackals, as it was the biggest challenge Sky City would face after arriving at the Sky Beyond the Clouds. It was necessary for the core members to know about it.","...","While Sky City’s core members were convening, Lin Yuan had already met the person in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace. He was an old man who looked very affable. His face was full of smiles, radiating an exceptionally warm and welcoming aura.","At present, Yu Run was choosing a room with Kani and was not with Lin Yuan. If he were present, he would still shiver uncontrollably even if the person in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace appeared benevolent.","There were foreign factions in Fortune Treasure Palace that could not afford resources every day. Fortune Treasure Palace treated these foreign factions as troublemakers.","In order to maintain its authority, Fortune Treasure Palace was extremely heavy-handed against troublemakers. Those troublemakers were personally dealt with by the person in charge, who was like a Grim Reaper in Treasure City.","However, the person in charge had two completely different faces when facing troublemakers and people like Lin Yuan, who might potentially become special honor guests.","“Dear guests, may I know how I should address you? My name is Zhan Lu. I haven’t been a director in Treasure City’s Fortune Treasure Palace branch for long. Fortune Treasure Palace’s branches are established in every large city on every continent. Prior to this, I oversaw the branch in Yunfeng City on the Hanyun Continent.”","Zhan Lu introduced himself as soon as he arrived and talked about his past. It was obvious that he wanted to get closer to Lin Yuan and his companions.","Immediately after that, Zhan Lu proceeded to explain the Fortune Treasure Palace’s foundation to Lin Yuan. It was a display of strength, informing Lin Yuan and his companions about the advantages of becoming special honor guests.","In the main world, Lin Yuan had never nonchalantly, casually, or indifferently disclosed his name because doing so would allow others to uncover his background.","Lin Yuan had always been concerned about Chu Ci in the main world. However, ever since she became Cold Moon’s disciple, Lin Yuan no longer had to worry about her safety or had any need to conceal his identity in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","However, with Spring and Winter by his side, Lin Yuan didn’t have to respond to Zhan Lu personally.","Spring took a step forward and said coldly, “Zhan Lu, right? I’m Rising Spring, and he’s Rising Winter, and this is our Young Master, Lin Yuan.”","The names of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter came from their personalities as well as their physiques. However, using a single-character name while traveling outside did seem a bit odd.","As Lin Yuan’s followers, it was impossible for them to share the same surname as him. Therefore, Lin Yuan had deliberately chosen appropriate surnames for them.","Such a situation was not uncommon in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, but such rules were only used by powerful species and factions with long histories.","Before coming, Zhan Lu had communicated with the female attendant who had received Lin Yuan in detail and learned that an elderly person was preparing to verify his strength and obtain the identity of a special honor guest. However, it turned out that the elderly man was merely the servant of the young man before him.","Even though Zhan Lu had witnessed many things, he could not help but be surprised. What kind of status did the young man before him have to have a Holy Spirit expert as his personal servant when he went out?","From the way the elderly man looked at the young man, it was evident that the elderly man’s respect for him came from the bottom of his heart.","Zhan Lu hurriedly greeted Lin Yuan seriously and asked with a smile, “I wonder if the food here is delicious? Our food caters to the taste of the masses. If you have any specific ingredients that you’re more interested in, I can immediately get someone to cook and serve them to you!”","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow. He was quite receptive to the Fortune Treasure Palace’s approach of fostering friendships through food. However, he did not know if this was their style or if it applied to all the factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","“There’s no need for that. I would like to obtain the special honor guest status as soon as possible. Then, I’ll use my special honor guest status to negotiate a huge deal with your Fortune Treasure Palace. I’ve heard that special honor guests receive substantial discounts when trading resources. I’m curious about the extent of this discount.”","Lin Yuan had no prior connection with Zhan Lu, so he didn’t see the need to engage in conversation with him. After completing the transaction with Fortune Treasure Palace, Lin Yuan had other things to attend to.","Zhan Lu had not expected Lin Yuan to go straight to the point and express his intention to verify his identity as a special honor guest and trade with them. Zhan Lu had always liked such straightforward people.","However, there were only a few people who were as straightforward as Lin Yuan.","The last person who had wanted to have their identity verified by Zhan Lu had not been as forthright. They had made Zhan Lu serve them for a full five days before undergoing the identity verification. Fortunately, their identity was eventually verified. Otherwise, Zhan Lu might have resorted to drastic measures.","“Young Master Lin, our Fortune Treasure Palace needs to spend money to obtain resources. The items in this booth are sold at a markup of 20% above market price. However, if a special honor guest makes a deal with our Fortune Treasure Palace, we will only increase the price by 1% according to the cost price. This is the sincerity we offer to our special honor guests.”","Zhan Lu was very sincere when he said that. Since the Fortune Treasure Palace wanted to rope in Holy Spirit experts, they would naturally be very generous to these Holy Spirit experts.","Fortune Treasure Palace certainly aimed to make a profit in its business dealings. Channel resources were considered the most expensive among all the resources. Furthermore, it would cost a lot to obtain these resources and present them to the traders. Fortune Treasure Palace only earned 1% of the cost price, which was already the greatest sincerity.","Despite that, Fortune Treasure Palace still hoped that special honor guests would engage in large transactions. Even if the profit margin was lower, they would still make a profit.","In addition, if Fortune Treasure Palace wanted to improve its control over resources, it needed to constantly maintain the end channels. The best way to maintain the end channels was to have sufficient funds to speed up the operation of the trading chain and be in a state of demand for goods when the end channels were supplying it.","If Fortune Treasure Palace did not have enough funds to maintain these end channels, it wouldn’t be able to acquire resources from them when they became available. After a few times, it would cause a large loss of channels at the end.","Lin Yuan thought highly of Fortune Treasure Palace. If they only earned 1% of the cost price for special honor guests, Lin Yuan could trade more with them and treat them as an important channel for him to obtain resources!","Zhan Lu added at the right time, “Nevertheless, it’s important to note that special honor guests trading resources at Fortune Treasure Palace must use resources at the chips’ level, not Honor Absent dollars. It’s important that I explain the situation clearly in advance to avoid unnecessary misunderstandings in the future. I hope you can understand!”","Lin Yuan did not comment on Zhan Lu’s words.","The items exchanged by Holy Spirit special honor guests through Fortune Treasure Palace were undoubtedly very precious. Such high-level resources could not be traded equivalently with Honor Absent dollars. In the market, Honor Absent dollars couldn’t purchase materials of that caliber. Therefore, Fortune Treasure Palace still incurred some minor losses when exchanging chip-level materials for certain resources.","Winter took a step forward and said, “You can give me the Holy Presence Bodhi seed at any time to verify my strength. However, there should be more benefits to becoming a special honor guest, right? What do special honor guests like us need to do to enjoy the benefits?”","Winter’s question hit the nail on the head. Zhan Lu had wanted to explain to Winter the duties and rights of becoming a special honor guest.","Zhan Lu explained very seriously, “Apart from being able to trade resources at a discounted price in Fortune Treasure Palace, becoming a special honor guest also enables you to issue rewards through Fortune Treasure Palace missions.","“If any other special honor guest is interested in accepting the posted rewards, they will have to complete the mission within the specified time.","“Fortune Treasure Palace’s existence also provides a platform for the special honor guests to interact with each other.","“As for what the special honor guests should do for Fortune Treasure Palace, if we have any requests in the future, we hope that the special honor guests can do their best to help.","“At that time, we will take out sufficient resources to provide security for the special honor guests. We won’t let the special honor guests help for nothing!”","Upon hearing that, a half-smile appeared on Winter’s face. If Fortune Treasure Palace had such an intention, then the more one looked at it, the more it resembled the Divine Lifeform Pavilion from before.","Fortune Treasure Palace had roped in so many special honor guests who had reached the Holy Spirit level, indicating that they must have a big goal. However, there was no guarantee without restrictions.","Winter had always admired Lin Yuan’s actions.","If Lin Yuan had not used his divine kingdom to control Kani, Winter would have definitely not been at ease letting Kani follow Lin Yuan.","As Zhan Lu spoke, he handed the Holy Presence Bodhi seed he had prepared long ago to Winter. As soon as Winter’s hand touched the seed of the Holy Presence Bodhi, the brown seed lit up with a mixed light!"]},{"number":2858,"title":"Chapter 2858 Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2858 Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower!","Gold and green light swirled around this seed, eventually morphing into a partially tangible imprint on the surface of the seed.","Zhan Lu smiled when he saw that.","With such a change to the Holy Presence Bodhi seed, it meant that Winter was truly a Holy Spirit expert.","However, Winter had enabled the Holy Presence Bodhi to germinate almost too quickly! This speed went beyond Zhan Lu’s comprehension.","After thinking about this, Zhan Lu attributed this to the Holy Presence Bodhi being special or more sensitive to Holy Spirit experts.","Zhan Lu did not link the cause to Winter. After all, if it was because of Winter, it would mean that the holy spirit in his divine kingdom was terrifyingly powerful!","With such power, it was also slightly embarrassing for Fortune Treasure Palace to bestow him with the title of a special honor guest.","Winter toyed with the germinated Holy Presence Bodhi in his hand before tossing it to Zhan Lu.","After examining the germinated Holy Presence Bodhi, Zhan Lu took out a special plant-type fey and handed it to Lin Yuan.","“Young Master Lin, this is a special identification pass that Fortune Treasure Palace gives to our special honor guests. It’s called the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. It’s a specialty fey of Fortune Treasure Palace. Not only can it keep records, but it can also be used to communicate with Fortune Treasure Palace. It will display the rewards for tasks, and tasks can also be assigned directly through it.”","The plant that Zhan Lu had handed to Lin Yuan resembled an illusion. The crystal was light green at the bottom, and the top gleamed with purple light. It was covered with a bush of roots. The crystal would occasionally move its roots, indicating that this horseshoe-shaped fleshy plant was brimming with vitality.","Lin Yuan was very interested in the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. The main reason for this was that it could be used as a transmission fey. Although its functions could not match up to that of the Thoughts Letter Paper, it did have the advantage of being able to facilitate communication over long distances.","Zhan Lu mentioned that this was a specialty fey of Fortune Treasure Palace. If this was something that Fortune Treasure Palace only gave their special honor guests, they definitely would not include it in their list of tradable resources.","Lin Yuan received the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower and used True Data to check on it.","This was when he saw that it was only Sovereign/Immortal!","Currently, it was easy for Lin Yuan to use his resources to nurture a Sovereign/Immortal fey. Lin Yuan felt that nurturing the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower would allow him to solve his problem of communicating with Sky City.","Moreover, the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower’s grade could definitely be evolved. This meant that its functions would definitely be able to grow and even become more outstanding.","In order to solve the issue of communicating with Sky City, Lin Yuan only needed to nurture two of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers. Sky City’s other members could communicate using the Thoughts Letter Paper and did not require the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.","“Mr. Zhan, this Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower should be a child ramet, right? I can sense that it is unidirectionally linked to another Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower but isn’t linked to any other Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers.”","Zhan Lu turned to Lin Yuan and replied, “Young Master Lin, you’re right. This is just a child ramet of the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. It is only linked to the ortet. If you’re interested, I can give you a few young Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers. They haven’t been linked to the ortet and can be nurtured into ortets themselves.”","Fortune Treasure Palace was using the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower to contact their special honor guests for their own sakes. They would not allow the special honor guests to contact each other as it would likely cause Fortune Treasure Palace to become excluded from the transactions.","Fortune Treasure Palace would never do something like this that would harm themselves!","When the special honor guests saw the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, many of them became interested in it, just like Lin Yuan was. Some of them were extremely unreasonable and would even ask them to give them the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower as well as tell them how it was nurtured.","In order to avoid issues, Fortune Treasure Palace permitted the young plants to be given as gifts.","Young Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers could indeed be nurtured into ortets. However, it came at an enormous cost and required special nurturing techniques. Fortune Treasure Palace would never reveal such special techniques.","Every powerful faction had Creators who could evolve lifeforms as well as manipulate pure spirit qi and various types of energy. Each Creator had their own unique methods.","Fortune Treasure Palace’s Creators only stumbled upon the method of nurturing the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower by accident.","Fortune Treasure Palace was unafraid of other factions’ Creators studying the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. They were sound in their confidence and were thus willing to give the young Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers to their special honor guests.","Lin Yuan replied with a smile, “Thank you! But might I ask how many chips it will cost for me to trade for a Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortet?”","Lin Yuan’s words stunned Zhan Lu. This was the first time he had received such a request.","Technically, the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower was also a type of resource, and it was possible to trade for it using chips!","However, Fortune Treasure Palace’s Creators were unlikely to be willing to nurture another Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. It also took far too long to nurture one!","Creators held high status in any faction they were part of. Even the strongest faction placed their Creators on a pedestal.","The Creators’ will was more important than profits.","Zhan Lu asked hesitantly, “Young Master Lin, are you really going to use chips to trade for a Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ortet? If you are sincere, I will submit a request. I’m sure you’re aware that this trade will involve the revered Creators. Even if the deal is made, the timeline will be determined by the Creators!”","After Lin Yuan used True Data to examine the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, he was able to uncover the method of nurturing the ortet. There was no need for him to trade with Fortune Treasure Palace or bother the Creators that Zhan Lu spoke of.","This was not the first time that Lin Yuan had heard the term ‘Creator’.","Lin Yuan, the Moon Empress, Wen Yu, Zong Ze, Gu Lang, and even the army of Hundred Questions Beasts could be considered Creators.","In truth, Creators were the equivalent of Creation Masters. The only thing that was different was the name of the title.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Creators were more revered than they were in the main world.","This was firstly because of the enormous population in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and the relatively small number of Creators.","Secondly, unlike in the main world, the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ Creators did not appear in public often.","In order to grow, Creators needed to use many resources. They preferred to remain in a stable faction from which they could receive a steady supply of resources.","Hence, the resources produced by the Creators all went to the factions and rarely landed in the hands of outsiders.","As a result, Creators enjoyed high statuses both in the outside world and in their own factions.","Aside from possessing high positions, the Creators would also not be endangered by the fighting between factions.","When two factions were locked in a bitter battle, the Creators could choose to join the victorious faction if their original faction was defeated. Their status and treatment would not differ much.","Moreover, Creators were usually very powerful because they were the ones producing the resources.","There were numerous large factions led by creators.","“You don’t have to submit any requests. I’m just a little interested in the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower. You can just give me the young Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers.","“I heard there are many treasures in Fortune Treasure Palace. I would also like to buy a batch of resources. Why don’t you take me around to browse the resources? Now that I’ve received the title of special honor guest, I should be able to receive the associated discount, right?”","Zhan Lu let out a sigh of relief. It would be best if he did not have to trouble the Creators! He might be in charge of one of the branches, but he still needed to show the appropriate respect to the Creators.","“That won’t be an issue. Fortune Treasure Palace’s rarest resources are displayed on level five and above. I will take you directly to browse level six. If you see anything you like, just let me know! How many chips do you intend to use?”","Zhan Lu remembered Lin Yuan saying that he wanted to strike a large deal with Fortune Treasure Palace. By asking Lin Yuan how many chips he wanted to spend, he would be able to get a sense of the scale of the transaction!","Lin Yuan raised his hand and made the hand sign for ‘1’.","Zhan Lu hurriedly asked, “Young Master Lin, are you going to spend 10,000,000 chips?”","Zhan Lu had assumed that he meant 1,000,000 chips. Lin Yuan had expressed that he wanted to strike a large deal. If he was referring to a deal that was only worth 1,000,000 chips, it would be a disappointment.","10,000,000 chips was not an overly large amount. After all, one needed to spend 30,000,000 chips to be considered Fortune Treasure Palace’s special honor guest.","Lin Yuan shook his head.","Just as Zhan Lu was about to up the amount to 100,000,000 chips, he heard Lin Yuan say softly, “Exchange 1 billion chips for me. If this isn’t enough for the final deal, I can spend more resources to exchange more chips.”","1 billion chips!? To Zhan Lu, this was already a sufficiently large amount.","Only foundational resources could be traded for Fortune Treasure Palace’s chips.","1 billion chips worth of resources was a giant transaction!","Yet, Lin Yuan was going to change 1 billion chips at once and even declared that this might not be the end of it.","Zhan Lu had managed many branches but had never come across a special honor guest as wealthy as Lin Yuan.","Even the most powerful and wealthy special honor guests were also exceptionally cautious when it came to spending their resources.","If his branch received such an enormous batch of resources, he would definitely receive rewards from the headquarters.","“Young Master Lin, I will help you to exchange the chips right now. Is it possible for me to take a look at the resources that you intend to trade for the chips?”","As the trader, Zhan Lu had to verify all the resources that Lin Yuan offered for the trade. If Lin Yuan’s resources were not up to scratch, Zhan Lu would have to supplement the disqualified resources out of his own pocket!","Zhan Lu had made such mistakes in the past and paid the price. As a result, he was now extremely careful when it came to assessing resources.","Lin Yuan took out two large rust-colored wooden chests that gleamed with the soft sheen of jade.","To Zhan Lu’s eyes, these two jade-textured red camphor chests were luxury items.","This was firstly because the pattern of the engravings was very intricate. Secondly, it was due to the jade-textured red camphor.","Red camphor required a much higher concentration of spirit qi to become fully jade-textured.","In order for red camphor to become jade-textured, they needed to absorb spirit qi that only Grade 6 Creators could concoct.","Fortune Treasure Palace only had one Creator who was Grade 6 and above.","These two jade-textured red camphor chests caused Zhan Lu to be even more bedazzled by Lin Yuan.","Zhan Lu intended to report this situation to the headquarters.","However, was there something wrong with the brain of this Grade 6 Creator? Why did they use the pure spirit qi they had painstakingly concocted on something as useless as wood?","“These contain crystals that contain pure spirit qi. The spirit qi in these crystals is constant. You can set a price for each of these crystals and tell me how many chips they’re worth. Then, you can take a quantity that is the equivalent of 1 billion chips.”","Zhan Lu had shown off Fortune Treasure Palace’s might and capabilities to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan now needed to do the same. He needed to flex in front of Fortune Treasure Palace to elevate his position in their eyes.","It had not been easy for him to obtain an excellent source of resources, and he hoped that he would be able to rely on them long-term.","Zhan Lu took a step forward and opened one of the jade-textured red camphor chests.","The chest that he opened was filled with crystals that were each around the size of his eyes. The crystals were white and milky. No aura could be sensed from their surfaces.","But once he used his spiritual energy to penetrate the crystals, his soul was instantly enveloped by the pure spirit qi. His soul now felt incomparable comfort.","The crystals in these two chests were all genuine foundational resources!","The level of spirit qi was that which was concocted by Grade 4 Creators.","If he was going to set a price for such a crystal for an ordinary guest, Zhan Lu would price it at 1,500 chips per crystal. This was an acceptable exchange rate!","However, Zhan Lu and Lin Yuan were not simply going to trade. Zhan Lu also wanted to use the trade to win Lin Yuan’s friendship.","Zhan Lu touched the spirit qi crystals in the chest and fell into deep thought."]},{"number":2859,"title":"Chapter 2859 Lin Yuan’s Sweep!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2859 Lin Yuan’s Sweep!","Zhan Lu knew nothing about Lin Yuan and his group, but now he was certain that Lin Yuan’s faction had an abundance of Creator resources!","This was the only way Lin Yuan could be so calm when spending Creator resources.","It was true that Creator resources could be exchanged for resources, but very few special honor guests would choose to do so.","The pure spirit qi concocted by Creators always existed in different forms.","Zhan Lu did not believe that these crystals filled with spirit qi were all created by one Creator.","If they were made by many Creators, Lin Yuan’s faction had to have a unique method of creating spirit qi.","Zhan Lu felt that Lin Yuan’s willingness to trade these spirit qi crystals for chips was a sign that he wanted to form a positive relationship with Fortune Treasure Palace.","Logically and for his personal sake, Zhan Lu should name a high price for Lin Yuan.","However, Zhan Lu was one of Fortune Treasure Palace’s managers, and the highest price he was authorized to set was 1,650. This was insufficient to show his sincerity in offering Fortune Treasure Palace’s alliance to Lin Yuan.","After thinking for a moment, Zhan Lu said, “I am limited in my authority to set a price. Can you give me some time so I can negotiate with the higher-ups? During this time, I will send someone to bring the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers to you.”","Lin Yuan smiled before grabbing a handful of spirit qi crystals and tossing them to Zhan Lu.","“Thank you, Mr. Zhan! If you are able to give me a good price, I will give you 3,000 spirit qi crystals once the matter is set!”","3,000 spirit qi crystals would be worth at least 500,000 chips.","Zhan Lu was touched by this gesture but also realized how generous Lin Yuan was. This added another layer to his impression of Lin Yuan.","“Since I brought it up, I’ll definitely do my best. You don’t have to worry about that!” Zhan Lu left the room.","It did not take long for the female attendant who had received Lin Yuan’s group to bring him the young Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers.","When the female attendant received Zhan Lu’s instruction to retrieve the young Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers, she knew that one of the members of the group had become a special honor guest.","Now that a special honor guest had appeared in the group she led, she would definitely be awarded a reward.","The female attendant did not dare to stay for long after handing the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers to Lin Yuan.","There were many special honor guests with bad tempers. It would not do her any good if she angered them and caused them to become displeased!","There were a few attendants in the past who had sabotaged themselves in an effort to get on the good side of special honor guests. They either ended up killed by the special honor guests or were eliminated by Fortune Treasure Palace.","Lin Yuan observed the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers for a moment. With the help of True Data, he learned that he needed a large amount of wood-type energy to trigger the flowers and nurture them into ortets.","Subsequently, each time the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers transformed, they needed a large amount of pure spirit qi. When nurturing the young plants, they also needed to consume other young Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers.","However, it was easy to cultivate the young Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers. All he needed to do was split the flower into two before using wood-type energy and spirit qi to heal the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers’ injuries. Two new young plants would grow from the wound point.","Lin Yuan understood why Zhan Lu had said that Fortune Treasure Palace’s Creators were unwilling to nurture the flowers.","All the resources that went into nurturing them would be wasted, and this was far too much for anyone to afford. Furthermore, the flowers’ practical functions did not have a value that matched this cost.","Hence, it was difficult to name a price for special honor guests.","Lin Yuan tossed the three Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers into the Spirit Lock spatial zone and informed Genius to instruct the Hundred Questions Beasts in cultivating them. It would be easy for them to do so.","Once the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers were derived to a certain extent, Lin Yuan would choose the best of them and nurture it into the ortet.","Winter said, “Young Master, Zhan Lu has also reached the Holy Spirit level. It’s likely that he reached Domain Mountain class thousands of years ago and is stable at that level. It will benefit you to get on good terms with Fortune Treasure Palace because you’ll be able to trade for resources with them.","“Don’t you need lifeforms that can produce special elemental energy? You can ask Fortune Treasure Palace to source them for you! They have only displayed a very small portion of their stock. They might not be willing to lay out its precious resources even for their special honor guests. But once you lay out these spirit qi crystals, the trade will be all but settled.”","Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up. It was true that he lacked many resources. He could take Winter’s advice and use Fortune Treasure Palace to source the resources he needed.","...","Zhan Lu did not make Lin Yuan wait too long and soon reappeared in front of Lin Yuan.","Zhan Lu said seriously, “Young Master Lin, after negotiating with the headquarters, I will only be able to offer you a price of 1,720 chips. This means that each of your spirit qi crystals will be worth 1,720 chips! But once you have confirmed 20 deals, you can trade for something worth less than the value of the first 20 items you trade for. You will be able to obtain that item without spending any additional resources. What do you think of this?”","Lin Yuan had expected a price of 1,750 chips and would be satisfied with it.","Although Zhan Lu’s price had not met that expectation, he was reassured by the offer of being able to obtain the 21st item for free after making 20 trades.","If the free item was considered a resource, every spirit qi crystal would now be worth 1,900 chips. This was sufficient to demonstrate Fortune Treasure Palace’s sincerity.","Lin Yuan raised his hand and took out a brocade pouch from his spatial equipment. He tossed the brocade pouch to Zhan Lu.","With a light toss of the brocade pouch to weigh it, Zhan Lu knew that it contained the 3,000 spirit qi crystals Lin Yuan had mentioned.","Giving him the 3,000 spirit qi crystals showed that Lin Yuan was satisfied with the effort he had made.","“If that’s the case, I will send people to retrieve the spirit qi crystals worth 1 billion chips! Do you intend to wait for them here before going to select your resources, or will you leave one of your subordinates behind to handle that while you go with me to pick the resources? I’ll also be able to introduce the resources and their prices to you!”","Lin Yuan did not intend to waste too much time there.","Lin Yuan looked at Spring and said, “Spring, you stay here and watch them. Once they’re done, collect the remaining spirit qi crystals. Winter, you’ll go with me to pick the resources. If you see anything that catches your eye, you can let me know, and I’ll select it for you!”","Lin Yuan said this because he wanted to pick some resources for Winter. Once Spring was done handling the payment, he would ask her to pick the resources she wanted as well.","Additionally, he needed Winter to give him reminders and ensure that he did not miss out on any precious or rare resources.","Lin Yuan was only one person and had limited capabilities. If there were too many items on display, he might not be able to examine all of them, and it would be something to slip through the cracks!","As Lin Yuan followed Zhan Lu to the sixth floor, he noticed that it was decorated much more elegantly than the fifth floor.","Unlike the fifth floor, where the items were all displayed on shelves, each resource on the sixth floor had its own display platform, and the display platforms were positioned in concentric squares.","All Lin Yuan needed to do was walk along the concentric squares, and he would be able to see all the exhibited items.","At the end of the path was the exit to the lower floor.","This was Lin Yuan’s first time trading resources in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, and he had never seen any of them. But all he needed to do was use True Data, and every resource’s effects and functions would become as plain as day to him.","Lin Yuan knew that he was going to trade for an enormous volume of resources and put on the airs of an elite figure. He sauntered through the exhibit and casually pointed at the resources he needed.","He did not give Zhan Lu any time to introduce the items.","Zhan Lu was delighted when he saw Lin Yuan’s strong willingness to make purchases.","Apart from the 3,000 spirit qi crystals that Lin Yuan had just given him, he would also be able to earn a commission from every trade he completed with Lin Yuan.","Since Lin Yuan did not need him to make any introductions, Zhan Lu was happy to enjoy his free time and hang back.","Winter occasionally gave Lin Yuan reminders to help him fill gaps.","Lin Yuan’s shocking manner of sweeping up resources was appalling. But he did not hold back at all.","This was firstly because Zhan Lu was the only one there, and now that he was a special honor guest, he and Zhan Lu were on the same side. Moreover, he could tell that Zhan Lu really wanted to be on good terms with him.","Additionally, holding back did not align with Lin Yuan’s goal of replenishing his store of resources.","By the time Lin Yuan was done looking through the sixth level, he had chosen more than 100 items and spent close to 60,000,000.","The higher up they went, the more expensive the resources would be. Lin Yuan predicted that he would only be buying even more resources. Given this trajectory, his 1 billion chips were far from enough!","In truth, Lin Yuan had an extremely important goal for coming to Fortune Treasure Palace to select resources. He wanted to select new feys for Morbius to spirit lock. After all, Morbius could only evolve by spirit-locking new feey!","However, Lin Yuan was becoming increasingly picky when it came to selecting feys for Morbius to spirit lock. It was difficult for a fey to meet his expectations.","...","By now, Zhan Lu had followed Lin Yuan to the eighth floor. The longer he spent by Lin Yuan’s side, the more shocked he became.","Lin Yuan was not there to buy resources. He was there to sweep up all the stock!","There were a total of 106 items on display on the seventh level, and Lin Yuan had selected 67 of them, spending 700,000,000 chips.","If Lin Yuan continued to be this unrestrained when they got to the eighth level, Lin Yuan would only have to pick a few more items before he used up all his chips.","Zhan Lu now needed to give Lin Yuan a reminder. “Young Master Lin, you have used up almost all your chips. Are you going to stop here, or should I continue browsing around with you?”","Lin Yuan asked, “You said that Fortune Treasure Palace has feys on display, but I haven’t seen many feys in the few levels that you’ve taken me around.”","When Lin Yuan did not respond to his question but asked him a new question instead, Zhan Lu hurriedly asked, “Young Master Lin, Fortune Treasure Palace has more spiritual ingredients than feys. You should be aware that spiritual ingredients are easier to manage than feys.","“We have a high standard for the feys we take in. We usually only take in feys that are Class 10 and above. If you continue browsing with me, you’ll be able to see even more of our treasured feys!”","Lin Yuan nodded. “If that’s the case, I’ll ask Rising Spring to help me spend all the spirit qi crystals in the two chests! The remaining spirit qi crystals should be sufficient to trade for a few billion chips.","“You can continue browsing and shopping with me! People like you who are in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace’s branches should be able to receive some commission when special honor guests like me make purchases, right? So you’ll also be able to benefit significantly when I buy resources from Fortune Treasure Palace.”","Zhan Lu was stunned when he heard what Lin Yuan said. He did not understand Lin Yuan’s meaning.","Could it be that Lin Yuan was displeased because he felt that Zhan Lu had earned too much from him buying so much and spending so many resources?","It was true that he would earn some commission, but most of his earnings came in the form of points that he could use to trade for resources from Fortune Treasure Palace.","Zhan Lu could give the chips he earned to guests like Lin Yuan.","But if Lin Yuan had such intentions, it would be difficult for him to strike up a friendship with Lin Yuan! In the future, it was unlikely that Lin Yuan would share any benefits with him!","While these thoughts were running through Zhan Lu’s head, Lin Yuan added, “I am sweeping up resources because I have just set up my faction and need to accumulate resources to build it up. Most of the resources I’m buying will be going into storage. I’m going to use them now. Mr. Zhan, I’m sure you understand my reason for telling you this.”","When Zhan Lu heard that, he felt a sense of release, and all feelings of conflict disappeared from within him.","It turned out that Lin Yuan was not bothered by the benefits he was going to receive but was hinting that the resources on display in the hall were too sparse. He wanted to trade for as many resources as he could."]},{"number":2860,"title":"Chapter 2860 Desire Moon-Eyed Beast!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2860 Desire Moon-Eyed Beast!","A few factions that had been passed down over several epochs, as well as ancient species, indeed had the tradition of training their young direct descendants. They would send them out to set up their own establishments as a way of building and developing their own factions.","The young members of these ancient factions and species were all the cream of the crop.","This not only trained the young direct descendants but also expanded the ancient species and factions.","Zhan Lu felt that there was a high chance that Lin Yuan was one of these young direct descendants who came from an ancient faction.","While these young direct descendants went out to train and test themselves, they were given numerous resources.","Lin Yuan could only act this liberally if he had the support of an ancient faction.","Previously, Zhan Lu was only trying to build a relationship with Lin Yuan. But now, he felt that he needed to curry favor with him.","If he became acquainted with a young lifeform like Lin Yuan, who not only possessed impressive martial force but also an abundance of resources, he might be able to obtain opportunities or assistance from Lin Yuan in the future.","Fortune Treasure Palace accumulated resources for trading.","Moreover, the resources that Lin Yuan exchanged for the trade were all more valuable than the items he traded for.","None of the rare and precious resources in the Sky Beyond the Clouds that could be found in the wild were more valuable than Creator resources.","“Young Master Lin, I understand your meaning. Aside from the items on display, Fortune Treasure Palace still has many resources in storage. I will take all of them out so you can have a look through them.","“Normally, the rules dictate that these resources are only allowed to be used to replenish the resources on display. But I am willing to give you this chance. I hope that you won’t let others find out about this! Otherwise, I won’t be able to answer to the other special honor guests.”","Lin Yuan did not reciprocate Zhan Lu’s feelings, but he could tell that Zhan Lu was trying to curry favor with him.","He did not believe what Zhan Lu said about the rules.","Rules were set by people. Even if Fortune Treasure Palace truly had such rules, Zhan Lu was only trying to help smoothen the process of the trade and was not harming Fortune Treasure Palace’s profits.","Zhan Lu would probably say the same thing to the other special honor guests who traded such enormous volumes of resources!","“That goes without saying. We might be Fortune Treasure Palace’s special honor guests, but you’re the one who has been helping us the entire time. Our friendship with you is much deeper.","“Even if we don’t trade with Fortune Treasure Palace in the future, we will continue doing business with you! I hope you’ll be willing to continue working with us! It’s fine if you can’t find the resources I need. But if you can find them, please don’t hold back!”","Lin Yuan’s words sounded friendly, but his tone was sharp. He was trying to make his reasons for becoming acquainted with Zhan Lu clear.","Lin Yuan also clearly expressed that he wanted Zhan Lu to do his best to help him search for resources. If Zhan Lu slacked off or was unwilling to put in the effort, Lin Yuan would stop associating with Zhan Lu.","Lin Yuan’s words caused a bright smile to appear on Zhan Lu’s face.","After hearing what Lin Yuan said, Zhan Lu relaxed. Since he would be able to obtain benefits by helping Lin Yuan search for resources, it went without saying that Zhan Lu would put his best foot forward.","“Young Master Lin, you can just send instructions to your subordinates, and I’ll make the arrangements. Then, we can continue picking resources from the higher levels!","“I will tell them to place all the resources from storage on the 15th floor. When we get to the 15th floor, I will filter through the resources. The amount of resources in storage is five times that of what is currently on display.","“If you want to continue trading after looking through the resources in storage, I will have to submit a request to headquarters to ask if the branches from the other islands will be able to bring their resources over for you!”","Lin Yuan shook his head.","“The current store of resources is sufficient for this trade. I don’t have an infinite supply of resources. If not for the conflict within my species, I wouldn’t be this anxious to trade my Creator resources for other resources.”","In truth, Lin Yuan was trying to probe Zhan Lu’s thoughts and slowly curate an impression of himself in Zhan Lu’s mind.","Lin Yuan had prepared this speech in advance. He needed a reasonable explanation when he was out doing business. His speech would frame himself as a direct descendant of an ancient species in Zhan Lu’s mind.","After receiving Zhan Lu’s report, Fortune Treasure Palace would verify his background.","Slowly, news of his background would spread, and many other factions would want to link up with him.","Even the cruel and radical factions would be interested in the faction that was supporting him and think twice about whether they could afford to provoke him.","Although the hidden ancient factions and species were willing to let their young members go out to train, they were still very protective of them and would not stand by and watch as they were bullied.","Just as Zhan Lu was about to leave to make the arrangements, Lin Yuan said in a low voice, “I’ve only just begun my training and don’t know much about anything. I heard that the various chambers of commerce are releasing books, and I have sent someone to collect the books from over 40,000 chambers of commerce in Treasure City.","“I’m sure there are many books in Fortune Treasure Palace as well. Once we’re done trading resources, I hope that you will lend me these books so I can read them. I’m sure you won’t reject such a small request of mine, right?”","Zhan Lu already had the intention of establishing a good relationship with Lin Yuan. He would never turn down such a request from Lin Yuan.","It was true that Fortune Treasure Palace had numerous books. Some of them were published by Fortune Treasure Palace, but the majority had been collected from outside sources. These books were highly valuable, but allowing Lin Yuan to look through them would not harm Fortune Treasure Palace’s profits.","It just so happened that Zhan Lu had the authority to do so.","Rather than using his resources to curry favor with Lin Yuan, Zhan Lu preferred to use Fortune Treasure Palace’s resources.","“Young Master Lin, this is no problem at all! The chambers of commerce’s books can’t compare with Fortune Treasure Palace’s collection in both quantity and quality. However, the Fortune Treasure Palace’s collection of books is all connected, and there are millions of them. It will be difficult for you to finish reading all of them quickly. Do you intend on staying in Fortune Treasure Palace?”","Zhan Lu and Lin Yuan were only recently acquainted, and he hoped that Lin Yuan would be able to stay in Fortune Treasure Palace longer so he could use the opportunity to become even closer to him.","Alas, Lin Yuan’s response was not what Zhan Lu had been hoping for.","“Mr. Zhan, all you need to do is help me bring all those books over. I will return them to you before the Treasure Convention begins. The books won’t be damaged in any way. If they do become damaged, I will pay 30,000 chips for every damaged book. I’m sure that Fortune Treasure Palace’s headquarters has copies of all these books.”","Zhan Lu was rather disappointed.","It was true that Fortune Treasure Palace had backups of every book, and in the event that any of them were damaged, he just needed to notify the headquarters.","Many special honor guests had borrowed the books in the past.","No one would be able to resist an offered compensation of 30,000 chips per book.","But Zhan Lu knew that if he agreed to Lin Yuan’s request, he would lose almost all hope of deepening his friendship with Lin Yuan.","Although the two of them were linked now by their shared benefits, they could form a friendship over time by maintaining a positive relationship.","Zhan Lu had become friends with many special honor guests through this method. Occasionally, they would gather together. Zhan Lu wanted to pull Lin Yuan into this circle.","It would benefit someone like Lin Yuan, who was a young disciple of a hidden ancient faction, to join this circle.","The members of this circle that were guarded by him always made sure to provide benefits to each other.","However, Zhan Lu could not extend an invitation to Lin Yuan now. He could only invite Lin Yuan after the two of them got on better terms, and he found the right opportunity to do so.","Lin Yuan’s unrestrained sweeping of Fortune Treasure Palace’s resources as well as the orders he gave to Zhan Lu had caused all of the attendants to become curious. Just who was this special honor guest, and how did he come to possess such wealth?","In the past, there were people who had gotten drunk in Fortune Treasure Palace and made declarations about emptying out Fortune Treasure Palace. However, everyone knew that the words of such drunkards were not to be believed.","But now, someone was actually doing that!","When Lin Yuan arrived at the 17th floor, he noticed that there were indeed more feys. However, they were still a far cry from reaching the standard of being spirit-locked by Morbius.","Nonetheless, Lin Yuan still traded for all these excellent feys.","Sky City had many members aside from main ones like Wen Yu, Liu Jie, Su Yiren, Luo Lan, and the rest. They needed feys as well.","The white-clothed followers and Sky City’s reserve members also needed to contract feys.","If he stocked up on more outstanding feys, it would only benefit Lin Yuan and Sky City.","The biggest issue with these feys was that they were not easy to look after.","But once Lin Yuan placed the feys in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, the Hundred Questions Beasts would start to look after them. Lin Yuan did not have to worry about them at all.","At first, Zhan Lu had been frightened when he saw Lin Yuan gobbling up all the resources. With each casual point, he spent hundreds of thousands of chips.","This cavalier attitude toward chips was evidence of true might and power.","But after some time, Zhan Lu became composed despite the resources becoming increasingly expensive on the higher floors.","When Lin Yuan asked him for Fortune Treasure Palace’s books, he said that he did not know much because he had only just left his faction.","However, Zhan Lu felt that Lin Yuan had a good grasp of the quality of the resources! He was able to pick the most useful resources on every floor.","Not even Zhan Lu had as good of an eye after years of interacting with treasures and working as a manager of Fortune Treasure Palace’s branches.","When they arrived at the 13th floor, Lin Yuan was instantly drawn by a small beast.","It resembled a fox but also differed considerably from one.","This beast was currently weakly cowering in a cage made of white starstone.","Through True Data, Lin Yuan learned that this beast was called the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast.","Lin Yuan could sense that the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s bloodline level was very high, but it had yet to grow the large third eye on the back of its head, which was characteristic of eyed-beasts.","The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast turned to look at Lin Yuan, and he saw that the back of its head was covered in white fur.","Lin Yuan was not interested in it because of its bloodline but because of its abilities and exclusive skill.","[Fey Name]: Desire Moon-Eyed Beast","[Fey Species]: Long-haired species/Eyed-beast species","[Fey Grade]: Silver (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Light","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Moon Condensed Dew]: The moonlight in its body will be condensed into moon dew. The moon dew can boost entities that use moonlight as a main source of energy. These entities will be able to absorb energy even quicker, and their bodies will be cleansed.","[Moonlight Protection]: Its eyes will cleanse moonlight, and the moonlight will protect selected targets. The strength of the protection will be linked to the strength of its own bloodline as well as the strength of the moonlight in its environment.","[Gazing Moon]: Its eyes will fixate on the moon, and it will be able to comprehend everything it requires to evolve. The speed at which it absorbs moonlight energy will also increase.","Exclusive Skill:","[Dark Side of the Moon]: When it uses moonlight in its attacks, the moonlight will be boosted. A portion of the light-elemental energy will be transformed into dark-elemental energy. The two kinds of moonlight energy will attack the target.","The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast was basically made for the Moon Empress.","Almost all of the Moon Empress’ feys were related to the moon and needed to absorb moonlight energy.","The Sky Beyond the Clouds also had a moon. It was much stronger than the main world’s moon, and its moonlight energy was also more potent.","Hence, the feys from the Sky Beyond the Clouds that needed to absorb moonlight energy to increase their power could do so much more quickly than those from the main world.","When the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast used Moon Condensed Dew to boost the Moon Empress’ feys, the feys’ absorption of moonlight energy would not only be quickened, but their bodies would also be cleansed.","This cleansing of their bodies was different from when impurities were removed from their bodies.","The removal of impurities would purify the body, while the cleansing of the body would aid in its growth and enable the lifeform to develop in the right direction.","Many feys had abilities and exclusive skills that did not complement each other, diminishing their combat power.","The Sacred Cry Moon Beast was facing this exact issue, and this was a problem that plagued the Moon Empress."]},{"number":2861,"title":"Chapter 2861 Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2861 Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake!","The Sacred Cry Moon Beast followed behind the Moon Empress, and it liked close-quarter combat.","After joining the Moon Empress and gaining her resources, the Sacred Cry Moon Beast attained an Eternal exclusive skill that allowed it to become a caster.","As a result, the Sacred Cry Moon Beast’s abilities diverged from its body composition.","If the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast used Moon Condensed Dew to produce moon dew and nourish the Sacred Cry Moon Beast for a prolonged period, the Sacred Cry Moon Beast’s body composition would improve, and it would become much stronger.","This would resolve one of the issues the Moon Empress was facing.","The Moon Empress’s main fey was still Zixi, and its abilities were still related to the aura of moonlight energy.","After Zixi obtained spirit qi crystals from him, it became the only fey that reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom without help from Lin Yuan’s body composition.","If the moon dew sped up Zixi’s absorption of moonlight energy, its power would also improve.","Zixi’s divine kingdom was exceptionally special—it could turn moonlight energy into divine kingdom power!","Moonlight energy was much easier to obtain than faith power.","The Moon Empress’s Cold Moon Lone Disk was a weapon-type fey. It was not a fey that had transformed using Tool Transformation.","A weapon-type fey that used moonlight energy as a source of power could be continuously upgraded, and there was no limit to its strength!","Lin Yuan knew that the Moon Empress badly wanted to increase her power. She had become even more anxious of late.","The Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s presence would give the Moon Empress some peace and security.","Aside from Moon Condensed Dew, the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s Elite ability, Moonlight Protection, was useful as well.","Moonlight Protection was not only linked to the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s own power and the strength of its bloodline but was also determined by the moonlight energy in the environment.","Given the strength of moonlight energy around the Moon Empress and her divine kingdom-level power, the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast would be able to use Moonlight Protection to fend off life forms below Eternal!","If the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast joined the Moon Empress, it would be able to evolve very quickly.","Lin Yuan felt that Gazing Moon was similar to Green Vine’s ability to increase its power endlessly.","But once it reached World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, Green Vine needed to absorb faith power as well. On the other hand, the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast only needed to continue absorbing moonlight.","Soon after joining the Moon Empress, the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast would become her second main fey after Zixi!","Dark Side of the Moon was a boosting support-type exclusive skill. It could transform moonlight energy into a special dark-type ability. Both types of energy would be used to attack the target simultaneously. This would maximize the damage dealt to the target and increase the combat power of the Moon Empress’ feys!","Truthfully, the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast was also useful to the Star Vastness Peony.","In the future, if Lin Yuan wanted to speed up the Star Vastness Peony’s peony, he could ask the Moon Empress for some moon dew.","Zhan Lu saw Lin Yuan looking at the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast. If this were any other special honor guest, he would begin extolling the merits of the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast in a bid to convince the special honor guest to purchase it. But he did not do so with Lin Yuan.","Zhan Lu said seriously, “Young Master Lin, there is also a Void-Shattering Eye Beast on the 14th floor. It has already opened the third eye on the back of its head and awakened its eyed-beast bloodline.","“It was personally nurtured by one of Fortune Treasure Palace’s Grade 5 Creators. However, this Desire Moon-Eyed Beast isn’t doing well, and its bloodline has yet to evolve. There is a high chance that its bloodline will never be able to evolve!","“Luckily, its quality evolved to Legend when it was Bronze grade. Its evolution potential won’t be affected by its failure to awaken its bloodline.”","From what Zhan Lu said, Lin Yuan learned that it was also common knowledge in the Sky Beyond the Clouds that the earlier a fey evolved to Legend quality, the better it was.","In the main world, many Creation Masters were still debating this matter, and there was no definite conclusion. The other federations were not as certain about this as the Radiance Federation was.","The Radiance Federation always saw this as common knowledge and taught it to their spirit qi professionals.","Lin Yuan did not know how the Creators were ranked and categorized.","The distinction for Creators had to be different from that of Creation Masters. However, there was no guarantee that Lin Yuan was incapable of doing what Grade 5 Creators could do.","Using Morbius, Lin Yuan had already confirmed that he could help the Desire Moon-Eyed Beast’s bloodline to evolve.","This meant that he was much stronger than Grade 5 Creators!","“It’s fine. Even if this fey’s bloodline can’t be evolved, I’m still very interested in it. Truthfully, I have many spirit contractors under me, and I intend to nurture them. I hope that you will be able to reach out to me first if you find any similar feys like this that have special bloodlines! Thank you in advance!”","Lin Yuan’s goal was to obtain more outstanding feys from Zhan Lu. However, his methods painted him as the possessor of superior resources in Zhan Lu’s eyes.","It was unsurprising that Lin Yuan had spirit contractors under him.","It was only to be expected that Lin Yuan would nurture his subordinates. However, it was abnormal for Lin Yuan to nurture his subordinates’ feys!","Not all lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds could be called feys.","Only lifeforms that were Diamond grade and below could be contracted by spirit contractors.","Many powerful species would help their offspring to quickly comprehend Willpower Runes to prevent their offspring from becoming recognized as feys and contracted by someone.","Once they evolved to Suzerain/Fantasy, they could not be contracted by spirit contractors.","Because of this, it was exceptionally difficult to find powerful feys.","Lin Yuan did not want to waste time and manpower searching for these feys.","While searching for these feys, it was inevitable that they would attract hostility from some powerful species or be resented by the feys they were trying to contract.","Zhan Lu hurriedly said, “Young Master Lin, rest assured. From now on, once any resources related to feys enter storage, I will set them aside for you so you can select those you want! I won’t lay them out for other guests.”","Zhan Lu was very happy that Lin Yuan was making requests for feys because this meant that they could continue interacting in the future. He could also use this reason to initiate contact with Lin Yuan.","Among all the feys on the 13th floor, Lin Yuan felt that two feys were worthy of being spirit locked.","One was called the Instant Light Spike Scorpion, and the other was the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake.","The Instant Light Spike Scorpion could enter light and travel instantly to assassinate targets.","Lin Yuan did not have such a fey in his arsenal.","Besides being spirit-locked by Morbius, the Instant Light Spike Scorpion was also suitable for Liu Jie’s Insect Queen. Elegance had yet to acquire a powerful insect-species fey that could utilize assassination techniques.","Regardless, Lin Yuan purchased the Instant Light Spike Scorpion.","If Liu Jie was interested in the Instant Light Spike Scorpion, Lin Yuan would give it to him so it could become Elegance’s new ability.","The Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s abilities were very special. Its snake eyes were akin to blooming six-petaled plum blossoms.","The Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake was able to defend against other snake-species feys.","This type of ability usually appeared in dominant fey species. However, there was no species called the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake on the Species Ranking.","When Zhan Lu described the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake, he only talked about how strong and mysterious it was. He did not elaborate in detail about the ways in which the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s bloodline was extraordinary.","It was Winter who carefully examined the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake before using his soul communication to describe its background to Lin Yuan.","There was a high chance that this Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake had the Nirvana Sky Snake bloodline.","The Nirvana Sky Snake used to be a dominant snake species.","When the Nirvana Sky Snake existed, its bloodline consistently remained in the top three of all snake-species feys. It was considered extraordinary.","Winter did not recognize the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s bloodline immediately because it had already gone extinct by the time Winter started his journey in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. It was already part of legend.","Lin Yuan thought, If Winter is right and the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake truly has the Nirvana Sky Snake bloodline, it will really be worth nurturing!","...","When Lin Yuan arrived at the 14th floor and started looking through the treasures there, the Dark Pufferfish had made contact with the Bloodians.","The Bloodians were very arrogant toward other species, but they were validated in having such an attitude.","However, they were rather friendly toward the Dark Pufferfish who came from the Lonely River.","The Bloodians would need help from the Dark Pufferfish to attack the mermaids successfully.","The Dark Pufferfish’s poison was the weapon that the Bloodians would use against the mermaids.","The mermaids would turn to other sea species as allies, but the Dark Pufferfish’s poison was equally as effective on them.","The Bloodians had no clue that the Dark Pufferfish they intended to partner up with had already fallen under the control of someone else.","The Dark Pufferfish team was led by an elder, and this elder had witnessed Lin Yuan’s methods. Hence, he put a lot of effort into this task he had to carry out with Fan Lou. This would not only satisfy Lin Yuan’s orders but would also enable him to form a positive relationship with Fan Lou.","This Dark Pufferfish elder was called Piercing Thorn. He saw this mission as his chance.","In the past, all the Dark Pufferfish were under Ink Thorn’s control. But now, he no longer called the shots.","Lin Yuan was the one who ruled the Dark Pufferfish now. Bei Xu, whom Lin Yuan had assigned to manage the species, was also in charge.","If he performed well, he might be able to accomplish something!","Piercing Thorn finally had the chance to address his ambition!","The Bloodians were uninterested in Fan Lou, who had been mentioned by Ink Thorn.","A distant relative of a species under their control was nothing more than a trivial character.","However, they needed to show the Dark Pufferfish the appropriate respect. Hence, the Bloodians sent an invitation to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves to invite Fan Lou to the banquet that would be taking place three days later.","This was not a significant matter to the Bloodians, but it caused a large stir among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Feng Qing was the only Chaos Wind Demon Wolf who had ever been invited to one of the Bloodians’ banquets.","Now, Fan Lou was receiving the same treatment as Feng Qing!","Fan Lou was considered a prominent character among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Among all of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ distant relatives, Fan Lou was the only one who could not only participate in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ meetings but could also speak authoritatively during those meetings.","All the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves believed that this privilege came from Feng Qing.","Although Feng Xuan was trying to get along with Fan Lou, he was still indignant of him.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ regular members were not the only ones who were surprised to see the invitation. Feng Qing, who relied on Fan Lou, was taken aback as well.","First, Feng Qing took a careful look at the contents of the invitation before he called for Fan Lou. He placed the invitation in Fan Lou’s hands before asking seriously, “Fan Lou, what is going on? Did something happen when you went to see the Dark Pufferfish? How did you convince them to support you so strongly and recommend you as their liaison with the Bloodians?”","Fan Lou was well aware of the reason, but he would not tell Feng Qing about it.","The Dark Pufferfish envoy also had the Thoughts Letter Paper.","His Thoughts Letter Paper could not be used to contact Lin Yuan, but he could contact the Dark Pufferfish envoy.","“Lord Feng Qing, the Light Wind Wolves were not the only ones who went with me to meet with the Dark Pufferfish. The Forbidden Wolf Team was there the entire time, too. I didn’t do anything special!”","While he spoke, Fan Lou looked deep in thought, as though he was remembering everything that happened during the journey.","Feng Qing looked at Fan Lou with suspicious inquisitiveness.","If Fan Lou had not done anything, there was no reason for the Dark Pufferfish to recommend him this strongly.","Feng Qing had already spoken with the leader of the Forbidden Wolf Team, Feng Nuo, and the latter’s surprise had been genuine.","Feng Nuo also said that the Dark Pufferfish envoy who had received the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had been very arrogant and had not been courteous toward Fan Lou at all.","This meant that Fan Lou had not secretly contacted the Dark Pufferfish.","Now that Fan Lou was receiving such treatment from the Dark Pufferfish, it meant that something major had to have happened.","With Fan Lou’s refusal to tell him about it, Feng Qing was beginning to doubt Fan Lou’s loyalty.","Once Feng Qing ascertained Fan Lou’s disloyalty, he would not only stop using Fan Lou but would also rescind all the benefits he had given Fan Lou.","Feng Qing’s eyes narrowed when he saw that Fan Lou had yet to speak.","At that moment, it seemed as though a thought suddenly struck Fan Lou, and he said with a tone of shocked realization, “Oh! When I went to North of the Lonely River to search for resources for you, I came across a young Dark Pufferfish who had been bitten by a water crocodile. I saved him. Is it possible that he comes from a special background?”"]},{"number":2862,"title":"Chapter 2862 Shadow Feather Butterfly!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2862 Shadow Feather Butterfly!","Fan Lou put on an exaggerated show of realization and gave a reason that anyone would find ridiculous, as though he thought Feng Qing was a moron.","However, Feng Qing had no choice but to believe Fan Lou because he had already aligned his story with the Dark Pufferfish. Later, they would find a way to relay the same reason to Feng Qing.","Feng Qing was still suspicious of him now, but once he heard the same story from the Dark Pufferfish, his suspicion would turn into deep trust.","Now that Fan Lou had become the bridge between the Dark Pufferfish and Bloodians, he could exit from Feng Qing’s protection. However, he chose not to do so because he knew that he would only be able to freely tap into the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ power by gaining Feng Qing’s trust and staying by his side.","Otherwise, with his sole power, it was unlikely that he would be able to convince the Bloodians to help him. He would not command much authority in front of the Bloodians with just his status as the liaison to the Dark Pufferfish. He needed an opportunity for the Bloodians to take him seriously.","For now, the best choice for Fan Lou would be to stick with Feng Qing.","Feng Qing did not react to this.","This reason seemed ludicrous to Feng Qing, but he believed Fan Lou. Feng Qing was aware of Fan Lou’s situation. He was nothing more than a Boundary Patrol Envoy who used to be supported by Kong Huan. He did not have any ties to any factions from the Lonely River.","The only reason Fan Lou could catch the eye of the Dark Pufferfish was the one he had mentioned. When Fan Lou saw Feng Qing’s expression soften, he knew that Feng Qing had been mostly convinced by what he said.","Fan Lou knew that he needed to perform properly to ensure that he secured Feng Qing’s trust and support. As long as he did this, Feng Qing would never suspect him again, regardless of what happened.","“Lord Feng Qing, from the moment I joined you, you have done so much for me, and I am indebted to you. The Chaos Wind Demon Wolf bloodline currently running through my veins was given to me by you. How could I ever lie to you?","“The truth is that I just never thought much of that incident. There are many water crocodiles in the Lonely River. They are very dumb and will fill their stomachs with anything they can get their hands on. If the Dark Pufferfish are truly doing this to thank me for saving that youngling,0it means that it definitely has an impressive status! I will use this opportunity to obtain benefits for you from the Dark Pufferfish!”","Feng Qing had heard many declarations of loyalty from his subordinates. Feng Xuan was skilled at this.","Feng Qing liked to hear such declarations of loyalty. Normally, he would not pay much attention to them.","However, Fan Lou’s speech touched Feng Qing and caused him to feel as though he had wronged Fan Lou. The Dark Pufferfish recommended Fan Lou and gave him the chance to attend the Bloodians’ banquet. Yet, even in such circumstances, Fan Lou was able to think of him. It was rare to come across such a character.","Feng Qing felt lucky to have a servant like that who was willing to think for his sake.","In the past, Feng Qing only supported Fan Lou within the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. But now, Feng Qing felt compelled to do something to help Fan Lou catch the Bloodians’ attention!","With Fan Lou’s loyalty, he would definitely help Feng Qing once he was connected to the Bloodians!","In order for Fan Lou to catch the Bloodians’ attention, he needed to use this opportunity to become even closer to the Dark Pufferfish!","Fan Lou did not actually know much about the Dark Pufferfish, but the latter’s gratitude toward Fan Lou was evident from their willingness to do this much for him.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had always been stuck in the vicinity of the Wind Ringing Mountain and Roaring Plains and were unable to expand.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ neighbors were all stronger than them. Otherwise, they would not have to seek protection from the Bloodians!","Feng Qing felt that the arrival of the Dark Pufferfish envoy was an opportunity for the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Feng Qing said seriously, “Fan Lou, your chance is here. Apart from allowing you to attend the Bloodians’ banquet, the Dark Pufferfish must be here to express their thanks to you. The Dark Pufferfish are just as strong as the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Since you know how to think for my sake, I have to do something for you, too! Remember to only accept the gifts that the Dark Pufferfish envoy insists that you accept. Don’t make any other requests of them. Once you make any requests, you will lose their gratitude. If you find the opportunity, help to connect me to the Dark Pufferfish envoy.”","When Fan Lou heard what Feng Qing said, he knew that he had earned Feng Qing’s full trust.","Feng Qing trusted him in the past as well, but before anything serious happened, that trust was only superficial.","Now, Feng Qing’s trust in him was cemented.","Nonetheless, introducing the Dark Pufferfish envoy to Feng Qing was already part of Fan Lou’s plan.","The Dark Pufferfish envoy should have already delivered the news to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","With the Thoughts Letter Paper, he could communicate with the Dark Pufferfish envoy anytime. This was much too convenient!","Fan Lou was struck by the Thoughts Letter Paper’s value and usefulness. He had no idea that the Thoughts Letter Paper was actually something that Wen Yu’s source-type lifeform could produce at any time.","Fan Lou looked forward to Lin Yuan arriving within his range and contacting him.","While Fan Lou was thinking about how to reply to Feng Qing, Feng Xuan briskly walked in.","Even after Fan Lou entered his life, Feng Qing did not fully ignore Feng Xuan. He acknowledged Feng Qing’s abilities as well.","Feng Xuan’s behavior told Feng Qing that something serious must have happened!","“Feng Xuan, what happened? Go ahead and spit it out. Don’t beat around the bush!”","Feng Xuan cast his gaze on Fan Lou. He wondered just what Fan Lou had done to earn him such treatment from the Dark Pufferfish. Not only had they invited him to the Bloodians’ banquet, but their envoy was even making a personal trip to come to meet Fan Lou. This unquestioningly skyrocketed Fan Lou’s status!","In Feng Xuan’s opinion, Fan Lou was a small character who came from nothing and did not deserve such treatment.","He wondered if Fan Lou had cast a spell over the Dark Pufferfish to convince them to make such a decision.","Feng Xuan felt deeply regretful.","If he was the one who had gone to the Lonely River, he would be the one receiving all the benefits now. Fan Lou would not even be able to lift his head up!","In spite of the boiling rage within him, Feng Xuan dared not express how he was feeling for fear that doing so would displease Feng Qing or cause Fan Lou to form a grudge against him.","Now, Fan Lou was someone he could only watch and admire from afar.","“Lord Feng Qing, the Dark Pufferfish envoy is about to arrive at the Wind Ringing Mountain. A few Dark Pufferfish have come in advance to our territory to inform us of this! I am sure that the envoy is here because of Big Brother Fan Lou.”","Fan Lou’s expression of shock was an act, but Feng Qing’s one was genuine.","Feng Qing thought, I underestimated Fan Lou’s importance to the Dark Pufferfish. Just who did Fan Lou save? Was it really one of the Dark Pufferfish’s young leaders? But how did one of their young leaders end up on the banks of the Lonely River and almost eaten by a lowly water crocodile?","Since the envoy was there to see Fan Lou, the latter would definitely be able to introduce him to the envoy.","At that time, he would also learn about how Fan Lou managed to earn such treatment from the Dark Pufferfish.","Feng Qing raised his hand and patted Fan Lou’s shoulder. “Let’s go and prepare. I will go with you to meet the Dark Pufferfish envoy.”","If Fan Lou and the Dark Pufferfish only became acquainted due to fate and not because of Lin Yuan, Fan Lou would take this matter extremely seriously.","But now, the Dark Pufferfish were nothing but his assistants. The envoy would have to cooperate with him, regardless of what he was told to do.","Lin Yuan had provided him with the opportunity. What he managed to accomplish would be up to his own effort!","Fan Lou is currently working hard for the sake of his own development.","The Bloodians had yet to make a move on the mermaids, so he had no reason to contact Lin Yuan.","Fan Lou hoped that the Bloodians would attack the mermaids soon.","...","Lin Yuan, who was far away in Treasure City, did not know how Fan Lou and the Dark Pufferfish’s collaborative plan was going.","Presently, Fan Lou was not a very important tool to Lin Yuan.","Fan Lou’s greatest value to Lin Yuan was still the protection he could offer the main world as a Boundary Patrol Envoy.","Lin Yuan had already arrived at Fortune Treasure Palace’s 14th floor.","The 15th floor was the private space of Zhan Lu, the manager of this branch. This meant that the 14th floor was the final floor where items were put on display!","Compared to the 13th floor, there were more items on the 14th floor that caught Lin Yuan’s attention.","However, the price of the items on the 14th floor could not be compared to that of the items on the 13th floor! If Lin Yuan was interested in everything and wanted to obtain all of them, he would definitely have to exchange more chips.","Although doing so would attract even more attention to himself, Lin Yuan was willing to do so for the sake of the items on the 14th floor.","Lin Yuan had always been on the lookout for feys that could produce special elemental energy.","Lin Yuan was finally looking at the items on the 14th floor of Fortune Treasure Palace.","[Fey Name]: Shadow Feather Butterfly","[Fey Species]: Fantasy-butterfly-species/Winged-butterfly-species","[Fey Grade]: Silver (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Shadow","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Feather Attack]: The feathers on its fantasy wings will be used to attack targets. When the fantasy feathers touch shadows, double the harm will be dealt to targets.","[Shadow Bondage]: Its shadow will be used to bind the target’s shadow. The target’s movements in reality will be restricted.","[Feather Transformed Scales]: When its feathers have accumulated sufficient shadow energy, it can be turned into scale powder that contains pure shadow energy and released from the body.","Exclusive Skill:","[Wide Fantasy Wings]: Its fantasy wings will break through its limit and increase its flying speed, as well as the quantity of fantasy wings produced.","...","[Fey Name]: Crystal Splitting Cactus","[Fey Species]: Cactus-species/Cactus-genus","[Fey Grade]: Silver (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Sound","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Spike Sudden Attack]: When in danger, its spike will elongate. Once the spike pierces a target, it absorbs the target’s blood.","[Long Spike Ejection]: Once the spike has transformed, it can eject it to cause significant harm to targets. The spike has extremely strong penetration effects.","[Treasure-Holding Flower Bud]: Each time the flower blooms, the energy it absorbs transforms into a special energy crystal made of earth-elemental energy. This special energy crystal benefits itself.","Exclusive Skill:","[Extreme Survival]: Even if its body is damaged, it can continue splitting and multiplying as long as it is in a positive environment. The smaller the split and multiplied bodies, the better the quality of the environment required.","The Shadow Feather Butterfly and Crystal Splitting Cactus come across as simple, and their abilities and exclusive skills were not strong. However, they are rare elemental users!","The shadow element was a mutation of dark and light elements. It is similar to the relationship between the thunder and electric elements, as well as the water and ice elements.","The elemental crystals produced by the Crystal Splitting Cactus were mutations of earth-elemental energy. Sand element could not be compared to this.","These minority elements were very difficult to find. However, the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil needed them to evolve its own bloodline.","Lin Yuan did not have any requirements for the Crystal Splitting Cactus and Shadow Feather Butterfly’s abilities and exclusive skills. All they needed to do was reliably produce rare elements.","The Shadow Feather Butterfly’s Wide Fantasy Wings appeared as an exclusive skill that increased its speed and attacking abilities. But, in actuality, it can increase the Shadow Feather Butterfly’s production of elements.","After all, the Shadow Feather Butterfly’s method of producing elements was to store sufficient shadow elements on its wings before turning them into scale powder.","He just needed to collect this scale powder.","The Crystal Splitting Cactus’s abilities did not increase its production of crystallized elements, but its exclusive skill was interesting.","Based on the description on True Data, the strongly adaptable Crystal Splitting Cactus could be cultivated and nurtured even if its body is damaged and cut up into small pieces!","Fortune Treasure Palace had powerful Creators. They must have learned of its exclusive skill while nurturing it. There was a high likelihood that the Crystal Splitting Cactus’s exclusive skill was chosen by the Creator who nurtured it.","It was likely that Fortune Treasure Palace used this exclusive skill to nurture many of the Crystal Splitting Cacti! Setting such a high price for the Crystal Splitting Cactus despite knowing this seemed rather selfish!"]},{"number":2863,"title":"Chapter 2863 Collapsing White Deer!","paragraphs":["2863 Collapsing White Deer!","As the person in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace, Zhan Lu was very clear about the situation of the Shadow Feather Butterfly and the Crystal Splitting Cactus.","Upon seeing that Lin Yuan’s gaze had landed on the Crystal Splitting Cactus for a prolonged time, Zhan Lu’s expression took on a playful tone, indicating that Lin Yuan had most likely seen through its uniqueness.","Zhan Lu was taken aback. Could Lin Yuan be a Creator? Only Creators possessed the ability to sense feys in such detail. Zhan Lu would not be surprised if Lin Yuan was indeed a Creator.","Those hidden ancient species that had been passed down for countless epochs often liked to carefully nurture members with Creator potential. If Lin Yuan was really a Creator, Zhan Lu would have to explain to him.","“Young Master Lin, this Crystal Cactus has caused our Fortune Treasure Palace a lot of losses!”","Lin Yuan turned to look at Zhan Lu with interest. Zhan Lu continued to explain, “Because of its exclusive skill, Fortune Treasure Palace has always treated this Crystal Splitting Cactus as a foundational treasure. For this reason, we specially arranged two Grade 4 Creators for this Crystal Splitting Cactus.","“Unexpectedly, the Crystal Splitting Cactus doesn’t have high requirements for the environment for its exclusive skill, but it needs to absorb pure wood-elemental energy to complete the splitting process. Furthermore, the purity requirement for wood elements is extremely high, and a Grade 4 Creator can’t concoct wood-elemental energy with such purity.","“It’s really not worthwhile to specially arrange for a Grade 5 Creator to obtain a niche type of elemental energy, like crystal-type elements, considering they can create resources that are far more important than these crystal-type elements. Thus, it rendered the existence of the Crystal Splitting Cactus somewhat awkward.","“However, the Grade 4 Creator from Fortune Treasure Palace had already performed the division on the Crystal Splitting Cactus. Since we can’t afford to waste the Crystal Splitting Cactus just like that, we arranged for a Grade 5 Creator to cultivate a Crystal Splitting Cactus. The rest of the Crystal Splitting Cactus’ fragments have been disposed of. If you want to trade this Crystal Splitting Cactus, you have to be mentally prepared!”","Under normal circumstances, Zhan Lu should not have used such a tone to convey that Fortune Treasure Palace’s trading item on the 14th floor was not good. However, Zhan Lu didn’t see the need to conceal the fact that Lin Yuan would have to pay a hefty price for an item with no practical use.","When Lin Yuan heard Zhan Lu’s words, he did not express any doubts. There was no need for Zhan Lu to lie to him because his words wouldn’t hold up.","As long as he could get the Crystal Splitting Cactus and nurture it, he would be able to see if Zhan Lu had spoken the truth.","Despite the Crystal Splitting Cactus being of little value, according to Zhan Lu, Lin Yuan was still very interested in it. Pure wood-elemental energy might be rare to others, but for Lin Yuan, it was just a matter of using a few Wood-Building Winged Sandflies’ cocoons to nurture it.","Wood-Building Winged Sandflies were extremely rare feys in the main world. In Lin Yuan’s Spirit Lock spatial zone, they could be used at will.","With these two niche types of elemental energy, Lin Yuan could try to evolve the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s bloodline.","“Even so, I still like this kind of resource that can produce special energy. Grade 5 Creator resources are precious, but they’re not inaccessible.","“I can consider nurturing the Crystal Splitting Cactus. If Fortune Treasure Palace needs crystal-elemental energy in the future, you can contact me. I’ve traded so many resources from Fortune Treasure Palace, so I won’t be stingy.”","Lin Yuan was subtly indicating to Zhan Lu that as long as Fortune Treasure Palace continued to trade with him in the future and acted as his channel to obtain resources, then his friendship with Fortune Treasure Palace would last for a long time.","Zhan Lu raised his hand and pointed to a booth in the distance. “Young Master Lin, if you’re interested in special types of elemental energy, the Collapsing White Deer over there should meet your requirements. It’s a coincidence that this Collapsing White Deer is placed in my exhibition hall.","“Originally, this Collapsing White Deer caught the interest of one of our Creators, who intended to form a contract with it. But later on, that Creator gave up on this Collapsing White Deer due to personal reasons. That’s why it has found its way here.","“As opposed to producing destructive elements that contain a single super destructive ability, the Collapsing White Deer’s bloodline is very powerful.","“If we want to trace its bloodline, the bloodline of the Collapsing White Deer can be traced back to the Sky Shattering Sacred Deer species that once controlled the White Stone Plateau in ancient times.”","Winter’s expression shifted subtly when he heard the words ‘Sky Shattering Sacred Deer’. He released his aura toward the direction Zhan Lu was pointing at. After feeling it for a while, Winter restrained his aura and did not refute Zhan Lu’s words. The change in Winter’s expression was so subtle that even Lin Yuan did not notice it.","Lin Yuan was quite interested in the Collapsing White Deer that Zhan Lu had mentioned. However, Lin Yuan was unaware of the legend surrounding the Sky Shattering Sacred Deer.","After Morbius could materialize, its physical body could be detached from its main body. Morbius’ main body enveloped Lin Yuan’s body while it remained in Sky City, collecting spirit qi crystals for Lin Yuan.","Although the faith country was only in its embryonic form, a large number of holy spirits in the faith country evolved every day. Previously, many lifeforms were not sure if they could withstand the World Cleansing and thus remained stagnant.","Now, when the lifeforms of these faith countries saw that someone was helping them through the World Cleansing, they all chose to increase their grade and quality.","Lin Yuan and Morbius’ consciousness bodies were too far apart to communicate, but large amounts of spirit qi crystals were emerging from the Pure Land of Bliss in the Spirit Lock spatial zone at all times.","If the Wind Speed Rapid Antelope did not have many Deposit Vegetable Pods in human form as helpers, it would not be able to count the spirit qi crystals alone. The massive amount of spirit qi crystals allowed Lin Yuan to squander and use them freely.","If Morbius’ consciousness was in the state of merging with its main body, it would definitely tell Lin Yuan something about Winter.","Despite Morbius’ consciousness not being physically present with Lin Yuan, Winter didn’t withhold anything from him.","Winter told Lin Yuan after calming down, “Lord Saint, I hope to nurture this Collapsing White Deer and become its spirit contractor.”","Winter’s words surprised Lin Yuan. He was aware of how arrogant his four followers were usually. Their arrogance stemmed from his soul, making them look down on every lifeform other than those involved with him.","Lin Yuan was not surprised that Winter could contract a fey. However, Zhan Lu had clearly mentioned that the Collapsing White Deer had been abandoned by a Creator. No matter what the reason was for the abandonment, the fact was that Winter was actually interested in a fey that had been abandoned. This did not match Lin Yuan’s understanding of Winter.","Lin Yuan looked up at Winter and heard him say in a reminiscent tone, “Lord Saint, you didn’t choose to recover the memories of your previous life. You most likely forgot that I was a member of the Sky Shattering Sacred Deer before I became your follower. To be precise, I was the Holy Son of the Sky Shattering Sacred Deer.","“It seems that even an ambitious faction like Fortune Treasure Palace doesn’t know much about the situation in ancient times. The Sky Shattering Sacred Deer controlled more than just the White Stone Plateau. The White Stone Plateau was merely the birthplace of the Sky Shattering Sacred Deer.","“The territory of the Sky Shattering Sacred Deer was at the intersection of the West Universe and the South Universe. All the territory’s compatibility range was almost 1/5 the size of the East Universe. It’s a pity that no matter how powerful a species is, once there’s a problem internally, it will eventually fall apart and gradually cut off the bloodline inheritance.”","Lin Yuan was astounded. This was the first time Lin Yuan had such a detailed understanding of Winter’s background. It turned out that Winter was from the Sky Shattering Sacred Deer.","After understanding Winter’s background, he could tell why Winter wanted to form a contract with the Collapsing White Deer. Even if Winter had no intention of restoring the Sky Shattering Sacred Deer, he definitely aimed to preserve their legacy.","Lin Yuan naturally would not reject Winter’s request.","Lin Yuan turned to Zhan Lu and said, “I want this Collapsing White Deer. Hand it over to me now! The resources can be deducted later!”","When Zhan Lu introduced the Collapsing White Deer, he could sense that Lin Yuan was not very interested in it. However, Lin Yuan suddenly became interested in it for some reason.","Even if Lin Yuan was interested in a niche type of energy, he should not have treated it any differently from the Shadow Feather Butterfly and Crystal Splitting Cactus. Zhan Lu was puzzled by Lin Yuan’s sudden change in attitude toward the Collapsing White Deer.","However, since Lin Yuan was interested in the Collapsing White Deer and had made such a request, Zhan Lu would not reject him no matter what.","“Young Master Lin, I’ll bring this Collapsing White Deer over to you now. Before it’s brought over, would you like our envoys to analyze and feed it?”","“As feys are trading items, we usually don’t feed them too much to keep them from causing too much trouble. Perhaps this Collapsing White Deer may not be able to display its best condition in front of you at the moment.”","Lin Yuan felt a pang in his heart upon hearing this. Could it be true?","In Winter’s heart, the Collapsing White Deer was not only a lifeform he was about to form a contract with, but it was also a descendant that Winter was prepared to nurture.","It was reasonable for Fortune Treasure Palace to treat the trading items in that manner. However, it was inevitable that Winter would hold a grudge.","Before Lin Yuan could respond to Zhan Lu, Winter spoke first. “Make sure to feed the Collapsing White Deer properly. After it’s fed, bring it to our Young Master.","“Young Master, there are a few good feys over there. Let’s go and take a look!”","The discovery of the Collapsing White Deer, with its unique bloodline, truly delighted Winter. However, Winter didn’t lose his mind because of the Collapsing White Deer. Winter knew exactly what his existence meant. As Lin Yuan’s follower, he would follow Lin Yuan and prioritize his interests.","Now that Lin Yuan wanted to establish a friendly relationship with Fortune Treasure Palace, Zhan Lu naturally wouldn’t hinder Lin Yuan’s objective due to personal reasons.","Upon hearing that, Zhan Lu immediately arranged for two men to feed the Collapsing White Deer. He specially instructed the two envoys to feed and nurture it to its best state before bringing it to Lin Yuan.","There must be a reason why Lin Yuan had suddenly taken such a fancy to the Collapsing White Deer. Zhan Lu had no intention of probing further. He only needed to provide the best service for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan hadn’t looked at a lot of spiritual creatures before he saw the special-eyed beast that Zhan Lu mentioned, the Void-","Shattering Eyed Beast. Just as Zhan Lu had said, a huge eye that occupied half of its head grew out of the back of its head. The bloodline activation of the eye beast was also exceptionally excellent.","However, this Void-Shattering Eye Beast’s abilities were all focused on probing and seeing through the truth. This ability overlapped with the ability of the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom. Therefore, no matter how outstanding this beast’s bloodline was, it was not suitable for Lin Yuan to contract and nurture it.","In Lin Yuan’s opinion, this Void-Shattering Eye Beast was quite suitable for Wen Yu. Lin Yuan planned to bring it back and let Wen Yu decide if she wanted to contract it.","If Wen Yu did not want to contract the Void-Shattering Eye Beast, Lin Yuan would place it in the prize pool for all the white-clothed followers, becoming one of the feys that would be rewarded to the white-clothed followers.","Lin Yuan looked at the feys on the 14th floor first. After examining Fortune Treasure Palace’s feys, he decided to choose the Six-Flower Jade Blood Snake for Morbius’ next spirit-locked fey.","Apart from feys, there were two other spiritual ingredients that caught Lin Yuan’s eye. The first one was called Pregnant Water Sea Eye.","The Pregnant Water Sea Eye could nurture all strange water in the world, but to increase the effect of strange water required a lot of water-elemental energy and spirit qi. However, these were resources that the lifeforms of the Sky Beyond the Clouds needed. Presumably, this was the reason why something like the Pregnant Water Sea Eye showed up there.","Even a faction with a huge reserve of resources like Fortune Treasure Palace would not spend so much water-elemental energy and spirit qi to strengthen a certain strange water.","However, it would benefit Lin Yuan!","Lin Yuan could use the Pregnant Water Eye to nurture Dark Blue and Frigid.","of strange water. While the strange water found in the waters of the Lonely River was quite outstanding, the energy level of this strange water was not considered high.","Now, Lin Yuan could use the Pregnant Water Ocean Eye to increase the grade of these strange water energies so that Frigid and Dark Blue could obtain the greatest enhancement when absorbing them!"]},{"number":2864,"title":"Chapter 2864 Dragon Blood Nurturing Stone!","paragraphs":["2864 Dragon Blood Nurturing Stone!","The second spiritual ingredient that Lin Yuan valued was called the Dragon Blood Nurturing Stone. It had the ability to speed up the nurturing of dragon-species feys.","The Dragon Blood Nurturing Stone, towering even above Lin Yuan, weighed at least a ton. Such a huge Dragon Blood Nurturing Stone could greatly accelerate the growth speed of dragon-species feys.","When Lin Yuan was in the main world, Long Tao had always provided him with dragon liver. However, in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, he would have to nurture his own dragon-species feys to obtain dragon liver. With Shiny’s digestive ability, it wouldn’t take long before it devoured all the dragon livers in Lin Yuan’s inventory.","Apart from the Pregnant Water Sea Eye and the Dragon Blood Nurturing Stone, other spiritual ingredients were equally effective, but they were not very useful to Lin Yuan at the moment.","After Lin Yuan finished trading on the 14th floor, he followed Zhan Lu all the way to the 15th floor and proceeded to sift through a wide array of spiritual ingredients.","With an increasing number of resources being traded, Lin Yuan’s demand for resources and his perspective were gradually expanding.","After all the transactions, Lin Yuan asked Spring and Zhan Lu to exchange for chips to pay for his expenses.","Lin Yuan would be staying in Fortune Treasure Palace for a while, so Zhan Lu did not have to entertain him immediately.","Zhan Lu had many things to do at the moment as Lin Yuan had traded so many resources. Apart from that, the Fortune Treasure Palace also had other guests who required Zhan Lu’s attention. Having spent nearly a full day with Lin Yuan, Zhan Lu’s absence may have caused dissatisfaction among numerous VIPs.","Furthermore, Zhan Lu was aware that Lin Yuan had just arrived in Treasure City and most likely had his own matters to attend to. Zhan Lu did not want to disrupt Lin Yuan’s plans and do things that would annoy him.","...","Kani and Yu Run had already chosen a room.","Kani contentedly explored the Fortune Treasure Palace’s surroundings. Kani had stayed in the territory of the King Blood Jackals for a long time and seldom had the opportunity to go out and enjoy the simple pleasure of walking around outside.","Despite being Lin Yuan’s follower, Kani had never experienced hardship while being by his side. Lin Yuan consistently treated her with respect, and his two trusted aides, Spring and Winter, have started to acknowledge her contributions more. As she followed Lin Yuan, Kani felt a sense of hope permeating her life.","On the other hand, Yu Run felt completely different from Kani. Yu Run had been waiting for Lin Yuan’s return for quite some time. According to Yu Run’s original plan, he had not intended to stay there for long before returning to the chamber of commerce.","As the leader of the merchant groups, Yu Run had already asked the members to send a message to their leader. The Purple Feather Rain Pigeons were currently targeted by the Bloodwood Lion Bees and were in a precarious situation. It was really unreasonable for him to make the leader wait for him for almost a day.","Yu Run could not afford to wait for Lin Yuan there. If he couldn’t return to the chamber of commerce, he wouldn’t be able to inform the leader of the situation. Yu Run was deeply concerned that the leader would not regard his instructions as an important matter.","If they failed to gather the books from the chambers of commerce for Lin Yuan within three days, Lin Yuan would definitely be dissatisfied. At that time, not only would he not be able to explain to Lin Yuan, but he would also not be able to ask Lin Yuan to help the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons get through their crisis. If that really happened, it would really be over!","Nevertheless, even if he wanted to leave now, Kani would definitely stop him without Lin Yuan’s permission. This realization filled Yu Run with a sense of fear as he could still recall the memory of Kani instantly killing the Bloodwood Lion Bees’ merchant groups even now.","Kani gazed at Yu Run, who was circling in front of her, and said, “You just have to wait patiently for Master to come back! The survival of the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons is fated. Worrying here won’t change anything. If you make Master unhappy when he comes back later, don’t blame me for not reminding you!”","With Kani’s strength, she would not have regarded a minor figure like Yu Run seriously at all. However, after these few days of interaction, Kani had developed a more favorable impression of Yu Run.","As the King Blood Jackal Queen, Kani had always admired lifeforms who displayed unwavering loyalty to their species. Yu Run’s actions over the past few days had demonstrated his sincerity and commitment toward the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons.","Upon hearing Kani’s words, Yu Run did not dare to continue pacing. Having pondered for a moment, he asked, “Lordess Kani, there’s something I wish to inquire about. May I have this opportunity?”","Kani had already expected that if Lin Yuan did not return, Yu Run would definitely ask her about the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ way out.","Kani had accompanied Lin Yuan out for training. Even Spring and Winter understood that Lin Yuan’s needs took precedence when they were out. Naturally, Kani wouldn’t make any commitments to Yu Run without considering Lin Yuan’s needs first.","However, based on Kani’s understanding of Lin Yuan, if the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons could genuinely offer assistance to Lin Yuan instead of attempting to take advantage of him, he wouldn’t ignore their plight if they faced extermination. However, all of this depended on the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons having established a certain level of friendship with Lin Yuan.","Kani reminded Yu Run, “In the entire Treasure City, the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons are considered insignificant and are basically eliminated every day.”","Yu Run was stunned for a moment before an ecstatic expression appeared on his face.","Even though the blonde woman before him was a servant to Lin Yuan, she still wasn’t someone he could afford to overlook. Faced with his inquiry, Kani could choose not to respond. Engaging with him meant that Kani would at least give some advice.","Kani’s words pierced Yu Run’s heart, but he knew that Kani was right. Being weak in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was indeed the original sin.","Had the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons been strong enough, they wouldn’t have been bullied and targeted by the Bloodwood Lion Bees. Furthermore, they wouldn’t have disclosed information about the Water Flame Crystal Vein, leading it to fall into the hands of the Sword Feather Vultures.","What was even more hateful was that the Sword Feather Vultures had not offered protection to the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons even though they had benefited so much from them. Instead, they had directly thrown out the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons and used them as tools to appease the anger of the Bloodwood Lion Bees.","The Purple Feather Rain Pigeons could only silently endure all of this. There was no other explanation for their predicament except for their weakness.","However, considering the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ bloodline and the lack of exceptionally talented individuals within the species, being able to maintain the current situation was already a stroke of luck!","Kani saw that Yu Run had taken her words to heart and did not refute them. The smile on Kani’s face widened.","Kani did not intend to belittle the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons in front of Yu Run and trample on his dignity. On the contrary, Kani needed to let Yu Run grasp the reality of the situation first. Only when Yu Run faced reality and could see the urgent situation of the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons could Kani advise Yu Run.","Yu Run’s current expression suggested that he also agreed with what Kani had said.","“Apart from becoming stronger, there’s another way for a weak species to survive. That is to choose a species or faction that is truly powerful and then attach themselves to them. However, the weak species need to demonstrate their value.","“Instead of concerning yourself with peripheral matters right now, why don’t you think about what benefits the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons can bring to the people you want to rely on? When you figure this out, many problems will be solved!”","Although Lin Yuan had not returned for such a long time, Kani was not worried about him at all. Just as Yu Run acknowledged her strength, Kani was also well aware of Spring and Winter’s capabilities. With them around, there were not many people who could threaten Lin Yuan’s safety. Moreover, individuals like that wouldn’t usually frequent a location like Fortune Treasure Palace.","...","When Lin Yuan returned to his residence, he had obtained numerous treasured books of Fortune Treasure Palace from Zhan Lu.","Lin Yuan had not forgotten that Yu Run was waiting for him.","Even though Lin Yuan had obtained numerous books from Fortune Treasure Palace, the books compiled by the chambers of commerce that Yu Run was helping him collect were also useful.","There was a lot of very basic information that was not recorded in Fortune Treasure Palace’s books, as those books that contained overly basic knowledge were useless to the Fortune Treasure Palace.","However, the books from chambers of commerce also didn’t document much. In order to enrich the content of their books, they would add a lot of basic information inside.","When Yu Run saw Lin Yuan, he hurriedly took two steps forward and bowed to greet him.","However, he did not dare to make a direct request to return to his species. Instead, he tried his best to express goodwill to Lin Yuan, saying, “Lord, I’ve already instructed my subordinates to help you collect the books. However, I’m uncertain of their progress. If you don’t require my immediate assistance, would you consider allowing me to return to check on them?”","Yu Run’s words were very sincere, but anyone could tell that he was just looking for an excuse.","Lin Yuan did not make things difficult for Yu Run and told Kani, “Since that’s the case, Kani, accompany Yu Run to assess the situation! I’ll entrust Yu Run’s matters to you!”","Kani’s interest was piqued when she heard Lin Yuan’s words. Lin Yuan had asked her to be in charge of Yu Run; this naturally included the conflict between the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons and the Bloodwood Lion Bees.","Kani deeply appreciated Lin Yuan’s generosity in allowing her the freedom to act independently rather than keeping her constantly by his side and letting her be a guard who could only follow orders.","“Master, don’t worry. Leave this to me. I will definitely do it well! When Yu Run comes back tomorrow morning, do you still want him to bring you around Treasure City?","Lin Yuan shook his head and said, “Kani, take my place and travel around Treasure City with Yu Run tomorrow. If you come across any resources that you think are not bad, kindly make the purchases on my behalf. I have other plans for the next few days, so I won’t be going out!”","Lin Yuan had traded many resources from the Fortune Treasure Palace. Not only did he need to sort them out as soon as possible, but he also needed Genius to record the contents of the books quickly.","After he was done reading the Fortune Treasure Palace’s books, it was very likely that the Treasure Convention would begin soon. Lin Yuan did not have that much time to deal with other matters. Lin Yuan believed that Kani would be able to handle this matter well.","Yu Run was also very happy that Lin Yuan left the decision-","making authority to Kani. He had interacted with Kani for the longest time, and Kani had clearly shown her kindness earlier. If he sought Kani’s help, it would be more effective than asking Lin Yuan to protect the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons. However, he could not imagine what value they could bring to Lin Yuan.","Just because Yu Run couldn’t figure it out didn’t mean that Kani didn’t have plans.","Treasure City was a very luxurious commercial city. Lin Yuan needed to control a faction in Treasure City as an informant. There was no necessity to nurture this faction as it only needed to be able to convey the situation in Treasure City accurately to Lin Yuan. This faction also didn’t need to be overly powerful as the stronger it became, the more conspicuous it would be, making it difficult to operate discreetly. The Purple Feather Rain Pigeons happened to be suitable for such a role.","“Yu Run, are all decisions regarding the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons made by your leader? If your leader doesn’t cooperate with me, I’ll appoint you as the leader. How does that sound? With you leading, the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons can at least secure a favorable position with me.”","Kani’s words were casual, but she had been watching Yu Run’s expression as she spoke. Her words were a double temptation for Yu Run. Not only did it ensure the safety of the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons, but it also gave Yu Run a chance to become their leader.","Kani saw the change in Yu Run’s expression, prompting her to ponder another problem, which was whether a lifeform who wholeheartedly thought for the species would have the intention to overstep their bloodline and seize power for themselves.","Kani had been allowing the ambitions of the King Blood Jackals to grow. However, after becoming the King Blood Jackal Queen for a long time, Kani found it increasingly challenging to think from the perspective of other King Blood Jackals. Yu Run’s next answer gave Kani an answer.","“Lordess Kani, if our leader is unwilling to cooperate with you, I can lead the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons and be loyal to you! I appreciate you giving me this opportunity!”","Apart from surprise and hesitation, Kani could also hear the shock in Yu Run’s tone.","At that moment, Kani felt immense gratitude that Lin Yuan had been willing to give her a chance back then. Kani was very well aware of how tough her attitude had been back then. The King Blood Jackals that she had nurtured were probably eager for her to die so that they could replace her!"]},{"number":2865,"title":"Chapter 2865 Treasure City Sealed Off!","paragraphs":["2865 Treasure City Sealed Off!","Kani finally understood something: as the leader of her species, strength was paramount. Without strength, everything was just empty talk.","During her time by Lin Yuan’s side, Kani had affirmed one thing: even if Lin Yuan took over the territory of the King Blood Jackals, he harbored no intention of controlling them. The King Blood Jackals remained under her control.","Although elevating the King Blood Jackals’ ambitions would make them work even harder, it could jeopardize the stability of Kani’s position. However, Kani still planned to develop the King Blood Jackals in this way in the future. Kani’s current strength was something that the other King Blood Jackals couldn’t catch up to.","Kani’s bloodline had evolved to Emperor Blood grade, reaching the pinnacle of the bloodline history of the King Blood Jackals. If she stayed by Lin Yuan’s side, she would be able to obtain more opportunities.","“In that case, don’t worry and bring me back to the chamber of commerce of your Purple Feather Rain Pigeons. Remember to take me around Treasure City in the next few days and let me purchase more resources for Master!”","Kani did not make any promises to Yu Run, but her words assured him that she would protect the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons. With Kani’s support, the Bloodwood Lion Bees could no longer cause any harm to the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons.","The next few days were exceptionally fulfilling for Lin Yuan. The Bloodwood Lion Bees did not directly find trouble with the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons.","However, the merchant groups dispatched by the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons were still being ambushed by the Bloodwood Lion Bees, causing the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons’ merchant groups to suffer heavy losses.","Yu Run was extremely anxious, yet Kani did not show any intention of helping.","Yu Run didn’t want the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons to die under the Bloodwood Lion Bees’ targeting. In the long run, the death of a large number of Purple Feather Rain Pigeons would undoubtedly cause them to die out.","Nevertheless, Kani did not take the initiative to aid the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons in attacking the Bloodwood Lion Bees, as she had her own considerations. Kani only intervened passively to assist the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons when they faced imminent danger of severe injury.","Even if the Bloodwood Lion Bees had backing, Lin Yuan wouldn’t hold Kani accountable if anything went awry. However, if Kani took the initiative to help the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons attack the Bloodwood Lion Bees, she would not be able to answer to Lin Yuan.","...","The Treasure Convention was about to begin, and everyone gathered in Treasure City.","The number of factions living in Fortune Treasure Palace gradually increased, and a large number of factions moved in every day.","The courtyards of Fortune Treasure Palace were positioned adjacent to each other, facilitating social interactions.","Many factions had visited Lin Yuan’s courtyard in the past few days. However, due to Lin Yuan’s busy schedule, Spring and Winter had refrained from entertaining guests. Consequently, many factions began to label Lin Yuan as cold and aloof.","However, the major factions all understood one thing: only powerful factions had the qualifications to be aloof. If a weak faction was cold and aloof, it was equivalent to digging their own grave. As a result, many factions were paying attention to Lin Yuan and wanted to see where he came from.","Lin Yuan did not know about this, and even if he was aware, he would be indifferent.","Under Kani’s supervision, more than 40,000 books compiled by the chambers of commerce in Treasure City were sent to Lin Yuan on the afternoon of the third day.","Fortunately, Genius’ grade had evolved, and the speed at which it read these books through spiritual energy was more than five times faster than before. Otherwise, Genius wouldn’t have been able to finish reading all the books in six days.","Lin Yuan had just taken a deep breath when he saw Zhan Lu, the person in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace, personally come to his courtyard. Under normal circumstances, Zhan Lu could just contact him using the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.","When Zhan Lu saw Lin Yuan, he said extremely seriously, “Young Master Lin, due to unforeseen circumstances, the Treasure Convention is likely to be postponed.”","Lin Yuan revealed a puzzled expression. The postponement of such a large-scale event held by a big city would have a huge impact on the entire Treasure City and would cause Treasure City to be questioned by all walks of life.","It was worth noting that many factions had already come to Treasure City to participate in the Treasure Convention. Postponing it would disrupt the schedules of these factions to a large extent, leading to a decrease in the influence of the Treasure Convention.","It was also important to note that the Treasure Convention only happened once every hundred years. It was difficult for the entire Treasure City and the factions living in it to bear such a loss.","Lin Yuan did not speak immediately because he knew that since Zhan Lu had mentioned this to him, he would definitely give him a reason, “Oh? I wonder how long the Treasure Convention will be postponed?”","The postponement of the Treasure Convention meant that the people from the major factions had to stay in Fortune Treasure Palace for a long time. Fortune Treasure Palace’s business would become even more popular in a short period. However, it would only be disadvantageous for Fortune Treasure Palace in the long term as it would face skepticism from the outside world.","Fortune Treasure Palace had branches in various large cities. If its Treasure City branch was not as good as before, Fortune Treasure Palace would undoubtedly question Zhan Lu.","“I can’t confirm the exact time, Young Master Lin. Treasure City has already entered a state of martial law. Two void passageways have appeared in the north and south of Treasure City at the same time.","“Because these two void passageways are too close to each other, they are showing signs of fusing. A large number of Abyssal Beasts have already begun to gather below these two void passageways.","“Once the void passageway appears, everything in the nearby compatibility range that needs to be communicated through spatial energy will lose its communication ability.”","“I’m here to inform you, and I also have to inform the other guests later.”","Zhan Lu’s words reminded Lin Yuan of the dimensional rift that had opened in the main world. The void passageways in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were quite similar to the dimensional rift in the main world, but there was a huge difference between them.","The dimensional rift was opened due to the high activity of the dimensional space. However, the void passageway had to be artificially connected to the void using a special method.","While the void passageway might naturally open, the locations where such passageways naturally form were at the edge of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","However, even the wilderness of the North of the Lonely River was not considered a border area, let alone Treasure City, which was already within the range of the continent.","Lin Yuan had only just arrived in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, but he already knew so much about the void passageway because he had considered artificially opening and feeding Red Thorn and Silver Corona through it.","Due to the fact that opening the void passageway required a few extremely difficult-to-find special spatial resources, Lin Yuan had been unable to do so.","The void passageway would gradually decline if it was opened in places without void energy replenishment. Consequently, the void lifeforms that surged from the passageway would diminish in grade, becoming far inferior to the mice fed to Silver Corona and Red Thorn.","The two void passageways here must have been artificially opened. It appeared that someone was plotting to attack Treasure City! However, it was unknown which faction was behind this scheme.","The faction was definitely very powerful. Otherwise, they wouldn’t have chosen to strike just as the Treasure Convention was about to commence. Attacking at this time would offend all the factions that were preparing to participate in the Treasure Convention. Nevertheless, it’s also the most profitable moment for them.","“Fortune Treasure Palace has extensive sources of information. Do you know which faction opened these two void passageways?”","Zhan Lu gritted his teeth and said, “Your Grace Lin Yuan, I really didn’t know about this! It’s best if I don’t know which faction did it. Otherwise, I won’t let this matter rest!”","“Only the star pirates who self-claim to be powerful would do such a thing. A single star pirate faction would never dare to attack Treasure City. This is most likely a joint operation between star pirates. It’s very likely that dozens of star pirate groups are among them.","“These pirate groups plundered for a living and lived a life of bloodshed. Since they dare to attack Treasure City, they must have enough forces to rely on. This situation is probably going to be troublesome!”","Zhan Lu apologized to Lin Yuan and expressed that he wanted to inform the other factions. He did not seek Lin Yuan’s assistance in helping Treasure City overcome this crisis.","Firstly, it was because these star pirate groups had already sealed off Treasure, and members of any faction in Treasure City were the prey of these star pirate groups. Secondly, even if someone were to request Lin Yuan’s assistance, it should be an official faction member of Treasure City and not him. Apart from personal matters, Zhan Lu did not want to owe Lin Yuan anything else.","Spring and Winter stayed by Lin Yuan’s side and did not speak.","After Zhan Lu left, Spring said to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, if Treasure City is really sealed off like what Zhan Lu said, there will definitely be endless turmoil in Treasure City in the short term! Regardless of whether a star pirate group attacked, any faction that dares to seize control of Treasure City must be exceptionally powerful! However, they will undoubtedly face repercussions from the Honor Absent Palace for such actions.","“Taking this into consideration, the Treasure Convention will probably be delayed considerably. Do you still intend to remain in Treasure City? If you prefer to leave, we can depart at any time.”","Spring was able to say such words when Treasure City was sealed off because she was confident in her strength.","Lin Yuan shook his head and said, “Given the circumstances, it’s an opportunity to broaden our horizons. I’m curious how Treasure City will navigate this crisis. Let’s just wait and see! Meanwhile, I can use this time to observe the reactions of the other factions. I think the guests in Fortune Treasure Palace will soon learn that Treasure City has been sealed.”","Winter agreed with Lin Yuan’s suggestion. Since Lin Yuan did not choose to obtain the memories of his previous life in the Returning Saint Pool, Lin Yuan really needed to train more under such circumstances. At this moment, the tumultuous Treasure City could be considered an excellent training ground.","“Young Master, if I’m right, Treasure City will descend into chaos even before those individuals intent on seizing or plundering it make a move. I’m afraid many factions are already preparing to exploit the situation and make a fortune in Treasure City! Those factions with grudges will take this opportunity to settle scores and eliminate each other.","“Young Master, you can take advantage of this opportunity by recruiting some talents from Treasure City into Sky City to expand our Sequence reserve. This way, not only can we inject fresh talents into Sky City, but it will also add pressure on the few hundred members of the white-clothed followers who are training to become Sequences! A sense of danger was the crucial foundation to improve strength rapidly.”","Lin Yuan nodded.","So far, he had only gone to the Sky Beyond the Clouds to control the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River, as well as Kani, the King Blood Jackal Queen. However, the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords were not considered Sky City’s members.","If Lin Yuan wanted to develop in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, he would definitely have to nurture experts there. Now was indeed a good time to select talents for Sky City.","Lin Yuan raised his hand and summoned Genius. He hugged Genius and stroked its soft fur.","“Genius, you’ve worked hard recently. You’ve probably stretched yourself thin. It’s time to take a good rest!”","“There are already 200,000 Hundred Questions Beasts in the Hundred Questions Beast Army. Each of them is a Class 4 Creation Master. After you became a Class 5 Creation Master, you also taught those Hundred Questions Beasts that you took a fancy to.","“The strength of these Hundred Questions Beasts that you have taught has reached the level of a Class 5 Creation Master. You can now liberate yourself and hand over your matters to the Hundred Questions Beast army!","“As a leader of your species, you don’t have to do everything yourself.”","Lin Yuan’s tone was extremely serious as he spoke. The current Hundred Questions Beast Army was a testament to Genius’ hard work over the years. Lin Yuan saw Genius’ hard work and didn’t want it to exhaust itself.","If Lin Yuan didn’t have to help a subordinate or companion increase their strength, he wouldn’t be working so hard day and night.","With the Hundred Questions Beast army, the Deposit Vegetable Pods in human form could already circulate their own stable production resources in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan was now investing more of his energy in the management and development of Sky City. The resources collected this time would be considered part of Sky City’s development. Despite Lin Yuan’s hard work in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, he couldn’t create these rare resources himself.","Under the night sky, the entire Treasure City descended into a state of panic, especially among those factions that did not have the ability to resist this conflict. The factions had no choice but to accept their fate now that they faced such a storm.","Some factions that had gone to Treasure City to participate in the Treasure Convention were unwilling to get involved in this mess. They had already begun to negotiate with the star pirate groups that had opened two void passageways to seal off Treasure City."]},{"number":2866,"title":"Chapter 2866 Second Eastern Region!","paragraphs":["2866 Second Eastern Region!","Once the negotiation was successful, these factions would leave Treasure City. By that time, the city’s strength would be weakened again. This was the scenario that the local factions in Treasure City were most unwilling to see.","Even if local factions were inclined to do so, they lacked the capability to. They could only hope that the star pirate group would be stronger than those factions and refuse their requests.","The star pirates never feared retaliation. If they were afraid of retaliation, they would not have taken such actions.","The star pirates plundered everywhere and did not hesitate to employ methods like void passages to control a large city under the jurisdiction of Honor Absent Palace. They did not care about Honor Absent Palace, so why would they care about these factions?","On the other hand, the star pirates had taken this matter into consideration. Agreeing to negotiations that allowed a portion of the species to leave Treasure City was equivalent to revealing a piece of news—that the star pirates lacked the strength to take down all the factions in Treasure City. Letting the people in the city entertain such thoughts would greatly bolster their inclination to resist.","Furthermore, if the star pirates let a certain faction go, there would be no way to prevent the news from spreading. The disappearance of the forces in the city would eventually become known to the people in the city.","The turmoil quickly spurred various factions within Treasure City to commence their power play.","After confirming that Lin Yuan was prepared to get involved in this mess, Winter said, “Young Master, given the current ambiguity surrounding Treasure City’s situation, why not allow me to investigate it thoroughly? It’s also good for us to have a clear understanding of the situation.”","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “I shall trouble you, Winter. After investigating the situation, we can assess whether Treasure City is qualified to fight with the faction that has sealed it off. More importantly, we need to ascertain if it’s really a group of star pirates behind this, as Zhan Lu said.”","Lin Yuan was no longer a greenhorn youth and had gained an understanding of the dangers of human nature. Hence, he would never easily believe others’ words and guesses.","Now that Lin Yuan possessed such an ability, it was only natural for him to conduct a thorough investigation.","Lin Yuan was very well aware that, regardless of whether the factions besieging Treasure City were formed by star pirates, the official faction should initiate mobilization efforts. This was not only the City Lord of Treasure City exercising the authority granted by Honor Absent Palace but also an act of self-preservation.","When Winter went to investigate the situation, Spring suggested, “Young Master, why don’t we summon Kani back? During this period, I can tell that Kani is quite concerned about the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons. Kani is really too playful.","“Even if the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons submit to you, they won’t be able to bring you much benefit. If you want to support a local faction in Treasure City, it would be a very easy thing to do. As long as we throw in the resources and completely control them, they will be as obedient as the Four Species Overlords of Lonely River.","“The best loyalty lies in obedience to the rule of the species. The Purple Feather Rain Pigeons are really too weak. Moreover, their bloodline doesn’t have much potential.”","Lin Yuan had a noncommittal attitude toward Spring’s words. Indeed, as she had mentioned, it was very simple to control a species as long as they had enough strength and resources.","With his strength, Lin Yuan would be able to control them. Providing them with resources would gradually increase their loyalty to Lin Yuan. The entire Sky Beyond the Clouds operates under this reality.","“We don’t need to inform Kani. She will naturally come back after she learns about the situation. She should be able to differentiate between priorities!","“Spring, if I set up a chamber of commerce in Treasure City, what are your thoughts on having the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons serve as my figureheads?”","While the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons were weak, they were obedient. It was said that Yu Run had already become their leader with Kani’s help.","The Purple Feather Rain Pigeons had no problems with the business model of the chamber of commerce. The reason they were in such a sorry state was that the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons were too weak. Without sufficient strength, it was impossible to guarantee control over huge resources.","If not for the Water Flame Crystal Vein, the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons would not be in such a miserable state.","If Lin Yuan allowed the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons to serve as his figureheads, he would definitely arrange for people with a certain level of strength for them.","Through the Tongue of Relinquish, Red Thorn could already control Divine Kingdom Weapons at the pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom with its current bloodline grade.","Experts who had just reached the Divine Kingdom level were insignificant in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. However, peak World Emperor/Divine Kingdom experts could establish a foothold in the Sky Beyond the Clouds held significant influence.","This was Kani’s strength before she met Lin Yuan.","Even in Honor Absent Palace, reaching Higher Divine Kingdom was already a requirement to become a member of the Honor Absent Palace Council.","No matter how far Red Thorn was, as long as there were no layers of space-time barriers, it could control the weapons controlled by the Tongue of Relinquish.","Red Thorn was the best intelligence gatherer on Lin Yuan’s side.","Lin Yuan had already made arrangements for many things in his mind.","Spring was silent for a moment before she said, “Young Master, if you only require the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons to operate the chamber of commerce, they are capable of serving as figureheads. It’s actually better to choose a weak species as figureheads than a powerful species! Actually, if Young Master is interested, controlling a few star pirates is also not a bad choice!”","Lin Yuan shook his head decisively.","Lin Yuan had already verified the composition of star pirates. The star pirates in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were even more despicable than the bandit groups in the main world. They were a group of monsters that burned, murdered, and plundered for a living and then reaped the benefits from each planned hunt.","Every time they undertook an operation, the resources obtained were immediately squandered by these star pirates. Some star pirate groups would even hire evil, cunning, and strange lifeforms like devils to be their advisors.","Lin Yuan had always been very principled. He could accept and understand the species competing with other species for their development. However, Lin Yuan could not agree with the actions of these unscrupulous star pirates.","On a large scale, they had brought about the downfall of numerous species and were like locusts in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. On a small scale, it was unknown how many families had crumbled due to the action of the star pirates and how many people had suffered the pain of losing their loved ones for no reason.","Lin Yuan knew very well what Spring meant. If a species like the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons could be regarded as figureheads by Lin Yuan, then the star pirates that roamed the Sky Beyond the Clouds were the best choice to act as the behind-the-scenes manipulators to assist Lin Yuan in handling matters that were not convenient to deal with on the surface.","But in reality, Lin Yuan, who was no longer constrained in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, no longer had any worries. The relatives and companions who could previously be considered constraints on Lin Yuan had now grown up.","With Lin Yuan’s resources, he could nurture those behind-","the-scenes manipulators himself. He had long been prepared to select some skilled combatants from the white-clothed followers to become Sky City’s dark side.","“Spring, I will not consider the star pirates. However, I am very interested in the devils who serve the star pirate group.”","Lin Yuan harbored less animosity toward devils compared to his feelings toward star pirates.","Devils themselves were a group of evil and strange lifeforms. Their purpose of existence was to constantly stir up the hearts of others and stimulate the evil desires of other lifeforms.","Nevertheless, there were two sides to everything. The devils could be said to be extremely high-quality tactical commanders. No matter how large-scale a plan was, as long as there were devils involved, it could be meticulously crafted and perfected.","The reason for such a situation was that devils were extremely vengeful. Some devils with extreme personalities would even risk their lives to take revenge on their own factions.","Furthermore, it was because these devils had grown to a certain extent before they were controlled by other factions.","Enhancing the devils’ bloodline or strength required a significant amount of resources. No faction would be willing to invest in nurturing devils from a young age, especially those star pirates who prioritized immediate gratification.","Just as in the main world, once the members of royalty from the federations or Lin Yuan contracted the devils, even if some were arrogant, their loyalty remained unwavering. The more Lin Yuan understood the devils, the more interesting he found them.","Devils were a species that was full of schemes, and their obedience to bloodlines was not inferior to fairies. It was many times stronger than dragon-species feys, which were widely acknowledged as lifeforms with outstanding bloodlines.","Although the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil wasn’t very strong now, it was already a Satan and had absolute dominance among the devils. Lin Yuan could get the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devils to govern these devils and form a council of devilish advisors led by the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil.","In the future, this council of devilish advisors would definitely play a beneficial role in the development and expansion of Sky City.","Spring knew that Lin Yuan had contracted the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil, so it was normal for him to be interested in devils.","Basically, all the major species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds were very interested in devils.","Despite the cunning, treacherous, and evil nature often associated with them, the reality was that the survival environment for devils in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was actually quite harsh and poor.","Regardless of how bad the devils were, they were constantly targeted by other factions.","Spring said softly, “If Young Master is really sure that the star pirates are colluding to carry out a plan against Treasure City, I will keep an eye on these devils for you and bring all of them to you!","“To dare to devise such a plan, there must be numerous devils within these star pirate groups.”","“If there are exceptionally powerful top-tier star pirate groups participating in this operation, there’s a chance that these star pirate groups might go as far as to capture and domesticate a group of devils.","“Star pirates plunder everywhere, and it is much easier to discover the existence of devils than other forces.","“Because these star pirates won’t spend any effort to nurture the devils, they will only leave behind those devils with enough outstanding potential. Those without any potential are basically eliminated when the star pirates discover them.","“Don’t worry. The potential of the devils in the star pirates will definitely be relatively outstanding.”","...","After the turmoil erupted, Lin Yuan didn’t just stay idle. Instead, he studied the flames that were even more top-notch than the strange flame.","Lin Yuan had traded for a large amount of strange water in Fortune Treasure Palace’s treasury, but he had not found any strange flames, which made it impossible for Chimey to continue improving.","Chimey could only stay anxious in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Chimey still wanted to enhance its strength to World Emperor/Divine Kingdom before restarting its acting career in the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","Lin Yuan had heard Kong Huan mention that those factions and species that had been certified in Honor Absent Palace could obtain a special card. Through this card, one could enter a place like Star Web, known as the Second Eastern Region.","The four dominant factions of the East, West, North, and South controlled similar existences.","If Lin Yuan’s Radiance Federation hadn’t possessed Star Web, it would have been very difficult for him to understand the Second Eastern Region that Kong Huan had mentioned.","As a frequent visitor to Star Web, Lin Yuan discovered from Kong Huan’s description that the illusory world controlled by the dominant factions closely resembled Star Web and could even be considered more perfect.","Those powerful forces and species would conduct serious operations in the Second Eastern Region. However, there was a threshold to operate in the Second Eastern Region, and the threshold was quite high!","Kong Huan’s Alluring Foxes did not have that many resources to invest in the Second Eastern Region. Therefore, Kong Huan couldn’t provide too detailed an explanation of the situation there.","Lin Yuan had asked Kani before, but she had never heard of the Second Eastern Region. The King Blood Jackals lived in seclusion in the wilderness North of the Lonely River. It was normal for them to be unaware of the situation in the Second Eastern Region. Lin Yuan knew that Kani would not lie to him about that.","Lin Yuan had already asked Zhan Lu about this matter, and the latter had provided an affirmative answer, which enabled Lin Yuan to confirm the Second Eastern Region’s existence.","Lin Yuan believed that Sky City needed to develop in the Second Eastern Region. Having understood Star Web’s convenience, Lin Yuan believed that the Second Eastern Region would be able to facilitate many of his plans and also allow Sky City to quickly connect with the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Even though Sky City was located in the wilderness North of the Lonely River, it could still accomplish many things without being constrained by geographical limitations."]},{"number":2867,"title":"Chapter 2867 The People Behind the Star Pirates!","paragraphs":["2867 The People Behind the Star Pirates!","During his previous interactions with Lin Yuan, Zhan Lu would always probe, seeking to confirm Lin Yuan’s background. Despite Lin Yuan’s elusive demeanor, Zhan Lu could tell that he did not belong to a local faction in the East Universe.","Kani said in all seriousness, “Master, the factions that besieged Treasure City are much stronger than the official factions of Treasure City. After a brief confrontation, the official factions initiated mobilization. Almost all the chambers of commerce in the city received the mobilization orders issued by them.","“Almost all the merchant groups of the chambers of commerce in the outside world that haven’t managed to return have become captives of the factions surrounding Treasure City. The deployment of factions targeting Treasure City is too unified. I have reason to suspect they are not just combined star pirates.”","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment and felt that Kani’s words made sense. These factions targeting Treasure City lurked in the shadows, and they could only see two void passageways on the surface.","Given that the officials of Treasure City were already so tense, the emergence of the Abyssal Beasts from the void passageway must have intensified the pressure they felt.","“How’s the situation with the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons?”","Kani was somewhat surprised by Lin Yuan’s question. In Kani’s heart, the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons were not significant enough to get Lin Yuan’s attention. She did not expect him to be concerned about their safety.","“Master, the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons occupy a good location in Treasure City, which is close to the Fourth City Guard Division of Treasure City. As long as they keep a low profile, no faction should target them at this time!","“These factions are all in the open, and targeting the factions that are officially certified in Treasure City at such a time will have a huge impact on their reputation. The Bloodwood Lion Bees shouldn’t be able to find trouble with the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons within this short period of time. The Bloodwood Lion Bees can suppress the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons, but they’re not a very powerful faction in Treasure City.”","Since Lin Yuan was prepared to use the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons as his figureheads, he decided to protect them during this upheaval.","“Kani, return to the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons. Take care of them on my behalf and help me obtain information in Treasure City, which will allow me to have some understanding of the situation outside Treasure City, even though I’m in Fortune Treasure Palace. If you encounter pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom corpses, remember to collect them and bring them to me.”","As Kani listened to the first half of Lin Yuan’s words, her heart leaped into her throat. Kani thought that Lin Yuan was dissatisfied with her spending too much time and effort on the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons.","If Lin Yuan really blamed her, Kani would feel wronged. During this period, Kani had actually helped Lin Yuan in gathering resources and efficiently completing the tasks he assigned to her.","Upon hearing the latter half of Lin Yuan’s sentence, Kani knew that Lin Yuan did not blame her and was really prepared to protect the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons amidst the turmoil. They were truly fortunate.","“Master, in that case, I’ll go back now. These are the resources I’ve collected for you using the resources you provided me during this period. Please check them.”","Lin Yuan took the spatial equipment he had given to Kani and realized it was already more than half full. There were all kinds of materials inside, and each of them was carefully labeled. It was evident that Kani was very serious about completing the mission he had assigned.","Lin Yuan was increasingly impressed with Kani’s meticulousness. It appeared she could potentially replace White Speak by his side.","“Kani, you’ve performed exceptionally well. Remember: if you encounter danger, don’t try to be brave just because you’ve reached the Holy Spirit level. You have to inform me immediately. Otherwise, if your roots are damaged, not only will you rely on me for resources, but you will also need a long time to recover, and it will affect your future strength enhancements.”","Kani earnestly kept Lin Yuan’s instructions in mind and could feel how much value he placed on her, which warmed her heart.","Winter had not returned yet, but he had already explained some of the situation to Lin Yuan through the Thoughts Letter Paper. Winter’s investigation result was exactly the same as what Kani had said, except it was much more detailed. He confirmed that the assault on Treasure City involved numerous star pirates. However, behind these groups of star pirates, there were people giving instructions. These people clearly possessed enough influence to make so many star pirates willing to listen to them.","From Winter’s description, Lin Yuan gathered that these star pirates hadn’t solely targeted Treasure City for plundering—they likely harbored other motives as well. Otherwise, the people behind these star pirate groups would not have gone through so much trouble.","Zhan Lu came to Lin Yuan’s courtyard two days later and said with a bitter smile, “I’m very sorry, Young Master Lin. I haven’t been able to take care of you for the past two days. I’m here to ask for your help!","“I’ve completely lost contact with the headquarters, but as the person in charge of Fortune Treasure Palace, it’s necessary to protect this branch. Our Fortune Treasure Palace is one of the iconic buildings in Treasure City. Those people will definitely target it for attack. However, it’s challenging for us to defend ourselves with our current strength.","“If you can help me guard this place, I can apply to the headquarters to help you obtain at least three precious items stored in the treasure vault!”","Zhan Lu wanted to establish a personal connection with Lin Yuan, but deep down, he was hesitant to bother Lin Yuan. Despite that, he had no other choice.","More than half of the factions in Fortune Treasure Palace had been roped in by the people from the City Lord’s side. Zhan Lu regretted that he had misjudged the situation and acted too late.","At present, there were only three special honor guests in Fortune Treasure Palace whose identities had been confirmed. On Lin Yuan’s side, only Winter’s identity had been verified, but it was obvious that the woman named Spring held an equal status with Winter. She was most likely a Holy Spirit expert.","Lin Yuan was rather interested in the remuneration that Zhan Lu was talking about. The resources stored in the headquarters must be exceptionally precious. However, even someone lacking emotional intelligence would not remain fixated solely on the reward itself.","“Mr. Zhan, I believe we are friends now, and I am more than willing to help a friend in need. Hence, you don’t have to be so courteous. There’s something I’d like to ask.”","Zhan Lu heaved a sigh of relief, knowing that Lin Yuan had agreed to help him.","“Young Master Lin, feel free to ask me anything you want. It’s my honor to be considered as your friend!”","As long as Lin Yuan did not ask about the Fortune Treasure Palace’s core secrets, Zhan Lu was willing to tell him anything.","“Mr. Zhan, your Fortune Treasure Palace has a large amount of strange water for sale. Why don’t you have strange flames?”","Zhan Lu thought Lin Yuan was going to ask him something important, but it turned out to be such a trivial matter.","Zhan Lu hurriedly explained, “Young Master Lin, strange flames are indeed harder to obtain than strange water in the East Universe, but they’re not that rare. The reason our Fortune Treasure Palace has never sold strange flames as items is that there’s a Lord in our Fortune Treasure Palace who has a huge demand for them. All the strange flames collected by Fortune Treasure Palace are provided for this Lord!”","Lin Yuan’s question suggested he had a need for strange flames.","Zhan Lu gritted his teeth and said, after a moment of silence, “Young Master Lin, if you need strange flames, I can help you get some through my personal connections. It’s just that the quantity and quality might not meet your requirements.”","In order to curry favor with Lin Yuan, Zhan Lu made such a promise, indicating that he was more important to him than the Fortune Treasure Palace’s Lord.","Upon hearing that, a look of realization appeared on Lin Yuan’s face. So that’s what happened!","He hadn’t been able to trade for even a single strain of strange flames simply because Fortune Treasure Palace had been consuming them internally!","Lin Yuan needed the strange flames to help Chimey increase its strength. Chimey was extremely weak now and had yet to successfully reach Creation Breed. As long as it was a strange flame produced by the Sky Beyond the Clouds, it could basically satisfy Chimey’s needs.","Chimey didn’t actually have much demand for strange flames. The strange flames that Zhan Lu had obtained for himself with his own energy should be enough for Chimey to raise its grade to the World Emperor/ Divine Kingdom. Apart from the strange flames, Lin Yuan could also use spirit qi to support Chimey.","“In that case, I’ll have to trouble you. Since you have already provided me with channels, I naturally want to do something for you as well. These spirit qi crystals will be your reward for providing me with channels!”","Lin Yuan handed a brocade box to Zhan Lu.","When Zhan Lu finished collecting the strange flames for Lin Yuan, he would like to take a look at the quality of these strange flames. Lin Yuan, who was a businessman before he became a spirit qi professional, would not give others a chance to cheat him!","Zhan Lu hesitated briefly before accepting Lin Yuan’s reward. It was a resource that could only be prepared by at least a Grade 4 Creator and was something that Zhan Lu could not refuse at all.","Zhan Lu had already regarded Lin Yuan as someone with character. However, Lin Yuan was also a shrewd person. Otherwise, he would not have remained hidden all this while and waited for Zhan Lu to seek his help. Had Lin Yuan shown up earlier, there was a chance that he might have been invited by people from the City Lord’s side.","“Young Master Lin, once the turmoil settles and communication resumes, I guarantee that I can obtain more than 20,000 strange flames for you in three days!","“Young Master Lin, if you have time now, why don’t you come to the conference room and sit for a while? I also invited other guests and special honor guests. I wonder if you’re interested in meeting them? It’s also good to inform everyone in advance and discuss how to navigate through this crisis together!”","In Zhan Lu’s opinion, even if Lin Yuan was a direct descendant of a hidden and powerful species, by venturing out to establish his faction, he would definitely harbor a certain desire to befriend other factions with Holy Spirit experts.","Regardless of whether it was because Lin Yuan had promised to help him or to get to know other special honor guests, Lin Yuan wouldn’t reject his invitation.","Lin Yuan was almost done with his work these few days. He believed that it was time for him to meet other factions. It would be beneficial for him to establish connections with factions with Holy Spirit experts.","However, based on Winter and Spring’s previous reports to him, several factions attempted to establish connections with him, only to be turned down. This had led to discontent among some factions. Included among them was a special honor guest from Fortune Treasure Palace.","However, all misunderstandings could be resolved in the face of benefits. Lin Yuan hoped that the dissatisfied factions would not take advantage of this opportunity to stir up trouble. Otherwise, he wouldn’t show them any mercy.","He had made a large transaction with Fortune Treasure Palace, and while he had displayed his wealth to them, he had not revealed his temper and strength. It appeared that Lin Yuan needed to show his temper and strength to Fortune Treasure Palace to make them pay more attention to him.","Even if Zhan Lu was in a hurry, he still did things very meticulously. He arranged a VIP room for Lin Yuan in the conference room.","Lin Yuan was the first to enter the VIP room, indicating that, in order to express his sincerity, Zhan Lu had invited him first. The VIP room was designed to separate special honor guests from regular VIPs so that they would not be influenced by those regular VIPs.","The special honor guests who had agreed to Zhan Lu’s invitation would also arrive at this private room to meet Lin Yuan.","Not long after, a tall and sturdy young man with long dark green hair and fair skin walked in with eight followers.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, appearance had always been unrelated to age but rather heavily influenced by one’s own sense of aesthetics. Even when some powerful lifeforms were about to reach the end of their lifespan, they could still maintain their appearance in their youth.","When the young man saw Lin Yuan sitting at the table and Spring standing behind him, he snorted coldly.","This young man had never interacted with Lin Yuan before, nor had he been rejected by Lin Yuan before for visiting him. There was no enmity between them and Lin Yuan.","His reason for treating Lin Yuan with such an attitude was mainly that the young man believed that if there were multiple special honor guests willing to support Fortune Treasure Palace, there must be someone influential among them."]},{"number":2868,"title":"Chapter 2868 Sky Radish Endless Vine!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2868 Sky Radish Endless Vine!","In order for this young man with dark green hair to be the main mouthpiece, he would first have to suppress and convince Lin Yuan to side with him.","Spring intended to release her aura to teach a lesson to this lifeform who had the audacity to butt heads with Lin Yuan. But before she could do so, Lin Yuan gently lifted his hand and stopped her.","Spring did not know what Lin Yuan was planning and looked up at the nine people in front of her.","With a single glance, she realized the background that this dark, green-haired young man came from.","The Sky Radish Endless Vines were a very rare and small species. Yet, they made it onto the Species Ranking every year. Even during their weakest years, their name never failed to appear on the Species Ranking.","The Sky Radish Endless Vines were known for taking control of other species and forcing them to do their bidding. The other eight men all came from different beast species.","Due to their bloodline, it was very easy for Sky Radish Endless Vines to reach the pinnacle of World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. All they needed to do was put in the slightest of effort.","However, the Sky Radish Endless Vine had a weakness that applied to every rare and small species. The members engaged in continuous, intense, and negative competition with each other.","The Sky Radish Endless Vines were one of the rare species that could cannibalize each other and absorb other members’ bloodlines to strengthen their own.","From certain perspectives, the Sky Radish Endless Vines were not suitable to be nurtured as subordinates.","Lin Yuan always had the option of using the Body of All Spirits to absorb a portion of the Sky Radish Endless Vines’ bloodline.","The Sky Radish Endless Vine’s bloodline had the strong and enviable power of revival.","Once the bloodline was activated, they could be revived quickly as long as more than half of their body was preserved and their roots were undamaged. It was said that at extremely high levels, their bloodline could even revive spiritual energy and soul power. But this was just a rumor, and it was unknown if any Sky Radish Endless Vine in the past few epochs had reached this stage.","Technically, the Sky Radish Endless Vine bloodline shared some origins with Spring’s bloodline. However, their connection was not as deep as that of Winter and the Collapsing White Deer.","Spring used her soul voice to tell Lin Yuan about this dark green-haired young man’s situation.","Lin Yuan thought, This special honor guest really isn’t an ordinary character!","Lin Yuan wanted to see what this Sky Radish Endless Vine was planning to do next.","Jin Chen did not underestimate Lin Yuan just because he came with a small group. Only experts who had reached the Holy Spirit level were allowed to take a seat here.","Fortune Treasure Palace only recognized the individual and not the individual’s background.","Even if someone wanted to bank on their title as a special honor guest, the influence and effects would be null if they were not currently in Fortune Treasure Palace.","In order to take over the position of leader, Jin Chen was already using his own methods to suppress Lin Yuan and study his background. He had no idea that his own background had already been fully exposed!","When Lin Yuan did not respond, Jin Chen went on to say, “You arrived here before we did. Yet, you didn’t come to greet us. How rude!”","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow. Even if they wanted to start trouble, was it really necessary to use such childish sparring of words?","However, Lin Yuan was willing to have some fun with this dark green-haired young man.","Jin Chen was trying to overwhelm Lin Yuan in the hopes that he would submit to him.","But Lin Yuan was also trying to overwhelm Jin Chen. He not only coveted Jin Chen’s bloodline but also his person.","The Sky Radish Endless Vine members were not only distrustful of each other due to their bloodline. No one wanted to sacrifice their life to become tools and help other members of their species to increase their power.","Hence, if Lin Yuan tried to suppress and take over this young man, none of the other Sky Radish Endless Vines would stop him.","“Why should I pay you any respect? Do you think that you deserve respect and flattery wherever you go just because you’re a Sky Radish Endless Vine?”","Jin Chen was shocked that Lin Yuan immediately exposed his identity.","Lin Yuan noticed that Jin Chen’s expression had grown solemn after hearing what he said. This caused Lin Yuan’s lips to curl elegantly.","Jin Chen was already awash in waves of shock and stupefaction.","He had wanted to investigate Lin Yuan’s identity. Not only had he failed to do so, but his identity had also been fully stripped and exposed.","It would not be difficult for Lin Yuan to find a Sky Radish Endless Vine and make them his subordinate. If he revealed his identity, plenty of Sky Radish Endless Vines would clamor to become his subordinate.","This young Sky Radish Endless Vine had no idea just what opportunity he had stumbled on!","In truth, Spring could not make any decisions for Lin Yuan. He would be the one to decide whether Jin Chen and his eight subordinates lived or died.","Before Jin Chen became aware of Lin Yuan’s power, threatening him was the best method of subjugating him!","Spring’s method was meant to demonstrate her power to Jin Chen. Once he saw that even someone with her power was willing to submit to Lin Yuan, Jin Chen would make inferences before coming to a decision.","Given Spring’s understanding of Lin Yuan, he would not kill anyone within Fortune Treasure Palace as long as he was in partnership with Zhan Lu and Fortune Treasure Palace. He would extend the appropriate courtesy to Fortune Treasure Palace.","But it was clear that Jin Chen did not think this way. He did not dare to risk crossing Fortune Treasure Palace and staking his life on the line!","Jin Chen heard from Zhan Lu that he wanted to introduce him to one of Fortune Treasure Palace’s new special honor guests. It was likely that he was referring to Lin Yuan.","However, a minute to decide his fate was far too little time!","He did not have any mental preparation at all. How was he supposed to make a decision? They were asking too much of him!","Still, Jin Chen had no means of fighting back against the terrifying energy emanating from the fingertip that was pointed at his forehead.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, everything was determined by power. The stronger side could take the weaker lifeform’s life if they wished.","Jin Chen had done that in the past.","Jin Chen’s thoughts were still a mess, and he had yet to sort them out. But at this moment, he heard Spring counting down.","Jin Chen instinctively said, “Give me another three minutes to think about it!”","Spring scoffed coldly. “Since you asked, I will give you another three minutes. I hope you won’t disappoint me after the three minutes. You have to think this through carefully!”","Jin Chen’s words meant that he had accepted his subjugation and only needed some time to adjust his mental state.","Otherwise, he could have just rejected them and would not have asked for three minutes to think about it!","The moment Spring placed her hand on Jin Chen’s forehead, Jin Chen’s eight guards hurriedly retracted their auras. Even the Lord they were serving was unable to fight back, much less the eight of them!","Unlike Jin Chen, who had the option of making his own decision when being threatened, Jin Chen’s eight guards knew they had no choice! Jin Chen’s decision would be their decision, too!","At first, Lin Yuan had only intended to take in Jin Chen after he was done with all he needed to do in Treasure City. However, Spring’s actions had caused such an unexpected development!","Three minutes passed quickly, and Jin Chen soon hung his head and said, “I can follow you, but just how many resources will you be giving me to increase my power?”","Now that his subjugation was certain, Jin Chen was cleverly trying to gauge his profits.","Lin Yuan did not respond.","Since Spring was the one who had brought Jin Chen to him, she should be the one to reply to him!","When Spring saw Lin Yuan gently knock twice on the table, she understood his meaning.","Spring would not make any promises to Jin Chen.","When Jin Chen eventually understood Lin Yuan’s situation, he would definitely thank Spring from the bottom of his heart.","“We can talk about the resources later. Later, three of Fortune Treasure Palace’s special honor guests will be arriving. Before they arrive, instruct the holy spirit in your divine kingdom to become loyal to the holy spirit in my Young Master’s divine kingdom!”","Unlike in the main world, swearing on wills and laws was ineffective in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. The best way to take control of Divine Kingdom experts in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was to use one’s own fountain of faith to take control of the other expert’s fountain of faith.","The best way to take control of Holy Spirit experts was to use one’s own holy spirit to take control of the other expert’s holy spirit and place a mark on the other expert’s holy spirit.","This was what Lin Yuan had done to Kani as well.","Jin Chen’s fate had been sealed. It made no difference whether he discussed his benefits and resources or not.","When Jin Chen entered the room, he could tell how young Lin Yuan was. He was definitely less than 100 years old. With an age like this, he was considered a newborn in any powerful species."]},{"number":2869,"title":"Chapter 2869 What Gives You the Right to Look Around?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2869 What Gives You the Right to Look Around?","Based on the way Spring addressed Lin Yuan, it showed that he held an extremely high status. It was unlikely that Jin Chen had ever interacted with such a figure before.","Jin Chen never expected Lin Yuan to be a Holy Spirit expert! Was it actually possible for a lifeform to reach the Holy Spirit level in less than 100 years? This went beyond Jin Chen’s comprehension.","If a lifeform could reach the Holy Spirit level in less than 100 years, what level would they reach 1,000 or even 10,000 years later?","Fellow Holy Spirit experts were aware of how high the barrier of crossing the Holy Spirit level was.","Jin Chen did not want to lose his chance with this person when another special honored guest arrived.","Jin Chen hurriedly said, “I can release my holy spirit now. But I hope that you will give me the appropriate dignity once I become your follower! I do not want to be humiliated in front of others.”","Lin Yuan nodded seriously and said, “Of course. I won’t trample over my subordinates’ dignity. Once you are under my control, I will regard you as my companion. I won’t give you orders unless necessary. But you must be aware of your own identity. Do not make things difficult for me. I’m sure you’ll like our friendly relationship! All you need to do is follow me, and I won’t let you suffer!”","Jin Chen did not believe what Lin Yuan said, but he knew that it did not matter whether he believed him or not. In the future, all decisions would be determined by Lin Yuan.","Jin Chen was definitely unwilling to be controlled by others. But he knew that this girl next to him would not give him such a chance.","Jin Chen released his holy spirit before looking at Lin Yuan.","Jin Chen still did not fully believe that Lin Yuan had reached the Holy Spirit level. However, his holy spirit had already injected its aura into his holy spirit. His holy spirit was now restrained.","All of this was completed in the blink of an eye. This allowed Jin Chen to understand that Lin Yuan had not recently reached the Holy Spirit level. It was likely he had reached the Holy Spirit level some time ago and had already attained a very high level. How else could an imprint be placed on his holy spirit so swiftly?","He had been a free man before he entered the meeting room. Now, he had a master.","Luckily, Jin Chen was a Sky Radish Endless Vine who did not have any kinship with the other members of his species. He only had to look out for himself!","At first, the eight beast species experts were only following Jin Chen. But now that Jin Chen had fallen under Lin Yuan’s control, the eight experts were under Lin Yuan’s control as well.","However, after learning of Spring and Lin Yuan’s powers, the eight experts were not upset about this development at all. Rather, they were overjoyed. They now had an even stronger source of support.","The eight experts all had their own species. It was possible that their species would be able to receive benefits from this mysterious young man in the future.","“Don’t worry. I also have eight followers and know what a follower needs to do. I will do my best as a follower. You must feel my sincerity!”","Jin Chen moved to stand behind Lin Yuan as one of his followers but was stopped by Lin Yuan.","“There’s no need to let Zhan Lu know that you’ve become my follower. You can return to your original seat and do what you need to do! Everything else can be discussed once this matter is settled. I will need a lot of help from you then!”","Apart from Jin Chen’s bloodline and power, Lin Yuan was just as interested in his experience and knowledge.","Lin Yuan needed an opportunity to broaden his horizons, and he would not be able to achieve this by reading books. But if Genius used Connected Tails to learn and share Jin Chen’s knowledge, Lin Yuan would be able to achieve his aim easily!","With Jin Chen’s breadth of knowledge and information, it would be easier for Genius to organize the contents of the books as well.","Genius would encounter many conflicting pieces of information when sorting through the records written by the chambers of commerce. This would make it much more difficult for Genius to organize the contents.","Because of conflicting information, it would be difficult for Genius to consolidate a significant portion of the information.","Lin Yuan would not recklessly ask Genius to use Connected Tails to link up with other experts. If Genius linked up with stronger experts, it would inevitably encounter risks.","Lin Yuan needed to put an end to all such risks. Hence, it would be best if an expert like Jin Chen, who was fully under Lin Yuan’s control, supplemented Sky City’s knowledge bank.","Frankly, even if Genius did not use Connected Tails to learn Jin Chen’s memories and knowledge, the contents of the books would be sufficient to enable Sky City to assimilate into the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","It might even be enough for Sky City to attain an equal level of information as other factions.","“Haven’t you realized that as you continue to absorb more of your species members’ bloodlines, tapping into your own bloodline becomes more complex and difficult? Don’t you also feel more tired after circulating your bloodline?”","Jin Chen had yet to absorb many of his species members’ bloodlines. Hence, he had not noticed any of the drawbacks yet.","But after the past few instances, Jin Chen did sense that circulating his bloodline did not come as easily to him as before. Jin Chen always assumed that his feeling was mistaken. But after hearing what Spring said, he knew that his feeling had been accurate.","But Spring must have asked him this question because she knew the answer!","“Your Excellency, how are you aware of my body condition? I have indeed been feeling those symptoms recently!”","This matter concerned his bloodline, and Jin Chen was very serious and anxious about this matter.","Spring did not beat around the bush and replied directly, “Since you’ve already noticed something yourself, I don’t think you’ll doubt what I’m about to say next!","“When you absorb the bloodlines of other members of your species to increase the strength of your own bloodline, you are not only bastardizing your own bloodline but also increasing the amount of impurities in your bloodline.","“The impurities from their bloodline aren’t the same as the ones in your own bloodline, so it’s extremely difficult to remove them. You are still able to evolve your bloodline with such impurities present, but your control over your bloodline will be increasingly affected!”","Astonishment bloomed on Jin Chen’s face when he heard what Spring said. But at the same time, he understood the meaning behind Spring’s words.","At that moment, Jin Chen no longer dared to aspire to continue consuming the bloodlines of other members of his species in order to increase his power.","However, his bloodline had already been affected. This was an urgent issue to Jin Chen, and he hurriedly asked, “Your Excellency, how do I remove the impurities from my bloodline? It must be very difficult, but there should be a way, right?”","Spring said with utmost seriousness, “Of course, there’s a way. However, it will come at a high cost to you. You will need to burn your own bloodline and sacrifice that part of your bloodline to force the impurities out of your body!","“Keep in mind that if you don’t want to waste even more of your bloodline, it will be better for you to remove the impurities as soon as possible! I don’t know how many impurities are in your bloodline and how much bloodline you’ll need to sacrifice. No one knows this better than you.”","Spring had experienced this before, so she knew what needed to be done to remove the impurities from one’s bloodline. It was not a price that most people could afford!","But if this was not done, his future development would be impacted to an indeterminable extent.","If Spring had not removed the impurities from her body, her power would be far below that of Summer, Autumn, and Winter now!","She was being very benevolent by saying all that she had to Jin Chen. It was now up to Jin Chen what he did next!","At that moment, the door was pushed open from the outside, and a girl with beautiful long brown hair walked in.","Based on her features, her beauty had a similar aura to that of Kani. However, Kani’s aura was colder and more merciless. This girl’s beauty was more feminine and gentle.","But the scheming glint in her eye tarnished the beauty she emanated!","Lin Yuan thought, Everyone should be here now. But Zhan Lu won’t be here so soon.","It was likely that Zhan Lu had predicted that the special honor guests would begin fighting and did not want to be involved. Hence, he left sufficient time for the special honor guests to finish their fight. Once they were done, he would step in to handle the tail end of the matter. This would save him significant trouble.","Jin Chen was extremely displeased with this girl.","He was in the middle of asking Spring something important. This girl just so happened to interrupt their conversation.","It seemed that he would only be able to ask Spring about the impurities in his bloodline once this matter was over!","There was a petite and short-haired girl behind this girl, as well as two elderly men.","Once the girl with long brown hair took a seat, the female attendant began surveying Jin Chen, Lin Yuan, and the rest.","Lin Yuan did not say anything, but Jin Chen instantly exploded with rage. “What are you looking at? What gives you the right to look around?”"]},{"number":2870,"title":"Chapter 2870 Silver Blue Fairy Shark!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2870 Silver Blue Fairy Shark!","Jin Chen did not hesitate to release his Holy Spirit aura and suppress the short-haired girl. Consequently, she resembled a small boat being tossed about in the sea.","The seated girl never expected one of Fortune Treasure Palace’s special honor guests to have such a violent temper!","He immediately attempted to suppress them! They hadn’t even done anything.","“Ling might be a little playful and curious about everything, but she has no intentions of provocation. She might have been a little rude, but it doesn’t warrant such a reaction!”","Yin Ruo also aimed to establish her might and take control of the situation. After all, she had brought more than one Holy Spirit expert with her.","Although she had yet to reach the Holy Spirit level, the two elders behind her had attained it some time ago.","To respond to Jin Chen’s aggressive provocation, Yin Ruo softly instructed the two elders behind her, “I will leave this to the two of you!”","The moment Yin Ruo finished speaking, the two elders simultaneously released their auras, which soon clashed with Jin Chen’s aura.","Jin Chen had absorbed the bloodlines of other members of his species to increase his power, so his strength had significantly risen since reaching the Holy Spirit level. Hence, he was not at a disadvantage at all!","However, the backgrounds of the two elder Holy Spirit experts prompted Jin Chen to speculate about Yin Ruo’s identity.","Alarm bells rang in Jin Chen’s head.","Neither Yin Ruo nor Lin Yuan were individuals he could afford to offend. Both of them were far more powerful than he was, yet he was attempting to gain the upper hand over them!","He appeared as a joke now.","The two elders behind the girl were genuine Holy Spirit experts. However, they were only regular Holy Spirit experts and were a far cry from Spring.","Jin Chen thought, Is Lin Yuan going to take control of this girl?","This sudden confrontation frightened Ling.","Ling looked at Yin Ruo in a panic, terrified that she had disrupted Yin Ruo’s plan.","Yin Ruo addressed Jin Chen with a solemn expression, “We are all here to confront the star pirates together. We’re friends, not foes. If the star pirates decide to attack, we’ll all be comrades and must protect Fortune Treasure Palace together. So, we should calmly discuss our plans rather than fight amongst ourselves. What do you think?”","Yin Ruo spoke righteously, but Jin Chen didn’t buy a word of it. Everything was determined by power!","If he were stronger than this girl and her group, she wouldn’t even be speaking at this moment!","Jin Chen retorted with a hint of amusement, “So what if I don’t agree with your opinion? There isn’t anyone else here but us. If our opinions match, I will definitely work with you. We are all here because we respect Zhan Lu. We have the same goal. We’re just trying to determine which of us is stronger and should call the shots.”","Jin Chen was now Lin Yuan’s follower, so he and Lin Yuan were on the same side in everything. Hence, he laid everything out on the table to save Lin Yuan time.","Jin Chen could already tell that this girl wanted to take the lead in this situation.","From the moment the girl took a seat, Lin Yuan received a message from Spring through his soul and learned of the girl’s true identity.","This girl had blue patterns on her face that were not very noticeable. They were only evident when the light hit her face at certain angles.","The Silver Blue Fairy Sharks were an elite species in the sea. They were neither below nor above the mermaids and had at least ten Holy Spirit experts.","Based on the fact that this girl had two Holy Spirit experts accompanying her, it showed that she held a certain status among the Silver Blue Fairy Sharks.","Lin Yuan was not as interested in Yin Ruo as he was in Jin Chen.","However, she dared not underestimate Lin Yuan because the aura Spring released had already proven the power of Lin Yuan’s group.","This was the first time Jin Chen was hearing of ‘Sky City’ as well. He thought, I must be the first member of Sky City!","After pausing for a moment, Zhan Lu smiled and walked in.","However, Lin Yuan, Jin Chen, and Yin Ruo could all see the anxiousness behind Zhan Lu’s smile.","Since Lin Yuan was now the leader, he took the initiative and asked, “Mr. Zhan, has something happened again?”","Zhan Lu said in a low voice, “Treasure City’s City Lord has dispatched people to begin building the defenses. They are going to see if using a large amount of Solid Void Stones will have an effect on the two void passageways. They are trying to reduce the impact of the two void passageways on Treasure City. But during this process, they discovered World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Abyssal Beasts beneath the void passageways!","“The void passageways have already reached the extremely difficult-to-combat class, Class 3. If the two void passageways reach pinnacle Class 3, it’s possible that Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit Abyssal Beasts might appear!","“The star pirates aren’t holding back at all. They want to completely destroy Treasure City! The City Lord contacted me in the hopes that we will be able to work with them. I am holding this meeting to ask what all of you think of this.”","Lin Yuan’s expression did not change, but Yin Ruo and Jin Chen’s expressions turned stern. Simultaneous expressions of astonishment appeared on their faces.","Zhan Lu would never scare his special honor guests when it came to such matters.","If what Zhan Lu was true, the issue was now beyond Jin Chen and Yin Ruo’s control. It would be difficult for the two of them to even save themselves!","Yin Ruo and Jin Chen instinctively looked at Spring, who was behind Lin Yuan. She was likely the strongest expert currently present in Treasure City.","Zhan Lu knew Jin Chen and Yin Ruo well. He was on close terms with both of them. He had intentionally arrived late because he knew they would fight over the position of leader.","But when he walked in, Lin Yuan had been the first to speak, not the two of them.","Yin Ruo and Jin Chen did not express any opposition, meaning that Lin Yuan had secured the position of leader.","Yin Ruo had two Holy Spirit experts!","Based on their reactions, it was as though the female expert standing behind Lin Yuan was a source of support.","Lin Yuan knew that Zhan Lu did not initially intend to work with the people from the City Lord’s side. Otherwise, he would have led people there right from the onset. He only accepted their invitation because he had no other choice.","However, Lin Yuan still asked Jin Chen and Yin Ruo for their opinions as a show of respect to them.","Jin Chen explained brightly, “Young Master Lin, I will accompany you throughout this matter. You don’t have to ask for my opinion. Please go ahead and make all the decisions.”","What a joke. How could a follower give his opinion to Lin Yuan? He had no right to do so!","It was likely that Yin Ruo would make the same choice that he had.","Now that the issue had blown up beyond their expected proportions, the people of Treasure City needed to come together to overcome this crisis.","Yin Ruo was silent for a moment before she said, “That’s right, Young Master Lin. I will follow your lead in everything, too! Since you’re our leader, you should be the one to make the decisions!”","Lin Yuan nodded in agreement with what Yin Ruo and Jin Chen said.","But instead of saying anything, Lin Yuan went on to ask Zhan Lu, “There will be many factions who will want to leave Treasure City at the beginning. Have they done so?”","Lin Yuan’s words caused Zhan Lu to freeze. He thought, Is Lin Yuan going to leave Treasure City now that he knows about what’s happening below the void passageways?","Zhan Lu hurriedly shook his head.","If Lin Yuan wanted to leave Treasure City, he would not have stayed till now.","The thought of what would happen to Treasure City once numerous factions departed caused Zhan Lu’s chest to tighten."]},{"number":2871,"title":"Chapter 2871 Treasure City in Chaos!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2871 Treasure City in Chaos!","Zhan Lu said with a strained and pained voice, “Young Master Lin, the star pirates are berserk this time. The factions that tried to leave Treasure City were all killed by the star pirates and tossed to the Abyssal Beasts. Many of the experts who were killed came from powerful species.","Lin Yuan immediately said, “Mr. Zhan, we accepted your invitation and have come to protect Fortune Treasure Palace. Since you intend to head to the City Lord Manor, we will go with you. Mr. Zhan. All you need to do is handle the guests of honor outside!”","In truth, Lin Yuan had already received a response from Winter and learned about the situation happening outside. He already knew what had happened to the factions that tried to leave Treasure City.","He asked Zhan Lu about the situation despite already being aware of it because he wanted to see if he would be able to find out anything special. Alas, he was unable to learn anything new from Zhan Lu.","Lin Yuan had been wondering about something. Why had the star pirates chosen to attack Treasure City of all places? Was it solely because the Treasure Convention was about to take place?","At present, there was a large amount of resources accumulated in Treasure City.","This was not the first Treasure Convention to take place, and there were many cities like Treasure City that had trade as their main role.","However, star pirates had never besieged any other city in the past!","Star pirates were indeed brazen—they lived by the bloody blade and killed daily.","But while the star pirates were plundering, they had to fend off vengeful enemies as well.","Star pirates were also frequently slaughtered by their enemies. Hence, they always thought out their actions before enacting them.","If the star pirates left behind even a hint of information after attacking Treasure City, they would be pursued by Honor Absent Palace!","Once Honor Absent Palace stepped in, their retribution would be swift and deadly. Hence, the star pirates were definitely planning something!","However, Lin Yuan still did not know what the star pirates were planning exactly.","Having surrounded Treasure City, the star pirates were nearer to the two void passageways than Treasure City was. They definitely had the means to suppress the two void passageways.","The Abyssal Beasts were also a threat to the star pirates.","Based on what Genius had read in the books, Lin Yuan had gained significant knowledge and could be regarded as a well of the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ knowledge.","In order to take control of void passageways of such a level, the star pirates had to have Abyss Commanders.","Only Commander-class abyssal lifeforms could take control of World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Abyssal Beasts.","Abyss Commanders came from the messy abyss outside of the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Hence, the star pirates could not control the Abyss Commanders.","Winter and Spring were strong enough to flatten this commotion and put an end to the issue, but this would cause the instigators to flee and go into hiding.","Lin Yuan intended to develop quietly so he could find out who was behind the star pirates and learn what their aim was!","Zhan Lu let out a sigh of relief when he heard what Lin Yuan said. He had been terrified that Lin Yuan would turn him down. This was especially so because he had become the mouthpiece for these three special honor guests.","Now that Lin Yuan was willing to work with him, things would be able to progress without issue.","Zhan Lu noted the favor he owed Lin Yuan.","In the past, Zhan Lu would definitely begin guessing what Lin Yuan had done to gain Yin Ruo and Jin Chen’s support. These two had not been present when Lin Yuan became a special honor guest.","Based on what Lin Yuan did, Zhan Lu, Yin Ruo, and the rest knew that he was the kind of person who prioritized order.","People who prioritized order were much more suited to be allies than those with wicked and convoluted hearts because they had limits.","However, only powerful lifeforms were able to maintain a character of prioritizing order. If weak factions had leaders who prioritized regulation, they would be eliminated swiftly.","The City Lord Manor held this arriving group in high regard. The City Lord came personally to receive them.","Treasure City’s City Lord was a true Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit expert and was considered capable. Otherwise, he would not have been able to develop Treasure City to such a prosperous extent before the crisis descended.","Treasure City’s City Lord, Li Feng, intended to greet Zhan Lu first. Before Li Feng contacted Zhan Lu, he already knew that Zhan Lu had three special honor guests with him and wanted Zhan Lu to introduce them to him.","Firstly, this would allow him to become acquainted with experts of similar power. It would also make it easier for him to command them in the future.","Yet, Zhan Lu did not immediately make contact with him. Rather, he lowered his head and began speaking to the young man next to him.","It was clear from the formation who the leader of this group was.","The man to the right of Zhan Lu was already young. But the one Zhan Lu was currently talking to was only 40 to 50 years old!","Lifeforms who were less than 100 years old were all newborns.","Zhan Lu was acting so humbly toward this newborn. Just what was special about this newborn?","Li Feng and Zhan Lu had known each other for some time.","Both of them lived in Treasure City and were part of its upper echelon. It was inevitable for them to interact from time to time.","Zhan Lu was less powerful than him but had a much higher EQ. Li Feng admitted that.","Despite Li Feng coming personally to greet them, Zhan Lu still deferred to this young man as the leader. The meaning behind this did not have to be said. This young man was much more important to Zhan Lu than Li Feng was!","Li Feng stood there good-naturedly and waited. He was sure that once Zhan Lu was done with his conversation with the young man, they would speak. He would then be able to ask Zhan Lu to introduce him to this young man.","Normally, Zhan Lu would not introduce important clients to him. But this situation was different. It was unlikely that Zhan Lu would reject his request.","Lin Yuan listened to Zhan Lu tell him about the information that Fortune Treasure Palace had discovered while he observed this elegant man standing before him.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, every species retained a few of their original traits when they transformed into human form.","This elegant man still had a long beard. It was likely that his bloodline was related to dragons.","Lin Yuan interrupted Zhan Lu while he was introducing him, “Mr. Zhan, this must be the City Lord of Treasure City! This is my first visit to Treasure City, and I don’t have a good grasp of the situation. Won’t you introduce us?”","Li Feng chuckled when he heard what Lin Yuan said. It was rare for a man this young to have such propriety.","Based on what this young man said, he intended to form ties with him. This saved him a lot of trouble!","“My name is Li Feng. Old Zhan doesn’t need to introduce you. I’ll tell you about myself! Treasure City is in the midst of a crisis. All of you are Treasure City’s saviors. I hope that you will work with me. I am endlessly grateful to all of you!”","Li Feng’s words were not just directed at Lin Yuan. He was also addressing Zhan Lu, Yin Ruo, Jin Chen, and the other experts behind Lin Yuan.","From Li Feng’s words, he had set aside his pride as the City Lord and was now asking for their help.","In this world that was ruled by experts, Li Feng’s attitude was not just for show.","As a result, Lin Yuan’s impression of Li Feng improved.","He was already willing to protect Treasure City. If he did not protect the city, how could he reel in the people behind the star pirates?"]},{"number":2872,"title":"Chapter 2872 I Will Handle Them!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2872 I Will Handle Them!","Zhan Lu initially intended to act as the middleman and introduce Li Feng to Lin Yuan and the rest.","Most of the people allocated to Fortune Treasure Palace’s branches were set. They only changed every 4,000 years.","Even if Treasure City was conquered and this branch was destroyed, Zhan Lu would still be responsible for rebuilding it once the crisis had passed.","This disaster was not within Li Feng’s control, so it was unlikely that he would be blamed by Honor Absent Palace. Even if he received some punishment, he would still be able to retain his position as the City Lord of Treasure City.","Since it was highly likely that he would have to continue working with Li Feng, Zhan Lu was more than willing to invest in building their relationship.","However, he was responding to what Lin Yuan said. Changing the topic before he was done responding to Lin Yuan was unquestionably rude!","Now that Li Feng had introduced himself to Lin Yuan, there was no need for Zhan Lu to say anything.","Lin Yuan was the representative of these three special honor guests. Zhan Lu turned to look at him.","Lin Yuan’s response would be Fortune Treasure Palace’s stance.","Li Feng caught the direction of Zhan Lu’s gaze. He noticed that the young man among the special honor guests was not the strongest of the lot.","Lin Yuan knew what his goal was. He had had a discussion with Yin Ruo before they arrived. Yin Ruo had also expressed that she would support the City Lord Manor’s operation.","“City Lord Li, the crisis caused by the star pirates affects every person in Treasure City. We are all here. It’s only right that we work with the City Lord.”","Lin Yuan’s words caused Li Feng’s already positive impression of him to improve. This young man was well aware of the current circumstances.","Li Feng was already working with many of the factions in Treasure City. After accepting Li Feng’s invitation, the factions began negotiating with him, which added to his troubles. He was extremely irritable now.","During this situation where their survival and doom were linked, they were still trying to negotiate. They were acting as though Li Feng was the only person living in Treasure City. It was not as though they would be able to continue living if Treasure City was destroyed!","Lin Yuan’s words shone a light into Li Feng’s heart.","Li Feng took a step forward and reached out a hand to Lin Yuan, “Treasure City thanks you for your help! On behalf of every person in Treasure City, thank you for your assistance!”","Lin Yuan reached out his own hand and grabbed Li Feng’s hand.","Spring stood behind Lin Yuan and glared at Li Feng. She believed that Li Feng did not have the right to interact with Lin Yuan. These actions were crossing the line, in Spring’s opinion.","But since Lin Yuan did not raise any opinions about it, Spring did not say anything either.","“We are very sincere in offering our help. We aren’t here for show. I hope that you can keep this in mind.”","If it were possible, none of Fortune Treasure Palace’s honor guests wanted to help Treasure City.","As the City Lord, Li Feng’s role was to protect Treasure City. Not only could he collect a large salary from Honor Absent Palace, but he also attained significant benefits from the city.","All of them had come to Treasure City to take part in the Treasure Convention. Otherwise, they would not be staying in Fortune Treasure Palace!","Staying a single night in Fortune Treasure Palace was not cheap.","Treasure City’s existence was truthfully unrelated to these people. They were only there because they had no other choice and had gathered together for warmth during this time of crisis.","Once Honor Absent Palace heard the news that Li Feng was not properly handling this disaster, Li Feng would have to face heavy punishment!","If they took this chance to understand these experts’ divine kingdom abilities, they might be able to hold on longer, even if they never managed to attain victory.","This elderly man’s words did not have the intended effect of raising the group’s spirits.","Many species saw transforming the remains of the living into undead creatures as desecration of the corpse.","Many species believed in the cycle of souls and set up altars for worship.","Once a corpse was turned into an undead lifeform, the vitality in the body would change. This was undoubtedly the greatest contamination of a body!","Undead lifeforms were despised in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, and they were seen as the lowest of the low.","No expert wanted to be contaminated after death.","Moreover, even if he was capable of doing so, it was not as though the star pirates did not have Holy Spirit experts of their own.","At this moment, a soft voice said, “We don’t have to be so pessimistic. Since we all see the two void passageways as problems, I will be the one to handle them! They will be gone before tomorrow afternoon.","“However, there are far too many Abyssal Beasts, and I won’t be able to eliminate every single one of them. Rather than researching a way to deal with these two void passageways and fearing them, it will be better for us to try to come up with a way to combat the star pirates.”","Lin Yuan’s words were like a clap of thunder that left every person present trembling.","“What? He can handle the two pinnacle Class 3 void passageways? He can even eliminate the Abyssal Beasts?!”","Lin Yuan’s words sounded like the declarations of a madman. But it was unlikely that this young man would be lying at such a time!","Lin Yuan held a high position in this group. As Fortune Treasure Palace’s representative, they could only believe what he said.","If he spouted nonsense at such a time, he would become the enemy of every faction in Treasure City.","There were only a few tens of hours left until tomorrow afternoon. The existence of the two void passageways at that time would make everything clear. Once the two void passageways disappeared, they would be able to communicate with the outside world, and the star pirates would be less of a threat!","All the factions under Honor Absent Palace would come to Treasure City’s aid.","The two void passageways had already expanded to an uncontrollable extent.","Once the void passageways reached Class 4, they would become frontage roads that were akin to beehives full of bees. At that point, they would become extremely difficult to deal with.","As long as the frontage roads existed, they would be able to quickly repair themselves even if the Class 4 void passageways were damaged.","At that time, even if they were suppressed by absolute power, it would take decades for them to be completely removed.","The star pirates and the person behind them who had opened the void passageways would not care what happened as a result of their actions.","Lin Yuan did not want the area around Treasure City to become decimated by the Abyssal Beasts. Moreover, Lin Yuan had already discovered that if he did not reveal some of his power, the people in Treasure City would be incapable of fighting back.","To Lin Yuan, this was terrifying!","Although Treasure City could no longer help Lin Yuan search for the person behind the star pirates, he still wanted to rescue some of Treasure City’s morale.","Winter had yet to show himself because he was not only gathering information but was also setting up for their ambush.","The ambush was imbued with Winter’s soul aura, and Winter could appear anywhere within the formation instantly. The formation also contained the chilling frost from within his body that could even freeze the holy spirits within divine kingdoms.","If Lin Yuan instructed Winter to destroy the two void passageways and revealed the power that was strong enough to take on the person behind the star pirates, the person in question would stand no hope of escaping!"]},{"number":2873,"title":"Chapter 2873 The Moon Empress’ Decision!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2873 The Moon Empress’ Decision!","Li Feng was the first to come back to his senses and asked Lin Yuan in an uncertain tone, “Young Master Lin, are you sure you can eliminate those two void passageways? If needed, you can dispatch all the factions in our Treasure City at will. We will cooperate with you!”","Lin Yuan shook his head and said, “There’s no need. I’ve already said that the experts in Treasure City only need to think about how to deal with the star pirates. My people alone are sufficient to eliminate these two void passageways!”","Lin Yuan told the shocked people around him, “As long as everyone works together, we can overcome this obstacle, so let’s not be pessimistic! When City Lord Li arranges the mission later, I hope that everyone can devote 100% of their energy and determination to complete their mission!","“If anyone’s morale wavers, even if City Lord Li doesn’t take action, I won’t let them off easily!”","When Lin Yuan spoke these words, he changed his previous gentle demeanor and showed off his ability. At that moment, Lin Yuan’s power and influence directly overshadowed the City Lord of Treasure City.","Lin Yuan was very well aware that in such an extremely low morale situation, even if he managed to eliminate the two void passageways, it would be very difficult for the morale to recover quickly.","Lin Yuan intended to use his influence to intimidate the experts here. He wanted to simultaneously uplift their morale and get them to listen to Li Feng’s arrangements.","If everyone went their own way in such a situation, even if Winter managed to eliminate the two void passageways, the star pirates would still wreak havoc upon Treasure City, thus making it difficult for Lin Yuan to find out which faction was supporting the star pirates and what their goal was.","Not only did Winter have to deal with these two void passageways, but he also had to maintain the operation of the grand formation, which would surely hold him back.","Another person Lin Yuan could only rely on was Spring. Nevertheless, Spring had to stay by his side to protect his safety. Therefore, even if the star pirates really attacked Treasure City, Lin Yuan would not be able to let Spring protect Treasure City.","Lin Yuan had already made a huge contribution by letting Winter destroy the two void passageways. No matter what, he had to prioritize his own safety above all else. The entire Sky City was still waiting for Lin Yuan to manage and develop it.","Li Feng looked at Lin Yuan gratefully. Lin Yuan represented Fortune Treasure Palace as the main representative of the VIPs. However, he did not bring him any resistance. Not only that, but Lin Yuan also helped to uplift the morale of those present. He owed the young man in front of him a huge favor.","Jin Chen looked at Lin Yuan with a complicated yet joyful expression. Initially, Jin Chen had caused trouble for Lin Yuan, but under Spring’s threat, he eventually became one of Lin Yuan’s subordinates. There was a hint of reluctance in his heart because being taken under Lin Yuan’s wing meant losing his freedom.","Jin Chen admired Spring’s strength. He even speculated that Spring might be an expert who had reached the pinnacle of the Holy Spirit level or even surpassed it. However, apart from this powerful female expert, there was another expert following Lin Yuan.","After learning about the strength of the two void passageways, Lin Yuan actually promised to eliminate them by noon the next day. This was something that Jin Chen did not even dare to think about.","Without Lin Yuan, the two pinnacle Class 3 void passageways alone would be enough to flatten Treasure City, and he would most likely not be able to survive in Treasure City.","Lin Yuan was equivalent to his savior. From this perspective, he would have to rely on Lin Yuan in the future, and losing his freedom was a matter of course. His master was so powerful that it filled Jin Chen, a Holy Spirit expert, with a sense of security.","In such a dangerous environment like the Sky Beyond the Clouds, even Holy Spirit experts had to live a life of bloodshed.","It was fine for those Holy Spirit experts from large species. They had the support of their species and could rely on them.","Despite their small number, the Sky Radish Endless Vines were considered a large species in the Species Ranking. However, the other members of the Sky Radish Endless Vines were far more dangerous to Jin Chen than the Holy Spirit experts he had offended.","Under normal circumstances, unless it was a life-and-death feud, a Holy Spirit expert would not fight with another Holy Spirit expert whose strength was similar to theirs. Even if they were stronger and managed to eliminate the other party, it was very likely that they would damage their roots. A Holy Spirit expert whose roots were injured could easily become prey for others.","As Jin Chen followed Lin Yuan, he felt reassured that he would be less likely to encounter danger in the future.","Lin Yuan left a positive impression on Yin Ruo. To her, Lin Yuan seemed much more approachable than Jin Chen. She found Lin Yuan’s words to be beyond her comprehension as well.","At that moment, Yin Ruo and Zhan Lu shared similar feelings. When Lin Yuan displayed his strength, both of them wanted to try their best to get closer to him.","Just as Zhan Lu was about to say something to Lin Yuan, he heard Li Feng laugh heartily. “Young Master Lin, you’ve given Treasure City hope. You’re now the backbone in our hearts. Thank you very much for your willingness to help Treasure City.”","After expressing his gratitude to Lin Yuan again, he said solemnly, “Since everyone from Fortune Treasure Palace is already here and Young Master Lin can resolve the impact brought by these two void passageways, then let’s go to the meeting room of the City Lord Manor and study how to deal with these star pirates!","“The moment the seal on the void passageways disappears, I will immediately seek help from Honor Absent Palace. We only need to hold on for less than two days, and aid will arrive!”","If Lin Yuan had not asked everyone to cooperate with him as the City Lord, Li Feng would not have dared to steal Lin Yuan’s limelight, as this was equivalent to questioning Lin Yuan’s authority. However, after Lin Yuan provided him with an opportunity, Li Feng wielded the authority of the City Lord and began to take charge of the situation.","Lin Yuan wasn’t certain if what he had just said would circulate within Treasure City and eventually reach the ears of the star pirates and the people behind them.","First of all, those star pirates and the people behind them might not believe him. It was impossible for this group of star pirates to find out Winter’s whereabouts. Secondly, even if they knew and took precautions, it probably wouldn’t affect Winter much.","Lin Yuan did not want to put Winter in danger, so he had specially inquired Winter about this prior to the operation. Winter had made it clear that even if two more void passageways were opened, they wouldn’t become a burden to him. Even if it really advanced to Class 4, it would only require him more time to eliminate it.","...","In the wilderness of North of the Lonely River, a country formed by villages scattered all over the area had been established. It was operating in an orderly manner under management.","At present, the Moon Empress’ mind was focused on the envoys from the Spinning Wings White Falcons. She was afraid that the envoys would suddenly cause trouble.","The Moon Empress had personally asked Kani about the situation near the King Blood Jackals’ territory. According to Kani’s description, the Spinning Wings White Falcons were much stronger than the King Blood Jackals. This made the Moon Empress rather wary of them.","The Moon Empress was never the kind of person who did not dare to fight or risk her life. If this matter only concerned the Moon Empress herself, she would act very radically. However, this matter concerned the entire Sky City and the newly established faith country.","The faith country had just been established. Any setback would affect the relatively good collection of faith at the moment. The twists and turns would cause the citizens of the faith country to lose the sense of security that they had painstakingly built up.","If Sky City could not handle this storm, it would take a long time for the citizens of the faith country to regain their lost trust!","If Lin Yuan were in Sky City, he would have made the decision. However, now that Lin Yuan was not around, she had to help Lin Yuan manage Sky City on his behalf. The Moon Empress really did not want to fail to protect Lin Yuan’s foundation as it would reflect poorly on her capabilities as his Master.","Fortunately, Autumn had returned. Not only did Autumn manage to investigate the situation of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, but he also gained a certain understanding of the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","Autumn had made it clear to the Moon Empress that the Crimson Heaven Falcons were not formidable enough to pose a threat to Sky City.","After the Moon Empress repeatedly confirmed with Autumn and received his affirmative answer several times, the Moon Empress decided that she would no longer tolerate the envoys.","The Moon Empress sent Mystic Moon to inform the two female King Blood Jackals in charge of managing the King Blood Jackals that if the envoys did something out of line, they would be directly eliminated.","At the same time, he asked the two female King Blood Jackals to inform the envoys that Kani was in seclusion and that it would be impossible to finish her seclusion in a short period. Hence, the envoys should leave first. When Kani came out of seclusion, she would visit them.","It would be fine if the envoys chose to leave tactfully. If they refused to do so, then the Moon Empress would simply let Autumn eliminate them to send a clear message to intimidate the entire Spinning Wings White Falcons.","If conflict became inevitable, they would simply engage in battle.","Ever since Lin Yuan left, the Moon Empress noticed that regardless of whether it was Wen Yu, Liu Jie, Su Yiren, Luo Lan, or the white-clothed followers, they no longer had the confidence to do things like in the main world. She felt that it was crucial for the core members of Sky City to regain their confidence.","If Lin Yuan was currently in Sky City, the Moon Empress believed that he would most likely make the same decision as her.","If Sky City was extremely vulnerable and hid away, there would be no point in developing a faith country. Moreover, Sky City’s retreat would only fuel the arrogance of the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","If the Spinning Wings White Falcons discovered the existence of the faith country, they would definitely attack it and steal the faith generated by them. By that time, a protracted war would ensue. If they wanted to prevent it from happening, it would be better to suppress the Spinning Wings White Falcons from the beginning.","...","Upon receiving Mystic Moon’s news, the two female King Blood Jackals couldn’t contain their excitement. Before Kani left, she had imparted some teachings to the two female King Blood Jackals.","Apart from teaching them how to manage the King Blood Jackals on her behalf, Kani had also made it clear to them that Sky City was exceptionally powerful. Sky City’s strength was formidable enough for the King Blood Jackals not to have to fear the Spinning Wings White Falcons or even the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","These two female King Blood Jackals were already thoroughly fed up with the envoys. If not for the fact that they hadn’t received a reply from the Moon Empress for a long time, they wouldn’t have tolerated it any longer.","The two female King Blood Jackals were not the only ones who were furious. The envoys were equally furious.","White Howl was an Elder of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, capable of representing his species in dealing with the King Blood Jackals. He had quite a high status among the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","White Howl had arrived at the King Blood Jackals’ territory for some time. Different species had different living habits and suitable environments. The King Blood Jackals preferred dark and humid surroundings, so the buildings in their territory had extremely poor ventilation.","In the residence provided by the King Blood Jackals, White Howl and the other envoys felt abnormally depressed.","Under normal circumstances, if one species extended kindness to another, they would prepare a suitable living environment for the envoys. However, not only was the living environment provided by King Blood Jackals inadequate, but their food was also less appetizing compared to what White Howl was accustomed to.","Moreover, Kani had yet to make an appearance.","The King Blood Jackals didn’t appear to be taking the Spinning Wings White Falcons seriously. They had only produced a Holy Spirit expert, yet they were already so arrogant.","Before the two female King Blood Jackals came to look for him, White Howl had already flared up.","Among the King Blood Jackals, the status of female King Blood Jackals was much higher than that of male King Blood Jackals. However, the attendants that the King Blood Jackals had arranged for the Spinning Wings White Falcons were all male.","The more White Howl looked at these male King Blood Jackals, the more displeased he became. He extended his claws forward in a threatening gesture. The two whirlwinds struck the male King Blood Jackals who were setting up meals for the envoys and tore a total of 24 of them into bloody pulp.","Upon witnessing this, most of the Spinning Wings White Falcons cheered loudly and applauded. Only a few envoys secretly frowned. Killing the King Blood Jackals in their own territory was tantamount to declaring war. It was the opposite of what they had come for.","What if the King Blood Jackals were dissatisfied and conflict arose due to this? White Howl was not a Holy Spirit expert, and his strength was only at the pinnacle of the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","It was impossible for him to resist Kani, a genuine Holy Spirit expert!"]},{"number":2874,"title":"Chapter 2874 Autumn and Tree!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2874 Autumn and Tree!","Nevertheless, the Spinning Wings White Falcons had the Crimson Heaven Falcons backing them. Even if the King Blood Jackals didn’t fear the Spinning Wings White Falcons, they would definitely fear the Crimson Heaven Falcons!","White Howl’s actions showed fearlessness.","These male King Blood Jackals weren’t particularly strong. Even if he were to eliminate all of those 24 male King Blood Jackals, it wouldn’t amount to much. White Howl was certain that the King Blood Jackals would not dare to stand up for them.","Kani had yet to show her face, and White Howl believed that Kani could not possibly be in seclusion.","The King Blood Jackals had always harbored fear toward the Spinning Wings White Falcons. In the early years, upon their arrival to this wasteland, they had a conflict with the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","During that time, the King Blood Jackals found themselves at a disadvantage in their conflict. Even Kani sustained injuries inflicted by their Holy Spirit experts.","Had the Crimson Heaven Falcons not deliberately stopped their conflict, the Spinning Wings White Falcons could have completely wiped out the King Blood Jackals, given that the latter had not had any Holy Spirit experts among them.","White Howl wasn’t certain whether the Crimson Heaven Falcons were restricting the development of the Spinning Wings White Falcons due to the fear that the expansion of their territory would cause them to harbor ulterior motives or if it was because they had recognized Kani’s potential from the beginning and wanted to recruit the entire species once her strength had grown.","No matter what the reason was, Kani must be afraid of the Spinning Wings White Falcons. It was very likely that Kani would not want to be involved with them.","What White Howl wanted to do was to force Kani out. He could not just admit that he failed to even catch a glimpse of Kani when he returned to report to their leader. In that case, his entire trip would have been in vain as the leader would not just accept such an excuse.","Killing the 24 male King Blood Jackals was just the beginning. If Kani continued to be so insensible, White Howl would not mind killing those two female King Blood Jackals. White Howl did not believe that Kani would continue to act like a coward by then!","Nai Wei and Ban Se were chosen by Kani to manage the territory. This immediately raised their status among the King Blood Jackals. Consequently, all other female King Blood Jackals found themselves one level below Nai Wei and Ban Se and were now unable to maintain a competitive relationship with them.","Naturally, Nai Wei and Ban Se were both competitors and collaborators. They had to work together to manage the King Blood Jackals.","Although Sky City had control over the King Blood Jackals, Nai Wei and Ban Se still had a lot of responsibilities that made them feel immense pressure. Nevertheless, Nai Wei and Ban Se couldn’t delegate these tasks to other female King Blood Jackals in Kani’s absence as it would be perceived as laziness.","If Nai Wei and Ban Se, who were also competitors themselves, discovered that their opponents were slacking off, they would definitely report it to Kani. Nai Wei and Ban Se were fully aware of this, so they basically chose to handle everything personally.","There was already a lot of work in the territory to begin with, and the envoys’ arrival only added to Nai Wei and Ban Se’s workload. This made Nai Wei and Ban Se extremely dissatisfied.","In particular, White Howl’s attitude frequently humiliated Nai Wei and Ban Se.","White Howl had disrespected Kani several times, but Nai Wei and Ban Se did not have the ability to protect Kani’s dignity as King Blood Jackals.","Now that the Moon Empress had made her decision, Nai Wei and Ban Se no longer had to fear the envoys. They were there to inform White Howl and his group to leave.","Nai Wei and Ban Se suspected that White Howl and his group might cause trouble, so they specially requested the Moon Empress to arrange for an expert capable of dealing with White Howl.","In the entire Sky City, only Summer and Autumn were deemed capable of dealing with White Howl.","Autumn took the initiative and requested to travel with Nai Wei and Ban Se. He was aware of what the envoys had done and was already dissatisfied with their actions. He needed an outlet to vent.","Actually, the reason Autumn wanted to vent was mainly that he had not been able to follow Lin Yuan outside to train like Spring and Winter. It made Autumn feel that Lin Yuan placed more importance on Spring and Winter than him.","Autumn’s thoughts were more or less paranoid, and he was lacking the broad understanding of situations that Summer possessed. In Summer’s opinion, Lin Yuan letting her stay in the territory to help guard Sky City was the highest level of trust in her.","Summer was very well aware of Autumn’s stubbornness, so she chose not to participate in the series of actions against the Spinning Wings White and Crimson Heaven Falcons.","Nai Wei and Ban Se appeared exceptionally cold in front of the other King Blood Jackals, but they went to great lengths to please Autumn and curry favor with him whenever they were around him.","Autumn did not show any obvious liking or disliking toward their actions. In fact, he did not regard Nai Wei and Ban Se seriously at all. He simply regarded their flattery coldly and did not give any response.","It was still quite a distance away from the location where the envoys stayed. Autumn frowned slightly upon sensing an overwhelmingly strong smell of blood. From the scent of blood, he could tell that it emanated from the King Blood Jackals. The blood scent was remarkably fresh, indicating that the King Blood Jackals had just died not long ago. The only perpetrators who were capable of killing the King Blood Jackals were probably the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Autumn seethed with anger. In his opinion, the King Blood Jackals were Lin Yuan’s assets. For any member of the envoys to kill even one of them would constitute a violation of Lin Yuan’s interests and an appropriation of his assets.","Autumn would never allow such an act to occur. If any individual or species were to commit such an act, they would definitely have to pay the price.","However, Autumn was not in a hurry to make a move. When he arrived at the scene, Nai Wei and Ban Se would naturally seek his help. By that time, it would not be too late for him to intervene.","Autumn could feel the disgust in Nai Wei and Ban Se’s voices when they talked about the envoys. Soon, they also noticed the distinct scent of blood in the air. Their expressions turned cold as they subconsciously looked at Autumn.","Autumn said calmly, “No matter what happens later, you just need to tell me your decision, and I’ll take action.”","The manner in which White Howl had killed the 24 attendants was extremely cruel. It was so brutal that it sent shivers down one’s spine. However, after doing all that, White Howl did not choose to clean up the scene, leaving it a total mess.","Upon witnessing the scene, Nai Wei and Ban Se were not filled with fear but rather felt a primal ferocity stirring within their blood. The two of them stared fiercely at all the members of the Spinning Wings White Falcons, including White Howl.","Ban Se was the first to speak coldly. “Even if you have any dissatisfaction with our King Blood Jackals, it’s unjustifiable to treat our attendants in such a manner. If you had pointed out the problem with them, I would have definitely arranged for them to be replaced. Since you show utter disregard for the dignity of our King Blood Jackals, why bother coming here as an envoy?”","White Howl originally thought that his actions would have a deterrent effect, but he did not expect them to have the opposite effect. However, the deed had already been done. There’s no room for backing down now.","Moreover, even if he admitted defeat, the two King Blood Jackals didn’t seem inclined to let the matter slide. Since that was the case, he might as well kill them to force Kani out. With the Crimson Heaven Falcons as his backing, Kani would not dare to do anything to him.","Before White Howl could make a move, he saw the other silent female King Blood Jackal bow deeply to the handsome man beside her. “Lord Autumn, I hope you can help our King Blood Jackals get rid of these uninvited guests! The Spinning Wings White Falcons’ envoys dare to commit such acts, which is a disrespect to Sky City!”","Autumn looked at Nai Wei with a half-smile as she was really straightforward. The envoys clearly were not aware of Sky City’s existence. If they knew that the King Blood Jackals were controlled by a faction called Sky City, how could they stay here peacefully? They would probably have gone back to report it long ago!","Since Nai Wei requested his help, Autumn no longer had any worries. Autumn did not want the Moon Empress to think that he was the instigator behind the killing of the envoys right from the start, provoking a war between Sky City, the Spinning Wings White Falcons, and even the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","White Howl’s expression turned solemn.","At first, White Howl could not sense Autumn’s aura at all, so he did not take him seriously. Yet, the actions of the female King Blood Jackals affirmed that the man before him was immensely powerful. Either this man was very good at concealing his aura, or his strength surpassed that of the Divine Kingdom level. It was clear that he was not someone White Howl could contend with.","Autumn didn’t give White Howl time to prepare. He gently raised his hand, and a golden and red leaf flew out from his fingertips. The leaf continued to split and reform, casting a sense of desolation to fill the world. As the leaves fluttered, the Spinning Wings White Falcons, including White Howl, were reduced to dust.","Only a small-bodied member of the Spinning Wings White Falcons remained, huddled and seated on the spot. Apart from fear, there was also a hint of solemn shock in his eyes.","The towering trees formed by the leaves were immensely shocking. The energy contained in the fruit seemed to be able to easily nurture holy spirits.","Since Autumn had taken charge of the conflict, it shifted from being a conflict between the King Blood Jackals and the Spinning Wings White Falcons to being a conflict between Sky City and the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","Autumn’s voice was slow and emotionless. “You should have died. I spared your life to let you tell your leader not to let anyone in your species cross the border and trespass into the territory of the King Blood Jackals ever again!","“Furthermore, have your leader convey to the Crimson Heaven Falcons not to be arrogant and believe that no faction in North of the Lonely River can contend with them!”","After speaking, Autumn’s figure vanished into the residence prepared for the envoys, where he reported back to the Moon Empress.","Autumn’s measure may appear somewhat drastic, but he was not a radical individual. He had always been a sensible individual. He had made such a decision because he was fully aware of the Spinning Wings White and Crimson Heaven Falcons’ strength.","...","Lin Yuan did not choose to be the main character in Li Feng’s meeting. Li Feng repeatedly asked for Lin Yuan’s opinion, but the latter only said that Li Feng could make the decision.","Firstly, Lin Yuan did not know much about the situation in Treasure City. Secondly, Lin Yuan could not guarantee that his arrangements would be correct. He did not want to cause unnecessary losses because of his arrangements. Lin Yuan believed Li Feng kept asking for his opinion because he was also reluctant to shoulder the responsibility.","Lin Yuan acknowledged Li Feng’s exceptionally high EQ. However, when the situation required Li Feng to step up and take charge, he showed fear, which showed that his ability to handle this crisis was somewhat weak.","Treasure City, a city whose main function was trade, was experiencing continuous development. Its reputation was also steadily increasing. It seemed that Li Feng’s talent lay in the development of the city.","Yin Ruo also noticed this and looked up at Lin Yuan countless times, hoping he would step forward and preside over the overall situation. However, Lin Yuan did not respond to Yin Ruo.","Jin Chen sat on the chair like a Buddha. He would not listen to Li Feng’s orders because only Lin Yuan could command him.","Meanwhile, Zhan Lu was very cooperative with Li Feng.","Zhan Lu and Li Feng were in a situation where they were bound together for better or for worse.","As the meeting concluded, each faction was organized accordingly.","Li Feng was the last to leave the meeting room. He wiped the cold sweat from his forehead. This crisis had made him realize many problems.","Previously, in order to make Treasure City more prosperous, Li Feng could be said to have invested all his resources in the development of the chambers of commerce in Treasure City. There were nearly 5,000 chambers of commerce in Treasure City now, and the city had been opening up trade routes. Its prosperity made Li Feng extremely intoxicated.","However, this crisis made Li Feng discover the drawback, which was that Treasure City did not have the ability to deal with such a crisis. The strength he wielded as the City Lord was indeed a little weak in comparison to the entire Treasure City.","If he could successfully survive this crisis, Li Feng would use the profits of the Treasure City for the next few thousand years to build his own direct line of descent and strengthen his power.","By that time, if he were to encounter such a situation of star pirates surrounding the city again, he would be able to face it calmly and would not be in such a sorry state like now. As the City Lord, he no longer wanted to feel such humiliation.","Fortune Treasure Palace’s development model gave Li Feng some inspiration. These special honor guests would often provide assistance to Fortune Treasure Palace. However, in reality, Fortune Treasure Palace only provided these special honor guests with some channels.","Li Feng believed that he could recruit some guardians for Treasure City and let it provide resources for them for free with the aim that when the city encountered danger, these guardians could extend a helping hand for protection.","Li Feng had a perfect candidate in his heart—Lin Yuan!"]},{"number":2875,"title":"Chapter 2875 A Group of Devil Appeared!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2875 A Group of Devil Appeared!","Li Feng was prepared to extend an olive branch to Lin Yuan and invite him to become Treasure City’s first guardian. At the same time, he hoped that Zhan Lu wouldn’t blame him for snatching Lin Yuan away from Fortune Treasure Palace when he found out.","Li Feng believed that there was a high chance that Zhan Lu would not blame him. After all, there was no conflict between Lin Yuan becoming a special honor guest of Treasure City and Fortune Treasure Palace. If Zhan Lu was really dissatisfied with him because of this, there was nothing Li Feng could do about it.","No matter what, Treasure City had to focus on developing its strength. Otherwise, it would lose all its credibility. By that time, most of the chambers of commerce stationed there would opt not to continue developing in Treasure City and leave.","Lin Yuan was the core figure in resolving the crisis of the star pirates surrounding Treasure City. If he could announce that Lin Yuan had become a guardian of Treasure City after this crisis ended, the hearts of the people would naturally stabilize.","At present, Li Feng was contemplating how to ask Lin Yuan for help to ensure that he would not be rejected. After thinking for a long time, Li Feng still couldn’t come up with a good solution.","He contemplated that perhaps he should go talk to Zhan Lu and ask him for help. If he requested Zhan Lu to speak with Lin Yuan, he could just offer Zhan Lu more benefits in return.","Zhan Lu had always wanted to expand Fortune Treasure Palace. He had been applying for a piece of land for a long time, but Li Feng had intentionally curbed Fortune Treasure Palace’s power in Treasure City. Thus, not only did he not give Zhan Lu the piece of land he had his eyes on, but he even imposed many restrictions on them.","Now, he promised to fulfill Zhan Lu’s previous requests and support the development of Fortune Treasure Palace in Treasure City, aiming to make Fortune Treasure Palace become the strongest faction there after the City Lord Manor so that Zhan Lu would be willing to help him.","However, when Li Feng went to look for Zhan Lu with this intention, he was met with resistance. Despite Li Feng’s efforts to persuade him, Zhan Lu refused to offer help. It left Li Feng extremely anxious, especially as Zhan Lu would often brush him off with words.","“City Lord Li, Treasure City is currently in a precarious situation. I’m afraid it’s not suitable for you to consider these things now. I advise you to think about how to navigate Treasure City through this crisis.","“Even if Young Master Lin eliminates these two void passageways, we have to consider how Treasure City will resist the invasion of these star pirates. Could it be that you have already found a way to resist the invasion of star pirates?”","Li Feng gritted his teeth in anger. If Zhan Lu was really unwilling to help, he could have just rejected him. However, Zhan Lu was talking to him with a mocking tone, clearly implying he was only willing to help if Li Feng offered him irresistible benefits that made it difficult for him to refuse.","Li Feng still had many affairs to attend to, so he had no time to argue with Zhan Lu. He went straight to the point and said, “Brother Zhan Lu, letting Young Master Lin become a guardian of Treasure City will provide him more chances to come here and deepen the bond between him and Fortune Treasure Palace. I believe your intelligence will allow you to understand this point. If you’re willing to help, everything will be negotiable from my end.”","Zhan Lu narrowed his eyes upon hearing Li Feng’s words. He had been worried about whether Treasure City would collapse because of this turmoil. Its fate was intertwined with the fate of the branch under his jurisdiction. The two of them were bound together for better or for worse. It was impossible for Zhan Lu not to comprehend such a simple matter.","Li Feng had found a practical way to break out of the problem at breakneck speed. Once Lin Yuan agreed to become a guardian, Li Feng would revive Treasure City.","Zhan Lu said that he wanted Li Feng to come up with a solution to break out of the crisis. However, Zhan Lu was very well aware that Li Feng could not think of any solution at all and could only wait for help.","Since Lin Yuan was willing to help Treasure City clear out the two pinnacle Class 3 void passageways outside the city, he couldn’t possibly stand by and watch the cty be destroyed under the siege of these star pirates. He would definitely lend a helping hand at the critical moment.","At such times, it was understandable for Li Feng to think about the protection of Treasure City after the disaster ended.","If this had been Zhan Lu’s idea, even if Li Feng had not come to him for help, Zhan Lu would have offered a plan. However, circumstances had changed. Now that Li Feng had taken the initiative to speak to him, he had to fight for more benefits for himself. In the future, he and Li Feng would have a common ally to rely on, and their relationship would undoubtedly become closer. This was a very good thing for him.","“Brother Li Feng, we’re old acquaintances, so I won’t beat around the bush with you. You have come to me for this favor, so I’ll definitely help you for the sake of our years of friendship. However, I can’t guarantee that Young Master Lin will definitely agree. Even if he doesn’t agree, I’ll swallow my pride and beg Young Master Lin on behalf of Treasure City.","“I’m doing this entirely for Treasure City. My branch has gathered a lot of popularity for the city over the years. It has also contributed to Treasure City. My branch’s land is really too small now, which greatly restricts its development.","“I’m extremely heartbroken that Fortune Treasure Palace can’t continue to assist in the city’s development! Brother Li Feng, you should be able to understand my feelings, right?”","In Li Feng’s eyes, Zhan Lu’s behavior was rather unsightly. He had already made such a concession, yet Zhan Lu still wanted to ask for benefits in the name of contributing to Treasure City. If not for the fact that he needed Zhan Lu’s help, with his temper, he would have left long ago.","Fortune Treasure Palace did not bring many benefits to Treasure City. On the contrary, the latter had been beneficial to the development of Treasure City. The reason Li Feng had not agreed to Zhan Lu’s request to expand his branch previously was that Fortune Treasure Palace had been suppressing similar factions in Treasure City, making it difficult for factions of the same type to develop.","From Li Feng’s perspective as the City Lord, he preferred to see the various local factions rather than let Fortune Treasure Palace stand out alone. But now, in order to get Zhan Lu’s help, Li Feng had no choice but to lift the restrictions.","“The Treasure Lake on the west side of the city, not far from your branch, has yet to be developed. Haven’t you always been interested in this Treasure Lake? The land at Treasure Lake will from now on be handed over to Fortune Treasure Palace for development.”","Zhan Lu did not immediately nod and agree as Li Feng had expected. Instead, he said meaningfully, “Treasure Lake is indeed an excellent location. I pleaded with you so much before, but you didn’t grant me this piece of land. Now, you’re willing to let our Fortune Treasure Palace develop there.","“The riverbank on the eastern side of Treasure Lake has a piece of fertile land comparable to about half the current area of my branch. Why not allocate this land to Fortune Treasure Palace for development as well?","“Our Fortune Treasure Palace plans to build a special residence for special honor guests so that it can match their status! I think Young Master Lin will be staying there, too!”","Li Feng had thought that Zhan Lu had a huge ambition, but he did not expect him to have such a huge ambition that he actually thought of the fertile land on the riverbank on the eastern side.","That fertile land was the best land in the entire Treasure City. It was unknown how many factions in this land had asked Li Feng for it, but all of them had been rejected without exception.","Li Feng even had plans to move the City Lord Manor to that fertile land. Not only did Zhan Lu request it of him, but he also used Lin Yuan to exert pressure on him. For a moment, Li Feng did not know how to react!","Li Feng looked at Zhan Lu with a complicated expression. After pondering for a moment, he asked, “Brother Zhan Lu, you should know that I hate people negotiating with me the most. However, Brother Zhan Lu, it’s you and I who are negotiating at this time.","“Given our relationship, I’m willing to hand over the entire Treasure Lake and this fertile land in the east to you! But correspondingly, you have to promise to ensure that Young Master Lin is willing to become a guest of our Treasure City.”","Zhan Lu agreed readily. If it were not for convincing Lin Yuan to become a guardian on behalf of Li Feng, Zhan Lu wouldn’t have dared to take so many benefits.","“Brother Li Feng, I’ll do my best in this matter. Just wait for my news! However, I can’t ask Young Master Lin now. It won’t be too late for me to ask Young Master Lin after he removes the restrictions on those two void passageways! I think you’ll be more at ease this way.”","After saying that, Zhan Lu bowed to Li Feng and said, “Brother Li Feng, you must have a lot of matters to attend to. I’ll take my leave first.”","After Zhan Lu left, Li Feng’s face darkened, but he soon relaxed his frown. Since he was destined to work with Zhan Lu in the future, there was no need for him to be too calculative now.","This star pirate siege had caused him, the City Lord of Treasure City, to lose all his prestige. Li Feng would use thousands of years and the city’s accumulated capital to strengthen the power of the City Lord’s lineage for 1,000 years to come. At that time, his lost dignity would naturally be restored!","...","Spring had been continuously releasing her spiritual aura to investigate the situation in the City Lord Manor. This allowed Spring to understand the composition of everyone in the City Lord Manor and better protect Lin Yuan. At the same time, it also enabled Spring to identify any spies within the City Lord Manor who might be colluding with the star pirates outside.","Spring had already gained information on the prime channels through which these spies interacted with star pirates.","Initially, Spring looked down on Li Feng. It was really difficult to support such a useless City Lord who could not even do anything when his city was besieged by star pirates.","However, Li Feng’s subsequent plans made Spring admire him a little. Li Feng was a talent of the same type as Listen, but as a City Lord, there was basically no possibility of being recruited. It was an excellent idea for Li Feng to ask Lin Yuan to become a guardian of Treasure City.","However, whether or not Lin Yuan would agree to Li Feng’s request was not something Spring could decide.","Lin Yuan was communicating with Winter, who had confirmed that there were more than two groups of devils among the star pirates.","These devils were extremely arrogant toward the star pirates, which did not quite make sense. If the star pirates were supporting these two devil groups, then the star pirates should be the master of these devils. The devils should be extremely humble to their masters.","Once a devil perceived a lifeform as superior, it would instinctively curry favor. For such a situation to happen, it meant that these two devil groups had nothing to do with the star pirates themselves. They were most likely serving the people behind these star pirates.","Lin Yuan instructed Winter to monitor the activities of the two devil groups closely and investigate their ultimate intentions. It would also facilitate the capture of the mastermind behind through the devils’ movements.","“Young Master, these star pirates must have planted numerous spies in Treasure City. Otherwise, the news in the city wouldn’t have spread so quickly. These star pirates give me the impression that they are looking for something, not just to plunder Treasure City.","“We’ll know if we want to confirm this by finding more spies in the city to interrogate. These spies who were sent into the city by the star pirates must have brought a mission with them before entering the city.”","Lin Yuan nodded. After ending the conversation with Winter, Lin Yuan asked Spring, who was standing beside him, “Spring, have you noticed any suspicious people?”","Spring said softly, “The people in the City Lord Manor have been thoroughly scrutinized. I can’t accurately determine who the spy is.","“However, the conversation between the two groups is somewhat suspicious. It has nothing to do with the star pirates surrounding the city. It’s more about you, Young Master.","“But I locked onto many suspicious people outside the city. These people are basically confirmed to be spies sent into the city by star pirates. It’s really not appropriate for me to leave your side. What do you think about revealing the identities of these people and letting Li Feng or Kani arrest these spies?","“These spies aren’t very strong. The strongest one is still quite a distance away from the pinnacle of World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. Kani can handle it alone!”","Spring paused for a moment before continuing to suggest to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, if what Winter said is true that these star pirates are looking for an item in Treasure City, I suggest that you let Kani capture these spies. After we obtain the information, we can find this item before these star pirates do.","“The fact that these star pirates and those behind them are going to such lengths to obtain the item indicates that it must be something quite significant. It might be of some use to you, Young Master.","“If the other factions in Treasure City find out about this, there’s a high chance that someone won’t be able to resist the temptation and will join the pursuit of this item.”","“I’m not worried that someone will come and snatch it. It’s just that there’s really no benefit from spreading about this. We also can’t be sure that the person commanding these star pirates in this operation is the one who needs the item.”"]},{"number":2876,"title":"Chapter 2876 Kani’s Sense of Crisis!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2876 Kani’s Sense of Crisis!","Lin Yuan’s heart skipped a beat as he understood what Spring meant.","Certainly, the people hiding behind these star pirates in this operation were most likely insignificant figures around experts from a faction or powerful species who had no need to make enemies and believed that making money quietly was the best policy.","Despite possessing considerable strength and attracting attention from others, Lin Yuan preferred to keep the information about his possession of treasures undisclosed.","“In that case, instruct Kani to capture the spies of these star pirates in groups. Then, we will personally interrogate them. In a while, follow me to report to Li Feng that Kani has permission to enter and exit at will.”","Lin Yuan took out Chef Supreme’s precious instrument, the Jewelled Cave Golden Toad.","In the Sky Beyond the Clouds, precious instruments were no longer uncommon. If Kani wanted to bring those star pirate spies to meet him, she would not be discovered by anyone.","Since Kani was entrusted with such a simple task, she would undoubtedly not disappoint him given her ability.","As the King Blood Jackal Queen, Kani was able to manage vast territories. Even if North of the Lonely River was isolated from the world, it would not restrict Kani’s mobility and decision-making ability.","Spring realized immediately after speaking that she had misspoken. Her words sounded like she was teaching Lin Yuan how to do things, which was clearly overstepping her boundaries as his follower. However, Spring could sense that Lin Yuan did not merely regard her as his follower.","Lin Yuan had not chosen to recover the memories of his previous life. He was now a greenhorn youth. Lin Yuan’s talent was reflected in the growth of his strength, but growth often came with a price.","Spring did not want Lin Yuan to pay the price, so she believed that the best way was to offer Lin Yuan some advice. However, Spring didn’t insist on Lin Yuan heeding her words.","Coincidentally, Lin Yuan understood Spring’s intentions and did not feel that she was giving him unsolicited advice.","Having followed Lin Yuan for a period of time, Spring had been influenced by Lin Yuan’s personality.","Lin Yuan brought Spring to look for Li Feng and easily obtained the authority to allow Kani to enter and exit the City Lord Manor at will. Now that the entire Treasure City depended on Lin Yuan, Li Feng would not dare to disrespect Lin Yuan even if he disagreed deep down.","Moreover, it was not a big deal to let one of Lin Yuan’s subordinates enter the City Lord Manor freely at this time. Lin Yuan’s subordinates possessed extraordinary strength. Having such individuals enter the City Lord Manor would be beneficial.","If Zhan Lu had not promised to help him communicate with Lin Yuan, Li Feng would have seized this opportunity to invite him. However, in the end, Li Feng restrained himself. He did not know Lin Yuan well, so extending an invitation to Lin Yuan might come across as presumptuous.","Furthermore, Treasure City was currently in a precarious situation, and it was not appropriate for Li Feng to make promises to Lin Yuan through Treasure City.","If he went past Zhan Lu to communicate with Lin Yuan, it would be disrespectful to Zhan Lu. Li Feng did not want Zhan Lu to have such thoughts. After all, Lin Yuan was a special honor guest of Fortune Treasure Palace, and his relationship with Zhan Lu was much closer than with him. If Zhan Lu were to make things difficult for him and cause this matter to fall through, it would really be difficult for Treasure City to have a chance to rise up.","Lin Yuan could sense that Li Feng wanted to say something but hesitated. It just so happened that Spring had told Lin Yuan about Li Feng and Zhan Lu’s conversation.","Lin Yuan was actually not very interested in becoming a guardian of Treasure City. Despite being able to obtain a lot of benefits from it, Lin Yuan was fully aware that he also had to take responsibility for Treasure City in times of crisis.","Lin Yuan genuinely acknowledged Treasure City’s potential from the bottom of his heart. However, he had already gotten Kani to support the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons. In the future, the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons would be equipped with pinnacle Divine Kingdom war weapons. Lin Yuan already had a foundation in Treasure City.","If the benefits promised by Li Feng were compelling enough, Lin Yuan wouldn’t mind becoming a guardian. As for how to decide, he would wait until Li Feng contacted him first.","Li Feng had begun to use the resources in the city to recruit guardians. It seemed that he had become more aware following the disaster caused by the star pirates surrounding the city and had finally come to understand that the strength of a City Lord was of utmost importance. The strength didn’t necessarily imply Li Feng’s personal strength but rather emphasized the need for Li Feng to enhance the power he could command.","Lin Yuan’s strength was only at the pinnacle of spirit fire, and he was still a hair’s breadth away from the Divine Kingdom level. However, the power he possessed was sufficient and allowed him to do things that many Holy Spirit experts could not.","Naturally, it was also risky to control power that far exceeded one’s own strength in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. However, unlike others, Lin Yuan did not need to bear this risk.","...","Ever since Kani returned to the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons, she had been wondering if she had been too concerned about them. Although Lin Yuan had made the same decision in the end, some of her actions had been carried out before Lin Yuan issued any orders. Kani was terrified that Lin Yuan would vent his anger on her.","That was especially after Kani learned that Lin Yuan had recruited another subordinate, who was a member of the Sky Radish Endless Vines, shortly after her departure.","The King Blood Jackals and the Sky Radish Endless Vines were both species with deep heritages. However, the latter was much stronger than the former. It was obvious that the bloodline and the strength of the Holy Spirit experts of the Sky Radish Endless Vines far surpassed hers.","Kani had followed Lin Yuan along with many aspirations. Currently, she was afraid that Jin Chen would take over her position and hinder her from realizing many of her ambitions.","What if Lin Yuan no longer chose to let her remain by his side and instructed her to return to North of the Lonely River to rule over the King Blood Jackals? That would be a huge loss for Kani!","If Lin Yuan had not quickly made arrangements for Kani, she would most likely have vented some of her anger on the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons.","In order to secure his position as the leader of the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons, Yu Run loved to report every major and minor matter to Kani, frequently asking Kani to assist them in resolving problems left behind by history.","Upon hearing Yu Run’s request, Kani glared at him helplessly. “Now that you’re the leader of your species, you should be the one arranging all their affairs. Are you suggesting that you want to pass the position of the leader to an outsider like me?","“You can handle such a small matter yourself. I have to accompany Master on his journey eastward in the future and won’t be staying in Treasure City forever. Since Master has chosen to use you, he will definitely make appropriate arrangements for you after this and won’t let you die in Treasure City!","“I have something important to attend to and will be away for a period. During my absence, govern your people well and ensure they do not wander around Treasure City. The city is not peaceful now. I’ll be heading to the City Lord Manor. You will have no protection while I am away!”","Kani paused for a moment before adding, “Recently, many of your Purple Feather Rain Pigeons have obtained my protection and feel that existences like the Bloodwood Lion Bees can no longer oppress them. They are rather conspicuous in their actions.","“Based on my understanding of Master, he has never been fond of subordinates who seek high-profile attention. Even if you are not directly under Master’s command, you are merely forces manipulated by him at his whim.","“I hope you’ll refrain from doing unnecessary actions that might upset him. I’ve spent some effort for your Purple Feather Rain Pigeons, and I don’t want my efforts to be in vain!”","With that, Kani’s figure disappeared in front of Yu Run.","Kani was going to use the information Spring had provided to capture the targets that Lin Yuan had designated in groups and bring them to him. Any command from Lin Yuan was significant for Kani. She had to think of a way to make herself better than Jin Chen!","Yu Run was not a fool. He knew very well that Kani would not be staying with the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons forever. However, Kani was a true benefactor to Yu Run. Without Kani, even if Lin Yuan were to recruit the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons, Yu Run wouldn’t be appointed as the leader.","Yu Run was immensely grateful to Kani, yet he did not have the ability to repay Kani now. If such a day were to come, Yu Run would be willing to use the entire strength of the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons to repay her.","Although Yu Run was grateful to Kani, he also treated Kani as a tool. He had been using Kani’s power to help him establish his authority and eliminate the obstacles within the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons.","Despite knowing that there were many things Kani was unwilling to assist him with, Yu Run would still seek Kani’s help.","It wasn’t that Yu Run didn’t know what was good for him, but he knew that the best way to get Lin Yuan’s attention was to develop their chamber of commerce in Treasure City. He wanted to make the Purple Feather Chamber of Commerce prominent in the city as a testament to his capabilities.","As he wasn’t particularly strong, many issues couldn’t be resolved solely by the strength of the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons. If these matters were not resolved, their development in Treasure City would also be restricted.","...","The spies sent into the city by the star pirates were not particularly strong. Those who possessed considerable strength stood out too much in Treasure City and would easily be noticed by the patrolling city guards. In addition, these people had already infiltrated the city a long time ago. Some even had stable interpersonal relationships in Treasure City.","Had Spring not investigated these spies, it would have been very difficult for them to be captured by the people of the City Lord Manor. This led the spies not to feel any sense of danger, only feeling anticipation for the imminent rewards they believed awaited them. When they were captured by Kani, a Holy Spirit expert, most of the spies were dumbfounded.","Kani brought the first group of people to Lin Yuan, and right on the heels of that, she set off to help Lin Yuan capture the second group.","With the spies in the city being collectively captured, the star pirates would soon receive the news.","Lin Yuan did not care about it as long as he could obtain the information he wanted.","Lin Yuan brought the spies from the star pirates into the Spirit Lock spatial zone. In his eyes, these spies were no different from the star pirates themselves. Lin Yuan had no intention of letting them come out alive after being brought into the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","These spies were all part of the star pirates. They were known to have tight lips and a penchant for ruthless actions. However, Lin Yuan was not afraid of these tight-lipped fellows. The Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom’s interrogation ability came in handy here.","These spies quickly realized the predicament they were in. However, they did not beg for mercy. Instead, they threatened Lin Yuan.","“You should be the City Lord of Treasure City, right?”","“Treasure City is about to fall!”","“When the time comes, you will all become captives. If you let us go now, I can let you live after we break through Treasure City!”","These spies’ tone was fierce—they spoke with a solemn expression.","Lin Yuan curled his lips and watched the spies’ performance with interest.","These spies held a very low status in the star pirate group. Otherwise, they would not have undertaken such a dangerous mission. How could these people, who had no status among the star pirates, have the ability to protect the lifeforms in the city?","Lin Yuan could not be bothered to waste his breath on these spies and said, “Take a moment to consider where you currently are. I didn’t bring you here to listen to your threats but rather to gather information from you. Judging by your current attitude, I don’t think you’re willing to answer me obediently. In that case, it seems like there’s something that I need to do!”","Lin Yuan raised his hand, and the spores of the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom surged toward the spies.","Upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words, the spies suddenly became aware of the dense spirit qi in the air. The spirit qi seemed to have a life of its own as it entered their bodies and was directly absorbed by them.","They found themselves in a paradise, and this young man was the owner of the paradise. From the concentration of spirit qi in the paradise, they were able to find out the background of this youth in front of them.","Apart from being ruthless in their actions, these spies also had keen insights, which often exceeded that of life forms of the same level in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","However, before these spies could fully comprehend the situation, they felt a burning sensation in their bodies. Under the immense pain caused by the burning sensation, these spies did not even have the ability to wail.","“There are so many of you here. Soon, I’ll capture more spies. Among all of you, there are some who are tight-lipped, while others are loose-lipped.","“I’ll get rid of all those who are tight-lipped, and I’ll only leave five of those who are loose-lipped. Now, I’ll give you a chance to explain the situation to me.”"]},{"number":2877,"title":"Chapter 2877 The Law of Survival of the Star Pirates!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2877 The Law of Survival of the Star Pirates!","Kani had captured more than 80 spies among the first group, and Lin Yuan did not have the time to interrogate them one by one.","Some of these spies were certain that Lin Yuan would be afraid of the star pirate faction backing them and would not dare to make a move. Those who harbored such beliefs would adamantly refuse to provide information to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan could not be bothered to waste time with these tight-lipped people. What Lin Yuan needed to do now was to immediately identify those who felt threatened by him and were willing to disclose the information.","After Lin Yuan finished speaking, despite being shocked by the spirit qi in the environment, none of the spies chose to speak.","Even though the burning sensation coming from their bodies made them wish they were dead.","Spring sent a voice transmission to Lin Yuan. “Young Master, these spies are used to a life of bloodshed. They are all very wild. Those who fear death in the Sky Beyond the Clouds will not join star pirate groups.","“Ever since these spies joined the star pirate groups, everything revolves around the star pirate groups. They have a sense of belonging and loyalty to each other. Rather than coercion, it’s better to lure them with benefits. If it involves benefits, these spies will surely speak up. Once one person opens up, others will follow suit.”","Lin Yuan raised his brows. It seemed that he still didn’t understand the situation in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and wasn’t familiar with the ecology and interactions between the various people there.","Enticement was easier for Lin Yuan than coercion.","The Deposit Vegetable Pods were looking after the Spirit Lock spatial zone, but they were not adept at doing a lot of physical work. Genius also needed some servants to help clean up the cat garden with its tens of thousands of cat-species feys. These spies were qualified for this job.","Lin Yuan was definitely not willing to let someone too powerful enter the Spirit Lock spatial zone as a servant, especially someone who wasn’t completely under his control. Once they caused trouble in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, they would incur huge losses.","However, these people weren’t strong and were only at the level of igniting their spirit fire or had just reached the Divine Kingdom level.","Begin Lady, Celestial Sight, and the others were taking care of the Spirit Lock spatial zone. In addition, the feys in the Spirit Lock spatial zone were all at the World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, making them capable of monitoring those people effectively.","“The first five people who took the initiative to reveal information to me can stay in this paradise forever in the future. I will also reward them with 1,000 spirit qi crystals.”","Lin Yuan shook the spirit qi crystals in his palm and added, “Each of these spirit qi crystals can be exchanged for thousands of chips in Fortune Treasure Palace. There are millions of chips waiting for you all. Once this opportunity is gone, there won’t be another chance!”","Given that it was coercion and bribery, he had to give a price that no one could refuse.","These spirit qi crystals were merely resources for the spies, but they were exceptionally precious as they were produced by a Creator. However, there was no concrete amount of value to these spirit qi crystals.","Lin Yuan’s words made these spies realize how precious the spirit qi crystals were. Millions of chips were something that they would not be able to earn for hundreds of years. Moreover, as star pirates, they had to take risks while plundering. There were very few pirates who had been active for hundreds of years.","Lin Yuan’s promise of benefits was constantly breaking through the psychological defense of these spies.","One of the female spies with a long scar on her cheek endured the burning sensation of her body and spoke quickly. “Lord, there is an alliance formed by more than 70 star pirates outside Treasure City. They are preparing to launch a surprise attack on the city tomorrow evening. They’ll directly crush all the defensive forces there.”","Before the woman could finish speaking, a few stern shouts came from beside her.","“Red Scorpion, you actually exposed our plan!?”","“Aren’t you afraid that this person is deceiving us?!”","“I’ll see how you explain this to our boss then!”","Lin Yuan gently raised his hand, and the burning sensation in Red Scorpion’s body instantly disappeared.","In the next instant, the ground beneath the feet of the few people who had just spoken instantly turned into a whirlpool of quicksand, engulfing them in yellow sand that flowed into their seven orifices like liquid water.","Strange cries came from their throats, and soon, they stopped breathing.","Lin Yuan told the woman who had first provided him with information and was now looking at him in horror, “Your name is Red Scorpion, right? You’ve done very well. You’re welcome to settle down here from now on!”","Lin Yuan said sternly to the other star pirates that were crawling on the ground, “Is there any reason for me to deceive you? Now that the first person has come forward to explain the situation to me, I’ll wait for the rest of the four people to meet the same fate.","“As a member of the star pirate group, you have burned, plundered, and murdered countless lifeforms. Such actions are unforgivable. However, by explaining the situation to me and letting Treasure City successfully survive this crisis, you’re using your actions to atone for your sins and provide me with a reason to spare your life.”","The few people who had scolded Red Scorpion had met a gruesome end. In addition, Lin Yuan had already handed the 1,000 spirit qi crystals to Red Scorpion.","Since Red Scorpion had already spoken, even if the others spoke up, they wouldn’t be the first traitor!","Soon, five people were gathered. The second and third individuals were still hesitant, but the fourth and fifth ones were basically competing to speak up.","Lin Yuan had just used his actions to prove that he was not afraid of the star pirates behind these spies.","Spring did not give the sixth person a chance to speak. After the fifth person finished speaking, she raised his hand and pointed. The remaining 70 or so spies were directly reduced to dust by the huge force, ceasing to exist in the world.","Spring’s move frightened the five people, including Red Scorpion, so much that they subconsciously recoiled. At the same time, they felt an unusual sense of relief, as if they had been given a second chance at life.","These spies, who had always been ruthless, looked at Lin Yuan as if he was the real devil!","Lin Yuan looked at Red Scorpion and the others and said coldly, “I’ve already fulfilled my promise and given you the benefits you deserve. Next, it’s your turn to explain everything to me! Remember, your lives were exchanged with great difficulty. Don’t make a mistake!","“In a while, other spies will be brought here. I will also inquire with them about the situation. If they make me think that you’re deliberately hiding more than you say, you’ll follow in the footsteps of your companions just now.","“I’m not sure how many more groups of star pirates there will be. I’ll only spare the lives of half of them. Don’t let down your guard and think that everything is fine now!”","If Lin Yuan had just established Sky City, he would never have been able to say such words. However, times had changed, and Lin Yuan was already used to adopting different attitudes toward different people.","These spies were inherently cunning, and Lin Yuan did not want to get any dispensable information that served no purpose to him. Hence, Lin Yuan exerted a lot of pressure on the spies as soon as he arrived, preventing them from covering up for each other.","Even if these spies were the survivors of the same group, they were all competitors. Lin Yuan’s words immediately caused the few spies to return to their tense state.","Originally, they were standing very close to each other, but now, there was a distance between them.","Red Scorpion, who was the first to disclose information to Lin Yuan, was also the first to speak. “Lord, although we are also spies, there are different ranks between us. The higher the rank, the more information the spies possess.","“Not all of us know each other. I only know the people who are in charge of contacting me. For instance, I only know two of the four people here. Both of their ranks are lower than mine, so they definitely don’t have as much information as I do. However, I can guarantee that I’ll tell you everything I know!”","Red Scorpion’s words caused the two spies she pointed out to glare fiercely at her. However, what Red Scorpion said was the truth. The two spies had no way to refute her. Nonetheless, it appeared that an enmity had formed between them.","There was no absolute relationship between the rank and strength of the spies. Out of the two of them, one was significantly stronger than Red Scorpion.","Red Scorpion dared to speak these words in order to gain Lin Yuan’s trust and make him aware of her value. After all, Lin Yuan had said that regardless of how many people there were in the end, he would only spare half of them. As long as Red Scorpion pointed out those of lower level, she would be able to save her own life.","Having already abandoned the star pirates to ensure her own survival, Red Scorpion no longer had anything to hide.","The man, who looked very sloppy with his eyes concealed beneath the disarrayed hair on his forehead, spoke up. “I know her. My name is Mino. My level is higher than hers. I can also tell you all the information!”","Mino was the fifth person to report to Lin Yuan. Before he could finish speaking, Spring had already eliminated the remaining 70 or so spies. It could be said that among the five of them, Mino was the one who felt most like he had been given a second chance at life.","The old woman pointed out by Mino shouted hysterically, “What if your rank is higher than mine? Does that mean you necessarily know more than I do? Even if you know more, it doesn’t necessarily mean you know the details better than I do! Mino, I saved your life. Is this how you repay me?!”","Mino told the old woman without any guilt, “You saved me because it was your duty as a doctor. Remember, you’re the one who blinded one of my eyes with your treatment.","“So what if you saved my life? I’m truthfully explaining the situation to my Lord. My rank is higher than yours, and there are a total of ten people reporting to me, including you. Are you suggesting that you also know the information reported by those nine people? Whatever orders the star pirates have, I’m the one who sent them to you. Low-ranked spies like you have no chance of obtaining information.”","The old woman was so angry that her body trembled.","Lin Yuan looked at the scene in front of him and pondered whether this continuous cycle of backstabbing was driven by the instinct for survival. From any perspective, this scene was a little ironic.","“All right, who told you to argue so loudly here? I don’t care what your rank is. All you need to do now is tell me everything you know! There will be someone who will come to summarize your information.”","Lin Yuan then arranged for Genius to send a few Hundred Questions Beasts to record the information provided by the spies.","...","Kani was extremely efficient and quickly sent the second group of people to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan repeated the same process, and Kani divided the star pirates into four groups and captured them all.","In the third group of spies, Red Scorpion pointed out an extremely ordinary-looking person, indicating that the spy was her superior.","Red Scorpion wasn’t sure if this person held the highest rank among everyone, but they would definitely be able to provide Lin Yuan with useful information. Red Scorpion did that because the information Mino possessed was comparable to hers.","Mino and Red Scorpion didn’t want to be disregarded by Lin Yuan and hoped to be valued more by him. Hence, Red Scorpion was using this method to prove her value to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan looked at Red Scorpion with admiration before seizing the person that she had pointed out from the crowd.","Lin Yuan had already obtained information from the two groups of spies, so he basically had a clear understanding of the information that he needed to know.","However, these spies did not know if there was anyone behind the star pirate groups. When Lin Yuan raised this point, many spies revealed shocked expressions.","When Lin Yuan obtained the information, the Sky-Questioning Flaming Heart Mushroom’s spores were already within their bodies. If a spy lied, the spores would immediately react, and Lin Yuan could easily find the liar.","This left Lin Yuan feeling somewhat frustrated, so he placed all his attention on Red Scorpion’s superior.","Lin Yuan was actually not very interested in the size of the star pirate group or the number of experts in it. Spring and Winter could easily deal with these people. The strongest among these star pirates was only at the Holy Spirit level.","Lin Yuan had already nurtured a Holy Spirit expert, so he no longer had any sense of awe for the Holy Spirit level.","However, Lin Yuan learned from these low-ranking spies that there were two devil groups in the star pirate group, and each devil group had 10 members. These two devil groups had been giving orders. It was these devils’ idea to let so many spies enter Treasure City. As a result, the spies captured by Lin Yuan were hostile toward the devils.","When this spy was pointed out by Red Scorpion, his expression stiffened. It was obvious that he did not expect Red Scorpion to identify him.","The fact that Red Scorpion had identified him meant that she had completely submitted to the young man in front of him. It was likely that the information had already been leaked."]},{"number":2878,"title":"Chapter 2878 Star Pirate Alliance’s Secret!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2878 Star Pirate Alliance’s Secret!","Rail Thorn held the highest position among all the star pirate spies present and managed all of them.","Rail Thorn came from the Dark Punishment Star Pirates and was the third most important figure.","After the Dark Punishment Star Pirates joined the ‘Star Pirate Alliance’, the members were shuffled. The first and second most important figures became team leaders, while Rail Thorn became the second-in-command of the Star Pirate Alliance’s search and reporting department.","The first in command of the Star Pirate Alliance’s search and reporting department managed the internal affairs, while Rail Thorn handled the external operations.","Rail Thorn designed the different roles and ranks in the search and reporting department. He designed the roles in this manner because he did not want the members of the search and reporting department to get to know each other.","If they were pigeonholed into their individual roles and ranks, it would be easy to notice if any of them were missing. Additionally, even if one of them was caught by the enemy and forced to speak, they would not be able to implicate the entire department.","This system also protected Rail Thorn.","Rail Thorn only had four members in his team and was extremely cautious of his own safety. He had deemed the four team members as trustworthy, but Red Scorpion had named him in order to save herself.","In order to ensure that the Star Pirate Alliance’s plan went smoothly, Rail Thorn was even prepared to sacrifice himself.","Rail Thorn looked at Lin Yuan serenely through several strands of hair that fell over his face as he tried to come up with the next step of his plan.","Spring frowned at Rail Thorn. She knew that he was very cunning. Otherwise, she would not have been unable to discern anything special about him when she was investigating Treasure City!","Rail Thorn had to be extremely talented to avoid being picked out by Spring’s sharp eyes.","A person like this, who also held an important position in the Star Pirate Alliance, would not divulge information easily.","Lin Yuan wanted to handle this matter personally, so Spring did not interject or add anything.","When Rail Thorn did not respond, Lin Yuan knew that he was not an easy character to deal with. Lin Yuan did not have time to waste on Rail Thorn.","From his previous questioning of the spies, Lin Yuan confirmed that the higher the position of the spy, the more information they knew.","It was true that Rail Thorn was the most valuable figure among the spies.","Lin Yuan took a step forward and pushed aside the hair that covered Rail Thorn’s forehead.","Rail Thorn was startled by Lin Yuan’s actions and instinctively took a step backward. However, he was immobilized by a jet of water that had burst out from Lin Yuan’s body.","As the head of the information department, his abilities were far more important than his power.","Rail Thorn was not strong and was still some way from reaching World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. This was why he did not stand out, regardless of where he was.","Rail Thorn was not used to being examined in such an open and vulnerable state, but there was nothing he could do about it.","Lin Yuan used his pointer finger to tap Rail Thorn’s forehead.","“You might not have voluntarily stepped forward, but I am still willing to give you a chance to live. But you need to tell me everything you know. As a reward, I will give you a platform where you’ll be able to utilize your value better than you currently do in the Star Pirate Alliance!","“If you’re unwilling to cooperate with me while I’m communicating with you through normal methods, I will have no choice but to use my own means to make you talk. I will give you three minutes to think. With your experience, I’m sure you understand the implications.”","Lin Yuan decided to flex his power in the most direct manner.","Lin Yuan’s intensity caused cold sweat to begin dripping down Rail Thorn’s back.","Rail Thorn knew that, given his current situation, he was a prisoner who did not get to decide whether he lived or died. There was no question that revealing what he knew would bring him the most benefits and give him the greatest chance of surviving!","Rail Thorn could already guess what Lin Yuan wanted to ask. Once he revealed such information, many of his brothers would lose their lives in Treasure City!","He initially thought that he only needed to pay attention to Fortune Treasure Palace in this operation. But it turned out that there was such a terrifying faction present in Treasure City!","Rail Thorn did not know what level this secret space was at, but it had to be extremely high. Otherwise, it would not contain spirit qi of such purity! This purity of spirit qi was comparable to that of the potions concocted by Grade 4 Creators!","He did not know the rate at which this spirit qi was produced.","If the spirit qi was produced at a high rate, this place would be unbelievably stunning.","The Star Pirate Alliance had made a grave mistake!","His brothers on the outside were still ignorant of this. Rather than telling Lin Yuan about the Star Pirate Alliance, Rail Thorn would much rather tell the Star Pirate Alliance about what had happened in the city.","Rail Thorn believed that this young man would be able to provide him with a stage on which to exhibit his talents. There was a good chance that this stage would be even wider than the one given to him by the Star Pirate Alliance.","However, Rail Thorn had his reasons for being unable to speak. Even if he wanted to tell Lin Yuan about this, he could not.","Rail Thorn could guess that he would be in for suffering if he did not do what the young man wanted and told him everything he knew. He did not want to experience the suffering, but it was not up to him!","Rather than suffering physical pain, he would rather die and put an end to everything.","With these thoughts in mind, Rail Thorn said seriously, “I can’t tell you everything that goes on in the Star Pirate Alliance. Even if I want to, I can’t. You won’t be able to get any useful information from me.”","Lin Yuan frowned when he heard what Rail Thorn said.","Rail Thorn’s words sounded extremely superficial to Lin Yuan. The mouth was on his body. What did he mean that he could not speak about what went on among the star pirates?","Spring sensed Rail Thorn’s condition before saying to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, it looks like the Star Pirate Alliance has a mutated dragon-species fey, the Forbidden Speech Dragon.","“The Forbidden Speech Dragons communicate through forbidden speech, and the information they deliver is extremely secure. Those who have been encrypted can’t transmit information to anyone else. They will only be able to communicate directly with the Forbidden Speech Dragon. They’ll only be able to speak to others once the Forbidden Speech Dragon removes the encryption.”","Spring’s words caused surprise to appear on Lin Yuan’s face. He never expected a mystical lifeform like the Forbidden Speech Dragon to exist in this world!","When Spring was talking about the Forbidden Speech Dragon, Rail Thorn’s expression changed.","This meant that Rail Thorn not only knew about the Forbidden Speech Dragon but that he was linked to them as well.","Lin Yuan looked at Spring. He wanted to ask her how he could get Rail Thorn to speak if he was truly controlled by the Forbidden Speech Dragon’s forbidden speech.","Lin Yuan had not gleaned any information he wanted to hear from the spies. If he still could not receive such information from Rail Thorn, he could only take on the Star Pirate Alliance with force and squeeze out the person behind them!","In spite of Spring and Winter’s power, Lin Yuan did not have enough manpower to carry this out.","Spring smiled and said, “Young Master, if this Forbidden Speech Dragon’s power has exceeded Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit, it will be very difficult to find a way to break the forbidden speech spell while it is in effect.","“However, the Forbidden Speech Dragon is an extremely powerful functional-type lifeform. It’s difficult for them to reach even World Emperor/Divine Kingdom. Even if they receive an enormous opportunity, it will be difficult for them to reach Domain Mountain/Holy Spirit. I only need a moment to remove the forbidden speech spell from Rail Thorn!”","Spring turned and said coldly, “I can remove the forbidden speech spell that has a hold on you. Once the forbidden speech spell is removed, you can decide for yourself whether or not to speak!","“Rather than chaining your soul and dissecting your soul to learn your secrets, it will be smarter for you to speak for yourself! Loyalty and sincerity don’t exist among star pirates. Even the subordinates you treat well won’t hesitate to abandon you. A group that burns and kills for profit can’t speak of righteousness and good faith!”","Once she was done speaking, a revitalizing energy surged within Spring. The energy had a mystical rhythm, flowed into Rail Thorn, and removed the forbidden speech spell. At the same time, a black and brown insect crawled out from Rail Thorn’s heart.","The long insect fell to the ground and began writhing creepily.","Spring pointed forward, crashing the long insect. “Apparently, apart from the forbidden speech magic, you also have such a parasite in you! You should be able to answer the question now, right?”","Spring’s action astonished Rail Thorn. He never expected someone to be this strong.","Now, he was completely unrestrained and truly free.","Rail Thorn was silent for a moment before he asked, “If I tell you about the situation, what will you do to the other star pirates in the Star Pirate Alliance?”","Lin Yuan replied with a question of his own, “Do you think the Star Pirate Alliance, who go around killing and plundering, deserve to live? Will anyone survive after the star pirates conquer Treasure City? I won’t be letting any of the Star Pirate Alliance’s star pirates go free!”","Lin Yuan spoke firmly. Rail Thorn’s expression became austere.","“What about the spies you chose? Will you be letting them live?”","Lin Yuan no longer had any patience. “They get to live because they have used their own means to fend off the star pirates outside of Treasure City. I am willing to give a chance to those who know how to right their own wrongs. Are you going to give up your chance to continue living?”","Rail Thorn could sense Lin Yuan’s irritation from his words.","Now that he was free of control, Rail Thorn no longer had anything to worry about. Rail Thorn had a few good friends in the Star Pirate Alliance, but their relationship was not stable.","Rail Thorn could not be certain that these people would prioritize their relationship when they were presented with profits.","Due to Rail Thorn’s lack of power, he always had to put on a display of weakness when he interacted with these supposed friends.","Now that he was being offered the chance at a new life, Rail Thorn was both excited and apprehensive.","Rail Thorn was also calculating Lin Yuan’s chances of defeating the Star Pirate Alliance. After all, the Star Pirate Alliance had a terribly powerful faction supporting them! It was this faction that had established the Star Pirate Alliance and had been puppeteering them from the shadows.","However, this faction also brought the Star Pirate Alliance significant benefits.","This faction had always flown under the radar and never sent their main members to meet with the Star Pirate Alliance.","Yet, they sent two of their main members, as well as two devil groups, to this operation.","It was difficult for Rail Thorn to imagine this almighty Star Pirate Alliance being defeated!","If this young man could not defeat the Star Pirate Alliance, everything they did from now on would be meaningless!","“Do you have power above Domain Mountain/Pinnacle Holy Spirit? If you don’t have such power, I suggest that you pay more attention to Treasure City’s safety and do your best to break free in order to survive!","“I need a promise. You have to promise me that I will have the chance to fully wield my abilities. As long as you can promise this, I will tell you everything I know!”","Lin Yuan said softly, “I never lie. I don’t need to lie to you. All you need to do is say whatever you know. We will be the ones to worry about whether we have the power to handle this crisis!","“Soon, the two void passageways will be destroyed, and our relationship with the star pirates will be swapped. If I didn’t have enough power, I wouldn’t have been able to find you from among all these spies!”","Despite Lin Yuan saying that, Rail Thorn still could not relax completely. He felt that Lin Yuan was bragging.","Ever since the two figures came to the Star Pirate Alliance and opened the two void passageways, they never intended to handle the repercussions.","Under the control of the Abyss Commanders, the two void passageways were already showing signs of evolving from pinnacle Class 3 to Class 4.","Given the circumstances, Holy Spirit strength was insufficient to handle the situation. Yet, this young man actually said that he was capable of making the three pinnacle Class 3 void passageways disappear!","But since Lin Yuan had given him his assurance, Rail Thorn could only tell Lin Yuan everything he knew.","With Genius personally taking notes, it took almost two hours to record everything.","Rail Thorn knew more than five times what the other spies knew. Thus, Lin Yuan now knew everything about these star pirates.","Lin Yuan said seriously, “You said that those two figures are likely more powerful than the Holy Spirit experts. Can you be sure of that?”","Rail Thorn shook his head. “I won’t lie to you. I haven’t had the chance to interact directly with those two figures. They haven’t acted publicly, either.","“But one thing is for certain. They want to be present and order the Star Pirate Alliance to attack Treasure City because there is something there that they desperately want to get their hands on. But I don’t know what it is they want.”"]},{"number":2879,"title":"Chapter 2879 The Nine-Headed Snakes!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2879 The Nine-Headed Snakes!","Rail Thorn had said all that he could say. Although he was the second most important figure in the Star Pirate Alliance’s information system, he knew very little about those two figures.","Those two figures kept very low profiles in the Star Pirate Alliance, and most of its members knew nothing about them.","“Lord, I have already told you everything that I know. I hope that you can use my information to find a way to combat the Star Pirate Alliance. If you can’t guarantee that you’ll be able to defeat them, I think you should opt for the element of surprise. If those two Lords can’t find what they want, they will definitely turn Treasure City inside out!","“All the people in Treasure City will be killed as well to prevent the information from spreading. The two void passageways that have opened will begin transforming toward Class 4 once the Star Pirate Alliance kickstarts its operation.","“This is the two Lords’ plan to hide the operation. While the Abyssal lifeforms are rampaging, the people from Honor Absent Palace won’t be able to find anything in the ruins of Treasure City even if they clean up the two void passageways.”","Lin Yuan was silent for a moment before he continued. “You don’t have to worry about the future arrangements. Since you lead the star pirate spies, you will continue managing the remaining spies. If the chance ever arises, I will give you the opportunity to demonstrate your abilities.”","Once he was done speaking, Lin Yuan nodded at Spring. He led her back to the room that Li Feng had personally prepared for him.","When Lin Yuan left, Red Scorpion looked at Rail Thorn fearfully. She had pointed out Rail Thorn and exposed him to Lin Yuan.","Now that Lin Yuan wanted Rail Thorn to continue managing them, Red Scorpion was afraid that Rail Thorn would use the opportunity to take revenge on her. If Rail Thorn wanted to take revenge on her, she would be completely incapable of fighting back!","Rail Thorn walked over to Red Scorpion’s side and gently placed his hand on her shoulder before he shouted, and all the star pirate spies gathered around him.","When Lin Yuan left, Begin Lady became the manager and protector of the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Begin Lady had been living in the Element Well and using Lin Yuan’s resources. After all the years that had passed, Begin Lady had reached World Emperor/Pinnacle Divine Kingdom and was on the cusp of reaching the Holy Spirit level.","However, Begin Lady had no idea how to continue evolving its bloodline, grade, and quality. It was stuck at a gateway, and not even Lin Yuan could help it. It could only remain in this state and wait for an opportunity that would enable it to transform.","Begin Lady told Rail Thorn and the rest, “Come with me. All of you have taken so many resources without giving anything back. Why don’t you come with me to clean up the cat garden?”","The spies were normally willing to do anything for the sake of camouflage. They had just managed to save their own lives. Being able to continue living was the biggest benefit to them. They would not dare to be fussy at such a moment.","The spies did not move immediately after hearing Begin Lady’s instructions because they were genuinely petrified by Begin Lady’s identity.","Faeries were extremely elite in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. They never expected to see a faerie in this space. Moreover, it seemed that this faerie was under that young man’s control. More importantly, this faerie’s bloodline level was extremely high, and it was no ordinary faerie!","Faerie Institution’s biggest taboo was when other species or factions used faeries as tools.","They did not know if the faerie in this space meant that the faction they had submitted to was linked to Faerie Institution or if this faction had the ability to take on Faerie Institution.","Begin Lady’s appearance caused all the spies, including Rail Thorn and Red Scorpion, to first feel shock followed by excitement.","In this enormous Sky Beyond the Clouds, there was no one who did not want to join a powerful faction and attain a bright future.","...","When Spring saw the worry on Lin Yuan’s face, she hurriedly said, “Lord Saint, you don’t have to be worried. Winter is able to handle the Star Pirate Alliance. He doesn’t even need my help.","“There are many distinctions in the levels above the Holy Spirit level. Although we were in the main world for a long time and our power fell rather than rose, the ants who only just reached the Holy Spirit level are still no match for us!”","Lin Yuan had never been fully aware of Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter’s exact powers.","When Spring called the Holy Spirit lifeforms ‘ants’, Lin Yuan knew that he had underestimated her. She was much stronger than he had imagined!","Since that was the case, there was no need for him to continue worrying.","All he needed to do was continue developing Sky City as quickly as possible while Spring and Winter were still capable of protecting him.","Although he had encountered numerous issues, everything was going smoothly overall.","Not only had Lin Yuan collected resources to refresh Sky City’s store of resources, but he had also obtained powerful subordinates!","Jin Chen might not be as strong as Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter, but he was much stronger than Kani. In terms of martial force, he was in the top five in Sky City and was very impressive!","Due to the fact that Lin Yuan had developed his faith country first after arriving at the Sky Beyond the Clouds and gathered many living sources of strength, these living sources of strength were not strong individually.","Hence, when Lin Yuan invested resources, the citizens of the faith country broke through rapidly.","Morbius’ soul remained in the faith country and spent every day absorbing World Grace and Creation World Ley Lines.","Hence, Lin Yuan had a sufficient store of resources that Sky City could use to trade for other resources.","Treasure City’s problem did affect Lin Yuan’s plan, though.","Based on Fan Lou’s report, the Dark Pufferfish and Bloodians were growing increasingly closer, and Fan Lou was also becoming increasingly important to the Bloodians.","Accordingly, the Bloodians’ plan for the mermaids was about to unfold. As a result, it was unlikely that Lin Yuan would make it in time for the first phase of the Bloodians’ plan.","With Spring and Winter’s strength, Lin Yuan could easily leave Treasure City. But he did not choose to do so.","Firstly, since he had encountered the situation, there was no need for all of Treasure City’s residents to be killed by the Star Pirate Alliance. Secondly, Lin Yuan was curious about what the person behind the Star Pirate Alliance wanted to find. It had to be an extremely important thing. Otherwise, there was no reason to cause such an enormous fuss over it!","...","On the afternoon of the second day, Li Feng could not stop himself from going to see Lin Yuan and asking him about the plan.","It was not that Li Feng did not trust Lin Yuan. Rather, as the City Lord of Treasure City, he needed to be prepared. Otherwise, he would come across as useless!","Lin Yuan was extremely polite to Li Feng. He was not as arrogant as Yin Ruo.","“City Lord Li, there are only a few minutes to go before the time I spoke of. If you’re willing, you can go with me to witness the annihilation of the two void passageways.","“Based on what I found out, the star pirates outside the city are going to attack Treasure City this afternoon. I think that once we act, the star pirates’ counterattack will crumble. So I hope that you are prepared.”","Li Feng said calmly, “Of course. We have been prepared for some time. However, Treasure City is weak, and we will need your help in some areas! I hope that you’ll be able to help Treasure City to overcome this obstacle!”","Li Feng’s words essentially laid aside his pride as the City Lord, and this was a tick in Spring’s book.","Lin Yuan nodded. “That goes without saying. If I wasn’t going to help Treasure City overcome this obstacle, I wouldn’t have asked my subordinates to destroy the two pinnacle Class 3 void passageways.”","Li Feng had sent out the troops he had and had been keeping a strict watch over the two void passageways.","Li Feng did not notice anything abnormal happening to the two void passageways and could not tell that they were about to be destroyed.","There were already more than 20 Holy Spirit Abyss Commanders under the two void passageways.","The void passageways were beginning to expand beyond control!","If Lin Yuan had not made Li Feng that promise, Li Feng might have led Treasure City’s experts to abandon the city!","Li Feng had been wondering about something. It was impossible that the Abyssal Beasts were under the Star Pirate Alliance’s control. The Abyssal Commanders were a threat to the Star Pirate Alliance. Were the Star Pirate Alliance not afraid of being bitten by the Abyssal Beasts?","In the short span of a few minutes, he would be lucky enough to witness the destruction of two pinnacle Class 3 void passageways. This made Li Feng slightly nervous.","Li Feng was not concerned that Lin Yuan was lying to him. Rather, he was worried that Lin Yuan had overestimated the strength of his subordinates.","Lin Yuan was speaking with Li Feng when he heard Winter’s voice in his soul, “Young Master, I am about to begin my operation. You asked me to keep an eye on the two devil groups. I noticed that the two devil groups are headed toward tents that are north of the Star Pirate Alliance.","“As such, I began keeping a close watch over the tents. I saw that there were two individuals who are beyond the Holy Spirit level in the tents. They must be the people behind the star pirates!","“Do you think I should take control of these two figures first? I’m worried that they will flee or go into hiding once I begin my operation. You told me to do my best to protect Treasure City, so I placed my boundary around it.”","When Lin Yuan heard this, he suddenly had a feeling that everything was coming to an end before it even began. It turned out that Winter had already discovered the two figures Rail Thorn had spoken of!","But despite uncovering the two figures behind Star Pirate Alliance, Winter still did not know what they were looking for in Treasure City.","The thing the two figures were trying to find had to be extraordinary.","Lin Yuan was worried that once Winter took control of these two figures, they would stop searching for this thing. Lin Yuan did not have the confidence that he would be able to pry open the lips of experts beyond the Holy Spirit level on his own!","“Winter, do you know their backgrounds? Did they say why they came to Treasure City and started this storm?”","Winter was momentarily stunned. He knew that Lin Yuan asked this because he had caught spies and learned something from them.","It just so happened that Winter had something to report to Lin Yuan as well.","“Young Master, I uncovered their backgrounds. They come from Moon Mist Swamp and are from a legendary faction, the Nine-Headed Snakes. They are considered a branch of the Elemental Nine-Headed Snakes.","“There are many branches of the Nine-Headed Snakes, and more than six of them are on the Species Ranking. These two Nine-Headed Snakes aren’t emotionally stable and are full of hatred for Treasure City. If they weren’t trying to eliminate every single living being in Treasure City, they would have already struck!","“It’s obvious that the two Nine-Headed Snakes are husband and wife. The Nine-Headed Snakes have a tradition of monogamy. It’s likely that they are this irate because Treasure City has done something to their children!","“It’s very difficult for the Nine-Headed Snakes to continue their bloodline. There are some couples who go their entire lives without having offspring. The Nine-Headed Snakes have always laid eggs. In order to prevent their offspring from being targeted by other lifeforms, their eggs have strong aura-blocking abilities. Even the parents won’t be able to track their aura and find their offspring after losing them.”","Lin Yuan looked surprised when he heard this. “The Nine-Headed Snake couple can’t find their eggs. Why does it seem like they’re fending off other members of their own species as well?”","Winter smiled and said, “That’s exactly the case, Young Master. The Nine-Headed Snakes are always aggressive and will only go down kicking and screaming. Once something like this happens, it’s highly likely that the offspring have been stolen.","“When some Nine-Headed Snakes fail to have their own kids, they aren’t opposed to stealing the children of other Nine-Headed Snakes and bringing them up.”","Apparently, this Nine-Headed Snake couple was unable to locate their offspring. It was no wonder that they wanted to turn Treasure City inside out.","Since it was this direct, Winter could just take control of this couple.","“Winter, go and take control of the Nine-Headed Snake couple as well as both devil groups. Then, get rid of the two void passageways. You have to make sure that the couple won’t be able to escape!”","Lin Yuan was targeting not only the young Nine-Headed Snakes but their parents as well.","If this Nine-Headed Snake couple that had power above the Holy Spirit level joined Sky City, the faction would gain another two reliable experts!","Lin Yuan’s Body of All Spirits could absorb the bloodline of other lifeforms. It was likely that the Nine-Headed Snake bloodline would allow Lin Yuan’s body to improve significantly!"]},{"number":2880,"title":"Chapter 2880 Ice River That Pierced the Void Passageways!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2880 Ice River That Pierced the Void Passageways!","While Lin Yuan interacted with Winter, Li Feng waited silently.","A moment later, he noticed that the two void passageways had yet to be destroyed.","Li Feng could clearly see the two void passageways from any window in the City Lord Manor. They were already taller than Treasure City’s walls!","Li Feng became increasingly antsy, worried that Lin Yuan had overestimated himself and his subordinates had gone to the void passageways only to realize they were difficult to destroy. If that happened, everything would be doomed!","If the two void passageways were not destroyed, Treasure City would be trapped forever, unable to seek help from the outside world. Everything he had prepared would be reduced to a joke.","There was no way his preparations were sufficient to take on the torrent of Abyssal Beasts.","However, Lin Yuan had not moved from his spot. Thus, Li Feng could not react, either.","Lin Yuan did not seem like he was putting on a strong front. However, some time had passed since the agreed-upon time.","Winter moved very quickly. At the instant Lin Yuan decided to make a move on the Nine-Headed Snake couple, Winter captured them.","Inside a seemingly plain tent, a man and a woman with black hair and eyes, as well as silver and black scales dotting their bodies, sat next to each other. They had exquisite looks but had vertical pupils. Hence, they looked rather flirtatious.","At this moment, the air around them was very austere.","“Brother Chen, we have used the void passageways to lock down Treasure City. But I’m afraid the bastard who stole our child has already moved it. Why don’t we move up our attack on Treasure City?”","Compared to the woman, the man was much more composed.","“Ah Yao, we can’t even recognize our own offspring while it’s in egg form. The bastard who stole it can’t know either. He just took it while he was harvesting in the wild. It’s my fault that we lost the egg. If I hadn’t been pushed into the abyss by that idiot’s spatial power while I was hunting for food, our child wouldn’t have been stolen in the two minutes I was stuck!” Liu Yao sighed.","“Brother Chen, it’s not your fault.”","Ever since they bore a child together, the other members of their species in Moon Mist Swamp had placed a target on their backs. As a result, they had no choice but to leave Moon Mist Swamp together.","But it did not end even after they left Moon Mist Swamp. Other members of their species continued to hide in the shadows and try to steal their children.","Luckily, Liu Chen was sufficiently powerful and never failed to kill those who came after their offspring. Otherwise, their child would have already been captured and brought up by other Nine-Headed Snakes!","The Nine-Headed Snakes had a history of stealing each other’s offspring because not only was it difficult for the Nine-Headed Snakes to have offspring, but also because they claimed the ones who raised them as their parents. Once the Nine-Headed Snake broke out from their shell, they would claim the first lifeforms they saw as their parents.","This meant that the Nine-Headed Snakes that stole the offspring of another would easily be able to establish a bond with the offspring and become a real family.","It was possible for snake-species lifeforms to evolve into Nine-Headed Snakes. However, the Nine-Headed Snakes that evolved naturally in the wild were not recognized by the actual Nine-Headed Snakes.","The actual Nine-Headed Snakes were born with nine heads. While the Elemental Nine-Headed Snakes were growing, they would give their heads different attributes.","The spatial attribute was the most difficult one to give.","Liu Chen had been tripped up by an Elemental Nine-Headed Snake with the spatial attribute and was trapped in the abyss. As a result, they lost their offspring.","Before Liu Chen could respond to Liu Yao’s words, he heard an elderly voice say from the air above them, “You don’t have to decide who’s right or wrong. I can help you find our offspring! But in exchange, you have to submit to our Young Master.”","Liu Yao and Liu Chen were stunned when they heard this voice. They hurriedly bellowed simultaneously, “Who is that?”","Liu Yao and Liu Chen had experienced far too many attacks recently. They did not used to be this sensitive towards being attacked, but this time was different because they noticed that their auras could not lock down this incoming troublemaker.","There was only one possibility for this, which was that this person was much stronger than the two of them!","Otherwise, he would not have arrived without the two of them noticing.","Liu Chen was fully on guard as he snarled, “We will find our own child. Your Young Master doesn’t have to go through the effort! I hope you won’t stop us from searching for our child. We will be extremely grateful for that! Once we find our child, we will definitely repay you!”","While they were speaking, Liu Chen circulated the energy in his body. He knew that the person who came would not give up until they reached their goal!","Based on what they said, the other party’s goal was not their offspring but the two of them.","All this time, Liu Chen had been focusing his plans on Treasure City. But now, he felt as though he had become the prey. This was a feeling he had never experienced before.","Winter knew that Lin Yuan was waiting for him to destroy the void passageways, so he did not waste time speaking to Liu Yao and Liu Chen.","A frigid chill emanated from Winter’s body.","“Since the two of you refuse to cooperate, I will just have to take control of you.”","Liu Chen and Liu Yao tried to resist and performed a mystical hand gesture.","Soon, the enormous Nine-Headed Snake shadows behind the two of them solidified.","However, before the two shadows could fully solidify, they, along with Liu Yao and Liu Chen, were completely frozen by Winter.","If Lin Yuan could see Winter at this moment, he would definitely be shocked.","At this moment, Winter no longer looked elderly. Rather, he had transformed into an elegant man who looked like he was in his thirties.","The color of his eyes had not changed from their original light blue. But there were now two long and slender crystal antlers protruding from the top of his head. They looked as though they had been carved from ice.","Using this method to take control of the two Nine-Headed Snakes was the fastest. However, this would harm the roots of the two Nine-Headed Snakes.","But if they eventually decided to join Lin Yuan, it would be easy to heal their roots later.","Winter used the same method on the two devil groups.","Once he was done with this, a terrifying energy flowed out from Winter’s body. Soon, two towering pillars of ice stretched towards the two void passageways and directly pierced through them.","Soon, the two pillars of ice began to crack, and in the blink of an eye, Treasure City was enveloped in the river of ice.","The naked eye could only see a very small portion of the river of ice. The majority of the river of ice was cracking within the void passageways and blocking the Abyssal Beasts from descending.","The powerful Abyssal Commanders were rapidly frozen by the river of ice. Luckily, the Abyssal Commanders’ physiques were strong enough not to be shattered by the cold.","The Abyssal lifeforms that had yet to reach World Emperor all shattered instantly upon contact with the frigid chill of the river of ice.","As the minutes and seconds ticked past, Li Feng had fallen deeper into despair. More than 20 minutes had passed since the agreed-upon time, yet there was no movement coming from the void tunnels. The Abyssal Beasts were not rampaging either.","This meant that Lin Yuan’s operation had likely failed.","Gradually, Li Feng felt as though he was going to explode. Lin Yuan could lie to him, but he could not play a joke on the entire Treasure City.","However, the river of ice that appeared abruptly completely wiped out all of the Abyssal Beasts and even caused the void passageways to turn illusory.","This was a might that Li Feng could not understand.","But this might also prove to Li Feng that Lin Yuan was someone he needed to do his best to build a relationship with.","“City Lord Li, sorry to make you wait. My people have eliminated the two void passageways. They will be closed soon. I’m sure that after all that commotion, the star pirates won’t be moving forward with their operation. You will be able to reach out for aid then.”","Li Feng forced himself to calm down before he clasped his fists together and said, “Young Master Lin, you are the savior of the entire Treasure City. We will tell Honor Absent Palace about what you’ve done so they can reward you! Help will be arriving very soon. I hope you will attend the banquet that will take place after this crisis. You deserve the most credit for saving Treasure City!”","Lin Yuan shook his head.","“I will be leaving soon. I don’t intend on staying in Treasure City for long. It looks like Treasure City will be postponing the Treasure Convention for some time.”","Li Feng understood what Lin Yuan meant.","Lin Yuan had come to Treasure City to attend the Treasure Convention. As the City Lord of Treasure City, Li Feng could decide when the Treasure Convention was held.","Li Feng wanted Lin Yuan to stay and could insist that the Treasure Convention could take place within a week. However, he was not going to do so.","Firstly, doing so would result in a Treasure Convention that did not have much substance. It was likely that Lin Yuan would lose interest in future Treasure Conventions after attending this one.","Additionally, it would be extremely irresponsible towards Treasure City.","Treasure City had lost the trust of its people due to this incident with the star pirates. Many of their resource supply chains were also broken.","It would take at least a hundred years before Treasure City was able to regain its original prowess and prosperity. The best time to hold the Treasure Convention again would be then.","Although Treasure City had suffered such damage, the next Treasure Convention would definitely be better than the previous ones!","That was the only way to regain the hearts of the people as well as Treasure City’s strength!","When he found out that Lin Yuan was about to leave, Li Feng forgot about his previous plan to ask Zhan Lu to ask Lin Yuan to become Treasure City’s guardian.","Based on his interaction with Lin Yuan, Li Feng knew that Lin Yuan was pragmatic. Otherwise, he would not decline to attend the banquet.","If he attended the banquet, he would play an important role in the event. It was clear Lin Yuan was not interested in being fawned upon.","“Young Master Lin, the Treasure Convention will indeed be pushed back for some time. It will be postponed by at least three years. But the next time that it takes place, it will be even grander than it used to be! Can I give you a communication item so we can keep in contact from now on?”","Based on Lin Yuan’s interest in the Treasure Convention, Li Feng knew what Lin Yuan’s goal was.","If Lin Yuan was unwilling to even leave a line of communication between them, it was likely that Lin Yuan would reject his request to become Treasure City’s guardian.","Li Feng was indirectly using this invitation to test Lin Yuan’s inclination.","Lin Yuan was very interested in the Treasure Convention, but he did not know where he would be three years later. He could not guarantee that he would be able to participate in the Treasure Convention.","The Treasure Convention would be a good source for Sky City to obtain resources. Even if Lin Yuan could not come personally, he could send someone from Treasure City to the Treasure Convention.","There were benefits to remaining in contact with Li Feng.","There was a good chance that the communication item Li Feng gave him would be a new method of communication after the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower!","“Sure, that’s not a problem at all. I’ll be glad to stay in touch with you. If my team members end up in Treasure City instead of me in the future, I hope you can look after them!”","There were countless people who asked Li Feng for help daily.","Li Feng hated it when someone used their connection with him to ask him to take care of their subordinates. It would be fine if those he agreed to protect were bullied and he intercepted. But if they caused trouble instead and were accused by others, it would not be appropriate for him to step in as the City Lord.","However, Lin Yuan’s words put Li Feng in a great mood because it meant that he was willing to continue interacting with him. This greatly increased his chances of successfully asking Lin Yuan to become Treasure City’s guardian!","Li Feng mustered his courage and asked Lin Yuan, “Young Master Lin, Treasure City is in the midst of a storm. In order for us to rise again, we need the support of experts. Here and now, let me invite you to become Treasure City’s guardian. Please protect Treasure City. Treasure City won’t disappoint your contribution and will provide you with offerings! Please give Treasure City this chance!”","Lin Yuan raised an eyebrow. Lin Yuan had not expected this invitation from Li Feng.","Lin Yuan thought that Li Feng had focused his management of Treasure City on the development of the city’s finances.","Now that Li Feng had extended this invitation to him and was willing to spend resources on experts, it meant that Li Feng was changing Treasure City’s style of management.","Li Feng, the City Lord of Treasure City, was finally enlightened!"]},{"number":2881,"title":"Chapter 2881 Sky City’s New Strength!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2881 Sky City’s New Strength!","Worship involved both protection and provision.","After accepting their provision, he also needed to take up the responsibility of protecting Treasure City.","Lin Yuan had already decided to build his team in Treasure City. The Purple Feather Rain Pigeons were already under his control. Apart from the Purple Feather Rain Pigeons, which functioned as a force working from the shadows, Lin Yuan was also linked to Fortune Treasure Palace.","With these two channels in Treasure City that he could tap into, Lin Yuan did not mind leaving another channel in the city that he could use to receive offerings.","However, Lin Yuan also wanted to see what kind of offerings Li Feng would give him.","Lin Yuan did not feel any bond to Treasure City. He saved it because it was part of him reaching his own goal. If Lin Yuan truly became Treasure City’s guardian, he would definitely invest more effort into Treasure City.","“City Lord Li, from my angle, it seems that gaining more guardians will indeed be a way of helping Treasure City. You want to invite me to become Treasure City’s guardian. What do I need to do for Treasure City? What will Treasure City offer me in return?”","Li Feng was afraid that Lin Yuan would turn him down without hesitation. He was not worried that Lin Yuan would negotiate terms with him. Rather, he looked forward to it.","Lin Yuan’s desires shone through clearly when he was negotiating. It meant that he would only become more invested in Treasure City from now on.","Li Feng laid out his requests seriously, “Young Master Lin, Treasure City has never had a guardian before. If you are willing to become Treasure City’s guardian, you’ll be the first! This role won’t require you to do much normally. You only need to help Treasure City when Treasure City is in danger. This incident was sudden. I don’t know the reason for this situation, but I don’t think that Treasure City will ever be in such a crisis again!”","Li Feng did not know the reason for this crisis, but Lin Yuan was fully aware.","It was likely that one of the chambers of commerce in the city had accidentally taken the Nine-Headed Snake egg. Alternatively, one of the factions who had come to Treasure City for the Treasure Convention had brought the egg to the city to trade during the Treasure Convention. The probability of such an accidental event was very low.","Treasure City was part of the Sky Beyond the Clouds that was under Honor Absent Palace’s jurisdiction. As such, the probability of Treasure City being endangered was very low.","“As Treasure City’s guardian, I will have to protect Treasure City when it’s in danger. What will Treasure City bring me?”","Lin Yuan did not shoot him down after hearing the responsibilities that came with being Treasure City’s guardian. This meant that Lin Yuan could accept this responsibility.","Li Feng had been thinking about the resources they could provide for the past few days. He now had an idea for a response.","“Young Master Lin, to be honest, I made a mistake with Treasure City’s development. I can face that mistake now. Treasure City’s defensive power is much weaker than that of other cities. From now on, I will be pivoting the direction of Treasure City’s development.","“I won’t be focusing all of Treasure City’s resources completely on the development of finances. This will cause Treasure City’s revenue to fall from its usual quantity. I will provide you with 2.5% of Treasure City’s revenue periodically as compensation for your assistance.”","For a grand and giant city like Treasure City, 2.5% of the profits represented an unimaginable amount of resources!","Li Feng’s sincerity was evident from his willingness to give Lin Yuan all those resources.","Truthfully, Li Feng only intended to give Lin Yuan 1.5% of Treasure City’s revenue at first. He increased it to 2.5% because he did not want any issues to crop up, with Lin Yuan being Treasure City’s guardian.","Lin Yuan was silently surprised by Li Feng’s determination. He was actually willing to give him 2.5% of the revenue.","However, Lin Yuan did not need any Honor Absent dollars. He could get his hands on resources like pure spirit qi and other elemental resources easily.","What Lin Yuan really needed were spiritual ingredients and feys with special effects.","Liu Chen retracted his sharp aura and told Lin Yuan in a humble and amicable tone, “We come from the Moon Mist Swamp. We came here because we were afraid of other Nine-Headed Snakes stealing our child. If you want anything, just let us know. All we want is the chance to search for our child so our family can be reunited! Our child will be hatching soon and will urgently require us to inject our energy into it to feed it.”","Liu Chen’s power exceeded the Holy Spirit level, yet he was acting in such a humble manner toward Lin Yuan. This touched Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan said seriously, “Before you join me, your survival has nothing to do with me. If you’re willing to join me and become my subordinates, it goes without saying that I’ll make sure that your family is reunited!","“I won’t give you much time to think it over. You are the most aware of the Nine-Headed Snakes’ nature. If your offspring hatches while you’re thinking, the one who picked up the egg will find out that there was a Nine-Headed Snake in the egg.","“I’m sure you can imagine what comes after. Your child will definitely be hidden away. If they don’t receive energy, they will become weak. Even if they survive, they won’t be able to grow well!”","Lin Yuan thought that taking over this Nine-Headed Snake couple would require considerable effort. Yet, they accepted his request easily.","“Lord, we’re willing to join you. I hope you will promise to help find our offspring!”","Liu Yao and Liu Chen were both level-headed and knew that power ruled above all else in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Firstly, this young man had taken control of them easily. They were completely incapable of fighting back. Thus, they had no authority to speak, much less reject his request.","Additionally, Liu Yao and Liu Chen could both tell that Lin Yuan was far from ordinary. It would benefit them to join someone of this caliber. It was possible that doing so would also benefit their child’s future.","Lastly, they knew that they stood virtually no chance of finding their offspring if they did not have Lin Yuan’s approval.","Liu Yao and Liu Chen’s direct acceptance of becoming Lin Yuan’s subordinate saved Lin Yuan a lot of trouble.","However, Lin Yuan was still unsure about how to take control and gain the loyalty of experts like Liu Yao and Liu Chen, who were above the Holy Spirit level.","Winter guessed what Lin Yuan was thinking and said seriously, “Young Master, there is already a holy spirit living in your divine kingdom. As long as you have your holy spirit, you will be able to take control of another party’s holy spirit. The loyalty of even Holy Spirit experts is assured when their holy spirits are under your control.”","Lin Yuan relaxed when he heard what Spring said, while Liu Yao and Liu Chen looked at him in surprise.","The two of them could tell that he was less than 50 years old. They were also sure that his background was far from normal.","It was astonishing that a lifeform less than 50 years old had such an expert following him!","They never expected Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom to already have a holy spirit living in it.","Did Holy Spirit experts who were younger than 50 years old truly exist in this world?","The speed at which a lifeform increased their power, as well as the limit of their power, was linked to their bloodline.","The Nine-Headed Snakes were a species from legend, and their bloodline was sufficiently strong. But compared to this young man’s bloodline, the Nine-Headed Snake bloodline seemed insignificant!","Just what species had a bloodline like this that allowed him to attain such power at such an age?","While Lin Yuan was taking control of Liu Chen and Liu Yao, he noticed that both of them only had one holy spirit in their divine kingdoms.","But Lin Yuan’s divine kingdom already had two holy spirits. If he wanted to, there could be even more!","Liu Yao and Liu Chen were not the only Holy Spirit experts Lin Yuan had interacted with. The other Holy Spirit experts he had interacted with also only had one holy spirit in their divine kingdoms.","This caused Lin Yuan to suddenly wonder if it was actually the norm for Holy Spirit experts to have only one holy spirit in their divine kingdoms."]},{"number":2882,"title":"Chapter 2882 Fan Lou’s News!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2882 Fan Lou’s News!","It wasn’t difficult for Lin Yuan to ascertain this. All he needed to do was ask the Holy Spirit experts he had taken control of.","Alternatively, he could get the answer by asking Spring and Winter.","Many of the Holy Spirit experts under Lin Yuan came from large species. They did not lack resources during their growth. If there was any chance that they were able to nurture more holy spirits in their divine kingdom, they definitely would not pass up on the opportunity. Hence, it was highly likely that his divine kingdom was special.","Lin Yuan had proven this when he gained a holy spirit in his divine kingdom back when he was only a pinnacle spirit fire expert.","After Lin Yuan used Truth to take control of the holy spirits in Liu Yao and Liu Chen’s divine kingdoms, Winter released Liu Yao and Liu Chen from their restraints.","Winter did not have a bad impression of Liu Yao and Liu Chen. They continued to prioritize searching for their offspring and their offspring’s safety despite being under Lin Yuan’s control. They did not try to gain anything from Lin Yuan. This lack of greed and bluff made them suitable for Lin Yuan to use.","After they were released, Liu Yao and Liu Chen continued acting respectfully toward Lin Yuan. They bowed deeply to him.","Liu Yao spoke first, “Lord, we will definitely work for you loyally from now on. I hope you will help us to find our offspring as soon as possible!”","Normally, Liu Yao would never make a request to Lin Yuan immediately after joining him. However, this was a special situation. She did not want her offspring’s future development to be affected because she did not transfer energy to it in time. She also did not want the person who stole her offspring to end up as her offspring’s closest kin.","Lin Yuan immediately said, “I heard the news from Winter before you arrived. I have already asked the City Lord to send a team of City Guards to search all the factions’ resources using the star pirates’ invasion as an excuse. All the two of you need to do is retract your aura and stay with the City Guards.","“If you find your offspring, just retrieve it. Don’t act impulsively while you’re with the City Guards. Once the City Guards are done with their investigation, you can seek revenge if you want. Remember to minimize unnecessary harm when you act!”","Liu Chen and Liu Yao were extremely thankful to Lin Yuan. Not only had he found a way for them to search for their offspring, but he even cared for their feelings and gave them the opportunity to seek revenge. He did not tell them to forget about revenge for the sake of the repercussions.","“Lord, you don’t have to worry. Whatever Ah Yao and I do won’t cause any negative impacts that affect you! Can you let us go now?”","Liu Chen had only just joined Lin Yuan. Liu Chen knew that Lin Yuan had to have many things that he wanted to ask about the star pirates’ invasion. He was worried that Lin Yuan would hold him and Liu Yao back and only allow them to leave after they told him everything.","However, Liu Chen’s concern did not come into play.","“I will personally take you to see Treasure City’s City Lord. Everything else can wait until you’ve found your offspring.”","Lin Yuan’s words warmed Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s hearts. They were lucky to have joined such a master!","Although Liu Yao and Liu Chen could not ascertain the egg’s location, they could still sense their egg and would definitely be able to identify it.","Li Feng did not know what Lin Yuan’s reason for making such a suggestion was.","However, Li Feng wanted to use the opportunity that was the star pirates’ invasion to gain an understanding of the factions’ resources. This would enable him to move forward in taking control of Treasure City. He would not be able to do so without the circumstances of crisis and danger.","At first, Li Feng only sent two teams of City Guards. But he ended up sending eight teams because Lin Yuan had secretly promised him that the Star Pirate Alliance would not destroy Treasure City.","In Li Feng’s mind, Lin Yuan’s method of destroying the two pinnacle Class 3 void passageways was almost magical.","Li Feng trusted Lin Yuan’s promise.","Li Feng had displeased many factions by sending the City Guards to rummage through and check all their resources. However, given the circumstances, not even Yin Ruo, who had two Holy Spirit experts, could turn down Li Feng’s request.","It did not take long for Liu Chen and Liu Yao to return to Lin Yuan. They found their offspring in a chamber of commerce. It had been displayed on a shelf without being given any special treatment.","Liu Chen was fully honest and did not hide anything from Lin Yuan.","If Lin Yuan had chosen to punish them because of this matter, Liu Chen would have accepted this punishment alongside Liu Yao. After all, every faction’s leader had different perspectives and approaches.","Lin Yuan was momentarily silent before he said to Liu Chen and Liu Yao, “I understand why you did what you did. I am now Treasure City’s sponsor. Now that you’ve joined me, why don’t you help me to protect Treasure City?”","Liu Yao let out a sigh of relief before she hurriedly asked, “Lord, should Brother Chen and I go and eliminate the star pirates immediately? Or should we ensure that they don’t damage Treasure City?”","There were many ways to protect Treasure City. Liu Yao was very detailed and always made sure to clarify the situation before she did anything.","Liu Yao felt that it would be too ostentatious if she and Liu Chen eliminated the star pirates outright.","Regardless of the situation or the power that one possessed, standing out too much did not align with the way of survival in the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","“You don’t have to get rid of the star pirates. All you need to do is ensure that they don’t cause widespread destruction in the city. Even if anyone from the Star Pirate Alliance entered Treasure City, there will be people to handle them.”","Li Feng had told Lin Yuan about what was happening in Treasure City. He saw Lin Yuan as one of his own.","As the City Lord of Treasure City, Li Feng was the true controller of Treasure City. He knew that Treasure City only managed to survive because of Lin Yuan’s help.","The factions in Treasure City never submitted to Li Feng’s control.","When Li Feng tried revitalizing Treasure City in the future, the factions would definitely use this incident to undermine Li Feng’s strength and increase their influence in Treasure City. This would greatly lower the speed of Treasure City’s development and cause Li Feng’s plan for Treasure City to fail.","Li Feng felt that he should use this opportunity to remove these problems.","Zhan Lu had already told Lin Yuan all about these factions and this situation.","Zhan Lu saw these factions as parasites. Many of the chambers of commerce established by the various species were under the thumb of these factions. If these factions did not exist, Treasure City would be far more prosperous than it currently was.","Moreover, Zhan Lu had been suspecting that the factions had been colluding and were aspiring to take over Treasure City!","During the recent crisis, the experts from this city had not shown Li Feng the appropriate respect as the City Lord of Treasure City. They had placed all the pressure on Li Feng and abandoned Treasure City in its time of need.","One of the factions had even fled before Treasure City’s combat power was affected and diminished. Before they left, they even made arrangements so that they could regain all the resources after they returned.","From Li Feng’s perspective, there was no need to keep such factions around.","As Treasure City’s sponsor, Lin Yuan definitely preferred Treasure City to develop in the best and most positive direction.","Treasure City was currently the best channel for Lin Yuan to obtain resources.","After asking for Lin Yuan’s stance, Liu Chen and Liu Yao immediately left to work with Treasure City’s City Guards.","Liu Yao and Liu Chen were well aware of what the star pirates were capable of.","After thinking for a moment, they went to see Li Feng and began making arrangements with him.","Li Feng assumed that Liu Yao and Liu Chen were Lin Yuan’s hidden subordinates. They did not know that they were also the ones behind the Star Pirate Alliance.","Lin Yuan decided to spirit lock the feys he had picked out. Fan Lou used the crystal that Winter had given him to send an urgent message to Lin Yuan.","Using the crystal to send a message came at a high cost. Fan Lou would not bother Lin Yuan unless it was absolutely necessary."]},{"number":2883,"title":"Chapter 2883 The Sacred Space of the Bloodians!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2883 The Sacred Space of the Bloodians!","Lin Yuan abandoned his plan to spirit-lock feys and began communicating with Fan Lou through the crystal jade.","Fan Lou was currently extremely nervous in the Bloodians’ territory. He had indeed discovered something when he contacted Lin Yuan.","However, Lin Yuan had not instructed Fan Lou to inform him of the situation that Fan Lou had discovered.","At this moment, Fan Lou was making the decision on his own. Fan Lou felt that he needed to inform Lin Yuan after some consideration.","If Lin Yuan was not interested in this matter, he would at most reprimand him. However, if Lin Yuan was interested in this matter, it would be equivalent to him contributing and becoming a person who had contributed.","Fan Lou had seen Lin Yuan use his body to absorb the essence blood of other species, including the Bloodians. It was precisely because of this that Fan Lou had reported this matter to Lin Yuan.","“Greetings, Lord. I’m Fan Lou. How have you been, Lord?”","Lin Yuan said in a clear voice, “I’ve been doing well recently. If anything happens on your side, you can inform me right away. I encountered some matters here that delayed my footsteps, but I should be able to meet you later.”","Upon hearing this, Fan Lou looked surprised and disappointed. Fan Lou was surprised because he had witnessed Lin Yuan’s strength, and Lin Yuan had easily controlled the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords. It was hard to imagine the kind of strength that he possessed. Fan Lou did not expect that Lin Yuan, who was so powerful, would still be held back by some matters.","On the other hand, he was disappointed that Lin Yuan didn’t consider his mission to follow up with the Bloodians as important. After Fan Lou adopted this mindset, he immediately realized that he had been too complacent recently, which led to a sense of arrogance creeping into his thoughts. He was indeed nothing to Lin Yuan, so it was better to maintain a humble attitude around him.","Whether it was because Feng Qing highly regarded him or because he had become an honored guest of the Bloodians due to his relationship with the Dark Pufferfish, it was all related to Lin Yuan’s support behind the scenes.","Had it not been for Lin Yuan, Feng Qing might not be able to put him in an important position. Even if he was put in an important position by Feng Qing and sent to the Dark Pufferfish for a mission, even if he did not die at their hands, the Bloodians would also question him if he didn’t fulfill their request.","Although Feng Qing valued him, he was only regarded as an assistant by his side and an existence that could be discarded at any moment should the need arise.","Fan Lou said to Lin Yuan in an extremely serious tone, “Master, an ancient lineage of the Bloodians has initiated the blood pool. There seems to be a Bloodian Queen who wishes to seek a breakthrough in her bloodline. The Bloodians I’m currently with have set their sights on this blood pool. I would like to ask if Lord is interested in the blood pool.”","Lin Yuan initially thought that Fan Lou had suddenly looked for him because there was a problem in the main world. Now that he knew that it had nothing to do with the main world, Lin Yuan heaved a sigh of relief.","Lin Yuan didn’t know what the Bloodians’ blood pool was, but he was certain that it was quite useful.","As for what exactly the blood pool was, Lin Yuan definitely could not ask Fan Lou. It wouldn’t be acceptable for Lin Yuan not to know about things that Fan Lou knew.","As the condenser of the crystal jade, Winter was also aware that Fan Lou had communicated with Lin Yuan through the crystal jade.","Winter hurriedly explained to Lin Yuan when he noticed the latter looking at him, “Young Master, every Bloodian with an ancient lineage possesses a sacred space. The blood pool usually exists inside the sacred space.","“After every large-scale hunt, the Bloodians will inject a portion of the essence of the prey’s blood into the blood pool for accumulation. The blood pool will nurture the energy in this blood. After a long time, the blood-type energy will surge, causing a tide to appear every few decades.”","“Whether or not Bloodians’ blood pool can produce a blood tide is one of the conditions to determine their foundation.","“In order to prove their strength, some Bloodians will still artificially induce the tide of blood even if the blood-type energy in the blood pool hasn’t reached a surging level. They would even go to the extent of creating a fake blood tide and spreading a fake message directly outside.","“A powerful Bloodian will only use the energy in the blood pool at a critical moment.","“Young Master, the Bloodian bloodline in your body is pure, but your bloodline level is too low. Suppose you can absorb the energy in the blood pool to nurture and strengthen the Bloodian bloodline in your body. In that case, it will definitely reach an extremely advanced level in an extremely short period.","“There’s a restriction in the sacred space of the Bloodians. Due to the restriction, only Bloodians with the bloodline can enter. Furthermore, it has to be a pure bloodline. However, once the sacred space of the Bloodians is opened, even non-core members of the Bloodians can enter. It’s very difficult for the outside world to know that the Bloodians have initiated the blood pool. It’s an excellent opportunity for you.”","Upon hearing this, Lin Yuan’s eyes lit up, gaining a clear understanding of the blood pool.","The Bloodians had a long lifespan, and at the same time, they were a species that hunted frequently. The blood-type energy in the blood pool of any powerful species could only be described as vast.","These Bloodians had initiated the blood pool in order to elevate the bloodline of a Bloodian Queen. This meant that the energy in the blood pool was most likely overflowing.","Fan Lou had given Lin Yuan a fortuitous opportunity, so Lin Yuan spoke to him very seriously, “Fan Lou, you have told me a piece of information that is extremely useful to me. As a reward, I will arrange two pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Human Weapons for you to use.","“It’s not suitable for you to enhance your bloodline among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, but I promise to provide you a chance to transform your bloodline in the future.”","Lin Yuan’s promise deeply resonated within Fan Lou’s heart.","Lin Yuan had arranged two pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Human Weapons for Fan Lou, which was equivalent to ensuring Fan Lou’s safety. Fan Lou could also use the power of these two Human Weapons to do many things that he wanted to do.","For example, Kong Huan, whom Fan Lou had been loyal to back then, was only a pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom expert.","Feng Qing was still quite a distance away from evolving to the Holy Spirit level. In the environment Fan Lou was in, two pinnacle World Emperor/Divine Kingdom Human Weapons were sufficient. Apart from ensuring Fan Lou’s safety, Lin Yuan’s promise to help Fan Lou enhance his bloodline was equivalent to promising Fan Lou an extremely bright future.","Fan Lou also knew that Lin Yuan had helped Kong Huan upgrade her bloodline. If Lin Yuan could upgrade Kong Huan’s bloodline just like that, the bloodline that Lin Yuan had promised him would definitely not be bad.","Due to his own bloodline and the fact that he had absorbed the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ bloodline, his bloodline could only continue to develop in the current direction.","However, as long as he worked harder for Lin Yuan in the future and gained his recognition, there was a possibility that Lin Yuan might enhance his bloodline to an even higher level than Kong Huan’s.","Insignificant figures had their own way of living. As an insignificant figure in the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Lin Yuan’s treatment of Fan Lou could be considered completely maximized. With his safety and future guaranteed, Fan Lou was passionate about serving Lin Yuan.","“Master, thank you for your appreciation. I will definitely not disappoint you in the future. Do you need me to keep you informed of any new developments?”","Fan Lou did not inquire to confirm if Lin Yuan required his updates. He was very well aware that he had to report the subsequent situation to Lin Yuan. However, Fan Lou needed to know from Lin Yuan how often he would have to report in the future.","Fan Lou could feel that whenever he contacted Lin Yuan through the crystal jade, a lot of soul energy would be lost.","Winter sent a voice transmission to Lin Yuan, “Young Master, the number of crystal jades I gave out is very limited. As long as the long-distance communication doesn’t exceed 30 crystal jades per day, I can replenish the consumed soul energy on my own.","“Since the Bloodians that Fan Lou is with know that other Bloodians are about to initiate the blood pool, this news has most likely spread. These Bloodians will definitely consume the energy in the blood pool as soon as possible. I suggest that we leave immediately. Otherwise, we might miss this opportunity. Letting Fan Lou report in real-time will help us control the situation.”","Lin Yuan had always been afraid that using the crystal jade too frequently would consume too much of Winter’s energy.","However, Lin Yuan felt completely relieved upon hearing from Winter. Since Winter could replenish his energy independently, it would not have any effect on him even if Lin Yuan communicated with Fan Lou.","“Fan Lou, inform me immediately if anything happens. When we meet to equip you with the two Human Weapons, I will provide you with a new communication tool. It’ll be much more convenient for us to communicate then!”","Fan Lou was overjoyed when Lin Yuan asked him to report the situation in real time, as it provided Fan Lou more opportunities to communicate with Lin Yuan. Fan Lou cherished the opportunity to communicate with Lin Yuan. The more opportunities he had to communicate with Lin Yuan, the easier it was to gain Lin Yuan’s recognition.","“Master, the Bloodians I’m currently with have communicated with the envoys of the Dark Pufferfish. They hope to form an alliance with the Dark Pufferfish and obtain their help in their operations.","“During this period, the Dark Pufferfish envoys have developed a very close relationship with the Bloodians and have already gained their trust. I wonder if we should facilitate cooperation between the Dark Pufferfish and the Bloodians?","“The territory of the Dark Pufferfish is located in a remote place like the Lonely River. The Bloodians are completely defenseless against the Dark Pufferfish. I’m not worried about any conflict of interest with the Dark Pufferfish at all.”","Fan Lou had actually taken quite a risk in making such a proposal.","The Dark Pufferfish did not have the ability to communicate with Lin Yuan directly, so they were not under his command. If the Dark Pufferfish’s leader wanted to improve his status among the species, he did not need to curry favor with Ink Thorn. Instead, he needed to think of a way to gain Lin Yuan’s recognition.","Fan Lou would not have a chance to participate if this matter spread back to the Dark Pufferfish and Ink Thorn communicated with Lin Yuan through Bei Xu.","The Dark Pufferfish envoys had given him face and allowed him to manipulate them. Now that they had something to ask of him, Fan Lou really couldn’t refuse. Furthermore, if the entire Dark Pufferfish participated, it would once again bring the Bloodians closer to the Dark Pufferfish. By then, his status as a bridge figure would also rise.","Now, some other Bloodians had become aware of his existence and wanted to contact the Dark Pufferfish through him. This situation marked an increase in his value. Feng Qing no longer treated him like a subordinate.","Lin Yuan raised his brows. It would take at least a month for the members of the Dark Pufferfish to head to the Bloodians’ gathering area. Could it be that the Bloodians would wait for nearly a month to initiate the blood pool?","Lin Yuan raised his question to Fan Lou. If the Bloodians’ blood pool was opened before the Dark Pufferfish experts arrived, the experts wouldn’t be able to help at all.","If the blood pool only opened after a month, it would be great news for Lin Yuan. If Lin Yuan wanted to rush to the Scarlet Territory where the Bloodians were gathered, it would take him more than half a month, even if he were to rush there at full speed. Furthermore, Lin Yuan needed to stay in Treasure City for a few more days to make arrangements for the situation there.","Fan Lou quickly explained to Lin Yuan, “Master, the Bloodians need to undergo many rituals to open the blood pool. These rituals will consume a lot of time. Although the Bloodians I’m currently with have their eyes set on the blood pool, they’re not planning to snatch it and take the energy in it for themselves.","“On the contrary, they want to use the opportunity to get a portion of the blood tide when the blood pool opens. If any Bloodians dare to set their sights on the blood pool of other Bloodians, a war will definitely break out between the two Bloodians. This is a situation that the other Bloodians won’t allow to happen.","“Although there are always conflicts between the Bloodians, they are unlikely to escalate into wars that threaten their survival. If you are interested in this blood pool, you must make thorough preparations!","Lin Yuan muttered to himself when he heard Fan Lou’s words.","Since the other Bloodians only coveted the blood tide that would spread after the blood pool opened, this Bloodian opening the blood pool wouldn’t cause too much of a commotion. On the contrary, those Bloodians who coveted the blood tide would provide protection to a certain extent.","It was not easy for Lin Yuan to use the energy in the blood pool to strengthen the Bloodian bloodline nurtured by his Body of All Spirits.","Lin Yuan needed to think of a way to create some chaos. It would be best if this chaos could cause a conflict between the Bloodians so Lin Yuan could take advantage of it to enter the blood pool.","Lin Yuan asked, “Fan Lou, how did the arrangements I asked you to make before turn out?”","Fan Lou had long wanted to discuss this matter with Lin Yuan. Since Lin Yuan had taken him under his wing, this mission was the only task he assigned to Fan Lou besides protecting the Class 2 world as the Boundary Patrol Envoy of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team."]},{"number":2884,"title":"Chapter 2884 Snake Eyes and Six Flowers Curse!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2884 Snake Eyes and Six Flowers Curse!","In order to prove to Lin Yuan that he had been doing his best all along, Fan Lou had already achieved results long ago. However, since Lin Yuan did not take the initiative to bring it up, Fan Lou was afraid that initiating the conversation himself might raise suspicions of seeking recognition from Lin Yuan. Therefore, Fan Lou did not do so.","Now that Lin Yuan had brought it up himself, Fan Lou could finally happily talk about his results. “Master, it was not convenient for me to involve myself when I was first placed in an important position by Feng Qing because it would have some degree of association with me.","“This made me change my target from looking for people who were somewhat related to me and possessed a certain level of strength, and instead developed relationships with those who were completely unfamiliar to me and less powerful than me, and used them.","“These people have no connection with me, whether openly or secretly. Hence, anything they do will not affect me.","“Among them, there are a few people whom I can recommend through Feng Qing, allowing them to enter the Bloodians’ sight. In the end, no matter what they did, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves would be the main carrier of responsibility.","“Because of my relationship with the Dark Pufferfish, I’m very useful to the Bloodians now. They won’t regard me as one of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves anymore. Besides, I’m only a distant relative of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. The origin of my bloodline has nothing to do with them.”","Fan Lou had already known Lin Yuan’s goal from the moment he assigned him the task, especially since Lin Yuan had deliberately emphasized that he wanted to ensure that it had nothing to do with him.","However, although Fan Lou could clear himself, he had just obtained power and escaped from the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. In addition, since this matter needed to be coordinated with the Bloodians, Fan Lou could only use the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves as a scapegoat.","Lin Yuan nodded to himself. Fan Lou had completed this mission much better than Lin Yuan had expected. Lin Yuan had not expected Fan Lou to be able to use the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves as a tool when he had just escaped. Lin Yuan greatly admired Fan Lou’s intelligence.","“Since you’re the one who completed the mission, I’ll entrust you to make the future arrangements. Fan Lou, if you can keep up your intelligence, I will promote you to a member of Honor Absent Palace.”","Lin Yuan cut off the connection with Fan Lou, leaving Fan Lou staring blankly at the crystal jade.","Lin Yuan’s promise was something that Fan Lou did not even dare to hope for. If one wanted to become a member of the Honor Absent Parliament, it was essential to have a species as their backing.","Lin Yuan’s promise was equivalent to agreeing to Fan Lou’s request, allowing him to breed his own bloodline later. If he were to become a member of the Honor Absent Parliament, Fan Lou would be considered a top figure in the entire East Universe of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","This status was different from the status brought by strength, but it was more prominent because of Honor Absent Palace. Even those Holy Spirit experts would never dare to make a move on a World Emperor/Divine Kingdom expert.","Even if they didn’t pose a threat to the life of the Honor Absent Parliament members and only infringed upon their dignity and authority, the latter could still report the issue to Honor Absent Palace. The Honor Absent Palace would have a specialized department to handle such matters.","If they were to kill the members of Honor Absent Parliament and threaten their lives and safety, their entire species involved would be held accountable by Honor Absent Palace.","Many factions on the Species Ranking had met their demise because they killed a member of Honor Absent Palace and defied their judges.","Fan Lou knew very well that if Lin Yuan really promoted him to a member of the Honor Absent Parliament, it would only be the beginning.","Winter also acknowledged Fan Lou’s ability. Fan Lou was extremely weak in both strength and bloodline, yet he had completely relied on his intelligence and capability to change his fate.","In the beginning, Lin Yuan had chosen to take Fan Lou under his wing because he had no other choice. Now that Lin Yuan had various options, he still chose to entrust Fan Lou with an important position because Fan Lou earned it with his own efforts.","Lin Yuan had originally planned to stop traveling after leaving Treasure City and head straight to the Scarlet Territory where the Bloodians were to meet Fan Lou.","Fan Lou’s report did not affect Lin Yuan’s plan at all. Lin Yuan knew very well that the Star Pirate Alliance would not pose a threat to Treasure City. Liu Chen and Liu Yao alone possessed the ability to destroy the Star Pirate Alliance.","Even if there was no void passageway now and the various factions in Treasure City could request help, the storm would not subside in two days. Firstly, as long as the Star Pirate Alliance did not invade Treasure City on a large scale, Liu Chen and Liu Yao would launch an attack.","When the various factions in Treasure City saw the light of victory, they would not think of resisting with all their might. Instead, they would try their best to ensure that the strength of their species didn’t diminish in the battle. Liu Chen and Liu Yao had already verified this for Lin Yuan.","Secondly, some factions in Treasure City had hidden agendas through this storm. Putting others aside, Li Feng, the City Lord of Treasure City, had a similar plan.","During these two days, Lin Yuan could properly nurture Morbius’ new spirit-locked fey.","...","When Lin Yuan entered the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Begin Lady immediately reported to him, “Lin Yuan, the dozen or so people whose lives you spared and brought into the Spirit Lock spatial zone are quite well-behaved. They have been arranged to work in the cat garden according to your instructions. I’ve asked Celestial Sight to watch over them.","“My bloodline hasn’t improved much over the years, but my Celestial Sight bloodline is already showing signs of becoming a medial-class faerie. I estimate that the metamorphosis will take less than half a year!","“The Spirit Lock spatial zone is not suitable for evolving faeries. Lin Yuan, you have to release Celestial Sight from the Spirit Lock spatial zone!”","When she explained the situation to Lin Yuan, Begin Lady was filled with gratitude. As a faerie herself, Begin Lady was very well aware of how difficult it was to evolve a faerie’s bloodline. The Celestial Sight bloodline could improve so quickly because Lin Yuan had nourished it through the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Otherwise, Celestial Sight, this newborn faerie, would not be able to successfully transform its bloodline within 20 years. Even if it took thousands of years, it would be very difficult to obtain the corresponding opportunity.","The evolution of faeries required pure spirit qi and elemental energy. The Spirit Lock spatial zone could be said to be a paradise for faeries.","During this period, Lin Yuan’s attention was not on Celestial Sight. Celestial Sight and Begin Lady had stayed in the Spirit Lock spatial zone for decades to help take care of it.","Lin Yuan was extremely happy to hear that the Celestial Sight’s bloodline was about to undergo transformation.","“Begin Lady, how’s your bloodline progressing?”","Begin Lady smiled and shook her head. She was not obsessed with improving her strength. Different faeries had different characteristics. As a faerie with dual attributes, it was extremely difficult for the Begin Lady to level up.","Not only that, but the Begin Lady’s bloodline also possessed a special breeding ability. This was also the key to the Begin Lady being able to bestow her bloodline to other lifeforms and aid them in their transformation. It was precisely because of the uniqueness of her bloodline that Begin Lady encountered many barriers in increasing her strength.","“Lin Yuan, you also know that my bloodline is rather special. I’ve never felt any signs of my bloodline transforming. My bloodline might not be able to transform for a long time.”","Begin Lady was a little melancholic and sighed, “I initially believed that I could enhance my bloodline, but to my surprise, the more I strengthened myself, the more I realized the limitations of my abilities.”","Begin Lady’s words were filled with helplessness.","Lin Yuan now had a much clearer understanding of the faeries than before.","Spring had explained to Lin Yuan about faeries before. They could be said to be nature’s darlings. The faeries evolved from natural phenomena such as mountains and rivers and were born with the will of heaven and earth. They possessed the ability to fuse with heaven and earth. However, to a certain extent, this talent had also become a shackle for the faeries, making it difficult for them to enhance their bloodline.","It was extremely difficult for middle-level faeries to evolve to higher-level faeries, especially for those with bloodlines that were even more difficult to evolve than ordinary faeries.","If he were still in the main world, Lin Yuan would not have made any promises to Begin Lady. However, he had already arrived at the Sky Beyond the Clouds and had undergone too many innovations.","Many of the resources that Lin Yuan had obtained from Fortune Treasure Palace were effective on the Begin Lady, but what she needed the most now was the spirit spring. The spiritual spring in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was much more advanced than the spiritual spring in the main world.","The spirit spring was a foundation-level resource in the main world, and it was the same in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Once the spirit spring was extracted from the ground, it would have an indelible effect on an area. As such, Lin Yuan did not choose to take the spring with him before he left the main world.","The factions in the Sky Beyond the Clouds that possessed spirit springs would also firmly control them to prevent them from flowing out. The spirit spring was a treasure for plant-type lifeforms, and it held the same significance for water-type lifeforms. However, this did not deter Lin Yuan from collecting the spirit springs.","“Begin, Lady, don’t be so pessimistic. Even if you continue staying in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, it’s only a matter of time before your bloodline evolves. The resources in the Spirit Lock spatial zone are sufficient to aid in your gradual transformation!”","“Apart from spirit qi and various types of elemental energy, what you need most is the nourishment of the spirit springs. You once told me that your main body, the Gaea Begin River, was formed from the spirit spring over tens of millions of years.”","“There are spirit springs in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. I’ll help you collect those spirit springs. Higher faeries won’t be beyond your reach.”","Begin Lady was slightly stunned when she heard this, but a gentle smile soon appeared on her face. Her eyes were filled with gratitude. Ever since she gained consciousness, she had been nurturing other lifeforms and helping them undergo metamorphosis. She would even distribute her bloodline to those with less innate talent. Now that her identity as Lin Yuan’s nurturer had changed, it felt good to have someone to rely on!","Lin Yuan chatted with Begin Lady for a while before taking out the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake from his spatial equipment. Lin Yuan chose not to place it in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","The environment of the Spirit Lock spatial zone was excessively suitable for any lifeforms that primarily relied on spirit qi as their main source of energy. It would not take long for these lifeforms to break through their grades in the Spirit Lock spatial zone.","Lin Yuan preferred to spirit-lock Bronze feys. A Bronze spirit-locked fey could guarantee that the fey would evolve to Legend at Bronze, but other spirit-locked feys could not guarantee this. If this could not be guaranteed, it would affect Morbius’ future potential. Lin Yuan did not want to take such a risk.","If the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake had not been a Bronze fey when it was discovered in Fortune Treasure Palace, Lin Yuan would have decisively given up on it, no matter how much potential it had.","Although the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake was a Bronze fey, snake-species feys had extraordinary intelligence.","As soon as the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake was summoned, it greedily absorbed the surrounding spirit qi and even treated Lin Yuan as a competitor. It was worried that Lin Yuan would share the spirit qi in the environment with it.","Lin Yuan could not help but smile when he saw the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s protective behavior. It seemed that the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake had yet to comprehend the situation.","Lin Yuan could use Morbius’ exclusive skill to lock other feys without needing the feys’ approval.","Even if the Bronze Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake had some intelligence, it could not deal with such complicated emotions.","Before Lin Yuan used True Data on the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake, he had carefully investigated it.","[Fey Name]: Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake","[Fey Species]: Snake Pupils/Illusion Snake","[Fey Grade]: Bronze (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood/Soul","[Fey Quality]: Legend","Abilities:","[Snake Eyes]: Controls other snake-species feys through its eyes. When its soul energy is sufficient to suppress other snake-species feys, it can induce them to contract or sacrifice it (Contract allows control over the snake-type lifeforms. As long as the targeted snake-type lifeforms’ spiritual power does not exceed its own, they will not escape its control. When sacrificing the targeted snake-type lifeforms, it can obtain energy from their bodies and use their flesh to strengthen its own physical fitness).","[Snake Coiling Defense]: Coils its body together, allowing the entire snake body to become one. When attacked, it can shrink its body and increase its defense to the greatest extent.","Exclusive Skill:","[Six Flowers Curse]: Through the Six Flowers Curse in the eye, whenever the target’s body is invaded by poison related to the target, a snake flower will grow from the wound. When the number of snake flowers reaches six, the target’s bloodline will be forcibly changed, turning the target into a sub-snake.","This was not the first time Lin Yuan had checked the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s data. The last time he had done so, he had not been as serious as he was now.","Even so, Lin Yuan had decided to spirit-lock the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake. Now that he saw how powerful it was, he trembled in fear!"]},{"number":2885,"title":"Chapter 2885 Power Bestowed by the Bloodline!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2885 Power Bestowed by the Bloodline!","If the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake were already so powerful, how powerful would it be if it transformed into the Nirvana Sky Snake? The Nirvana Sky Snake was indeed one of the three top snake bloodlines in the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds!","In the world that Lin Yuan had lived in during his previous life, many powerful lifeforms once existed, yet they ultimately faded away as part of natural changes and became forgotten in history.","The lifeforms in the Sky Beyond the Clouds would also undoubtedly be affected by natural changes, but their rise and fall would mostly depend on the circumstances they encountered during their growth process.","Take the Snow-Covered Foxes as an example. Although they were powerful in the beginning, they did not have much influence. The Snow-Covered Foxes that lived in the snow mountain in the North Universe for 100,000,000 years were semi-isolated from the world. The reason they were able to gain fame across the four universes was that they had actively nurtured other foxes as their own subordinates. It was this decision that helped them rise in influence.","Lin Yuan had heard Winter mention that the Nirvana Sky Snakes were a species that instinctively wanted to control other snakes due to their bloodline. Within their own kind, they also harbored the goal of controlling each other.","They were somewhat similar to the Sky Radish Endless Vines. It was very difficult for the Nirvana Sky Snakes to help each other due to their inherent wariness. Regardless of how powerful they were, they would definitely face a lot of trouble during their reproduction process. Lin Yuan believed that this should be the real cause behind the decline and eventual destruction of the Nirvana Sky Snakes.","The Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake, which only possessed a trace of the Nirvana Sky Snake bloodline, had a much stronger soul energy than other snake-species feys. Through Snake Eyes, the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake could choose to contract or sacrifice other snake-species feys as long as its soul power could suppress the latter.","If the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake chose to contract other snake-species feys, the latter would be subjected to its control, turning them into puppets to be manipulated at will.","On the other hand, if it chose to sacrifice other snake-species feys, the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake could permanently strengthen its own physique by using the targets’ flesh and blood, thereby gaining a portion of the energy accumulated by the targets through long-term reproduction.","The Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s Normal ability, Snake Eyes, allowed it to enhance its physique almost without an upper limit. Moreover, it could also increase its grade at an extremely fast speed by sacrificing other snake-species feys. Even if Lin Yuan had not known that it possessed the Nirvana Sky Snake’s bloodline, he would still have considered contracting it just with Snake Eyes.","The Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake was an elegant contractor. Its main combat method was to train the snake-species feys contracted through Snake Eyes. This made it akin to those spirit qi professionals whose primary focus was on increasing their defense.","Its Elite ability, Snake Coiling Defense, just so happened to strengthen the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s defense. Through this ability, it would greatly increase its defense by coiling its body and making its body become one.","While this kind of defensive ability might appear a little cumbersome, the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake used Snake Eyes to sacrifice other snake-species feys and used their flesh and blood to strengthen its physique.","Therefore, when the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake used Snake Coiling Defense to defend, even if other lifeforms of the same grade were stronger, they would pose no threat to it. Even if the ability was executed clumsily, as long as it achieved the desired outcome, then it could be considered an excellent ability.","As the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake was not an elite fey, Lin Yuan could not choose its Bronze exclusive skill. While it was not ideal for nurturing a Bronze fey, it was the best way to choose a fey. This ready-made exclusive skill could directly represent the value of a fey. Six Flowers Curse had enhanced its grade.","Six Flowers Curse was a curse ability. The Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake could control many snake-species feys, and most of them were adept at using poison. The snake-species feys controlled by Snake Eyes would all have connections to the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake.","When these snake-species feys attacked their targets, every time they injected poison into the target’s body, the target would be infected by the venom. Because of the curse effect of the Six Flowers Curse, a snake flower would grow from the target’s wound.","Targets will not be affected until five snake flowers grow. However, once there were six snake flowers on the target’s body, the target’s bloodline would undergo a huge mutation, and it would become a snake-shaped monster.","These snake-shaped monsters were collectively known as sub-snakes. Sub-snakes could be controlled and contracted by the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake through its Snake Eyes ability. As long as the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake possessed sufficient strength, everything in the world could be contracted or sacrificed. It was truly a terrifying creature!","Although the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake was extremely fierce to Lin Yuan, it immediately became obedient when Lin Yuan used Morbius’ exclusive skill, Spirit Lock, to control it.","However, Lin Yuan did not intend to let the Six-Flowed Jade Blood Snake sacrifice those innocent snake-species feys. Instead, he planned to let it use Six Flowers Curse to transform those evil star pirates and sacrifice them.","Given Treasure City’s current situation, it was extremely easy to obtain star pirates. In less than two days, Lin Yuan had evolved the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake to Diamond X/Fantasy V.","[Fey Name]: Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake","[Fey Species]: Snake Pupils/Illusion Snake","[Fey Grade]: Diamond (10/10)","[Fey Type]: Wood/Soul","[Fey Quality]: Fantasy V","Abilities:","[Snake Eyes]: Controls other snake-species feys through its eyes. When its soul energy is sufficient to suppress other snake-species feys, it can induce them to contract or sacrifice it (Contract allows control over the snake-type lifeforms. As long as the targeted snake-type lifeforms’ spiritual power does not exceed its own, it will not escape its control. When sacrificing the targeted snake-type lifeforms, it can obtain energy from their bodies and use their flesh to strengthen its own physical fitness).","[Snake Coiling Defense]: Coils its body together, allowing the entire snake body to become one. When attacked, it can shrink its body and increase its defense to the greatest extent.","[Wood Forging Armor]: When the pure wood-elemental energy is combined with the snake-species fey’s bloodline, it forms armor that interweaves with the bloodline on the surface of the body. Not only can it resist physical attacks, but it also has a certain resistance to elemental damage.","[Life-Prolonging Shedding]: Under the circumstances of using the Snake Coiling Defense, if the target pierces through the defense and poses a threat to its life, it instinctively undergoes a snake shedding to avoid fatal damage. Each snake shedding weakens the body and diminishes a certain amount of soul strength.","[Swift Snake Shadow]: Increases the snake-species feys under its control, allowing them to react and attack more quickly.","[Violent Venom Burst]: Activates the snake venom in the target’s body, causing the slow-acting snake venom to instantly activate its poison effect and cause timely damage to the target. The poison damage to the target will be converted into healing energy to heal the army of snakes.","Exclusive Skill:","[Six Flowers Curse]: Through the Six Flowers Curse in the eye, whenever the target’s body is invaded by poison related to the target, a snake flower will grow from the wound. When the number of snake flowers reaches six, the target’s bloodline will be forcefully changed, turning the target into a sub-snake.","[Control Strengthening]: When contracting a snake-species fey, the contract will be bound to the target’s soul. Once bound to the target’s soul, if the contract is shaken by external influences, the contract will spontaneously sacrifice the target to prevent it from breaking free from its control.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with his new spirit-locked fey. The Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake could be considered a functional fey or a power offense-type fey. Of course, the function of the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake was not achieved by itself but rather through controlling other snake-species feys and using them.","Lin Yuan thought to himself, “After the cat garden, I’m probably going to build another snake garden in the Spirit Lock spatial zone to nurture the snake-species feys controlled by the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake.”","The Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake could be considered a huge consumption of resources. Under normal circumstances, it was very difficult for feys that required a lot of resources to become too powerful in the natural environment. However, the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake relied on its powerful strength and ability to control other snake-species feys.","Even in a situation where resources were very scarce, they would still possess the strength to obtain a large number of resources."]},{"number":2886,"title":"Chapter 2886 Target: Scarlet Territory!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2886 Target: Scarlet Territory!","The Star Pirate Alliance had originally besieged Treasure City and treated it as their prey. The various pirate groups in the Star Pirate Alliance were all waiting for this grand harvest. In the perception of all the star pirates, the resources in Treasure City were exceptionally abundant on the eve of the Treasure Convention.","The upper echelons of the Star Pirate Alliance were originally quite nervous about taking action against Treasure City. Attacking a massive city under the control of Honor Absent Palace, especially for a newly formed Star Pirate Alliance, seemed incredibly reckless to anyone who heard about it. However, with the two experts’ backing, the star pirate leaders were relieved.","Yet, star pirate leaders did not expect the Star Pirate Alliance would end up in such a predicament.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao had not communicated closely with the Star Pirate Alliance before. Their communication with them had always been one-way.","The upper echelons of the Star Pirate Alliance thought that Liu Chen and Liu Yao were behind the two glaciers that pierced straight into the void passageways, and the reason they did this was that they did not want these two pinnacle Class 3 dimensional rifts to transform into Class 4.","If an irreversible disaster was really caused, Honor Absent Palace experts would definitely trace the source and find out the truth. Ultimately, those who participated in this operation would inevitably face repercussions. Thus, the Star Pirate Alliance had been extremely confident from the beginning to the end, charging toward Treasure City without hesitation when the time came.","Amidst the clamor of battle, Li Feng methodically executed his plan to eliminate the factions that would affect the city’s future development. Meanwhile, Liu Chen and Liu Yao followed Lin Yuan’s orders and eliminated the star pirates that had invaded Treasure City.","As they were eliminating these star pirates, Liu Chen and Liu Yao noticed that they would often show signs of dependency, as if hoping that someone would come to their aid. From this, Liu Chen and Liu Yao understood that the people these star pirates were looking forward to were actually the two of them.","When the reinforcements from Treasure City arrived and completely suppressed these star pirates, this star pirate leader would inevitably reveal his and Liu Yao’s existence. Even if the star pirate leader did not know of his and Liu Yao’s identities, it would not deter Honor Absent Palace from spending more effort to find out the truth.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao were not afraid of trouble and did not believe that Honor Absent Palace would be able to find them. However, as Lin Yuan’s subordinates, they were concerned about any potential impact their actions might have on him and how to proceed if their actions did affect him.","During this time, Liu Chen and Liu Yao contacted Lin Yuan and suggested that they get rid of all the star pirates and destroy their souls. It was the only way to ensure that nothing would go wrong.","After contemplating it, Liu Yuan agreed to Liu Chen and Liu Yao’s suggestion. From his perspective, those star pirates deserved to die. Furthermore, Lin Yuan had just arrived and would continue to develop in the East Universe in the future.","Lin Yuan did not want to provoke a behemoth like Honor Absent Palace. He was using his true identity to travel outside, and he had also used Sky City’s name. Naturally, he did not want Sky City to become the target of public criticism.","If there were any clues left after such a huge incident, Honor Absent Palace would definitely investigate thoroughly. However, getting Liu Chen and Liu Yao to not only eliminate all the star pirates but also clean up their souls would appear too conspicuous in the eyes of outsiders. It could raise suspicion of eliminating evidence.","While Liu Chen and Liu Yao could take care of these star pirates, it was better to let the City Lord of Treasure City arrange for people to clean up their souls.","While Li Feng arranged for people to clean up the souls of the star pirates, Lin Yuan could take the opportunity to let Rememberling absorb some soul fragments and extract the law power contained in them to strengthen the suitable white-clothed followers.","In order to extract the law power from the souls, he had to ensure that the souls were fresh. The souls of these star pirates that had just perished would be in the freshest state.","Li Feng would definitely be willing to help Lin Yuan, the guardian of Treasure City, just like how the latter supported Li Feng when he wanted to get rid of the disobedient factions.","...","Soon, the first wave of reinforcements arrived at dawn.","Li Feng sent a request for help to the headquarters of Honor Absent Palace and the branch he was on at the same time. The first wave of reinforcements came from Floating Light City, which was adjacent to Treasure City.","There had always been a competitive relationship between the two cities, but when Treasure City encountered danger, they received orders from the higher-ups. The City Lord of Floating Light City had to arrange for people to rescue Treasure City.","...","While Lin Yuan, Spring, Winter, Jin Chen, and Kani headed to the Scarlet Territory, Yin Ruo was very depressed. As the princess of the Silver Blue Fairy Sharks, she rarely took the initiative to befriend others.","Previously, Yin Ruo had been worried about Treasure City’s safety. If Treasure City could not successfully resist the Star Pirate Alliance that was wreaking havoc, even with two Holy Spirit combatants on her side, it would be very difficult for her to escape the Star Pirate Alliance’s persecution.","At such a critical juncture, Yin Ruo did not have the enthusiasm to befriend Lin Yuan. However, after the Star Pirate Alliance was completely wiped out and the incident in Treasure City came to an end, Lin Yuan had actually left without a word, depriving Yin Ruo of the opportunity to initiate friendship. This left Yin Ruo feeling regretful.","Even if Yin Ruo was not aware of Lin Yuan’s arrangements behind the scenes, in Yin Ruo’s heart, Lin Yuan was the hero who protected Treasure City. Had Lin Yuan’s experts not destroyed the two pinnacle Class 3 void passageways, Treasure City would not have been the only one to suffer the calamity.","Putting aside Yin Ruo’s favorable impression of Lin Yuan, just the powerful strength that Lin Yuan had displayed alone was enough to prompt Yin Ruo to take the initiative to befriend him.","Yin Ruo sighed. She hoped that she could find another chance to befriend Lin Yuan in the future. Lin Yuan heading to Treasure City at this juncture meant that he was interested in the Treasure Convention. When Treasure City achieved its revival and the Treasure Convention was rescheduled, Lin Yuan would most likely return. By that time, she could create an opportunity to reunite with him.","...","Fan Lou had been reporting the situation to Lin Yuan along his way to the Scarlet Territory. With Fan Lou’s permission, the Dark Pufferfish envoys agreed to the request to invite the Bloodian clan Fan Lou was with.","The Dark Pufferfish and the Bloodians began cooperation. The envoys mentioned the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River were also interested in participating.","This Bloodian clan was quite delighted with this development, as it meant that their own strength would significantly increase.","With the support of the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River, the Bloodian clan would be able to obtain a certain amount of support when competing with other Bloodian clans or fighting against the mermaids.","The overall strength of the Bloodians was extremely powerful, but the competition between the various Bloodian clans was also very intense. If one clan was not careful, the resources of their clan would be greatly deprived, and they might even lose their inheritance.","Lin Yuan knew very well that he did not have much accumulation or many connections that he could use in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. This made many of the projects difficult to implement. However, these situations were only temporary. As long as Lin Yuan was given more time, he would definitely be much more composed when carrying out certain plans in the future.","...","While Lin Yuan was out acquiring resources and expanding Sky City’s resources, Sky City had also developed extremely quickly. The development of the faith country could be described as changing day by day.","The Land Imps that Lin Yuan had brought from the main world were extremely useful. They could easily adapt to the new environment and had a huge advantage in that they reproduced at breakneck speed.","Previously, the Moon Empress had been suppressing these Land Imps’ reproduction. But now, she had given them the opportunity to reproduce freely and provided them with many resources to help them reproduce.","Once the faith country was established, the population would definitely increase greatly. Apart from being a safe haven for those weak lifeforms, the faith country would also be the source of faith for Sky City.","As the faith country continued to develop, it became very difficult to hide it from its neighbor, the Spinning Wings White Falcons.","The lone survivor of the Spinning Wings White Falcon envoys should have brought the news back. The Spinning Wings White Falcons would definitely respond soon. Since the Crimson Heaven Falcons had sent them on the mission to the King Blood Jackals’ territory, the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ attitude was not important. What was important was the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ attitude.","If not for the fact that she could not contact Lin Yuan, given the rapid development in the faith country, the Moon Empress would have proposed to proactively engage with the Crimson Heaven Falcons and completely gain control of the entire North of the Lonely River. Without this potential enemy, Sky City’s development would be much smoother than it was now.","The resources in the King Blood Jackals’ territory were too scarce. Relying solely on its resources to build the faith country would greatly impact the living standards of the people living in it.","Although the living standards may be considerably better compared to what these lifeforms in the faith country were accustomed to, as they had always lived in the barren wilderness, if she could use the resources in the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ territory to build faith country, the speed at which faith was produced would definitely increase exponentially."]},{"number":2887,"title":"Chapter 2887 Crimson Heaven Falcons’ Plan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2887 Crimson Heaven Falcons’ Plan!","The Moon Empress evolved from a birth horoscope to a spirit fire expert through Lin Yuan before quickly ascending to the Divine Kingdom level. It could be said that she had not been in contact with faith power for long.","However, upon reaching the Divine Kingdom level and harnessing faith power, she possessed far more of it than others. The Moon Empress could gather more faith in the Radiance Federation than Lin Yuan.","As one of the three Class 5 Creation Masters in the Radiance Federation, the Moon Empress was revered by its citizens. Part of the reason Lin Yuan had obtained only so much faith power from the Radiance Federation was due to his identity as Black. However, most of it was because he was the Moon Empress’ disciple.","The glowing dots of faith power produced by the Radiance citizens toward the Moon Empress were not something Lin Yuan could compare to in a few years. Furthermore, she later became the leader of the Major Federation Union and ruled the entire main world, bringing benefits to the various alliances in the main world.","If not for the fact that Lin Yuan controlled the five dimensional worlds and had faith power injected into him by Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter, the Moon Empress would definitely possess more faith power than Lin Yuan.","Regardless of whether she acted as a manager adept at governing or as the possessor of a large amount of faith power, the Moon Empress had a deep understanding of acquiring and utilizing faith power.","When a lifeform was already capable of producing faith power, enhancing its sense of happiness could significantly increase the rate at which faith power was produced.","Therefore, the best way to accelerate the production of faith power was to invest more resources in building a faith country and increasing the happiness of the lifeforms living in it.","At present, it was vital to obtain faith power from all the members of Sky City in the Sky Beyond the Clouds and also to develop a faith country, as it was equivalent to giving the faction a brighter future.","After reaching World Emperor/Divine Kingdom, faith power became an equally important power source as spirit qi.","However, the Moon Empress would not take the initiative to make any big moves before Lin Yuan returned. Therefore, as long as the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons did not take any drastic measures, the situation would continue to be maintained as it was.","However, the Moon Empress felt that the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons would definitely respond to their resistance since they were already prepared to target the King Blood Jackals.","In the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ eyes, the King Blood Jackals were the inferior species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. What they did to the Spinning Wings White Falcons was equivalent to defying the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","The Spinning Wings White Falcons had visited the King Blood Jackals’ territory under the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ banner. As a superior species, the Crimson Heaven Falcons would want to uphold their dignity unless more pressing matters were at hand.","...","The Spinning Wings White Falcons were currently holding a meeting, and the atmosphere throughout the meeting could only be described as explosive.","Every Spinning Wings White Falcon Elder was in a state of wrath. The messenger Autumn had spared to send a message also attended the meeting.","The Spinning Wings White Falcon envoy, fortunate enough to have his life spared, shuddered at the thought of the handsome, indifferent man who had effortlessly obliterated the entire envoy team with a single wave of his hand.","The bleakness in that killing move lingered in Bai Yuan’s heart, causing him to no longer be able to recover his previous confident state and fully display the spirit of the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ younger generation.","The Spinning Wings White Falcon Elders took notice of Bai Yuan’s state. One of the female Elders, in particular, found Bai Yuan increasingly displeasing and snarled, “Bai Yuan, have you been scared out of your wits? Hurry up and pull yourself together! I don’t believe a word you’re saying. White Howl is only one step away from reaching the pinnacle of World Emperor/Divine Kingdom.","“Even facing Kani, who has just reached the Holy Spirit level, White Howl should at least be able to withstand a few moves. It can’t be as dismal as you’re making it out to be. If you really suffer from hysteria from fear, deal with it yourself. Why are you trying to spread rumors?!”","Bai Yan did not want to go to the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ investigation department. If she was sent to manage it, she would lose her position as a permanent Elder. Then, she would become a marginal figure among the Elders. Moreover, if possible, Bai Yan also wanted to obtain the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ bloodline and break through the current restrictions.","Bai Yan opened her mouth and reflected in front of all the Elders, “Lord, thank you for your teachings. I definitely won’t make such a mistake again in the future.”","The Spinning Wings White Falcons only had one Holy Spirit expert, Bai Yunzong. He had officially stepped into the Domain Mountain class decades ago. Since then, Bai Yunzong’s control over the Spinning Wings White Falcons had become stricter. Many Elders who were not very obedient had been marginalized and eliminated by Bai Yunzong without exception.","It seemed like the Spinning Wings White Falcons would frequently hold a meeting among the Elders when they encountered issues, but in fact, there wasn’t much difference compared to the situation with the King Blood Jackals before.","Bai Yunzong had absolute authority among the Spinning Wings White Falcons but was usually too lazy to make decisions. Bai Yunzong knew very well that the Crimson Heaven Falcons controlled their entire species and not only him. Therefore, he could not afford to act excessively within the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ internal dynamics.","Bai Yunzong’s words today carried no implications of making grand promises. Chi Jue had indeed promised Bai Yunzong that he would bestow three portions of Crimson Heaven Falcon blood essence to them within ten years. Bai Yunzong was definitely going to occupy one portion of the blood essence.","As for who would receive the other two portions of blood essence, Bai Yunzong required further observation.","Firstly, these two people had to be talented enough. Secondly, he had to ensure that these two people would still stand on his side and listen to his orders after their strength increased.","Although they were all Spinning Wings White Falcons and shared the same bloodline, there would be significant differences in the level of acceptance of the blood essence.","The Spinning Wings White Falcons, who showed higher levels of acceptance of the blood essence, would have a higher potential development limit in the future.","Without obtaining the blood essence, Bai Yunzong was unable to determine his level of acceptance, and this made him very hesitant.","Recently, Bai Yunzong had been observing the Spinning Wings White Falcons and took in the expressions of all the Elders present as he revealed that piece of information.","The meeting continued for a few hours before Bai Yunzong decided to end it.","...","Chi Jue, the Crimson Heaven Falcon envoy to the Spinning Wings White Falcons, had already returned to his species with the information. When Chi Jue returned, the Crimson Heaven Falcons would probably take action. When the Spinning Wings White Falcons agreed to cooperate with the Crimson Heaven Falcons, they would have to strive to do their best.","However, after Chi Jue returned, his response exceeded Bai Yunzong’s expectations. He immediately called Bai Yunzong over and instructed him, “Your species will temporarily stop all operations against the King Blood Jackals’ territory.”","Bai Yunzong never thought that he would receive such an undefined answer. It was fine if Chi Jue did not give him an explanation, but he could not give the Spinning Wings White Falcons no explanation. This would definitely affect his status as their leader.","“Lord Chi Jue, we acted under the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ instruction, not on their own. The people behind the King Blood Jackals are disrespecting the Crimson Heaven Falcons. I propose—”","Before Bai Yunzong could finish, Chi Jue said coldly, “Bai Yunzong, since when is it your turn to suggest my instructions? You just have to follow my instructions. The decision I bring back is from the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","“I recall mentioning to you that we have been having some internal issues within that require us to lay low for a while. You understand better than I do why the King Blood Jackals targeted your envoys.”","With that, Chi Jue casually threw out a crystal bottle. There was a sticky red-brown liquid inside. “This is the blood essence that you tried your best to obtain from me. I can give you a bottle to transform your bloodline first.","“This is the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ grace. From now on, don’t do anything that will disgust me. Otherwise, you know what will happen to you. As for the faction behind the King Blood Jackals, we will naturally settle scores with them when the time comes!”"]},{"number":2888,"title":"Chapter 2888 Scarlet Territory!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2888 Scarlet Territory!","Chi Jue’s eyes flashed with cold malice, filling his long and rather feminine eyes with an evil and calculating glint.","When the King Blood Jackals killed the Spinning Wings White Falcon envoys, they had left one of them alive to deliver the news. No one was more enraged by this than Chi Jue.","Thousands of years had passed since Chi Jue last experienced the Crimson Heaven Falcons being disrespected by another species.","Regardless of the location of the King Blood Jackals’ territory and which faction was protecting them, this action not only disrespected the Spinning Wings White Falcons but also provoked them.","Even if the new faction was unaware of the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ existence, the King Blood Jackals would have undoubtedly informed them about the situation.","The King Blood Jackals had always been weak. They even showed respect to the Spinning Wings White Falcons, much less the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","However, this was a crucial moment for the Crimson Heaven Falcons. The experts could not be distracted for even a moment, or all their efforts would go down the drain.","If successful, this matter would enable all the Crimson Heaven Falcons to transform and reach a completely new level.","At such a moment, the Crimson Heaven Falcons could not discipline this group of clowns, as it could mean a misstep jeopardizing what they had been working toward for tens of thousands of years.","Hence, as livid as Chi Jue was, he still chose to listen to the Elders and forced a lid on his anger.","Bai Yunzong’s words were fully intended to persuade him to take action against the faction behind the King Blood Jackals. This severely irritated Chi Jue.","Ever since Bai Yunzong reached Domain Mountain class, putting them on equal levels, he had started acting with less respect toward him despite him still being weaker. Bai Yunzong no longer feared him like he did in the past.","Chi Jue slapped Bai Yunzong, reminding him of the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ position.","At the same time, he gave Bai Yunzong a sweet date that was actually his blood essence.","Bai Yunzong did not know that the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ blood essence was categorized into different classes. They always gave the lowest class to their dependent species.","Within the Crimson Heaven Falcons, those with inferior bloodlines had to submit to superiors.","Once Bai Yunzong absorbed his blood essence, it would become even easier to control him!","Bai Yunzong had always been fearfully respectful toward Chi Jue. He even addressed Chi Jue as “Lord Chi Jue” when mentioning him to the Elders.","Once a lifeform’s power exceeded a certain level, it was difficult for it not to get to its head. Once Bai Yunzong attained his long-time dream of reaching Domain Mountain class, he became slightly full of himself.","However, this also caused Bai Yunzong to become more reliant on Chi Jue.","Bai Yunzong knew that Chi Jue would easily be able to put an end to him if he wanted to.","Even if he was gone, any other main member of the Spinning Wings White Falcons who had reached the Holy Spirit level would be able to manage the species.","This increased Bai Yunzong’s desire to deepen his relationship with Chi Jue. He wanted to use Chi Jue to slowly gain the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ recognition.","Bai Yunzong had always been working hard for this goal. He was delighted that Chi Jue had given him his blood essence and was definitely going to use it.","Bai Yunzong’s unhappiness was completely erased by the gift of Chi Jue’s blood essence. He received it carefully as though it was a sacred item.","Chi Jue was very happy with Bai Yunzong’s attitude. “Bai Yunzong, when you’re absorbing the blood essence, it will clash with your current bloodline. I will personally help you to tide through the bloodline transformation. Now is not the best time to act. The Spinning Wings White Falcons will stay low and endure alongside the Crimson Heaven Falcons.”","Bai Yunzong thanked Chi Jue for the blood essence while promising, “Lord Chi Jue, don’t worry. We definitely won’t ruin the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ plan! The Spinning Wings White Falcons and I will arrange everything.”","When Bai Yunzong returned to his residence, he began seriously preparing. Once he was in peak condition, he would absorb the Crimson Heaven Falcon bloodline that had been so hard to come by.","...","From the moment Lin Yuan fused his bloodline with the Bloodian bloodline, no blood servant dared to attack him.","Since arriving at the Scarlet Territory, the Thoughts Letter Paper could be used again. This made it much easier for Lin Yuan to communicate with Fan Lou.","The Bloodian clan that Fan Lou was with was named Andra. The Bloodian clans were named after ancestral kings or queens. The members were all descendants of the respective king or queen.","Andra sounded male. It was likely that this clan descended from a king.","The Bloodians were a matriarchy. Both male and female members were turned female once they became kings or queens. At that time, even male members would change the name of their clan to female names due to the change in their gender.","Due to bloodline level, the bloodlines of king clans were always inferior to those of queen clans.","The Andra clan must have encountered an enormous opportunity in order to develop to this extent.","Lin Yuan responded to the information that Fan Lou had sent him through the Thoughts Letter Paper.","[Lin Yuan]: Fan Lou, you say that members from the Lonely River’s four species have reached the Andra clan and have even spoken to the upper echelon of the Andra clan.","Lin Yuan thought. Those four species work quicker than I expected. This Andra clan sure likes to use external power to attain their goals.","Although there were no Holy Spirit experts among the Four Species Overlords, their leaders had World Emperor/Pinnacle Divine Kingdom power.","Having the bravery to work with these four species meant that the Andra clan had Holy Spirit experts. Otherwise, they would not be able to control the situation!","Fan Lou gave a detailed answer to Lin Yuan’s inquiry.","[Fan Lou]: Master, the branch of the Bloodians I am with is very friendly toward the experts from the Lonely River. Apart from working with the Four Species Overlords, they also contacted other branches of the Bloodians to work with them. This has allowed me to work with even more branches of Bloodians and gain more chances to elevate my position within the Bloodians. It’s a shame that none of these branches are queen clans. These branches want to use a queen clan to open a blood pool and feed their greed. I am a little afraid that this operation will come at the cost of many members of the Four Species Overlords. They are all part of your strength!","There was nothing that Fan Lou was more afraid of than failing after leading the Four Species Overlords in carrying out Lin Yuan’s instructions.","Although they supported him because Lin Yuan had spoken up, it was still due to his suggestion.","The Four Species Overlords would not dare to blame Lin Yuan but could blame Fan Lou.","Fan Lou did not want to be the target of the Four Species Overlords’ resentment. It would definitely not be beneficial for his future development.","If he told Lin Yuan about the situation now, Lin Yuan would definitely make the appropriate arrangements.","The more involved Fan Lou was in the Andra lineage’s operation, the more danger he was in.","The different Bloodian clans often attacked each other over profits, especially during times like this when resources were involved.","Fan Lou did not have strong power. All he could do was put in the work and further his own interests.","However, Fan Lou had been developing for too short of a period of time to have laid out any establishment within the Bloodians. As much as he wanted to further his own interests, there was not much he could do. This made Fan Lou feel helpless.","However, Lin Yuan had allowed him to contact him anytime so he could ask Lin Yuan for his opinion at any time.","Otherwise, Fan Lou would be at a loss.","The experts from the Four Species Overlords appeared courteous to him but actually refused to listen to his orders. If not for the fact that he could contact Lin Yuan and could thus invoke the authority attached to Lin Yuan’s name, the experts would have gone over Fan Lou’s head for many matters and communicated directly with the Andra clan.","When Lin Yuan saw Fan Lou’s message, he was silent for a moment before he replied.","[Lin Yuan]: If working with the Andra clan harms those from the Lonely River, there’s no helping it. But I don’t think those from the Lonely River are being honest. Rather than making use of them, I think the Andra clan will see them as destabilizers and be wary of them. All you need to do is remind them not to step over the line and affect you!","[Lin Yuan]: The Dark Pufferfish are important to the Bloodians. The Bloodians will need to deepen their collaboration with the Dark Pufferfish in order to minimize harm. I’m sure that a queen clan will make contact with you soon! You can use some of the lines you buried in advance and introduce the Bloodian clan I represent to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Lin Yuan did not know much about the Bloodian clans. If he interacted with the other Bloodian clans while presenting himself as the leader of a Bloodian clan, it would be easy for others to expose his fabrication.","As such, the best method was to interact with the trusted factions under the Bloodians and use them to introduce him to the Bloodians so they could vouch for him. This would give Lin Yuan the chance to visit the blood pool that was about to open."]},{"number":2889,"title":"Chapter 2889 Coincidence of the Calculated Plan! full","paragraphs":["Chapter 2889 Coincidence of the Calculated Plan! full","2889 Coincidence of the Calculated Plan!","Now that Lin Yuan wanted to tap into these lines, Fan Lou was not anxious but was exceptionally thrilled.","Fan Lou was skilled at reading others and had relied on this skill considerably to get to where he was today. He had managed to survive the cruel environment around Kong Huan and was even valued by her because he had read her.","Fan Lou had survived after being captured by Winter because he successfully guessed what Lin Yuan wanted.","The same went for his tenure with Feng Qing. Fan Lou was more valued than Feng Xuan because he was more capable of reading Feng Qing.","It was because he knew how to read others that he knew Feng Xuan felt extremely conflicted.","At first, Feng Xuan had looked down on him. He believed that Fan Lou was only able to be acknowledged as Feng Qing because he had been recommended by Kong Huan to be the guide in the Class 2 world.","Back then, Feng Xuan did not take him seriously or think much of him.","Fan Lou brought back a large amount of resources for Feng Qing. This removed all of Feng Qing’s suspicions toward him.","Feng Qing began to rely on him, and his importance overshot that of Feng Xuan.","At that time, Feng Xuan was unhappy and furious. However, he could not show these emotions while Fan Lou was by Feng Qing’s side.","Subsequently, he fully left Feng Xuan in the dust, and the latter’s presence disappeared from Feng Qing’s side.","Additionally, he became linked with the Bloodians. At that point, Feng Xuan stood no chance of competing with him.","Aside from enduring his situation, Feng Xuan was smart enough to begin currying favor with Genius.","But regardless of how humble Feng Xuan acted toward Fan Lou, Feng Xuan’s heart was still filled with dissatisfaction.","Feng Xuan had been longing for the chance to surpass Fan Lou. It was because Fan Lou was aware of this that he knew that planting a hidden line under Feng Xuan was the best decision.","Firstly, Feng Xuan was very aggravated by him, and his judgment abilities and emotional control were rather weak now. It would be easy to insert a hidden line in Feng Xuan’s circle.","Secondly, both of them were rivals. Even if an issue arose with this hidden line, it would be Feng Xuan who received the flak. The hidden line would not be traced back to Fan Lou.","There was no way that Feng Xuan would turn down the chance to interact with an elite Bloodian!","Although Feng Xuan was not valued by Feng Qing now, he still gave Feng Xuan tasks.","Fan Lou thought, Why don’t I create an opportunity for Feng Xuan and Lin Yuan to meet directly?","Lin Yuan did not converse with Fan Lou for long. After activating the Bloodian bloodline and fusing it with his own, Lin Yuan became more attracted to the Scarlet Territory’s environment.","This Scarlet Territory was the resting place for countless Sky Beyond the Clouds’ species.","This ground was only able to brim with blood energy after it was injected with a large amount of essence blood.","It was definitely important for the Bloodians to protect the Scarlet Territory.","Lin Yuan noticed that the further into the Scarlet Territory he went, the more concentrated the blood energy in the environment.","The location that Fan Lou gave was not far from where Lin Yuan currently was. Lin Yuan needed to establish a formidable identity regardless of whether he was interacting with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves or Bloodians.","The Bloodians used their clans as a token of honor. As such, Lin Yuan needed to create a Bloodian clan. This would not be difficult for him.","In the long history of the Bloodians, many clans had faded into history and had even been forgotten.","Some of these fallen clans were even queen ones!","Elise was a unique female name. If Lin Yuan gave this name, others would instinctively assume that he was the descendant of a Bloodian Queen.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves would not be able to verify his identity. He also had a pure Bloodian bloodline, which the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves could not refute.","He would only be at risk when he interacted with other Bloodians.","However, even if the other clans suspected his identity, they did not have any proof.","A few Bloodian clans maintained a low profile. The clans that were not developing well rarely showed their faces publicly.","Lin Yuan would not form deep connections with other Bloodian clans. All he wanted to do was to enter the blood pool to take its energy.","If this caused him to become a target, Lin Yuan would choose to leave the Scarlet Territory.","If no one suspected him, Lin Yuan would remain in the Scarlet Territory so he could participate in the Bloodians’ plan to attack the mermaids.","As long as he could obtain a large number of mermaids, Dark Blue’s power would skyrocket. The mermaids would be Dark Blue’s source of faith power.","Spring and Winter felt a strange feeling come over them as they watched Lin Yuan carry out his plan through a minor character like Fan Lou.","The previous Lord Saint had not been keen on such strategies and plans. He preferred the direct route.","If the previous Lord Saint became interested in the Bloodians’ blood pool, he would charge in and take it for himself.","If the previous Lord Saint could act like the current one, it would have resulted in many better resolutions.","After Lin Yuan’s manipulation, a trivial character like Fan Lou managed to form a connection with the Bloodians.","Lin Yuan dared to target the Bloodians and attempt to steal the blood pool from their sacred ground. If the two of them did not know Lin Yuan, they would definitely think that he was mad.","But the two of them had witnessed Lin Yuan’s methods in Treasure City and believed his plan for the Bloodians could be achieved easily.","As opposed to Kani and Jin Chen, Liu Chen and Liu Yao, who had surpassed the Holy Spirit level, were more aware of just how strong Lin Yuan was.","The two of them felt that both Spring and Winter had reached a level that they could only aspire to attain.","Although the two of them had not been Spirit Territory experts for long and their power had not grown since, they were still undeniable Spirit Territory experts.","Yet, in front of Spring and Winter, the couple were like useless children who were completely unable to fight back.","Even a Bloodian Queen’s clan might not have experts above the Holy Spirit level. They were utterly incapable of resisting.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao were currently focused on their child. They were greatly looking forward to the birth of their child.","Lin Yuan had said that he would use outstanding resources to nurture their child once it was born.","...","13:52","It did not take Lin Yuan long to arrive at the location Fan Lou had told him about. Spring and Winter had sensed the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ presence from far away.","Lin Yuan had orchestrated a carefully planned-out accidental meeting with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had no authority in the Bloodians’ territory. Otherwise, they would not be sent to harvest the basic resources.","Feng Xuan stood nonchalantly among a group of subordinates and issued instructions to them.","He had helped pick so much of the Scarlet Grass but would not receive any reward after submitting them.","On the other hand, Fan Lou was now extremely popular and prominent among the Bloodian clans!","Apart from this Bloodian clan, the other clans often sent people to communicate with Fan Lou as well.","Even now, Feng Xuan did not think much of Fan Lou. He felt that Fan Lou only had good luck and liked playing games.","Fan Lou was an impure wolf who had lived under the Alluring Foxes for the past few thousand years.","If he were truly capable, he would have shot up in power and through the ranks rather than seek shelter under Feng Qing.","Feng Qing attributed all of Fan Lou’s success to Feng Qing’s favor.","Feng Qing had treated Feng Xuan well all these years but had never given him the opportunity to interact with the Bloodians. If Feng Qing had been willing to give him the chance, he would definitely have done a better job than Fan Lou!","The more he thought about this, the angrier Feng Qing became. He was the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf with the pure bloodline. Yet, Feng Qing was favoring an outsider! He had been with Feng Qing and served him for much longer than Fan Lou had.","However, as miserable as Feng Xuan was, he had no choice. He could not question Feng Qing about why he had not given him any chances.","At this moment, Feng Xuan heard one of his new subordinates say, “Lord Feng Xuan, you don’t have to be this bored. Although the Scarlet Grass isn’t a specialty product of the Scarlet Territory, it still needs an environment with a high concentration of blood energy in order to grow.","“You can keep some Scarlet Grass and exchange them for Honor Absent dollars. Moreover, the Scarlet Territory is where the Bloodian clans live. You might get to meet real Bloodians and become noticed by them! When that happens, please don’t forget about me!”","Feng Xuan’s mood lifted when he heard this. He looked at the Light Wind Wolf and said, “You sure are a smart one. You even know how to think for my sake. But you need to remember that what belongs to the Bloodians will always belong to them. We don’t have the right to touch any of it!”","Even if he had already stolen some of the Scarlet Grass, he needed to act appropriately. There was no way that he would allow himself to be caught over a matter like this.","Every time Feng Xuan went out, he hoped to be able to meet a true Bloodian, regardless of which clan they came from. He felt that it would be a good opportunity for him to meet any true Bloodian, even if they came from a weak clan.","It would help him to elevate his position among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Feng Qing might even notice him again. Otherwise, as things stood, Feng Qing only had eyes for Fan Lou.","Recently, Feng Xuan’s mood had been low, and he needed someone like this who was considerate. He decided to keep this Light Wind Wolf with him in the hopes that he could spark joy in him like he just did.","This young Light Wind Wolf thought, Lord Fan Lou was right. Feng Xuan will value and rely on me if I use this method to curry favor with him.","“Lord Feng Xuan, my name is Wu Qing. If you don’t find my name pleasant, you can give me another name!”","Wu Qing kneeled on the ground in a display of submission.","Since Feng Xuan had always been by Feng Qing’s side, he did not get to experience this feeling often.","This was a refreshing feeling for Feng Xuan. He absolutely adored it!","Feng Xuan wanted to change Wu Qing’s name to Bai Qing, but he did not have such authority within the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","“Wu Qing, you should just keep your name. If the chance arises, I will help you to become a distant relative of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. You don’t have to do tasks like this anymore.”","The moment Feng Xuan was done speaking, he saw a group of people walking toward him. If he were currently in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ territory, Feng Xuan would definitely question their background as a means of exhibiting his status.","But he was currently in the Scarlet Territory. As a Chaos Wind Demon Wolf, he had little to no presence in the Scarlet Territory. If someone wanted to make things difficult for him, there was nothing he could do but endure.","If he offended someone he could not afford to cross, Feng Qing would not try to save him. Once the matter involved the Bloodian clans, Feng Qing could not help him even if he wanted to!","Feng Xuan could already sense the pure Bloodian aura emanating from Lin Yuan’s body. Although the aura was not strong, this handsome golden-haired young man had to be special in order to possess such a pure Bloodian bloodline!","He had been helping to harvest the Scarlet Grass for some time, but this was the first time that he was coming face to face with a Bloodian.","Feng Xuan said experimentally, “Lord, up ahead is the Andra clan’s territory. Are you headed there? If you are, I can lead the way!”","Lin Yuan’s lip curled slightly.","If he had initiated contact with this Chaos Wind Demon Wolf, it would have seemed as though he was harboring a motive. But now that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf had spoken to him first, things were different!","Now, there was no need to use any of the hidden lines that Fan Lou had prepared. Regardless of what he did, Fan Lou would not be implicated!"]},{"number":2890,"title":"Chapter 2890 Successful Interaction! Full","paragraphs":["Chapter 2890 Successful Interaction! Full","2890 Successful Interaction!","The Bloodians’ arrogance stemmed not only from their power but also from the strength of their bloodline. Bloodline strength was much more important to the Bloodians than power. A Bloodian with an extremely pure bloodline could sneer at other Bloodians.","The strength of one’s bloodline was the equivalent of one’s status. It was Lin Yuan’s understanding that nothing was more important to the Bloodians than their bloodline.","It was the Bloodians’ emphasis on their bloodline that gave Lin Yuan a loophole he could exploit.","Lin Yuan was naturally skilled at acting. He had seen arrogant elites both in his previous life and in the main world.","All Lin Yuan needed to do was act haughtily when he interacted with this Chaos Wind Demon Wolf.","“Andra clan? So it’s the Andra clan that’s up ahead! From their name, they don’t sound like a queen clan.”","Feng Xuan did not even dare to draw breath when he heard what Lin Yuan said. He did not know how to respond to this young male Bloodian.","If he picked up on what this young man said, he would come across as looking down on the Andra clan. But if he did not respond at all, he would not be able to leave a positive impression on this young man!","Based on Lin Yuan’s attitude toward the Andra clan, Feng Xuan was certain that he came from a clan with a queen bloodline.","If he could become acquainted with such a clan, he would become the pride of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Feng Xuan was sure of this.","Presently, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were only linked to the Andra clan. They did not have ties to any other Bloodian clans.","One could be considered the Bloodians’ dependent species once they became close with one of the Bloodian clans.","Most of the Bloodian clans were arrogant toward the other clans’ dependent species. The dependent species would only be acknowledged after they made a contribution to their affiliated clan.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had tried and failed to form ties with other Bloodian clans over the years.","With certainty that his chance was here, Feng Xuan pushed aside his fear and said with a slight tremor in his voice, “Lord, it’s true that the Andra clan doesn’t have a queen, but they are extremely strong nonetheless and treat their guests well. If you pay their territory a visit, they will definitely be friendly to you! You might even gain some benefits!”","When Lin Yuan heard this, he knew he had reached his goal. All it took was a few words, and Feng Xuan had extended an invitation to him.","By using Feng Xuan to complete his plan, he was also tapping into Feng Xuan’s ambition.","“What is your name?”","Feng Xuan looked just as excited as he felt when he heard what Lin Yuan said.","Lin Yuan acted as though he knew about the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Feng Xuan could not be more excited.","If he managed to bring a Bloodian from a queen clan to meet with the Andra clan, he would not only be able to become linked with this young Bloodian but would also be recognized by the Andra clan!","Having a connection to a queen clan was far more important than being connected to the remote Lonely River.","Fan Lou would not be able to swagger about in front of him with his nose in the air again! He would definitely be able to regain Feng Qing’s favor!","With this thought, Feng Xuan resolved to be the middleman between this young Bloodian and the Andra clan. He would not allow this young Bloodian to shove him aside once he took him to meet the Andra clan.","Feng Xuan mustered his courage and asked, “Lord, can you tell me the name of your clan? This will make it easier for me to introduce you to the Andra clan!”","While he was speaking, Feng Xuan’s heart pounded loudly in his chest. He was afraid that Lin Yuan would turn him down and cast him a look of scorn.","While Feng Xuan waited, his body slowly stiffened as he silently prayed.","At that moment, he heard a pleasant voice say softly, “My surname is Elise. My clan has always remained under the radar, so the Andra clan might not have heard of us. Since you’re going to introduce me to the Andra clan, you can have this spirit qi crystal!”","Lin Yuan tossed a spirit qi crystal to Feng Xuan.","Feng Xuan was so nervous that he almost failed to catch the spirit qi crystal. But when he caught it, he sensed the pure and strong spirit qi within it. He had never received such pure and strong spirit qi before in his life.","Spirit qi of such purity should enable his bloodline to be further purified.","From the way that Lin Yuan casually gave away something this precious, Feng Xuan could tell that Lin Yuan was an elite. Only the truly powerful Bloodian clans would be so generous with the rewards they gave out.","Until now, he was doing nothing more than serving this young Bloodian. They did not have any ties to each other and had only just met.","Being this generous to a stranger showed how wealthy this young Bloodian was.","Elise had a clear female ring to it. This young man had to come from a queen bloodline.","If this young man he introduced to the Andra ended up completing a large and important trade with them that led to the two clans working together, Feng Xuan’s position would not only shoot past that of Fan Lou, but even Feng Qing would have to start showing him some respect!","With this thought, Feng Xuan became even friendlier toward Lin Yuan. He saw Lin Yuan as the life-saving straw that would enable him to exhibit his value.","Feng Xuan kneeled and bowed to Lin Yuan just like how a believer would act toward the sacred being they worshipped.","“Lord, let me take you there now!”","Feng Xuan looked at Wu Qing, who was standing nearby.","“Wu Qing, stay here and help me watch over the rest. Make sure that no issues crop up with the harvesting of the Scarlet Grass. If there are any problems, you’ll have to answer for them!”","Once he finished speaking sternly to Wu Qing, Feng Xuan put on another pleasing expression for Lin Yuan.","If the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves did not collect enough Scarlet Grass, the Andra clan would become unhappy with them and increase their requested tributes.","Normally, they were able to collect enough Scarlet Grass. However, he had to siphon some not only for himself but for Feng Qing as well.","Feng Xuan did not want to give up on the opportunity to obtain the Scarlet Grass, so he needed to instruct the workers to do their best.","Additionally, he wanted to let Lin Yuan know that he was considered a manager among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and could become his bridge to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Lin Yuan did not know anything about him, and they had only just become acquainted. Feng Xuan found it necessary to prove his worth to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan could not be bothered to care about what Feng Xuan was thinking. He saw Feng Xuan as a stupid person.","It was good if he was smart enough to seize opportunities. But someone like him, who had appeared out of the blue, was like a tempting poison to Feng Xuan. In order to seize the opportunity, he would swallow the poison without hesitation. Such actions were taboo for a faction’s development.","If Lin Yuan found out that someone within Sky City harbored such thoughts, he would eliminate them immediately. There was no way he would keep such a source of disaster by his side.","The Andra clan would definitely be smarter than Feng Xuan. They would not trust him until they confirmed his identity.","However, this would not get in the way of him trading Creator resources with the Andra clan. Although the Bloodians absorbed blood energy on a day-to-day basis, their main source of energy was still spirit qi.","Blood Love needed a large amount of blood energy to increase her power.","Lin Yuan wanted to use this trip to the Scarlet Territory to obtain more resources that Blood Love could use to increase her power.","These resources containing blood energy were very hard to come by and were considered rare spiritual ingredients. They were only available in large quantities in places like the Scarlet Territory.","After he produced a large amount of Creator resources, the Andra clan would definitely be willing to trade these resources that they could easily get their hands on for the Creator resources.","The Andra clan would definitely have concerns about him while they were guarded against him.","But once they traded for a large amount of Creator resources from him and desired to maintain such a relationship with him, they would have to be friendly toward him even if they continued to distrust him.","The Andra clan already intended to target the clan that was opening the blood pool. They wanted to obtain as much energy from the blood tide as they could.","If he suggested joining their plan, it was likely that they would be in agreement.","The Andra would never expect him to steal the entire blood pool once it was opened.","He would go into hiding after stealing the blood pool. At that time, that Bloodian clan’s fury would be directed at the Andra clan.","The Andra clan would become the scapegoats for Lin Yuan’s careful plan.","While Feng Xuan was leading the way, he never stopped trying to communicate with Lin Yuan, but he ignored him. All he did was ask the occasional question about the Andra clan or Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Most of the information Lin Yuan asked about was extremely confidential. Under normal circumstances, Feng Xuan should not tell Lin Yuan about any of it.","But it was clear that Feng Xuan had completely let his guard down against Lin Yuan and told him everything he knew. Lin Yuan knew the answers to some of the questions he asked. He had asked Fan Lou the same questions, and Fan Lou’s answers matched the answers that Feng Xuan gave.","It was clear that Fan Lou knew more about the Bloodians than Feng Xuan did. This meant that Feng Xuan was insignificant to the Bloodians. It was no wonder that Feng Xuan was so desperate to prove himself to him!","The Andra clan considered this matter of Feng Xuan bringing them a true Bloodian to be very important.","One of the Andra clan’s Elders personally met with Lin Yuan, and everything he said was meant to extract information from Lin Yuan. This did not align with what Feng Xuan had expected. Feng Xuan had wanted to be the one to introduce Lin Yuan to the Andra clan.","After Feng Xuan was led away by members of the Andra clan, they began questioning him in detail about Lin Yuan’s circumstances.","Feng Xuan thought, Luckily, I asked and learned about his circumstances. Otherwise, I would be clueless and completely unable to answer the Andra clan’s questions!","Not only did Feng Xuan not feel a shred of unhappiness about this situation, but he was thrilled because this was the first time he had the opportunity to speak with the Andra clan’s elite. This was the first time they were properly acknowledging him.","Just mentioning the name of Lin Yuan’s clan, which had the legacy of a queen, would be enough for the Andra clan to acknowledge him.","...","The Elder from the Andra clan tried more than once to investigate the aura of Lin Yuan’s bloodline. His aura was so pure that the Elder could not suspect Lin Yuan’s identity.","Lin Yuan’s bloodline caused the Elder to act extremely courteously toward him.","As the Elder continued to question him, this young man with unquestionably beautiful features said with displeasure, “I’m only here at the Andra clan’s territory for a visit. Do you plan on interrogating me? If the Andra clan doesn’t want to be on friendly terms with me, I can just leave.”","Lin Yuan’s attitude was a big issue for Andre.","Lin Yuan’s pure bloodline and his background made it impossible for the Andra clan to give up on the opportunity to interact with him. The best way for the Bloodians to improve their bloodline was not to absorb the bloodlines of their targets but to link their bloodline to that of other Bloodians with pure bloodlines through marriage. This would enable their offspring’s bloodline to be significantly strengthened.","Andre asked Lin Yuan so much about his situation because he had never heard of the Elise clan."]},{"number":2891,"title":"Chapter 2891 Coincidence of the Calculated Plan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2891 Coincidence of the Calculated Plan!","Fan Lou had reported his achievements to Lin Yuan not long ago and told Lin Yuan about all the hidden lines he could tap into.","Fan Lou was skilled at reading others and had relied on this skill considerably to get to where he was today. He had managed to survive the cruel environment around Kong Huan and was even valued by her because he had read her.","Fan Lou had survived after being captured by Winter because he successfully guessed what Lin Yuan wanted.","The same went for his tenure with Feng Qing. Fan Lou was more valued than Feng Xuan because he was more capable of reading Feng Qing.","It was because he knew how to read others that he knew Feng Xuan felt extremely conflicted.","At first, Feng Xuan had looked down on him. He believed that Fan Lou was only able to be acknowledged as Feng Qing because he had been recommended by Kong Huan to be the guide in the Class 2 world.","Back then, Feng Xuan did not take him seriously or think much of him.","Fan Lou brought back a large amount of resources for Feng Qing. This removed all of Feng Qing’s suspicions toward him.","Feng Qing began to rely on him, and his importance overshot that of Feng Xuan.","At that time, Feng Xuan was unhappy and furious. However, he could not show these emotions while Fan Lou was by Feng Qing’s side.","Subsequently, he fully left Feng Xuan in the dust, and the latter’s presence disappeared from Feng Qing’s side.","Additionally, he became linked with the Bloodians. At that point, Feng Xuan stood no chance of competing with him.","Aside from enduring his situation, Feng Xuan was smart enough to begin currying favor with Genius.","But regardless of how humble Feng Xuan acted toward Fan Lou, Feng Xuan’s heart was still filled with dissatisfaction.","Feng Xuan had been longing for the chance to surpass Fan Lou. It was because Fan Lou was aware of this that he knew that planting a hidden line under Feng Xuan was the best decision.","Firstly, Feng Xuan was very aggravated by him, and his judgment abilities and emotional control were rather weak now. It would be easy to insert a hidden line in Feng Xuan’s circle.","Secondly, both of them were rivals. Even if an issue arose with this hidden line, it would be Feng Xuan who received the flak. The hidden line would not be traced back to Fan Lou.","There was no way that Feng Xuan would turn down the chance to interact with an elite Bloodian!","Although Feng Xuan was not valued by Feng Qing now, he still gave Feng Xuan tasks.","Feng Xuan was also present in the Scarlet Territory.","[Fan Lou]: Master, I will give you a location tonight. You can meet a Chaos Wind Demon Wolf there. All you need to do is head there, and I’ll handle everything else!","This Scarlet Territory was the resting place for countless Sky Beyond the Clouds’ species.","This ground was only able to brim with blood energy after it was injected with a large amount of essence blood.","It was definitely important for the Bloodians to protect the Scarlet Territory.","Lin Yuan noticed that the further into the Scarlet Territory he went, the more concentrated the blood energy in the environment.","The location that Fan Lou gave was not far from where Lin Yuan currently was. Lin Yuan needed to establish a formidable identity regardless of whether he was interacting with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves or Bloodians.","The Bloodians used their clans as a token of honor. As such, Lin Yuan needed to create a Bloodian clan. This would not be difficult for him.","In the long history of the Bloodians, many clans had faded into history and had even been forgotten.","Some of these fallen clans were even queen ones!","Elise was a unique female name. If Lin Yuan gave this name, others would instinctively assume that he was the descendant of a Bloodian Queen.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves would not be able to verify his identity. He also had a pure Bloodian bloodline, which the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves could not refute.","He would only be at risk when he interacted with other Bloodians.","However, even if the other clans suspected his identity, they did not have any proof.","A few Bloodian clans maintained a low profile. The clans that were not developing well rarely showed their faces publicly.","Lin Yuan would not form deep connections with other Bloodian clans. All he wanted to do was to enter the blood pool to take its energy.","If this caused him to become a target, Lin Yuan would choose to leave the Scarlet Territory.","If no one suspected him, Lin Yuan would remain in the Scarlet Territory so he could participate in the Bloodians’ plan to attack the mermaids.","As long as he could obtain a large number of mermaids, Dark Blue’s power would skyrocket. The mermaids would be Dark Blue’s source of faith power.","Spring and Winter felt a strange feeling come over them as they watched Lin Yuan carry out his plan through a minor character like Fan Lou.","The previous Lord Saint had not been keen on such strategies and plans. He preferred the direct route.","If the previous Lord Saint became interested in the Bloodians’ blood pool, he would charge in and take it for himself.","If the previous Lord Saint could act like the current one, it would have resulted in many better resolutions.","After Lin Yuan’s manipulation, a trivial character like Fan Lou managed to form a connection with the Bloodians.","Both Kani and Jin Chen had heard about the Bloodians’ might and knew what kind of species they were.","But the two of them had witnessed Lin Yuan’s methods in Treasure City and believed his plan for the Bloodians could be achieved easily.","As opposed to Kani and Jin Chen, Liu Chen and Liu Yao, who had surpassed the Holy Spirit level, were more aware of just how strong Lin Yuan was.","The two of them felt that both Spring and Winter had reached a level that they could only aspire to attain.","Although the two of them had not been Spirit Territory experts for long and their power had not grown since, they were still undeniable Spirit Territory experts.","Yet, in front of Spring and Winter, the couple were like useless children who were completely unable to fight back.","Even a Bloodian Queen’s clan might not have experts above the Holy Spirit level. They were utterly incapable of resisting.","Liu Chen and Liu Yao were currently focused on their child. They were greatly looking forward to the birth of their child.","Lin Yuan had said that he would use outstanding resources to nurture their child once it was born.","...","It did not take Lin Yuan long to arrive at the location Fan Lou had told him about. Spring and Winter had sensed the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ presence from far away.","Lin Yuan had orchestrated a carefully planned-out accidental meeting with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had no authority in the Bloodians’ territory. Otherwise, they would not be sent to harvest the basic resources.","Feng Xuan stood nonchalantly among a group of subordinates and issued instructions to them.","He had helped pick so much of the Scarlet Grass but would not receive any reward after submitting them.","On the other hand, Fan Lou was now extremely popular and prominent among the Bloodian clans!","Apart from this Bloodian clan, the other clans often sent people to communicate with Fan Lou as well.","Even now, Feng Xuan did not think much of Fan Lou. He felt that Fan Lou only had good luck and liked playing games.","Fan Lou was an impure wolf who had lived under the Alluring Foxes for the past few thousand years.","If he were truly capable, he would have shot up in power and through the ranks rather than seek shelter under Feng Qing.","Feng Qing attributed all of Fan Lou’s success to Feng Qing’s favor.","Feng Qing had treated Feng Xuan well all these years but had never given him the opportunity to interact with the Bloodians. If Feng Qing had been willing to give him the chance, he would definitely have done a better job than Fan Lou!","The more he thought about this, the angrier Feng Qing became. He was the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf with the pure bloodline. Yet, Feng Qing was favoring an outsider! He had been with Feng Qing and served him for much longer than Fan Lou had.","However, as miserable as Feng Xuan was, he had no choice. He could not question Feng Qing about why he had not given him any chances.","At this moment, Feng Xuan heard one of his new subordinates say, “Lord Feng Xuan, you don’t have to be this bored. Although the Scarlet Grass isn’t a specialty product of the Scarlet Territory, it still needs an environment with a high concentration of blood energy in order to grow.","“You can keep some Scarlet Grass and exchange them for Honor Absent dollars. Moreover, the Scarlet Territory is where the Bloodian clans live. You might get to meet real Bloodians and become noticed by them! When that happens, please don’t forget about me!”","Feng Xuan’s mood lifted when he heard this. He looked at the Light Wind Wolf and said, “You sure are a smart one. You even know how to think for my sake. But you need to remember that what belongs to the Bloodians will always belong to them. We don’t have the right to touch any of it!”","Feng Xuan was the type to act with caution.","Even if he had already stolen some of the Scarlet Grass, he needed to act appropriately. There was no way that he would allow himself to be caught over a matter like this.","Every time Feng Xuan went out, he hoped to be able to meet a true Bloodian, regardless of which clan they came from. He felt that it would be a good opportunity for him to meet any true Bloodian, even if they came from a weak clan.","It would help him to elevate his position among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Feng Qing might even notice him again. Otherwise, as things stood, Feng Qing only had eyes for Fan Lou.","Recently, Feng Xuan’s mood had been low, and he needed someone like this who was considerate. He decided to keep this Light Wind Wolf with him in the hopes that he could spark joy in him like he just did.","This young Light Wind Wolf thought, Lord Fan Lou was right. Feng Xuan will value and rely on me if I use this method to curry favor with him.","“Lord Feng Xuan, my name is Wu Qing. If you don’t find my name pleasant, you can give me another name!”","Wu Qing kneeled on the ground in a display of submission.","Since Feng Xuan had always been by Feng Qing’s side, he did not get to experience this feeling often.","This was a refreshing feeling for Feng Xuan. He absolutely adored it!","Feng Xuan wanted to change Wu Qing’s name to Bai Qing, but he did not have such authority within the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","“Wu Qing, you should just keep your name. If the chance arises, I will help you to become a distant relative of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. You don’t have to do tasks like this anymore.”","The moment Feng Xuan was done speaking, he saw a group of people walking toward him. If he were currently in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ territory, Feng Xuan would definitely question their background as a means of exhibiting his status.","But he was currently in the Scarlet Territory. As a Chaos Wind Demon Wolf, he had little to no presence in the Scarlet Territory. If someone wanted to make things difficult for him, there was nothing he could do but endure.","If he offended someone he could not afford to cross, Feng Qing would not try to save him. Once the matter involved the Bloodian clans, Feng Qing could not help him even if he wanted to!","Feng Xuan could already sense the pure Bloodian aura emanating from Lin Yuan’s body. Although the aura was not strong, this handsome golden-haired young man had to be special in order to possess such a pure Bloodian bloodline!","He had been helping to harvest the Scarlet Grass for some time, but this was the first time that he was coming face to face with a Bloodian.","Feng Xuan said experimentally, “Lord, up ahead is the Andra clan’s territory. Are you headed there? If you are, I can lead the way!”","Lin Yuan’s lip curled slightly.","If he had initiated contact with this Chaos Wind Demon Wolf, it would have seemed as though he was harboring a motive. But now that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf had spoken to him first, things were different!","Now, there was no need to use any of the hidden lines that Fan Lou had prepared. Regardless of what he did, Fan Lou would not be implicated!"]},{"number":2892,"title":"Chapter 2892 Successful Interaction!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2892 Successful Interaction!","Given that Lin Yuan needed to pass off as a true Bloodian, he had done extensive homework and preparation.","The strength of one’s bloodline was the equivalent of one’s status. It was Lin Yuan’s understanding that nothing was more important to the Bloodians than their bloodline.","It was the Bloodians’ emphasis on their bloodline that gave Lin Yuan a loophole he could exploit.","Lin Yuan was naturally skilled at acting. He had seen arrogant elites both in his previous life and in the main world.","All Lin Yuan needed to do was act haughtily when he interacted with this Chaos Wind Demon Wolf.","“Andra clan? So it’s the Andra clan that’s up ahead! From their name, they don’t sound like a queen clan.”","Feng Xuan did not even dare to draw breath when he heard what Lin Yuan said. He did not know how to respond to this young male Bloodian.","If he picked up on what this young man said, he would come across as looking down on the Andra clan. But if he did not respond at all, he would not be able to leave a positive impression on this young man!","Based on Lin Yuan’s attitude toward the Andra clan, Feng Xuan was certain that he came from a clan with a queen bloodline.","If he could become acquainted with such a clan, he would become the pride of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Feng Xuan was sure of this.","Presently, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were only linked to the Andra clan. They did not have ties to any other Bloodian clans.","One could be considered the Bloodians’ dependent species once they became close with one of the Bloodian clans.","Most of the Bloodian clans were arrogant toward the other clans’ dependent species. The dependent species would only be acknowledged after they made a contribution to their affiliated clan.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had tried and failed to form ties with other Bloodian clans over the years.","With certainty that his chance was here, Feng Xuan pushed aside his fear and said with a slight tremor in his voice, “Lord, it’s true that the Andra clan doesn’t have a queen, but they are extremely strong nonetheless and treat their guests well. If you pay their territory a visit, they will definitely be friendly to you! You might even gain some benefits!”","When Lin Yuan heard this, he knew he had reached his goal. All it took was a few words, and Feng Xuan had extended an invitation to him.","By using Feng Xuan to complete his plan, he was also tapping into Feng Xuan’s ambition.","“What is your name?”","Feng Xuan looked just as excited as he felt when he heard what Lin Yuan said.","“My name is Feng Xuan, and I come from the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves have been the Bloodians’ dependent species for some time. I hope me and the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves will be able to help you from now on!”","“Oh? One of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves should be a member of the Honor Absent Parliament, right? I am on this trip to trade with the other Bloodians. Since I have nothing else to do, why don’t you take me to meet the Andra clan?”","If he managed to bring a Bloodian from a queen clan to meet with the Andra clan, he would not only be able to become linked with this young Bloodian but would also be recognized by the Andra clan!","Having a connection to a queen clan was far more important than being connected to the remote Lonely River.","Fan Lou would not be able to swagger about in front of him with his nose in the air again! He would definitely be able to regain Feng Qing’s favor!","With this thought, Feng Xuan resolved to be the middleman between this young Bloodian and the Andra clan. He would not allow this young Bloodian to shove him aside once he took him to meet the Andra clan.","Feng Xuan mustered his courage and asked, “Lord, can you tell me the name of your clan? This will make it easier for me to introduce you to the Andra clan!”","While he was speaking, Feng Xuan’s heart pounded loudly in his chest. He was afraid that Lin Yuan would turn him down and cast him a look of scorn.","While Feng Xuan waited, his body slowly stiffened as he silently prayed.","At that moment, he heard a pleasant voice say softly, “My surname is Elise. My clan has always remained under the radar, so the Andra clan might not have heard of us. Since you’re going to introduce me to the Andra clan, you can have this spirit qi crystal!”","Lin Yuan tossed a spirit qi crystal to Feng Xuan.","Feng Xuan was so nervous that he almost failed to catch the spirit qi crystal. But when he caught it, he sensed the pure and strong spirit qi within it. He had never received such pure and strong spirit qi before in his life.","Spirit qi of such purity should enable his bloodline to be further purified.","From the way that Lin Yuan casually gave away something this precious, Feng Xuan could tell that Lin Yuan was an elite. Only the truly powerful Bloodian clans would be so generous with the rewards they gave out.","Until now, he was doing nothing more than serving this young Bloodian. They did not have any ties to each other and had only just met.","Being this generous to a stranger showed how wealthy this young Bloodian was.","Elise had a clear female ring to it. This young man had to come from a queen bloodline.","If this young man he introduced to the Andra ended up completing a large and important trade with them that led to the two clans working together, Feng Xuan’s position would not only shoot past that of Fan Lou, but even Feng Qing would have to start showing him some respect!","With this thought, Feng Xuan became even friendlier toward Lin Yuan. He saw Lin Yuan as the life-saving straw that would enable him to exhibit his value.","Feng Xuan kneeled and bowed to Lin Yuan just like how a believer would act toward the sacred being they worshipped.","“Lord, let me take you there now!”","Feng Xuan looked at Wu Qing, who was standing nearby.","“Wu Qing, stay here and help me watch over the rest. Make sure that no issues crop up with the harvesting of the Scarlet Grass. If there are any problems, you’ll have to answer for them!”","Once he finished speaking sternly to Wu Qing, Feng Xuan put on another pleasing expression for Lin Yuan.","Feng Xuan did this because he needed to ensure that the harvesting of the Scarlet Grass was taken care of. The Andra clan had assigned the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves to harvest the Scarlet Grass and needed a collection periodically.","Normally, they were able to collect enough Scarlet Grass. However, he had to siphon some not only for himself but for Feng Qing as well.","Feng Xuan did not want to give up on the opportunity to obtain the Scarlet Grass, so he needed to instruct the workers to do their best.","Additionally, he wanted to let Lin Yuan know that he was considered a manager among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and could become his bridge to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Lin Yuan did not know anything about him, and they had only just become acquainted. Feng Xuan found it necessary to prove his worth to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan could not be bothered to care about what Feng Xuan was thinking. He saw Feng Xuan as a stupid person.","It was good if he was smart enough to seize opportunities. But someone like him, who had appeared out of the blue, was like a tempting poison to Feng Xuan. In order to seize the opportunity, he would swallow the poison without hesitation. Such actions were taboo for a faction’s development.","If Lin Yuan found out that someone within Sky City harbored such thoughts, he would eliminate them immediately. There was no way he would keep such a source of disaster by his side.","The Andra clan would definitely be smarter than Feng Xuan. They would not trust him until they confirmed his identity.","However, this would not get in the way of him trading Creator resources with the Andra clan. Although the Bloodians absorbed blood energy on a day-to-day basis, their main source of energy was still spirit qi.","Blood Love needed a large amount of blood energy to increase her power.","Lin Yuan wanted to use this trip to the Scarlet Territory to obtain more resources that Blood Love could use to increase her power.","These resources containing blood energy were very hard to come by and were considered rare spiritual ingredients. They were only available in large quantities in places like the Scarlet Territory.","After he produced a large amount of Creator resources, the Andra clan would definitely be willing to trade these resources that they could easily get their hands on for the Creator resources.","The Andra clan would definitely have concerns about him while they were guarded against him.","But once they traded for a large amount of Creator resources from him and desired to maintain such a relationship with him, they would have to be friendly toward him even if they continued to distrust him.","The Andra clan already intended to target the clan that was opening the blood pool. They wanted to obtain as much energy from the blood tide as they could.","If he suggested joining their plan, it was likely that they would be in agreement.","The Andra would never expect him to steal the entire blood pool once it was opened.","He would go into hiding after stealing the blood pool. At that time, that Bloodian clan’s fury would be directed at the Andra clan.","The Andra clan would become the scapegoats for Lin Yuan’s careful plan.","While Feng Xuan was leading the way, he never stopped trying to communicate with Lin Yuan, but he ignored him. All he did was ask the occasional question about the Andra clan or Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Most of the information Lin Yuan asked about was extremely confidential. Under normal circumstances, Feng Xuan should not tell Lin Yuan about any of it.","But it was clear that Feng Xuan had completely let his guard down against Lin Yuan and told him everything he knew. Lin Yuan knew the answers to some of the questions he asked. He had asked Fan Lou the same questions, and Fan Lou’s answers matched the answers that Feng Xuan gave.","It was clear that Fan Lou knew more about the Bloodians than Feng Xuan did. This meant that Feng Xuan was insignificant to the Bloodians. It was no wonder that Feng Xuan was so desperate to prove himself to him!","It did not take long for Lin Yuan’s group to arrive at the Andra clan’s territory.","The Andra clan considered this matter of Feng Xuan bringing them a true Bloodian to be very important.","One of the Andra clan’s Elders personally met with Lin Yuan, and everything he said was meant to extract information from Lin Yuan. This did not align with what Feng Xuan had expected. Feng Xuan had wanted to be the one to introduce Lin Yuan to the Andra clan.","After Feng Xuan was led away by members of the Andra clan, they began questioning him in detail about Lin Yuan’s circumstances.","Feng Xuan thought, Luckily, I asked and learned about his circumstances. Otherwise, I would be clueless and completely unable to answer the Andra clan’s questions!","Not only did Feng Xuan not feel a shred of unhappiness about this situation, but he was thrilled because this was the first time he had the opportunity to speak with the Andra clan’s elite. This was the first time they were properly acknowledging him.","Just mentioning the name of Lin Yuan’s clan, which had the legacy of a queen, would be enough for the Andra clan to acknowledge him.","...","The Elder from the Andra clan tried more than once to investigate the aura of Lin Yuan’s bloodline. His aura was so pure that the Elder could not suspect Lin Yuan’s identity.","Lin Yuan’s bloodline caused the Elder to act extremely courteously toward him.","As the Elder continued to question him, this young man with unquestionably beautiful features said with displeasure, “I’m only here at the Andra clan’s territory for a visit. Do you plan on interrogating me? If the Andra clan doesn’t want to be on friendly terms with me, I can just leave.”","Lin Yuan’s attitude was a big issue for Andre.","Lin Yuan’s pure bloodline and his background made it impossible for the Andra clan to give up on the opportunity to interact with him. The best way for the Bloodians to improve their bloodline was not to absorb the bloodlines of their targets but to link their bloodline to that of other Bloodians with pure bloodlines through marriage. This would enable their offspring’s bloodline to be significantly strengthened.","Andre asked Lin Yuan so much about his situation because he had never heard of the Elise clan."]},{"number":2893,"title":"Chapter 2893 Brahma Snake Totem!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2893 Brahma Snake Totem!","Lin Yuan had never had high expectations for the Star Vastness Peony. However, ever since the Star Vastness Peony had been contracted by Lin Yuan, it had displayed its unique functions. Lin Yuan’s current outstanding physique had a lot to do with the Star Vastness Peony.","During this period, Lin Yuan had also tried to use the Star Vastness Peony’s exclusive skill, Merciful Stars, to temper Spring and Winter’s physique and let them obtain some benefits through the Star Vastness Peony.","The exclusive skill that the Star Vastness Peony had obtained after evolving into a Creation Breed was Star Map Shackle. Lin Yuan had originally thought that the Star Vastness Peony would continue to move in the direction he controlled, yet he was surprised to find it diverging.","After evolving to Sovereign, the Radiant Star Teardrops would gather all the energy in the galaxy and brew them in the calyx, eventually transforming them into pure star energy. The relationship between star energy and light-type energy could be likened to the relationship between water-type and ice-type.","With the Radiant Star Teardrops, the Star Vastness Peony could steadily produce a niche amount of elemental energy. Lin Yuan could use this niche elemental energy to nurture the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil.","Lin Yuan had obtained two feys that produced niche elemental energy in the Fortune Treasure Palace. With the addition of the Star Vastness Peony’s star energy, the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil’s transformation into Major Satan was already a sure bet and was just a matter of time.","Since Lin Yuan had taken Liu Chen and Liu Yao under his wing, he had two devil groups under his command. These two devil groups each had a Satan devil as their leader. Devil commanders were afraid of bloodlines that were higher than their own and would not submit to bloodlines of equal status. This made it impossible for the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil to control these two devil groups.","However, when the Flower Calamity Beautiful Devil became a Major Satan, everything would be different. Under the absolute bloodline suppression, it would be able to control these two devil groups perfectly.","The Star Vastness Peony had successfully evolved into a Creation Breed and obtained a new exclusive skill, Celestial Body Boost, which allowed the Star Vastness Peony to attach itself to other things or lifeforms.","Then, its spiritual energy would be applied to the lifeforms to increase the lifeforms’ sensitivity towards celestial bodies. The lifeforms’ link to the celestial body would also be deepened and enable it to interact with the lifeforms.","To put it simply, Celestial Body Boost could be linked with all the Star Vastness Peony’s abilities and effects. Possessing a target could enhance the celestial body’s ability to refine its physical form. Then, the celestial body would be able to better contact a lifeform through Star Vastness Peony in order to inject a large amount of energy into that lifeform’s body.","This effect would not have much effect on Lin Yuan in a short period of time. With his physical strength, he could not absorb more of the energy in the celestial body and use it to temper his body. However, it could increase the tempering effect of the Star Vastness Peony on top experts like Spring, Summer, Autumn, and Winter.","On a larger scale, the Star Vastness Peony had unlimited possibilities of augmenting the target’s spiritual energy by strengthening the connection between things and stars.","The Star Vastness Peony’s exclusive skill, Celestial Body Boost, had the most interlinked effect. Instead of calling it the Star Vastness Peony itself, it was more appropriate to call it Wen Yu.","Wen Yu’s sacred source lifeform, Astronomical Parliament, had not activated after arriving in the Sky Beyond the Clouds. The sacred source lifeforms contracted by Lin Yuan and the others were almost equivalent to the treasures refined by the natives of the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","The intrinsic treasure refined by the natives of the Sky Beyond the Clouds would also be bound to their souls.","Logically speaking, Wen Yu’s sacred source lifeform, the Astronomical Parliament, should have a miraculous effect when venturing into the Sky Beyond the Clouds, enabling Lin Yuan to flourish across the four universes of the Sky Beyond the Clouds and absorb more members for the Astronomical Parliament.","The reason why the Astronomical Parliament had not been restarted was not because Lin Yuan and Wen Yu lacked the intention to do so, but because Wen Yu needed to communicate with the celestial bodies if he wanted to use the Astronomical Parliament to bring people who had made wishes to the gathering place of the stars.","However, Wen Yu was too weak and the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ celestial body was too high-level. It was difficult for Wen Yu to contact the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ celestial body. This was the main reason why the Astronomical Parliament could not be held.","This greatly restricted Sky City’s development in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","Back in the main world, Lin Yuan had used the Astronomical Parliament to make a name for himself. Every member of the Astronomical Parliament played an indispensable role in Lin Yuan’s conquest and exploration of the main world.","Without Bei Xu, Lin Yuan would not have discovered that there was a piece of land on the other side of the Barren Sea. Without Peace, it would be difficult for Lin Yuan to explore the Broiling Rock Continent.","Without Yin Lin leading the Azure Federation envoy to the Radiance Federation to work closely with Lin Yuan, Liu Jie would not have been able to obtain the transformation of the Firefly Demon Fetus.","Ta Lei, Luo Lan, and Su Yiren had also given Lin Yuan the opportunity to start his training on the Startling Lines Continent. Su Yiren had always been Lin Yuan’s right-hand man.","Yin Lin, Bu Po, Ta Lei, and the others had not gone to the Sky Beyond the Clouds. Even if Wen Yu used the Star Vastness Peony’s exclusive skill, Celestial Body Boost, to reopen the Astronomical Parliament, he wouldn’t be able to contact them.","They could be considered to have left the Astronomical Parliament. However, Lin Yuan would never forget their contributions.","Lin Yuan was uncertain if the Sovereign X/Immortal IX Star Vastness Peony could revive the Astronomical Parliament with Wen Yu’s enhancement. However, this enhancement would undoubtedly increase the possibility of the Astronomical Parliament reopening. When Lin Yuan returned to the wasteland in the North of the Lonely River, he would let Wen Yu give it a try.","The Star Vastness Peony’s transformation brought Lin Yuan a pleasant surprise, which put him in an extremely good mood. After putting the Star Vastness Peony back into the Spirit Lock spatial zone, Lin Yuan looked at the time.","There were still nearly two hours until the Bloodians’ banquet. Lin Yuan planned to use this time to strengthen the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake that he had just spirit-locked. After a short period of accumulation, the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake could already transform into a Suzerain/Myth Breed.","When a Fantasy Breed fey transformed its will into a law, it marked one of the most crucial transformations in its life, comparable to obtaining divine kingdom ability. The laws comprehended by a fey basically laid the foundation for its subsequent growth.","Lin Yuan had already witnessed the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s strength and had high expectations for its transformation and growth. Lin Yuan sensed that the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s bloodline had reached a critical point and was in a throbbing state.","As long as this upgrade provided the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake with sufficient high-quality energy and resources, it was very likely that its bloodline would undergo a metamorphosis.","When Liu Chen and Liu Yao were eliminating the star pirates, apart from killing them, they also spared some of them. These star pirates were used as food for the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake. With the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s exclusive skill, Six Flowers Curse, these star pirates were transformed into sub-snakes before being devoured by the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake.","Apart from that, Lin Yuan also followed the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake to retrieve the Wood-Building Winged Sandflies’ pupae and various soul-type spiritual ingredients.","In the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds, even experts wouldn’t have access to materials of such high caliber unless they had many high-grade Creators serving them.","Lin Yuan knew that letting his feys receive the World Cleansing in the Andra clan’s mansion would definitely attract their attention. He could be said to have done so intentionally. His actions indeed have succeeded in intimidating the members of the Andra clan, as Lin Yuan had anticipated.","The Andra clan’s Elders had basically explored Lin Yuan’s courtyard, but they had not found anything. It was obvious what this indicated. This meant that Black Elise was stronger than the Elders of the Andra clan. This discovery suppressed all of the Andra clan’s sinister intentions, leaving them with no choice but to cooperate with Lin Yuan.","It turned out that Lin Yuan wasn’t a fat piece of meat nailed to the chopping board by the Andra clan. In fact, the Andra clan was the fat piece of meat in front of him and he was holding the sharp blade.","Lin Yuan couldn’t be bothered to care about what the Andra clan thought. If his obvious intimidation still didn’t work, there was no need for Lin Yuan to be polite to them anymore. At most, he would just think of another way to head to the blood pool!","Lin Yuan’s attention was completely focused on improving the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake. At this moment, the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake was absorbing the sub-snake star pirates while absorbing the soul-type spiritual ingredients.","It was clearly more interested in the soul-type spiritual ingredient than the pupae of the Wood-Building Winged Sandfly, which meant that the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake was rejecting its wood attributes.","As a Wood-type/Soul-type dual-attribute fey, wood attributes did not have much of an effect on the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake. The only ability related to wood attributes that the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake had was Wood Forging Armor.","Once the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake abandoned its wood attributes after its bloodline metamorphosis, the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s Silver ability, Wood Forging Armor, would also undergo an obvious change due to the change in attributes.","Lin Yuan did not interfere with the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s choice during the bloodline transformation process. He was just waiting for the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake to transform its bloodline.","Just as Lin Yuan had observed, as the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s soul power continued to increase, it began to shed its skin.","The Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake constantly expelled the wood-elemental energy from its body by shedding its skin. Every time it shed its skin, the patterns on its body would become more beautiful and distinct. The patterns on its scales seemed to have an obscure spirit attribute.","Suddenly, the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake let out a violent neigh. Right on the heels of that, an energy exploded in the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s body and enveloped it. The Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake finally began to transform!","This metamorphosis didn’t last long before it returned to normal. After evolving in grade, the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s body was much smaller than before.","If the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake were to stick its head and tail together, it could fit on Lin Yuan’s wrist. However, Lin Yuan’s wrist was Morbius’ territory, and the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake did not have the courage to share the wrist with Morbius. Even Lin Yuan’s other wrist, which was not wearing Morbius, was the same.","Lin Yuan sensed the Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake’s aura and was certain that its bloodline had undergone a metamorphosis. He used Morbius’ True Data to investigate the transformed Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake.","[Fey Name]: Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake","[Fey Species]: Snake Pupils/Illusion Snake","[Fey Grade]: Suzerain (1/10)","[Fey Type]: Soul","[Fey Quality]: Myth I","Abilities:","[Snake Eyes]: Controls other snake-species feys through its eyes. When its soul energy is enough to suppress other snake-species feys, it can induce them to contract or sacrifice it (Contract allows control over the snake-type lifeforms. As long as the targeted snake-type lifeforms’ spiritual power does not exceed its own, it will not escape its control. When sacrificing the targeted snake-type lifeforms, it can obtain the energy from its body and use its flesh to strengthen its own physical fitness).","[Snake Coiling Defense]: Coiled its body together, allowing the entire snake body to become one. When it is attacked, it can shrink its body and increase its defense to the greatest extent.","[Soul Forging Armor]: When the soul energy is combined with the snake-species fey’s bloodline, it will form an armor that interweaves with the bloodline on the surface of the body. Not only can it resist physical attacks, but it also has a certain resistance to elemental damage","[Life Prolonging Shedding]: Under the circumstances of using the Snake Coiling Defense, if the target pierces through the defense and poses a threat to its life, it will instinctively undergo a snake shedding to avoid fatal damage. Each snake shedding weakens the body and diminishes a certain amount of soul strength.","[Swift Snake Shadow]: Increases the snake-species feys under its control, allowing them to react and attack more quickly.","[Violent Venom Burst]: Activate the snake venom in the target’s body, causing the slow-acting snake venom to instantly activate its poison effect and cause timely damage to the target. The poison damage to the target will be converted into healing energy to heal the army of snakes.","[Snake Devouring Rampage]: The snake-type feys under its control will devour each other and increase the strength of the main body in a superimposed manner. It will also cause the devouring main body to enter a berserk state and sacrifice itself to attack the enemy. At the end of its life, its body will explode, and the damage will be equivalent to its full strength attack at its peak.","Exclusive Skill:","[Six Flowers Curse]: Through the Six Flowers Curse in the eye, whenever the target’s body is invaded by poison related to the target, a snake flower will grow from the wound. When the number of snake flowers reaches six, the target’s bloodline will be forcefully changed, turning the target into a sub-snake.","[Control Strengthening]: When contracting a snake-species fey, the contract will be bound to the target’s soul. Once bound to the target’s soul, if the contract is shaken by external influences, the contract will spontaneously sacrifice the target to prevent it from breaking free from its control.","[Brahma Snake Totem]: Transform one’s own totem into the contractor’s body. The contractor will share the worship of the snake-type creatures. One can perfectly control the snake-type feys and obtain the faith power nurtured by these snake-type feys."]},{"number":2894,"title":"Chapter 2894 What Do You Mean By I Won’t Force It!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2894 What Do You Mean By I Won’t Force It!","The Six-Flowered Jade Blood Snake had already evolved into a lifeform called the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake. In terms of bloodline, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake was undoubtedly closer to the Nirvana Sky Snake bloodline.","Just as Lin Yuan had expected, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake had stripped away the wood-elemental energy in its body and become a pure soul-type lifeform. Becoming a pure soul-type lifeform would help the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake control other lifeforms.","The Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s original Silver ability, Wood Forging Armor, had become Soul Forging Armor. Through the fusion of soul energy with its body, it formed an armor to protect itself.","Even prior to the transformation of its bloodline, the soul energy in the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s body was much more than the wood-elemental energy in its body. Therefore, from any perspective, the change in the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s Silver ability was a good thing!","The exclusive skill that the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake obtained after evolving to Suzerain was called Snake Devouring Rampage, which granted it the ability to control the lives of the snake-type feys and easily decide their life and death.","When encountering troublesome enemies, the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake could increase the strength of the snake-type feys it controlled by letting them devour each other. It could use this ability to kill powerful enemies above its level.","Under normal circumstances, if a fey wanted to unleash a powerful ability surpassing its grade, it would have to endure many negative effects. The Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake also had to bear the consequences. However, these consequences would not directly affect it. Rather, they would impact the snake-type feys under its control.","Snake Devouring Rampage allowed the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake to display its cruel and cold-blooded nature. All the snake-type feys it nurtured and controlled served as ammunition for the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake to fight enemies and could be easily discarded.","Logically speaking, when a Myth Breed fey obtained the ability to fight beyond its grade, the contractor would definitely be very happy. Although Lin Yuan was also very happy with the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake, it was Brahma Snake Totem that caught his eye.","When Brahma Snake Totem was used, it would transform itself into a totem imprinted on Lin Yuan’s body. Lin Yuan could then share the worship of snake-type feys with the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake and perfectly control the snake-type feys under its command.","This was equivalent to Lin Yuan possessing the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake’s ability. It was very similar to a possession-type skill. However, it was fundamentally different from a real possession-type ability.","After the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake transformed into a totem and attached itself to Lin Yuan, the latter unexpectedly gained the faith power that should rightfully belong to the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake. This was a source of faith power for Lin Yuan.","Originally, Lin Yuan had not planned to spend too many resources on nurturing the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake. But now, he changed his mind. He was prepared to wantonly nurture snake-species feys.","The Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake was currently in its totem state, so Lin Yuan could use these snake-species feys to wantonly increase his strength and achieve many of his goals. He could even wantonly control snake-species feys.","In terms of the nourishment of faith power, the sub-snake was very different from ordinary snake-species feys. This prevented Lin Yuan from using the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake to convert other feys. Lin Yuan needed to obediently search for the snake-species and control them.","...","Upon hearing the knock on the door, Lin Yuan put away the Brahma Flower Jade Blood Snake and gestured for Kani to open the door.","Andre, who was standing at the door, had a strange expression on his face.","As the Andra Elder in charge of receiving Lin Yuan, he was observing Lin Yuan’s strength and also seeking to obtain some benefits from him at the same time. Andre was a profit-seeker. He only had a good impression of Lin Yuan after the latter gave him some spirit qi crystals as a reward.","Andre wondered if the Elders would covet Lin Yuan’s wealth if he reported it to them.","Lin Yuan did not have many followers. However, due to the World Cleansing triggered by the feys in Lin Yuan’s room, the Andra experts were unable to surpass the shielding and probe into the situation inside the room.","After this incident, the Andra clan’s attitude toward Lin Yuan had changed. Their initial probing had turned into fear and admiration.","When Andre came to see Lin Yuan again, the pressure was undoubtedly much greater than before.","Upon entering the room, Andre saw Lin Yuan looking at him elegantly. Although he did not say anything, he tilted his head slightly and revealed a questioning expression.","Andre hurriedly said, “Lord, the Andra clan has already prepared a banquet for you. When are you willing to go for a meal? I’ll arrange for them to wait to prevent those delicacies from getting cold. In order to express the sincerity of our Andra clan, we specially took out a jar of blood wine that has been stored for more than 10,000 years. There aren’t many bottles left in the Andra clan’s wine cellar.”","Under normal circumstances, there was a tradition within the Bloodians where guests followed the host’s lead, and guests were expected to comply with the host’s arrangements. Andre’s attitude toward Lin Yuan was that of a host accommodating his guest. This was a significant gesture of goodwill to a Bloodian with long-standing traditions.","Andre represented the Andra clan, and his words represented the clan’s attitude toward Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan remembered that the vintage of the blood wine Andre originally mentioned was not as high as it was now. It seemed that the Andra clan had raised their standards to deal with him upon learning about his strength.","Lin Yuan was very satisfied with the change in the Andra clan’s attitude toward him. This was the effect he wanted and the only way to facilitate Lin Yuan’s goals.","“Mr. Andre, you don’t have to be so polite to a Bloodian junior like me. I’ve never liked to steal the limelight, so it’s better for the guest to follow the host. I will attend whenever the Andra clan is ready to host. Compared to attending this banquet, I’m more concerned about when I can observe the records of the Andra clan and gain some understanding of the Scarlet Territory.","“I’ve always been a person who doesn’t like to drag things out. If the Andra clan really can’t satisfy my request, just tell me directly. I don’t think I’ll force it!”","Andre’s hair stood on end when he heard Lin Yuan’s words. What did he mean by he wouldn’t force it? Lin Yuan’s words seemed to be telling Andre that if the Andra clan didn’t let him read the records, they would have to bear the consequences!","Andre hurriedly said, “Your Grace Black, there’s naturally no problem if you want to read the records of the Andra clan regarding the Scarlet Territory. After the banquet ends, I’ll bring you to the Hidden Book Pavilion of the Andra clan. At that time, you can read whatever you want. The other books in the Hidden Book Pavilion are all collected by the Andra clan. If you are interested, you can also read them!”","Lin Yuan smiled. “I’ve always been fond of making friends. I’m willing to be friends with the Andra clan since considering your treatment toward me. I have many spirit qi crystals made by Creators using secret techniques. They are the things I gave you previously.","“In addition, there’s also pure elemental energy of various elements. The resources created by these Creators are precious to any species. I don’t think I need to say more about how sincere I am in trading with you.”","Andre’s expression was abnormally excited. The Andra clan had treated Lin Yuan so well, not hesitating to take out the blood wine that had been stored in the cellar for 10,000 years. They had even let Lin Yuan read the Andra clan’s precious books. Their purpose was to befriend Lin Yuan and obtain some benefits from him at the same time.","Andre, who had come to contact Lin Yuan, was also responsible for communicating with him. However, he did not know how he should speak to Lin Yuan. He was afraid that Lin Yuan might suspect him of having ulterior motives. It wouldn’t be good if that were the case!","Now that Lin Yuan had taken the initiative to propose a trade with the Andra clan, Andre no longer had any qualms. When the family clan found out about the situation, they would definitely reward him.","Apart from fulfilling his clan’s mission, Andre also wanted to use the convenience of interacting with Lin Yuan to obtain some benefits from him. Judging from the reward that Lin Yuan had just given him, he should be generous enough to satisfy his selfish desires.","Since Lin Yuan wanted to be on good terms with the Andra clan, he definitely needed a middleman. Andre would like to act as the middleman between Lin Yuan and the Andra clan.","However, Andre wasn’t in a hurry to discuss these matters with Lin Yuan. He planned to wait until Lin Yuan engaged in actual dealings with the Andra clan before broaching the subject, hoping to gain Lin Yuan’s favor in the process.","...","Lin Yuan participated in the Andra clan’s banquet as a descendant of the queen’s bloodline. Despite being the center of attention, Lin Yuan didn’t make much of a spectacle at the event.","On the other hand, Feng Xuan was eager to show off and had talked to Lin Yuan more than once at the banquet.","If the Andra clan did not value Lin Yuan and had no intention of communicating with him, it would be understandable for Feng Xuan to do so. However, when the Andra clan wanted to show off in front of Lin Yuan, Feng Xuan’s actions became an eyesore.","Feng Xuan represented the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. His actions would lead the Andra clan to believe that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were eager to make contact with Lin Yuan, a pure-blooded Bloodian with the queen’s bloodline.","Would the Chaotic Wind Demon Wolves happen to look down on the Andra clan and attempt to seize the opportunity to establish a direct connection with the Elise clan, reaching for a higher branch to fly away?","Upon watching Feng Xuan’s performance, Fan Lou had the thought that he had ruthlessly manipulated Feng Xuan. In the beginning, Fan Lou did not take the initiative to target Feng Xuan. After all, Feng Xuan was not in Fan Lou’s eyes at all.","Now, even Feng Qing no longer instilled fear in Fan Lou, and the entire Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were just a springboard for him.","Fan Lou still acted as a loyal subordinate in front of Feng Qing. Since he was acting, Fan Lou would naturally fulfill his duties as a loyal subordinate and help Feng Qing monitor Feng Xuan. Fan Lou would tell Feng Qing everything that Feng Xuan had done.","Even if Feng Xuan wasn’t tricked to death by Lin Yuan’s plan, he would ultimately be dealt with by Feng Qing. The decline of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves would start because of Feng Xuan’s greed.","Fan Lou didn’t take the initiative to find trouble with Feng Xuan, but the latter changed his attitude in front of Fan Lou and kept showing off to Fan Lou. This infuriated Fan Lou.","When Fan Lou first started following Feng Qing, Feng Xuan often made things difficult for him, causing him to almost lose Feng Qing’s trust several times.","Because of his connection with Lin Yuan, which changed his fate, Fan Lou became indifferent to confronting Feng Xuan. However, this did not mean that he had let go of his hatred for Feng Xuan.","However, Fan Lou was aware that he could not go overboard. If Feng Qing got rid of Feng Xuan in anger, not only would it affect Lin Yuan’s plan, but he would also lose a scapegoat after the incident!","Thinking of this, Fan Lou decided to temporarily suppress the dissatisfaction in his heart and tolerate Feng Xuan for a while. In any case, Feng Xuan was already a grasshopper after autumn. He wouldn’t be able to jump for long!","Lin Yuan had been bored at the banquet and had been observing Fan Lou. He was not interested in the dishes and wine that were delicious to the Bloodians at all.","Lin Yuan realized that Fan Lou had a good temperament and knew how to tolerate Feng Xuan’s provocation.","In the beginning, Lin Yuan had just taken Fan Lou under his wing because he was intrigued by Fan Lou’s identity as a member of the Sixth Boundary Patrol Team and did not think that Fan Lou could be of much use. However, Lin Yuan felt that nurturing Fan Lou was a good choice now.","After this incident was over, Lin Yuan would fulfill his promise to help Fan Lou take off. Fan Lou might not be strong and talented, but he was really good at reading someone’s body language.","People like Fan Lou were the most suitable to make connections. Lin Yuan had said that he would help Fan Lou become a member of Honor Absent Palace, the most suitable stage for Fan Lou’s development.","Just as Feng Xuan was about to contact and negotiate with Lin Yuan again, Andre pulled Feng Xuan back and said coldly, “Why do you keep hovering around Lord Black? Could it be that your Chaos Wind Demon Wolves harbor intentions toward the Elise clan and want to follow them instead of remaining as a direct subordinate of the Andra clan!?","“If your Chaos Wind Demon Wolves really harbor such intentions, you can tell me directly. I will report to the family clan to fulfill your wishes!","“If you’ve finished your dinner, leave quickly. Later, I’ll personally remind Feng Qing not to have those useless delusions! Our Andra clan has supported your Chaos Wind Demon Wolves for so long. This kind of kindness is not something that you can abandon just because you want to! I believe that Feng Qing should be aware of this!”","Andre was truly enraged by Feng Xuan’s actions. How dare a dependent species member like Feng Xuan meddle with the affairs of the Andra clan!?","If Feng Xuan had not spoken to Lin Yuan, the latter’s attitude toward him would have been pretty good.","Andre had long wanted to get rid of Feng Xuan!","The Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River were all close to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Was this the reason the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were so arrogant?"]},{"number":2895,"title":"Chapter 2895 The Hundred Questions Beast Army With Strategic Significance Enhancement!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2895 The Hundred Questions Beast Army With Strategic Significance Enhancement!","Andre believed that the Andra clan needed to severely punish the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and make them realize upon whom they relied for their development to this day. The Andra clan wouldn’t be so foolish as to allow their direct subordinates to climb the social ladder of other Bloodians. If the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves harbored ill intentions, the Andra clan could simply destroy them.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were not particularly significant to the Andra clan. Among them, the most important individual for the Bloodians was Fan Lou, who could facilitate their communication with the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords.","The Andra clan had already discerned Fan Lou’s background, and he was not a native member of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Previously, Fan Lou had no association with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves and only acquired their bloodline after aligning with them. Hence, he definitely did not harbor deep feelings for the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","As a relative, Fan Lou must have been utilized by the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves previously. His ability to endure until now was less about Feng Qing’s favoritism and more about Fan Lou’s capability to make the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves value him.","If the Andra clan were willing to accept Fan Lou and bestow the Bloodian bloodline upon him, he would undoubtedly be even happier because the Bloodian bloodline level was much higher than that of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Unless the Chaos Wind Demon Wolf bloodline reverted to the Moon-Worship Wolves bloodline, it could not compare to the Bloodian bloodline. However, the curse in their bloodline made it impossible for them to revert to their ancestral bloodline.","Andre’s words spoken in his wrath were utterly merciless. Andre was not afraid that Feng Xuan would relay his words to Feng Qing, nor was he concerned that Feng Qing would hold any opinions about the Andra clan.","From start to finish, Andre had not paid much attention to the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Servants would always be servants. The Andra clan played a significant role in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ ability to secure a place in the Honor Absent Parliament.","Feng Qing was well aware that if the Andra clan could promote him to the position of a member of the Honor Absent Parliament, they could also demote him from his position. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been trying so hard to curry favor with the Andra clan.","Feng Xuan was stunned for a long time after hearing Andre’s words. He had no idea how he had offended Andre. It was worth noting that Black Elise was brought here by him on behalf of the Andra clan. Without him, the Andra clan wouldn’t have had the chance to meet Mr. Black. Not only did the Andra clan not accept his kindness, but they also resorted to threatening him.","Feng Xuan wasn’t foolish, and he quickly understood the reason. There was only one possibility for the Andra clan to treat him like this, and that was that they were eager to befriend Lin Yuan, and his efforts to curry favor with Lin Yuan had interfered with their plans.","Given Feng Qing’s attitude toward the Andra clan, if this Andra Elder had indeed said such words to him, Feng Qing would definitely blame him.","At that moment, Feng Xuan was on the brink of tears. He couldn’t help but feel that everything he did was right, yet in the end, it seemed as if he had done something wrong.","In the beginning, Feng Xuan remained highly optimistic about his rise in status, but now, he no longer entertained any optimistic thoughts. His heart was like dead ashes, and he experienced an unprecedented sense of confusion.","Feng Xuan had a feeling that no matter how hard he tried, nothing good would come of it.","Fan Lou sighed inwardly. No matter how much he detested Feng Xuan, he did not contribute to exacerbating the situation. Feng Xuan’s current predicament could be entirely attributed to his own actions.","If Fan Lou were to encounter such a situation, no matter how much he wanted to change his fate, he would not recklessly bring someone back without understanding their background.","Firstly, it was because Fan Lou was accustomed to having no backing. He had basically never relied on anyone along the way. Being cautious was fundamental to Fan Lou’s character. Even with Lin Yuan’s backing, Fan Lou had never considered relying on him.","Fan Lou knew very well that if he needed to rely on Lin Yuan to solve a problem, it would indicate his own inadequacy and that he was causing trouble for Lin Yuan. It was precisely because of this mentality that Fan Lou would never be as bold and reckless as Feng Xuan.","Feng Qing had called Feng Xuan to his side. His attitude actually served as the best reminder to Feng Xuan. However, because of the unrealistic fantasy in his heart, Feng Xuan didn’t take his words seriously. If he had understood Feng Qing’s attitude and recognized the concern in Feng Qing’s heart, he wouldn’t have ended up in his current situation, as warned by the Andra clan!","A high-level faction would not bother to lie to a low-level faction. Since Andre had spoken, he would definitely seek out Feng Qing. Fan Lou thought to himself that since Feng Qing wanted him to keep an eye on Feng Xuan, he should inform him about this matter beforehand since he was at the banquet.","When Feng Qing found out about this, he would undoubtedly fly into a rage. He might even direct his anger toward Fan Lou, even if Feng Qing knew very well that he was only watching over Feng Xuan and could not truly control him.","Fan Lou pursed his lips. Feng Qing had been kind to him. Without Feng Qing, he would not have been able to complete the mission according to Lin Yuan’s request.","If Feng Qing did not vent his anger on him this time, Fan Lou would be willing to try to help the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves if they were in danger. Fan Lou’s pity didn’t arise out of nowhere. Fan Lou believed that as his status rose in the future and he gained some understanding of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, he could make them capable subordinates under his command.","However, if Feng Qing took his anger out on him and punished him for Feng Xuan’s actions, Fan Lou would completely retract his pity, as he wouldn’t tolerate being treated with such indignity. Fan Lou would also sever the only connection with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","Feng Xuan had put considerable effort into getting close to Lin Yuan, who was under the alias Black Elise, but Fan Lou had already succeeded in establishing a relationship with Lin Yuan. Moreover, Fan Lou could sense that Lin Yuan indeed valued him. Otherwise, he would not have asked him to manage the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords’ envoys.","When it came to strength and background, he couldn’t possibly compare to the Four Overlords of the Lonely River on his own.","Fan Lou had boundless expectations for the future. This expectation was entirely different from Feng Xuan’s fanciful fantasy.","If Lin Yuan had not controlled the fountain of faith in his divine kingdom from the start and completely controlled his life and death, Fan Lou would never have obediently worked for Lin Yuan. He had no other choice at that time.","However, after working for Lin Yuan, he realized that Lin Yuan was willing to give him opportunities, leading Fan Lou to have his current expectations and hopes.","When attending the banquet, Lin Yuan was personally received by the Andra Clan’s leader. Before Lin Yuan revealed his strength, the Andra Clan’s leader would not have personally received a junior like Lin Yuan, even if he had the queen’s bloodline.","However, Lin Yuan had already proven that his side was stronger than the Andra clan. Hence, the Andra clan could only express their sincerity and value Lin Yuan 100% by sending their leader to receive him personally.","The Andra clan valued the trade with Lin Yuan very much and hoped that it would bring them a lot of opportunities. “Your Grace Black, I’m Andra Yi Xue, the head of the Andra clan. I’m glad that you’re willing to accept our friendship! I wonder what arrangements and plans you have in the future?”","When Andra Yi Xue came to Lin Yuan’s side, the latter clearly felt a sense of pressure. Andra Yi Xue’s strength had at least reached the high-grade Holy Spirit level. Although there was still a certain gap between him and the pinnacle of the Holy Spirit level, it wasn’t too significant. For a Bloodian that did not have the bloodline of a queen to possess such strength was enough to show how formidable the overall foundation of the Bloodians was.","There was a reason why the Bloodians were able to stand tall in the Sky Beyond the Clouds despite not being as united as the mermaids. The formidable strength of the Bloodians was the best guarantee!","Yi Xue’s words were extremely vague, yet he assured Lin Yuan that if there was anything he needed the Andra clan to do, he could just ask. As long as the Andra clan could do it, they would definitely not refuse. It was just that Andra Yi Xue didn’t make it too clear due to his identity and reputation.","When talking to smart people, there was usually no need to explain things clearly. Lin Yuan knew that this was the best opportunity to make a request to the Andra clan.","Lin Yuan said without any hesitation, “I heard that a Bloodian with the bloodline of a queen is about to open the blood pool. I’m very interested in this blood pool. I wonder if the Andra clan can bring me to join in the fun?”","Lin Yuan’s words did not alert Yi Xue as every Bloodian would hope to be closer to the blood pool upon hearing such news in order to absorb the blood tide. Bringing the young Bloodian in front of him to the Elisa clan’s territory to share the blood tide would be considered generous, and it wouldn’t harm the Andra clan at all.","If he were to bring Lin Yuan along, it would imply that they had formed a team. Lin Yuan’s strength could help him defeat the Bloodian clans that came to divide the spoils and thus seek the greatest benefits for the Andra clan.","Yi Xue had initially planned to invite Lin Yuan and the Andra clan to work together. However, after Lin Yuan said that, there was no need for him to invite Lin Yuan anymore.","“Your Grace Black, there’s naturally no problem! You came at the right time. The blood pool will open in less than a week. Since you’re interested in this blood pool, why don’t you work with our Andra clan?","“The Elisa clan has a rich foundation. It’s said that within the Elisa clan there’s a veteran king who wants to transform the king’s bloodline into the queen’s bloodline, and he has already broken through to the Holy Spirit level. With his strength breaking through to the Holy Spirit level before his bloodline breaks through to the queen’s bloodline. It’s enough to call him a genius.","“After absorbing the energy in the blood pool, his bloodline metamorphosis can be said to have become a sure bet. It has become an unspoken rule for every clan to open a blood pool for the other clans to share the energy in the blood pool tide.","“The news of the opening of the Elisa Clan’s blood pool has probably already spread out to the Scarlet Territory. At that time, it’s inevitable that other clans will come and cause trouble. If we encounter such people, we can help protect the Elisa clan.","“If we let those troublemakers in, we might be chased away before the blood pool closes. Furthermore, offending a newly promoted Bloodian Queen is very likely to bring calamity to the entire clan.","As Yi Xue said this, he carefully observed Lin Yuan’s expression. Yi Xue realized that he did not see any fear or apprehension in Lin Yuan’s expression. This behavior sent a strong signal to Yi Xue, indicating that there must also be a current Bloodian Queen in the Elise clan. Otherwise, Lin Yuan would not have been so calm.","Originally, Yi Xue only wanted to facilitate the cooperation with Lin Yuan. Now, he just wanted to be on good terms with Lin Yuan.","“Your Grace Yi Xue, I’ve always done things appropriately. Thank you for your information. If I have a satisfactory harvest in this operation, I will express my gratitude to your Andra clan.","“If it’s convenient, Your Grace Yi Xue, please bring me to the Hidden Book Pavilion of the Andra clan and let me understand the situation in the Scarlet Territory. It’ll also be convenient for me to inform the Elders of the clan when I return. Otherwise, this trip of mine will seem meaningless!”","Lin Yuan’s words convinced Yi Xue that he came from somewhere outside the Scarlet Territory. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be so determined to understand the situation inside the Scarlet Territory.","There were many precious books in the Hidden Book Pavilion of the Andra clan. They had spent a lot of money to collect these precious books. However, when he thought about how Lin Yuan would trade with the Andra clan after leaving the Hidden Book Pavilion, Yi Xue felt much better.","Yi Xue personally led Lin Yuan to the Andra clan’s Hidden Book Pavilion. When Lin Yuan expressed that he needed peace to read the books, Yi Xue withdrew the Elders who were guarding the Hidden Book Pavilion.","After Lin Yuan came out, Yi Xue would ask the elders in charge of the Hidden Book Pavilion to investigate the books inside to prevent any books from being lost. As for whether Lin Yuan would copy the books in the Hidden Book Pavilion or not, Yi Xue couldn’t care less.","Yi Xue allowed Lin Yuan to enter the Hidden Book Pavilion without fear that he would copy the books there as long as he could ensure that they were not lost.","Lin Yuan asked Spring to check the Hidden Book Pavilion. After confirming that there were no problems, he sealed the Hidden Book Pavilion with his aura to prevent the Andra clan from investigating the situation inside.","If Lin Yuan wanted to read all the books in the Andra clan in a short period, he would have to use Genius.","Genius was comparable to a Creation Master in the main world, and every Hundred Questions Beast in the Sky Beyond the Clouds was comparable to a Creator.","The information related to the Hundred Questions Beast must not be leaked. Otherwise, it would be coveted by the entire Sky Beyond the Clouds!"]},{"number":2896,"title":"Chapter 2896 Being At Odds and Wild Ambition!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2896 Being At Odds and Wild Ambition!","Genius quickly recorded the contents of all the books in the Hidden Book Pavilion. After analyzing the data and sorting out the contents of the book, it used Connected Tails to inform Lin Yuan of the relevant information.","Lin Yuan’s current understanding of these books was probably no better than that of the Andra clan. If the Andra clan did not have abilities similar to Genius’, it would be impossible for them to have such a detailed understanding of the contents of the Hidden Book Pavilion.","Lin Yuan had already developed a rough understanding of the Sky Beyond the Clouds. The Elisa clan, whose blood pool he was about to seize, held quite a high status in the Scarlet Territory. They were one of the 16 clans in the entire Scarlet Territory that possessed the bloodline of the queen.","The queen’s bloodline had only been severed within the past 400 years. The Elisa clan had worked diligently to prepare to continue the queen’s bloodline by opening the blood pool.","Lin Yuan felt that to seize the blood pool of the Elisa clan, it was necessary for him to create some chaos in the situation. Ideally, he hoped to instigate a scenario similar to that of Treasure City. However, Lin Yuan would not be able to make too many arrangements in just less than a week.","Lin Yuan pondered for a moment and decided to assign the mission to Liu Chen and Liu Yao so that they could make their own plans.","Winter, who stood beside Lin Yuan, held a crystal jade in his hand, which emitted energy fluctuations. Winter said in a low voice, “Young Master, it seems that Fan Lou is enduring difficult times among the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves for the sake of this plan.”","Lin Yuan pursed his lips. Even if the Dark Pufferfish and the Four Species Overlords had a bad relationship, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves wouldn’t likely cause too much trouble for Fan Lou. Feng Xuan should be the one who was having a hard time.","However, because of him, even if Feng Xuan did not die, his fate in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves was bound to be very miserable. Feng Xuan must be very aggrieved now. He would most likely be at odds with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves because of this matter.","After Feng Xuan discovered that the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves were no longer his protection and support but rather a limitation to his development, he would definitely try to make contact with him again and be willing to be his chess piece.","Lin Yuan had always observed Fan Lou’s performance. Since he had already decided to nurture Fan Lou, Lin Yuan would find an opportunity for Fan Lou to evolve.","Fan Lou still had a mission to complete at hand, so it was not suitable for Lin Yuan to provide Fan Lou with too many resources to help him enhance his bloodline and strength.","Fan Lou was clutching his left shoulder blade, which was completely shattered by the force of Feng Qing’s palm.","Feng Xuan appeared far more miserable than Fan Lou. He lay on the ground, vomiting blood profusely. Some broken fragments had obviously injured his internal organs. More than the physical pain, what truly hurt Feng Xuan was his heart.","Feng Xuan indeed had some schemes, but he truly considered himself one of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. When he sought benefits for himself, he had never intended to harm the benefits of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. He was clearly fighting for an opportunity for them, yet Feng Qing actually treated him in this manner.","Although Feng Xuan did not die from Feng Qing’s furious attack, he suffered damage to his roots, which was extremely difficult to recover from. Unless Feng Qing took out his precious resources and used them on himself, he would have to live with his crippled body. While losing his limbs might be bearable, the root injury made every breath agonizing for him.","However, given the way Feng Qing treated him, it was unlikely that Feng Qing would allocate precious resources to him. If Feng Qing were to heal his injured roots, wouldn’t that be equivalent to Feng Qing slapping his own face!?","Feng Xuan indeed felt that Feng Qing was more biased toward Fan Lou, but Feng Xuan had also been deceiving himself. He thought about how Feng Qing valued Fan Lou because the latter had indeed made contributions. In comparison to Fan Lou, he had indeed not achieved anything for Feng Qing recently.","By deceiving himself in this manner, Feng Xuan could still manage to maintain composure in front of Feng Qing. Currently, Feng Qing was in a state of uncontrollable rage, yet he had only injured Fan Lou’s left shoulder.","When Feng Qing attacked Fan Lou, he had clearly restrained his strength. Feng Xuan couldn’t deny this blatant favoritism no matter how much he tried to.","Feng Xuan forced himself to look up at Feng Qing in confusion. “Lord Feng Qing, what did I do wrong? Is it just because the Elders of the Andra clan told you that I’ve been trying to get in touch with Mr. Black at the banquet?”","Mr. Black came from a clan that has the bloodline of a queen. Even if he wasn’t stronger than the Andra clan, it was still a way out. Weren’t the Elders of the Andra clan dissatisfied with his actions because he was fighting for a relationship with Mr. Black alongside them?","He had been tirelessly working for the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, clearly contributing to their success. Fan Lou had also made contact with the species from the Lonely River. Why didn’t Feng Qing blame Fan Lou?!","With Feng Qing treating him so differently, there was no way he could stay in the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves any longer in the future.","Fan Lou looked at Feng Xuan, who was bleeding non-stop from the corner of his mouth, and felt a deep sense of pity for him. However, even though Feng Xuan was pitiful, he was really stupid. Even at this moment, he failed to comprehend why Feng Qing was so furious. Despite Feng Xuan’s reluctance to admit or understand it, he had indeed brought disaster upon the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","The excruciating pain of his shattered shoulder blade made Fan Lou afraid to take any action. Although Feng Qing didn’t kill him, he vented his anger on him. If Feng Qing had used a little more strength, his left lung would have been injured.","This attack completely shattered Fan Lou’s friendship with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Feng Qing’s current incompetence and anger could not change reality at all.","After his outburst, Feng Qing finally calmed down. The Andra clan was the backbone of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves. Before the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves developed and found a new pillar, it was impossible for them to leave the Andra clan, nor did they have the ability to.","The words Andre had said to him were exceptionally harsh. Andre represented the Andra clan, which meant that the Andra clan was already very dissatisfied with the attitude of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","If this continued, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves would lose their stable living environment. Feng Xuan’s actions had caused the Andra clan to be dissatisfied, which was their biggest mistake. Nonetheless, Feng Xuan showed no remorse at all.","If it wasn’t for the fact that Feng Qing had some feelings for Feng Xuan and that Feng Xuan was related to the pureblood Bloodian named Black Elise, Feng Qing would have certainly not spared his life.","Fan Lou could not be bothered to continue engaging in conversation with Feng Xuan. He shot a look at the few guards next to Feng Qing and directly dragged Feng Xuan, who was vomiting blood on the ground, away.","Although Fan Lou had already cut off all ties with the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves, he would still continue acting in front of Feng Qing.","Fan Lou knelt on the ground and said sincerely, “Lord Feng Qing, please investigate! I never had the chance to talk to Feng Xuan at the banquet at all. Feng Xuan has always seemed to harbor some resentment toward me. I’m also afraid that some of my actions might provoke Feng Xuan to do something even more extreme.”","Fan Lou’s words did not provide much defense for himself; he simply stated the truth about what happened at the time. If he had spoken such words when Feng Qing was in his state of rage, it would be no different from adding fuel to the fire. However, Feng Qing had already passed the most emotional moment. Feng Qing would be more receptive to what he said.","Even if Feng Qing took his anger out on him, Feng Qing would still have to rely on him to contact the four major species of the Lonely River. This was the trump card that Lin Yuan had given him, and Fan Lou would make good use of it.","Feng Qing had indeed realized that he had treated Fan Lou inappropriately just now. There was no reason for him to vent his anger on Fan Lou. As Feng Xuan increasingly distanced himself from Feng Qing, Feng Qing started to rely on Fan Lou more and more.","Facing Feng Qing’s support, Fan Lou put on an expression that indicated he was touched and fearful at the same time.","Nonetheless, Fan Lou did not continue putting on much of an act and waited for Feng Qing’s next move. Fan Lou knew that Feng Qing was preparing to appease him. He wanted to take this opportunity to gain more benefits from Feng Qing.","“You’re not at fault in this matter. I’ve wronged you. The injury on your shoulder didn’t hurt your roots. I’ll arrange for the Creator to personally treat you. There won’t be any hidden dangers.","“The wolf guards that Feng Xuan used to manage will be handed over to you to lead from now on! I know that Feng Xuan has always been defiant and caused you trouble. After that pureblood Bloodian from the Elise clan leaves, I’ll hand Feng Xuan over to you to deal with! Do you think my arrangement is to your liking?”","At this moment, Fan Lou could feel Feng Qing’s high regard for him and his ruthlessness. No matter what, Feng Xuan had been by Feng Qing’s side for hundreds of years. In these hundreds of years, even if Feng Xuan did not contribute, he certainly had worked hard. It was true that Feng Xuan had done something wrong, but he hadn’t caused any harm to the interests of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves.","The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had only received a warning from the Andra clan. If Fan Lou were to look at Feng Xuan from an omniscient point of view, he would only think that Feng Xuan was impetuous and would not think that there was anything wrong with him.","Reckless people indeed needed to be punished. It was understandable that Feng Qing removed Feng Xuan’s identity as the manager of the wolf guards. However, Feng Qing actually wanted him to deal with Feng Xuan. In essence, this was a tacit agreement that he could do whatever he wanted to Feng Xuan.","Even if Feng Xuan’s roots were injured now, he probably wouldn’t want to end up like this.","“Lord Feng Qing, Feng Xuan has been following you for such a long time. Even if Feng Xuan keeps targeting me, I won’t do anything to him. It’s uncertain what impact this matter will have in the end. I’ll just leave it to you to make the judgment regarding Feng Xuan.","“If Feng Xuan’s recklessness leads to a positive outcome and he really establishes a relationship with the clan with the queen’s bloodline, Feng Xuan can still be of value to you, Lord!”","At first, Fan Lou felt some pity for Feng Xuan. However, with Fan Lou’s current mentality, he no longer derived any pleasure from him. Not to mention Feng Xuan, even Feng Qing seemed insignificant after he followed Lin Yuan!","Furthermore, before Fan Lou left Feng Qing, he had to maintain his image in front of Feng Qing. He could not let Feng Qing perceive him as becoming arrogant after receiving recognition. If Feng Qing had such thoughts, Feng Qing would have reservations about him, and this would have been inconvenient for him to work for Lin Yuan by Feng Qing’s side.","Feng Qing was quite satisfied with Fan Lou’s performance. If Fan Lou and Feng Xuan’s positions were reversed today, Feng Xuan would definitely want to eliminate Fan Lou. The latter didn’t become disrespectful because of the favor he received, and this was a huge plus in Feng Qing’s heart.","Feng Qing was indeed relying on Fan Lou, but he did have any necessity to put Fan Lou in an important position. In Feng Qing’s heart, Fan Lou would always remain a servant. Even without Fan Lou, Feng Qing would choose to let anyone who could bring him luck stay by his side.","“In that case, look for Master Feng Xu first. I’ll inform him to let him heal you. After meeting Master Feng Xu, go and take over the wolf guards. Then, take 15 drops of Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ second-grade blood essence from the warehouse managed by the wolf guards. This second-grade blood essence can help your bloodline evolve further!”","Fan Lou thanked him profusely, but he was very disdainful in his heart. The Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ blood essence, which he had previously regarded as a treasure, was no longer important in Fan Lou’s eyes.","Fan Lou would most likely obtain the Bloodian bloodline next. Absorbing the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ blood essence would only increase the difficulty of transitioning to pureblood Bloodians.","However, 15 drops of Chaos Wind Demon Wolves’ second-grade blood essence were also useful to Fan Lou. If the blood essence were sold, it could be sold for a good price. Fan Lou would definitely not sell the blood essence of the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves now. He would wait until he had separated himself from them before dealing with the blood essence.","After Fan Lou left, Feng Qing remained silent for a while. In the end, he decided to meet the Elders of the Andra clan and try to resolve the misunderstanding with them. However, they would have to pay the Andra clan a large amount of resources.","Over the years, the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves had intentionally cultivated a few dependent species like the Light Wind Wolves. Nurturing dependent species caused them to spend a large amount of resources, making it challenging for them to sustain themselves. It was truly difficult to survive under the hands of the Bloodians.","Greed was ingrained in his bones, but he was left with no choice.","If the Chaos Wind Demon Wolves could establish a good relationship with the Lonely River’s Four Species Overlords, they would not be as inferior as before when the Bloodians needed the help of the Dark Pufferfish to deal with the mermaids.","...","Lin Yuan had already walked out of the Andra clan’s Hidden Book Pavilion. Apart from recording the Scarlet Territory’s situation for the past 10,000 years, the Bloodians also had a large number of knowledge-related books in the Hidden Book Pavilion, leaving Lin Yuan with substantial gains.","When Lin Yuan returned to Sky City, this knowledge would be passed on to the core members of Sky City at the same time, allowing them to evolve.","Next, it was time for Lin Yuan to make a deal with the Andra clan!"]},{"number":2897,"title":"Chapter 2897 New Battle Fortress!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2897 New Battle Fortress!","The Andra clan’s leader, Yi Xue, had been waiting for Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan spent nearly four days in the Hidden Book Pavilion. There were less than two days left before he would leave for the Elisa clan’s territory.","Yi Xue had wanted Andre to look for Lin Yuan more than once. If Lin Yuan stayed in the Hidden Book Pavilion for too long and delayed his journey, the Andra clan would not be able to wait for Lin Yuan and break their promise to the other Bloodian clans and Lonely River’s four major species. On the other hand, it was not appropriate to leave Lin Yuan there without care. In short, the Andra clan was in a difficult position!","As the leader of the Andra Clan, Yi Xue rarely hesitated like this. From the bottom of his heart, Yi Xue hoped to be on good terms with the Elise clan. It was a good thing for the Andra clan to be on good terms with a powerful Bloodian clan with a large amount of resources. It would be great if the Andra clan could seize an opportunity to obtain a lotus imprint from the Elise clan during their interaction.","This young Bloodian named Elise Black was the perfect candidate for a marriage alliance!","If Lin Yuan had not revealed his overwhelming strength, the Andra clan would have been prepared to attack him. They would most likely imprison Lin Yuan and use a method of reproduction to extract the essence of Elise’s bloodline from him.","Fortunately, Lin Yuan left the Hidden Book Pavilion as scheduled. Yi Xue brought Andre to find Lin Yuan personally.","Yi Xue told Lin Yuan with a bright smile, “Your Grace Black, I heard that you want to obtain some blood-type spiritual ingredients. Our Andra clan has abundant blood-type spiritual ingredients. As long as you’re willing, we can trade at any time!","“You have some blood-type spiritual ingredients in your hands. When absorbing the blood tide, use these ingredients as support to increase the effect of absorbing the blood tide!”","Upon hearing this, the corners of Lin Yuan’s mouth curled up slightly. He had not revealed the information to Andre. The fact that Yi Xue, the Andra clan’s leader, had taken the initiative to use blood-type spiritual ingredients to trade with him saved him the trouble of specifying what he wanted.","“I really need blood-type spiritual ingredients. They are a necessity for us Bloodians. However, blood-type spiritual ingredients are everywhere in the Scarlet Territory. I don’t want to be taken advantage of by trading with the Creator resources. If the Andra clan is sincere, I’m very willing to make a deal. However, if the Andra clan only wants to take advantage of me, it’s better not to talk about the deal. I don’t want to ruin our friendship.","“There are so many Bloodian clans in the Scarlet Territory. It should be very easy for me to exchange Creator resources for blood-type spiritual ingredients. I wonder if Leader Yi Xue agrees with me?”","Lin Yuan’s words placed him in an extremely high position, adopting a somewhat condescending attitude toward the Andra clan. His high and mighty behavior made Yi Xue very dissatisfied, but there was nothing he could do. Lin Yuan’s side was much stronger than the Andra clan. Previously, they had attempted to scheme against him, but now the Andra clan was afraid that they would fall into Lin Yuan’s trap.","The resources allocated by the Creators in the Scarlet Territory, such as pure spirit qi and elemental energy, were indeed much more expensive than blood-type spiritual ingredients. Even though the Bloodians in the Scarlet Territory had powerful Creators, they still lacked Creator resources.","“Of course. Our Andra clan will definitely not take advantage of the other party if we cooperate with them. In the future, you’ll know how sincere our Andra clan is when you deal with the other clans!”","Upon hearing that, Lin Yuan did not personally head to the Andra clan’s treasure vault. Instead, he asked Jin Chen to trade with the Andra clan.","Lin Yuan had always felt that it was necessary for him to resume communication with Sky City, even though there were people he trusted, like Wen Yu and Liu Jie in Sky City. However, Lin Yuan had lost control of Sky City.","Even if he left Summer and Autumn in Sky City, who could greatly ensure its safety, Lin Yuan still felt somewhat uneasy. He had never let go of Sky City. Previously, he made all the decisions without exception.","The Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower had been accumulated by Lin Yuan with a large amount of resources. At present, it was finally producing child ramets. Once the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower produced a child ramet, the ortet would be able to connect with the child ramet from an extremely long distance.","Then, Lin Yuan could send the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower’s ortet back by sacrificing the Ethereal Jellyfish’s tentacles. Although this would cost Lin Yuan a lot, it would allow him to maintain contact with Sky City.","Sky City must have encountered some problems during his absence.","...","Just as Lin Yuan had expected, there were indeed some problems in Sky City. There were many problems that even the Moon Empress could not make a decision on.","When Lin Yuan left, Sky City was in need of rapid development. Many decisions could not be changed once the Moon Empress made them. At that moment, the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons did not attack Sky City.","Keira, who led the demon insects, treated them as guardians of the faith country and had created a large number of them. These demon insects were constantly expanding outwards. To put it bluntly, their expansion served as a method of exploration in Sky City. They were expanding at an extremely fast speed without any sense of boundaries.","In the southwest of the King Blood Jackals’ territory, the demon insects discovered a powerful species. They were all huge lifeforms that were more than 100,000 meters long. Even the Bug-Consuming Thearch Emperor Lizards that Lin Yuan had nurtured as moving fortresses were inferior to them.","A body length of more than 100,000 meters was only a very basic state. Some powerful lifeforms in this species could easily grow to more than 400,000 meters.","In terms of size, they could not compare to the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtles. As long as there was marsh soil, the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtles could grow indefinitely because of their innate talent.","However, there was a limit to the existence of marsh soil in the marsh world. However, the number of marsh soil in the Sky Beyond the Clouds became even larger, allowing the Land-Lifting Marsh Turtles’ bodies to continue growing.","However, in terms of strategic significance, this species’ strategic significance was stronger. This was due to their ability to reproduce continuously and maintain a certain population size.","If he could subdue them, he could use this species as Sky City’s war fortress in the future.","After this species discovered the demon insects, they used their earth-type ability to manipulate the earth and killed all the demon insects. They did not take the demon insects seriously at all and did not bother to investigate their origins.","However, after expelling the demon insects, many lifeforms of the species marked the surroundings of their territory. This marking method was the same as the marking method of many large lifeforms. They used excrement. The smell of this excrement would spread extremely far, and it was extremely intimidating to all kinds of lifeforms.","If not for the fact that Lin Yuan was behind the demon insects that Keira controlled, she would most likely have been shocked by the strong body odor.","When the Moon Empress, Wen Yu, and the others received Keira’s message, they understood the significance of this species. They were not aggressive, so there was no need to worry that they would invade the area under Sky City’s jurisdiction. However, if they could subdue them, it would be of great help to Sky City!","The reason the Moon Empress and the others were conflicted about whether to attack this species was firstly because they were not sure when the Crimson Heaven Falcons and the Spinning Wings White Falcons would choose to attack Sky City.","Sky City’s territory was vast, and the faith country had already been established. It was already difficult for Summer and Autumn to protect the huge Sky City. If they wanted to subdue this species, they would have to send out Sky City’s experts, which would greatly affect Sky City’s defense!","If the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons were secretly observing the situation in the King Blood Jackals’ territory, they would definitely take advantage of this opportunity to attack Sky City! If such a problem occurred, neither the Moon Empress nor Wen Yu could bear the responsibility.","Furthermore, it was impossible to control a species relying on brute force alone. After intimidating the species with brute force, they would definitely need to use other methods to capture their heart. Lin Yuan had always been the one doing this. The Moon Empress, Wen Yu, and the other core members of Sky City could not come up with anything that could move them.","They were all waiting for Lin Yuan’s return. Without Lin Yuan, they seemed to have lost their backbone. However, Lin Yuan had yet to send back any news. Everyone believed that Lin Yuan’s safety would be ensured. However, believing that Lin Yuan was fine and hearing that he was fine were two completely different things.","Just as everyone was worried about Lin Yuan’s situation, the white-clothed followers, who had been guarding the transportation created by the Ethereal Jellyfish, handed a palm-sized special plant-type fey to Liu Jie.","Initially, he knew that people could be teleported through this transportation, but he did not expect that even feys that did not have the ability to move on their own could do so.","After Liu Jie obtained the young Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, he was finally able to communicate with Lin Yuan.","The Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower could be used by Fortune Treasure Palace to contact special honor guests. Its communication ability was extremely powerful, and it could perfectly satisfy the communication needs.","Unfortunately, there was only one young Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, but it was enough to facilitate Lin Yuan’s connection with Sky City. The Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower could only transmit words, not sounds. Even so, Liu Jie was still excited for a long time, and he finally received news about Lin Yuan again.","Liu Jie easily understood how to use the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower as he sent a message to Lin Yuan to inform him that the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower had been teleported to Sky City. He hurriedly took the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower to look for the Moon Empress.","Now was not the time for him to reminisce with Lin Yuan. The Moon Empress had been worried about Lin Yuan’s situation, so Liu Jie wanted to let all the members of Sky City know that Lin Yuan was safe. Then, he would let the Moon Empress and Wen Yu communicate with Lin Yuan to determine how to implement some of Sky City’s plans.","After losing contact with Sky City for so long, Lin Yuan was very happy to receive Liu Jie’s message. He did not personally trade with the Andra clan because he wanted to use this time to communicate with his partners in Sky City.","Ever since Lin Yuan left, the Moon Empress had basically spent the entire day in the meeting hall dealing with various matters. She did not even have much time to concoct spirit fluids.","Core members of Sky City, like Liu Jie, Wen Yu, and Su Yiren, could freely enter and exit the meeting hall.","As soon as Liu Jie entered the meeting hall, he saw the Moon Empress flipping through the Thoughts Letter Paper with a tired expression. It was likely that Su Yiren and Luo Lan had encountered another problem when they were managing the faith country and needed the Moon Empress to make a decision.","For an expert, the stronger they were, the better their spirits would be. However, the Moon Empress’s current vitality was inferior to when she was in the main world.","After Lin Yuan left, every core member of Sky City felt the pressure, but in fact, the Moon Empress was the one bearing the most pressure in Sky City. Mystic Moon and Cold Moon’s conditions were similar to the Moon Empress’. They basically did not have any time to rest.","Liu Jie hurriedly raised the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower ramet in his hand and said to the Moon Empress, “Moon Empress, this is a communication fey that Lin Yuan sent back through the Ethereal Jellyfish. You can communicate with Lin Yuan through this communication fey!”","The Moon Empress, who had always been poised and calm, stood up from her seat when she heard Liu Jie’s words.","The Moon Empress had constantly been worrying about Lin Yuan’s safety. For example, Liu Jie, Wen Yu, and the rest worshiped Lin Yuan in their hearts, as if they had deified him and had complete trust in him. They believed that Lin Yuan would not encounter any safety problems.","The Moon Empress understood the laws of survival of the Sky Beyond the Clouds the moment she arrived. Under the laws of survival, where the strong preyed on the weak, the Sky Beyond the Clouds was much more dangerous than the main world.","Lin Yuan had just left the main world for the Sky Beyond the Clouds. No matter how many trump cards he had, it was very likely that he would be schemed against by an expert or species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds.","In Lin Yuan’s previous life, when a child had just reached adulthood and traveled far away to study, their parents would be worried and often think about their child. Some parents would only be at ease if they maintained a phone call once a day.","Lin Yuan seemed to have been training outside the main world, but apart from the battle with Tower Canon in the five dimensional worlds, he had always been under the Moon Empress’ care. While Lin Yuan embarked on this journey with confidence, it was a dangerous journey filled with too many dangers and uncertainties for the Moon Empress.","Now that Lin Yuan had finally sent back news, the Moon Empress knew that Lin Yuan was safe. She calmed herself down and did not ask Lin Yuan when he would be back. Her question would definitely make Lin Yuan worry about the situation in Sky City, and the Moon Empress did not want Lin Yuan to be worried when he was outside.","“Little Yuan, the situation is the same as before, with only a few minor incidents occurring. Sky City and the faith country are still operating well. Don’t worry!”"]},{"number":2898,"title":"Chapter 2898 Blood Love Wakes Up!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2898 Blood Love Wakes Up!","The Moon Empress paused before she continued. “Little Yuan, although there have been no issues with Sky City or the faith country, you still need to make decisions on some matters.”","Lin Yuan relaxed. The Moon Empress was sufficient to manage Sky City.","Wen Yu, Su Yiren, and the rest could ask her for advice if they encountered any issues.","The Moon Empress said she needed to ask him something. This meant that it was an issue on which she could not decide.","Lin Yuan was in no rush to ask the Moon Empress about the matter she needed his opinion on. Instead, he greeted her, “Master, how have you been? I found a fey that is very suited for you. All you need to do is contract and nurture this fey, and your entire combat system, as well as the way you wield your feys, will undergo an enormous positive transformation!”","The Moon Empress looked surprised. She was acutely aware of her feys, and she could not imagine the kind of fey that would enable her entire system to improve!","The Moon Empress did not think of Lin Yuan as a braggart.","“Little Yuan, everything has been well. Make sure to take care of your safety and never put yourself at risk!”","The Moon Empress cared more about Lin Yuan’s safety than the fey Lin Yuan mentioned.","Lin Yuan felt a wave of warm fuzziness wash over him when he heard the Moon Empress’ reminder.","Lin Yuan and the Moon Empress chatted idly for a while. She knew that he had many things on his plate. Otherwise, he would have returned long ago!","Lin Yuan was a very responsible person and would never toss aside an establishment as large as Sky City.","“Little Yuan, after you left, the Spinning Wings White Falcon’s envoy group went to the King Blood Jackals’ territory. They were far from pleasant and tested the King Blood Jackals’ limits constantly. You took the King Blood Jackal Queen away, and the two female King Blood Jackals who were left behind in her stead were unable to tackle the Spinning Wings White Falcon envoy group.","“I sent Autumn to investigate the Spinning Wings White Falcons’ situation and eliminated all but one of them. The Spinning Wings White Falcons should be trying to talk to the King Blood Jackals about this, but they haven’t done so. As the Crimson Heaven Falcons’ dependent species, the Spinning Wings White Falcons have their full backing!","“I can’t shake the feeling that the Spinning Wings White Falcons have something else up their sleeves and that the Crimson Heaven Falcons are involved as well. We have to be prepared! These two species will eventually become a headache for Sky City!”","Lin Yuan nodded in agreement. He found what the Moon Empress said to be right.","The Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons had always been next to the King Blood Jackals’ territory. The Spinning Wings White Falcons, in particular, bordered the King Blood Jackals’ territory.","Even if the Spinning Wings White Falcons did not cause trouble for Sky City, the latter would need to go past the Spinning Wings White Falcons to expand!","This was the only way that Sky City would be able to obtain a large amount of resources.","Lin Yuan could obtain high-quality resources from elsewhere, but he needed to nurture basic necessities in the Lonely River.","The faith country had only just begun to grow and could not afford any losses or damage.","The faith country would be able to grow rapidly once the King Blood Jackals and Crimson Heaven Falcons’ territories were conquered.","In order to obtain faith power, not only did the faith country need to expand, but its citizens’ supply of faith needed to increase as well.","The best way to increase the production of faith power was to raise the citizens’ happiness.","Lin Yuan had nurtured a large amount of the Soldier Ration Radishes in the Spirit Lock spatial zone and given them to the Moon Empress.","She found an area within the King Blood Jackals’ territory with a suitable environment and filled it with a large amount of marsh soil before planting the Soldier Ration Radishes in the fertile soil.","The concentration of spirit qi was much higher in the Sky Beyond the Clouds than in the main world. Although the Soldier Ration Radishes would not grow as quickly in the Sky Beyond the Clouds as they did in the Spirit Lock spatial zone, they would still spread out up to six to seven meters every second, and their vines would grow by more than 200 meters daily.","A Soldier Ration Radish had six to seven vines. These Soldier Ration Radishes were sufficient to feed the faith country and were considered the foundation of the faith country. There was no way that the faith country would be able to develop successfully without the Soldier Ration Radishes.","Keeping the citizens fed was only part of basic survival. It did not do much to help raise the happiness of the citizens.","When Lin Yuan first went to the Divine Wood Federation, he saw the Item-Storing Walnuts as a business opportunity. The Divine Wood Federation did manage to amass enormous wealth by selling low-grade and high-quality Item-Storing Walnuts. Eventually, the Item-Storing Walnuts became the resource that Lin Yuan used to travel through the Space Tunnel. But in truth, the Item-Storing Walnut’s real value lay in its item-storing ability.","The Item-Storing Walnut Tree had a high production yield in the main world, and the same went for the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","Lin Yuan intended to provide every family in the faith country with an Item-Storing Walnut. This would enable them to increase their income and obtain even more Soldier Ration Radishes.","Listen had promised Lin Yuan that he would open the Listening Heron Chamber of Commerce in the faith country within three years to enable goods to flow freely within the faith country!","Ever since he established the faith country, Lin Yuan had more than just Sky City under his belt.","Lin Yuan could provide all the resources needed to maintain a faction with tens of main members and a total membership of fewer than 5,000 people.","However, the faith country had a mammoth population of more than 100 billion. Lin Yuan could not be the sole provider of resources. The faith country needed to be self-sufficient!","Once the happiness and safety within the faith country reached a certain level, Lin Yuan would pick a few talented people to become the faith country’s protectors.","With these plans and arrangements, both the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons would have to be eliminated!","After his trip, Lin Yuan learned that despite the Sky Beyond the Clouds’ vastness, even the smallest of areas with an abundance of resources would house multiple species. The species would fight and plunder for the sake of the resources.","Lin Yuan was glad that he had arrived at North of the Lonely River first. Although North of the Lonely River lacked resources, it was a large incubator from which Lin Yuan would be able to obtain faith!","“Master, Autumn and Spring are extremely strong. If the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons really try anything, the two of them will definitely protect Sky City. You don’t have to worry! I am already aware of the Crimson Heaven Falcons.","“I haven’t sent Spring and Autumn after the Crimson Heaven Falcons because I want to learn their motives and because it won’t do the faith country any good to experience disruption so soon after its establishment.”","The Moon Empress relaxed upon hearing Lin Yuan’s words—they indicated his decision. Now, she knew what orders to give if problems truly arose.","“Little Yuan, Little Yu, and Yiren have much to report to you. I won’t take up too much of your time. Let’s keep it brief. There’s something else you need to know. There is a powerful species southwest of the King Blood Jackals’ territory. These lifeforms have large bodies, much larger than the three Bug-Consuming Thearch Emperor Lizards you gave me!","“Keira discovered them while scouting the environment and attempting to expand the demon insects. This species is very territorial. They refused to leave even when invaded by the demon insects. They stood their ground and attacked the demon insects to drive them out of their territory. I think this species will be very helpful for Sky City’s development!”","Lin Yuan had been trying to devise a way to bolster the faith country’s defensive power. There weren’t many other lifeforms north of the Lonely River. However, Lin Yuan couldn’t be certain that news of the faith country would never leak.","Once news of the faith country leaked, many factions would zero in on this tantalizing opportunity!","The powerful species in the Sky Beyond the Clouds would all desire to obtain the faith country’s power.","In any case, the highly tempting faith country needed to be armed!","Lin Yuan surmised what the Moon Empress was worrying about. She had not attacked this species because she was concerned that using Sky City’s forces would allow the Crimson Heaven and Spinning Wings White Falcons to take advantage of the situation.","Additionally, using force to take control of these species, where every member could be used as a moving fortress, would not gain their loyalty.","Moving this species into the King Blood Jackals’ territory would be difficult to manage.","But if they continued living in their original territory, the Moon Empress worried they would flee and abandon them once the faith country expanded!","“Master, I will return to Sky City within a year. At that time, I will personally lead a group to make contact with that species.”","The Moon Empress said with a smile, “Now that I’ve informed you of both matters and you’ve come to a decision on both, there’s nothing else I need to worry about!”","A weight lifted off the Moon Empress’ shoulders, and she spoke lightheartedly.","Lin Yuan also smiled brightly upon hearing her happy voice.","Spring and Winter had not seen Lin Yuan reveal his row of pearly teeth in a while.","Kani was slightly startled to see Lin Yuan smiling. In his Bloodian form, his features were even more chiseled, and his aura of eliteness magnified significantly! With such an aura and features, his smile was harmonious and suited him very well.","If Lin Yuan had not been without the Bloodian bloodline when she first encountered him, she would have assumed that he came from an ancient elite Bloodian clan.","It was said that when a Bloodian transformed into a queen, even a male would change gender to female.","What would Master look like as a Bloodian queen?","With this thought, Kani scolded herself and resumed her usual expression.","Lin Yuan knew that after he left, the Moon Empress would rack her brains to protect and supervise Sky City.","“Master, you don’t have to handle the trivial matters yourself. Let Wen Yu and Liu Jie handle them. You should rest! I should be reaching the divine kingdom level soon. Once I return, I’ll help you increase your power!”","Lin Yuan had helped the Moon Empress increase her power in the past. It was no longer a secret to Sky City’s key members that he could help others increase their powers.","Currently, the Moon Empress was the only one who had the authority to manage Sky City in his stead!","When Lin Yuan thought of helping others increase their powers, the Moon Empress was naturally the first person to come to his mind.","When Lin Yuan traded resources in Fortune Treasure Palace, he had basically emptied the place.","With the support from these resources, he was confident that he would be able to help the Moon Empress become a Holy Spirit Realm expert.","The Moon Empress and Lin Yuan did not chat for long, and she forced herself to put aside her concern for him. After all, she had already given him the advice she needed to as his Master. It would be better not to take up too much of his time.","When Liu Jie received news through the communication fey, Wen Yu and Su Yiren received it as well. The two of them were going mad with impatience!","Aside from Kani, Spring, and Winter, Blood Love, who was Lin Yuan’s Path Protector, had left Sky City with him.","However, due to her bloodline, Blood Love fell into a deep sleep not long after they left and had been lying in a mimicked state in Lin Yuan’s hair all this time.","Blood Love did not even wake up during the storm in Treasure City.","Now that they were at the Scarlet Territory and she was being nourished by the concentrated blood energy, Blood Love moved her two forelegs.","Lin Yuan sensed this. Just as he was about to check on her, he heard Blood Love’s unique and pleasant voice, “Lin Yuan, the Moon Empress hasn’t changed at all. She still cares for you as much as ever!”","Blood Love did not know about Lin Yuan’s background at first. She only found out from Chu Ci that their parents had died while guarding the Xia Region when Lin Yuan was only eight or nine years old. From that young age, Lin Yuan began supporting himself and his sister. This was very similar to Blood Love’s experiences.","Blood Love eventually found her parents and learned what it was like to be loved by parents.","The Moon Empress’ presence was akin to a replacement for his parents.","There were some real parents who did not treat their children as well as the Moon Empress treated Lin Yuan, much less teachers!","Lin Yuan smiled but did not respond to what Blood Love said. Instead, he said, “Blood Love, you woke up at just the right time. Your opportunity is here! When we get to the blood pool, you should do your best to absorb the blood energy within the blood pool. Your bloodline should be able to improve.”","Blood Love was very stubborn. Despite being a heavenly family fey, she never once thought of giving up her original bloodline and had allowed her original bloodline to coexist with her Sky Sundial Jade Spider bloodline!"]},{"number":2899,"title":"Chapter 2899 Blood Love’s Plan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2899 Blood Love’s Plan!","Heavenly Family Feys’ bloodlines were much stronger than those of regular feys. This was an undeniable fact.","It would be fine if both bloodlines in her body were of the same level. If one of the bloodlines became significantly stronger than the other, Blood Love’s future development would be greatly impacted!","Blood Love had her own thoughts, and Lin Yuan would not force her to do things his way. Instead, he would find the most suitable way to help her.","After hearing what Lin Yuan said and understanding what the blood pool was, Blood Love’s icy gaze softened.","She was only able to grow into the person she was now because of her reliance on Lin Yuan and her other comrades. Without Lin Yuan, she would never have been able to reach her current stage!","Before Blood Love could speak, Lin Yuan continued. “This time, try to enable your original bloodline to overcome the Sky Sundial Jade Spider bloodline. This will make it easier for you to evolve the Sky Sundial Jade Spider bloodline in the future!","“After these two bloodlines coexist for some time, they will probably merge once you reach the Holy Spirit λεωελ. Once they merge, your bloodline will surpass your original condition”","Blood Love knew that her choice would come at a huge cost of resources. But Lin Yuan never failed to help her unconditionally.","“Lin Yuan, I will do my best. If my two bloodlines merge, the effects of the exclusive skills will increase greatly.”","Blood Love paused before continuing, “Lin Yuan, do you remember the Day Forging Furnace in my divine kingdom? Now that I’m awake, I can create precious instruments anytime. If you have a set of spiritual ingredients prepared, you can hand them over to me! It’ll also give me the chance to test how fast the Day Forging Furnace produces precious instruments!”","Despite being Lin Yuan’s protector, Blood Love was not only unable to protect him but was the one being protected instead. Blood Love felt slightly ashamed by this.","Blood Love badly wanted to prove her worth, and the Day Forging Furnace gave her the opportunity to do so.","Regardless of how strong a Creator was, they produced spiritual instruments using their flesh and body. This did not apply to Blood Love. She used celestial power to temper the spiritual ingredients she absorbed into her body, thereby turning them into precious instruments.","When celestial bodies were used to forge precious instruments, the homogeneity of the spiritual ingredients would be significantly increased. This ensured that the precious instrument produced would be of an extremely high level.","Lin Yuan did not hold back from Blood Love and handed over seven to eight sets of spiritual ingredients. They included many precious items he had traded from Fortune Treasure Palace. Lin Yuan estimated that the precious instruments would be 10 stars at worst!","These precious instruments would be created for Sky City’s key members. Once he found more suitable materials, Lin Yuan would prepare precious instruments for the white-clothed followers as well.","Blood Love stored away the spiritual ingredients Lin Yuan gave her. A thought struck her, and she asked, “Lin Yuan, has your sacred source lifeform awakened since absorbing those two things?”","This was the first time Blood Love was hearing of a sacred source lifeform that could sleep for decades.","This was because Lin Yuan had a very long lifespan. Regular people or experts’ lives would come to an end before they saw their sacred source lifeform wake up.","Lin Yuan smiled and said, “My sacred source lifeform hasn’t woken up yet. But there are signs that it will be waking up soon. I’m sure it will bring me a huge surprise once it does wake up!”","Lin Yuan had fed the two rulers’ sacred source lifeforms to the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen.","The Sacred Sword Wielding Queen was the two rulers’ offspring, and they shared the same source. As such, it could absorb the two rulers’ sacred source lifeforms.","Lin Yuan had not expected the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen to sleep for so many years, but he believed that accumulation would lead to a sudden burst of power!","It was possible that the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen would break through past 12 stars once it woke up!","Lin Yuan had relied greatly on the Sacred Sword Wielding Queen in his journey thus far. It would definitely become an enormous help to Lin Yuan once it woke up.","The Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flowers had already been delivered to Liu Jie and Wen Yu, who were two of Sky City’s three kingpins.","If the Moon Empress had not come to the Sky Beyond the Clouds, Wen Yu would have been the one to manage Sky City in Lin Yuan’s absence.","Wen Yu was very influential in Sky City.","Firstly, Liu Jie trusted Wen Yu implicitly. Among the two of them, Wen Yu had always been the one to issue orders while Liu Jie executed them.","Wen Yu was the actual starter of the Astronomical Parliament. Su Yiren, Luo Lan, Bei Xu, and the rest were all linked to her.","Ever since Wen Yu became Mystic Moon’s disciple, she had improved considerably. After she had grown, the Moon Empress did not hold back from guiding her as well.","But this did not mean that Wen Yu could single-handedly manage the faith country that was as large as all the federations of the main world combined.","The faith country was still expanding continuously. It had only held together because the Moon Empress was there to oversee the entire operation.","But even with the Moon Empress’ supervision, there were still many things for Wen Yu to attend to daily.","Firstly, every member of Sky City needed to report their issues and business to Wen Yu first. Wen Yu was in charge of organizing the information before delivering it to the Moon Empress, who would make the final decisions.","Additionally, Wen Yu supported Su Yiren and Luo Lan in the management of the faith country.","Without Wen Yu’s help, Su Yiren and Luo Lan would never be able to hold down the fort regardless of how strong they were!","Listen also needed to communicate with Wen Yu, and she helped him to allocate resources.","In spite of the incredible pressure and all the work she needed to do, Wen Yu managed to shoulder it all. The growth she achieved was obvious.","Wen Yu was neither afraid of exertion nor difficulty. She was only afraid of being left behind by Liu Jie and Lin Yuan.","Ever since Liu Jie gained an endless supply of the Firefly Demon Fetuses, his strategic significance rose again.","In the past, it was Wen Yu who was a source of pressure for Liu Jie. But now, it was the other way around.","The emotions and dynamics of Sky City’s founders could not be understood by anyone else.","“Young Master, I have sent someone to fetch Su Yiren, Luo Lan, and Listen. They have all exhausted themselves. Listen is relatively fine. Setting up a supply network within the faith country’s different districts isn’t difficult. The main world’s system can just be carried over. Su Yiren and Luo Lan have had a very tough time. Su Yiren is much more capable than Luo Lan, and she handles most of the management of the faith country.”","When reporting the situation to Lin Yuan, Wen Yu could not help but be taken aback when she thought about Su Yiren’s recent achievements.","Luo Lan had also improved significantly and had been doing her best to manage the faith country. However, her improvement was overshadowed by Su Yiren.","Liu Jie’s eyes flashed when he saw the message that Wen Yu sent to Lin Yuan.","Wen Yu had a harder time than Su Yiren, but she did not talk about her achievements at all. All she ever did was praise others.","Liu Jie knew this, and so did Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan intended to help the Moon Empress reach the Holy Spirit Realm first. But after her came Wen Yu, followed by Liu Jie.","Wen Yu had not contracted many feys. There was no need to continue strengthening the Earth Rush Golden Lotus and Sunlight Egret!","In the earlier days, Wen Yu did not have the opportunity to select outstanding feys. However, the Elemental Paper was enough to maximize Wen Yu’s strategic significance.","As Wen Yu’s power increased, the Elemental Paper would reach the Holy Spirit Realm as well.","Evolving the Elemental Paper would not only increase the speed of resource transfer in the faith country, but every piece of paper that flew around the faith country would help Wen Yu to watch over the faith country and gather information. Most importantly, as the Elemental Paper’s power rose, its range would also increase.","With the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower, there was no need for Lin Yuan to pursue the increase of the Elemental Paper’s range.","The Elemental Paper could ensure utmost secrecy and convenient communication. This was what set it apart from the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower.","The Elemental Paper’s range only needed to cover the areas that were under Sky City’s control.","Once Lin Yuan returned to Sky City, the territory would definitely expand. If the Elemental Paper was not improved, it would be impossible to take control of the Crimson Heaven Falcons, the feys that were akin to moving fortresses, and the Spinning Wings White Falcons!","By helping Wen Yu to increase her power before increasing the Stars of her sacred source lifeform as well as using the Star Vastness Peony to boost the Astronomical Parliament, it would definitely be successfully activated!","Wen Yu needed to make preparations in advance in order to activate the Astronomical Parliament.","“Wen Yu, there should be a large amount of spiritual ingredients in the treasure vault that can increase spiritual energy and soul power. Take these spiritual ingredients to Di Wanmi so she can turn them into potions for you. Use the potions to strengthen your spiritual energy and soul power as soon as possible. Increase the Astronomical Parliament’s Stars as well. Tell Di Wanmi and Yi Huailu to drop everything else and help you instead. Don’t worry about the resources. When I return, I intend to activate the Astronomical Parliament again!”","Lin Yuan paused before he continued, “I know that it will be difficult for you to activate the Astronomical Parliament again even after your power is strengthened. Don’t be pressured. I have ways to help you. All you need to do is increase your own power!”","Wen Yu’s eyes lit up. She could not be happier to activate the Astronomical Parliament again.","In the main world, Wen Yu always believed that the Elemental Paper was not where her greatest value lay. Her greatest value lay in her sacred source lifeform, the Astronomical Parliament.","If the Astronomical Parliament was activated again, her strategic significance in Sky City would be raised.","More importantly, their establishment in the Sky Beyond the Clouds would expand as quickly as it had in the main world. With new members, they would gain a better understanding of the various situations in the Sky Beyond the Clouds!","If Lin Yuan did not tell her why he wanted her to use those resources, Wen Yu would definitely think that it was a waste for her to use such a large amount of spiritual-type and soul-type spiritual ingredients as well as occupy two Class 5 Creation Masters. But since he had told her the reason, there was no need for her to be concerned.","“Young Master, I will increase my sacred source lifeform’s Stars, as well as my spiritual energy and soul power as you said. According to your previous instructions, I placed transportation ports in every city. They are all linked to the evolution grounds at the center. Anyone in the faith country who wants to evolve will have to head to the evolution grounds. As the faith country expands, there will be more and more people evolving. I would like to ask Su Yiren and Luo Lan to expand the evolution grounds, as well as renovate it so it looks more imposing! Compared to the rest of us, the increase of your power is the most important for Sky City! I intend to erect a statue of you in the grounds. It’ll make it easier for you to obtain faith power from the faith country. I don’t think you will become very involved in the management of the faith country even after you return. At this rate, most of the faith power in the faith country will go to Su Yiren and Luo Lan.”","Wen Yu said this for Lin Yuan’s benefit and also because she felt that there was an issue with the current organization of faith.","Most of Sky City’s main members were doing their best in their own stations. Given Wen Yu’s circumstances, there was no need for her to be envious of Su Yiren and Luo Lan’s obtaining of faith power.","But as time went on, if such thoughts took root in someone’s mind and a fight ensued, it would be harmful for Sky City’s unity!","Lin Yuan rubbed his temples.","He always knew that he was Sky City’s main pillar and was the only provider of top resources.","Lin Yuan never underestimated his importance to Sky City. The best scenario for Sky City’s development would indeed be for him to obtain faith power.","However, he had never considered the repercussions of having Su Yiren and Luo Lan manage the faith country.","Luckily, Wen Yu had explained the circumstances to him. This needed to be corrected. Otherwise, it would lead to problems in the long run!","Alas, as of now, Lin Yuan did not have a suitable solution for this.","Ever since he took control of Kani, he had been nurturing her as one of Sky City’s key members. Additionally, she was under his control, so there was no need for him to hide anything about Sky City from her.","Kani offered Lin Yuan a suggestion, “Young Master, why don’t you use the Faith Tree to take control of every person? This way, you don’t have to be worried about issues arising from an unequal distribution of faith power! You can also organize the faith power through the Faith Tree!”","Kani’s words caused Lin Yuan to frown.","Her words mirrored the methods of the Four Species Overlords of the Lonely River. It was simple and highly effective but came with a giant problem. This method of using the Faith Tree would not solve the issue of the distribution of","faith power. Rather, it targeted those who might take issue with the distribution of faith power.","Lin Yuan saw this as focusing on the details and disregarding the root of the issue.","Lin Yuan saw all of Sky City’s key members as his companions. This course of action did not align with Sky City’s initial intention.","Spring was silent for a moment before she said, “Young Master, I might have a viable plan!”"]},{"number":2900,"title":"Chapter 2900 Listen’s Request!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2900 Listen’s Request!","“Long ago, the Faith Tree wasn’t like this. It’s the simplest manifestation of the Faith Creation Tree’s bloodline. If the Faith Creation Tree’s bloodline is awakened, the faith of all targets in the surroundings will be gathered even if it doesn’t evolve into a true Faith Creation Tree.","“It only needs to become a Ten Thousand Source Faith Tree. The gathered faith won’t be absorbed by the Ten Thousand Source Faith Tree. It can be extracted and used at will. It will be difficult for any other faction, even Fortune Treasure Palace, to use their resources to transform the Faith Tree into the Ten Thousand Source Faith Tree.","“But Young Master, you can do it if you want. If you absorb faith power through the Ten Thousand Source Faith Tree, the distribution of faith power won’t become skewed even if someone has more territory.”","Although Kani was stuck in North of the Lonely River to lead the King Blood Jackals, she did have experience and knowledge! Yet, she had never heard of the Faith Creation Tree and Ten Thousand Source Faith Tree.","Apparently, the Faith Tree was the simplest form of a lifeform’s bloodline. Yet, it was able to take control of a divine kingdom. This proved the fearsomeness of that bloodline!","Kani carefully took note of all the knowledge she learned while she was by Lin Yuan’s side. This knowledge would help her to grow.","Kani did not have many thoughts when she first joined Lin Yuan. But now, she fully understood the pressure that came with being by his side.","Kani always wanted to prove herself to Lin Yuan. Liu Chen, and Liu Yao. They were much stronger than her, and she was unable to stand out in comparison to them.","Kani was terrified that she would eventually be eliminated, and this anxiousness motivated her to grow as quickly as possible.","Lin Yuan had seen the Faith Tree on display on the ninth floor of Fortune Treasure Palace. Normally, something of the Faith Tree’s level did not deserve to be displayed there. In Fortune Treasure Palace, precious items were displayed from the fourth floor and up.","The Faith Tree had been displayed on the ninth floor of Fortune Treasure Palace because its bloodline was much stronger than that of other Faith Trees.","This Faith Tree was very suitable to be used to evolve one’s bloodline.","As compared to other Faith Trees, this Faith Tree stood a higher chance of transforming when given the same amount and quality of resources.","Lin Yuan would nurture this Faith Tree personally.","The information that Spring provided him solved an extremely important issue pertaining to Sky City’s development. It eliminated the tumor that might have formed in the future.","Winter added, “The Four Seasons Mountain is going to transform into a faerie soon. Once it transforms, it will be an intermediate faerie at the very least. The chances of it transforming into a higher faerie might be even higher than the chances of it transforming into an intermediate faerie!","“A natural-born higher faerie is able to transform into a faerie king. The transformed Faith Tree can be planted on Four Seasons Mountain. With Four Seasons Mountain nourishing the Faith Tree, not only will its bloodline transform, but its range of effects will increase as well.”","Winter was not at all worried that Lin Yuan would fail to activate the Faith Tree’s bloodline and enable it to transform into the Ten Thousand Source Faith Tree. He believed that there was nothing that Lin Yuan who possessed the Body of All Spirits could not do.","Wen Yu and Liu Jie were unaware of this conversation among Lin Yuan, Kani, Spring, and Winter.","When Wen Yu saw that Lin Yuan had yet to reply to her message, she was unsurprised because she knew that this matter was not easy to address. If it was, she and Liu Jie would have already handled it. There would have been no need to seek Lin Yuan’s help and bother him with this.","At this moment, Wen Yu turned to Liu Jie and asked, “Big Brother Liu, do you think we should wait until Young Master returns so we can tell him about this?”","Liu Jie shook his head resolutely and said, “Wen Yu, this is the biggest issue Sky City is currently facing. Although this matter will worry Lin Yuan, he absolutely needs to know! If it isn’t handled well it will become worse. Won’t that trouble him even more?","“The sooner he learns of the issue, the higher the chance of him circumventing unnecessary problems. Even if it isn’t resolved perfectly, he will at least be able to come up with mitigation strategies.”","Su Yiren and Luo Lan were the first ones to notice this issue. Upon discovering this, they did not cheer their good luck and wealth. Rather, they did their best to help the others to increase their strength.","Once one reached the Divine Kingdom level, faith power became even more important than spirit qi.","Given the speed at which the faith country was growing, Luo Lan and Su Yiren would be able to lap far ahead of the rest within a year if they did not bring this up to Wen Yu. Under Lin Yuan’s leadership, both Su Yiren and Luo Lan saw Sky City as their family.","Hence, when Su Yiren and Luo Lan encountered this matter, they did not focus on their own profits. Rather, they cared more about what the other members of Sky City would think of them once they found out.","It was because of this matter that Wen Yu and Liu Jie fully acknowledged Su Yiren and Luo Lan. It was not their abilities, but their character that Su Yiren and Liu Jie acknowledged.","Sky City had no lack of capable members. Even the members who were able to become part of Sky City’s reserve team were true talents. Apart from power, they had other outstanding capabilities as well.","But if their character was not assured, they could only be used as tools.","If Su Yiren and Luo Lan had not told Wen Yu about this matter, Wen Yu would not have waited until they arrived to tell Lin Yuan about this matter.","While Wen Yu was ruminating, Lin Yuan replied, “Wen Yu, I can handle this issue. You don’t need to worry. I will distribute the faith power equally so just let Su Yiren and Luo Lan know.”","Lin Yuan was not the type to push away responsibility, especially when he was part of an enormous faction.","This current situation was largely linked to Lin Yuan’s arrangement.","He told Wen Yu and Liu Jie to inform Su Yiren and Luo Lan before he returned because he was worried they would become accustomed to reaping such earnings and oppose his plans.","When Wen Yu saw Lin Yuan’s message, she hurriedly replied, “Young Master, I’m not the one who discovered this situation. Su Yiren and Luo Lan were the ones who told me. Since you have a way to solve it, they will also be able to set their worries at ease and continue developing the faith country. I have already sent word to them, and they should be arriving very soon!”","Once Wen Yu was done with this matter, there was nothing else she needed to report to Lin Yuan.","Lin Yuan was out traveling. There was no need to add to his burdens when she and the Moon Empress could make the decisions themselves!","Listen arrived at the meeting room sooner than Luo Lan and Su Yiren did. He had been seeking the chance to speak with Lin Yuan. Now, this chance was here!","It was very challenging for Su Yiren and Luo Lan to develop the faith country. But it was not easy for Listen to build the trade network from scratch either.","Listen was very glad that Gu Lang was willing to join the trading team that consisted of him and Endless Summer.","Su Yiren and Luo Lan’s work could not be rushed, but Listen’s job needed to be completed as quickly as possible. This was especially so now as it was the peak of Sky City’s developmental stage.","Listen realized that the speed at which he was building the trade network did not match the speed at which the faith country was growing.","On the surface, it seemed as though there was nothing happening to the faith country. But if one was in the faith country, one would see that there were conflicts and problems taking place every second.","Luckily, the demon insects managed the faith country strictly. Otherwise, it would have crumbled long ago!","Nonetheless, the conflicts significantly impacted Listen’s building of the trading system.","As such, Listen could not blame Luo Lan and Su Yiren—they did not have a solution either.","The people in the faith country came from different species, and their bloodlines gave them different traits and temperaments.","Many of them kept their fangs hidden at first. They only revealed them slowly as time went on. Hence, it required a lot of time to remove these issues, and what Listen lacked the most was time.","Listen was aware of faith power. He was now a Divine Kingdom expert and needed to complete the trading system as soon as possible in order to increase his divine kingdom’s production of faith power.","Wen Yu had reported everything she needed to report to Lin Yuan. When she saw that Listen was here, she gave him the chance to speak with Lin Yuan.","Listen did not like to beat around the bush, especially when he was speaking to Lin Yuan. If he did not have such a personality, he would never have been able to complete the Startling Lines Continent’s trading system in as short of a period of time as he had. He also would not have been able to turn Thick Soil City into the center of the Startling Lines Continent and enable all resources to pass through it. He had also managed to rebuild the main world’s entire trading system within five to six years.","“Young Master, the faith country is very stable now. The small issues won’t affect the faith country’s stability, but it is a significant problem for me. I hope that you will be able to instruct all the King Blood Jackals to listen to me and send me 3 billion demon insects I can control. This will increase my speed of development by at least 50%, and I’ll be able to finish three days worth of work in two days.”","Lin Yuan liked Listen’s personality. He was always direct with what he needed. Whenever his requests were met, he always brought back compensation and benefits. Lin Yuan liked this method of communication.","Lin Yuan did not respond to Listen immediately. Instead, he asked, “Wen Yu, are there any plans for the King Blood Jackals now?”","Before Lin Yuan left, he had not made any arrangements for the King Blood Jackals. But after all the time that had passed, the likelihood was high that Wen Yu and the Moon Empress had made arrangements for them.","If arrangements had been made for the King Blood Jackals, Lin Yuan could not redirect them just because of what Listen said. This would satisfy Listen’s request but would affect others.","When Lin Yuan posed a question to Wen Yu after speaking to Listen, she was silent for a moment before she said, “The King Blood Jackals are currently managing their own dependent species, which have almost all assimilated into the faith country and become a part of it.","“There aren’t any plans for them now. When building the faith country, equality must be ensured. This will prevent incidents from breaking out!","“I plan to assimilate the King Blood Jackals into the faith country as well. They are powerful and every member can become a leader of one of the districts. The demon insects are only able to maintain the safety of the faith country. They can’t manage the faith country!”","Lin Yuan turned to look at Kani when he saw Wen Yu’s message.","There was nothing special about the King Blood Jackals. As the faith country grew, it would take in more species that were even more powerful than the King Blood Jackals.","The King Blood Jackals were not suited to be managers. The best option for them was to assimilate into the faith country.","Kani was slightly upset when she saw the message that appeared on the Fantasy Crystal Birth Stone Flower but did not express it.","After learning of Lin Yuan’s power and resources, she had been anticipating the arrival of such a day.","Regardless of whether the King Blood Jackals were suited to manage the territory, Kani’s personal reasons prevented her from being happy when the King Blood Jackals were given more responsibilities. However, she could not afford to anger Lin Yuan!","“Young Master, I agree with your decision. The King Blood Jackals will support you too!”","Lin Yuan replied to Listen, “If that’s the case, the demon insects will become your assistants. They will help you to set up the trading system! Go and inform Keira of your request and tell her that the instructions come from me. Ten days later, she will prepare 3 billion demon insect warriors for you.”","When Listen heard that Lin Yuan had agreed to his request, a relieved smile appeared on his face.","Listen always hated inefficiency. Now that Lin Yuan agreed to his request, his efficiency would rise!","“Young Master, I have another matter. I think Gu Lang is more talented than me when it comes to trading and management. Many of his plans and designs are very good. He also wants to bring his ideas to life. The business network and system in the faith country needs to be adjusted and expanded continuously. I would like to recommend Gu Lang to be the one to build the system while I execute the channels of the network.”","Wen Yu and Liu Jie both looked shocked when they saw the message Listen sent Lin Yuan.","Listen’s words essentially elevated Gu Lang to an even higher position than his own."]}]);
